values
  ('156927831902959004', 'Poveri Noi', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Fabrizio Maria Cortese, Dario Di Mella, Andrea Massimi', 'Fabrizio Maria Cortese, Federico Moccia', 'Paolo Ruffini, Ricky Memphis, Ilaria Spada, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Ricky Tognazzi, Paola Sambo, Chantal Nchako, Clizia Fornasier', null, 'Edoardo and Ottavio were high school classmates and best friends, but 30 years have passed and they''ve long since lost touch. Edoardo has achieved great success, married Giovanna, and together they have three children, Giacomo, Emma, ​​and Lidia, who have grown up in a comfortable and overly spoiled environment. A bad investment, however, threatens to bankrupt him. Ottavio, on the other hand, has led a simpler and more humble life than his friend, but in times of need, he proves to be the only person willing to help Edoardo without asking for anything in return.', 'Edoardo and Ottavio were high school classmates and best friends, but 30 years have passed and they''ve long since lost touch. Edoardo has achieved great success, married Giovanna, and together they have three children, Giacomo, Emma, ​​and Lidia, who have grown up in a comfortable and overly spoiled environment. A bad investment, however, threatens to bankrupt him. Ottavio, on the other hand, has led a simpler and more humble life than his friend, but in times of need, he proves to be the only person willing to help Edoardo without asking for anything in return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tr26vXCL7JVNgWFVsJd2BL9j7Be.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1441215'),
  ('864142159281992477', 'Poverty and Nobility', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Mario Mattoli, Karl Struss, Roberto Cinquini', 'Ruggero Maccari', 'Totò, Sophia Loren, Enzo Turco, Dolores Palumbo, Gianni Cavalieri, Franca Faldini, Carlo Croccolo, Liana Billi', null, 'Eugene, a young nobleman, asks two penniless idlers to impersonate his noble relatives to help him marry Gemma, the daughter of an enriched cook.', 'Eugene, a young nobleman, asks two penniless idlers to impersonate his noble relatives to help him marry Gemma, the daughter of an enriched cook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOwn3agwatgzHtEGJ8Dda9hANGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58007'),
  ('959901082617534346', 'Powaqqatsi', 1988, 'Documentary', 'Godfrey Reggio, Leonidas Zourdoumis, Graham Berry', 'Ken Richards, Godfrey Reggio', 'Christie Brinkley, David Brinkley, Patrick Disanto, Pope John Paul II, Dan Rather, Cheryl Tiegs', 'G', 'An exploration of technologically developing nations and the effect the transition to Western-style modernization has had on them.', 'An exploration of technologically developing nations and the effect the transition to Western-style modernization has had on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xh8Pvtq4dYry9B4uRT3VbmSI4Wi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24348'),
  ('1034762811289362298', 'Powder', 1995, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Jerzy Zieliński, Victor Salva', 'Victor Salva', 'Mary Steenburgen, Sean Patrick Flanery, Lance Henriksen, Jeff Goldblum, Brandon Smith, Bradford Tatum, Susan Tyrrell, Missy Crider', 'PG-13', 'Harassed by classmates who won''t accept his shocking appearance, a shy young man known as "Powder" struggles to fit in. But the cruel taunts stop when Powder displays a mysterious power that allows him to do incredible things. This phenomenon changes the lives of all those around him in ways they never could have imagined.', 'Harassed by classmates who won''t accept his shocking appearance, a shy young man known as "Powder" struggles to fit in. But the cruel taunts stop when Powder displays a mysterious power that allows him to do incredible things. This phenomenon changes the lives of all those around him in ways they never could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQSA63T7zyzZxBZxr2MQaxt1gtO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12665'),
  ('687802180594055694', 'Powder', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tonatiuh Martínez, José María Yázpik', 'José María Yázpik', 'José María Yázpik, Mariana Treviño, Adrián Vázquez, Carlos Valencia, Guillermo Nava, Irineo Alvarez, Franciso Javier López Lucero, Giovani Florido', null, 'After a ten year absence, El Chato returns to San Ignacio, his hometown, in order to retrieve a shipment of cocaine that was dropped there by a cartel pilot.', 'After a ten year absence, El Chato returns to San Ignacio, his hometown, in order to retrieve a shipment of cocaine that was dropped there by a cartel pilot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pH28HqCQx1WW4MRPYSGQjz5Ayaw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568776'),
  ('129980163743172952', 'Powder Blue', 2009, 'Drama', 'Timothy Linh Bui, Jonathan Sela, Barry Berona', 'Timothy Linh Bui', 'Jessica Biel, Eddie Redmayne, Forest Whitaker, Ray Liotta, Patrick Swayze, Lisa Kudrow, Kris Kristofferson, Sanaa Lathan', 'R', 'On the gritty streets of LA, the destinies of four people desperate for connection and redemption are about to collide.', 'On the gritty streets of LA, the destinies of four people desperate for connection and redemption are about to collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1wQcqOoQQF7tt1HijnmQRLjTo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17740'),
  ('150923669807223273', 'Powder Keg', 2001, 'Action, War', 'Alejandro González Iñárritu, Robert Richardson', 'Alejandro González Iñárritu, Guillermo Arriaga, David Carter', 'Clive Owen, Stellan Skarsgård, Lois Smith, Javier Zaragoza, Luis Francisco Escobedo, Gilberto Barraza, Alfredo Escobar, Carlos Torres Torrija', null, 'The Driver is drafted by the UN to rescue a wounded war photographer named Harvey Jacobs from out of hostile territory. While they are leaving Jacobs tells the Driver about the horrors he saw as a photographer, but he regrets his inability to help war victims. Jacobs answers the driver curiosity about why he is a photographer by saying how his mother taught him to see. He gives the Driver the film needed for a New York Times story and also his dog tags to give to his mother. When they reach the border, they are confronted by a guard who begins to draw arms as Jacobs begins taking pictures, trying to get himself killed. The Driver drives through a hail of gunfire to the border, but finds Jacobs killed by a bullet through the seat. The Driver arrives in America to visit Jacobs'' mother and share the news of him winning the Pulitzer prize and hand over the dog tags, only to discover that she is blind.', 'The Driver is drafted by the UN to rescue a wounded war photographer named Harvey Jacobs from out of hostile territory. While they are leaving Jacobs tells the Driver about the horrors he saw as a photographer, but he regrets his inability to help war victims. Jacobs answers the driver curiosity about why he is a photographer by saying how his mother taught him to see. He gives the Driver the film needed for a New York Times story and also his dog tags to give to his mother. When they reach the border, they are confronted by a guard who begins to draw arms as Jacobs begins taking pictures, trying to get himself killed. The Driver drives through a hail of gunfire to the border, but finds Jacobs killed by a bullet through the seat. The Driver arrives in America to visit Jacobs'' mother and share the news of him winning the Pulitzer prize and hand over the dog tags, only to discover that she is blind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9FgdaWOsHYEwck8nDqqna0kEbf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38187'),
  ('925794736703995911', 'Power', 1986, 'Drama', 'Sidney Lumet, Andrzej Bartkowiak', 'David Himmelstein', 'Richard Gere, Denzel Washington, Gene Hackman, Julie Christie, Kate Capshaw, E.G. Marshall, J.T. Walsh, Beatrice Straight', 'R', 'Pete St. John is a powerful and successful political consultant, with clients spread around the country. When his long-time friend and client Ohio senator Sam Hastings decides to quit politics, he is rapidly drafted to help with the campaign of the man destined to succeed him, unknown and mysterious businessman Jerome Cade...', 'Pete St. John is a powerful and successful political consultant, with clients spread around the country. When his long-time friend and client Ohio senator Sam Hastings decides to quit politics, he is rapidly drafted to help with the campaign of the man destined to succeed him, unknown and mysterious businessman Jerome Cade...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sj8HFCODqHah4DTCWs8uPp4IyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46948'),
  ('644877944304537855', 'Power Alley', 2023, 'Drama', 'Julia Medeiros, Wilssa Esser, Lillah Halla', 'María Elena Morán, Lillah Halla', 'Ayomi Domenica, Loro Bardot, Grace Passô, Gláucia Vandeveld, Rômulo Braga, Larissa Siqueira, Ona Silva, Lorre Motta', null, 'On the eve of a future-defining championship, promising 17-year-old volleyball player Sofia is faced with an unwanted pregnancy. Seeking an illegal termination, she becomes the target of a fundamentalist group determined to stop her at any cost – but neither Sofia nor those who love her are willing to surrender to the blind fervor of the swarm.', 'On the eve of a future-defining championship, promising 17-year-old volleyball player Sofia is faced with an unwanted pregnancy. Seeking an illegal termination, she becomes the target of a fundamentalist group determined to stop her at any cost – but neither Sofia nor those who love her are willing to surrender to the blind fervor of the swarm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysOwI8Ph7of9tsKc0AvYjkemzp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008568'),
  ('184059552302540257', 'Power Kids', 2009, 'Action, Drama', 'Krissanapong Rachata, Surachet Thongmee', 'Napalee, Nonont Kontaweesook, Piyaros Thongdee', 'Nantawut Boonrubsub, Nawarat Techarathanaprasert, Pimchanok Luevisadpaibul, Sasisa Jindamanee, Paytaai Wongkamlao, Johnny Tri Nguyen, Arun Pawilai, Cheathavuth Watcharakhun', null, 'A group of friends have trained themselves in martial arts. One of the gang is in hospital so when the hospital is taken over by a group of terrorists, the kids take on the rebels.', 'A group of friends have trained themselves in martial arts. One of the gang is in hospital so when the hospital is taken over by a group of terrorists, the kids take on the rebels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfpUmXbmHU39GkiYVjLRTtJwAZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41995'),
  ('651538012508305670', 'Power of Love', 2023, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Carmen Treichl, Jonas Rothlaender', 'Jonas Rothlaender', 'Saara Kotkaniemi, Nicola Perot, Outi Mäenpää, Timo Torikka, Elmer Bäck, Cecilia Paul', null, 'Saara and Robert are living a love that is free from traditional conventions and role models. They set off to an extensive summer holiday on a lonely island in the Finnish archipelago where the tension between them escalates and becomes a fight for survival.', 'Saara and Robert are living a love that is free from traditional conventions and role models. They set off to an extensive summer holiday on a lonely island in the Finnish archipelago where the tension between them escalates and becomes a fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqUQ0xyMaJn5g7RYqCMykbXXW4C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666433'),
  ('297354878100993246', 'Power of Plants', 1949, null, 'Paul Finder Moss', null, null, null, 'Uses time-lapse photography to show the physical power of plants in their efforts to receive sunlight and fulfill their growth.', 'Uses time-lapse photography to show the physical power of plants in their efforts to receive sunlight and fulfill their growth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1OtndBRCpGh6PmMVRy8Nxio1px.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362501'),
  ('114975859690662610', 'Power of the Press', 1943, 'Drama', 'Lew Landers, George Rhein, John Stumar', 'Robert Hardy Andrews', 'Guy Kibbee, Lee Tracy, Gloria Dickson, Otto Kruger, Victor Jory, Don Beddoe, Edmund Cobb, Eddie Laughton', 'NR', 'During WWII, the publisher of the isolationist New York Gazette is murdered just as he was about to change the paper''s policy and support the US war effort. His friend, a small town patriotic editor, is brought in to find the culprits.', 'During WWII, the publisher of the isolationist New York Gazette is murdered just as he was about to change the paper''s policy and support the US war effort. His friend, a small town patriotic editor, is brought in to find the culprits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gADzD4VG6fiRofAyY9iAvXczQAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95510'),
  ('755776820282858069', 'Power Play', 1978, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Ousama Rawi, John Board, Phil Desjardins', 'Martyn Burke, Cliff Osmond', 'Peter O''Toole, David Hemmings, Donald Pleasence, Barry Morse, August Schellenberg, Harvey Atkin, George Touliatos, Alberta Watson', null, 'A group of military officers frustrated by government corruption and brutality attempts a coup.', 'A group of military officers frustrated by government corruption and brutality attempts a coup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cME3FknhWWOFfy8KnQLvE723wPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144229'),
  ('582740045820689853', 'Power Rangers', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Matthew J. Lloyd, Aldric La''Auli Porter, Katie Carroll', 'John Gatins', 'Dacre Montgomery, RJ Cyler, Ludi Lin, Naomi Scott, Becky G, Bryan Cranston, Bill Hader, Elizabeth Banks', 'PG-13', 'Five ordinary teens must become something extraordinary when they learn that their small town of Angel Grove — and the world — is on the verge of being obliterated by an alien threat. Chosen by destiny, our heroes quickly discover they are the only ones who can save the planet. But to do so, they will have to overcome their real-life issues and before it’s too late, band together as the Power Rangers.', 'Five ordinary teens must become something extraordinary when they learn that their small town of Angel Grove — and the world — is on the verge of being obliterated by an alien threat. Chosen by destiny, our heroes quickly discover they are the only ones who can save the planet. But to do so, they will have to overcome their real-life issues and before it’s too late, band together as the Power Rangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKYKyyIv5YnisxjZtDreWtYA386.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305470'),
  ('108235815399353091', 'Powerless King', 1981, null, 'Kenji Ishiguro', 'Chiaki Watanabe', 'Mio Takaki, Jinpachi Nezu, Junko Enjou, Namihiko Ohmura, Kazumi Sawada, Jiro Karasawa', null, 'Set in the neon heartbeat of Yokohama, this film ignites an outrageously erotic 17-hour odyssey of desire that unleashes from a lazy Sunday afternoon to a feverish Monday dawn. A sultry fertile female college student meets a band of insatiable young men, sparking a frenzy of scintillating passion that blurs every sexual boundary. Every moment throbs with wild, uninhibited lust—a dizzying climax of youthful ardor and raw, intense, unfettered ecstasy. This cinematic explosion catapults desire into an endless flight of erotic fantasy, transforming ordinary encounters into a delirious, sensual inferno.', 'Set in the neon heartbeat of Yokohama, this film ignites an outrageously erotic 17-hour odyssey of desire that unleashes from a lazy Sunday afternoon to a feverish Monday dawn. A sultry fertile female college student meets a band of insatiable young men, sparking a frenzy of scintillating passion that blurs every sexual boundary. Every moment throbs with wild, uninhibited lust—a dizzying climax of youthful ardor and raw, intense, unfettered ecstasy. This cinematic explosion catapults desire into an endless flight of erotic fantasy, transforming ordinary encounters into a delirious, sensual inferno.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ygQF47pqJzqBkULLh87T6k0Mv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029529'),
  ('173517823867618730', 'Powers of Ten', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Charles Eames, Ray Eames', null, 'Philip Morrison', null, 'A scientific film essay, narrated by Phil Morrison. A set of pictures of two picnickers in a park, with the area of each frame one-tenth the size of the one before. Starting from a view of the entire known universe, the camera gradually zooms in until we are viewing the subatomic particles on a man''s hand.', 'A scientific film essay, narrated by Phil Morrison. A set of pictures of two picnickers in a park, with the area of each frame one-tenth the size of the one before. Starting from a view of the entire known universe, the camera gradually zooms in until we are viewing the subatomic particles on a man''s hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPfnkN2ZFeWCg19INDLCBbfYP0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53223'),
  ('22808881054848899', 'Powwow Highway', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jonathan Wacks, Toyomichi Kurita, Lee Alan McConnell', 'Janet Heaney, Jean Stawarz', 'A Martinez, Gary Farmer, Joanelle Romero, Amanda Wyss, Sam Vlahos, Wayne Waterman, Margot Kane, Geoffrey Rivas', null, 'Two Northern Cheyenne men take a road trip from Montana to New Mexico to bail out the sister of one of them who has been framed and arrested in Santa Fe. On the way, they begin to reconnect to their spiritual heritage.', 'Two Northern Cheyenne men take a road trip from Montana to New Mexico to bail out the sister of one of them who has been framed and arrested in Santa Fe. On the way, they begin to reconnect to their spiritual heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ah1le8MVItngtlLpASzkGsWFXW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63587'),
  ('100655724167552570', 'PR Girls', 1998, 'Drama', 'Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong', 'Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong, Cheng Man-Fai, Joe Ma Wai-Ho', 'Grace Lam Nga-Si, Angela Tong Ying-Ying, Liz Kong Hei-Man, Sherming Yiu Lok-Yee, Yennis Cheung, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Moses Chan Ho, Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong', null, 'A group of Hong Kong hostess girls where they mingle with clients to make money to spend at other clubs after prostituting themselves.', 'A group of Hong Kong hostess girls where they mingle with clients to make money to spend at other clubs after prostituting themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r26iZopLdu0eyuzS5EHaoPC85Ac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405998'),
  ('29862519699965282', 'Praça Paris', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lúcia Murat, Guillermo Nieto, Marília Nogueira', 'Raphael Montes, Lúcia Murat', 'Grace Passô, Joana de Verona, Alex Brasil, Babu Santana, Digão Ribeiro, Marco Antonio Caponi', null, 'Camila is a Portuguese therapist who works at Rio de Janeiro State University, where she attends Glória, the university''s elevator operator. Throughout the sessions, Camila faces a very violent reality, since Glória was raped by her own father as a child and her brother Jonas is a dangerous bandit that is in prison. Increasingly frightened by the reports she hears, she feels threatened at the same time that Glória sees her as essential in her life.', 'Camila is a Portuguese therapist who works at Rio de Janeiro State University, where she attends Glória, the university''s elevator operator. Throughout the sessions, Camila faces a very violent reality, since Glória was raped by her own father as a child and her brother Jonas is a dangerous bandit that is in prison. Increasingly frightened by the reports she hears, she feels threatened at the same time that Glória sees her as essential in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xtukR0jCsBodtnLHj212sT0TOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480213'),
  ('284629333683225104', 'Practical Joke', 1977, 'Family, Romance, Drama', 'Vladimir Menshov, Mikhail Bits, Valeri Popov', 'Semyon Lungin', 'Dmitriy Kharatyan, Yevgeniya Khanayeva, Natalya Fateyeva, Natalya Vavilova, Andrei Gusev, Evdokiya Germanova, Zinoviy Gerdt, Pavel Vinnik', null, 'Secondary school students play a ''practical joke'' on their teacher: on midterms day, they claim she told them the wrong date. She almost believes them, but an honest classmate ruins their fun... and now they want revenge.', 'Secondary school students play a ''practical joke'' on their teacher: on midterms day, they claim she told them the wrong date. She almost believes them, but an honest classmate ruins their fun... and now they want revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4MhYHIuXb2hygQqSsPjeDPT8jI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133700'),
  ('33011972285632890', 'Practical Magic', 1998, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Andrew Dunn, Griffin Dunne, Amanda Mackey', 'Robin Swicord, Akiva Goldsman, Adam Brooks', 'Sandra Bullock, Nicole Kidman, Stockard Channing, Dianne Wiest, Goran Višnjić, Aidan Quinn, Evan Rachel Wood, Alexandra Artrip', 'PG-13', 'Sally and Gillian Owens, born into a magical family, have mostly avoided witchcraft themselves. But when Gillian''s vicious boyfriend, Jimmy Angelov, dies unexpectedly, the Owens sisters give themselves a crash course in hard magic. With policeman Gary Hallet growing suspicious, the girls struggle to resurrect Angelov -- and unwittingly inject his corpse with an evil spirit that threatens to end their family line.', 'Sally and Gillian Owens, born into a magical family, have mostly avoided witchcraft themselves. But when Gillian''s vicious boyfriend, Jimmy Angelov, dies unexpectedly, the Owens sisters give themselves a crash course in hard magic. With policeman Gary Hallet growing suspicious, the girls struggle to resurrect Angelov -- and unwittingly inject his corpse with an evil spirit that threatens to end their family line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwmToSgf2IL3aHv0QRVsR5KvChv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6435'),
  ('120332404343522793', 'Prague', 2006, 'Drama', 'Ole Christian Madsen', 'Kim Fupz Aakeson', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Stine Stengade, Jana Plodková, Bořivoj Navrátil, Josef Vajnar, Milan Duchek, Nicola Meisselová, Lucia Vráblicová', null, 'Christoffer and Maja''s trip to Prague to bring back Chistoffer''s deceased father, evolves into the story of a break-up. With the dead father lurking in the background, secrets gradually emerge threatening to destroy their marriage.', 'Christoffer and Maja''s trip to Prague to bring back Chistoffer''s deceased father, evolves into the story of a break-up. With the dead father lurking in the background, secrets gradually emerge threatening to destroy their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oL1kQ1JMzcNQ48eFQR9md7rkqV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16017'),
  ('881678885440049317', 'Prague Nights', 1969, 'Comedy, Drama, Horror', 'Robert Vacík, Lenka Němečková, Jan Mimra', 'Evald Schorm, Miloš Makovec, Jiří Brdečka', 'Milena Dvorská, Miloš Kopecký, Jiří Hrzán, Milena Zahrynowská, Květa Fialová, Nataša Gollová, Milan Neděla, Zdeněk Dítě', null, 'A stuffy middle-aged foreigner, a businessman named Fabricius, lonely and looking for a night''s diversion, finds it in the form of a mysterious blonde. In an abandoned cemetery, she tells him three tales involving black magic and erotic obsession. In "The Last Golem," a young rabbi struggles to fashion a massive, silent giant out of living clay — until he''s distracted by a mute servant girl. In the second episode, "Bread Slippers," an 18th-century countess indulges her passion for sweet cakes, adulterous affairs, and secret kisses with pretty maids until a mysterious visitor whisks her away to an abandoned mansion, where Fate has a different kind of dance in store for her. And in the final story, "Poisoned Poisoner," a ravishing murderess in the Middle Ages dispatches lecherous merchants to the tune of upbeat ''60s Czech pop songs.', 'A stuffy middle-aged foreigner, a businessman named Fabricius, lonely and looking for a night''s diversion, finds it in the form of a mysterious blonde. In an abandoned cemetery, she tells him three tales involving black magic and erotic obsession. In "The Last Golem," a young rabbi struggles to fashion a massive, silent giant out of living clay — until he''s distracted by a mute servant girl. In the second episode, "Bread Slippers," an 18th-century countess indulges her passion for sweet cakes, adulterous affairs, and secret kisses with pretty maids until a mysterious visitor whisks her away to an abandoned mansion, where Fate has a different kind of dance in store for her. And in the final story, "Poisoned Poisoner," a ravishing murderess in the Middle Ages dispatches lecherous merchants to the tune of upbeat ''60s Czech pop songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9axqxz6YrgexFKzHmcVZwnOslq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344743'),
  ('953322106151503980', 'Prahaar', 1991, null, 'Nana Patekar, Subhankar Ghosh', 'Nana Patekar, Sujit Sen', 'Makrand Deshpande, Madhuri Dixit, Gautam Joglekar, Dimple Kapadia, Khan Jahangir Khan, Nana Patekar, Vishwajeet Pradhan, Shivkumar Subramaniam', null, 'Prahaar is the story of Major Chavan, a tough and stern soldier, trained to destroy the enemy. He can see the enemy on our borders but is unaware of the invisible enemy within ourselves. When one of Major''s Commandos - Peter D''Souza is killed, he is shown the harsh reality revolving around us, the enemy is within ourselves. The battlefield changes and Major Chavan makes his final attack on the enemy within this crumbling society.', 'Prahaar is the story of Major Chavan, a tough and stern soldier, trained to destroy the enemy. He can see the enemy on our borders but is unaware of the invisible enemy within ourselves. When one of Major''s Commandos - Peter D''Souza is killed, he is shown the harsh reality revolving around us, the enemy is within ourselves. The battlefield changes and Major Chavan makes his final attack on the enemy within this crumbling society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1k45jZdMMo7i8GuMI749lEu5Kkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140883'),
  ('1102697543526576003', 'Praise This', 2023, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'Jen Willis, Daniel Silverberg, Kristen B. Adams', 'Jana Savage, Brandon Broussard, Hudson Obayuwana', 'Chloe Bailey, Anjelika Washington, Druski, Birgundi Baker, Jekalyn Carr, Quavo, Tristan Mack Wilds, Loren Lott', 'PG-13', 'When aspiring musical superstar Sam is forced to join her cousin''s struggling, underdog praise team in the lead-up to a national championship competition, she sees an opportunity to finally make her dreams come true.', 'When aspiring musical superstar Sam is forced to join her cousin''s struggling, underdog praise team in the lead-up to a national championship competition, she sees an opportunity to finally make her dreams come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twdgFrp9Sd8rb3TdbWFQXAvslrH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551806'),
  ('752501958893481310', 'Prakambanam', 2026, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Vijesh Panathur, Alby', 'Vijesh Panathur, Sreehari Vadakkan', 'Ganapathi S. Poduval, Sagar Surya, Ameen, Mallika Sukumaran, Azees Nedumangad', null, 'Three college buddies navigate campus politics and pranks at their Ernakulam hostel until a surprise event throws their world into hilarious disarray.', 'Three college buddies navigate campus politics and pranks at their Ernakulam hostel until a surprise event throws their world into hilarious disarray.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FbExPPwAamQzVLtBnwEutiJ53jDZ.jpg', 'plex:movie:prakambanam-2026'),
  ('833740184503544585', 'Prancer', 1989, 'Family, Drama, Fantasy', 'John D. Hancock, Ian Woolf, Susan Willett', 'Greg Taylor', 'Rebecca Harrell Tickell, Sam Elliott, John Duda, Rutanya Alda, Cloris Leachman, Ariana Richards, Abe Vigoda, Michael Constantine', 'G', 'Jessica, the daughter of an impoverished apple farmer, still believes in Santa Claus. So when she comes across a reindeer with an injured leg, it makes perfect sense to her to assume that it is Prancer, who had fallen from a Christmas display in town. She hides the reindeer in her barn and feeds it cookies, until she can return it to Santa. Her father finds the reindeer and decides to sell it to the butcher, not for venison chops, but as an advertising display.', 'Jessica, the daughter of an impoverished apple farmer, still believes in Santa Claus. So when she comes across a reindeer with an injured leg, it makes perfect sense to her to assume that it is Prancer, who had fallen from a Christmas display in town. She hides the reindeer in her barn and feeds it cookies, until she can return it to Santa. Her father finds the reindeer and decides to sell it to the butcher, not for venison chops, but as an advertising display.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3JfCGX9fgHwmmKFhRzu7BYc29d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24951'),
  ('955566350965370668', 'Prancer Returns', 2001, 'Comedy, Family', 'Joshua Butler, Bruce Worrall', 'Gregg Taylor', 'Gavin Fink, John Corbett, Stacy Edwards, Jack Palance, Michael O''Keefe, Robert Clark, Boyd Banks, Darren T. Knaus', null, 'This holiday-themed children''s film offers a unique take on the legend of Santa Claus and his tiny reindeer. In this movie, a young boy finds a deer in the forest he is sure is Santa''s beloved Prancer. Determined to return the creature to the North Pole and his rightful destiny, the child overcomes the cynicism of his family to teach them and us a lesson about the true spirit of Christmas.', 'This holiday-themed children''s film offers a unique take on the legend of Santa Claus and his tiny reindeer. In this movie, a young boy finds a deer in the forest he is sure is Santa''s beloved Prancer. Determined to return the creature to the North Pole and his rightful destiny, the child overcomes the cynicism of his family to teach them and us a lesson about the true spirit of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPEtXRrjuDoCQmUhUz2044MPxn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51210'),
  ('2646742654424674', 'Prancer: A Christmas Tale', 2022, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Phil Hawkins, Miguel Gallego', 'Greg Taylor', 'James Cromwell, Darcey Ewart, Sarah-Jane Potts, Aaron McCusker, Joseph Millson, Stephanie Levi-John, Florisa Kamara, Lucas Persaud', 'PG', 'Ten-year-old Gloria and her recently widowed grandfather Bud befriend a mysterious reindeer when the family gather for Christmas. Bud comes to believe that Prancer may actually be magical, but Gloria fears his theory will send him straight to a retirement home.', 'Ten-year-old Gloria and her recently widowed grandfather Bud befriend a mysterious reindeer when the family gather for Christmas. Bud comes to believe that Prancer may actually be magical, but Gloria fears his theory will send him straight to a retirement home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJgCmwkf2ytEHYHv8vH3QtRGVPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047431'),
  ('560370836821871120', 'Prange', 2025, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Lars Jessen, Marion Haack', 'Andreas Altenburg', 'Bjarne Mädel, Katharina M. Schubert, Olli Dittrich, Angelika Richter, Linn Reusse, Maximilian Scheidt, Michel Diercks, Boži Kocevski', null, 'Ralf Prange lives on the ground floor and is at home all day. This makes him the perfect "branch" for the whole building. Stacks of boxes and parcels from his neighbors pile up in his tiny apartment. But one day, love comes knocking at his door: Dörte, the new parcel delivery woman. The grumpy but kind-hearted Prange is smitten, and Dörte doesn''t seem averse to the idea either. However, Horst Rohde, Prange''s number one annoying neighbor, doesn''t like the budding romance at all. Because he has his eye on Dörte himself.', 'Ralf Prange lives on the ground floor and is at home all day. This makes him the perfect "branch" for the whole building. Stacks of boxes and parcels from his neighbors pile up in his tiny apartment. But one day, love comes knocking at his door: Dörte, the new parcel delivery woman. The grumpy but kind-hearted Prange is smitten, and Dörte doesn''t seem averse to the idea either. However, Horst Rohde, Prange''s number one annoying neighbor, doesn''t like the budding romance at all. Because he has his eye on Dörte himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w19rkWwqXov4qrIC1ObK99jAs2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1544046'),
  ('197368075324198145', 'Prassthanam', 2019, 'Action, Drama', 'Deva Katta', null, 'Sanjay Dutt, Jackie Shroff, Ali Fazal, Manisha Koirala, Chunky Panday, Satyajeet Dubey, Amyra Dastur, Yashraaj Chaurasia', null, 'A rural politician marries a widow with kids and gains a respectable position and trusts his stepson more than his own in political matters; thus upsetting his son beyond limits.', 'A rural politician marries a widow with kids and gains a respectable position and trusts his stepson more than his own in political matters; thus upsetting his son beyond limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irGjVUIJdJneVjrs2jxtMC7gwnM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621005'),
  ('57017393265759302', 'Prathichaya', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller, Suspense', 'B. Unnikrishnan, Chandru Selvaraj, Shaji Padoor, Naveen Chandran, Alex George, Sugheesh S. G., Vishak Ravindran, Sujai S Kumar, Sallap Sreekandan, Vishnu P Balan, Vivek Anirudh', 'B. Unnikrishnan', 'Nivin Pauly, Neethu Krishna, Balachandra Menon, Harisree Ashokan, Vishnu Agasthya', null, 'After Kerala’s Chief Minister dies in a scandal engineered by a ruthless media tycoon, his son a brilliant tech entrepreneur enters the blood-soaked arena of politics to expose the conspiracy, vindicate his father, and turn technology against those who weaponized it', 'After Kerala’s Chief Minister dies in a scandal engineered by a ruthless media tycoon, his son a brilliant tech entrepreneur enters the blood-soaked arena of politics to expose the conspiracy, vindicate his father, and turn technology against those who weaponized it', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6X9JcHVT5SamcTSSS6sNJ60tIlP.jpg', 'plex:movie:prathichaya'),
  ('344047189951524588', 'Pravda', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Jean-Henri Roger, Paul Burron', 'Jean-Henri Roger, Jean-Luc Godard, Paul Burron', 'Věra Chytilová', null, 'Filmed clandestinely in Czechoslovakia on 16mm. It''s one of the films Godard made with the Groupe Dziga Vertov - a Marxist film about the political situation after the ''68 revolution.', 'Filmed clandestinely in Czechoslovakia on 16mm. It''s one of the films Godard made with the Groupe Dziga Vertov - a Marxist film about the political situation after the ''68 revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7w4VKNrxco7cm4mHoAaLxkAmlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190872'),
  ('602512944439531915', 'Praxis Dr. Hasenbein', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Serge Roman, Helge Schneider', null, 'Helge Schneider, Andrea Rottmann, Bernhard Sondermann, Werner Abrolat, Norbert Losch, Peter Berling, Carlos Boes, Carina Berns', null, 'Before WWII: Dr. Hasenbein lives with his son Peter in a small town. Aunt Uschi''s orphanage houses many children and a hamster. When the hamster falls ill, Dr. Hasenbein is given something to do. The tailor, Mr. Voss, is also treated by Dr. Hasenbein: for tendinitis. During the war, Dr. Hasenbein has to go away. When he comes back after 30 years, everything has changed...', 'Before WWII: Dr. Hasenbein lives with his son Peter in a small town. Aunt Uschi''s orphanage houses many children and a hamster. When the hamster falls ill, Dr. Hasenbein is given something to do. The tailor, Mr. Voss, is also treated by Dr. Hasenbein: for tendinitis. During the war, Dr. Hasenbein has to go away. When he comes back after 30 years, everything has changed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0kJskT769jdLBcYwwY1elfzSK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1655'),
  ('664702624471897782', 'Pray Away', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Kristine Stolakis, Melissa Langer', null, 'Julie Rodgers, Randy Thomas, Yvette Cantu Schneider, John Paulk, Jeffrey McCall, Alan Chambers', 'PG-13', 'In the 1970s, five men struggling with being gay in their Evangelical church started a bible study to help each other leave the "homosexual lifestyle." They quickly received over 25,000 letters from people asking for help and formalized as Exodus International, the largest and most controversial conversion therapy organization in the world. But leaders struggled with a secret: their own “same-sex attractions” never went away. After years as Christian superstars in the religious right, many of these men and women have come out as LGBTQ, disavowing the very movement they helped start. Focusing on the dramatic journeys of former conversion therapy leaders, current members, and a survivor, PRAY AWAY chronicles the “ex gay" movement’s rise to power, persistent influence, and the profound harm it causes.', 'In the 1970s, five men struggling with being gay in their Evangelical church started a bible study to help each other leave the "homosexual lifestyle." They quickly received over 25,000 letters from people asking for help and formalized as Exodus International, the largest and most controversial conversion therapy organization in the world. But leaders struggled with a secret: their own “same-sex attractions” never went away. After years as Christian superstars in the religious right, many of these men and women have come out as LGBTQ, disavowing the very movement they helped start. Focusing on the dramatic journeys of former conversion therapy leaders, current members, and a survivor, PRAY AWAY chronicles the “ex gay" movement’s rise to power, persistent influence, and the profound harm it causes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wikrtZZZoThwnHulB7klQek4Ai.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685264'),
  ('568769099763660813', 'Pray for Death', 1985, 'Action', 'Gordon Hessler, Roy H. Wagner', 'James Booth', 'Sho Kosugi, James Booth, Donna Kei Benz, Norman Burton, Kane Kosugi, Shane Kosugi, Matthew Faison, Parley Baer', 'R', 'Akira Saito, a Japanese businessman lives in Tokyo with his Japanese-American wife Aiko and their children, Takeshi and Tomoya. When the family has a chance to move to the United States so that Aiko can teach the children about their American heritage, they pack up and head for Houston, Texas and run a restaurant. This is where the trouble begins....', 'Akira Saito, a Japanese businessman lives in Tokyo with his Japanese-American wife Aiko and their children, Takeshi and Tomoya. When the family has a chance to move to the United States so that Aiko can teach the children about their American heritage, they pack up and head for Houston, Texas and run a restaurant. This is where the trouble begins....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8lcXvFQqii1FmsWr9UbD82G8yG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35106'),
  ('1125060727535496252', 'Prayer of the Rollerboys', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Rick King, Phedon Papamichael', 'W. Peter Iliff', 'Corey Haim, Patricia Arquette, Christopher Collet, Julius Harris, Devin Clark, Mark Pellegrino, Morgan Weisser, Jake Dengel', 'R', 'Griffin, a rollerblader in the not so distant future of an economically wrecked Los Angeles, races against time to save both his younger brother and the city from the fate dealt out by the fascist rollerblading street gang, the Rollerboys.', 'Griffin, a rollerblader in the not so distant future of an economically wrecked Los Angeles, races against time to save both his younger brother and the city from the fate dealt out by the fascist rollerblading street gang, the Rollerboys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YjtI2teTkhNZouCiFLvfmsOHQw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44568'),
  ('1009942469295814464', 'Prayers for the Stolen', 2021, 'Drama', 'Dariela Ludlow Deloya, Tatiana Huezo', 'Tatiana Huezo', 'Ana Cristina Ordóñez, Marya Membreño, Blanca Itzel Pérez, Giselle Barrera Sánchez, Camila Gaal, Alejandra Camacho, Mayra Batalla, José Estrada', null, 'Ana and her two best friends, Maria and Paula, navigate life in their oppressive countryside village. Whilst their families struggle in the poppy fields harvesting opium, the girls try to grow alongside the creeping terror of their cartel oppressors.', 'Ana and her two best friends, Maria and Paula, navigate life in their oppressive countryside village. Whilst their families struggle in the poppy fields harvesting opium, the girls try to grow alongside the creeping terror of their cartel oppressors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9nMTsuaWRwKe0GfAmEGMEILqog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670981'),
  ('384508086036985485', 'Praying with Anger', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'M. Night Shyamalan, Madhu Ambat', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'M. Night Shyamalan, Michael Muthu, K. Subramanian, Arun Balachandran, Richa Ahuja, Christabal Howie, Sushma Ahuja, Apajit Singh', 'PG-13', 'An alienated, Americanized teenager of East Indian heritage is sent back to India where he discovers not only his roots but a lot about himself.', 'An alienated, Americanized teenager of East Indian heritage is sent back to India where he discovers not only his roots but a lot about himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CrWxYHGQCtwFwA5CZShh30VvxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114284'),
  ('545593396404529159', 'Pre-Hysterical Hare', 1958, 'Family, Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Dave Barry', null, 'Bugs discovers a Micronesian Film Documentary in "Cromagnonscope" showing Elmer Fuddstone and a sabertooth bunny in 10,000 BC.', 'Bugs discovers a Micronesian Film Documentary in "Cromagnonscope" showing Elmer Fuddstone and a sabertooth bunny in 10,000 BC.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDNfexAdDT7zh59RzRdFN3mCFe9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234970'),
  ('264920800208033995', 'Preacherman', 1971, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Albert T. Viola', 'Albert T. Viola, Harvey Flaxman', 'Albert T. Viola, Ilene Kristen, Adam Hesse, Marian Brown, Esty F. Davis Jr., W. Henry Smith, Colleen McGee, Shiela Gibson', 'R', 'Phony backwoods preacher Amos T. Huxley stays in a small North Carolina town long enough to fleece his congregation, swindle the profits from a moonshine still, and seduce dumb blonde Mary Lou. Mary Lou''s ex-boyfriend becomes suspicious of the preacher and gets the local police to investigate his actions.', 'Phony backwoods preacher Amos T. Huxley stays in a small North Carolina town long enough to fleece his congregation, swindle the profits from a moonshine still, and seduce dumb blonde Mary Lou. Mary Lou''s ex-boyfriend becomes suspicious of the preacher and gets the local police to investigate his actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FivjhpmtYav0HkWVxhJszKdXXf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117213'),
  ('264473426290429901', 'Preaching to the Perverted', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stuart Urban, Sam McCurdy', 'Stuart Urban', 'Guinevere Turner, Christien Anholt, Tom Bell, Julie Graham, Georgina Hale, Julian Wadham, Ricky Tomlinson, Roger Lloyd Pack', null, 'A computer wizard infiltrates a London sex club to get evidence for a shutdown, but falls for the proprietress.', 'A computer wizard infiltrates a London sex club to get evidence for a shutdown, but falls for the proprietress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44jLHbqSLDRsgdLrCaeCUQIEyEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20684'),
  ('466788965254722912', 'Precautions Against Fanatics', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog', 'Petar Radenković, Mario Adorf, Hans Tiedemann, Herbert Hisel, Peter Schamoni', null, 'The film features several horse trainers and other track workers talking about their roles at the track, always eventually interrupted by an older man who claims to be the true authority, and demands that they be thrown out. One recurring young man, the first to appear, claims that he protects the horses from enthusiastic racing fans. He does not appear to be employed by the track, but seems to provide his services voluntarily. His protection from "fanatics" gives the film its title. The film is shot in a documentary style, but the sheer implausibility of the dialogue leaves the exact nature of the film ambiguous.', 'The film features several horse trainers and other track workers talking about their roles at the track, always eventually interrupted by an older man who claims to be the true authority, and demands that they be thrown out. One recurring young man, the first to appear, claims that he protects the horses from enthusiastic racing fans. He does not appear to be employed by the track, but seems to provide his services voluntarily. His protection from "fanatics" gives the film its title. The film is shot in a documentary style, but the sheer implausibility of the dialogue leaves the exact nature of the film ambiguous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMsCfrrHbft0D8pK5fFhbqozz1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146473'),
  ('485002137619067745', 'Precious Cargo', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Max Adams, Brandon Cox, Jonathan Southard', 'Max Adams, Paul V. Seetachitt', 'Bruce Willis, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Claire Forlani, Jenna B. Kelly, Nick Loeb, Daniel Bernhardt, John Brotherton, Lydia Hull', 'R', 'After a botched heist, Eddie a murderous crime boss, hunts down the seductive thief Karen who failed him. In order to win back Eddie’s trust, Karen recruits her ex-lover and premier thief Jack to steal a cargo of rare precious gems. But when the job goes down, allegiances are betrayed and lines are crossed as Jack, Karen, and Eddie face off in a fateful showdown.', 'After a botched heist, Eddie a murderous crime boss, hunts down the seductive thief Karen who failed him. In order to win back Eddie’s trust, Karen recruits her ex-lover and premier thief Jack to steal a cargo of rare precious gems. But when the job goes down, allegiances are betrayed and lines are crossed as Jack, Karen, and Eddie face off in a fateful showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOQv2PDBu9bBCZRLeRp6QQYJDr3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384737'),
  ('981713946255236684', 'Precious Find', 1996, 'Action, Science Fiction, Western', 'Philippe Mora, Walter Bal', 'Lenny Britton', 'Rutger Hauer, Joan Chen, Brion James, Don Stroud, Philippe Mora, Tim DeZarn, Harold Pruett, Morgan Hunter', null, 'The year is 2049. 200 years after the great Californian goldrush. The new generation of gold diggers are just as full of gold fever as their ancestors.', 'The year is 2049. 200 years after the great Californian goldrush. The new generation of gold diggers are just as full of gold fever as their ancestors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdSB74gDPEeUjiZQkyyor8GtR1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62347'),
  ('191395954268878506', 'Precious Images', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Chuck Workman', null, null, null, 'A cross-cut of nearly 100 years of American movies. We see the most precious film sequences that we all remember: From Citizen Kane to Star Wars, from Some Like It Hot to E.T. The incredible short cuts of roughly a second each push the audience into a kind of trance and take them on a journey into their individual memories of great films of the 20th century. The film won an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'A cross-cut of nearly 100 years of American movies. We see the most precious film sequences that we all remember: From Citizen Kane to Star Wars, from Some Like It Hot to E.T. The incredible short cuts of roughly a second each push the audience into a kind of trance and take them on a journey into their individual memories of great films of the 20th century. The film won an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pDZf4A6U46yuVMvgO4egnkUNNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147081'),
  ('831184975635028848', 'Precious: Based on the Novel ''Push'' by Sapphire', 2009, 'Drama', 'Lee Daniels, Andrew Dunn', 'Geoffrey S. Fletcher', 'Gabourey Sidibe, Mo''Nique, Paula Patton, Mariah Carey, Sherri Shepherd, Lenny Kravitz, Stephanie Andujar, Chyna Layne', 'R', 'In Harlem in 1987, Claireece "Precious" Jones is a 16-year-old African American girl born into a life no one would want. She''s pregnant for the second time by her absent father, and at home she must wait hand and foot on her mother, an angry woman who abuses her emotionally and physically. School is chaotic and Precious has reached the ninth grade with good marks and a secret – she can''t read.', 'In Harlem in 1987, Claireece "Precious" Jones is a 16-year-old African American girl born into a life no one would want. She''s pregnant for the second time by her absent father, and at home she must wait hand and foot on her mother, an angry woman who abuses her emotionally and physically. School is chaotic and Precious has reached the ninth grade with good marks and a secret – she can''t read.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4ltLIDbvZskSwbzXqi0Hfv5ma4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25793'),
  ('492344062572184150', 'Predator', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Donald McAlpine, John McTiernan, Beau Marks', 'Jim Thomas, John Thomas', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Carl Weathers, Kevin Peter Hall, Elpidia Carrillo, Bill Duke, Jesse Ventura, Sonny Landham, Richard Chaves', 'R', 'A team of elite commandos on a secret mission in a Central American jungle come to find themselves hunted by an extraterrestrial warrior.', 'A team of elite commandos on a secret mission in a Central American jungle come to find themselves hunted by an extraterrestrial warrior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3mW4qfJo6SKqe6laRyNGnbB9n5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106'),
  ('320676965473641883', 'Predator 2', 1990, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Stephen Hopkins, Peter Levy, Paul Gentry', 'Jim Thomas, John Thomas', 'Danny Glover, Gary Busey, Rubén Blades, María Conchita Alonso, Bill Paxton, Robert Davi, Adam Baldwin, Kevin Peter Hall', 'R', 'A police chief in the war-torn streets of Los Angeles discovers that an extraterrestrial creature is hunting down residents - and that he is the next target.', 'A police chief in the war-torn streets of Los Angeles discovers that an extraterrestrial creature is hunting down residents - and that he is the next target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83X4VwY9sdSJykskmsplIVG0a4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169'),
  ('481579155971782058', 'Predator: Badlands', 2025, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Dan Trachtenberg, Richard Cowan, Jeff Cutter', 'Patrick Aison', 'Elle Fanning, Dimitrius Schuster-Koloamatangi, Ravi Narayan, Michael Homick, Stefan Grube, Reuben De Jong, Cameron Brown, Alison Wright', 'PG-13', 'Cast out from his clan, a young Predator finds an unlikely ally in a damaged android and embarks on a treacherous journey in search of the ultimate adversary.', 'Cast out from his clan, a young Predator finds an unlikely ally in a damaged android and embarks on a treacherous journey in search of the ultimate adversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erTRAi241eYF4K8KoGGOI8kFPox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242898'),
  ('249285444264975270', 'Predators', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Gyula Pados, Nimród Antal, Jonathan Swartz', 'Alex Litvak, Michael Finch', 'Adrien Brody, Topher Grace, Alice Braga, Walton Goggins, Oleg Taktarov, Laurence Fishburne, Danny Trejo, Louis Ozawa', 'R', 'A group of cold-blooded killers find themselves trapped on an alien planet to be hunted by extraterrestrial Predators.', 'A group of cold-blooded killers find themselves trapped on an alien planet to be hunted by extraterrestrial Predators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdniP8NDaJIydi1hMxhpbJMUfr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34851'),
  ('605009771675592196', 'Predators', 2025, 'Documentary', 'David Osit, David Osit', null, 'David Osit, Chris Hansen, Dani Jayden, Dan Schrack, Casey Mauro, Skeeter Jean, T Coy', 'NR', 'In the mid-aughts, Dateline NBC''s To Catch a Predator drew millions of weekly viewers to watch sting operations: men planning to meet minors for sex would instead be confronted by polished host Chris Hansen, then by the police — all on hidden camera.', 'In the mid-aughts, Dateline NBC''s To Catch a Predator drew millions of weekly viewers to watch sting operations: men planning to meet minors for sex would instead be confronted by polished host Chris Hansen, then by the police — all on hidden camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epjqcM33F3PKRZmj3KbpsXlJ3gY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400382'),
  ('921028592078023593', 'Predestination', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Michael Spierig, Peter Spierig, Ben Nott', 'Michael Spierig, Peter Spierig', 'Ethan Hawke, Sarah Snook, Noah Taylor, Christopher Kirby, Madeleine West, Jim Knobeloch, Freya Stafford, Elise Jansen', 'R', 'Predestination chronicles the life of a Temporal Agent sent on an intricate series of time-travel journeys designed to prevent future killers from committing their crimes. Now, on his final assignment, the Agent must stop the one criminal that has eluded him throughout time and prevent a devastating attack in which thousands of lives will be lost.', 'Predestination chronicles the life of a Temporal Agent sent on an intricate series of time-travel journeys designed to prevent future killers from committing their crimes. Now, on his final assignment, the Agent must stop the one criminal that has eluded him throughout time and prevent a devastating attack in which thousands of lives will be lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38Xr1JnV1ZcLQ55zmdSp6n475cZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206487'),
  ('1000986506564616694', 'Prefontaine', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Steve James, Jeanne Caliendo, Peter Gilbert', 'Eugene Corr, Steve James', 'Jared Leto, R. Lee Ermey, Ed O''Neill, Breckin Meyer, Lindsay Crouse, Amy Locane, Laurel Holloman, Brian McGovern', 'PG-13', 'It''s the true-life story of legendary track star Steve Prefontaine, the exciting and sometimes controversial "James Dean of Track," whose spirit captured the heart of the nation! Cocky, charismatic, and tough, "Pre" was a running rebel who defied rules, pushed limits ... and smashed records ...', 'It''s the true-life story of legendary track star Steve Prefontaine, the exciting and sometimes controversial "James Dean of Track," whose spirit captured the heart of the nation! Cocky, charismatic, and tough, "Pre" was a running rebel who defied rules, pushed limits ... and smashed records ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jtG9mgfiZRTRQf19BiUAY6QPN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26306'),
  ('667461682297146946', 'Prehistoric Women', 1950, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Gregg Tallas, Lionel Lindon, Al Westen', 'Sam X. Abarbanel, Gregg Tallas', 'Judy Landon, Laurette Luez, Allan Nixon, Joan Shawlee, Mara Lynn, Jo-Carroll Dennison, Kerry Vaughn, Tony Devlin', null, 'Tigri and her stone age friends, all of which are women, hate all men. However, she and her Amazon tribe see men as a "necessary evil" and capture them for potential husbands. Engor, who is smarter than the rest of the men, is able to escape them. He discovers fire and battle enormous beasts.', 'Tigri and her stone age friends, all of which are women, hate all men. However, she and her Amazon tribe see men as a "necessary evil" and capture them for potential husbands. Engor, who is smarter than the rest of the men, is able to escape them. He discovers fire and battle enormous beasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qb37xcPvl9OjlpZYmiimc6Nav9s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23335'),
  ('266486016140679801', 'Prehysteria!', 1993, 'Family, Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Albert Band, Charles Band, Adolfo Bartoli', 'Michael Davis', 'Brett Cullen, Colleen Morris, Samantha Mills, Austin O''Brien, Tony Longo, Stuart Fratkin, Stephen Lee, Tom Williams', 'PG', 'A young boy and his family embark on a series of adventures when the boy finds some mysterious eggs which hatch to reveal a brood of baby dinosaurs.', 'A young boy and his family embark on a series of adventures when the boy finds some mysterious eggs which hatch to reveal a brood of baby dinosaurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZ70Mx9Psd0ciVJvTnuQxqNy4bZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79500'),
  ('167064319273119166', 'Prehysteria! 2', 1994, 'Family, Comedy', 'James Lawrence Spencer, Albert Band, Douglas Aarniokoski', 'Brent V. Friedman, Mark Goldstein, Michael Davis', 'Kevin Connors, Jennifer Harte, Dean Scofield, Bettye Ackerman, Greg Lewis, Michael Hagiwara, Larry Hankin, Alan Palo', 'PG', 'A rich boy desperate for attention makes friends with the dinosaurs of "Prehysteria!". Prehysteria! 2', 'A rich boy desperate for attention makes friends with the dinosaurs of "Prehysteria!". Prehysteria! 2', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5QcTprkDyXvKC2exp9AyjMN4K5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201937'),
  ('275979366378834357', 'Prehysteria! 3', 1995, 'Drama, Family, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Comedy', 'James Lawrence Spencer, David DeCoteau, Fred Kennamer', 'Neil Ruttenberg, Michael Davis', 'Whitney Anderson, Matthew Bartilson, Owen Bush, Dave Buzzotta, Peter Dennis, Thomas Emery Dennis, Colter Fleming, John Fujioka', 'PG', 'The dinosaurs help young Ella and her family save their mini-putt business.', 'The dinosaurs help young Ella and her family save their mini-putt business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBTW3ME6IQuzuq6puvOhN0IQpQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201938'),
  ('39123067074985350', 'Préjudice', 2015, 'Drama', 'Antoine Cuypers, Frédéric Noirhomme', 'Antoine Cuypers, Antoine Wauters', 'Nathalie Baye, Arno Hintjens, Thomas Blanchard, Ariane Labed, Éric Caravaca, Cathy Min Jung, Julien Baumgartner, Arthur Bols', null, 'A challenging psychological drama where the carefully nurtured harmony of a family is shattered one lovely summer evening. Cédric, who is generally shut away in a world of his own, doesn''t react very well to the happy news of his sister’s pregnancy.', 'A challenging psychological drama where the carefully nurtured harmony of a family is shattered one lovely summer evening. Cédric, who is generally shut away in a world of his own, doesn''t react very well to the happy news of his sister’s pregnancy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ra2brYfSnyQrILKkjkITdsSJQsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363007'),
  ('1003134850982587042', 'Prélude', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sabrina Sarabi, Max Preiss', 'Sabrina Sarabi', 'Louis Hofmann, Liv Lisa Fries, Johannes Nussbaum, Ursina Lardi, Saskia Rosendahl, Jenny Schily, Arno Frisch, David Kosel', null, 'Nineteen-year-old David dreams of being a concert pianist on the international stage. Although his talent made him special in his home town, he soon realizes that at the conservatory he is but one of many talented students.', 'Nineteen-year-old David dreams of being a concert pianist on the international stage. Although his talent made him special in his home town, he soon realizes that at the conservatory he is but one of many talented students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxsSUhxvOwrg3U98vntOq6Y2GOs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608613'),
  ('995923952311334663', 'Prelude 1', 1995, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Turquoise and maroon-toned thin lines of paint are interspersed with variously toned circular "watermarks" of blotched paint giving-way to multi-colored brush strokes and finally fulsomely darkened and thickened brush-strokes which then thin to something akin to the beginning.', 'Turquoise and maroon-toned thin lines of paint are interspersed with variously toned circular "watermarks" of blotched paint giving-way to multi-colored brush strokes and finally fulsomely darkened and thickened brush-strokes which then thin to something akin to the beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDwLq0Iyu8JRI9f7w7lurTiiHhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384616'),
  ('624185693915779227', 'Prelude to a Kiss', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Norman René, Stefan Czapsky', 'Craig Lucas', 'Alec Baldwin, Meg Ryan, Kathy Bates, Ned Beatty, Patty Duke, Richard Riehle, Stanley Tucci, Sydney Walker', 'PG-13', 'A couple fall in love despite the girl''s pessimistic outlook. As they struggle to come to terms with their relationship, something supernatural happens that tests it.', 'A couple fall in love despite the girl''s pessimistic outlook. As they struggle to come to terms with their relationship, something supernatural happens that tests it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jircyuuGwx7OtFcSMVVXW0fNvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2613'),
  ('966509927523939175', 'Prelude: Dog Star Man', 1962, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'Stan Brakhage, Jane Wodening', null, 'A creation myth realized in light, patterns, images superimposed, rapid cutting, and silence. A black screen, then streaks of light, then an explosion of color and squiggles and happenstance. Next, images of small circles emerge then of the Sun. Images of our Earth appear, woods, a part of a body, a nude woman perhaps giving birth. Imagery evokes movement across time. Part of the Dog Star Man series of experimental films.', 'A creation myth realized in light, patterns, images superimposed, rapid cutting, and silence. A black screen, then streaks of light, then an explosion of color and squiggles and happenstance. Next, images of small circles emerge then of the Sun. Images of our Earth appear, woods, a part of a body, a nude woman perhaps giving birth. Imagery evokes movement across time. Part of the Dog Star Man series of experimental films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNDLS7aFCJp3Ir0W2O86AGFwMSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126692'),
  ('725762014897237607', 'Preludes to Ecstasy', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'T.J. Särkkä, Olavi Tuomi, Åke Lindman', 'T.J. Särkkä', 'Liana Kaarina, Esko Salminen, Toivo Mäkelä, Eero Roine, Rose-Marie Precht, Åke Lindman, Kaarlo Wilska, Severi Seppänen', null, 'Sten Lehtoja, a married, middle-aged businessman, picks up a young hitchhiker, Elsie, while driving to his summer home. Elsie spends the night and becomes his mistress. Later during the summer, Elsie also begins an affair with Reino, the teenage son of a local storekeeper. Sten offers to divorce his wife, and Elsie, attracted by the prospect of a secure social position, agrees to marry him when the divorce becomes final. One night when the couple are in bed, Reino climbs a ladder and attempts to force his way into their room; he falls and breaks his neck, and to avoid scandal Sten hides the body. But the strain of guilt ruins the romance, and Elsie contacts the police, who arrest her lover.', 'Sten Lehtoja, a married, middle-aged businessman, picks up a young hitchhiker, Elsie, while driving to his summer home. Elsie spends the night and becomes his mistress. Later during the summer, Elsie also begins an affair with Reino, the teenage son of a local storekeeper. Sten offers to divorce his wife, and Elsie, attracted by the prospect of a secure social position, agrees to marry him when the divorce becomes final. One night when the couple are in bed, Reino climbs a ladder and attempts to force his way into their room; he falls and breaks his neck, and to avoid scandal Sten hides the body. But the strain of guilt ruins the romance, and Elsie contacts the police, who arrest her lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bgcMtrmUz313jEoiQNb5yEb9UJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39009'),
  ('511430716901629823', 'Prem Ratan Dhan Payo', 2015, 'Romance, Drama, Action', 'Greg Powell, Sooraj Barjatya, V. Manikandan', 'Sooraj Barjatya', 'Salman Khan, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Neil Nitin Mukesh, Anupam Kher, Swara Bhasker, Deepak Dobriyal, Arman Kohli, Manoj Joshi', 'NR', 'While recovering from an assassination attempt four days before his coronation, a stern prince is replaced by a romantic lookalike.', 'While recovering from an assassination attempt four days before his coronation, a stern prince is replaced by a romantic lookalike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCxT9c2E0YhzxsSkweVW2ELO3mS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362136'),
  ('990290510308548876', 'Prem Rog', 1982, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Raj Kapoor, Radhu Karmakar', 'Jainendra Jain', 'Shammi Kapoor, Tanuja Samarth, Vijayendra Ghatge, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Bindu Desai, Sushma Seth, Raza Murad, Rajendranath Malhotra', null, 'Manorama, the daughter of a rich, orthodox family is married off, leaving her childhood friend Deodhar and his secret love for her, in despair. When tragedy befalls her, and traditions seem unfair, Deodhar must fight for what''s right.', 'Manorama, the daughter of a rich, orthodox family is married off, leaving her childhood friend Deodhar and his secret love for her, in despair. When tragedy befalls her, and traditions seem unfair, Deodhar must fight for what''s right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yseczqtwaxYNknHFNDyUzQ8awAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81253'),
  ('22979094944616892', 'Premalu', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Anwyn Wayne, Girish A. D., Ajmal Sabu', 'Girish A. D., Kiran Josey', 'Naslen K. Gafoor, Mamitha Baiju, Sangeeth Prathap, Shyam Mohan, Akhila Bhargavan, Meenakshi Raveendran, Mathew Thomas, Althaf Salim', null, 'Sachin, a carefree graduate, crosses paths with Reenu, a spirited IT professional, in Hyderabad. As their friendship deepens, unspoken feelings, career ambitions and life choices challenge their bond.', 'Sachin, a carefree graduate, crosses paths with Reenu, a spirited IT professional, in Hyderabad. As their friendship deepens, unspoken feelings, career ambitions and life choices challenge their bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPpmBjY3znUqGY8kYwI5xvOrSc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1149791'),
  ('193099768592003992', 'Premam', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ashwini Kale, Alphonse Puthren, Anend C Chandran', 'Alphonse Puthren', 'Nivin Pauly, Madonna Sebastian, Sai Pallavi, Anupama Parameswaran, Shabareesh Varma, Krishna Shankar, Soubin Shahir, Vinay Forrt', null, 'Three stages in George''s life, and three girls he encounters in each stage.', 'Three stages in George''s life, and three girls he encounters in each stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfMgsfDrtouYOM6MbrkHtU96Xij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341895'),
  ('865458837072698251', 'Premature', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Dan Beers, Jimmy Lindsey', 'Dan Beers, Mathew Harawitz', 'John Karna, Katie Findlay, Craig Roberts, Alan Tudyk, Carlson Young, Zoe Myers, Elon Gold, Cara Mantella', 'R', 'On the most important day of his young life, a high school senior is forced to relive his failed attempt at losing his virginity over and over again, until he gets it right.', 'On the most important day of his young life, a high school senior is forced to relive his failed attempt at losing his virginity over and over again, until he gets it right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iU7OQ2oG2HyIqmZjikXA4N86wpN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253310'),
  ('742253638218958931', 'Premature', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rashaad Ernesto Green, Laura Valladao', 'Rashaad Ernesto Green, Zora Howard', 'Zora Howard, Joshua Boone, Michelle Wilson, Alexis Marie Wint, Imani Lewis, Tashiana Washington, Nile Bullock, Myha''la', 'NR', 'The summer before she leaves for college, Ayanna meets handsome and mysterious outsider Isaiah; her entire world is turned upside down as she navigates the demanding terrain of young love against a changing Harlem landscape.', 'The summer before she leaves for college, Ayanna meets handsome and mysterious outsider Isaiah; her entire world is turned upside down as she navigates the demanding terrain of young love against a changing Harlem landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4J6RxvVCdgu7xRflDNsD492nsfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565379'),
  ('338206231179252205', 'Premeditated Murder', 1995, 'Drama', 'Gorčin Stojanović', 'Slobodan Selenić', 'Branka Katić, Nebojša Glogovac, Ana Sofrenović, Dragan Mićanović, Sergej Trifunović, Nada Blam, Svetozar Cvetković, Vladan Dujović', null, 'Men, women, and war. Jelena Panic is a young woman in Belgrade in the early 1990s, during Serbia''s war with Croatia; she''s making a book of her grandmother''s diaries from the end of World War II. She takes up with Bogdan, a young soldier recovering from war wounds. He helps her with her grandmother''s story, a tragic triangle involving her effete and well-educated husband and an uneducated major, a Chekist who has, perhaps, the power to save a political prisoner who is the grandmother''s friend. As Jelena wonders which man was her grandfather (the Chekist or the husband), Bogdan recovers from his wounds and must decide whether to return to the front. Jelena pleads; duty calls.', 'Men, women, and war. Jelena Panic is a young woman in Belgrade in the early 1990s, during Serbia''s war with Croatia; she''s making a book of her grandmother''s diaries from the end of World War II. She takes up with Bogdan, a young soldier recovering from war wounds. He helps her with her grandmother''s story, a tragic triangle involving her effete and well-educated husband and an uneducated major, a Chekist who has, perhaps, the power to save a political prisoner who is the grandmother''s friend. As Jelena wonders which man was her grandfather (the Chekist or the husband), Bogdan recovers from his wounds and must decide whether to return to the front. Jelena pleads; duty calls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMcZHTuvElOAaFzOHmLzuzJV4ao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284154'),
  ('87636783422629951', 'Premier de la classe', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Stéphane Ben Lahcene, Laurent Hanon, David Baldari', 'Morgane Aubert', 'Michèle Laroque, Pascal N''Zonzi, Mutamba Kalonji, Fatsah Bouyahmed, Issa Doumbia, Nadia Roz, Philippe Uchan, Thomas VDB', null, 'Abu, 14, is his father''s pride. Unlike his three brothers, he is the "top of his class". Well, that''s what he would have you believe. In truth, Abu is, above all, the king of lies and fake school grades. When the first meeting of parents and teachers arrives, he is going to stage the biggest lie of his life: he is looking for false teachers among his acquaintances in the neighborhood to meet his real father, while his real teachers will meet a false father.', 'Abu, 14, is his father''s pride. Unlike his three brothers, he is the "top of his class". Well, that''s what he would have you believe. In truth, Abu is, above all, the king of lies and fake school grades. When the first meeting of parents and teachers arrives, he is going to stage the biggest lie of his life: he is looking for false teachers among his acquaintances in the neighborhood to meet his real father, while his real teachers will meet a false father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw8lM0lbLnTKI4R2zWF2Ify3si4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605015'),
  ('900211391140600751', 'Premier Homme', 2017, 'Documentary, History', 'Jérôme Guiot, Frédéric Fougea, Lionel Jan Kerguistel', 'Alain-Michel Blanc, Frédéric Fougea, Stéphanie Valloatto', 'Nathan Willcocks, Jacobus Claassen, Natalie Walsh, Sven Ruygrok, Nieke Lombard, Amir Gelgor, Lee-Shane Booysen, Danica Carelse', null, 'Man’s early ancestors set off to conquer the world, to explore the unknown, to adapt to every environment. And one day, to conquer fire – a discovery that made them invincible. They built shelters. They transformed their environment. But still this did not slake their thirst for more. They sought to fathom Nature’s mysteries. They invented stories to explain the inexplicable. Now, they are Men. Here, for the very first time in television history, is the saga of our origins, told through the story of one single family - an epic journey upon which the latest scientific discoveries shine an exciting new light.', 'Man’s early ancestors set off to conquer the world, to explore the unknown, to adapt to every environment. And one day, to conquer fire – a discovery that made them invincible. They built shelters. They transformed their environment. But still this did not slake their thirst for more. They sought to fathom Nature’s mysteries. They invented stories to explain the inexplicable. Now, they are Men. Here, for the very first time in television history, is the saga of our origins, told through the story of one single family - an epic journey upon which the latest scientific discoveries shine an exciting new light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pssF3UjE7vVgR6z35XFmQz9L44q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432320'),
  ('653116517418108961', 'Premium Rush', 2012, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'David Koepp, Joseph P. Reidy, Amy Lauritsen', 'David Koepp, John Kamps', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Michael Shannon, Dania Ramirez, Jamie Chung, Wolé Parks, Aasif Mandvi, Henry O, Christopher Place', 'PG-13', 'In Manhattan, a bike messenger picks up an envelope that attracts the interest of a dirty cop, who pursues the cyclist throughout the city.', 'In Manhattan, a bike messenger picks up an envelope that attracts the interest of a dirty cop, who pursues the cyclist throughout the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHnGhJmE0LByOd4RS2mOASmUqQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49526'),
  ('1033719555952426883', 'Premonition', 2004, 'Horror', 'Norio Tsuruta', 'Jirō Tsunoda', 'Hiroshi Mikami, Noriko Sakai, Kazuhiro Yamaji, Maki Horikita, Mayumi Ono, Kei Yamamoto, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Tarō Suwa', 'R', 'While stopped at a roadside phone booth for transmitting his work through the Internet to the university, Professor Hideki Satomi finds a scrap of newspaper with the picture of his five-year-old daughter Nana in the obituary section.', 'While stopped at a roadside phone booth for transmitting his work through the Internet to the university, Professor Hideki Satomi finds a scrap of newspaper with the picture of his five-year-old daughter Nana in the obituary section.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aarfof4kkVvxw9aKETcOGX8vFaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40069'),
  ('1090018260451497285', 'Premonition', 2006, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Bernard Cavalié', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Valérie Stroh', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Valérie Stroh, Hippolyte Girardot, Nathalie Richard, Anne Canovas, Laurence Roy, Didier Bezace, Maurice Chevit', null, 'A Parisian lawyer moves to a working-class neighborhood in an attempt to shed his social conditioning and bourgeois values.', 'A Parisian lawyer moves to a working-class neighborhood in an attempt to shed his social conditioning and bourgeois values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXk1b30QwAKv77QgBMmeUEWc31z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31339'),
  ('713659515588843447', 'Premonition', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Torsten Lippstock, Mennan Yapo, Tony Steinberg', 'Bill Kelly', 'Sandra Bullock, Julian McMahon, Courtney Taylor Burness, Shyann McClure, Nia Long, Kate Nelligan, Amber Valletta, Laurel Whitsett', 'PG-13', 'A depressed housewife who learns her husband was killed in a car accident the day previously, awakens the next morning to find him alive and well at home, and then awakens the day after to a world in which he is still dead.', 'A depressed housewife who learns her husband was killed in a car accident the day previously, awakens the next morning to find him alive and well at home, and then awakens the day after to a world in which he is still dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKW1XIYrIqVrbCaYj9FQDHKXR8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9963'),
