  ('913179502429404696', 'Presumed Innocent', 1990, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Alan J. Pakula, Gordon Willis, Tony Adler', 'Frank Pierson, Alan J. Pakula', 'Harrison Ford, Brian Dennehy, Raúl Juliá, Bonnie Bedelia, Paul Winfield, Greta Scacchi, John Spencer, Joe Grifasi', 'R', 'Rusty Sabich is a deputy prosecutor engaged in an obsessive affair with a coworker who is murdered. Soon after, he''s accused of the crime. And his fight to clear his name becomes a whirlpool of lies and hidden passions.', 'Rusty Sabich is a deputy prosecutor engaged in an obsessive affair with a coworker who is murdered. Soon after, he''s accused of the crime. And his fight to clear his name becomes a whirlpool of lies and hidden passions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSPWptOsqU1nxXQe6muSPB0kD3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11092'),
