  ('809292393668687798', 'Pretend I''m Not Here', 2000, 'Drama', 'Olivier Jahan, Gilles Porte, Jean-Marc Brondolo', 'Olivier Jahan, Michel C. Pouzol', 'Jérémie Renier, Aurore Clément, Johan Leysen, Alexia Stresi, Sami Bouajila, Nathalie Richard, Pierre Berriau, Emma de Caunes', null, 'Student Eric kills time by spying on his neighbors. Compulsively taking notes on everything within binocular range from his bedroom window, he harasses his neighbors by sending unsigned notes and making their private affairs public. When they discover his identity and draw him in, will this release him from his solitude, or confirm in his mind that he will always be the outsider?', 'Student Eric kills time by spying on his neighbors. Compulsively taking notes on everything within binocular range from his bedroom window, he harasses his neighbors by sending unsigned notes and making their private affairs public. When they discover his identity and draw him in, will this release him from his solitude, or confirm in his mind that he will always be the outsider?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nFpuWGxlYlht8ArXrwXsSduhSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27127'),
  ('970575700756504307', 'Pretty as a Picture: The Art of David Lynch', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Toby Keeler, Vincent Dyer', null, 'David Lynch, Angelo Badalamenti, Jack Nance, Patricia Arquette, Balthazar Getty, Natasha Gregson Wagner, Robert Loggia, Bill Pullman', null, 'An in-depth look at artist/filmmaker David Lynch''s movies, paintings, drawings, photographs, and various other works of art. Features interview footage and commentary by family members, friends, fans, and people he''s worked with, as well as behind-the-scenes antics of some of his most critically praised efforts.', 'An in-depth look at artist/filmmaker David Lynch''s movies, paintings, drawings, photographs, and various other works of art. Features interview footage and commentary by family members, friends, fans, and people he''s worked with, as well as behind-the-scenes antics of some of his most critically praised efforts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBW9g3w4aUZPch2MgU0D7ZdLKjs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44386'),
  ('517023044644854426', 'Pretty Baby', 1978, 'Drama', 'Louis Malle, Gary Chason, Donald Heitzer', 'Polly Platt', 'Brooke Shields, Keith Carradine, Susan Sarandon, Frances Faye, Antonio Fargas, Matthew Anton, Diana Scarwid, Barbara Steele', 'R', 'In 1917 New Orleans, a 12-year-old girl is raised in a brothel by her prostitute mother.', 'In 1917 New Orleans, a 12-year-old girl is raised in a brothel by her prostitute mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smBDqEIwEZbtOYdAEVpY0QYJyRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26973'),
  ('330169451484751836', 'Pretty Bird', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Paul Schneider, Igor Martinović', 'Paul Schneider', 'Billy Crudup, Paul Giamatti, Kristen Wiig, David Hornsby, Denis O''Hare, Elizabeth Marvel, Anna Camp, Aasif Mandvi', 'R', 'A comic tale of three would-be entrepreneurs who set out to invent a rocket belt. The clash of their mismatched personalities soon dissolves the business into a morass of recriminations and retaliations, kidnapping, and murder in this parable of American dreams and delusions.', 'A comic tale of three would-be entrepreneurs who set out to invent a rocket belt. The clash of their mismatched personalities soon dissolves the business into a morass of recriminations and retaliations, kidnapping, and murder in this parable of American dreams and delusions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFPwhvFvLeJ3b4bsvxsYiYNjniC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40818'),
  ('155097599033968914', 'Pretty Boy', 1993, 'Drama', 'Carsten Sønder', 'Carsten Sønder', 'Christian Tafdrup, Benedicte W. Madsen, Rami Nathan Sverdlin, Sune Otterstrøm, Jakob Vikkelsøe, Daniel Barfod, Rasmus Botoft, Stig Hoffmeyer', null, 'Nick is a handsome 13-year-old runaway whose search for a family leads him into the arms of male prostitution. While Nick''s sexual exploits with strange men keep his pockets lined with cash, the experience does nothing to preserve his waning innocence. Soon enough, he''s as hardened as a man three times his age.', 'Nick is a handsome 13-year-old runaway whose search for a family leads him into the arms of male prostitution. While Nick''s sexual exploits with strange men keep his pockets lined with cash, the experience does nothing to preserve his waning innocence. Soon enough, he''s as hardened as a man three times his age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6P9Osf6SoOjskFutmkpQ5eJUSLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179692'),
  ('117206684728438765', 'Pretty Crazy', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy, Mystery', 'Lee Sang-geun, Kim Min-jae, Kim Il-yeon', 'Lee Sang-geun', 'Yoona, Ahn Bo-hyun, Sung Dong-il, Joo Hyun-young, Shin Hyun-soo, Ko Gun-han, Han Jae-ah, Song Duk-ho', null, 'A pastry chef apprentice lives unaware she becomes a wild she-devil nightly. Her family hires their neighbor to watch her night version, as he falls for her day self while seeking to break her curse.', 'A pastry chef apprentice lives unaware she becomes a wild she-devil nightly. Her family hires their neighbor to watch her night version, as he falls for her day self while seeking to break her curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUYYdxEexDmKpKeXOTFqscjLidz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:873797'),
  ('607151543606784677', 'Pretty Cure All Stars DX: Everyone Is a Friend - A Miracle All Pretty Cures Together', 2009, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Takashi Otsuka, Mitsuru Aoyama, Kentaro Kawasaki', 'Isao Murayama', 'Kanae Oki, Eri Kitamura, Akiko Nakagawa, Yuko Sanpei, Junko Takeuchi, Mariya Ise, Ai Nagano, Ai Maeda', null, 'Love, Miki and Inori are on their way to a dance contest, but get lost on their way to Minato Mirai. Still looking for their way, they are attacked by a monster. When the three Fresh Precure girls start to fight it, other Precures show up to support them. They all have to combine their powers to win against this mighty enemy.', 'Love, Miki and Inori are on their way to a dance contest, but get lost on their way to Minato Mirai. Still looking for their way, they are attacked by a monster. When the three Fresh Precure girls start to fight it, other Precures show up to support them. They all have to combine their powers to win against this mighty enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8qMD7S7JJ8bboY7epCTccj4BTI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84160'),
  ('124242403417373550', 'Pretty Cure All Stars DX2: The Light of Hope - Protect the Rainbow Jewel!', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Rie Matsumoto, Takashi Otsuka, Satoshi Ohtsubo', 'Isao Murayama', 'Nana Mizuki, Fumie Mizusawa, Kanae Oki, Eri Kitamura, Akiko Nakagawa, Yuka Komatsu, Yuko Sanpei, Junko Takeuchi', null, 'Tsubomi Hanasaki is woken by her best friend Erika Kurumi only to find out that their two fairies, Coffret and Shypre, have left just leaving a note explaining where to find them. Fairy Park is not only the destination of both girls, it is also the meeting point of all other Precures who planned to spend this special day together. This magical theme park holds the Rainbow Jewel, a special gem that represents all of the hopes and dreams of the world. Such a powerful stone is the object of desire of a malefic entity named Bottom who has waited one thousand years for the opportunity to possess it.', 'Tsubomi Hanasaki is woken by her best friend Erika Kurumi only to find out that their two fairies, Coffret and Shypre, have left just leaving a note explaining where to find them. Fairy Park is not only the destination of both girls, it is also the meeting point of all other Precures who planned to spend this special day together. This magical theme park holds the Rainbow Jewel, a special gem that represents all of the hopes and dreams of the world. Such a powerful stone is the object of desire of a malefic entity named Bottom who has waited one thousand years for the opportunity to possess it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFD9uh6alAK66B3RZtJIGtHAMrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57869'),
  ('272898069041908548', 'Pretty Cure All Stars DX3: Deliver the Future! The Rainbow-Colored Flower That Connects the World', 2011, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Rie Matsumoto, Kenji Takahashi, Takashi Otsuka', 'Isao Murayama', 'Ami Koshimizu, Fumiko Orikasa, Nana Mizuki, Fumie Mizusawa, Houko Kuwashima, Aya Hisakawa, Kanae Oki, Eri Kitamura', null, 'Precure All Stars Movie DX3: Deliver The Future! The Rainbow-Colored Flower That Connects The World is the third movie in the series, released on March 19, 2011, starring all the Cures from the previous series, including those introduced in Suite PreCure, as well as various villains featured in previous Pretty Cure movies. The theatrical release was edited in parts as a result of the 2011 Sendai earthquake and tsunami which occurred before the movie was due to be released.', 'Precure All Stars Movie DX3: Deliver The Future! The Rainbow-Colored Flower That Connects The World is the third movie in the series, released on March 19, 2011, starring all the Cures from the previous series, including those introduced in Suite PreCure, as well as various villains featured in previous Pretty Cure movies. The theatrical release was edited in parts as a result of the 2011 Sendai earthquake and tsunami which occurred before the movie was due to be released.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYbdoDoJJuMX1onDdpfzKH8ZvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84155'),
  ('692976815565326743', 'Pretty Cure All Stars F', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Yukiko Nakatani, Kyoko Yufu, Tomoko Kusuki', 'Jin Tanaka', 'Akira Sekine, Ai Kakuma, Maaya Sakamoto, Atsumi Tanezaki, Ayumu Murase, Ayaka Nanase, Hana Hishikawa, Ai Kayano', null, 'Pretty Cure All Stars F is a Japanese magical girl anime film and a part of the Pretty Cure franchise, celebrating its 20th anniversary.', 'Pretty Cure All Stars F is a Japanese magical girl anime film and a part of the Pretty Cure franchise, celebrating its 20th anniversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIw2vkZJllnKvp9xuqZI1BaSVqK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094448'),
  ('884767912488416239', 'Pretty Cure All Stars New Stage 2: Friends from the Heart', 2013, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Kouji Ogawa, Kenji Takahashi', 'Yoshimi Narita', 'Hitomi Nabatame, Minako Kotobuki, Mai Fuchigami, Kanako Miyamoto, Misato Fukuen, Asami Tano, Hisako Kanemoto, Marina Inoue', null, 'One day, the Pretty Cures receive an invitation to a party in their honor. Everyone is heading to the party venue, the school of fairies, but awaits a mysterious shadow. The shadow steals transformation objects! What can they do? If the Cures can not be converted are in big trouble! If this continues, the school, our world and everything else will deborado by that shadow! The 32 Pretty Cures will fight to protect everyone!', 'One day, the Pretty Cures receive an invitation to a party in their honor. Everyone is heading to the party venue, the school of fairies, but awaits a mysterious shadow. The shadow steals transformation objects! What can they do? If the Cures can not be converted are in big trouble! If this continues, the school, our world and everything else will deborado by that shadow! The 32 Pretty Cures will fight to protect everyone!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS5zHIW82tUrk8SmiSzYYfiTPN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214722'),
  ('1039474794106616925', 'Pretty Cure All Stars New Stage 3: Eternal Friends', 2014, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Kouji Ogawa, Yasuhiro Kato', 'Yoshimi Narita', 'Megumi Nakajima, Megumi Han, Hitomi Nabatame, Minako Kotobuki, Mai Fuchigami, Kanako Miyamoto, Rie Kugimiya, Marina Inoue', null, '"Pretty Cure All Stars New Stage 3: Eternal Friends") is the sixth of the Pretty Cure All Stars crossover movie series featuring all current Pretty Cure characters and the last of the "New Stage" film.', '"Pretty Cure All Stars New Stage 3: Eternal Friends") is the sixth of the Pretty Cure All Stars crossover movie series featuring all current Pretty Cure characters and the last of the "New Stage" film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9xygRdJhqRPmu6Spr2QhmYrmdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285650'),
  ('764900081150016547', 'Pretty Cure All Stars New Stage: Friends of the Future', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Kenji Takahashi, Junji Shimizu, Mitsuru Aoyama', 'Yoshimi Narita', 'Misato Fukuen, Asami Tano, Hisako Kanemoto, Marina Inoue, Chinami Nishimura, Mamiko Noto, Ami Koshimizu, Fumiko Orikasa', null, 'In the city of Minato Mirai in Yokohama, the news of Fusion''s defeat by the Pretty Cures is the hottest topic in town! Girls everywhere, were in love with the Pretty Cures, are dressing up and acting as their favourite Cures. Only Sakagami Ayumi, the new transfer student, is alone by herself. On her way home from school, Ayumi encounters a strange creature. After naming it Fuu-chan, Ayumi and the creature soon become good friends. However, Fuu-chan is actually a piece of Fusion, and holds the power of darkness. In an effort to make Ayumi happy, Fuu-chan swallows up everything that Ayumi dislikes, creating chaos in school and throughout the city! To help bring across Ayumi''s true feelings to Fuu-chan, all 28 Pretty Cures were gathered once more. When everyone''s power comes together, a miraculous light starts to shine.', 'In the city of Minato Mirai in Yokohama, the news of Fusion''s defeat by the Pretty Cures is the hottest topic in town! Girls everywhere, were in love with the Pretty Cures, are dressing up and acting as their favourite Cures. Only Sakagami Ayumi, the new transfer student, is alone by herself. On her way home from school, Ayumi encounters a strange creature. After naming it Fuu-chan, Ayumi and the creature soon become good friends. However, Fuu-chan is actually a piece of Fusion, and holds the power of darkness. In an effort to make Ayumi happy, Fuu-chan swallows up everything that Ayumi dislikes, creating chaos in school and throughout the city! To help bring across Ayumi''s true feelings to Fuu-chan, all 28 Pretty Cures were gathered once more. When everyone''s power comes together, a miraculous light starts to shine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1A4hX0uHLbpo922I0JgHrJQTi3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120422'),
  ('528887281206147325', 'Pretty Cure All Stars: Everybody Sing♪ Miraculous Magic!', 2016, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Music, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Yutaka Tsuchida, Kenji Takahashi', 'Isao Murayama', 'Rie Takahashi, Yui Horie, Yu Shimamura, Masumi Asano, Hibiku Yamamura, Miyuki Sawashiro, Megumi Nakajima, Megumi Han', null, 'Mirai and Liko come to the human world to play, but are separated when the witch Sorcierre and her servant Trauuma suddenly appear. Their aim is to acquire the tears of the 44 Pretty Cures, using them for her Most Evil Magic. Only the friendship of all 44 Pretty Cures will allow them to protect the world.', 'Mirai and Liko come to the human world to play, but are separated when the witch Sorcierre and her servant Trauuma suddenly appear. Their aim is to acquire the tears of the 44 Pretty Cures, using them for her Most Evil Magic. Only the friendship of all 44 Pretty Cures will allow them to protect the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/de8pcCDwgQ6Mne5Z0NxsQr2D943.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413164'),
  ('831156847256136909', 'Pretty Daughters-in-law', 2021, 'Romance', 'Lee Ro-woon', null, 'Yeon Joo, Lee Chae-dam, Yoon Yool, Yoon Taek-seung, Min Do-yoon, Jung In', null, 'The old man who lost his wife and lives in the house of his three daughters-in-law is bothered by their mature bodies. The three careless daughters-in-law have sex with their husbands, or shower without locking their doors, making the old man’s sexual desire more and more active.', 'The old man who lost his wife and lives in the house of his three daughters-in-law is bothered by their mature bodies. The three careless daughters-in-law have sex with their husbands, or shower without locking their doors, making the old man’s sexual desire more and more active.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyElJLPSsnrWkNCOCUCL2KOgMNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016131'),
  ('80839704189396364', 'Pretty Devils', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Serge Meynard, Bruno Privat', 'Serge Meynard', 'Olivia Bonamy, Audrey Tautou, Axelle Ade-Pasdeloup, Didier Bezace, Marie Matheron, Pierre-Loup Rajot, Natacha Amal, Chantal Pelletier', null, 'Three very different adolescent girls team up to take revenge on men until one day it is no longer a game.', 'Three very different adolescent girls team up to take revenge on men until one day it is no longer a game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oZAe3v3lGwuuJnKlrttm8p0K2I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85429'),
  ('331881111151365056', 'Pretty Far from Okay', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Aline László, Helena Hufnagel', 'Sina Flammang, Madeleine Fricke, Helena Hufnagel', 'Luise Heyer, Jytte-Merle Böhrnsen, Annika Blendl, Sunnyi Melles, Patrick Güldenberg, Boris Aljinovic, Lisa Vicari, Maximilian Schafroth', null, 'Isi doesn''t get the world anymore. Just a short while ago, life was wild, fun, and without obligations, but suddenly everyone around her seems to be grown-up and successful. With her diploma in one hand and a drink in the other, she is stuck between the careless days of college and real life. When her best friend Lotte gets a respectable job and becomes pregnant, Isi realizes that she needs to find a way to start living a life on her own.', 'Isi doesn''t get the world anymore. Just a short while ago, life was wild, fun, and without obligations, but suddenly everyone around her seems to be grown-up and successful. With her diploma in one hand and a drink in the other, she is stuck between the careless days of college and real life. When her best friend Lotte gets a respectable job and becomes pregnant, Isi realizes that she needs to find a way to start living a life on her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uF2nhr7FSstaeO6asAvWmIQicu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432660'),
  ('127600746806285686', 'Pretty Guardian Sailor Moon Cosmos the Movie Part 1', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Tomoya Takahashi, Tomoya Takahashi, Katsuya Shigehara', 'Kazuyuki Fudeyasu', 'Kotono Mitsuishi, Kenji Nojima, Misato Fukuen, Hisako Kanemoto, Rina Sato, Ami Koshimizu, Shizuka Itoh, Junko Minagawa', 'R', 'The Sailor Guardians enjoy a brief moment of peace until Mamoru''s Golden Crystal is stolen by Sailor Galaxia and the mysterious Sailor Starlights appear. One by one, Sailor Moon’s friends and loved ones are targeted by a formidable new enemy who threatens to destroy everything and rule over the cosmos.', 'The Sailor Guardians enjoy a brief moment of peace until Mamoru''s Golden Crystal is stolen by Sailor Galaxia and the mysterious Sailor Starlights appear. One by one, Sailor Moon’s friends and loved ones are targeted by a formidable new enemy who threatens to destroy everything and rule over the cosmos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CZm6hQe9kdTaUaFqB3w2GjjwZ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:968868'),
  ('790659711203409072', 'Pretty Guardian Sailor Moon Cosmos the Movie Part 2', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Tomoya Takahashi, Yoshifumi Sueda, Yuko Inoue', 'Kazuyuki Fudeyasu', 'Kotono Mitsuishi, Kenji Nojima, Misato Fukuen, Hisako Kanemoto, Rina Sato, Ami Koshimizu, Shizuka Itoh, Junko Minagawa', 'R', 'One by one, Sailor Moon’s friends and loved ones are targeted by a formidable new enemy who threatens to destroy everything and rule over the cosmos. After devastating losses, Sailor Moon endures her battle against Shadow Galactica. Will despair crush her, or will she find light in the darkness?', 'One by one, Sailor Moon’s friends and loved ones are targeted by a formidable new enemy who threatens to destroy everything and rule over the cosmos. After devastating losses, Sailor Moon endures her battle against Shadow Galactica. Will despair crush her, or will she find light in the darkness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHmtdPMhnVtZWHro6f8CuDQuusz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:968870'),
  ('121491152755936714', 'Pretty Guardian Sailor Moon Eternal the Movie Part 1', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Aya Miyajima, Maki Fujii, Yuu Yoshiyama', 'Kazuyuki Fudeyasu', 'Kotono Mitsuishi, Misato Fukuen, Hisako Kanemoto, Rina Sato, Ami Koshimizu, Shizuka Itoh, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Kenji Nojima', 'PG-13', 'After a total solar eclipse, a dark circus troupe appears, Mamoru is stricken with a mysterious malady and bad things start happening across the city. Sequel to the Sailor Moon Crystal TV series.', 'After a total solar eclipse, a dark circus troupe appears, Mamoru is stricken with a mysterious malady and bad things start happening across the city. Sequel to the Sailor Moon Crystal TV series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJaGPwYJh3c6EXNX8JlHBYQH0Ij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618851'),
  ('296223511047935410', 'Pretty Guardian Sailor Moon Eternal the Movie Part 2', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Drama', 'Chiaki Kon, Chiaki Kon, Akira Hashimoto', 'Kazuyuki Fudeyasu', 'Kotono Mitsuishi, Misato Fukuen, Hisako Kanemoto, Rina Sato, Ami Koshimizu, Shizuka Itoh, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Kenji Nojima', 'PG-13', 'While under the care of the Outer Sailor Guardians, Hotaru begins to age rapidly. Then, the time comes for all the Sailor Guardians to reunite!', 'While under the care of the Outer Sailor Guardians, Hotaru begins to age rapidly. Then, the time comes for all the Sailor Guardians to reunite!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f91rtk8dODezNLT3grQrELyzFwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784500'),
  ('777152202939452860', 'Pretty in Pink', 1986, 'Romance, Drama', 'Howard Deutch, Tak Fujimoto, Stephen Lim', 'John Hughes', 'Molly Ringwald, Andrew McCarthy, Jon Cryer, Annie Potts, Harry Dean Stanton, James Spader, Kate Vernon, Alexa Kenin', 'PG-13', 'Andie is an outcast, hanging out either with her older boss, who owns the record store where she works, or her quirky high school classmate Duckie, who has a crush on her. When one of the rich and popular kids at school, Blane, asks Andie out, it seems too good to be true. As Andie starts falling for Blane, she begins to realize that dating someone from a different social sphere is not easy.', 'Andie is an outcast, hanging out either with her older boss, who owns the record store where she works, or her quirky high school classmate Duckie, who has a crush on her. When one of the rich and popular kids at school, Blane, asks Andie out, it seems too good to be true. As Andie starts falling for Blane, she begins to realize that dating someone from a different social sphere is not easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeFJyzJBufJexpOuywuPp8q2tCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11522'),
  ('774176757901588696', 'Pretty Lethal', 2026, 'Music, Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Vicky Jewson, Bridger Nielson, David Stafford', 'Kate Freund', 'Maddie Ziegler, Lana Condor, Iris Apatow, Millicent Simmonds, Avantika, Michael Culkin, Lydia Leonard, Uma Thurman', 'R', 'A troupe of ballerinas find themselves fighting for survival as they attempt to escape from a remote inn after their bus breaks down on the way to a dance competition.', 'A troupe of ballerinas find themselves fighting for survival as they attempt to escape from a remote inn after their bus breaks down on the way to a dance competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znTPnXCK3lEQJgqXCvP7e5FUz6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084187'),
  ('472259560354999145', 'Pretty Maid Café', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Akiyoshi Sugiura', null, 'Taichi Hirabayashi, Kotono, Jun Takatsuki, Taketora Morita', null, 'Geeky Hideki can''t seem to catch a break, so his friend brings him to a café to cheer him up. But Hideki finds more than good service at the café; he falls in love with his waitress, Misaki, who is dressed in a maid''s uniform and caters to his every whim. He gets up the courage to ask her out ... to go fishing. Will his inexperience chase Misaki away? The third installment in the "Akihabara trilogy". Each of these stand alone films are set in the famed Akihabara shopping district in Tokyo which is a popular destination for hardcore fans of anime, manga, video games and model kits. This city-sized shopping area provides a colorful backdrop and plays an integral part in the storylines for each of the three movies.', 'Geeky Hideki can''t seem to catch a break, so his friend brings him to a café to cheer him up. But Hideki finds more than good service at the café; he falls in love with his waitress, Misaki, who is dressed in a maid''s uniform and caters to his every whim. He gets up the courage to ask her out ... to go fishing. Will his inexperience chase Misaki away? The third installment in the "Akihabara trilogy". Each of these stand alone films are set in the famed Akihabara shopping district in Tokyo which is a popular destination for hardcore fans of anime, manga, video games and model kits. This city-sized shopping area provides a colorful backdrop and plays an integral part in the storylines for each of the three movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDN4unTSeG1fE9yYx5j08l5dgIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123892'),
  ('332265686372301919', 'Pretty Maids All in a Row', 1971, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Roger Vadim, Charles Rosher Jr.', 'Gene Roddenberry', 'Rock Hudson, Angie Dickinson, Telly Savalas, John David Carson, Roddy McDowall, Keenan Wynn, James Doohan, William Campbell', 'R', 'At Oceanfront High School, female students are being targeted by an unknown serial killer. Meanwhile, a married teacher hides his flings with nubile students, and an awkward male is frustrated by the plethora of uninhibited freewheeling young girls.', 'At Oceanfront High School, female students are being targeted by an unknown serial killer. Meanwhile, a married teacher hides his flings with nubile students, and an awkward male is frustrated by the plethora of uninhibited freewheeling young girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9fOCFolNCB5RQ4grachHoYK7cb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69321'),
