  ('603017218439595730', 'Pretty Princess', 1993, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Carlo Vanzina, Luigi Kuveiller', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Raoul Bova, Barbara Snellenburg, David Warner, Susannah York, Paul Freeman, Catherine Schell, Liz Smith, Alessio Avenali', null, 'A princess from a Nordic European country is obligated to marry the boy her family chose. She escapes and discovers love in the arms of a beautiful swimming teacher.', 'A princess from a Nordic European country is obligated to marry the boy her family chose. She escapes and discovers love in the arms of a beautiful swimming teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLPHCRHXDAVZFI9IznwDY0jApR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74004'),
  ('612421074384483207', 'Pretty Smart', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dimitri Logothetis, Dimitris Papakonstadis', 'Dan Hoskins', 'Tricia Leigh Fisher, Dennis Cole, Patricia Arquette, Kimberly B. Delfin, Paris Vaughan, Joely Fisher, Julie K. Smith, Lisa Lörient', null, 'In this adolescent-oriented drama, a young woman is forced to attend a posh finishing school in the Mediterranean. She vents her anger by rebelling against the cruel and sicko headmaster. When she discovers that he has been secretly photographing them naked and profiting from the pictures, she rallies the other girls and gets revenge.', 'In this adolescent-oriented drama, a young woman is forced to attend a posh finishing school in the Mediterranean. She vents her anger by rebelling against the cruel and sicko headmaster. When she discovers that he has been secretly photographing them naked and profiting from the pictures, she rallies the other girls and gets revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MKL2ORILcnEoCETBtSY2RJ92JE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134153'),
  ('583615729827226317', 'Pretty Thing', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Justin Kelly, Matt Klammer', 'Jack Donnelly', 'Karl Glusman, Alicia Silverstone, Catherine Curtin, Sergi Martos, Britne Oldford, Monica Rae Summers Gonzalez, Kyle Bary, Paul McCallion', 'R', 'A successful executive fights back when a scorned young lover takes his obsession too far.', 'A successful executive fights back when a scorned young lover takes his obsession too far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWVbtqUvuhAOYzkZV6YDQOnN5fQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1223690'),
  ('150230335123478487', 'Pretty Things', 2001, 'Drama', 'Gilles Paquet-Brenner', 'Gilles Paquet-Brenner', 'Marion Cotillard, Stomy Bugsy, Patrick Bruel, Titoff, Ophélie Winter, Tony Amoni, Matthieu Touboul, Axelle Renoir', null, 'Lucie, who works as a white-hot fashion model, exhibits a dominant, often controlling, "Type A" personality, whereas identical twin Marie consistently projects a backward, reserved, laconic and unassuming attitude. When Lucie receives a covetable French recording contract, a significant problem stands in her way: the inability to sing. Marie possesses the voice of an angel, however, and quickly jets off to Paris to stand in for her sister, unannounced - little realizing the dangerous and even violent string of consequences that she is igniting.', 'Lucie, who works as a white-hot fashion model, exhibits a dominant, often controlling, "Type A" personality, whereas identical twin Marie consistently projects a backward, reserved, laconic and unassuming attitude. When Lucie receives a covetable French recording contract, a significant problem stands in her way: the inability to sing. Marie possesses the voice of an angel, however, and quickly jets off to Paris to stand in for her sister, unannounced - little realizing the dangerous and even violent string of consequences that she is igniting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVlcUoZ586iHmNwftwx8RIuEzR7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31355'),
  ('315962544721754768', 'Pretty Ugly People', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Tate Taylor, J.P. Lipa', 'Tate Taylor', 'Missi Pyle, Melissa McCarthy, Josh Hopkins, Octavia Spencer, Jack Noseworthy, Larry Sullivan, Allison Janney, Phill Lewis', 'R', 'Lucy has always used food to escape life''s problems, but when this self-titled "fat friend" lures her group of old college buddies to the Montana wilderness, she reveals a new self - skinny, beautiful and still flawed.', 'Lucy has always used food to escape life''s problems, but when this self-titled "fat friend" lures her group of old college buddies to the Montana wilderness, she reveals a new self - skinny, beautiful and still flawed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/togHIE3Bs2alz7CNt8o7x1QVXGz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24450'),
