  ('784691450350780520', 'Prey for Rock & Roll', 2003, 'Drama, Music', 'Alex Steyermark, Leonard Reynolds III, Antonio Calvache', 'Cheri Lovedog, Robin Shushan', 'Gina Gershon, Drea De Matteo, Marc Blucas, Shelly Cole, Ivan Martin, Lori Petty, Sandra Seacat, Ashley Eckstein', 'R', 'In late 1980s Los Angeles, Jacki and her all-girl punk rock band, Clam Dandy, are trying to make it big. On the verge of turning 40, Jacki decides that if the band''s one last shot at the big time is unsuccessful, she will give up her dreams of stardom.', 'In late 1980s Los Angeles, Jacki and her all-girl punk rock band, Clam Dandy, are trying to make it big. On the verge of turning 40, Jacki decides that if the band''s one last shot at the big time is unsuccessful, she will give up her dreams of stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXXAJjWHcXbfwdlq96nHSTxCVHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28026'),
  ('144543399116555106', 'Prey for the Devil', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tsvetelina Mateeva, Ioan Banzourkov, Kristina Sakizli', 'Robert Zappia', 'Jacqueline Byers, Colin Salmon, Christian Navarro, Lisa Palfrey, Nicholas Ralph, Ben Cross, Virginia Madsen, Tom Forbes', 'PG-13', 'In response to a global rise in demonic possessions, the Catholic Church reopens exorcism schools to train priests in the Rite of Exorcism. On this spiritual battlefield, an unlikely warrior rises: a young nun, Sister Ann. Thrust onto the spiritual frontline with fellow student Father Dante, Sister Ann finds herself in a battle for the soul of a young girl and soon realizes the Devil has her right where he wants her.', 'In response to a global rise in demonic possessions, the Catholic Church reopens exorcism schools to train priests in the Rite of Exorcism. On this spiritual battlefield, an unlikely warrior rises: a young nun, Sister Ann. Thrust onto the spiritual frontline with fellow student Father Dante, Sister Ann finds herself in a battle for the soul of a young girl and soon realizes the Devil has her right where he wants her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCvgemXf2Kpr2LvpDmt5J9NhjKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676547'),
  ('1139724815653228447', 'Prey of the Chameleon', 1992, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Fleming B. Fuller, Randolph Sellars', 'Fleming B. Fuller, April Campbell Jones, Ronald J. Fields', 'Daphne Zuniga, James Wilder, Alexandra Paul, Don Harvey, Red West, Michelle McBride, Bob Larkin, David Wells', null, 'J.D. returns to his hometown many years after leaving Carrie at the altar. After their unhappy reunion, J.D. heads to California, only to soon fall for a woman he helps with her broken down car. Little does he know that this woman is a serial killer who takes on the identity of each of her victims.', 'J.D. returns to his hometown many years after leaving Carrie at the altar. After their unhappy reunion, J.D. heads to California, only to soon fall for a woman he helps with her broken down car. Little does he know that this woman is a serial killer who takes on the identity of each of her victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sghvsgFwPpDSQzyb5nDZV9P5i6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291671'),
