  ('398186277663908997', 'Prick Up Your Ears', 1987, 'Drama', 'Stephen Frears, Lee Cleary, Michael Zimbrich', 'Alan Bennett', 'Gary Oldman, Alfred Molina, Vanessa Redgrave, Wallace Shawn, Lindsay Duncan, Julie Walters, James Grant, Frances Barber', 'R', 'When the young, attractive Joe Orton meets the older, more introverted Kenneth Halliwell at drama school, he befriends the kindred spirit and they start an affair. As Orton becomes more comfortable with his sexuality and starts to find success with his writing, Halliwell becomes increasingly alienated and jealous, ultimately tapping into a dangerous rage.', 'When the young, attractive Joe Orton meets the older, more introverted Kenneth Halliwell at drama school, he befriends the kindred spirit and they start an affair. As Orton becomes more comfortable with his sexuality and starts to find success with his writing, Halliwell becomes increasingly alienated and jealous, ultimately tapping into a dangerous rage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLrWxmqPqAQFjyefJtYjoaDxGpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27857'),
  ('156891619222510484', 'Prickly Pears', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Massimo Carocci, Carlo Carlini', 'Renato Pozzetto, Sandro Continenza, Raimondo Vianello', 'Renato Pozzetto, Aldo Maccione, Gloria Guida, Diego Abatantuono, Gianfranco Barra, Daniele Formica, Luca Sportelli, Roberto Della Casa', null, 'Lorenzo is the mayor of a small town. One evening, returning home, surprised the well-known playboy Ghigo Buccilli who tries to seduce his beautiful wife. Enraged, he threatens the two with a gun, and Buccilli is the victim of a heart attack: the man survives but, forced to total rest, remains at the mayor''s house. The result is an endless series of gags and misunderstandings, due to the stratagems devised by Lorenzo to avoid that the situation becomes the subject of gossip by fellow citizens ...', 'Lorenzo is the mayor of a small town. One evening, returning home, surprised the well-known playboy Ghigo Buccilli who tries to seduce his beautiful wife. Enraged, he threatens the two with a gun, and Buccilli is the victim of a heart attack: the man survives but, forced to total rest, remains at the mayor''s house. The result is an endless series of gags and misunderstandings, due to the stratagems devised by Lorenzo to avoid that the situation becomes the subject of gossip by fellow citizens ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSlVFECwfLxy9VdPo9evC1a3m9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77330'),
  ('1100342395052536259', 'Pride', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Manuel Mur Oti, Juan Mariné', 'Jaime García Herranz, Manuel Mur Oti', 'Marisa Prado, Alberto Ruschel, Enrique Diosdado, Cándida Losada, Fernando Nogueras, Félix Fernández, Beni Deus, María Francés', null, 'A tale of two families, the Mendozas and Alzagas, faced for generations by the water of a river separating their adjoining properties. Old grudges reappear when the two heirs fall in love.', 'A tale of two families, the Mendozas and Alzagas, faced for generations by the water of a river separating their adjoining properties. Old grudges reappear when the two heirs fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPipYysWLPzpMq8NZEtpAQYGm6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171553'),
  ('208897860424579876', 'Pride', 2004, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'John Downer, Michael W. Richards', null, 'Kate Winslet, Helen Mirren, Sean Bean, Rupert Graves, Jim Broadbent, Robbie Coltrane, Martin Freeman, John Hurt', null, 'The story of Suki, a lioness cub, who rebels against her mother and her Pride to mate with an unsuitable lion from the other side of the river.', 'The story of Suki, a lioness cub, who rebels against her mother and her Pride to mate with an unsuitable lion from the other side of the river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smwTDsE33wGV8PFi3kz9h3kOUcr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17452'),
  ('351712134339472582', 'Pride', 2007, 'Drama', 'Sunu Gonera, Matthew F. Leonetti', 'Kevin Michael Smith, J. Mills Goodloe, Michael Gozzard', 'Terrence Howard, Bernie Mac, Kimberly Elise, Tom Arnold, Brandon Fobbs, Alphonso McAuley, Regine Nehy, Nate Parker', 'PG', 'Coach Jim Ellis shocks the community and changes lives when, aided by a local janitor, he sets out to form Philadelphia''s first black swim team. But the odds are against them as they battle rigid rules, racism and more.', 'Coach Jim Ellis shocks the community and changes lives when, aided by a local janitor, he sets out to form Philadelphia''s first black swim team. But the odds are against them as they battle rigid rules, racism and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBMqdt52wgU9soSD9Asq1eNx6iX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16385'),
  ('679864246117848635', 'Pride & Prejudice', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roman Osin, Joe Wright, Guy Heeley', 'Deborah Moggach', 'Keira Knightley, Matthew Macfadyen, Brenda Blethyn, Rosamund Pike, Carey Mulligan, Jena Malone, Talulah Riley, Donald Sutherland', 'PG', 'A story of love and life among the landed English gentry during the Georgian era. Mr. Bennet is a gentleman living in Hertfordshire with his overbearing wife and five daughters, but if he dies their house will be inherited by a distant cousin whom they have never met, so the family''s future happiness and security is dependent on the daughters making good marriages.', 'A story of love and life among the landed English gentry during the Georgian era. Mr. Bennet is a gentleman living in Hertfordshire with his overbearing wife and five daughters, but if he dies their house will be inherited by a distant cousin whom they have never met, so the family''s future happiness and security is dependent on the daughters making good marriages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8UhmEbWPHmTUxP0lMuCoqNkbB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4348'),
  ('389865084608341804', 'Pride and Glory', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gavin O''Connor, Declan Quinn, Todd Pfeiffer', 'Joe Carnahan, Gavin O''Connor', 'Edward Norton, Jon Voight, Colin Farrell, Noah Emmerich, Jennifer Ehle, John Ortiz, Frank Grillo, Shea Whigham', 'R', 'A saga centered on a multi-generational family of New York City Police officers. The family''s moral codes are tested when Ray Tierney, investigates a case that reveals an incendiary police corruption scandal involving his own brother-in-law. For Ray, the truth is revelatory, a Pandora''s Box that threatens to upend not only the Tierney legacy but the entire NYPD.', 'A saga centered on a multi-generational family of New York City Police officers. The family''s moral codes are tested when Ray Tierney, investigates a case that reveals an incendiary police corruption scandal involving his own brother-in-law. For Ray, the truth is revelatory, a Pandora''s Box that threatens to upend not only the Tierney legacy but the entire NYPD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VZ1ABbtXqwPcc06yXbf3gj3anG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13150'),
  ('1106985446017385625', 'Pride and Prejudice', 1940, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Groesse, Karl Freund, Robert Z. Leonard', 'Aldous Huxley, Jane Murfin', 'Greer Garson, Laurence Olivier, Mary Boland, Edna May Oliver, Maureen O''Sullivan, Ann Rutherford, Frieda Inescort, Edmund Gwenn', 'NR', 'In early 19th century England, Mr and Mrs Bennet''s five unmarried daughters vie for the affections of rich and eligible Mr Bingley and his status-conscious friend, Mr Darcy, who have moved into their neighbourhood. While Bingley takes an immediate liking to eldest daughter Jane, Darcy has difficulty adapting to local society and repeatedly clashes with second-eldest Elizabeth.', 'In early 19th century England, Mr and Mrs Bennet''s five unmarried daughters vie for the affections of rich and eligible Mr Bingley and his status-conscious friend, Mr Darcy, who have moved into their neighbourhood. While Bingley takes an immediate liking to eldest daughter Jane, Darcy has difficulty adapting to local society and repeatedly clashes with second-eldest Elizabeth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoWwsLkuY5tMxUqkKMOHAJlImTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43818'),
  ('932941876150944474', 'Pride and Prejudice', 2003, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Andrew Black, Bianca Cline', 'Anne K. Black, Katherine Brim, Jason Faller', 'Kam Heskin, Orlando Seale, Benjamin Gourley, Lucila Solá, Henry Maguire, Kelly Stables, Amber Hamilton Russo, Rainy Kerwin', 'PG', 'In this contemporary LDS twist on Jane Austen''s iconic novel, Elizabeth Bennet is a hard-working, intelligent college student who won''t even think about marriage until she graduates. But when she meets Jack Wickham, a good-looking playboy, and Darcy, a sensible businessman, Elizabeth''s determination is put to the test. Will she see through their exteriors and discover their true intentions?', 'In this contemporary LDS twist on Jane Austen''s iconic novel, Elizabeth Bennet is a hard-working, intelligent college student who won''t even think about marriage until she graduates. But when she meets Jack Wickham, a good-looking playboy, and Darcy, a sensible businessman, Elizabeth''s determination is put to the test. Will she see through their exteriors and discover their true intentions?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oAub2opFoDhepSoNW3Tlcmems7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18087'),
  ('1150720658065024178', 'Pride and Prejudice and Zombies', 2016, 'Romance, Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'Burr Steers, Remi Adefarasin', 'Burr Steers', 'Lily James, Sam Riley, Jack Huston, Bella Heathcote, Douglas Booth, Matt Smith, Charles Dance, Lena Headey', 'PG-13', 'A zombie outbreak has fallen upon the land in this reimagining of Jane Austen''s classic tale of the tangled relationships between lovers from different social classes in 19th century England. Feisty heroine Elizabeth Bennet is a master of martial arts and weaponry and the handsome Mr. Darcy is a fierce zombie killer, yet the epitome of upper class prejudice. As the zombie outbreak intensifies, they must swallow their pride and join forces on the blood-soaked battlefield in order to conquer the undead once and for all.', 'A zombie outbreak has fallen upon the land in this reimagining of Jane Austen''s classic tale of the tangled relationships between lovers from different social classes in 19th century England. Feisty heroine Elizabeth Bennet is a master of martial arts and weaponry and the handsome Mr. Darcy is a fierce zombie killer, yet the epitome of upper class prejudice. As the zombie outbreak intensifies, they must swallow their pride and join forces on the blood-soaked battlefield in order to conquer the undead once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsJlOhVHiz1xXr36616EI8tJ4b2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58431'),
  ('883799788527210279', 'Pride of the Bowery', 1940, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Joseph H. Lewis, Arthur Hammond, Herman Pett', 'George H. Plympton', 'Leo Gorcey, Bobby Jordan, Kenneth Howell, Mary Ainslee, Bobby Stone, Donald Haines, David Gorcey, Sunshine Sammy Morrison', 'NR', 'Muggs is tricked into entering a Civilian Conservation Corps camp by Danny in order to get in shape. Muggs resists and battles with the camp captain and with other campers. He also becomes involved in trying to help one of his friends get out of trouble.', 'Muggs is tricked into entering a Civilian Conservation Corps camp by Danny in order to get in shape. Muggs resists and battles with the camp captain and with other campers. He also becomes involved in trying to help one of his friends get out of trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htElgtS4PAly51oEe7tcTrPI9fo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23338'),
  ('1040970802108931738', 'Pride of the Marines', 1945, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Delmer Daves, J. Peverell Marley, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Albert Maltz', 'John Garfield, Eleanor Parker, Dane Clark, John Ridgely, Rosemary DeCamp, Ann Doran, Ann E. Todd, Warren Douglas', 'NR', 'Marine hero Al Schmid is blinded in battle and returns home to be rehabilitated. He readjusts to his civilian life with the help of his soon to be wife.', 'Marine hero Al Schmid is blinded in battle and returns home to be rehabilitated. He readjusts to his civilian life with the help of his soon to be wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpDRMCsw1TsLVrrZgkecneIbHeD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52337'),
  ('114762505310214176', 'Pride, Prejudice and Mistletoe', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'David A. Makin, Rocco Gismondi, Don McBrearty', null, 'Lacey Chabert, Brendan Penny, Sherry Miller, Art Hindle, Anna Hardwick, Morgan David Jones, Mark Wiebe, Steve Belford', null, 'Darcy has always worked hard to prove herself and be successful on her own terms, even choosing to start her own company, rather than work with her father. Returning to her hometown for Christmas, Darcy reconnects with an old rival, restaurant owner Luke, and they are forced to plan a charity event together. As Darcy spends time with her family and Luke, she starts to realize what matters most in life and sets out to mend her relationship with her father, and possibly fall in love.', 'Darcy has always worked hard to prove herself and be successful on her own terms, even choosing to start her own company, rather than work with her father. Returning to her hometown for Christmas, Darcy reconnects with an old rival, restaurant owner Luke, and they are forced to plan a charity event together. As Darcy spends time with her family and Luke, she starts to realize what matters most in life and sets out to mend her relationship with her father, and possibly fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEZ0Sd1Jy22gKij2LONgitlRmNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535810'),
  ('724967177107071740', 'Priest', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Antonia Bird, Fred Tammes', 'Jimmy McGovern', 'Linus Roache, Tom Wilkinson, Robert Carlyle, Cathy Tyson, Lesley Sharp, Robert Pugh, Christine Tremarco, James Ellis', 'R', 'The deeply held religious convictions of an idealistic young priest are challenged when he must face extraordinary events within his own congregation.', 'The deeply held religious convictions of an idealistic young priest are challenged when he must face extraordinary events within his own congregation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCZ2eGJb78HzaYthNwVF8R0G6BG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40156'),
  ('392947845845199656', 'Priest', 2011, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Scott Stewart, Don Burgess, Bradley Rubin', 'Min-Woo Hyung, Cory Goodman', 'Paul Bettany, Karl Urban, Lily Collins, Maggie Q, Stephen Moyer, Cam Gigandet, Mädchen Amick, Brad Dourif', 'PG-13', 'In an alternate world, humanity and vampires have warred for centuries. After the last Vampire War, the veteran Warrior Priest lives in obscurity with other humans inside one of the Church''s walled cities. When the Priest''s niece is kidnapped by vampires, the Priest breaks his vows to hunt them down. He is accompanied by the niece''s boyfriend, who is a wasteland sheriff, and a former Warrior Priestess.', 'In an alternate world, humanity and vampires have warred for centuries. After the last Vampire War, the veteran Warrior Priest lives in obscurity with other humans inside one of the Church''s walled cities. When the Priest''s niece is kidnapped by vampires, the Priest breaks his vows to hunt them down. He is accompanied by the niece''s boyfriend, who is a wasteland sheriff, and a former Warrior Priestess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYHiA7LPGl9DG7m3DUs0Td1VMcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38321'),
  ('244953750541966321', 'Priest Daens', 1992, 'Drama, History', 'Stijn Coninx, Walther van den Ende, Johan Dirckx', 'François Chevallier, Stijn Coninx, Addy Weijers', 'Jan Decleir, Gérard Desarthe, Antje De Boeck, Michaël Pas, Karel Baetens, Julien Schoenaerts, Wim Meuwissen, Brit Alen', null, 'In the 1890s, Father Adolf Daens goes to Aalst, a textile town where child labor is rife, pay and working conditions are horrible, the poor have no vote, and the Catholic church backs the petite bourgeoisie in oppressing workers. He writes a few columns for the Catholic paper, and soon workers are listening and the powerful are in an uproar. He''s expelled from the Catholic party, so he starts the Christian Democrats and is elected to Parliament. After Rome disciplines him, he must choose between two callings, as priest and as champion of workers. In subplots, a courageous young woman falls in love with a socialist and survives a shop foreman''s rape; children die; prelates play billiards.', 'In the 1890s, Father Adolf Daens goes to Aalst, a textile town where child labor is rife, pay and working conditions are horrible, the poor have no vote, and the Catholic church backs the petite bourgeoisie in oppressing workers. He writes a few columns for the Catholic paper, and soon workers are listening and the powerful are in an uproar. He''s expelled from the Catholic party, so he starts the Christian Democrats and is elected to Parliament. After Rome disciplines him, he must choose between two callings, as priest and as champion of workers. In subplots, a courageous young woman falls in love with a socialist and survives a shop foreman''s rape; children die; prelates play billiards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jH0dtpIBt0w0KGsj60zXtHCABqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44103'),
  ('1079787668680791426', 'Priest of Darkness', 1936, 'Drama', 'Sadao Yamanaka, Harumi Machii', 'Shintarō Mimura', 'Chōjūrō Kawarasaki, Kan''emon Nakamura, Shizue Kawarazaki, Setsuko Hara, Sensho Ichikawa, Daisuke Katō, Sukezō Sukedakaya, Chōemon Bandō', null, 'A boy steals a knife from an old samurai, unaware of its value, setting off a strange chain of events.', 'A boy steals a knife from an old samurai, unaware of its value, setting off a strange chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0b93Ew6nGffih6mW4TNvLF5Uxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128722'),
  ('259668298830464612', 'Priest of Love', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christopher Miles, Graham Fowler, Nigel Goldsack', 'Alan Plater', 'Ian McKellen, Janet Suzman, Ava Gardner, Penelope Keith, Maurizio Merli, John Gielgud, Jorge Rivero, James Faulkner', 'R', 'Following the banning and burning of his novel, "The Rainbow," D.H. Lawrence and his wife, Frieda, move to the United States, and then to Mexico. When Lawrence contracts tuberculosis, they return to England for a short time, then to Italy, where Lawrence writes "Lady Chatterley''s Lover."', 'Following the banning and burning of his novel, "The Rainbow," D.H. Lawrence and his wife, Frieda, move to the United States, and then to Mexico. When Lawrence contracts tuberculosis, they return to England for a short time, then to Italy, where Lawrence writes "Lady Chatterley''s Lover."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A31WqFh6h0tjQMjO2igG4zncLTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49789'),
  ('56393867878819127', 'Priklyucheniya pingvinenka Lolo. Film pervyy', 1986, 'Animation', 'Gennadiy Sokolskiy, Kenji Yoshida', 'Eiichi Taji, Viktor Merezhko, Shozo Matsuda', 'Svetlana Stepchenko, Lyudmila Gnilova', null, 'A family cartoon about the amusing adventures of a brave little penguin named Lolo. This charming short film immerses viewers in the world of Antarctic adventures, where little Lolo and his friend Pepe solve puzzles, explore their surroundings, and help other animals. Despite his young age, the penguin chick shows wit and courage.', 'A family cartoon about the amusing adventures of a brave little penguin named Lolo. This charming short film immerses viewers in the world of Antarctic adventures, where little Lolo and his friend Pepe solve puzzles, explore their surroundings, and help other animals. Despite his young age, the penguin chick shows wit and courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47SdYn0OMdGZvHfs1eDeKOsE0xY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444509'),
  ('262057228214447080', 'Primal', 2010, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Josh Reed', 'Nigel Christensen, Josh Reed', 'Zoe Tuckwell-Smith, Krew Boylan, Will Travel, Damien Freeleagus, Rebekah Foord, Lindsay Farris', 'NR', 'Anja and five friends join anthroplogy student, Dace, on a journey to study a remote, ancient rock painting. Their excitement vanishes when Mel becomes delirious after skinny-dipping in the waterhole. Feverish, bleeding, confused, she physically and mentally regresses to a vicious predatory state. Mel has gone primal. Mel’s lover and friends realise they are the prey as she savagely hunts them down. Before they can escape another one of them starts to regress, posing a hideous choice; kill their friends or be killed by them. Their only hope of survival is through a cave, where Anja learns too late the meaning of the ancient rock art they came to study.', 'Anja and five friends join anthroplogy student, Dace, on a journey to study a remote, ancient rock painting. Their excitement vanishes when Mel becomes delirious after skinny-dipping in the waterhole. Feverish, bleeding, confused, she physically and mentally regresses to a vicious predatory state. Mel has gone primal. Mel’s lover and friends realise they are the prey as she savagely hunts them down. Before they can escape another one of them starts to regress, posing a hideous choice; kill their friends or be killed by them. Their only hope of survival is through a cave, where Anja learns too late the meaning of the ancient rock art they came to study.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXq7G9GcemHVDpxDmwWDoVULdnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49958'),
  ('348093459215609489', 'Primal', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Nick Powell, Javier E. Pérez, Alexandra Burgos', 'Richard Leder', 'Nicolas Cage, Famke Janssen, Kevin Durand, Jeremy Jay Nazario, LaMonica Garrett, Michael Imperioli, Isaac Santiago, Braulio Castillo Jr.', null, 'A big-game hunter for zoos books passage on a Greek shipping freighter with a fresh haul of exotic and deadly animals from the Amazon, including a rare white Jaguar – along with a political assassin being extradited to the U.S in secret. Two days into the journey, the assassin escapes and releases the captive animals, throwing the ship into chaos.', 'A big-game hunter for zoos books passage on a Greek shipping freighter with a fresh haul of exotic and deadly animals from the Amazon, including a rare white Jaguar – along with a political assassin being extradited to the U.S in secret. Two days into the journey, the assassin escapes and releases the captive animals, throwing the ship into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0Air5GTsfgtjsnZyji2lH6r2b8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500916'),
  ('621465121075542827', 'Primal Fear', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gregory Hoblit, Michael Chapman, Lucille OuYang', 'Steve Shagan, Ann Biderman', 'Richard Gere, Laura Linney, Edward Norton, John Mahoney, Alfre Woodard, Frances McDormand, Terry O''Quinn, Andre Braugher', 'R', 'Defense attorney Martin Vail takes on jobs for money and prestige rather than any sense of the greater good. His latest case involves an altar boy, accused of brutally murdering the archbishop of Chicago. Vail finds himself up against his ex-pupil and ex-lover, but as the case progresses and the Church''s dark secrets are revealed, Vail finds that what appeared a simple case takes on a darker, more dangerous aspect.', 'Defense attorney Martin Vail takes on jobs for money and prestige rather than any sense of the greater good. His latest case involves an altar boy, accused of brutally murdering the archbishop of Chicago. Vail finds himself up against his ex-pupil and ex-lover, but as the case progresses and the Church''s dark secrets are revealed, Vail finds that what appeared a simple case takes on a darker, more dangerous aspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJf2TzE8nRTFbFMPJNW6c8mI0KU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1592'),
  ('621294673295643542', 'Primal Force', 1999, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Nelson McCormick, Checco Varese', 'Michael Thoma', 'Ron Perlman, Mark Kiely, Roxana Zal, Kimberlee Peterson, Guillermo Ríos, Richard Fancy, Julian Sedgwick, Ramiro González', 'NR', 'Rescuers try to reach plane crash victims that are trapped on an isolated Mexican island populated by mutant baboons. Ron Perlman stars as a troubled guide hired to lead the mission.', 'Rescuers try to reach plane crash victims that are trapped on an isolated Mexican island populated by mutant baboons. Ron Perlman stars as a troubled guide hired to lead the mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onbKS51odRl1svOcfS8jNDQOIgv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122539'),
  ('1014681232995922566', 'Primal Rage', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Vittorio Rambaldi, Antonio Climati', 'Umberto Lenzi, James Justice', 'Patrick Lowe, Cheryl Arutt, Sarah Buxton, Mitch Watson, Bo Svenson, Doug Sloan, Luis Valderrama, John Baldwin', 'R', 'A scientist at a Florida university inadvertently creates a "rage virus" while performing experiments intended to restore dead brain tissue in baboons. When a journalist for the college paper breaks into the campus lab, he''s bitten by one of the infected baboons; the virus soon spreads to a trio of rapists and a valley girl, all of whom go on killing sprees.', 'A scientist at a Florida university inadvertently creates a "rage virus" while performing experiments intended to restore dead brain tissue in baboons. When a journalist for the college paper breaks into the campus lab, he''s bitten by one of the infected baboons; the virus soon spreads to a trio of rapists and a valley girl, all of whom go on killing sprees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6bZk79VHK4XvZo6dAJd6Z9JgKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90941'),
  ('719164420427776089', 'Primal Rage', 2018, 'Horror', 'Patrick Magee, Jay Lee', 'Patrick Magee, Jay Lee', 'Casey Gagliardi, Andrew Joseph Montgomery, Jameson Pazak, Eloy Casados, Justin Rain, Marshal Hilton, Brandon Gibson, Jim Roof', null, 'A newly reunited young couple''s drive through the Pacific Northwest turns into a nightmare as they are forced to face nature, unsavory locals, and a monstrous creature, known to the Native Americans as Oh-Mah.', 'A newly reunited young couple''s drive through the Pacific Northwest turns into a nightmare as they are forced to face nature, unsavory locals, and a monstrous creature, known to the Native Americans as Oh-Mah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tGM0Vv4X60r6zHDGcpanIrDcdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436373'),
  ('58687265747689495', 'Primary', 1960, 'Documentary', 'Robert Drew, Richard Leacock, Albert Maysles', 'Robert Drew', 'John F. Kennedy, Hubert H. Humphrey, Jacqueline Kennedy, Robert F. Kennedy, Muriel Humphrey, Robert Drew, Joseph McBride, Joseph Julian', 'NR', 'Primary is a documentary film about the primary elections between John F. Kennedy and Hubert Humphrey in 1960. Primary is the first documentary to use light equipment in order to follow their subjects in a more intimate filmmaking style. This unconventional way of filming created a new look for documentary films where the camera’s lens was right in the middle of what ever drama was occurring. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 1998.', 'Primary is a documentary film about the primary elections between John F. Kennedy and Hubert Humphrey in 1960. Primary is the first documentary to use light equipment in order to follow their subjects in a more intimate filmmaking style. This unconventional way of filming created a new look for documentary films where the camera’s lens was right in the middle of what ever drama was occurring. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 1998.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVloWsthHRlw719vzRWRpBqDM20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133'),
  ('944936870059246181', 'Primary Colors', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mike Nichols, Michael Ballhaus, Michael Haley', 'Elaine May', 'John Travolta, Emma Thompson, Billy Bob Thornton, Adrian Lester, Maura Tierney, Paul Guilfoyle, Larry Hagman, Kathy Bates', 'R', 'In this adaptation of the best-selling roman à clef about Bill Clinton''s 1992 run for the White House, the young and gifted Henry Burton is tapped to oversee the presidential campaign of Governor Jack Stanton. Burton is pulled into the politician''s colorful world and looks on as Stanton -- who has a wandering eye that could be his downfall -- contends with his ambitious wife, Susan, and an outspoken adviser, Richard Jemmons.', 'In this adaptation of the best-selling roman à clef about Bill Clinton''s 1992 run for the White House, the young and gifted Henry Burton is tapped to oversee the presidential campaign of Governor Jack Stanton. Burton is pulled into the politician''s colorful world and looks on as Stanton -- who has a wandering eye that could be his downfall -- contends with his ambitious wife, Susan, and an outspoken adviser, Richard Jemmons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FDR837wg7bi02F1R7JESCoPWBD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9440'),
  ('340396386931078430', 'Primary Russia', 1986, 'History, Drama', 'Aleksandr Garibyan, Gennadi Vasilyev, Leonid Veytkov', 'Mikhail Vorfolomeyev, Gennadi Vasilyev', 'Boris Nevzorov, Lyudmila Chursina, Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Margarita Terekhova, Elena Kondulaynen, Arnis Līcītis, Igor Dmitriev, Volodymyr Talashko', null, 'The film takes place in pre-Christian Russia, when Ratibor united the East Slavs into one army against the nomadic Khazars.', 'The film takes place in pre-Christian Russia, when Ratibor united the East Slavs into one army against the nomadic Khazars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnxLDxEsJAdHFJcP0tD4SlnkjRO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252454'),
  ('571070876065664124', 'Primate', 1974, 'Documentary', 'William Brayne, Frederick Wiseman', null, null, null, 'Primate sees realist documentarian Frederick Wiseman hone his lens on the inmates of the Yerkes Primate Research Centre. A representative scientist explains the aims and outcomes of the organisation, describing the mating habits and relationships of the animals.', 'Primate sees realist documentarian Frederick Wiseman hone his lens on the inmates of the Yerkes Primate Research Centre. A representative scientist explains the aims and outcomes of the organisation, describing the mating habits and relationships of the animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i14ftsoQBp4XLblaKYlU9ZpkK8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114409'),
  ('131105243132631286', 'Primate', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Johannes Roberts, Stephen Murphy, Nick Dent', 'Ernest Riera, Johannes Roberts', 'Johnny Sequoyah, Jessica Alexander, Troy Kotsur, Victoria Wyant, Gia Hunter, Benjamin Cheng, Charlie Mann, Tienne Simon', 'R', 'Lucy, a college student, along with her friends, spend their vacation at her family''s home in Hawaii, which includes her pet chimpanzee, Ben. However, when Ben contracts rabies after being bitten by a rabid animal, the group must fight for their lives in order to avoid the now-violent chimp.', 'Lucy, a college student, along with her friends, spend their vacation at her family''s home in Hawaii, which includes her pet chimpanzee, Ben. However, when Ben contracts rabies after being bitten by a rabid animal, the group must fight for their lives in order to avoid the now-violent chimp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z97hrgI5wbGbZvSVkBfAeBnFKAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315303'),
  ('318721831553175813', 'Primavera', 2025, 'Music, Drama, History', 'Damiano Michieletto, Daria D''Antonio', 'Ludovica Rampoldi, Damiano Michieletto', 'Tecla Insolia, Michele Riondino, Fabrizia Sacchi, Andrea Pennacchi, Valentina Bellè, Stefano Accorsi, Alessandro Bressanello, Miko Jarry', null, 'In 18th-century Venice, 20-year-old violin virtuoso Cecilia lives at the Pièta orphanage, where, despite her talent, she remains confined, knowing that marriage is the only way out. Yet, her life takes a turn after she meets Antonio Vivaldi, a brilliant and ambitious composer who becomes the new violin teacher. Guided by Vivaldi and his music, Cecilia finds the strength to challenge the destiny that once seemed inevitable.', 'In 18th-century Venice, 20-year-old violin virtuoso Cecilia lives at the Pièta orphanage, where, despite her talent, she remains confined, knowing that marriage is the only way out. Yet, her life takes a turn after she meets Antonio Vivaldi, a brilliant and ambitious composer who becomes the new violin teacher. Guided by Vivaldi and his music, Cecilia finds the strength to challenge the destiny that once seemed inevitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Giqb3a9ITCKhlkNeWtfzGWOxU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1365683'),
  ('980614061930035758', 'Prime', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ben Younger, William Rexer', 'Ben Younger', 'Uma Thurman, Meryl Streep, Bryan Greenberg, Jon Abrahams, Zak Orth, Annie Parisse, Aubrey Dollar, Jerry Adler', 'PG-13', 'A career driven professional from Manhattan is wooed by a young painter, who also happens to be the son of her psychoanalyst.', 'A career driven professional from Manhattan is wooed by a young painter, who also happens to be the son of her psychoanalyst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gz17H1jiLI9OrTo8ruS31WkP9Am.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2313'),
  ('918836275382370990', 'Prime Cut', 1972, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Michael Ritchie, Gene Polito, Ronald R. Grow', 'Robert Dillon', 'Lee Marvin, Gene Hackman, Angel Tompkins, Gregory Walcott, Sissy Spacek, Janit Baldwin, Bill Morey, Clint Ellison', 'R', 'A group of ruthless Chicago mob enforcers are sent to Kansas City to settle things with the owner of a slaughterhouse who has taken money that is not his to keep.', 'A group of ruthless Chicago mob enforcers are sent to Kansas City to settle things with the owner of a slaughterhouse who has taken money that is not his to keep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAesYoQKGIPBJoT7jmaKAUGD9Y8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27292'),
  ('570370227394006873', 'Prime Evil', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Roberta Findlay, Roberta Findlay', 'Ed Kelleher, Harriette Vidal', 'William Beckwith, Christine Moore, Mavis Harris, Max Jacobs, Tim Gail, George Krause, Ruth Collins, Amy Brentano', 'R', 'Nestled in a Manhattan monastery, evil is lurking. A group of devil worshipping monks are stalking the city, looking for victims to sacrifice to the dark lord in the hope of bringing satanic rule to the world!', 'Nestled in a Manhattan monastery, evil is lurking. A group of devil worshipping monks are stalking the city, looking for victims to sacrifice to the dark lord in the hope of bringing satanic rule to the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIRRw3pBrwBfW3bP8oPqOiv3DSR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78522'),
  ('1006537292033952133', 'Prime Orbit', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Gustavo Cosenza', 'Gustavo Cosenza', 'Fernando Bolaños, Noelia Campos, Melvin Jimenez, Monserrat Montero Cole, Andrey Ramirez, Erika Hidalgo', null, 'When humanity evacuates the planet because of the imminent collision with an asteroid, Manuel is set apart and left behind. Now he will have to survive an automated last resort mission to save the Earth. It’s the only option to reunite with his brother.', 'When humanity evacuates the planet because of the imminent collision with an asteroid, Manuel is set apart and left behind. Now he will have to survive an automated last resort mission to save the Earth. It’s the only option to reunite with his brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4APT3e07DHExyb4xwjJYZ7ujhxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070630'),
  ('478663836812541621', 'Prime Rush', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Abascal Peiró, Nathan Lellouche, Michaël Ben Hammouda', 'Carlos Abascal Peiró', 'Jean Chevalier, François Cluzet, Karin Viard, Alex Lutz, Émilie Gavois-Kahn, Olivier Broche, Sawsan Abès, Marc Zinga', null, 'The week after the French elections, the President must appoint his prime minister. In exchange for a higher position, ambitious young parliamentary attaché Nino is charged with persuading his longestranged father, a reclusive senator, to accept the post. But Lionel Perrin isn’t the only candidate for the coveted position, and in the race for power absolutely nothing is off-limits… Nino embarks on a high stakes adventure risking everything, his love life and political ambitions alike.', 'The week after the French elections, the President must appoint his prime minister. In exchange for a higher position, ambitious young parliamentary attaché Nino is charged with persuading his longestranged father, a reclusive senator, to accept the post. But Lionel Perrin isn’t the only candidate for the coveted position, and in the race for power absolutely nothing is off-limits… Nino embarks on a high stakes adventure risking everything, his love life and political ambitions alike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lo3jHhGmOEZk7avUX1iZuRIfXAI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1197122'),
  ('1055225661400948275', 'Prime Time', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jakub Piątek, Michał Łuka', 'Jakub Piątek, Łukasz Czapski', 'Bartosz Bielenia, Magdalena Popławska, Andrzej Kłak, Małgorzata Hajewska-Krzysztofik, Dobromir Dymecki, Monika Frajczyk, Cezary Kosiński, Adam Nawojczyk', 'R', 'On the last day of 1999, 20-year-old Sebastian locks himself in a TV studio. He has two hostages, a gun, and an important message for the world. The story of the attack explores a rebel’s extreme measures and last resort.', 'On the last day of 1999, 20-year-old Sebastian locks himself in a TV studio. He has two hostages, a gun, and an important message for the world. The story of the attack explores a rebel’s extreme measures and last resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIzmgtt51M4ZtHxOuxSLggc7FnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745078'),
  ('327127958995848145', 'Primer', 2004, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Shane Carruth, Troy Dick', 'Shane Carruth', 'Shane Carruth, David Sullivan, Casey Gooden, Anand Upadhyaya, Carrie Crawford, Jay Butler, John Carruth, Juan Tapia', 'PG-13', 'A group of fledgling inventors discover a complex method to manipulate reality. At first, they successfully game the stock market with it, but the consequences of the invention start to catch up with them.', 'A group of fledgling inventors discover a complex method to manipulate reality. At first, they successfully game the stock market with it, but the consequences of the invention start to catch up with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEoq2WmDzpzxhkHEsmOYOg6BPg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14337'),
  ('571000473901787646', 'Primeval', 2007, 'Adventure, Horror, Action', 'Michael Katleman, Edward J. Pei', 'Michael Ferris, John Brancato', 'Dominic Purcell, Brooke Langton, Orlando Jones, Jürgen Prochnow, Gideon Emery, Gabriel Malema, Linda Mpondo, Lehlohonolo Makoko', 'R', 'A news team is sent to Burundi to capture and bring home a legendary 25-foot crocodile. Their difficult task turns potentially deadly when a warlord targets them for death.', 'A news team is sent to Burundi to capture and bring home a legendary 25-foot crocodile. Their difficult task turns potentially deadly when a warlord targets them for death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ou56J8FIxbIFusR9zIA9GW7zwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4283'),
  ('418479299776741077', 'Primitive Love', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Scattini, Claudio Racca', 'Massimo Pupillo, Luigi Scattini', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Jayne Mansfield, Carlo Kechler, Mickey Hargitay, Lucia Modugno, Alfonso Sarlo, Eugenio Galadini', null, '"Doctor" Jayne Mansfield is in Italy to show a peer her documentary about mating customs from around the world while at the same time having to deal with two bellhops who have an idea or two about mating with Jayne.', '"Doctor" Jayne Mansfield is in Italy to show a peer her documentary about mating customs from around the world while at the same time having to deal with two bellhops who have an idea or two about mating with Jayne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iOu1gz4TdZyy3dULFaAy0Dw5wc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131821'),
  ('541392524116820488', 'Primitive Pluto', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Charles August Nichols', null, null, 'NR', 'Pluto''s primitive wolf nature emerges and berates him for going soft. But their little hunting trip goes bad when Pluto encounters a rabbit and bear that give him some trouble.', 'Pluto''s primitive wolf nature emerges and berates him for going soft. But their little hunting trip goes bad when Pluto encounters a rabbit and bear that give him some trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srvu7WJwmyW0GkGxS57B1RjpMES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164975'),
  ('541618230455104967', 'Primitive War', 2025, 'Action, Horror, War, Science Fiction', 'Luke Sparke, Wade Muller, Alex Becconsall', 'Luke Sparke', 'Jeremy Piven, Tricia Helfer, Ryan Kwanten, Nick Wechsler, Anthony Ingruber, Aaron Glenane, Albert Mwangi, Carlos Sanson Jr.', 'NR', 'During the Vietnam War, a recon unit ventures to an isolated jungle valley to uncover the fate of a missing platoon. They soon find themselves in a fight for their lives against an unexpected enemy — prehistoric dinosaurs.', 'During the Vietnam War, a recon unit ventures to an isolated jungle valley to uncover the fate of a missing platoon. They soon find themselves in a fight for their lives against an unexpected enemy — prehistoric dinosaurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZnY97zAyATRH50Q1I92fQy1hUg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1257009'),
  ('860815019894117068', 'Primitives', 1978, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sisworo Gautama Putra, Leo Fioole', 'Imam Tantowi', 'Enny Haryono, Barry Prima, Johann Mardjono, Rukman Herman, Eva Arnaz, Jafarpree York, Novita Rully, Rengga Takengon', null, 'Three students, Tommy, Rita, and Robert, and their guides head into the jungle to study primitive tribes separated from civilization. However, the students say the one tribe they visit isn''t primitive enough, and they want to find some really savages, and to locate the legendary cannibal tribe supposedly living in the area.', 'Three students, Tommy, Rita, and Robert, and their guides head into the jungle to study primitive tribes separated from civilization. However, the students say the one tribe they visit isn''t primitive enough, and they want to find some really savages, and to locate the legendary cannibal tribe supposedly living in the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9v2yV3UCX4qpguTHZQX1i50PB0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89950'),
  ('167636262385712669', 'Primo Basílio', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Daniel Filho, Nonato Estrela', 'Rafael Dragaud', 'Débora Falabella, Fábio Assunção, Glória Pires, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Simone Spoladore, Zezeh Barbosa, Laura Cardoso, Nilton Bicudo', null, 'Luísa is a romantic, dreamy and delicate young woman married to Jorge, an engineer, a man of good habits and good economic conditions. They didn''t know each other well, but got married and Luísa was a good wife, "she was clean and happy as a bird". Everything get changed when she meets a childhood love, her cousin Basílio. What seemed to be a great adventure will became a nightmare and Luísa will discover the price of her infidelity.', 'Luísa is a romantic, dreamy and delicate young woman married to Jorge, an engineer, a man of good habits and good economic conditions. They didn''t know each other well, but got married and Luísa was a good wife, "she was clean and happy as a bird". Everything get changed when she meets a childhood love, her cousin Basílio. What seemed to be a great adventure will became a nightmare and Luísa will discover the price of her infidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJFjJu6rMlHwm4HOQyg0BXoqh87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51847'),
  ('734871446616532430', 'Primorsky Boulevard', 1988, 'Comedy, Music', 'Aleksandr Polynnikov, Arkadi Povzner', 'Anatoli Shajkevich', 'Alexander Kuznetsov, Anna Nazaryeva, Olga Kabo, Andrey Gradov, Anatoliy Ravikovich, Valentina Talyzina, Marina Shimanskaya, Yury Volodarsky', null, 'The events of the movie take place in the city of Odesa. A guy named Sasha sees a beautiful girl on the street and, following her, inadvertently causes a car crash. The driver of the car turns out to be none other than this girl''s father, who is also a screenplay writer currently experiencing a writer''s block. Instead of demanding money from Sasha for repairs to his vehicle, the writer makes Sasha tell him all the details of his new relationship with the girl he saw on the street, not knowing that this girl (Lena) is his own daughter. To make things more complex, Lena has a younger sister Dasha who begins to like Sasha.', 'The events of the movie take place in the city of Odesa. A guy named Sasha sees a beautiful girl on the street and, following her, inadvertently causes a car crash. The driver of the car turns out to be none other than this girl''s father, who is also a screenplay writer currently experiencing a writer''s block. Instead of demanding money from Sasha for repairs to his vehicle, the writer makes Sasha tell him all the details of his new relationship with the girl he saw on the street, not knowing that this girl (Lena) is his own daughter. To make things more complex, Lena has a younger sister Dasha who begins to like Sasha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UfBnmF9KrUiJ2WGfFZyzq0fXz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315317'),
  ('411111388015826560', 'Primrose Hill', 2007, 'Drama', 'Mikhaël Hers, Sébastien Buchmann', 'Mikhaël Hers', 'Hubert Benhamdine, Stéphanie Daub-Laurent, Thibault Vinçon, Jeanne Candel, Mila Dekker, Alain Libolt, Mona Heftre, Sophie Letourneur', null, 'On Christmas Eve, a West suburb of Paris. Stéphane, Joëlle, Xavier and Sonia (25 years old) decide to take a stroll down the big park overhanging the city of their youth, musing on pop music, their work, sex and their disappointed ambitions.', 'On Christmas Eve, a West suburb of Paris. Stéphane, Joëlle, Xavier and Sonia (25 years old) decide to take a stroll down the big park overhanging the city of their youth, musing on pop music, their work, sex and their disappointed ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdxb7949pjL3pttbLx4KfjE1lF8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162659'),
  ('1057182253710069192', 'Primrose Path', 1940, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gregory La Cava, Carroll Clark, Joseph H. August', 'Allan Scott, Gregory La Cava', 'Ginger Rogers, Joel McCrea, Marjorie Rambeau, Henry Travers, Miles Mander, Queenie Vassar, Joan Carroll, Vivienne Osborne', 'NR', 'Ellie Mae lives on Primrose Hill with her good-hearted and fancy free mother, her drunken father, her younger sister and a mean-spirited grandmother. The Hill is not a good part of town, however. When she meets and falls for a hard-working man, they marry and she hides her past from him. When he discovers the truth it jeopardizes their marriage.', 'Ellie Mae lives on Primrose Hill with her good-hearted and fancy free mother, her drunken father, her younger sister and a mean-spirited grandmother. The Hill is not a good part of town, however. When she meets and falls for a hard-working man, they marry and she hides her past from him. When he discovers the truth it jeopardizes their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yrimUM6qpPlRTByQLB5YQLdSGH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80054'),
  ('1134342683058583945', 'Prince', 2010, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kookie Gulati, Vishnu Rao', 'Shiraz Ahmed', 'Vivek Oberoi, Aruna Shields, Nandana Sen, Sanjay Kapoor, Neeru Bajwa, Dalip Tahil, Mayur Puri, Rajesh Khattar', null, 'A wanted thief races against time to find an antique coin after he commits the biggest heist of his life and wakes up the next day with no memories.', 'A wanted thief races against time to find an antique coin after he commits the biggest heist of his life and wakes up the next day with no memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWKyB7hJ1SzyVjHoIQESx5lNzoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43216'),
  ('600757014318512523', 'Prince - Lovesexy Live', 1988, 'Music', 'Egbert van Hees', null, 'Prince, Sheila E., Levi Seacer Jr., Miko Weaver, Dr. Fink, Boni Boyer, Eric Leeds, Atlanta Bliss', null, 'Lovesexy Live was the fifth Prince home video to be released and second live concert released on Home Video format. It was first released on 2 cassettes under the name of "Lovesexy Live 1" and "Lovesexy Live 2" in Europe. Confusingly Vol.1 contained the latter part of the concert, while Vol.2 contained the first part. The concert was later re-released as Lovesexy Live on one cassette (of 127 minutes) and on laserdisc.', 'Lovesexy Live was the fifth Prince home video to be released and second live concert released on Home Video format. It was first released on 2 cassettes under the name of "Lovesexy Live 1" and "Lovesexy Live 2" in Europe. Confusingly Vol.1 contained the latter part of the concert, while Vol.2 contained the first part. The concert was later re-released as Lovesexy Live on one cassette (of 127 minutes) and on laserdisc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoQGgS6kzFnVrvsNibW41hYHOdn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292872'),
  ('511975992617909882', 'Prince and the Evening Star', 1979, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Václav Vorlíček, Josef Illík, Jaroslav Pour', 'Jiří Brdečka', 'Vladimír Menšík, Juraj Ďurdiak, Libuše Šafránková, Radoslav Brzobohatý, František Filipovský, Julie Jurištová, Zlata Adamovská, Ivana Andrlová', null, 'A wonderful fairytale about looking for love, defeating evil and learning some valuable moral lessons on the way. The story begins with the young Prince Velen, who is left in charge of the castle and his three sisters. During the night he has a visitation and before he knows it, all his sisters are married off and gone away, and himself falls in love with beautiful Večernice. Now he is faced with the King''s wraths and charged with a quest. The journey, however, hides obstacles and danger; not only treacherous merchants and robbers, but also a evil wizard Mrakomor...', 'A wonderful fairytale about looking for love, defeating evil and learning some valuable moral lessons on the way. The story begins with the young Prince Velen, who is left in charge of the castle and his three sisters. During the night he has a visitation and before he knows it, all his sisters are married off and gone away, and himself falls in love with beautiful Večernice. Now he is faced with the King''s wraths and charged with a quest. The journey, however, hides obstacles and danger; not only treacherous merchants and robbers, but also a evil wizard Mrakomor...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60lq7nda0HtihYJ23PlmF48SDBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84030'),
  ('1017301147685556744', 'Prince and the Revolution: Live', 1985, 'Music', 'Paul Becher', null, 'Prince, Bobby Z, Brown Mark, Wendy Melvoin, Lisa Coleman, Dr. Fink, Eric Leeds, Sheila E.', 'NR', '“Prince and the Revolution: Live” is a legendary concert filmed toward the end of Prince''s “Purple Rain” tour in Syracuse, NY on March 30, 1985. The performance has Prince at the height of his powers, backed by the classic Revolution lineup of Wendy Melvoin, Lisa Coleman, Matt Fink, Mark Brown, Eric Leeds, and Bobby Z. The 20-song set features: Let''s Go Crazy, Delirious, 1999, Little Red Corvette, Take Me With U, Yankee Doodle Dandy, Do Me Baby, Irresistible Bitch, Possessed, How Come U Don''t Call Me Anymore, Let''s Pretend We Are Married, International Lover, God, Computer Blue, Darling Nikki, The Beautiful Ones, When Doves Cry, I Would Die 4 U, Baby I''m A Star, and Purple Rain.', '“Prince and the Revolution: Live” is a legendary concert filmed toward the end of Prince''s “Purple Rain” tour in Syracuse, NY on March 30, 1985. The performance has Prince at the height of his powers, backed by the classic Revolution lineup of Wendy Melvoin, Lisa Coleman, Matt Fink, Mark Brown, Eric Leeds, and Bobby Z. The 20-song set features: Let''s Go Crazy, Delirious, 1999, Little Red Corvette, Take Me With U, Yankee Doodle Dandy, Do Me Baby, Irresistible Bitch, Possessed, How Come U Don''t Call Me Anymore, Let''s Pretend We Are Married, International Lover, God, Computer Blue, Darling Nikki, The Beautiful Ones, When Doves Cry, I Would Die 4 U, Baby I''m A Star, and Purple Rain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2JORkqB37Uk6QjS3GCvw2wgR3p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79154'),
  ('12398598158531145', 'Prince Avalanche', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tim Orr, David Gordon Green', 'Hafsteinn Gunnar Sigurðsson, David Gordon Green', 'Paul Rudd, Emile Hirsch, Lance LeGault, Joyce Payne, Gina Grande, Lynn Shelton, Larry Kretchmar, Enoch Moon', 'R', 'Two highway road workers spend the summer of 1988 away from their city lives. The isolated landscape becomes a place of misadventure as the men find themselves at odds with each other and the women they left behind.', 'Two highway road workers spend the summer of 1988 away from their city lives. The isolated landscape becomes a place of misadventure as the men find themselves at odds with each other and the women they left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCfs93bW6FdLIZoYN5pYILysyx4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113148'),
  ('612190683392791602', 'Prince Charming', 2001, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance, Family', 'Allan Arkush', null, 'Christina Applegate, Sean Maguire, Martin Short, Andrea Martin, Billy Connolly, Bernadette Peters, Julian Richings', 'PG', 'After an extramarital indiscretion, a fairy-tale prince and his sidekick are turned into frogs for all eternity or until the prince can convince a maiden to kiss and then marry him.', 'After an extramarital indiscretion, a fairy-tale prince and his sidekick are turned into frogs for all eternity or until the prince can convince a maiden to kiss and then marry him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sma7B0TJNGfXMzi5Ob9HZOsmsP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51532'),
