  ('1027511473081396735', 'Prince of Darkness', 1987, 'Horror', 'Gary B. Kibbe, John Carpenter, Larry Franco', 'John Carpenter', 'Donald Pleasence, Lisa Blount, Victor Wong, Jameson Parker, Dennis Dun, Susan Blanchard, Anne Marie Howard, Ann Yen', 'R', 'A priest discovers an ancient canister containing a strange liquid in an abandoned church. When a group of graduate students and scientists are tasked with studying it, they unknowingly unleash an evil force waiting to destroy all of humanity.', 'A priest discovers an ancient canister containing a strange liquid in an abandoned church. When a group of graduate students and scientists are tasked with studying it, they unknowingly unleash an evil force waiting to destroy all of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjcAOhtGuX4p8XvlVn1WXUT1jWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8852'),
  ('178776269141849551', 'Prince of Foxes', 1949, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Henry King, Joseph C. Behm, Leon Shamroy', 'Milton Krims', 'Tyrone Power, Orson Welles, Wanda Hendrix, Marina Berti, Katina Paxinou, Everett Sloane, Felix Aylmer, Eduardo Ciannelli', 'NR', 'In 1500, Duke Cesare Borgia hopes to marry his sister to the heir apparent of Ferrara, which impedes his conquest of central Italy. On this delicate mission he sends Andrea Orsini, his sister''s lover and nearly as unscrupulous as himself. En route, Orsini meets Camilla Verano, wife of the count of Citta'' del Monte, and sentiment threatens to turn him against his deadly master, whom no one betrays twice...', 'In 1500, Duke Cesare Borgia hopes to marry his sister to the heir apparent of Ferrara, which impedes his conquest of central Italy. On this delicate mission he sends Andrea Orsini, his sister''s lover and nearly as unscrupulous as himself. En route, Orsini meets Camilla Verano, wife of the count of Citta'' del Monte, and sentiment threatens to turn him against his deadly master, whom no one betrays twice...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wW7QnqORPwTUGp62gAxaOequywC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44533'),
  ('924028228206229121', 'Prince of Jutland', 1994, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Gabriel Axel, Henning Kristiansen', 'Erik Kjersgaard, Gabriel Axel', 'Gabriel Byrne, Helen Mirren, Christian Bale, Brian Cox, Steven Waddington, Kate Beckinsale, Tony Haygarth, Freddie Jones', 'R', 'A Danish prince seeks revenge upon the villain who killed the king and his son to usurp the throne.', 'A Danish prince seeks revenge upon the villain who killed the king and his son to usurp the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qG90bxBkwfiqqSdmsWZWEjAvS2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48791'),
  ('324967395544517126', 'Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time', 2010, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Mike Newell, John Seale, Simon Warnock', 'Doug Miro, Carlo Bernard, Boaz Yakin', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Gemma Arterton, Ben Kingsley, Alfred Molina, Steve Toussaint, Toby Kebbell, Richard Coyle, Ronald Pickup', 'PG-13', 'A rogue prince reluctantly joins forces with a mysterious princess and together, they race against dark forces to safeguard an ancient dagger capable of releasing the Sands of Time – gift from the gods that can reverse time and allow its possessor to rule the world.', 'A rogue prince reluctantly joins forces with a mysterious princess and together, they race against dark forces to safeguard an ancient dagger capable of releasing the Sands of Time – gift from the gods that can reverse time and allow its possessor to rule the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siNGMLdOUNYLEGtlsnmQcpO2XZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9543'),
  ('230080727771016203', 'Prince of Shadows', 1991, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Pilar Miró, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Mario Camus, Pilar Miró, Juan Antonio Porto', 'Terence Stamp, Patsy Kensit, José Luis Gómez, Geraldine James, Simón Andreu, Aleksander Bardini, John McEnery, Jorge de Juan', null, 'Madrid, 1962. More than twenty years after the civil war has finished, a communist comes back to Spain to kill a traitor.', 'Madrid, 1962. More than twenty years after the civil war has finished, a communist comes back to Spain to kill a traitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NXkeQ3BlYrL8bNyF1jSANV4Dyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93877'),
  ('510498529873387958', 'Prince of Space', 1959, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Family', 'Eijirō Wakabayashi, Masahiko Iimura, Shozo Horai', 'Shin Morita', 'Tatsuo Umemiya, Ushio Akashi, Joji Oka, Hiroko Mine, Ken Sudo, Takashi Kanda, Junji Masuda, Takeshi Hasebe', null, 'Attracted by the report of the development of a new type of rocket fuel, the vicious dictator of Krangkor, the dark planet, descends on Earth to steal the formula from its creator, the benevolent Dr. Makin.', 'Attracted by the report of the development of a new type of rocket fuel, the vicious dictator of Krangkor, the dark planet, descends on Earth to steal the formula from its creator, the benevolent Dr. Makin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rBZdyPkaeReQ0vlwC02X6sPDiE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62855'),
  ('40137251255168787', 'Prince of the City', 1981, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Sidney Lumet, Andrzej Bartkowiak', 'Jay Presson Allen, Sidney Lumet', 'Treat Williams, Jerry Orbach, Richard Foronjy, Don Billett, Kenny Marino, Carmine Caridi, Tony Page, Norman Parker', 'R', 'New York City detective Daniel Ciello agrees to help the United States Department of Justice eliminate corruption in the police department, as long as he will not have to turn in any close friends. In doing so, Ciello uncovers a conspiracy within the force to smuggle drugs to street informants.', 'New York City detective Daniel Ciello agrees to help the United States Department of Justice eliminate corruption in the police department, as long as he will not have to turn in any close friends. In doing so, Ciello uncovers a conspiracy within the force to smuggle drugs to street informants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdERW77zecB5pkKWWeqbSkns0t4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32047'),
  ('1089730125192074171', 'Prince of the Sun', 1990, 'Action, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Wellson Chin Sing-Wai, Cheung Yiu-Cho', 'Lawrence Lau Jun-Wai, Abe Kwong Man-Wai', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Conan Lee, Sheila Chan Suk-Lan, Cheng Pak-Lam, Lam Ching-Ying, Jeffrey Falcon, Lau Shun, Derek Cheung Chi-Chuen', null, 'Bencheuk (Cynthia Rothrock) helps to protect a Buddhist boy from villains, who wish to stop him from becoming the Prince of the Sun.', 'Bencheuk (Cynthia Rothrock) helps to protect a Buddhist boy from villains, who wish to stop him from becoming the Prince of the Sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ja6npvaas6LQnQWCJBH5k0e3xiP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53006'),
  ('113754786407215916', 'Prince Valiant', 1954, 'Adventure, Action, Romance', 'Lucien Ballard, Henry Hathaway', 'Dudley Nichols', 'James Mason, Janet Leigh, Robert Wagner, Debra Paget, Sterling Hayden, Victor McLaglen, Donald Crisp, Brian Aherne', 'NR', 'A young Viking prince strives to become a knight in King Arthur''s Court and restore his exiled father to his rightful throne.', 'A young Viking prince strives to become a knight in King Arthur''s Court and restore his exiled father to his rightful throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7q1JvtEmU46XecF9NWw7kmiswS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65994'),
  ('734901645299615575', 'Prince Valiant', 1997, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Anthony Hickox, Roger Lanser, Don Dossett', 'Michael Frost Beckner, Anthony Hickox, Carsten H.W. Lorenz', 'Stephen Moyer, Katherine Heigl, Thomas Kretschmann, Edward Fox, Udo Kier, Joanna Lumley, Ron Perlman, Warwick Davis', 'PG-13', 'An Arthurian legend of young Prince Valiant, son of the King of Scandia. After the King is exiled by an evil leader, the Prince travels to Camelot to secure the aid of King Arthur in helping restore his family to power and prevent a plot by the Black Knight.', 'An Arthurian legend of young Prince Valiant, son of the King of Scandia. After the King is exiled by an evil leader, the Prince travels to Camelot to secure the aid of King Arthur in helping restore his family to power and prevent a plot by the Black Knight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTg3XnghiI8Z8sp7Pxknnl2A3rn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6264'),
  ('1107504153014238261', 'Prince Violent', 1961, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Friz Freleng, Hawley Pratt', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Viking Yosemite Sam arrives to storm the castle. But Bugs takes charge of the defenses, and between Bugs'' cleverness and Sam''s stupidity, the castle is never seriously threatened, even when Sam enlists the help of an elephant.', 'Viking Yosemite Sam arrives to storm the castle. But Bugs takes charge of the defenses, and between Bugs'' cleverness and Sam''s stupidity, the castle is never seriously threatened, even when Sam enlists the help of an elephant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lk2FefsHA4CKOq3QPNwKztJmAve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234698'),
  ('1140545726612432809', 'Prince Vladimir', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Yuri Kulakov, Leonid Dragilev, Pavel Emeljanov', 'Yuriy Batanin, Andrey Dobrunov, Yuri Kulakov', 'Irina Bezrukova, Sergei Bezrukov, Aleksandr Barinov, Yuri Berkun, Lev Durov, Aleksey Kolgan, Dmitri Nazarov, Vladimir Gostyukhin', null, 'The plot follows the events surrounding Vladimir from childhood and into adulthood. In the beginning of the film, being under the influence of the high priest Krivzha, the Prince is a young, impulsive and cruel pagan. Fighting for supreme power, Vladimir wins a battle that kills his brother. Regretting what he has done, Vladimir does not suspect a conspiracy between the priest and the Pechenegs. Vladimir is concerned about gathering the Slavic tribes into one united state. Solving this major task, he faces obstacles, which Vladimir overcomes in the end, defeating Krivzha and winning the battle against Kurya, a Pecheneg chief.', 'The plot follows the events surrounding Vladimir from childhood and into adulthood. In the beginning of the film, being under the influence of the high priest Krivzha, the Prince is a young, impulsive and cruel pagan. Fighting for supreme power, Vladimir wins a battle that kills his brother. Regretting what he has done, Vladimir does not suspect a conspiracy between the priest and the Pechenegs. Vladimir is concerned about gathering the Slavic tribes into one united state. Solving this major task, he faces obstacles, which Vladimir overcomes in the end, defeating Krivzha and winning the battle against Kurya, a Pecheneg chief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KntOHQB0tp2Ddtmx9H6YeKDuVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39170'),
  ('926534142589111611', 'Prince: Once Upon a Time in Dhaka', 2026, 'Crime, Action', 'Abu Hayat Mahmud, Pritom Hasan, Imran Mahmudul', null, 'Shakib Khan, Tasnia Farin, Dibyendu Bhattacharya, Nasir Uddin Khan, Ejajul Islam, Intekhab Dinar, Jyotirmoyee Kundu, Rashed Mamun Apu', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CTw5gGz4GrWyCYjPBuf2VdjTsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1253175'),
  ('318941389848359337', 'Prince: Sign ''o'' the Times', 1987, 'Music', 'Prince, Peter Sinclair', null, 'Prince, Sheila E., Levi Seacer Jr., Miko Weaver, Dr. Fink, Boni Boyer, Eric Leeds, Atlanta Bliss', 'PG-13', 'In 1987, to capitalize on his growing success in Europe, Prince toured extensively to promote the album of the same name and sales increased accordingly. However, the United States remained resistant to his latest album, and sales began to drop; it was at this point that Prince decided to film a live concert promoting the new material, for eventual distribution to theaters in America. Featuring the band that accompanied Prince on his 1987 Sign o'' the Times Tour, including dancer Cat Glover, keyboardist Boni Boyer, bassist Levi Seacer, Jr., guitarist Miko Weaver, drummer Sheila E. and former member of The Revolution keyboardist Dr. Fink, the film sees the group perform live on stage (although "U Got the Look" is represented by its promotional music video).', 'In 1987, to capitalize on his growing success in Europe, Prince toured extensively to promote the album of the same name and sales increased accordingly. However, the United States remained resistant to his latest album, and sales began to drop; it was at this point that Prince decided to film a live concert promoting the new material, for eventual distribution to theaters in America. Featuring the band that accompanied Prince on his 1987 Sign o'' the Times Tour, including dancer Cat Glover, keyboardist Boni Boyer, bassist Levi Seacer, Jr., guitarist Miko Weaver, drummer Sheila E. and former member of The Revolution keyboardist Dr. Fink, the film sees the group perform live on stage (although "U Got the Look" is represented by its promotional music video).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zk0C7KOk30M2Awr3vecEUKB2JPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38178'),
  ('1051799188401766392', 'Princes and Princesses', 2000, 'Drama, Animation, Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Romance, Mystery, Adventure', 'Michel Ocelot, Mireille Roulet', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Yves Barsacq, Philippe Cheytion, Arlette Mirapeu, François Voisin', null, 'In this episodic animated fantasy from France, an art teacher interprets a series of six fairy tales (each involving a prince or princess) with the help of two precocious students. Princes and Princesses was created using a special style of cutout animation, with black silhouetted characters performing the action against backlit backdrops in striking colors.', 'In this episodic animated fantasy from France, an art teacher interprets a series of six fairy tales (each involving a prince or princess) with the help of two precocious students. Princes and Princesses was created using a special style of cutout animation, with black silhouetted characters performing the action against backlit backdrops in striking colors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gP1PDJmbsF5J2teuond2OtRiEaC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65592'),
  ('1068667760845898605', 'Princesita', 2017, 'Drama', 'Marialy Rivas, Sergio Armstrong, Alejandra Alaff', 'Manuela Infante, Marialy Rivas, Camila Gutiérrez', 'Nathalia Acevedo, Marcelo Alonso, María Gracia Omegna, Rafael Federman, Emiliano Jofre, Sara Caballero, Agustín Silva, Isidora Uribe', null, 'Twelve-year-old Tamara lives within a cult that is ruled by the beliefs of its leader Miguel, who becomes obsessively convinced that Tamara is the "chosen one". But when she falls in love with a classmate, Tamara''s relationship gets in the way of Miguel''s objective, and he will seek her absolute obedience.', 'Twelve-year-old Tamara lives within a cult that is ruled by the beliefs of its leader Miguel, who becomes obsessively convinced that Tamara is the "chosen one". But when she falls in love with a classmate, Tamara''s relationship gets in the way of Miguel''s objective, and he will seek her absolute obedience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLYcVQ9PrJByX7eR2WedIV7NJtB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473319'),
  ('78958355358505747', 'Princess', 2008, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Mark Rosman, David A. Makin', 'Heidi Ferrer', 'Nora Zehetner, Kip Pardue, Nicole Gale Anderson, Deborah Grover, Matthew Edison, Mayko Nguyen, Shileen Paton, Rebecca Northan', null, 'A reclusive princess and a directionless young man embark on a quest to save the world''s mythical creatures from becoming extinct.', 'A reclusive princess and a directionless young man embark on a quest to save the world''s mythical creatures from becoming extinct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txLRWBOjPISJ8NNypcNqeejMs2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41362'),
  ('883536726516935738', 'Princess', 2022, 'Drama', 'Roberto De Paolis, Claudio Cofrancesco', 'Roberto De Paolis', 'Glory Kevin, Lino Musella, Maurizio Lombardi, Salvatore Striano', null, 'Princess is a young illegal immigrant from Nigeria who sells her body on the outskirts of a big city. Like an Amazon on the hunt, protected by her friends, she moves through a pinewood that stretches as far as the sea, an enchanted forest in which to find refuge, hide away from life and earn her daily bread. Every day, in order to survive, Princess has to steer clear of dangers and sentiments, follow the scent of money and dupe her clients. Her life is a succession of days that are always the same, one joins to another, without a break. Until one day, driven by an inner force to break the shackles of cynicism and exploitation, she quarrels with the friends with whom she shares the street and meets a man who wants to save her, but first she will have to save herself.', 'Princess is a young illegal immigrant from Nigeria who sells her body on the outskirts of a big city. Like an Amazon on the hunt, protected by her friends, she moves through a pinewood that stretches as far as the sea, an enchanted forest in which to find refuge, hide away from life and earn her daily bread. Every day, in order to survive, Princess has to steer clear of dangers and sentiments, follow the scent of money and dupe her clients. Her life is a succession of days that are always the same, one joins to another, without a break. Until one day, driven by an inner force to break the shackles of cynicism and exploitation, she quarrels with the friends with whom she shares the street and meets a man who wants to save her, but first she will have to save herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WXTG9RowvsMIltqlQVRYFTFJ8J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936373'),
  ('384227649541667921', 'Princess Arete', 2001, 'Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Sunao Katabuchi, Daisuke Nagata, Hiroyuki Hayase', 'Sunao Katabuchi', 'Houko Kuwashima, Tsuyoshi Koyama, Yusuke Numata, Minami Takayama, Satomi Korogi, Eiji Takemoto, Norihisa Mori, Takashi Nagasako', null, 'Imprisoned by a sorcerer who fears she will rob him of eternal life, guileless young Princess Arete befriends a villager who helps her plan an escape.', 'Imprisoned by a sorcerer who fears she will rob him of eternal life, guileless young Princess Arete befriends a villager who helps her plan an escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVngEXEdGUePCQY3G5NOYstYjtB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59297'),
  ('59741292972900362', 'Princess Aurora', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Pang Eun-jin, Kim Sung-kwan, Joung Yong-ju', 'Kim Chang-rae, Jeong Yong-ju', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Moon Sung-keun, Kwon Oh-joong, Hyun Young, Kim Yong-geon, Park Hyo-joon, Jang Hyun-sung, Lee Dae-yeon', null, 'A woman gets killed in a department store. No one imagines this could lead to serial murders, but two days after the first murder, another homicide occurs. A woman is suffocated to death and the only evidence left at the crime scene is a sticker of the cartoon character “Princess Aurora”.', 'A woman gets killed in a department store. No one imagines this could lead to serial murders, but two days after the first murder, another homicide occurs. A woman is suffocated to death and the only evidence left at the crime scene is a sticker of the cartoon character “Princess Aurora”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5r5yritUHl1UZJA84MoqUTfaDZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38054'),
  ('905238340452530020', 'Princess Caraboo', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, History, Mystery', 'Michael Austin, Freddie Francis, Jonathan Benson', 'Michael Austin, John Wells', 'Jim Broadbent, Phoebe Cates, Wendy Hughes, Kevin Kline, John Lithgow, Stephen Rea, Peter Eyre, Jacqueline Pearce', 'PG', 'Bristol, England, early 19th century. A beautiful young stranger who speaks a weird language is tried for the crime of begging. But when a man claims that he can translate her dialect, it is understood that the woman is a princess from a far away land. She is then welcomed by a family of haughty aristocrats that only wants to heighten their prestige. However, the local reporter is not at all convinced she is what she claims to be and investigates. Is Caraboo really a princess?', 'Bristol, England, early 19th century. A beautiful young stranger who speaks a weird language is tried for the crime of begging. But when a man claims that he can translate her dialect, it is understood that the woman is a princess from a far away land. She is then welcomed by a family of haughty aristocrats that only wants to heighten their prestige. However, the local reporter is not at all convinced she is what she claims to be and investigates. Is Caraboo really a princess?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3Fw33tSGdO2eV8SULQigOITzH4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37345'),
  ('679050353502821036', 'Princess Cursed in Time', 2020, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Petr Kubík, Pavel Kopp, Robert Beca', 'Petr Kubík, Lukáš Daniel Pařík, Viktor Krištof', 'Natalia Germani, Marek Lambora, Eliška Křenková, Jan Révai, Simona Zmrzlá, Veronika Freimanová, Roman Zach, Martin Písařík', null, 'Princess Elen wakes up on her birthday knowing she must either kill the evil witch who cursed her or find her true love. The princess has got one last chance to save herself and the kingdom. If she doesn´t manage either, the kingdom will be destroyed. Will she be able to persuade her friends, break the strong spell and defeat the powerful witch?', 'Princess Elen wakes up on her birthday knowing she must either kill the evil witch who cursed her or find her true love. The princess has got one last chance to save herself and the kingdom. If she doesn´t manage either, the kingdom will be destroyed. Will she be able to persuade her friends, break the strong spell and defeat the powerful witch?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BdpJPZxhgu50avJRkkh6kEcZIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649034'),
  ('879739443673861059', 'Princess Cursed in Time: Alchemist''s Quest', 2022, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Petr Kubík, Pavel Kopp', 'Petr Kubík, Lukáš Daniel Pařík', 'Eliška Křenková, Natalia Germani, Marek Lambora, Vojtěch Kotek, Roman Zach, Simona Zmrzlá, Ján Jackuliak, Karel Dobrý', null, 'It follows young alchemist Amélie as she acquires a magical power: partially influencing the flow of time. But she is split in time, and Amélie from the present meets Améliw from the past, who accompanies her every step of the way.', 'It follows young alchemist Amélie as she acquires a magical power: partially influencing the flow of time. But she is split in time, and Amélie from the present meets Améliw from the past, who accompanies her every step of the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywzbF5YSBfZ7XqcGO9YR6Gy4VFt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027604'),
  ('933344755701061761', 'Princess Cyd', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Stephen Cone, Zoë White, Johnny Woj', 'Stephen Cone', 'Jessie Pinnick, Rebecca Spence, Ro White, James Vincent Meredith, Matthew Quattrocki, Tyler Ross, Marika Mashburn, Paul Brian Fagen', null, 'High school athlete Cyd Loughlin lives alone with her depressive father in South Carolina, perpetually longing to get away from it all. When her aunt, famous novelist Miranda Ruth, agrees to host her for a few weeks during the summer, Cyd jumps at the opportunity. While there, she falls for a girl in the neighborhood, even as she and her aunt gently challenge each other in the realms of sex and spirit.', 'High school athlete Cyd Loughlin lives alone with her depressive father in South Carolina, perpetually longing to get away from it all. When her aunt, famous novelist Miranda Ruth, agrees to host her for a few weeks during the summer, Cyd jumps at the opportunity. While there, she falls for a girl in the neighborhood, even as she and her aunt gently challenge each other in the realms of sex and spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZhF8acObc0R5tIETl7doRO1Bac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454889'),
  ('617737333877117329', 'Princess from the Moon', 1987, 'Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Kon Ichikawa, Setsuo Kobayashi', 'Shinya Hidaka, Kon Ichikawa, Mitsutoshi Ishigami', 'Toshirō Mifune, Ayako Wakao, Yasuko Sawaguchi, Koji Ishizaka, Kiichi Nakai, Koasa Shunpūtei, Takatoshi Takeda, Megumi Odaka', null, 'Two poor, married farmers have recently lost their only child; after a freak visitation, they pry open an alien cocoon to greet their new daughter.', 'Two poor, married farmers have recently lost their only child; after a freak visitation, they pry open an alien cocoon to greet their new daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9mBi2GEgskwZo24SJtKx21I6vr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55188'),
  ('656872622295536522', 'Princess Iron Fan', 1941, 'Fantasy, Animation, Drama, Music, Action', 'Wan Laiming, Guchan Wan', null, 'Hong Bai, Jiang Ming, Han Lan-Gen, Xiucen Yin, Furong Ge, Wan Laiming, Guanxiang Liu, Zhou Jirang', null, 'The story was liberally adapted from a short sequence in the popular Chinese folk tale Journey to the West. Princess Iron Fan is a main character. Specifically, the film focused on the duel between the Monkey King and a vengeful princess, whose fan is desperately needed to quench the flames that surround a peasant village.', 'The story was liberally adapted from a short sequence in the popular Chinese folk tale Journey to the West. Princess Iron Fan is a main character. Specifically, the film focused on the duel between the Monkey King and a vengeful princess, whose fan is desperately needed to quench the flames that surround a peasant village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW2qTSIrVHENBrdiJv7fWxVInR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76737'),
  ('734116902126769262', 'Princess Jasnenka and the Flying Shoemaker', 1987, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Zdeněk Troška, Kryštof Hanzlík, Helena Rohanová', 'Karel Steigerwald', 'Michaela Kuklová, Jan Potměšil, Lubor Tokoš, Antonie Hegerliková, Jaroslav Čejka, Helena Růžičková, Yvetta Blanarovičová, Oto Ševčík', null, 'Fairy tale about young cobbler Jíra, who had fashioned wings from leather in order to rescue princess Jasnenka from the tower of the royal castle, where her father had closed her to to save her from the evil witch and her daughter Cernava.', 'Fairy tale about young cobbler Jíra, who had fashioned wings from leather in order to rescue princess Jasnenka from the tower of the royal castle, where her father had closed her to to save her from the evil witch and her daughter Cernava.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osglAR1utWNFQTwny2Zo8iQQitN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82279'),
  ('632840515334201231', 'Princess Jellyfish', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Taisuke Kawamura, Jun Fukumoto, Tomokazu Naruse', 'Toshiya Ohno, Taisuke Kawamura', 'Non, Masaki Suda, Hiroki Hasegawa, Chizuru Ikewaki, Rina Ohta, Tomoe Shinohara, Nana Katase, Mokomichi Hayami', null, 'Plain, timid and obsessed with jellyfish, Tsukimi is a far cry from her idea of a princess. Her tepid life as a jobless illustrator comes complete with roommates who harbor diehard hobbies that solidify their status as hopeless social rejects. These wallflowers run a tight, nun-like ship, but their no-men-allowed-not-no-one-not-no-how bubble is unwittingly burst after Tsukimi brings home a rescued sea jelly and a beauty queen... who''s actually a guy. When the threat of losing their cozy convent inspires this glamour boy to turn the neurotic entourage into a portrait of success, will Tsukimi take her chance to bloom, or will she end up a hot mess?', 'Plain, timid and obsessed with jellyfish, Tsukimi is a far cry from her idea of a princess. Her tepid life as a jobless illustrator comes complete with roommates who harbor diehard hobbies that solidify their status as hopeless social rejects. These wallflowers run a tight, nun-like ship, but their no-men-allowed-not-no-one-not-no-how bubble is unwittingly burst after Tsukimi brings home a rescued sea jelly and a beauty queen... who''s actually a guy. When the threat of losing their cozy convent inspires this glamour boy to turn the neurotic entourage into a portrait of success, will Tsukimi take her chance to bloom, or will she end up a hot mess?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7A1ZtUcaOfPGUkTSjflu5yzw02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296071'),
  ('147173575277356690', 'Princess Madam', 1989, 'Action', 'Godfrey Ho, Philip Ma Kam-Cheung', 'Simon Fong, Charles Ng, Chan Chi-Yin', 'Moon Lee Choi-Fung, Sharon Yeung, Michiko Nishiwaki, Liu Kai-Chi, Anthony Tang Ho-Kwong, Elliot Ngok Wah, Kenneth Tsang, Cheng Yuen-Man', null, 'Fung and Pan, two policewomen, are assigned to protect a gangster''s mistress turned police informant. Her lover orders her assassination, but the attempt fails. In a desperate bid to prevent her going to court, he threatens to kill Pan''s stepfather. Pan has no choice but to leave the police force in order to protect her family and seek her revenge.', 'Fung and Pan, two policewomen, are assigned to protect a gangster''s mistress turned police informant. Her lover orders her assassination, but the attempt fails. In a desperate bid to prevent her going to court, he threatens to kill Pan''s stepfather. Pan has no choice but to leave the police force in order to protect her family and seek her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y52edCSCoFaGUoEX4IPxGlSbHCI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172700'),
  ('819780515634566526', 'Princess Mononoke', 1997, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Atsushi Okui, Masakatsu Ishizone', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Yoji Matsuda, Yuriko Ishida, Yuko Tanaka, Kaoru Kobayashi, Masahiko Nishimura, Tsunehiko Kamijô, Akihiro Miwa, Mitsuko Mori', 'PG-13', 'Ashitaka, a prince of the disappearing Emishi people, is cursed by a demonized boar god and must journey to the west to find a cure. Along the way, he encounters San, a young human woman fighting to protect the forest, and Lady Eboshi, who is trying to destroy it. Ashitaka must find a way to bring balance to this conflict.', 'Ashitaka, a prince of the disappearing Emishi people, is cursed by a demonized boar god and must journey to the west to find a cure. Along the way, he encounters San, a young human woman fighting to protect the forest, and Lady Eboshi, who is trying to destroy it. Ashitaka must find a way to bring balance to this conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMYCDADoLKLbB83g4WnJegaZimC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128'),
  ('1133136683495701889', 'Princess O''Rourke', 1943, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Norman Krasna, Leo F. Forbstein, Ernest Haller', 'Norman Krasna', 'Olivia de Havilland, Robert Cummings, Charles Coburn, Jack Carson, Jane Wyman, Harry Davenport, Gladys Cooper, Minor Watson', 'NR', 'A down-to-earth pilot charms a European princess on vacation in the United States.', 'A down-to-earth pilot charms a European princess on vacation in the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ELqUEit0clvoFdEMJjk0N9xRlp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33039'),
  ('1135562399343061726', 'Princess of Cleves', 1961, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Jean Delannoy', 'Jean Cocteau', 'Jean Marais, Marina Vlady, Jean-François Poron, Annie Ducaux, Lea Padovani, Raymond Gérôme, Alain Ferral, Renée-Marie Potet', null, 'When a young teen marries the Prince of Cleves, more than twice her age, she automatically becomes an official Princess and takes her new position to heart. Although distracted by the elite entertainments found at court, the princess cannot help but mourn her impossible love for the dashing Duc de Nemours.', 'When a young teen marries the Prince of Cleves, more than twice her age, she automatically becomes an official Princess and takes her new position to heart. Although distracted by the elite entertainments found at court, the princess cannot help but mourn her impossible love for the dashing Duc de Nemours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qAwBageeuIKmpRamvuWX5mY8RC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104305'),
  ('438782544526890167', 'Princess of Mars', 2009, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, War, Action', 'Mark Atkins, Mark Atkins, Rachel Lee Goldenberg', 'Mark Atkins', 'Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Traci Lords, Matt Lasky, Chacko Vadaketh, Mitchell Gordon, Noelle Perris, Matt Lagan, Kimberly Ables Jindra', 'PG', 'Based on the novel by Edgar Rice Burroughs, a US soldier finds himself inexplicably transported to Mars in the midst of a war between two alien races.', 'Based on the novel by Edgar Rice Burroughs, a US soldier finds himself inexplicably transported to Mars in the midst of a war between two alien races.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYsnB94eYRY6yDQ9Pglnb5IUDFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28524'),
  ('1031618234189975131', 'Princess of the Sun', 2007, 'Animation', 'Philippe Leclerc', 'Gilles Adrien, Hadrien Soulez-Larivière', 'Coralie Vanderlinden, David Scarpuzza, Arnaud Léonard, Catherine Conet, Philippe Allard, Mathieu Moreau, Nathalie Hons', null, 'In Ancient Egypt, during the monotheistic regime of Akhenaten, Akhesa is a beautiful princess, 14 years of age. An impetuous young girl, Akhesa rebels against her father''s dictats. She refuses to live confined in the royal palace and wants to discover why her mother, Queen Nefertiti, has been exiled on the island of Elephantine. Assisted by her half-brother prince Tutankhaten, or "Tut", Akhesa flees the court in hopes of finding her mother. In defiance of danger the two teenagers travel down the Nile to the burning-hot desert dunes, courageously facing the mercenary Zannanza and priests of Amun Ra, who are conspiring to overthrow the pharaoh because of his rejection of their god. With innocence their only weapon, Akhesa and Tut overcome many hardships, and encounter an extraordinary destiny.', 'In Ancient Egypt, during the monotheistic regime of Akhenaten, Akhesa is a beautiful princess, 14 years of age. An impetuous young girl, Akhesa rebels against her father''s dictats. She refuses to live confined in the royal palace and wants to discover why her mother, Queen Nefertiti, has been exiled on the island of Elephantine. Assisted by her half-brother prince Tutankhaten, or "Tut", Akhesa flees the court in hopes of finding her mother. In defiance of danger the two teenagers travel down the Nile to the burning-hot desert dunes, courageously facing the mercenary Zannanza and priests of Amun Ra, who are conspiring to overthrow the pharaoh because of his rejection of their god. With innocence their only weapon, Akhesa and Tut overcome many hardships, and encounter an extraordinary destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4s4HvpbTSvr6Y1yOhxtgkmsUjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70438'),
  ('513365133142600163', 'Princess of Thieves', 2001, 'Adventure, Action', 'Peter Hewitt, Andy Collins, Adrian Conerth', 'Robin Lerner', 'Keira Knightley, Stephen Moyer, Malcolm McDowell, Stuart Wilson, Jonathan Hyde, Roger Ashton-Griffiths, David Barrass, Hannah Cresswell', 'PG', 'Sherwood forest has a courageous new hero - Gwyn, the daughter of Robin Hood. Possessing the cunning skills of her legendary father and the beauty and intelligence of her mother Maid Marian, Gwyn is anxious to follow in her father''s footsteps. King Richard nears death and Robin Hood and his Merry Men are summoned to help bring Richard''s son Philip to his rightful place on the throne before the evil Prince John can assume power. Robin Hood''s life and that of the future King of England soon lies in Gwyn''s hands when Robin is captured and sentenced to death.', 'Sherwood forest has a courageous new hero - Gwyn, the daughter of Robin Hood. Possessing the cunning skills of her legendary father and the beauty and intelligence of her mother Maid Marian, Gwyn is anxious to follow in her father''s footsteps. King Richard nears death and Robin Hood and his Merry Men are summoned to help bring Richard''s son Philip to his rightful place on the throne before the evil Prince John can assume power. Robin Hood''s life and that of the future King of England soon lies in Gwyn''s hands when Robin is captured and sentenced to death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53A3XgzJOTSWQfJFI3FjPMWTt0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5764'),
  ('1015253053442497662', 'Princess Principal Crown Handler: Chapter 1', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Kokunen Oh, Eri Kojima, Katsunori Tanaka', 'Noboru Kimura', 'Aoi Koga, Akira Sekine, You Taichi, Akari Kageyama, Nozomi Furuki, Takayuki Sugo, Miyuki Sawashiro, Hiroyuki Honda', null, 'The story is set in London at the end of the 19th century. A new task has been assigned to Team White Pigeon, a group of spies from the Commonwealth. It is a delivery of a used bookstore owner to the Commonwealth. Ange, Dorothy and Chise successfully recapture the owner, who had been held in a detention center by the Kingdom. Meanwhile, the "spy hunt" became more intense in the Kingdom following an assassination attempt on the queen, and tension is strained at Control in the Commonwealth. Control speculates that the spy who has dispatched to the royal family might be a "double agent." To find out the truth, they order Team White Pigeon to contact with the spy, whose codename is "Bishop." How their new mission will be accomplished? And who is "Bishop"?', 'The story is set in London at the end of the 19th century. A new task has been assigned to Team White Pigeon, a group of spies from the Commonwealth. It is a delivery of a used bookstore owner to the Commonwealth. Ange, Dorothy and Chise successfully recapture the owner, who had been held in a detention center by the Kingdom. Meanwhile, the "spy hunt" became more intense in the Kingdom following an assassination attempt on the queen, and tension is strained at Control in the Commonwealth. Control speculates that the spy who has dispatched to the royal family might be a "double agent." To find out the truth, they order Team White Pigeon to contact with the spy, whose codename is "Bishop." How their new mission will be accomplished? And who is "Bishop"?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iD09UJgG3SIfmI28YsfzYwB6AZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542507'),
  ('398717883442890795', 'Princess Principal Crown Handler: Chapter 2', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Hiroaki Kudou, Eri Kojima, Masumi Hojo', 'Noboru Kimura', 'Aoi Koga, Akira Sekine, You Taichi, Akari Kageyama, Nozomi Furuki, Takayuki Sugo, Miyuki Sawashiro, Hiroyuki Honda', null, 'After an attempt on King Richard’s life, assassins target Princess Mary, the next in line to the throne. Team White Pigeon must protect her while locating deadly Cavorite bombs — a tough feat when Ange is Princess Mary’s sister in disguise.', 'After an attempt on King Richard’s life, assassins target Princess Mary, the next in line to the throne. Team White Pigeon must protect her while locating deadly Cavorite bombs — a tough feat when Ange is Princess Mary’s sister in disguise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bigcS5uX9bAPeMQcPUWMDUxgaxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843267'),
  ('930400274091938858', 'Princess Principal Crown Handler: Chapter 4', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Masaki Tachibana', null, 'Aoi Koga, Akira Sekine, You Taichi, Akari Kageyama, Nozomi Furuki, Takayuki Sugo, Miyuki Sawashiro, Takumi Yamazaki', null, 'The fourth film of Princess Principal: Crown Handler.', 'The fourth film of Princess Principal: Crown Handler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNmw2ASKXomAlKnM3GZsXGKIS13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1438229'),
  ('815600879938676451', 'Princess Protection Program', 2009, 'Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Allison Liddi-Brown, José Gilberto Molinari Rosaly, Jana Camacho', 'Annie DeYoung', 'Demi Lovato, Selena Gomez, Nicholas Braun, Tom Verica, Molly Hagan, Samantha Droke, Johnny Ray Rodríguez, Sully Diaz', 'G', 'When her nation is invaded, a young princess is taken into the Princess Protection Program. She is relocated to Louisiana, where she stays with a covert agent and his tomboyish daughter, and must learn how to behave like an ordinary teenager.', 'When her nation is invaded, a young princess is taken into the Princess Protection Program. She is relocated to Louisiana, where she stays with a covert agent and his tomboyish daughter, and must learn how to behave like an ordinary teenager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPKD9hmuYxclAQnfup47qLx8a5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19458'),
  ('7827294582184741', 'Princess Raccoon', 2005, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Seijun Suzuki, Yonezō Maeda', 'Yoshio Urasawa', 'Zhang Ziyi, Joe Odagiri, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Mikijiro Hira, Miwako Ichikawa, Taro Yamamoto, Eisuke Sasai, Yuki Saori', null, 'Amechiyo (the banished prince) falls in love with Tanukihime (a princess of raccoon dog disguised as human). This is an operetta which includes comedy, singing and dancing, and a love story.', 'Amechiyo (the banished prince) falls in love with Tanukihime (a princess of raccoon dog disguised as human). This is an operetta which includes comedy, singing and dancing, and a love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVkyXPT9sqVOp7YLRb89vcYqS1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37711'),
  ('2293581227169862', 'Princess Sakura', 2013, 'Romance', 'Hajime Hashimoto, Yuji Tanaka, Toshio Sawada', 'Masahiro Yoshimoto, Hajime Hashimoto', 'Kyoko Hinami, Munetaka Aoki, Yuma Asami, Masashi Goda, Denden, Miki Hirama, Yuki Kazamatsuri, Yuu Tokui', null, 'One evening, Princess Sakura is attacked by a man. At that time, the Princess could not see his face and only sees a tattoo on his body. Because of that that night, Princess Sakura falls in love with the man. In order to find the man she gives up everything and gets the same identical tattoo. The princess then works as a prostitute. Meanwhile Gonsuke is the man who attacked Princess Sakura. He also stole a scroll and, because of that, he is chased by assassins.', 'One evening, Princess Sakura is attacked by a man. At that time, the Princess could not see his face and only sees a tattoo on his body. Because of that that night, Princess Sakura falls in love with the man. In order to find the man she gives up everything and gets the same identical tattoo. The princess then works as a prostitute. Meanwhile Gonsuke is the man who attacked Princess Sakura. He also stole a scroll and, because of that, he is chased by assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIAxUSjxV99PA2SUQ9begwq1J2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234701'),
  ('1072338201519091691', 'Princess Tam Tam', 1935, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Edmond T. Gréville, Georges Benoît', 'Pepito Abatino', 'Josephine Baker, Albert Préjean, Robert Arnoux, Germaine Aussey, Georges Péclet, Viviane Romance, Jean Galland, Paul Demange', null, 'A French novelist passes off an African shepherdess as a princess.', 'A French novelist passes off an African shepherdess as a princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yKswrkfN5YkgrtvEGNCV3lDSbV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93057'),
  ('345168955654253086', 'Princess Undercover', 2005, 'Romance', 'Franziska Meyer Price', 'Jochen Ketschau, Kerstin Wiedé', 'Muriel Baumeister, René Steinke, Gudrun Landgrebe, Ilja Richter, Mickey Hardt, Nadja Zwanziger, Karin Gregorek, Philipp Sonntag', null, 'A crown princess works incognito for the embassy of her country in Berlin, where she fells in love with a gardener who does not know who she is. As the affair blows up, two lovers and one kingdom have to make the right decision.', 'A crown princess works incognito for the embassy of her country in Berlin, where she fells in love with a gardener who does not know who she is. As the affair blows up, two lovers and one kingdom have to make the right decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDeeLPmFycIs0w7OQZL1B3hiWW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83337'),
  ('1009390823280921931', 'Princess Yang Kwei-fei', 1955, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Kōhei Sugiyama, Yasuzō Masumura', 'Matsutarō Kawaguchi', 'Machiko Kyō, Masayuki Mori, So Yamamura, Eitarō Shindō, Eitarō Ozawa, Haruko Sugimura, Yōko Minamida, Bontarō Miake', null, 'In 8th-century China, the Emperor grieves the death of his wife. The Yang family wants to provide the Emperor with a consort so that they may consolidate their court influence. General An Lushan finds a distant relative working in their kitchen, whom they groom to present to the Emperor. The Emperor falls in love and she becomes the Princess Yang Kwei-fei. The Yangs are then appointed important ministers, though An Lushan is not given the court position he covets.', 'In 8th-century China, the Emperor grieves the death of his wife. The Yang family wants to provide the Emperor with a consort so that they may consolidate their court influence. General An Lushan finds a distant relative working in their kitchen, whom they groom to present to the Emperor. The Emperor falls in love and she becomes the Princess Yang Kwei-fei. The Yangs are then appointed important ministers, though An Lushan is not given the court position he covets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QiJiqVmeJ3ExzhBUpof5oCrt1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91426'),
  ('517842237737797915', 'Princesses', 2005, 'Drama', 'Fernando León de Aranoa, Ramiro Civita', 'Fernando León de Aranoa', 'Candela Peña, Micaela Nevárez, Mariana Cordero, Llum Barrera, Violeta Pérez, Mònica van Campen, Flora Álvarez, María Ballesteros', null, 'Caye is a young prostitute whose family is unaware of her profession. She meets her striking Dominican neighbour Zulema, an illegal immigrant, after she finds her in the bathroom, badly beaten up. They strike up a close friendship unbeknownst to Caye''s xenophobic co-workers.', 'Caye is a young prostitute whose family is unaware of her profession. She meets her striking Dominican neighbour Zulema, an illegal immigrant, after she finds her in the bathroom, badly beaten up. They strike up a close friendship unbeknownst to Caye''s xenophobic co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMW8v2uhR8pwKXoxa10nq8U3pGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127'),
  ('972876688775470546', 'Principal: Am I In a Love Story?', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Toru Yamamoto, Tetsuo Shinohara', 'Yukiko Mochiji', 'Yuina Kuroshima, Nozomu Kotaki, Mahiro Takasugi, Rina Kawaei, Mitsuki Tanimura, Tomohiro Ichikawa, Ayano Mashiro, Kumi Nakamura', null, 'After her parents divorced, Shima Sumitomo lived with her mother. She felt uncomfortable living with her stepfather and she was unable to hang out with people at her high school. Shima Sumitomo decides to move to Hokkaido where her father lives. At her new high school in Hokkaido, she meets classmate Gen Tatebayashi and Wao Sakurai. They are the two most popular boys at her school. A principle of her school is that "Gen and Wao are for everyone." If anyone breaks the rule, that person will be ostracized. Even so, Shima Sumitomo gets closer to Gen and Wao.', 'After her parents divorced, Shima Sumitomo lived with her mother. She felt uncomfortable living with her stepfather and she was unable to hang out with people at her high school. Shima Sumitomo decides to move to Hokkaido where her father lives. At her new high school in Hokkaido, she meets classmate Gen Tatebayashi and Wao Sakurai. They are the two most popular boys at her school. A principle of her school is that "Gen and Wao are for everyone." If anyone breaks the rule, that person will be ostracized. Even so, Shima Sumitomo gets closer to Gen and Wao.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvLVBzJ8Qf9k7p0b9HrmfZt52CH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557080'),
  ('848898992175421565', 'Print the Legend', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Luis Lopez, J. Clay Tweel', 'Steven Klein, Luis López, J. Clay Tweel', 'Chris Anderson, Bruce Bradshaw, Craig Broady, Bill Buell, Michael Calore', null, '3D printing is changing the world – from printing guns and human organs to dismantling the world’s industrial infrastructure by enabling home manufacturing. The 3D Printing revolution has begun. Who will make it?', '3D printing is changing the world – from printing guns and human organs to dismantling the world’s industrial infrastructure by enabling home manufacturing. The 3D Printing revolution has begun. Who will make it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VpvcgdC3yLVMBet1WnWDQS54kP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253266'),
  ('290218571644042564', 'Prinzessinnenbad', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Bettina Blümner, Mathias Schöningh', null, 'Klara Reinacher, Mina Bowling, Tanutscha Glowasz, George-Daniel Thelitz', null, 'A film about three teenagers - Klara, Mina and Tanutscha - from the Berlin district of Kreuzberg. The trio have known each other since Kindergarten and have plenty in common. The three 15-year-olds are the best of friends; they are spending the summer at Prinzenbad, a large open-air swimming pool at the heart of the district where they live. They''re feeling pretty grown up, and are convinced they''ve now left their childhood behind.', 'A film about three teenagers - Klara, Mina and Tanutscha - from the Berlin district of Kreuzberg. The trio have known each other since Kindergarten and have plenty in common. The three 15-year-olds are the best of friends; they are spending the summer at Prinzenbad, a large open-air swimming pool at the heart of the district where they live. They''re feeling pretty grown up, and are convinced they''ve now left their childhood behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rPL5rdNNG87HmNwXnCt8MrNiZ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1684'),
  ('921669417118565481', 'Priscilla', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jon Chan, Andrew M. Robinson, Sofia Coppola', 'Sofia Coppola', 'Cailee Spaeny, Jacob Elordi, Ari Cohen, Dagmara Dominczyk, Tim Post, Lynne Griffin, Dan Beirne, Rodrigo Fernandez-Stoll', 'R', 'When teenage Priscilla Beaulieu meets Elvis Presley at a party, the man who is already a meteoric rock-and-roll superstar becomes someone entirely unexpected in private moments: a thrilling crush, an ally in loneliness, a vulnerable best friend.', 'When teenage Priscilla Beaulieu meets Elvis Presley at a party, the man who is already a meteoric rock-and-roll superstar becomes someone entirely unexpected in private moments: a thrilling crush, an ally in loneliness, a vulnerable best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDCeELWWpsNq7ErM61Yuq70WAE9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020006'),
  ('875841606004752107', 'Prisión de mujeres', 1977, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'René Cardona', null, 'Carmen Montejo, Hilda Aguirre, Zully Keith, Queta Carrasco, René Cardona, Susana Kamini, Hortensia Santoveña, Gloria Chávez', null, '''Prisión de Mujeres'' is a film by Fernando A. Rivero that narrates a harsh reality: the strength of women in a prison, how they lose their dignity and do not stop for anything.', '''Prisión de Mujeres'' is a film by Fernando A. Rivero that narrates a harsh reality: the strength of women in a prison, how they lose their dignity and do not stop for anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gC7e1TYUHbr0hcyFJTwlkCqw6rj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405162'),
  ('1132840233396441829', 'Prison', 1949, 'Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Göran Strindberg', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Doris Svedlund, Birger Malmsten, Eva Henning, Hasse Ekman, Stig Olin, Irma Christenson, Anders Henrikson, Marianne Löfgren', null, 'A filmmaker sets out to create the greatest film in history, but finds out that human abilities have limits.', 'A filmmaker sets out to create the greatest film in history, but finds out that human abilities have limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVxGfCgzain9dxrnmIL0EwCDAvE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113653'),
  ('348632813139341643', 'Prison', 1987, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Mac Ahlberg, Renny Harlin', 'C. Courtney Joyner', 'Viggo Mortensen, Chelsea Field, Lane Smith, Lincoln Kilpatrick, Tom Everett, Ivan Kane, André De Shields, Tommy Lister Jr.', 'R', 'After Charles Forsyth was sent to the electric chair for a crime he didn''t commit, he forever haunts the prison where he was executed. Flash forward several years when the prison is reopened, under the control of its new warden Eaton Sharpe, a former security guard who framed Charlie. When prisoners are ordered to break down the wall to the execution room, they unknowingly release the angry spirit of Charles Forsyth, a powerful being distributing his murderous rage to all, leading up to the Warden himself.', 'After Charles Forsyth was sent to the electric chair for a crime he didn''t commit, he forever haunts the prison where he was executed. Flash forward several years when the prison is reopened, under the control of its new warden Eaton Sharpe, a former security guard who framed Charlie. When prisoners are ordered to break down the wall to the execution room, they unknowingly release the angry spirit of Charles Forsyth, a powerful being distributing his murderous rage to all, leading up to the Warden himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bB6iCnYO1dlVA1kZp04acFyXTpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48309'),
  ('324211172281459631', 'Prison 77', 2022, 'Drama', 'Alberto Rodríguez, Álex Catalán, Manuela Ocón', 'Rafael Cobos, Alberto Rodríguez', 'Miguel Herrán, Javier Gutiérrez, Jesús Carroza, Catalina Sopelana, Xavi Sáez, Fernando Tejero, Víctor Castilla, Alfonso Lara', null, 'Modelo Prison. Barcelona, 1977. A young accountant, awaiting trial for embezzlement with a possible 20 years sentence, joins a group of prisoners demanding amnesty.', 'Modelo Prison. Barcelona, 1977. A young accountant, awaiting trial for embezzlement with a possible 20 years sentence, joins a group of prisoners demanding amnesty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NmaPNP3NS0Ok6sL1fT6ZSnw5OF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913991'),
  ('19310138675499005', 'Prison Break', 1938, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Arthur Lubin', 'Dorothy Davenport', 'Barton MacLane, Glenda Farrell, Paul Hurst, Constance Moore, Edward Pawley, Edmund MacDonald, Ward Bond, Guy Usher', 'NR', 'Story of a tuna fisherman who has been wrongfully convicted of a murder he did not commit. His exemplary behavior in prison ensures that he is up for early parole. He realizes, however, that his movements will be limited, and he will be unable to join and wed his beloved. The only solution is to escape and hunt down the real killer, himself.', 'Story of a tuna fisherman who has been wrongfully convicted of a murder he did not commit. His exemplary behavior in prison ensures that he is up for early parole. He realizes, however, that his movements will be limited, and he will be unable to join and wed his beloved. The only solution is to escape and hunt down the real killer, himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSeX7De6WLd1sLh7USH0GVctyH8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242693'),
  ('950195275395736735', 'Prison Break: The Final Break', 2009, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Brad Turner, Kevin Hooks, Fernando Argüelles', null, 'Wentworth Miller, Sarah Wayne Callies, Dominic Purcell, Jodi Lyn O''Keefe, Amaury Nolasco, Robert Knepper, William Fichtner, Leon Russom', null, 'Michael and Sara wed, but the happiness is short-lived when the Feds apprehend her for the murder of Michael''s mother, Christina. Once a hit is ordered on Sara, the team reunite to break out the increasingly vulnerable target.', 'Michael and Sara wed, but the happiness is short-lived when the Feds apprehend her for the murder of Michael''s mother, Christina. Once a hit is ordered on Sara, the team reunite to break out the increasingly vulnerable target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1QRyGuWVXM4Cr3FyPISSjMCBkA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176241'),
  ('740887003918077366', 'Prison Girls', 1972, 'Drama', 'Tom DeSimone', 'Lee Walters', 'Jacqueline Giroux, Annik Borel, Tracy Handfuss, Maria Arnold, Liz Wolfe, Linda York, Neola Graef, Uschi Digard', null, 'Six female prisoners are given a weekend furlough to prepare them for their upcoming parole. While out, they all have miscellaneous sexual experiences, some good, some bad. One returns to her pimp even though he beats her, one overcomes her frigidity, one gets gang raped, two join in a threesome, and one goes back to her criminal lover shortly before the police show up.', 'Six female prisoners are given a weekend furlough to prepare them for their upcoming parole. While out, they all have miscellaneous sexual experiences, some good, some bad. One returns to her pimp even though he beats her, one overcomes her frigidity, one gets gang raped, two join in a threesome, and one goes back to her criminal lover shortly before the police show up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaKTpyyMRkgNsKa4jDFmEUolZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93068'),
  ('752599888871049904', 'Prison Heat', 1993, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Joel Silberg, Amnon Salomon', 'David Alexander', 'Rebecca Chambers, Lori Jo Hendrix, Kena Land, Toni Naples, Gilya Stern, Uri Gavriel, Michal Yannai, Diana Olearchik', 'R', 'Four American babes on vacation in the Middle East run into trouble when they are imprisoned by corrupt army officials and that''s where the fun begins.', 'Four American babes on vacation in the Middle East run into trouble when they are imprisoned by corrupt army officials and that''s where the fun begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxk8EMSLZX1c1H72SyGR39VUblG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83024'),
  ('431389330087091534', 'Prison on Fire', 1987, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Wen Yun Huang, Joseph Chi Chiong Chavez', 'Nam Yin', 'Tony Leung Ka-fai, Chow Yun-Fat, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, William Ho, Tommy Wong, Victor Hon Kwan, Terrence Fok Shui-Wah, Frankie Ng Chi-Hung', null, 'Lo Ka Yiu, a young ad designer who is sentenced to jail for manslaughter, has gotten himself in trouble with the corrupted wardens and fellow inmates of Triad background. Chung Tin Ching, a veteran inmate and Yiu''s mentor, is forced to confront his comrade''s enemies time and again, leading up to the final showdown with the head of security.', 'Lo Ka Yiu, a young ad designer who is sentenced to jail for manslaughter, has gotten himself in trouble with the corrupted wardens and fellow inmates of Triad background. Chung Tin Ching, a veteran inmate and Yiu''s mentor, is forced to confront his comrade''s enemies time and again, leading up to the final showdown with the head of security.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGReD24bx9lZ13vDLQUqhrI0VhQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53653'),
  ('654457414668361866', 'Prison on Fire II', 1991, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Lam Moon-Wa, Fan Chuen-Yam', 'Nam Yin', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Chan Chung-Yung, Woo Yiu-Chung, Yu Li, Tommy Wong, Victor Hon Kwan, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Vincent Wan Yeung-Ming', null, 'The rivalry between two Chinese prison factions heats up as a seasoned inmate forms an alliance that could cost him more than his freedom.', 'The rivalry between two Chinese prison factions heats up as a seasoned inmate forms an alliance that could cost him more than his freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9DYSG3huWQFnrv02Du43ZLDqk4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56251'),
  ('571624924082123448', 'Prisoner 13', 1933, 'Drama', 'Fernando de Fuentes, Ross Fisher', 'Miguel Ruiz, Fernando de Fuentes', 'Alfredo del Diestro, Luis G. Barreiro, Adela Sequeyro, Arturo Campoamor, Adela Jaloma, Emma Roldán, Antonio R. Frausto, Luis Sánchez Tello', null, 'Colonel Carrasco''s wife Marta leaves him taking his young son. The child, Juan, grows into an admirable and well-mannered young man. Having been promoted to a higher rank of power amidst the Mexican Revolution, the indulgent and corrupt Colonel accepts a bribe to free a revolutionary, Felipe Martinez, from his prison. Martinez has been sentenced to execution at the hands of a firing squad. Carrasco asks to have the revolutionary replaced by absolutely anyone. In a twist of fate, that anyone turns out to be his own long lost son Juan. Upon receiving this news, Marta races to the prison and explains the predicament to Carrasco. He subsequently desperately attempts to prevent the gunning down of his son by his very own government officials.', 'Colonel Carrasco''s wife Marta leaves him taking his young son. The child, Juan, grows into an admirable and well-mannered young man. Having been promoted to a higher rank of power amidst the Mexican Revolution, the indulgent and corrupt Colonel accepts a bribe to free a revolutionary, Felipe Martinez, from his prison. Martinez has been sentenced to execution at the hands of a firing squad. Carrasco asks to have the revolutionary replaced by absolutely anyone. In a twist of fate, that anyone turns out to be his own long lost son Juan. Upon receiving this news, Marta races to the prison and explains the predicament to Carrasco. He subsequently desperately attempts to prevent the gunning down of his son by his very own government officials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Kw6VjwsgQDY01nhyeR4qseThVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145048'),
  ('36381818732737746', 'Prisoner of Honor', 1991, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Ken Russell, Mike Southon, Callum McDougall', 'Ron Hutchinson', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Oliver Reed, Peter Firth, Jeremy Kemp, Brian Blessed, Peter Vaughan, Kenneth Colley, Catherine Neilson', null, 'France, 1897. Colonel Georges Picquart challenges the French government when he discovers the obscure political maneuvers that led to the imprisonment of the Jewish Captain Alfred Dreyfus after being convicted of espionage in 1894.', 'France, 1897. Colonel Georges Picquart challenges the French government when he discovers the obscure political maneuvers that led to the imprisonment of the Jewish Captain Alfred Dreyfus after being convicted of espionage in 1894.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSCqyMQrSnmM4f4FUSl5leGCYIG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233156'),
  ('1086916172820361839', 'Prisoner of the Mountains', 1996, 'Drama, War', 'Pavel Lebeshev, Ekaterina Popova-Evans, Irina Tretyakova', 'Sergei Bodrov, Boris Giller, Arif Aliev', 'Oleg Menshikov, Sergei Bodrov Jr., Jemal Sikharulidze, Susanna Mekhraliyeva, Aleksandr Bureyev, Valentina Fedotova, Aleksei Zharkov, Pavel Lebeshev', null, 'Two Russian soldiers, one battle-seasoned and the other barely into his boots and uniform, are taken prisoner by an anxious Islamic father from a remote village hoping to trade them for his captured son.', 'Two Russian soldiers, one battle-seasoned and the other barely into his boots and uniform, are taken prisoner by an anxious Islamic father from a remote village hoping to trade them for his captured son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82WdNsibYEwZI3u3XB0ndfKKKLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55936'),
  ('669528514227547321', 'Prisoner of War', 2025, 'Action, War, Thriller, History', 'Louis Mandylor, Andy Andico, Melchor Berja', 'Marc Clebanoff', 'Scott Adkins, Peter Shinkoda, Michael Copon, Gabbi Garcia, Michael Rene Walton, Masanori Mimoto, Gary Cairns, Kashio Atsuki', 'NR', 'British RAF Wing Commander James Wright is captured by the Japanese during WWII and forced to fight in brutal hand-to-hand combat. The Japanese soldiers get more than they bargained for when Wright’s years of martial arts training in Hong Kong prove him to be a formidable opponent.', 'British RAF Wing Commander James Wright is captured by the Japanese during WWII and forced to fight in brutal hand-to-hand combat. The Japanese soldiers get more than they bargained for when Wright’s years of martial arts training in Hong Kong prove him to be a formidable opponent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4T4yRG6iskDcfMeoLuUZEJYCrjL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1328803'),
  ('830702767124925932', 'Prisoner''s Daughter', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Catherine Hardwicke, Noah Greenberg, Mark Bacci', 'Mark Bacci', 'Kate Beckinsale, Brian Cox, Christopher Convery, Tyson Ritter, Ernie Hudson, Mark Oliver Everett, Jon Huertas, Mark Kubr', 'R', 'Released from prison with terminal cancer, Max tries to reconnect with his estranged daughter and the grandson he’s never known. When his daughter’s abusive, drug-addicted ex-husband reappears, Max’s violent past comes back to haunt them all.', 'Released from prison with terminal cancer, Max tries to reconnect with his estranged daughter and the grandson he’s never known. When his daughter’s abusive, drug-addicted ex-husband reappears, Max’s violent past comes back to haunt them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NYd7jKFnilcIOUfDI8o2TOuCmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865382'),
  ('151985946225002237', 'Prisoners', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Denis Villeneuve, Roger Deakins, Michael Saunders', 'Aaron Guzikowski', 'Hugh Jackman, Jake Gyllenhaal, Viola Davis, Maria Bello, Terrence Howard, Melissa Leo, Paul Dano, Dylan Minnette', 'R', 'Keller Dover is facing every parent’s worst nightmare. His six-year-old daughter, Anna, is missing, together with her young friend, Joy, and as minutes turn to hours, panic sets in. The only lead is a dilapidated RV that had earlier been parked on their street.', 'Keller Dover is facing every parent’s worst nightmare. His six-year-old daughter, Anna, is missing, together with her young friend, Joy, and as minutes turn to hours, panic sets in. The only lead is a dilapidated RV that had earlier been parked on their street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsS3a3ep2KyBVmmiwaz3LvK49b1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146233'),
  ('659060662001689579', 'Prisoners of the Ghostland', 2021, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller, Action, Western', 'Kiyotaka Ohara, Sion Sono, Kentaro Nishikido', 'Reza Sixo Safai, Aaron Hendry', 'Nicolas Cage, Sofia Boutella, Nick Cassavetes, Bill Moseley, Tak Sakaguchi, YOUNG DAIS, Charles Glover, Cici Zhou', 'NR', 'In the treacherous frontier city of Samurai Town, a ruthless bank robber is sprung from jail by wealthy warlord The Governor, whose adopted granddaughter Bernice has gone missing. The Governor offers the prisoner his freedom in exchange for retrieving the runaway. Strapped into a leather suit that will self-destruct within five days, the bandit sets off on a journey to find the young woman—and his own path to redemption.', 'In the treacherous frontier city of Samurai Town, a ruthless bank robber is sprung from jail by wealthy warlord The Governor, whose adopted granddaughter Bernice has gone missing. The Governor offers the prisoner his freedom in exchange for retrieving the runaway. Strapped into a leather suit that will self-destruct within five days, the bandit sets off on a journey to find the young woman—and his own path to redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5HRzcvN1QXZLvwfc3NLxX8XQJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523638'),
