  ('487680735445045242', 'Prisoners of the Lost Universe', 1983, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Terry Marcel, Derek V. Browne', 'Harry Robertson, Terry Marcel', 'Richard Hatch, Kay Lenz, John Saxon, Peter O''Farrell, Ray Charleson, Kenneth Hendel, Philip Van der Byl, Larry Taylor', null, 'Three people are transported into a parallel universe. There they find that they must use modern technology, but medieval weapons, in order to save the citizenry from a murderous warlord.', 'Three people are transported into a parallel universe. There they find that they must use modern technology, but medieval weapons, in order to save the citizenry from a murderous warlord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qS0SsjfiER8RIEUjLiAVqhfZK4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70500'),
