  ('1149901459778847449', 'Private Hell 36', 1954, 'Crime, Drama', 'Burnett Guffey, Don Siegel, James H. Anderson', 'Ida Lupino, Collier Young', 'Ida Lupino, Steve Cochran, Howard Duff, Dean Jagger, Dorothy Malone, James Anderson, William Boyett, Chester Conklin', 'NR', 'In New York City, a bank robbery of $300,000 goes unsolved for a year, until some of the marked bills are found in a Los Angeles drugstore theft. Police detectives Cal Bruner and Jack Farnham investigate and are led from the drugstore to a nightclub, where singer Lilli is another recipient of a stolen bill. With Lilli''s help, the partners track down the remaining money, but both Lilli and Jack are dismayed when Cal decides he wants to keep part of it.', 'In New York City, a bank robbery of $300,000 goes unsolved for a year, until some of the marked bills are found in a Los Angeles drugstore theft. Police detectives Cal Bruner and Jack Farnham investigate and are led from the drugstore to a nightclub, where singer Lilli is another recipient of a stolen bill. With Lilli''s help, the partners track down the remaining money, but both Lilli and Jack are dismayed when Cal decides he wants to keep part of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okM3v5AhAaOYUnrmwUuYdVSq3l3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36522'),
  ('368470196389558395', 'Private House of the SS', 1977, 'Drama, War, History, Horror', 'Bruno Mattei, Giacinto Bonacquisti, Oscar Santaniello', 'Giacinto Bonacquisti, Bruno Mattei', 'Gabriele Carrara, Marina Daunia, Macha Magall, Vassili Karis, Tamara Triffez, Luce Gregory, Walter Brandi, Thomas Rudy', null, 'Top Nazi officials, intent on rooting out traitors and those in the military who may be plotting to overthrow Adolf Hitler, recruit and train a group of beautiful prostitutes whose mission is to use any means necessary to uncover plots against the Fuhrer.', 'Top Nazi officials, intent on rooting out traitors and those in the military who may be plotting to overthrow Adolf Hitler, recruit and train a group of beautiful prostitutes whose mission is to use any means necessary to uncover plots against the Fuhrer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQFkim4BLyg53QtmJAijiXy1JD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40339'),
