  ('699502472847405359', 'Private Lessons', 1981, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alan Myerson, Beau Marks, Russell Vreeland', 'Dan Greenburg', 'Sylvia Kristel, Howard Hesseman, Eric Brown, Patrick Piccininni, Ed Begley Jr., Pamela Jean Bryant, Meridith Baer, Ron Foster', 'R', 'Phillip Filmore is a naive, 15-year-old, preoccupied with sex, who develops a crush on Nicole Mallow, the new 30-something, French housekeeper and sitter to look after him when Phillip''s father is out of town for the summer on a "business" trip. But Mr. Filmore''s unscrupulous chauffeur, Lester Lewis, takes advantage of Phillip''s crush on Nicole to hire her to seduce the youth, then draws her into a plot to fake her own death in a blackmail scheme aimed to drain Phillip''s trust fund.', 'Phillip Filmore is a naive, 15-year-old, preoccupied with sex, who develops a crush on Nicole Mallow, the new 30-something, French housekeeper and sitter to look after him when Phillip''s father is out of town for the summer on a "business" trip. But Mr. Filmore''s unscrupulous chauffeur, Lester Lewis, takes advantage of Phillip''s crush on Nicole to hire her to seduce the youth, then draws her into a plot to fake her own death in a blackmail scheme aimed to drain Phillip''s trust fund.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTkBOgOv3tpCnfMY6kX2MCYibo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41280'),
