  ('1037780970960755551', 'Private Network: Who Killed Manuel Buendía?', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'Manuel Alcalá', null, 'Daniel Giménez Cacho', null, 'An account of the life and work of the famous Mexican journalist Manuel Buendía (1926-84) that seeks to unravel his murder and the links between Mexican politics and drug trafficking.', 'An account of the life and work of the famous Mexican journalist Manuel Buendía (1926-84) that seeks to unravel his murder and the links between Mexican politics and drug trafficking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNzYnaThW3rxGzV1Uxca1kBkUkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842063'),
