  ('269096382562932544', 'Private School', 1983, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Noel Black, Walter Lassally', 'Dan Greenburg, Suzanne O''Malley', 'Phoebe Cates, Betsy Russell, Matthew Modine, Michael Zorek, Fran Ryan, Kathleen Wilhoite, Ray Walston, Sylvia Kristel', 'R', 'Private-school student Christine loves Jim. But her classmate, Jordan, is also vying for Jim''s attention and trying to end his relationship with Christine. Meanwhile, Jim''s friend Bubba embarks on a series of sexual escapades, including dressing up as a woman to access the girls'' locker room. Despite Jim and Christine''s efforts to spend some time alone, various shenanigans and schemes interfere.', 'Private-school student Christine loves Jim. But her classmate, Jordan, is also vying for Jim''s attention and trying to end his relationship with Christine. Meanwhile, Jim''s friend Bubba embarks on a series of sexual escapades, including dressing up as a woman to access the girls'' locker room. Despite Jim and Christine''s efforts to spend some time alone, various shenanigans and schemes interfere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZLpmALf3LRUnCb0JI2ZRa9IR1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18835'),
  ('790905156241238406', 'Private Town', 1994, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Jacek Skalski, Andrzej Adamczak', 'Jacek Skalski', 'Bogusław Linda, Maciej Kozłowski, Maria Gładkowska, Mirosław Baka, Dariusz Gnatowski, Mirosław Zbrojewicz, Krzysztof Zaleski, Krzysztof Kiersznowski', null, 'A town near Warsaw. A group of teenagers rules one of the courtyards: Ali, Pawik, and Małgośka, the object of both boys'' fascination. A few years later, these same young people form a typical youth gang. Ali and Pawik gather around them a group of peers who have been unable to find their place in society and want to live an easy life. Robberies and thefts are their idea of a comfortable existence. A few more years pass and the gang transforms into a mafia. After the 1989 elections, it enters into deals with politicians. It also gets into a conflict with Russian gangsters.', 'A town near Warsaw. A group of teenagers rules one of the courtyards: Ali, Pawik, and Małgośka, the object of both boys'' fascination. A few years later, these same young people form a typical youth gang. Ali and Pawik gather around them a group of peers who have been unable to find their place in society and want to live an easy life. Robberies and thefts are their idea of a comfortable existence. A few more years pass and the gang transforms into a mafia. After the 1989 elections, it enters into deals with politicians. It also gets into a conflict with Russian gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6F2u6Swm7l0Q38BMGi20GH7wlG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107174'),
  ('939330868539428636', 'Private Tuition', 1986, 'Drama, Crime', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre', 'Jean-Marc Roberts, Pierre Granier-Deferre, Christopher Frank', 'Élisabeth Bourgine, Michel Aumont, Xavier Deluc, Sylvia Zerbib, Emmanuelle Seigner, Sandrine Kiberlain, André Chaumeau, Jacques Boudet', null, 'Jeanne Kern is a pretty, somewhat repressed schoolteacher who suffers a smear campaign at work. Someone has been sending her director letters accusing her of lewd and immoral conduct. Matters take a turn for the worse when a photograph of an orgy is sent to all the faculty with one face cut out; presumably, the face is hers.', 'Jeanne Kern is a pretty, somewhat repressed schoolteacher who suffers a smear campaign at work. Someone has been sending her director letters accusing her of lewd and immoral conduct. Matters take a turn for the worse when a photograph of an orgy is sent to all the faculty with one face cut out; presumably, the face is hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nkDVYQ7uKgkfCXri9hiyLO8MRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296435'),
  ('668870005957054030', 'Private Valentine: Blonde & Dangerous', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Steve Miner, Patrick Cady, Bruce A. Simon', 'April Blair, Kelly Bowen', 'Jessica Simpson, Vivica A. Fox, Steve Guttenberg, Aimee Garcia, Olesya Rulin, Keiko Agena, Jill Marie Jones, Ryan Sypek', 'PG-13', 'When fluffy, bubble gum movie star Megan Valentine suddenly finds herself broke and humiliated in the public eye, she wanders from the wreckage of a car accident and witlessly enlists in the U.S. Army hoping in vain that it will change her life.', 'When fluffy, bubble gum movie star Megan Valentine suddenly finds herself broke and humiliated in the public eye, she wanders from the wreckage of a car accident and witlessly enlists in the U.S. Army hoping in vain that it will change her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49hl7b0s6YCtO1qWDulBZ0RPmgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15616'),
  ('1095496462611594310', 'Private Vices, Public Virtues', 1976, 'Drama, War', 'Miklós Jancsó, Tomislav Pinter', 'Miklós Jancsó, Giovanna Gagliardo', 'Lajos Balázsovits, Pamela Villoresi, Franco Branciaroli, Teresa Ann Savoy, Laura Betti, Ivica Pajer, Ilona Staller, Umberto Silva', 'R', 'The setting is a Central European kingdom, near the turn of the century. Bored by his very proper wife, the youthful heir to the throne spends his time in amorous dalliances at a sprawling country estate. His wife departs at the arrival of his friends, and they organize a celebration which becomes a wild orgy and culminates in death and tragedy.', 'The setting is a Central European kingdom, near the turn of the century. Bored by his very proper wife, the youthful heir to the throne spends his time in amorous dalliances at a sprawling country estate. His wife departs at the arrival of his friends, and they organize a celebration which becomes a wild orgy and culminates in death and tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZgqkdDx8A2xyISXjkFAh7oTga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46696'),
  ('702337993954047468', 'Private''s Progress', 1956, 'Comedy, War', 'John Boulting, Eric Cross, John Addison', 'John Boulting, Frank Harvey', 'Ian Carmichael, Richard Attenborough, Terry-Thomas, John Le Mesurier, William Hartnell, Dennis Price, Ian Bannen, Peter Jones', 'NR', 'Stanley Windrush has to interrupt his university education when he is called up towards the end of the war. He quickly proves himself not to be officer material, but befriends wily Private Percival Cox who knows exactly how all the scams work in the confused world of the British Army. And Stanley''s brigadier War Office uncle seems to be up to something more than a bit shady too - and they are both soon working for him, behind the enemy lines.', 'Stanley Windrush has to interrupt his university education when he is called up towards the end of the war. He quickly proves himself not to be officer material, but befriends wily Private Percival Cox who knows exactly how all the scams work in the confused world of the British Army. And Stanley''s brigadier War Office uncle seems to be up to something more than a bit shady too - and they are both soon working for him, behind the enemy lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnHaZ2dyyuz4YAW7L5fgzn3Xwk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84109'),
  ('511920767627163563', 'Privates on Parade', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama, War, Music', 'Michael Blakemore, Noel Davis, Michael Zimbrich', 'Peter Nichols', 'John Cleese, Denis Quilley, Michael Elphick, Nicola Pagett, Patrick Pearson, John Standing, David Bamber, Bruce Payne', 'R', 'It is 1947, the year of the communist rebellion in Malaya and the British army''s SADUSEA (Song And Dance Unit South East Asia) are called to the Malayan Jungle to entertain the troops. The eccentric, bible-bashing Major Giles Flack (John Cleese) is in command of the unit. Flack is accompanied by an ageing, theatrical drama queen, Terri Dennis (Denis Quilley) who hopes to entertain the troops with his flamboyant impressions, but the bored troops find other ways to enjoy themselves.', 'It is 1947, the year of the communist rebellion in Malaya and the British army''s SADUSEA (Song And Dance Unit South East Asia) are called to the Malayan Jungle to entertain the troops. The eccentric, bible-bashing Major Giles Flack (John Cleese) is in command of the unit. Flack is accompanied by an ageing, theatrical drama queen, Terri Dennis (Denis Quilley) who hopes to entertain the troops with his flamboyant impressions, but the bored troops find other ways to enjoy themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4uDeaKKrtQbz7y5aFb1u6Kn7UZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83562'),
  ('389305299358367766', 'Privilege', 1967, 'Drama', 'Peter Watkins, Peter Suschitzky', 'Norman Bognor, Peter Watkins', 'Paul Jones, Jean Shrimpton, Mark London, William Job, Max Bacon, Jeremy Child, James Cossins, Frederick Danner', 'NR', 'Britain''s biggest pop singer, Steven Shorter, receives unwavering adulation and possesses total control over his rabid fans, which includes nearly the entire population. Yet Shorter is not an autonomous performer -- he is little more than a puppet for the government, promoting whatever agenda they see fit. When a beautiful artist, Vanessa Ritchie, is commissioned to paint his portrait, she pushes Shorter to question his obedience to his manipulative handlers.', 'Britain''s biggest pop singer, Steven Shorter, receives unwavering adulation and possesses total control over his rabid fans, which includes nearly the entire population. Yet Shorter is not an autonomous performer -- he is little more than a puppet for the government, promoting whatever agenda they see fit. When a beautiful artist, Vanessa Ritchie, is commissioned to paint his portrait, she pushes Shorter to question his obedience to his manipulative handlers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oX3lnV77rYHibP9UEdrZzq3TJfW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51856'),
  ('504796242473270412', 'Prizefighter: The Life of Jem Belcher', 2022, 'History, Drama', 'Daniel Graham, Ben Braham Ziryab', 'Matt Hookings', 'Matt Hookings, Ray Winstone, Jodhi May, Marton Csokas, Russell Crowe, Steven Berkoff, Julian Glover, Lucy Martin', null, 'At the turn of the 19th century, Pugilism was the sport of kings and a gifted young boxer fought his way to becoming champion of England.', 'At the turn of the 19th century, Pugilism was the sport of kings and a gifted young boxer fought his way to becoming champion of England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3PIk93PTbxT88ohfeb26L1VpZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943822'),
  ('49623838142554621', 'Prizzi''s Honor', 1985, 'Romance, Comedy, Crime', 'John Huston, Andrzej Bartkowiak, Benjamin Rosenberg', 'Janet Roach, Richard Condon', 'Jack Nicholson, Kathleen Turner, Robert Loggia, John Randolph, William Hickey, Lee Richardson, Michael Lombard, Anjelica Huston', 'R', 'Charley Partanna is a hitman who works for the Prizzis, one of the richest crime families in the US. When he sees Irene Walker, it''s love at first sight. But he soon finds that she, too, is a killer for hire. Charley can overlook his suspicions, but he can''t turn off his heart. And the couple must remember that even if they love each other, the Prizzis love only money.', 'Charley Partanna is a hitman who works for the Prizzis, one of the richest crime families in the US. When he sees Irene Walker, it''s love at first sight. But he soon finds that she, too, is a killer for hire. Charley can overlook his suspicions, but he can''t turn off his heart. And the couple must remember that even if they love each other, the Prizzis love only money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5azGfZXuUFYjYfz6etYOdlyLXwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2075'),
  ('1108830522199149800', 'Pro Dia Nascer Feliz', 2006, 'Documentary', 'João Jardim, Gustavo Hadba, Gabriela Weeks', 'João Jardim', null, null, '"Pro Dia Nascer Feliz" é o segundo longa-metragem do diretor João Jardim, diretor do cultuado documentário "Janela da Alma" que, em 2002, bateu recordes de público no gênero. Através de uma investigação do relacionamento do adolescente com a escola - ambiente fundamental em sua formação - o diretor traz à tona, além de questões comuns a qualquer adolescente dentro do ambiente escolar, questões como a desigualdade social e o impacto da banalização da violência no desenvolvimento de muitos desses jovens.', '"Pro Dia Nascer Feliz" é o segundo longa-metragem do diretor João Jardim, diretor do cultuado documentário "Janela da Alma" que, em 2002, bateu recordes de público no gênero. Através de uma investigação do relacionamento do adolescente com a escola - ambiente fundamental em sua formação - o diretor traz à tona, além de questões comuns a qualquer adolescente dentro do ambiente escolar, questões como a desigualdade social e o impacto da banalização da violência no desenvolvimento de muitos desses jovens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpaijqE50AnzoYnCXioGIyyVAJ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57979'),
  ('1135912680884786510', 'Pro-Life', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'John Carpenter', 'Rebecca Swan, Drew McWeeny', 'Ron Perlman, Caitlin Wachs, Emmanuelle Vaugier, Mark Feuerstein, Biski Gugushe, Lisa Bunting, Stephen Dimopoulos, Ashley Whillans', null, 'Angelique, a traumatized fifteen year old, is taken to an abortion clinic to end her pregnancy. However, her deeply religious father and three brothers are out to make sure the baby lives.', 'Angelique, a traumatized fifteen year old, is taken to an abortion clinic to end her pregnancy. However, her deeply religious father and three brothers are out to make sure the baby lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVUUEFgHzfW1qDNZ5MMsUewnPMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298723'),
  ('307385332687731923', 'Problem Child', 1990, 'Comedy, Family', 'Dennis Dugan, Peter Lyons Collister, Nelson Coates', 'Scott Alexander, Larry Karaszewski', 'John Ritter, Jack Warden, Michael J. Oliver, Gilbert Gottfried, Amy Yasbeck, Michael Richards, Peter Jurasik, Charlotte Akin', 'PG', 'Ben Healy and his social climbing wife Flo adopt fun-loving seven year old Junior. But they soon discover he''s a little monster as he turns a camping trip, a birthday party and even a baseball game into comic nightmares.', 'Ben Healy and his social climbing wife Flo adopt fun-loving seven year old Junior. But they soon discover he''s a little monster as he turns a camping trip, a birthday party and even a baseball game into comic nightmares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cJK28DhybQGEldJJPtTdKlSbWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11077'),
  ('1009154105010594787', 'Problem Child 2', 1991, 'Comedy, Family', 'Brian Levant, Peter Smokler', 'Larry Karaszewski, Scott Alexander', 'John Ritter, Michael J. Oliver, Jack Warden, Laraine Newman, Amy Yasbeck, Ivyann Schwan, Gilbert Gottfried, Paul Willson', 'PG-13', 'Junior and his father, Ben, move from Cold River to Mortville. Junior becomes threatened by Ben''s desire to date again and find a new mother for Junior, and sabotages each of his dates.', 'Junior and his father, Ben, move from Cold River to Mortville. Junior becomes threatened by Ben''s desire to date again and find a new mother for Junior, and sabotages each of his dates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnmw3F3rdbxb08zSdfHHMwfXMLI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28597'),
  ('5761165224647888', 'Problem Child 3', 1995, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Greg Beeman, Peter Smokler', 'Michael Hitchcock', 'William Katt, Justin Chapman, Sherman Howard, Carolyn Lowery, Eric Edwards, Blake McIver Ewing, Jennifer Ogletree, Brock Pierce', 'PG', 'Now a pre-teen, Junior has fallen head over heels for a classmate who doesn''t even notice him, but does notice three other boys – a child star, a hockey player and a Boy Scout – who are rivals to Junior. This means war!', 'Now a pre-teen, Junior has fallen head over heels for a classmate who doesn''t even notice him, but does notice three other boys – a child star, a hockey player and a Boy Scout – who are rivals to Junior. This means war!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adCNPBJPaBjp9ikJAJYGAkqz6CE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28601'),
  ('1072043554815269913', 'Problemista', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Julio Torres, Kether Abeles, Hope McCullough', 'Julio Torres', 'Julio Torres, Tilda Swinton, RZA, Isabella Rossellini, Catalina Saavedra, James Scully, Laith Nakli, Spike Einbinder', 'R', 'Alejandro is an aspiring toy designer from El Salvador, struggling to bring his unusual ideas to life in New York City. As time on his work visa runs out, a job assisting an erratic art-world outcast becomes his only hope to stay in the country and realize his dream.', 'Alejandro is an aspiring toy designer from El Salvador, struggling to bring his unusual ideas to life in New York City. As time on his work visa runs out, a job assisting an erratic art-world outcast becomes his only hope to stay in the country and realize his dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8R5s0optPNlTncP876bK8gWGkRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852247'),
  ('524382025093359743', 'Problemos', 2017, 'Comedy, Family', 'Éric Judor', 'Noé Debré, Blanche Gardin', 'Blanche Gardin, Éric Judor, Celia Rosich, Youssef Hajdi, Marie Helmer, Claire Chust, Blandine Ruiz, Arnaud Henriet', null, 'When a pandemic strikes the world, Victor and his family get stuck within a hippie community.', 'When a pandemic strikes the world, Victor and his family get stuck within a hippie community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12KzS7zZ2Kj4p556lvR7UtJsQoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450179'),
  ('630834421832785813', 'Process Red', 1966, null, 'Hollis Frampton', null, null, null, 'An experimental short film by Hollis Frampton of contrasting colours.', 'An experimental short film by Hollis Frampton of contrasting colours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glj5l0NA3ikeppSRotytmOEtlmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163347'),
  ('1061861550578510477', 'Procession', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Robert Greene, Robert Kolodny', null, 'Joe Eldred, Mike Foreman, Ed Gavagan, Dan Laurine, Monica Phinney, Michael Sandridge, Ryan Trobough, Terrick Trobough', 'R', 'Six men who were sexually abused by Catholic clergy as boys become a makeshift family and find empowerment by creating films inspired by their trauma.', 'Six men who were sexually abused by Catholic clergy as boys become a makeshift family and find empowerment by creating films inspired by their trauma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVhtXaXqCjy8Gdu3TspYPRq4zeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869623'),
  ('670317436158008694', 'Procession of Baby Carriages at a Paris Nursery', 1899, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'A long line of nurses pushing carts with their babies enter from the far right, cross a garden in front of the large nursery home, and leave by the close left to the camera. A few toddlers also follow in the same orderly line, along their nurses.', 'A long line of nurses pushing carts with their babies enter from the far right, cross a garden in front of the large nursery home, and leave by the close left to the camera. A few toddlers also follow in the same orderly line, along their nurses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bd2kn3NemIsN9li7RrONfmwrNtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195349'),
