  ('654891823658601828', 'Prodigies', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Frédéric Potier, Valentin Potier, Véronique Lamarche', 'Frédéric Potier, Valentin Potier, Sabine Dabadie', 'Camille Razat, Mélanie Robert, Franck Dubosc, Isabelle Carré, August Wittgenstein, Elisa Doughty, Derek Simon Robin, Thomas Landbo', null, 'Claire and Jeanne are twin sisters, united by the same passion: the piano. Coached by their father like athletes, they join the prestigious Karlsruhe Conservatory. They are now competing to be soloists and training for a concert that will make or break their careers. But Claire and then Jeanne discover they are suffering from a serious illness and are slowly losing the use of their hands. With the support of their family and their undying love of music, they will find a unique way to change their fate. An inspiring and moving tale, based on a true story.', 'Claire and Jeanne are twin sisters, united by the same passion: the piano. Coached by their father like athletes, they join the prestigious Karlsruhe Conservatory. They are now competing to be soloists and training for a concert that will make or break their careers. But Claire and then Jeanne discover they are suffering from a serious illness and are slowly losing the use of their hands. With the support of their family and their undying love of music, they will find a unique way to change their fate. An inspiring and moving tale, based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NPOX1IOHatXRAovxIy6vkUfAR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1063881'),
  ('289443011695583158', 'Prodigy', 2017, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Alex Haughey, Brian Vidal, Hisonni Johnson', 'Alex Haughey, Brian Vidal', 'Richard Neil, Savannah Liles, Jolene Andersen, Emilio Palame, David Linski, Harvey Q. Johnson, Penelope Figueroa, Alex Matthew', null, 'Jimmy is a committed child psychologist who uses his own playbook, but when he is brought in to work with Ellie, he is completely unprepared for his subject—a 9-year-old psychopathic genius with nothing to lose. As he begins to understand the extent of her capabilities and the fate that has been planned for her, he struggles to overcome her defenses before it is too late for them both.', 'Jimmy is a committed child psychologist who uses his own playbook, but when he is brought in to work with Ellie, he is completely unprepared for his subject—a 9-year-old psychopathic genius with nothing to lose. As he begins to understand the extent of her capabilities and the fate that has been planned for her, he struggles to overcome her defenses before it is too late for them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMqyMjzqMi8Nd57iITmzi1fE5rP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446827'),
  ('604151090137306389', 'Producing Adults', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Aleksi Salmenperä, Mark Lwoff, Piia Nokelainen', 'Pekko Pesonen', 'Minna Haapkylä, Kari-Pekka Toivonen, Minttu Mustakallio, Tommi Eronen, Pekka Strang, Dick Idman, Antti Raivio, Saara Pakkasvirta', null, 'Longtime couple Venla and Antero come to a serious impasse. After years with Antero, Venla wants to start a family, but her boyfriend, worried that parenthood will stifle his speed-skating career, secretly gets a vasectomy. Determined to have a child, Venla seeks help from a female fertility doctor, a decision that breeds new possibilities for the prospective mother when she falls in love with the doctor.', 'Longtime couple Venla and Antero come to a serious impasse. After years with Antero, Venla wants to start a family, but her boyfriend, worried that parenthood will stifle his speed-skating career, secretly gets a vasectomy. Determined to have a child, Venla seeks help from a female fertility doctor, a decision that breeds new possibilities for the prospective mother when she falls in love with the doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cYdN0EsH8ekdWZ1SE0jBMLEdT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39496'),
  ('762557658444892531', 'Profesor eróticus', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Luis María Delgado, Manuel Rojas', 'Diego Santillán, Luis María Delgado', 'Alfredo Landa, Antonio Ferrandis, Jorge Rivero, Silvia Aguilar, Ricardo Merino, Hilda Aguirre, Alfonso del Real, Angélica Chain', null, 'A young professor of sexology advantage to spend the honeymoon at hotel in Mallorca where he has a congress. There he meets colleagues of different nationalities who also attended with their wives. A number of changes in the novel drugs that are causing a number of unexpected reactions ranging from professional envy jealousy. The situation causes wobble love affair honeymooners.', 'A young professor of sexology advantage to spend the honeymoon at hotel in Mallorca where he has a congress. There he meets colleagues of different nationalities who also attended with their wives. A number of changes in the novel drugs that are causing a number of unexpected reactions ranging from professional envy jealousy. The situation causes wobble love affair honeymooners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6THSTJN3vtYIboUweZ73nOwD34r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197619'),
  ('432712264854665210', 'Professionals for a Massacre', 1967, 'Western', 'Nando Cicero, Francisco Marín, Stefano Rolla', 'Jaime Jesús Balcázar, Roberto Gianviti, Enzo Dell''Aquila', 'George Hilton, Edd Byrnes, George Martin, Mónica Randall, Milo Quesada, Gérard Herter, José Bódalo, Gisella Monaldi', null, 'Caught selling stolen guns, three Confederate soldiers get a reprieve from the firing squad, provided they go into Mexico on a mission to recover stolen gold belonging to the Confederacy.', 'Caught selling stolen guns, three Confederate soldiers get a reprieve from the firing squad, provided they go into Mexico on a mission to recover stolen gold belonging to the Confederacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kSyQAgBu4kYMwsSwE2F9loEmG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143931'),
  ('352209679901022744', 'Professione vacanze', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Vittorio De Sisti', 'Jerry Calà, Maria Rita Parsi, Marco Cavaliere', 'Jerry Calà, Gegia, Sandro Ghiani, Mara Venier, Jenny Tamburi, Giorgio Vignali, Francesco Caruso Cardelli', null, 'Enrico Borghini is an entertainer who finds himself becoming the director of a tourist village in crisis. Helped by the village staff, who are initially hostile to him, he manages to revive the fortunes of the structure.', 'Enrico Borghini is an entertainer who finds himself becoming the director of a tourist village in crisis. Helped by the village staff, who are initially hostile to him, he manages to revive the fortunes of the structure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7SY3ArfRh91t99frYRdwpcMC5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227037'),
  ('245545976921942220', 'Professor Dan Petory''s Blues', 2002, 'Animation', 'Hidekazu Ohara', null, null, null, 'A musical number starring a hand puppet named Junior. The puppet is controlled by the drunken Professor Dan Petory who explains in puppetry the answers to such questions as why the Earth is blue and why UFOs fly in a zig-zag pattern.', 'A musical number starring a hand puppet named Junior. The puppet is controlled by the drunken Professor Dan Petory who explains in puppetry the answers to such questions as why the Earth is blue and why UFOs fly in a zig-zag pattern.', null, 'tmdb:movie:365293'),
  ('1030849345406523219', 'Professor Godoy', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gui Ashcar', 'Gui Ashcar', 'Roney Facchini, Kauê Telloli', null, 'Mr. Godoy teaches math at a Private High School''s senior year. Stubborn and severe, Godoy lives a dull life defined by rules, but something is about to change.', 'Mr. Godoy teaches math at a Private High School''s senior year. Stubborn and severe, Godoy lives a dull life defined by rules, but something is about to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weHOwDOD6gzgZ9oGK4qpXvRXApl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228323'),
  ('1067737016402425971', 'Professor Hannibal', 1956, 'Drama', 'Zoltán Fábri, Ferenc Szécsényi', 'István Gyenes, Péter Szász, Zoltán Fábri', 'Ernö Szabó, Noémi Apor, Emmi Buttykay, Hilda Gobbi, Manyi Kiss, Béla Barsi, Ferenc Bessenyei, Karola Zala', null, 'A school teacher becomes a momentary hero after having rescued a stuffed-bird from a school incident.', 'A school teacher becomes a momentary hero after having rescued a stuffed-bird from a school incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBgY90skCl9SFvoPiEJPHIorvwo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254359'),
  ('1093392607860834722', 'Professor Layton and the Eternal Diva', 2009, 'Family, Animation, Mystery', 'Masakazu Hashimoto, Hideki Takahashi, Noboru Sugimitsu', 'Aya Matsui', 'Yo Oizumi, Maki Horikita, Saki Aibu, Nana Mizuki, Atsuro Watabe, Hochu Otsuka, Iemasa Kayumi, Fumiko Orikasa', null, 'Archeologist and avid puzzle solver Professor Layton and his assistant Luke are caught up in an adventure when a masked figure steals an entire opera house and forces those in attendance to play a high-stakes game. The winner will receive eternal life, but it could mean death for the losers.', 'Archeologist and avid puzzle solver Professor Layton and his assistant Luke are caught up in an adventure when a masked figure steals an entire opera house and forces those in attendance to play a high-stakes game. The winner will receive eternal life, but it could mean death for the losers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GKPKoh9fwm34HyDdqjPoDwwnEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41066'),
  ('984398585343673571', 'Professor Marston and the Wonder Women', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Angela Robinson, Eric Altieri, Eric Berkal', 'Angela Robinson', 'Luke Evans, Rebecca Hall, Bella Heathcote, Connie Britton, JJ Feild, Oliver Platt, Monica Giordano, Maggie Castle', 'R', 'The unconventional life of Dr. William Marston, the Harvard psychologist and inventor who helped invent the modern lie detector test and co-created Wonder Woman in 1941.', 'The unconventional life of Dr. William Marston, the Harvard psychologist and inventor who helped invent the modern lie detector test and co-created Wonder Woman in 1941.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbrzHlnE8dNpllLWEe9bwDGNzLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420622'),
