  ('511348315645150504', 'Program', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Yutaka Minowa, Ryu Takizawa', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski', 'Hedy Burress, Phil LaMarr, John DiMaggio', null, 'Cis and Duo discuss leaving the real world while during a samurai sword fight. Part of the Animatrix collection of animated shorts set in the Matrix universe.', 'Cis and Duo discuss leaving the real world while during a samurai sword fight. Part of the Animatrix collection of animated shorts set in the Matrix universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ct5NLNwfkT3CaFBTAbaomtMpdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24959'),
  ('954338046352511959', 'Programmed to Kill', 1987, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Allan Holzman, Robert Short, Nissim Leon', 'Robert Short', 'Robert Ginty, Sandahl Bergman, James Booth, Alex Courtney, Paul Walker, Louise Caire Clark, Peter Bromilow, George Fisher', null, 'A middle eastern female terrorist is captured by the CIA in Greece, after an attack on a marketplace. Transported back to the USA, the terrorist undergoes an operation where she is transformed into a cybernetic killing machine. Now the CIA have a secret weapon to send back to the Middle East, but how long can they control her?', 'A middle eastern female terrorist is captured by the CIA in Greece, after an attack on a marketplace. Transported back to the USA, the terrorist undergoes an operation where she is transformed into a cybernetic killing machine. Now the CIA have a secret weapon to send back to the Middle East, but how long can they control her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjqgwl9PktkzQPTPNKdHafsoVTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258157'),
  ('359712823791718130', 'Project A', 1983, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jackie Chan, Chiu Lo-Kong, Jo Chan Wai-Yee', 'Jackie Chan, Edward Tang', 'Jackie Chan, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Yuen Biao, Dick Wei, Mars, Tai Bo, Isabella Wong, Kwan Hoi-San', 'PG-13', 'In late 19th century Hong Kong, the British may rule the land, but the pirates rule the waters. Coast Guard officer Dragon Ma is determined that his beloved Coast Guard will not be made a fool of.', 'In late 19th century Hong Kong, the British may rule the land, but the pirates rule the waters. Coast Guard officer Dragon Ma is determined that his beloved Coast Guard will not be made a fool of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvTu2bmJbVZGXPxdx6VllGXCtLG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21519'),
  ('928413986134361777', 'Project A Part II', 1987, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jackie Chan, Cheung Yiu-Cho, Lam Chun-Fai', 'Edward Tang, Jackie Chan', 'Jackie Chan, Maggie Cheung, Rosamund Kwan Chi-Lam, Carina Lau, David Lam Wai, Bill Tung Biu, Kwan Hoi-San, Isabella Wong', 'PG-13', 'Dragon is now transferred to be the police head of Sai Wan district, and has to contend with a gangster kingpin, anti-Manchu revolutionaries, some runaway pirates, Manchu Loyalists and a corrupt police superintendent.', 'Dragon is now transferred to be the police head of Sai Wan district, and has to contend with a gangster kingpin, anti-Manchu revolutionaries, some runaway pirates, Manchu Loyalists and a corrupt police superintendent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oY6wOuPmeeDoKjPdPlMwwmDCYmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21521'),
  ('558999283594462255', 'Project A-Ko', 1986, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Katsuhiko Nishijima, Yasunori Honda, Yuu Kou', 'Tomoko Kawasaki, Yuji Moriyama', 'Miki Ito, Emi Shinohara, Michie Tomizawa, Tessyo Genda, Shuichi Ikeda, Asami Mukaidono, Sayuri Ikemoto, Daisuke Gori', 'NR', 'Earth. The not too distant future. A city is miraculously reborn just sixteen years after being completely destroyed by a giant meteor. At the prestigious Graviton High School for Girls, two new students are introduced. A-ko and her ditzy sidekick, C-ko.', 'Earth. The not too distant future. A city is miraculously reborn just sixteen years after being completely destroyed by a giant meteor. At the prestigious Graviton High School for Girls, two new students are introduced. A-ko and her ditzy sidekick, C-ko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnOzcaxpL8PR1nIB02JgMqr97hb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42025'),
  ('538271888935013557', 'Project Alien', 1990, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Frank Shields, Richard Michalak', null, 'Michael Nouri, Darlanne Fluegel, Maxwell Caulfield, Derren Nesbitt, Ray Charleson, Charles Durning, Michael Latimer, Sebastian Allen', null, 'In Norway a military plane crashes under mysterious circumstances: in his last message the pilot reported many lights falling from the sky. NATO wants to play down the incident, but the famous TV moderator George Abbot and the no less persistent journalist Milker sense a sensational story about UFOs and start snooping around in the area with help of pilot "Bird" McNamara. Inspired by the suspiciously rigorous isolation of the whole area around the crash point and cases of an unknown disease they have a closer look at the military''s activities...', 'In Norway a military plane crashes under mysterious circumstances: in his last message the pilot reported many lights falling from the sky. NATO wants to play down the incident, but the famous TV moderator George Abbot and the no less persistent journalist Milker sense a sensational story about UFOs and start snooping around in the area with help of pilot "Bird" McNamara. Inspired by the suspiciously rigorous isolation of the whole area around the crash point and cases of an unknown disease they have a closer look at the military''s activities...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLRuOCvYq1Fp22IwOhkvBoujhdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219639'),
  ('199398775526287389', 'Project Almanac', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Dean Israelite, Christina Fong, Matthew J. Lloyd', 'Jason Pagan, Andrew Deutschman', 'Jonny Weston, Sofia Black-D''Elia, Sam Lerner, Allen Evangelista, Virginia Gardner, Amy Landecker, Gary Weeks, Macsen Lintz', 'PG-13', 'A group of teens discover secret plans of a time machine, and construct one. However, things start to get out of control.', 'A group of teens discover secret plans of a time machine, and construct one. However, things start to get out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9u5Rb0e7mx8qOO7zj39KnIRWClr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227719'),
  ('604960734035087413', 'Project Christmas Wish', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance, Family', 'Jeff Beesley', 'Joie Botkin', 'Travis Van Winkle, Amanda Schull, Amy Groening, Averie Peters, Sharon Bajer, Jan Skene, Stephanie Sy, Gino Anania', null, 'For years Lucy has played Santa to her small town’s community by making their holiday wishes come true. But when Lucy grants a little girl’s wish for a Christmas like she used to have with her mom, she unexpectedly finds her own wishes coming true in life and love.', 'For years Lucy has played Santa to her small town’s community by making their holiday wishes come true. But when Lucy grants a little girl’s wish for a Christmas like she used to have with her mom, she unexpectedly finds her own wishes coming true in life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rrVRvULO7Hx4bHIinhfcbRYhzW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746480'),
  ('1029762502743052377', 'Project Dreams - How to Build Mazinger Z''s Hangar', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa', 'Makoto Ueda', 'Mahiro Takasugi, Yusuke Kamiji, Yukino Kishii, Chikara Honda, Keita Machida, Rokkaku Seiji, Hiroaki Ogi, Suzuki Taku', null, 'Doi of the Maeda Construction Company''s Advertising group has little passion for his work. One day the group''s leader Asagawa declares, "Let''s build the hangar for Mazinger Z!" Having been dragged in by Asagawa, Doi and his co-workers commence putting on appearances of having taken on this request from a fantasy world.', 'Doi of the Maeda Construction Company''s Advertising group has little passion for his work. One day the group''s leader Asagawa declares, "Let''s build the hangar for Mazinger Z!" Having been dragged in by Asagawa, Doi and his co-workers commence putting on appearances of having taken on this request from a fantasy world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tznhGEsc8p8cTH5WovgpezWaZiO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:731868'),
  ('1110617117360152910', 'Project Eerie', 2023, 'Horror', 'Ricky Umberger', 'Ricky Umberger', 'Ricky Umberger, Austin Greene, Justin Snyder, Dennis Frazier, Alex Ahmer, Jacob Waeyaert, Blair Umberger, Braydan Wade', null, 'On Halloween, 2020, Jesse and Jacob Warner disappeared while live streaming on social media. This is that live stream.', 'On Halloween, 2020, Jesse and Jacob Warner disappeared while live streaming on social media. This is that live stream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tw8o7cJEybMbaqu8kCeTcxBi5EZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1158249'),
  ('506906482256793994', 'Project Gemini', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kirill Zotkin, Serik Beyseu', 'Natalya Lebedeva, Dmitry Zhigalov, Vyacheslav Lisnevsky', 'Egor Koreshkov, Alyona Konstantinova, Konstantin Samoukov, Pyotr Romanov, Nikita Dyuvbanov, Liza Martines, Viktor Potapeshkin, Dmitry Frid', null, 'After depleting Earth''s resources for centuries, humankind''s survival requires an exodus to outer space. An international expedition is quickly formed to find a suitable new planet, but when plans go awry, the crew is suddenly stranded without power on a strange planet, where something unimaginable lies in wait.', 'After depleting Earth''s resources for centuries, humankind''s survival requires an exodus to outer space. An international expedition is quickly formed to find a suitable new planet, but when plans go awry, the crew is suddenly stranded without power on a strange planet, where something unimaginable lies in wait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFljUdOozFEv6HDHIFpFvcYW0ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575322'),
  ('933788768366602196', 'Project Grizzly', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Tony Wannamaker, Peter Lynch', null, 'Troy Hurtubise, Peter Gzowski', null, 'Documentary about the lifelong project of Troy Hurtubise, a man who has been obsessed with researching the Canadian grizzly bear up close, ever since surviving an early encounter with such a bear. The film documents Hurtubise''s diligent work to improve his homemade "grizzly-proof" suit of armour, his efforts to test its resilience, and his forays into the Rockies to track down the grizzlies he dreams of meeting. The film manages to capture the humor of the project as well as its sincerity.', 'Documentary about the lifelong project of Troy Hurtubise, a man who has been obsessed with researching the Canadian grizzly bear up close, ever since surviving an early encounter with such a bear. The film documents Hurtubise''s diligent work to improve his homemade "grizzly-proof" suit of armour, his efforts to test its resilience, and his forays into the Rockies to track down the grizzlies he dreams of meeting. The film manages to capture the humor of the project as well as its sincerity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZTa0PbXstTOZAbbOeWUUdiwZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57953'),
  ('460514403535514240', 'Project Gutenberg', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Thomas Ma, Ricky Ko, Felix Chong Man-Keung', 'Felix Chong Man-Keung', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Aaron Kwok, Zhang Jingchu, Joyce Feng, Liu Kai-Chi, Catherine Chau, David Wang, Paulyn Sun', 'R', 'The Hong Kong police is hunting a counterfeiting gang led by a mastermind code-named "Painter" . The gang possesses exceptional counterfeiting skills which makes it difficult to distinguish the authenticity of its counterfeit currency. The scope of their criminal activities extends globally and greatly attracts the attention of the police. In order to crack the true identity of "Painter", the police recruits a painter named Lee Man to assist in solving the case.', 'The Hong Kong police is hunting a counterfeiting gang led by a mastermind code-named "Painter" . The gang possesses exceptional counterfeiting skills which makes it difficult to distinguish the authenticity of its counterfeit currency. The scope of their criminal activities extends globally and greatly attracts the attention of the police. In order to crack the true identity of "Painter", the police recruits a painter named Lee Man to assist in solving the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJv81P9fEsArYmEL1IGYNTYQLni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531384'),
  ('218500107463096542', 'Project Hail Mary', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Dan Channing-Williams, Greig Fraser, Phil Lord', 'Drew Goddard', 'Ryan Gosling, James Ortiz, Sandra Hüller, Lionel Boyce, Milana Vayntrub, Ken Leung, Priya Kansara, Mia Soteriou', 'PG-13', 'Science teacher Ryland Grace wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns, he begins to uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causing the sun to die out. He must call on his scientific knowledge and unorthodox ideas to save everything on Earth from extinction… but an unexpected friendship means he may not have to do it alone.', 'Science teacher Ryland Grace wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns, he begins to uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causing the sun to die out. He must call on his scientific knowledge and unorthodox ideas to save everything on Earth from extinction… but an unexpected friendship means he may not have to do it alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yihdXomYb5kTeSivtFndMy5iDmf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687163'),
  ('554482629179146568', 'Project Ithaca', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Nicholas Humphries', 'Anthony Artibello, Kevin C. Bjerkness', 'Deragh Campbell, James Gallanders, Daniel Fathers, Caroline Raynaud, Alex Woods', 'R', 'Five strangers awaken to find themselves trapped aboard an alien spaceship that seems to be harnessing their terror to power the ship. They begin to understand that these species have been abducting humans for decades and possibly centuries.', 'Five strangers awaken to find themselves trapped aboard an alien spaceship that seems to be harnessing their terror to power the ship. They begin to understand that these species have been abducting humans for decades and possibly centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1ku6nZmy3XEtPWA3HnrQ4zuJRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:600836'),
  ('73680003630548829', 'Project Legion', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Lance Kawas', 'Lance Kawas', 'Donald Cerrone, Brande Roderick, Kelly Lynn Reiter, Chris Maher', 'R', 'A former marine awakens to an apocalyptic sight outside of his window and barricades himself from evil creatures that surround his apartment door and terrorize the city.', 'A former marine awakens to an apocalyptic sight outside of his window and barricades himself from evil creatures that surround his apartment door and terrorize the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEfbuchWvISRpqwEUHoxwuxdF0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017335'),
  ('908181960158391375', 'Project Makeover', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Chang-rae, Kim Young-rho', 'Mil Choi, Hwang Jo-yoon, Hyeon-jin Kim', 'Ko So-young, Jo An, Yoo Gun, Lee Joong-moon, Lee Beom-soo, Oh Dal-su, Ok Ji-young, Oh Mi-hee', null, 'An unhappy woman goes back in time and poses as her cousin to prevent her younger self from making the same mistakes and ruining her future.', 'An unhappy woman goes back in time and poses as her cousin to prevent her younger self from making the same mistakes and ruining her future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fwV2QQByqvbdCzPqfV9Cu4fhHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109507'),
  ('150702976265083855', 'Project Moon Base', 1953, 'Science Fiction', 'Richard Talmadge, William C. Thompson, Leonard J. Shapiro', 'Jack Seaman, Robert A. Heinlein', 'Donna Martell, Hayden Rorke, Ross Ford, Larry Johns, Herb Jacobs, Barbara Morrison, Ernestine Barrier, James Craven', null, 'In the future (1970) the US sends a mission to the moon to investigate the building of a moon base.', 'In the future (1970) the US sends a mission to the moon to investigate the building of a moon base.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djG5ljYkjESdyeueMNfdu0VHsL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26270'),
  ('820306485054741625', 'Project Nim', 2011, 'Documentary', 'James Marsh, Michael Simmonds, Adine Duron', null, 'Bob Angelini, Bern Cohen, Reagan Leonard, Nim Chimpsky, Stephanie LaFarge, Herbert Terrace, Wer LaFarge, Jenny Lee', 'PG-13', 'From the team behind Man on Wire comes the story of Nim, the chimpanzee who in the 1970s became the focus of a landmark experiment which aimed to show that an ape could learn to communicate with language if raised and nurtured like a human child. Following Nim''s extraordinary journey through human society, and the enduring impact he makes on the people he meets along the way, the film is an unflinching and unsentimental biography of an animal we tried to make human. What we learn about his true nature - and indeed our own - is comic, revealing and profoundly unsettling.', 'From the team behind Man on Wire comes the story of Nim, the chimpanzee who in the 1970s became the focus of a landmark experiment which aimed to show that an ape could learn to communicate with language if raised and nurtured like a human child. Following Nim''s extraordinary journey through human society, and the enduring impact he makes on the people he meets along the way, the film is an unflinching and unsentimental biography of an animal we tried to make human. What we learn about his true nature - and indeed our own - is comic, revealing and profoundly unsettling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKvxfhFK4hSgY19ObJ30bQYtyli.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63579'),
  ('1144872759788895977', 'Project Power', 2020, 'Action, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Henry Joost, Ariel Schulman, Michael Simmonds', 'Mattson Tomlin', 'Jamie Foxx, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Dominique Fishback, Rodrigo Santoro, Courtney B. Vance, Amy Landecker, mgk, Tait Fletcher', 'R', 'An ex-soldier, a teen and a cop collide in New Orleans as they hunt for the source behind a dangerous new pill that grants users temporary superpowers.', 'An ex-soldier, a teen and a cop collide in New Orleans as they hunt for the source behind a dangerous new pill that grants users temporary superpowers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TnOeov4w0sTtV2gqICqIxVi74V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605116'),
  ('334820248148141033', 'Project Shadowchaser III', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'John Eyres, Mark Morris', 'Nick Davis', 'Musetta Vander, Sam Bottoms, Christopher Atkins, Frank Zagarino, Christopher Neame, Ricco Ross, Robina Alston, Aubrey Morris', 'R', 'It has been 25 years since the ore spaceship Siberia was last heard from. Unfortunately, it is now on a collision course with the communications station Comstat 5 which is orbiting Mars. After one successful maneuver to avoid the Siberia, it rams Comstat 5 and the crew soon finds that the Siberia crew is dead and the reason that it has been missing for 25 years. But that reason is trying to destroy them all as it destroyed the Siberia crew.', 'It has been 25 years since the ore spaceship Siberia was last heard from. Unfortunately, it is now on a collision course with the communications station Comstat 5 which is orbiting Mars. After one successful maneuver to avoid the Siberia, it rams Comstat 5 and the crew soon finds that the Siberia crew is dead and the reason that it has been missing for 25 years. But that reason is trying to destroy them all as it destroyed the Siberia crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJkexmkMBZpmA5UBfUuVAHT332C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29799'),
  ('46794818125753564', 'Project Silence', 2024, 'Thriller, Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Nam Gyeong-min, Hong Kyung-pyo, Kim Tae-gon', 'Park Joo-suk, Kim Tae-gon, Kim Yong-hwa', 'Lee Sun-kyun, Ju Ji-hoon, Kim Hie-won, Moon Sung-keun, Ye Su-jeong, Kim Tae-woo, Park Hee-von, Park Ju-hyun', null, 'Due to sudden deteriorating weather conditions, visibility on the Airport Bridge is severely impaired, leaving people stranded and at risk of the bridge collapsing due to a series of chain collisions and explosions. Amidst the chaos, the canine subjects "Echo" from the military experiment "Project Silence," who were being transported in secret, break free, and all human survivors become targets of relentless attacks.', 'Due to sudden deteriorating weather conditions, visibility on the Airport Bridge is severely impaired, leaving people stranded and at risk of the bridge collapsing due to a series of chain collisions and explosions. Amidst the chaos, the canine subjects "Echo" from the military experiment "Project Silence," who were being transported in secret, break free, and all human survivors become targets of relentless attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55jsexep1uh1ieMwyJMVapTETMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726139'),
  ('1020891701471338806', 'Project Wolf Hunting', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Yun Ju-hwan, Kim Hong-sun', 'Kim Hong-sun', 'Seo In-guk, Jang Dong-yoon, Park Ho-san, Jung So-min, Ko Chang-seok, Jang Young-nam, Son Jong-hak, Jung Moon-sung', null, 'While under heavily armed guard, the dangerous convicts aboard a cargo ship unite in a coordinated escape attempt that soon escalates into a bloody, all-out riot. But as the fugitives continue their brutal campaign of terror, they soon discover that not even the most vicious among them is safe from the horror they unknowingly unleashed from the darkness below deck.', 'While under heavily armed guard, the dangerous convicts aboard a cargo ship unite in a coordinated escape attempt that soon escalates into a bloody, all-out riot. But as the fugitives continue their brutal campaign of terror, they soon discover that not even the most vicious among them is safe from the horror they unknowingly unleashed from the darkness below deck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmeIsFSClo5UBWxBiiCDCnDOYJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799379'),
  ('381630582919565824', 'Project X', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Mystery', 'William Castle, Harold E. Stine', 'Edmund Morris', 'Christopher George, Greta Baldwin, Henry Jones, Monte Markham, Harold Gould, Phillip Pine, Lee Delano, Ivan Bonar', null, 'A spy is brought back from cryogenic suspension after being almost killed in a plane crash returning from a mission to learn about a deadly new weapon being developed in the East. But the vital memories are being suppressed, so the authorities use ultra-advanced technologies to try to uncover the secret.', 'A spy is brought back from cryogenic suspension after being almost killed in a plane crash returning from a mission to learn about a deadly new weapon being developed in the East. But the vital memories are being suppressed, so the authorities use ultra-advanced technologies to try to uncover the secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9beJl9aNrqKi8RFfhQ2MoWTKIJz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29398'),
  ('558106758325173030', 'Project X', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jonathan Kaplan, Albert M. Shapiro, Kenneth D. Collins', 'Lawrence Lasker, Stanley Weiser', 'Matthew Broderick, Helen Hunt, Willie, William Sadler, Johnny Ray McGhee, Jonathan Stark, Robin Gammell, Stephen Lang', 'PG', 'A young inductee into the military is given the task of looking after some chimpanzees used in the mysterious ''Project X''. Getting to know the chimps fairly well, he begins to suspect there is more to the secret project than he is being told.', 'A young inductee into the military is given the task of looking after some chimpanzees used in the mysterious ''Project X''. Getting to know the chimps fairly well, he begins to suspect there is more to the secret project than he is being told.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odUw1Th64wqGF8hQLyNJoKWbAXX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18410'),
  ('614226024518387636', 'Project X', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Ken Seng, Nima Nourizadeh, Kiel Gookin', 'Matt Drake, Michael Bacall', 'Thomas Mann, Oliver Cooper, Jonathan Daniel Brown, Dax Flame, Kirby Bliss Blanton, Brady Hender, Nick Nervies, Alexis Knapp', 'R', 'Three high school seniors throw a party to make a name for themselves. As the night progresses, things spiral out of control as word of the party spreads.', 'Three high school seniors throw a party to make a name for themselves. As the night progresses, things spiral out of control as word of the party spreads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUPDGT3lyRrq8SvWuNWG2DP64bR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57214'),
  ('783449043310560782', 'Project Y', 2026, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lee Hwan, Yoo Young-gi, Park Jin-wook', 'Lee Hwan, Kwak Jae-min, Oh Yu-kyung', 'Han So-hee, Jeon Jong-seo, Kim Shin-rock, Jeong Young-ju, Lee Jae-kyoon, YooA, Kim Sung-cheol, Park Bo-in', 'NR', 'Mi-sun and Do-kyung might be used to struggling in the most dangerous part of Seoul''s Gangnam district, but that doesn''t mean they''ve settled into it. With no one but each other to rely on, the two friends grind away to save the money needed to leave their dangerous lifestyles behind. But just as "retirement" comes within reach, the world betrays them, shattering their hopes. On the edge of a dead end, they discover a hidden fortune of dirty cash and gold in Gangnam – and place all their bets on one final high-stakes gamble of a lifetime.', 'Mi-sun and Do-kyung might be used to struggling in the most dangerous part of Seoul''s Gangnam district, but that doesn''t mean they''ve settled into it. With no one but each other to rely on, the two friends grind away to save the money needed to leave their dangerous lifestyles behind. But just as "retirement" comes within reach, the world betrays them, shattering their hopes. On the edge of a dead end, they discover a hidden fortune of dirty cash and gold in Gangnam – and place all their bets on one final high-stakes gamble of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KMG1inDAnKaGZ1W8Ac3wn6bdXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1401542'),
  ('1003363455389842470', 'Project-M', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Eric Piccoli, Eric Piccoli', 'Julien Deschamps Jolin, Mario J. Ramos, Eric Piccoli', 'Jean-Nicolas Verreault, Julie Perreault, Julien Deschamps Jolin, Nadia Essadiqi, Pierre Verville, Marie-Ginette Guay, Ted Pluviose, Roberto Mei', null, 'Four astronauts have to stay 1000 days in a space station around Earth in order to prove that a trip to Europa, one of Jupiter''s moon, is possible. The experience goes well until something happens on earth.', 'Four astronauts have to stay 1000 days in a space station around Earth in order to prove that a trip to Europa, one of Jupiter''s moon, is possible. The experience goes well until something happens on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIP03pRA0KEATkxNjn87JW3p8Vd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290365'),
  ('717194212351795759', 'Project: ALF', 1996, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry, Henry M. Lebo, C.C. Barnes', 'Tom Patchett, Paul Fusco', 'Paul Fusco, Miguel Ferrer, William O''Leary, Jensen Daggett, Martin Sheen, Ray Walston, Scott Michael Campbell, Beverly Archer', 'PG', 'Six years ago, the lovable intergalactic fugitive Gordon Shumway, best known as ALF, was on his way back to his new home when the Alien Task Force finally caught up with him. Now, he is being studied at a top-secret military base where he finds allies who feel that ALF''s existence should be announced to the world to ensure his safety... especially when they learn that the abrasive Colonel Milfoil wants ALF, and all Alien Life-Forms, destroyed.', 'Six years ago, the lovable intergalactic fugitive Gordon Shumway, best known as ALF, was on his way back to his new home when the Alien Task Force finally caught up with him. Now, he is being studied at a top-secret military base where he finds allies who feel that ALF''s existence should be announced to the world to ensure his safety... especially when they learn that the abrasive Colonel Milfoil wants ALF, and all Alien Life-Forms, destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cI69vlDUuSrkSM5sFvBPgxptdt5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10960'),
  ('55406079459157436', 'Project: Kill', 1976, 'Action, Drama', 'William Girdler, Frank E. Johnson', 'Galen Thompson', 'Leslie Nielsen, Gary Lockwood, Nancy Kwan, Vic Silayan, Vic Diaz, Galen Thompson, Carlos Salazar, Pamela Parsons', null, 'A former government assassin flees a mind-control program in the Philippines, pursued by his ex-partner, the local police and Asian gangsters.', 'A former government assassin flees a mind-control program in the Philippines, pursued by his ex-partner, the local police and Asian gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIaBtBlLbN6Dy0sjnFf7n6TutrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120773'),
  ('184115099124817350', 'Project: Metalbeast', 1995, 'Horror', 'Alessandro de Gaetano, Cynthia Webster, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Alessandro de Gaetano, Timothy E. Sabo, Roger Steinmann', 'Kim Delaney, Barry Bostwick, Kane Hodder, John Marzilli, Musetta Vander, Dean Scofield, Lance Slaughter, Carole Davis', 'R', 'With the medical breakthrough of a metal-based synthetic skin called "bio-ferron" the prospect for pioneering surgeries for burn victims and cancer patients seems set to occur but for the warped head scientist in charge...it''s a opportunist chance to reactivate a long forgotten classified project...that has been left frozen in a set of cryogenic chambers deep beneath the bowels of government laboratory. Convincing the other in the research team to start work on putting this living ''metal'' skin on corpses, he now has the perfect test patients waiting on ice for them to work on. But there was a reason three of these stiffs in particular where left to chill. Due to an experiment gone bad these three only look human on the outside and none of them are as dead as everyone believes they are.', 'With the medical breakthrough of a metal-based synthetic skin called "bio-ferron" the prospect for pioneering surgeries for burn victims and cancer patients seems set to occur but for the warped head scientist in charge...it''s a opportunist chance to reactivate a long forgotten classified project...that has been left frozen in a set of cryogenic chambers deep beneath the bowels of government laboratory. Convincing the other in the research team to start work on putting this living ''metal'' skin on corpses, he now has the perfect test patients waiting on ice for them to work on. But there was a reason three of these stiffs in particular where left to chill. Due to an experiment gone bad these three only look human on the outside and none of them are as dead as everyone believes they are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2Sy5Hb3xBIWjHLsPZaEqEv8MRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92698'),
  ('1108744306204440074', 'Project: Shadowchaser', 1992, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'John Eyres, Simon Lamont', 'Stephen Lister', 'Martin Kove, Meg Foster, Frank Zagarino, Joss Ackland, Paul Koslo, Ricco Ross, Raymond Evans, Robert Freeman', 'R', 'Set in the future, a group of terrorists with an android leader storm a hospital when the President''s daughter is inside, taking her hostage. To find a way of freeing her, the police decide to consult the architect who designed the building, but he''s currently in jail for some crime, and the punishment of the future is to be frozen solid for one''s sentence. The cops accidentally thaw out the wrong guy, a football player who decides to keep the mistake a secret and help the police in exchange for his freedom. Will he be able to defeat the terrorists and rescue the hostages, despite not knowing the first thing about architecture?', 'Set in the future, a group of terrorists with an android leader storm a hospital when the President''s daughter is inside, taking her hostage. To find a way of freeing her, the police decide to consult the architect who designed the building, but he''s currently in jail for some crime, and the punishment of the future is to be frozen solid for one''s sentence. The cops accidentally thaw out the wrong guy, a football player who decides to keep the mistake a secret and help the police in exchange for his freedom. Will he be able to defeat the terrorists and rescue the hostages, despite not knowing the first thing about architecture?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2vjNiWk4Zh7JyZWr1u5F72G9vv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92371'),
  ('742663712046619774', 'Projekt A - A Journey to Anarchist Projects in Europe', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Marcel Seehuber, Moritz Springer', 'Marcel Seehuber, Moritz Springer', 'Hanna Poddig', null, 'PROJEKT A is a documentary that resists the common clichés about anarchism to instead show anarchist ideas of a society in which no one shall have the power to control knowledge, natural resources, land, soil or other people. After inspiring over 25,000 German cinema-goers, this award-winning documentary about anarchism and anarchist projects in Europe is now available on VoD! “Projekt A stirs up the audience and is grippingly shot, getting close to the kinds of tenacious people who are so vital to change in our society.” (kinokino) “…a cinematic portrait, not of anarchy, but of anarchists. A story, not of possibilities, necessities or even failure, but a depiction of achievements, initiative, action, ideas, as well as success.” (kino-zeit.de) Audience Award Filmfest Munich', 'PROJEKT A is a documentary that resists the common clichés about anarchism to instead show anarchist ideas of a society in which no one shall have the power to control knowledge, natural resources, land, soil or other people. After inspiring over 25,000 German cinema-goers, this award-winning documentary about anarchism and anarchist projects in Europe is now available on VoD! “Projekt A stirs up the audience and is grippingly shot, getting close to the kinds of tenacious people who are so vital to change in our society.” (kinokino) “…a cinematic portrait, not of anarchy, but of anarchists. A story, not of possibilities, necessities or even failure, but a depiction of achievements, initiative, action, ideas, as well as success.” (kino-zeit.de) Audience Award Filmfest Munich', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61yoK2ZX6myrkJQIihRU0LDOLv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376084'),
  ('1071660538523787646', 'Projota - AMADMOL (A Milenar Arte de Meter o Louco)', 2017, null, null, null, 'Projota, Haikaiss, Rashid', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxMqkSrtX44Peo3wCvR3SJtdVOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836989'),
  ('817775647831880044', 'Prom', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joe Nussbaum, Byron Shah', 'Katie Wech', 'Aimee Teegarden, Thomas McDonell, Nolan Sotillo, Cameron Monaghan, Danielle Campbell, DeVaughn Nixon, Kylie Bunbury, Nicholas Braun', 'PG', 'At “Prom,” every couple has a story and no two are exactly alike. As the big dance approaches for Nova Prescott, it’s a battle of wills as she finds herself drawn to the guy who gets in the way of her perfect prom. Fellow seniors Mei and Tyler harbor secrets, while others face all the insecurity and anticipation that surrounds one of high school’s most seminal events.', 'At “Prom,” every couple has a story and no two are exactly alike. As the big dance approaches for Nova Prescott, it’s a battle of wills as she finds herself drawn to the guy who gets in the way of her perfect prom. Fellow seniors Mei and Tyler harbor secrets, while others face all the insecurity and anticipation that surrounds one of high school’s most seminal events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOYSCjYylOsEPkql3m9gcV1jycR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51588'),
  ('1017297043339913432', 'Prom Dates', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Bradford Lipson, Kim O. Nguyen', 'D.J. Mausner', 'Julia Lester, Antonia Gentry, Kenny Ridwan, JT Neal, Jordan Buhat, Zión Moreno, Terry Hu, Emery Kelly', 'R', 'Jess and Hannah, who made a pact at 13 to have the perfect senior prom. Despite the impending changes that college will bring over the next four years, the two are committed to honoring their prom pact. But with only 24 hours left before the big event, everything falls apart when they break up with each of their dates. Jess and Hannah are left with one night to find new dates and live out their middle-school fantasies.', 'Jess and Hannah, who made a pact at 13 to have the perfect senior prom. Despite the impending changes that college will bring over the next four years, the two are committed to honoring their prom pact. But with only 24 hours left before the big event, everything falls apart when they break up with each of their dates. Jess and Hannah are left with one night to find new dates and live out their middle-school fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojWiV81GldQSrBjY2izkayPSN05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1227780'),
  ('154327685674817119', 'Prom Night', 1980, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Paul Lynch, Robert C. New, Lee Knippelberg', 'William Gray', 'Leslie Nielsen, Jamie Lee Curtis, Casey Stevens, Anne-Marie Martin, Antoinette Bower, Michael Tough, Robert A. Silverman, Pita Oliver', 'R', 'At a high school senior prom, a masked killer stalks four teenagers who were responsible for the accidental death of a classmate six years prior.', 'At a high school senior prom, a masked killer stalks four teenagers who were responsible for the accidental death of a classmate six years prior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2Ew7wUP96PsePEZseK6JqcPWY9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36599'),
  ('709586746610416230', 'Prom Night', 2008, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'Nelson McCormick, Checco Varese, Lance Gilbert', 'William Gray, Robert Guza Jr.', 'Brittany Snow, Scott Porter, Jessica Stroup, Dana Davis, Collins Pennie, Kelly Blatz, Johnathon Schaech, Ming-Na Wen', 'PG-13', 'Donna''s senior prom is supposed to be the best night of her life, though a sadistic killer from her past has different plans for her and her friends.', 'Donna''s senior prom is supposed to be the best night of her life, though a sadistic killer from her past has different plans for her and her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKSeyN02R5khphImEIpAdBjQgEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8617'),
  ('806562334372926083', 'Prom Night III: The Last Kiss', 1990, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Frank Siracusa, Karen Lee Hall, Michael G. Burke', 'Ron Oliver', 'Tim Conlon, Cynthia Preston, David Stratton, Jeremy Ratchford, Dylan Neal, Courtney Taylor, Roger Dunn, Tom Nursall', 'R', 'Mary Lou, the prom queen burned to death by her boyfriend back in the fifties, has escaped from hell and is once again walking the hallways of Hamilton High School, looking for blood.', 'Mary Lou, the prom queen burned to death by her boyfriend back in the fifties, has escaped from hell and is once again walking the hallways of Hamilton High School, looking for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJOpzoUXeYhruTAc3PBbvKAeLpd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41828'),
  ('980534831905086102', 'Prom Night IV: Deliver Us from Evil', 1992, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Roman Buchok, Paul Bryan, Marcel Saumure', 'Richard Beattie', 'Nicole De Boer, J. H. Wyman, Joy Tanner, Alle Ghadban, Kenneth McGregor, Brock Simpson, James Carver, Krista Bulmer', 'R', 'Thirty years after slashing a Hamilton High couple on Prom Night 1957, psychotic priest Father Jonas gets loose from the chapel basement where the other church fathers had been secretly keeping him locked up and drugged.', 'Thirty years after slashing a Hamilton High couple on Prom Night 1957, psychotic priest Father Jonas gets loose from the chapel basement where the other church fathers had been secretly keeping him locked up and drugged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjq1iWClSBCfi3SjpVJblOU6q4F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41769'),
  ('104012854344436112', 'Prom Pact', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Anya Adams, Clark Mathis, Seth Rutledge', 'Anthony Lombardo', 'Peyton Elizabeth Lee, Milo Manheim, Blake Draper, Monique A. Green, Arica Himmel, Jason Sakaki, Chelah Horsdal, David S. Jung', 'PG-13', 'It''s prom season, and high school senior Mandy and her best friend and fellow outsider Ben are surrounded by over-the-top "promposals." Mandy is only focused on getting into her dream school Harvard, but as she starts tutoring basketball all-star Graham, she must re-evaluate whether her dream school is worth the cost of everything she believes in.', 'It''s prom season, and high school senior Mandy and her best friend and fellow outsider Ben are surrounded by over-the-top "promposals." Mandy is only focused on getting into her dream school Harvard, but as she starts tutoring basketball all-star Graham, she must re-evaluate whether her dream school is worth the cost of everything she believes in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVgRfuBvsFTU4mFvDt1Qlqo1CRo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:932430'),
  ('692092596703311751', 'Promare', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Michel Sugimoto, Masahiko Otsuka, Tatsumi Fujii', 'Kazuki Nakashima', 'Kenichi Matsuyama, Taichi Saotome, Ayane Sakura, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Tetsu Inada, Mayumi Shintani, Rikiya Koyama, Taiten Kusunoki', 'PG-13', 'Galo and the Burning Rescue Fire Department face off against BURNISH, a group of mutants who are able to control and wield flames, and the fire disaster they have unleashed on Earth.', 'Galo and the Burning Rescue Fire Department face off against BURNISH, a group of mutants who are able to control and wield flames, and the fire disaster they have unleashed on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCVRivpiVUJ4Wn6gHm8pLXppXla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553600'),
