  ('1125725584785919292', 'Promise at Dawn', 2017, 'Drama, Romance, History, War', 'Glynn Speeckaert, Eric Barbier, Giuseppe Barletta', 'Eric Barbier, Marie Eynard', 'Pierre Niney, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Didier Bourdon, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Finnegan Oldfield, Catherine McCormack, Pawel Puchalski, Némo Schiffman', null, 'From his childhood in Poland to his adolescence in Nice to his years as a student in Paris and his tough training as a pilot during World War II, this tragi-comedy tells the romantic story of Romain Gary, one of the most famous French novelists and sole writer to have won the Goncourt Prize for French literature two times.', 'From his childhood in Poland to his adolescence in Nice to his years as a student in Paris and his tough training as a pilot during World War II, this tragi-comedy tells the romantic story of Romain Gary, one of the most famous French novelists and sole writer to have won the Goncourt Prize for French literature two times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkRt22pxIow6dtDLyS2sJKJIL3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432616'),
  ('2064607214275005', 'Promise Me This', 2007, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Emir Kusturica, Milorad Glušica', 'Emir Kusturica', 'Marija Petronijević, Uroš Milovanović, Aleksandar Berček, Predrag Laković, Ljiljana Blagojević, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Ivan Maximov, Kosanka Đekić', null, 'An old man named Zivojin Markovic, living in a remote village prays for his grandson Cane to go to the city, sell his cow and bring back a wife. In the city he is supposed to meet up with his grandfather''s stepbrother, but this man is dead. Instead, he meets this man''s two grandsons, two good-natured brothers who are nevertheless small-time criminals and experts in demolition. Cane soon clicks with these men, and also falls in love with a schoolgirl (Jasna), who he wants to marry as part of his testament with his grandfather. He gets involved in this girl''s family affairs, rescuing both her and her mother from prostitution and gangsters headed by a man called Bajo, and the new group of people return to the small village in time to celebrate Zivojin''s wedding to his neighbor, despite the gangsters'' best efforts to stop the celebration, which results in a double wedding.', 'An old man named Zivojin Markovic, living in a remote village prays for his grandson Cane to go to the city, sell his cow and bring back a wife. In the city he is supposed to meet up with his grandfather''s stepbrother, but this man is dead. Instead, he meets this man''s two grandsons, two good-natured brothers who are nevertheless small-time criminals and experts in demolition. Cane soon clicks with these men, and also falls in love with a schoolgirl (Jasna), who he wants to marry as part of his testament with his grandfather. He gets involved in this girl''s family affairs, rescuing both her and her mother from prostitution and gangsters headed by a man called Bajo, and the new group of people return to the small village in time to celebrate Zivojin''s wedding to his neighbor, despite the gangsters'' best efforts to stop the celebration, which results in a double wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUKi2hgulPO8CbtAF4jgVhbTLqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8269'),
  ('903560979738460852', 'Promised Hearts', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anggy Umbara, Bounty Umbara, Nara Anindyaguna', 'Oka Aurora', 'Beby Tsabina, Deva Mahenra, Caitlin Halderman, Dito Darmawan, Imran Ismail, Kiki Narendra, Alya Rohali, Ayez Kassar', 'PG-13', 'A young woman''s future is jeopardized by a secret arrangement that throws her life into chaos — but it may be the only way to save her family.', 'A young woman''s future is jeopardized by a secret arrangement that throws her life into chaos — but it may be the only way to save her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shQW1KFEAEHCX9GytczYCDSXG6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1261555'),
  ('600618859401711430', 'Promised Heaven', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Leonid Kalashnikov, Semyon Litvinov', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Henrietta Altman', 'Olga Volkova, Liya Akhedzhakova, Valentin Gaft, Oleg Basilashvili, Leonid Bronevoy, Svetlana Nemolyaeva, Natalya Gundareva, Roman Kartsev', null, 'In the new Russia, former middle class citizens find themselves out in the dumps. Literally. They build homes, elect their own government, work, beg, scavenge, date and fight all while living in a huge city dump. Some try to beat the odds and return to society, but it seems that there is only one place left for them to go...', 'In the new Russia, former middle class citizens find themselves out in the dumps. Literally. They build homes, elect their own government, work, beg, scavenge, date and fight all while living in a huge city dump. Some try to beat the odds and return to society, but it seems that there is only one place left for them to go...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJtZVeeqCVRNx1pH0XSSyDMaOhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43684'),
  ('443962924944015113', 'Promised Land', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Hoffman, Alexander Gruszynski, Ueli Steiger', 'Michael Hoffman', 'Jason Gedrick, Tracy Pollan, Kiefer Sutherland, Meg Ryan, Googy Gress, Deborah Richter, Oscar Rowland, Sandra Seacat', 'R', 'Three recent high school grads - star athlete Hancock, his cheerleader girlfriend, Mary, and the awkward Senator - aim to leave their small town behind and realize big dreams, but their idealistic plans collide with life''s harsh realities.', 'Three recent high school grads - star athlete Hancock, his cheerleader girlfriend, Mary, and the awkward Senator - aim to leave their small town behind and realize big dreams, but their idealistic plans collide with life''s harsh realities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gP5lHwLdK73EDrKDbFp44wrNikO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62327'),
  ('766692119403469699', 'Promised Land', 2012, 'Drama', 'Gus Van Sant, Linus Sandgren, David Webb', 'Matt Damon, John Krasinski', 'Matt Damon, Frances McDormand, John Krasinski, Rosemarie DeWitt, Hal Holbrook, Titus Welliver, Lucas Black, Tim Guinee', 'R', 'A salesman for a natural gas company experiences life-changing events after arriving in a small town, where his corporation wants to tap into the available resources.', 'A salesman for a natural gas company experiences life-changing events after arriving in a small town, where his corporation wants to tap into the available resources.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5C0b6Wu4Z0V4NuA1cD8SZU7FCkb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133694'),
  ('1135350257758999752', 'Promised Sky', 2026, 'Drama', 'Erige Sehiri, Frida Marzouk', 'Erige Sehiri, Anna Ciennik, Malika Cécile Louati', 'Aïssa Maïga, Laëtitia Ky, Déborah Naney, Mohamed Grayaâ, Foued Zaazaa, Estelle Dogbo, Touré Blamassi, Sophie Tankou', null, 'Marie, Naney, and Jolie live together in Tunis, sheltering Kenza, a shipwreck survivor. As this unorthodox family forms, crises make each woman reconsider her place.', 'Marie, Naney, and Jolie live together in Tunis, sheltering Kenza, a shipwreck survivor. As this unorthodox family forms, crises make each woman reconsider her place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmdi05d5bUufTstIpKWTv4h8Ffg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1218412'),
  ('331613283048297742', 'Promises', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Carlos Bolado, B. Z. Goldberg, Justine Shapiro', 'B. Z. Goldberg, Justine Shapiro', 'Moishe Bar Am, B. Z. Goldberg, Sanabel Hassan', null, 'Documentarians Justine Shapiro and B.Z. Goldberg traveled to Israel to interview Palestinian and Israeli kids ages 11 to 13, assembling their views on living in a society afflicted with violence, separatism and religious and political extremism. This 2002 Oscar nominee for Best Feature Documentary culminates in an astonishing day in which two Israeli children meet Palestinian youngsters at a refugee camp.', 'Documentarians Justine Shapiro and B.Z. Goldberg traveled to Israel to interview Palestinian and Israeli kids ages 11 to 13, assembling their views on living in a society afflicted with violence, separatism and religious and political extremism. This 2002 Oscar nominee for Best Feature Documentary culminates in an astonishing day in which two Israeli children meet Palestinian youngsters at a refugee camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWjOPkUjgOpSaBJu1eAJiXmM16s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38880'),
  ('1016994317178635772', 'Promises', 2021, 'Drama', 'Amanda Sthers, Marco Graziaplena', 'Amanda Sthers', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Kelly Reilly, Jean Reno, Ginnie Watson, Cara Theobold, Deepak Verma, Kris Marshall, Gaia Scodellaro', null, 'When Alexander and Laura meet during a party what they feel for each other is obvious, but she’s about to get married and Alexander shares a daughter with his beautiful wife. Thanks in part to the support of his lifelong friends, Alexander''s childhood memories constantly resurface, leading him to reflect on what was, what will be, and what could have been.', 'When Alexander and Laura meet during a party what they feel for each other is obvious, but she’s about to get married and Alexander shares a daughter with his beautiful wife. Thanks in part to the support of his lifelong friends, Alexander''s childhood memories constantly resurface, leading him to reflect on what was, what will be, and what could have been.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Mm539VC9Zoj3Yin0whEACfGPk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821683'),
  ('116419751372793054', 'Promises', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ludovic Giraud, Alex Lamarque, Thomas Kruithof', 'Thomas Kruithof, Jean-Baptiste Delafon', 'Isabelle Huppert, Reda Kateb, Naidra Ayadi, Jean-Paul Bordes, Soufiane Guerrab, Laurent Poitrenaux, Hervé Pierre, Walid Afkir', null, 'Clémence, the fearless mayor of a town near Paris, is completing the final term of her political career. With her faithful right-hand man Yazid, she has long fought for this town plagued by inequality, unemployment and slumlords. However, when Clémence is approached to become Minister, her ambition arises, questioning her devotion and commitment to her citizens. Will her political integrity and election promises survive her newly found ambition?', 'Clémence, the fearless mayor of a town near Paris, is completing the final term of her political career. With her faithful right-hand man Yazid, she has long fought for this town plagued by inequality, unemployment and slumlords. However, when Clémence is approached to become Minister, her ambition arises, questioning her devotion and commitment to her citizens. Will her political integrity and election promises survive her newly found ambition?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kO9muUDMi40FpnrqRvkMqCwc5Ac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786918'),
  ('747109022260125752', 'Promises in the Dark', 1979, 'Drama', 'Jerome Hellman, Adam Holender', 'Loring Mandel', 'Marsha Mason, Ned Beatty, Susan Clark, Michael Brandon, Kathleen Beller, Donald Moffat, Bonnie Bartlett, James Noble', 'PG', 'A young doctor, Alexandra Kendall, seeking change while recovering from a recent heartbreak, moves from Chicago, Illinois to Hartford, Connecticut. She joins the West Hartford medical practice of Dr. Walter McInterny, a doctor approaching retirement age. 17-year-old Elizabeth "Buffy" Koenig is a precocious student at West Hartford''s William Hall High School. Her boyfriend Gerry is a football player at Hall High. While Dr. McInterny is away on vacation, longtime patient Buffy hurts her leg while harmlessly kicking a soccer ball during Gerry''s nearby football practice. At the hospital, Dr. Kendall finds that not only is the leg broken, but the bone was also weakened by cancer. Dr. Kendall treats Buffy and the two develop a bond that extends beyond the doctor-patient relationship; Dr. Kendall is drawn to Buffy''s humor and raw honesty.', 'A young doctor, Alexandra Kendall, seeking change while recovering from a recent heartbreak, moves from Chicago, Illinois to Hartford, Connecticut. She joins the West Hartford medical practice of Dr. Walter McInterny, a doctor approaching retirement age. 17-year-old Elizabeth "Buffy" Koenig is a precocious student at West Hartford''s William Hall High School. Her boyfriend Gerry is a football player at Hall High. While Dr. McInterny is away on vacation, longtime patient Buffy hurts her leg while harmlessly kicking a soccer ball during Gerry''s nearby football practice. At the hospital, Dr. Kendall finds that not only is the leg broken, but the bone was also weakened by cancer. Dr. Kendall treats Buffy and the two develop a bond that extends beyond the doctor-patient relationship; Dr. Kendall is drawn to Buffy''s humor and raw honesty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHR2jInroiouFt6MPOM98N07MBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118083'),
  ('80525851815695113', 'Promises! Promises!', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance', 'King Donovan, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Tommy Noonan, William Welch', 'Jayne Mansfield, Marie McDonald, Tommy Noonan, Mickey Hargitay, Fritz Feld, Eileen Barton, Claude Stroud, Eddie Quillan', 'NR', 'After a drunken spree on a cruise ship, two women discover that they''re pregnant, and set out to find who the fathers are.', 'After a drunken spree on a cruise ship, two women discover that they''re pregnant, and set out to find who the fathers are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRS0WZNcBT8Vclgyl1ybCK7KwmF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45230'),
  ('588419737699310396', 'Promising the Moon', 2011, 'Drama', 'Hans Steinbichler', 'Josephin von Thayenthal, Robert Thayenthal', 'Hannelore Elsner, Juliane Köhler, Karoline Herfurth, Niklas Kohrt, David Kross, Rüdiger Vogler, Matthias Brandt, Juta Vanaga', null, 'Throughout her life Marga has shown little feeling for her daughter Sofia. But now she reveals fear, wounds and a deep longing for her long-deceased husband Juris. She becomes increasingly lost in her forgetfulness and suddenly demands, like a child, gentleness. It’s an uncomfortable situation for Sofia who must now take care of her mother. Sofia’s growing realization that Marga’s past also affects her own gives Sofia impetus to make a sudden journey with her mother to Riga. This is where Marga grew up and where she married Juris. But the more Sofia learns about her mothers, the less clear it becomes who she herself is.', 'Throughout her life Marga has shown little feeling for her daughter Sofia. But now she reveals fear, wounds and a deep longing for her long-deceased husband Juris. She becomes increasingly lost in her forgetfulness and suddenly demands, like a child, gentleness. It’s an uncomfortable situation for Sofia who must now take care of her mother. Sofia’s growing realization that Marga’s past also affects her own gives Sofia impetus to make a sudden journey with her mother to Riga. This is where Marga grew up and where she married Juris. But the more Sofia learns about her mothers, the less clear it becomes who she herself is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0RIi87GLDWpTfsdd41NMizxevb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70839'),
  ('935993669946937336', 'Promising Young Woman', 2020, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Emerald Fennell, Benjamin Kračun, Michael T. Meador', 'Emerald Fennell', 'Carey Mulligan, Bo Burnham, Alison Brie, Clancy Brown, Jennifer Coolidge, Laverne Cox, Chris Lowell, Molly Shannon', 'R', 'A young woman, traumatized by a tragic event in her past, seeks out vengeance against those who crossed her path.', 'A young woman, traumatized by a tragic event in her past, seeks out vengeance against those who crossed her path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73QoFJFmUrJfDG2EynFjNc5gJxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582014'),
  ('815497358914415929', 'Promotion canapé', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Didier Kaminka, Claude Agostini', 'Didier Kaminka', 'Grace de Capitani, Thierry Lhermitte, Michel Sardou, Claude Rich, Patrick Chesnais, Margot Abascal, Zabou Breitman, Jean-Pierre Castaldi', null, 'Two women who want a raise, realize that they can easily get what they want, if they sleep with their boss.', 'Two women who want a raise, realize that they can easily get what they want, if they sleep with their boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SXenpduhQP4EcqOIldjXotU0Os.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79753'),
  ('1041233738823257498', 'Proof', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jocelyn Moorhouse, Martin McGrath, Tony Mahood', 'Jocelyn Moorhouse', 'Hugo Weaving, Russell Crowe, Geneviève Picot, Heather Mitchell, Jeffrey Walker, Daniel Pollock, Frankie J. Holden, Frank Gallacher', 'R', 'Martin, a young blind photographer, is divided between his friendship with restaurant worker Andy and the exclusive love that Celia—who is terribly jealous of this new friendship—has for him.', 'Martin, a young blind photographer, is divided between his friendship with restaurant worker Andy and the exclusive love that Celia—who is terribly jealous of this new friendship—has for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDWGe24TVQOHy0ZBQ8yek4P8fZn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14904'),
  ('3811334914903363', 'Proof', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Alwin H. Küchler, John Madden, Charmian Adams', 'David Auburn, Rebecca Miller', 'Gwyneth Paltrow, Anthony Hopkins, Jake Gyllenhaal, Hope Davis, Danny McCarthy, Tobiasz Daszkiewicz, Gary Houston, Leigh Zimmerman', 'PG-13', 'Catherine is a woman in her late twenties who is strongly devoted to her father, Robert, a brilliant and well-known mathematician whose grip on reality is beginning to slip away. As Robert descends into madness, Catherine begins to wonder if she may have inherited her father''s mental illness along with his mathematical genius.', 'Catherine is a woman in her late twenties who is strongly devoted to her father, Robert, a brilliant and well-known mathematician whose grip on reality is beginning to slip away. As Robert descends into madness, Catherine begins to wonder if she may have inherited her father''s mental illness along with his mathematical genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5z4JWhaPYMMXhYzwuK7SUgjmMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9777'),
  ('431713017810706111', 'Proof of Innocence', 2016, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Kwon Jong-kwan, Kim Jung-woo', 'Kwon Jong-kwan', 'Kim Myung-min, Kim Hyang-gi, Oh Min-suk, Sung Dong-il, Kim Sang-ho, Kim Young-ae, Park Hyuk-kwon, Lee Moon-sik', null, 'A disgraced ex-cop, seeking revenge on his treacherous ex-partner, sticks his nose into a high-profile murder case. But in the process, he finds himself in conflict with much more powerful and dangerous forces.', 'A disgraced ex-cop, seeking revenge on his treacherous ex-partner, sticks his nose into a high-profile murder case. But in the process, he finds himself in conflict with much more powerful and dangerous forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3y0Lu0mnpflxOcmqJFBSfqAAKq8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393985'),
  ('271869902192525509', 'Proof of Life', 2000, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Taylor Hackford, Sławomir Idziak, Michael Stevenson', 'Tony Gilroy', 'Meg Ryan, Russell Crowe, David Morse, Pamela Reed, David Caruso, Anthony Heald, Stanley Anderson, Gottfried John', 'R', 'When Peter Bowman, an American engineer working in a South American country, is captured by anti-government forces, the rebels learn his identity and demand $5 million for his safe return. However, his US employer is on the verge of insolvency and will not provide the ransom. Peter''s wife Alice is forced to deal with the matter on her own and she retains the services of freelance professional hostage negotiator Terry Thorne.', 'When Peter Bowman, an American engineer working in a South American country, is captured by anti-government forces, the rebels learn his identity and demand $5 million for his safe return. However, his US employer is on the verge of insolvency and will not provide the ransom. Peter''s wife Alice is forced to deal with the matter on her own and she retains the services of freelance professional hostage negotiator Terry Thorne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yw8x2i3vaHZZzpvqvF75E8q2N6M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11983'),
  ('570945446901097472', 'Proof of Love', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marcelo Antunez, Marcelo Brasil, Eduardo Kropf', 'Carolina Minardi, Angélica Lopes, Alessandra Gelman', 'Camila Queiroz, Klebber Toledo, Noemia Oliveira, Jonas Bloch, Leonardo Franco, Charles Paraventi, Kizi Vaz, Pedro Novaes', null, 'Alicia is a rich young woman who loves to party, travel and is very close to her grandfather. The protagonist runs away from responsibilities and tries to make the most of the benefits of being the heir to an immense estate. When her grandfather dies, she discovers that she has been excluded from the will and will only be able to get her hands on the family business and money when she is mature enough and married.', 'Alicia is a rich young woman who loves to party, travel and is very close to her grandfather. The protagonist runs away from responsibilities and tries to make the most of the benefits of being the heir to an immense estate. When her grandfather dies, she discovers that she has been excluded from the will and will only be able to get her hands on the family business and money when she is mature enough and married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oP54FuQr07FTCg203x1ZfVCb1P0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928745'),
  ('1148892104766012488', 'Proof of the Man', 1977, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Junya Satō, Shinsaku Himeda, Kaz Kuzui', 'Zenzō Matsuyama', 'Mariko Okada, George Kennedy, Yūsaku Matsuda, Hajime Hana, Broderick Crawford, Joe Yamanaka, Koichi Iwaki, Keiko Takeshita', 'NR', 'When an American is murdered in a Japanese inn, Tokyo police detective Munesue follows the trail of the killer to New York. There he is joined by a New York City detective named Shuftan and together they sort out the crime.', 'When an American is murdered in a Japanese inn, Tokyo police detective Munesue follows the trail of the killer to New York. There he is joined by a New York City detective named Shuftan and together they sort out the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuwOF9mwHLSpJjFH6klXdniMg49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287765'),
  ('1005895140378523046', 'Propaganda', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, History, Romance', 'Sinan Çetin, Mahir Akyol', 'Sinan Çetin, Gülin Tokat', 'Metin Akpınar, Kemal Sunal, Meltem Cumbul, Rafet El Roman, Ali Sunal, Meral Orhonsay, Nazmiye Oral, Nail Kirmizigül', null, 'Based on a true story set in 1948, customs officer Mehti is faced with the duty of formally setting up the border between Turkey and Syria, dividing his hometown. He is unaware of the pain that will eminently unfold, as families, languages, cultures and lovers are both ripped apart and clash head on in a village once united.', 'Based on a true story set in 1948, customs officer Mehti is faced with the duty of formally setting up the border between Turkey and Syria, dividing his hometown. He is unaware of the pain that will eminently unfold, as families, languages, cultures and lovers are both ripped apart and clash head on in a village once united.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMe9wka3jO0nJ0pvOIOy0sNKNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53934'),
  ('1068291000165846799', 'Propaganda: Engineering Consent', 2018, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Jimmy Leipold, Thomas Arbez, Denis Gaubert', null, 'Sébastien Desjours, Anne Bernays, Noam Chomsky, Stuart Ewen, Chris Hedges, David Miller, Shelley Spector, Larry Tye', null, 'How can the masses be controlled? Apparently, the American publicist Edward L. Bernays (1891-1995), a pioneer in the field of propaganda and public relations, knew the answer to such a key question. The amazing story of the master of manipulation and the creation of the engineering of consent; a frightening true story about advertising, lies and charlatans.', 'How can the masses be controlled? Apparently, the American publicist Edward L. Bernays (1891-1995), a pioneer in the field of propaganda and public relations, knew the answer to such a key question. The amazing story of the master of manipulation and the creation of the engineering of consent; a frightening true story about advertising, lies and charlatans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bR4FJrgLo0WilU1PSKlIKCtofe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531896'),
  ('791488785573293775', 'Proper Attire Required', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Philippe Lioret, Gérard Simon', 'Philippe Lioret, Sandra Joxe, Jean-Louis Leconte', 'Jacques Gamblin, Zabou Breitman, Elsa Zylberstein, Jean Yanne, Daniel Prévost, Christian Sinniger', null, 'His estranged wife is worth millions, but poor Paris resident Richard is homeless and jobless. He applied for unemployment benefits and now faces charges of fraud. To save himself from nine months in jail he must find his wife and force her to tell the courts the truth, that though she has married a politically-ambitious American governor and is filing U.S. tax returns, she is technically still married to Richard. But as she lives in America, how can he get to her? Opportunity knocks when Richard learns that she and her husband will be attending an international conference at an exclusive Paris hotel. To get in he will need a disguise.', 'His estranged wife is worth millions, but poor Paris resident Richard is homeless and jobless. He applied for unemployment benefits and now faces charges of fraud. To save himself from nine months in jail he must find his wife and force her to tell the courts the truth, that though she has married a politically-ambitious American governor and is filing U.S. tax returns, she is technically still married to Richard. But as she lives in America, how can he get to her? Opportunity knocks when Richard learns that she and her husband will be attending an international conference at an exclusive Paris hotel. To get in he will need a disguise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CrRCmUAAlUoJMJIJ9OXS8YEqGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111005'),
  ('109981593390151490', 'Property', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Daniel Bandeira, Pedro Sotero, Filipe Oliveira', 'Daniel Bandeira', 'Malu Galli, Zuleica Ferreira, Tavinho Teixeira, Samuel Santos, Ane Oliva, Edilson Silva, Ângelo Fàbio, Carlos Amorim', null, 'To protect herself from a revolt by the workers on her family''s farm, a reclusive designer locks herself in her armored car. The clock is ticking and the tension rises. Separated by an impenetrable layer of glass, two universes are about to collide.', 'To protect herself from a revolt by the workers on her family''s farm, a reclusive designer locks herself in her armored car. The clock is ticking and the tension rises. Separated by an impenetrable layer of glass, two universes are about to collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LXcEgxWGyBdsCKuMQqCsZIwGN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030571'),
  ('144876939515539777', 'Property Is No Longer a Theft', 1973, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Elio Petri, Rinaldo Ricci, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Ugo Pirro, Elio Petri', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Flavio Bucci, Daria Nicolodi, Mario Scaccia, Orazio Orlando, Julien Guiomar, Cecilia Polizzi, Jacques Herlin', null, 'A young bank teller, literally allergic to paper money, becomes the worst nightmare of his best customer, a wealthy butcher who manages his business unscrupulously.', 'A young bank teller, literally allergic to paper money, becomes the worst nightmare of his best customer, a wealthy butcher who manages his business unscrupulously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wf8G6AT2nV87sozQ5aE5NmfxCfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129564'),
  ('530507001139103189', 'Prophecies of Nostradamus', 1974, 'Drama, Action, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Toshio Masuda, Rokurô Nishigaki, Fumisake Okada', 'Toshio Yasumi', 'Tetsuro Tamba, Toshio Kurosawa, Kaoru Yumi, Yōko Tsukasa, So Yamamura, Katsuhiko Sasaki, Hiroshi Koizumi, Akihiko Hirata', null, 'Professor Nishiyama, after studying and interpreting the prophecies of Nostradamus, realizes that the end of the world is at hand. Unfortunately, nobody listens to him until it is too late. As the effects of mankind''s tampering of the earth - radioactive smog clouds, hideously mutated animals, destruction of the ozone layer - rage out of control, the world leaders hurtle blindly toward the final confrontation. The film sparked controversy in Japan and was subsequently pulled out of circulation, with no official video release of the uncut film.', 'Professor Nishiyama, after studying and interpreting the prophecies of Nostradamus, realizes that the end of the world is at hand. Unfortunately, nobody listens to him until it is too late. As the effects of mankind''s tampering of the earth - radioactive smog clouds, hideously mutated animals, destruction of the ozone layer - rage out of control, the world leaders hurtle blindly toward the final confrontation. The film sparked controversy in Japan and was subsequently pulled out of circulation, with no official video release of the uncut film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1zjbtstQ4PfCKDY9TzPDFjiXo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149608'),
  ('1129929696147669271', 'Prophecy', 1979, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'John Frankenheimer, Harry Stradling Jr., Robert P. Cohen', 'David Seltzer', 'Talia Shire, Robert Foxworth, Armand Assante, Richard Dysart, Victoria Racimo, George Clutesi, Tom McFadden, Burke Byrnes', 'PG', 'When a dispute occurs between a logging operation and a nearby Native American tribe, Dr. Robert Verne and his wife, Maggie, are sent in to mediate. Chief John Hawks insists the loggers are poisoning the water supply, and, though company man Isley denies it, the Vernes can''t ignore the strangely mutated wildlife roaming the woods. Robert captures a bear cub for testing and soon finds himself the target of an angry mutant grizzly.', 'When a dispute occurs between a logging operation and a nearby Native American tribe, Dr. Robert Verne and his wife, Maggie, are sent in to mediate. Chief John Hawks insists the loggers are poisoning the water supply, and, though company man Isley denies it, the Vernes can''t ignore the strangely mutated wildlife roaming the woods. Robert captures a bear cub for testing and soon finds himself the target of an angry mutant grizzly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jCyz5IRWmu8R5FhRO2BqtQXnCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31915'),
  ('670731297053770560', 'Prophecy', 2015, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Megumu Sawada, Daisuke Soma', 'Tamio Hayashi', 'Toma Ikuta, Erika Toda, Ryohei Suzuki, Gaku Hamada, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Masataka Kubota, Nana Komatsu, Fumiyo Kohinata', null, 'The cyber crime investigation division at the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department finds a video on website "YOURTUBE." In the video, a man covered by a newspaper, warns that a fire will be set at a food processing company. More crime notices are soon found involving violent crimes. Geitsu is the main guy behind the group "Shinbunshi," which has posted the videos. He used to work as a temporary employee at an IT company, but was unfairly dismissed. He then begins doing manual labor work and meets the other members of "Shinbushi."', 'The cyber crime investigation division at the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department finds a video on website "YOURTUBE." In the video, a man covered by a newspaper, warns that a fire will be set at a food processing company. More crime notices are soon found involving violent crimes. Geitsu is the main guy behind the group "Shinbunshi," which has posted the videos. He used to work as a temporary employee at an IT company, but was unfairly dismissed. He then begins doing manual labor work and meets the other members of "Shinbushi."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m10Qrs1W7MODvLe7c7ri3lV8u3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347483'),
  ('1019045977746622066', 'Prophet Without Honor', 1939, 'Drama, History', 'Felix E. Feist, John F. Seitz', 'Robert Lees, Frederic I. Rinaldo', 'Carey Wilson, Tom Neal', null, 'This short film portrays the story of Matthew Fontaine Maury (1806-1873), an American Naval officer who developed the first maps that charted the oceans'' winds and currents.', 'This short film portrays the story of Matthew Fontaine Maury (1806-1873), an American Naval officer who developed the first maps that charted the oceans'' winds and currents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8AVROKNa2J3gsu9t8bH8Ywvv3z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235659'),
