  ('352601825991434421', 'Prospect', 2018, 'Science Fiction', 'Zeek Earl, Christopher Caldwell, Zeek Earl', 'Christopher Caldwell, Zeek Earl', 'Sophie Thatcher, Pedro Pascal, Jay Duplass, Andre Royo, Sheila Vand, Anwan Glover, Luke Pitzrick, Arthur Deranleau', 'R', 'A teenage girl and her father travel to a remote alien moon, aiming to strike it rich. They''ve secured a contract to harvest a large deposit of the elusive gems hidden in the depths of the moon''s toxic forest. But there are others roving the wilderness and the job quickly devolves into a fight to survive.', 'A teenage girl and her father travel to a remote alien moon, aiming to strike it rich. They''ve secured a contract to harvest a large deposit of the elusive gems hidden in the depths of the moon''s toxic forest. But there are others roving the wilderness and the job quickly devolves into a fight to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HpAwszXLsD8GeypDzK0me7fPFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506072'),
