  ('394706327990172893', 'Prostitute', 1980, 'Drama', 'Tony Garnett, Charles Stewart', 'Tony Garnett', 'Kate Crutchley, Eleanor Forsythe, Kim Lockett, Nancy Samuels, Richard Mangan, Phyllis Hickson, Gillian Hawser, Joseph Senior', null, 'The tale of two women: Sandra, an ambitious but naive Birmingham working girl who moves to London with the hope of securing wealthier patrons, and Louise, her social worker friend, who is fighting to change the antiquated and hypocritical prostitution laws. As both strive to achieve their goals, a cold dose of reality dashes their hopes, and the built-in biases against women in society are unmasked.', 'The tale of two women: Sandra, an ambitious but naive Birmingham working girl who moves to London with the hope of securing wealthier patrons, and Louise, her social worker friend, who is fighting to change the antiquated and hypocritical prostitution laws. As both strive to achieve their goals, a cold dose of reality dashes their hopes, and the built-in biases against women in society are unmasked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1VHbjf3emgyQLQlZAZ0eLJovyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220135'),
  ('48070520024213386', 'Prostitution', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Sang-woo', null, 'Ahn So-hee, Baek Se-ri, Tae-Hyeon Min, Soo-ho Kang, Kim Beom-jik', null, 'Soo-hyeon and Hye-ji are sitting on a pile of debt thanks to their husband and father who ran away in the middle of the night. Tae-san the loan shark demands the money no matter what. He rapes the mother and daughter and requires them to join prostitution. They survive day by day selling themselves until one day, Tae-san suggests a way they can clean slate over one night and that is for the mother and daughter to have the most extreme sex with one man.', 'Soo-hyeon and Hye-ji are sitting on a pile of debt thanks to their husband and father who ran away in the middle of the night. Tae-san the loan shark demands the money no matter what. He rapes the mother and daughter and requires them to join prostitution. They survive day by day selling themselves until one day, Tae-san suggests a way they can clean slate over one night and that is for the mother and daughter to have the most extreme sex with one man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fYEZfHcIEcKRn9rG2quV2l6IOk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428605'),
  ('396722741206717699', 'Prostokvashino', 2026, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Animation', 'Sarik Andreasyan, Kirill Zotkin, Olga Selezneva, Aleksandra Yakovchuk, Svetlana Ershova', 'Aleksey Korda, Aleksandr Vyalykh, Ivan Novikov', 'Roman Pankov, Liza Moryak, Pavel Priluchnyy, Ivan Okhlobystin, Tatyana Orlova', 'TV-PG', 'Once upon a time, there lived a boy nicknamed Uncle Fyodor. He loved animals, but his parents wouldn''t hear of any furry, tailed creatures moving into their apartment. So Uncle Fyodor and his new friends-his cat, Matroskin, and his faithful dog, Sharik-were forced to set off for the village of Prostokvashino.', 'Once upon a time, there lived a boy nicknamed Uncle Fyodor. He loved animals, but his parents wouldn''t hear of any furry, tailed creatures moving into their apartment. So Uncle Fyodor and his new friends-his cat, Matroskin, and his faithful dog, Sharik-were forced to set off for the village of Prostokvashino.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlQ7fy8jlGM7iJtA5r1ZcNGGTFoz.jpg', 'plex:movie:fredonia-the-movie'),
