  ('1150833141648612403', 'Provocation', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato', null, 'Fabrizia Flanders, Erika Savastani, Gianni Demartiis, Lindo Damiani, Antonio Ascani', null, 'Passions run wildly amok at Carlo''s country inn as his wife, Amelia, fantasizes about an affair with a guest, while his grandson Gianni spies on him to learn the secrets of love. And when Carlo''s sexy cousin Marilinda comes to stay, everybody sits up and takes notice.', 'Passions run wildly amok at Carlo''s country inn as his wife, Amelia, fantasizes about an affair with a guest, while his grandson Gianni spies on him to learn the secrets of love. And when Carlo''s sexy cousin Marilinda comes to stay, everybody sits up and takes notice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyBaiQ6bDsG1y3GgIOTIxpYOcK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228794'),
  ('83508145320202242', 'Prowl', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Patrik Syversen, Håvard Andrè Byrkjeland, Mariana Stansheva', 'Tim Tori', 'Ruta Gedmintas, Joshua Bowman, Perdita Weeks, Jamie Blackley, Courtney Hope, Saxon Trainor, Bruce Payne, Atanas Srebrev', 'R', 'Amber dreams of escaping her small town existence and persuades her friends to accompany her to find an apartment in the big city. When their transportation breaks down, she and her friends gratefully accept a ride in the back of a semi. But when the driver refuses to stop and they discover the cargo is hundreds of cartons of blood, they panic. Their panic turns to terror when the truck disgorges them into a dark, abandoned warehouse where blood-thirsty creatures learn to hunt human prey, which, the friends realize, is what they now are... Written by Svetlio Svilenov', 'Amber dreams of escaping her small town existence and persuades her friends to accompany her to find an apartment in the big city. When their transportation breaks down, she and her friends gratefully accept a ride in the back of a semi. But when the driver refuses to stop and they discover the cargo is hundreds of cartons of blood, they panic. Their panic turns to terror when the truck disgorges them into a dark, abandoned warehouse where blood-thirsty creatures learn to hunt human prey, which, the friends realize, is what they now are... Written by Svetlio Svilenov', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9odMCaQynGfpvclF4PU4sLuzGgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60575'),
  ('1129657296603395281', 'Proxima', 2019, 'Drama', 'Alice Winocour, Georges Lechaptois, Nicolas Guilleminot', 'Jean-Stéphane Bron', 'Eva Green, Matt Dillon, Zélie Boulant-Lemesle, Lars Eidinger, Sandra Hüller, Alexey Fateev, Trond-Erik Vassal, Nancy Tate', null, 'Sarah is a French astronaut training at the European Space Agency in Cologne. She is the only woman in the arduous program. She lives alone with Stella, her seven year old daughter. Sarah feels guilty that she cannot spend more time with her child. Her love is overpowering, unsettling. When Sarah is chosen to join the crew of a year-long space mission called Proxima, it creates chaos in the mother-daughter relationship.', 'Sarah is a French astronaut training at the European Space Agency in Cologne. She is the only woman in the arduous program. She lives alone with Stella, her seven year old daughter. Sarah feels guilty that she cannot spend more time with her child. Her love is overpowering, unsettling. When Sarah is chosen to join the crew of a year-long space mission called Proxima, it creates chaos in the mother-daughter relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RiZB4x1alTwsJHTAVk5zC2p6TS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478860'),
  ('194963576287566606', 'Proximity', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Eric Demeusy', 'Eric Demeusy', 'Ryan Masson, Highdee Kuan, Christian Prentice, Shaw Jones, Nomi Abadi, Don Scribner, Ben Sullivan, Ian Coleman', null, 'A young NASA JPL scientist is abducted by extraterrestrials but when no one believes his story he becomes obsessed with finding proof which leads him on a journey of discovery.', 'A young NASA JPL scientist is abducted by extraterrestrials but when no one believes his story he becomes obsessed with finding proof which leads him on a journey of discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nto7dx8vmqESDU484huGoSt4o48.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693158'),
  ('431491140796832644', 'Proxy', 2014, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Zack Parker, Jim Timperman', 'Zack Parker, Kevin Donner', 'Alexia Rasmussen, Kristina Klebe, Alexa Havins, Joe Swanberg, Brittany Wagner, Faust Checho, Erika Hoveland, Kitsie Duncan', 'NR', 'While walking home from her latest OB appointment, a very pregnant Esther Woodhouse is brutally attacked and disfigured by a hooded assailant. This horrible event seems to be a blessing in disguise when Esther finds consolation in a support group. Her life of sadness and solitude is opened up to friendship, understanding, and even acceptance. However, friendship and understanding can be very dangerous things when accepted by the wrong people.', 'While walking home from her latest OB appointment, a very pregnant Esther Woodhouse is brutally attacked and disfigured by a hooded assailant. This horrible event seems to be a blessing in disguise when Esther finds consolation in a support group. Her life of sadness and solitude is opened up to friendship, understanding, and even acceptance. However, friendship and understanding can be very dangerous things when accepted by the wrong people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeVynprx6gjG9O2PItcb09FIZ7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211065'),
  ('845864848107983168', 'Prozac Nation', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erik Skjoldbjærg, Erling Thurmann-Andersen', 'Frank Deasy, Larry Gross', 'Christina Ricci, Jason Biggs, Anne Heche, Michelle Williams, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Jessica Lange, Lou Reed, Jesse Moss', 'R', 'When talented young writer Elizabeth Wurtzel earns a scholarship to Harvard, she sees it as her chance to escape the pressures of her working-class background and concentrate on her true talent. But what starts out so promising leads to self-destructive behavior and paralyzing depression that reflects an entire generation''s struggle to navigate the effects of divorce, drugs, sex, and high expectations.', 'When talented young writer Elizabeth Wurtzel earns a scholarship to Harvard, she sees it as her chance to escape the pressures of her working-class background and concentrate on her true talent. But what starts out so promising leads to self-destructive behavior and paralyzing depression that reflects an entire generation''s struggle to navigate the effects of divorce, drugs, sex, and high expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QB1h6mxlmQVM8BtYMybTwL2foc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16229'),
  ('315180350189185809', 'Prudence and the Pill', 1968, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Fielder Cook, Ronald Neame, Ted Moore', 'Hugh Mills', 'Deborah Kerr, David Niven, Robert Coote, Irina Demick, Joyce Redman, Judy Geeson, Keith Michell, Edith Evans', null, 'Prudence Hardcastle is on the pill. So is her sister-in-law, but someone has been swapping aspirin for their pills. Is it the teenage niece, the maid, the chauffeur, a lover, Prudence''s husband Gerald, or all of the above?', 'Prudence Hardcastle is on the pill. So is her sister-in-law, but someone has been swapping aspirin for their pills. Is it the teenage niece, the maid, the chauffeur, a lover, Prudence''s husband Gerald, or all of the above?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQB0uVOyXS2IIpbP2uTx13TDYEH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85847'),
  ('593867368511959365', 'Psalm 21', 2009, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Andrés Rignell, Fredrik Hiller, Jerker Berglin', 'Fredrik Hiller', 'Jonas Malmsjö, Niklas Falk, Björn Bengtsson, Görel Crona, Josefin Ljungman, Per Ragnar, Gunvor Pontén, Julia Dufvenius', null, 'Henrik is a young father who lives in Stockholm, constantly plagued by nightmares with his deceased mother. One day, he receives the news that his father, father, who lives in a remote village, it is drowned and died. The circumstances of drowning are mysterious. Henrik travels to the village to investigate the cause of his death. To find out more about the drowning and on his father, the door to the unknown and open. Shadows of the past emerge, returning to this world for one reason only: revenge.', 'Henrik is a young father who lives in Stockholm, constantly plagued by nightmares with his deceased mother. One day, he receives the news that his father, father, who lives in a remote village, it is drowned and died. The circumstances of drowning are mysterious. Henrik travels to the village to investigate the cause of his death. To find out more about the drowning and on his father, the door to the unknown and open. Shadows of the past emerge, returning to this world for one reason only: revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EdeBWIPqu2mDCNU28KHoAluswN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56685'),
  ('619716799616855781', 'Psalms of Planets Eureka Seven: Good Night, Sleep Tight, Young Lovers', 2009, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Romance, Adventure, Drama', 'Hiroshi Haraguchi, Tomoki Kyoda, Yohei Sasaki', 'Gichi Ootsuka', 'Yuko Sanpei, Kaori Nazuka, Keiji Fujiwara', null, 'Renton, son of scientists, and Eureka, a girl who can''t live under the sun, are raised together when very young and become very attached to each other. One day, Eureka is taken away. Powerless at the time, Renton vows to rescue her. He enters the military and is soon is assigned to the Independent Youths Unit 303 of the First Mobile Forces thanks to his exceptional performance alongside his Nirvash, a bio-mechanical armor/control system. Unknown to Renton, lies a plot to extinguish the alien invasion that is currently happening involving not only him, but Eureka too.', 'Renton, son of scientists, and Eureka, a girl who can''t live under the sun, are raised together when very young and become very attached to each other. One day, Eureka is taken away. Powerless at the time, Renton vows to rescue her. He enters the military and is soon is assigned to the Independent Youths Unit 303 of the First Mobile Forces thanks to his exceptional performance alongside his Nirvash, a bio-mechanical armor/control system. Unknown to Renton, lies a plot to extinguish the alien invasion that is currently happening involving not only him, but Eureka too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnAu9xcZEF2yTdfpzQBkkBmbyVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55958'),
  ('128268933216945123', 'Pseudo', 2020, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Luis Reneo, Gory Patiño', null, 'Cristian Mercado, Milton Cortez, Luigi Antezana, Carla Arana', 'R', 'A taxi driver from La Paz, out of work and desperate for money, assumes the identity of a passenger — a photographer — and takes his next assignment, not knowing he is actually a hit-man whose next target is a top-ranked government official. He gets caught up in a terrorist operation where nobody is what they claim, including the source financing the assassination plot.', 'A taxi driver from La Paz, out of work and desperate for money, assumes the identity of a passenger — a photographer — and takes his next assignment, not knowing he is actually a hit-man whose next target is a top-ranked government official. He gets caught up in a terrorist operation where nobody is what they claim, including the source financing the assassination plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p18CnWavWUvK8MXVQ5hXnVtB7oP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718080'),
  ('781789548338360431', 'Psy', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Philippe de Broca', 'Gérard Lauzier', 'Patrick Dewaere, Anny Duperey, Michel Creton, Charlotte Maury-Sentier, Michel Muller, Max Vialle, Catherine Frot, Jean-Pierre Darroussin', null, 'Marc runs a psychotherapy course at a large country house belonging to his wife Colette. His clients are depressed and his job is to cure them of their neuroses.', 'Marc runs a psychotherapy course at a large country house belonging to his wife Colette. His clients are depressed and his job is to cure them of their neuroses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvwsWTP21ZoICbuY9J2HW9Dfhcb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84393'),
  ('355236954125135870', 'Psy', 1992, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Paweł Edelman, Władysław Pasikowski, Wojciech Lepianka', 'Władysław Pasikowski', 'Bogusław Linda, Marek Kondrat, Cezary Pazura, Janusz Gajos, Agnieszka Jaskółka, Olaf Lubaszenko, Marek Frąckowiak, Tadeusz Szymków', null, 'In good old days Franz Maurer and his partners from secret police used to live like kings. Now, they all must adapt to new post-communist environment where they are scorned and losing all the privileges. Some, like Franz, are like ordinary police fighting against drug dealers. But Franz would soon find that some of his friends are on the other side.', 'In good old days Franz Maurer and his partners from secret police used to live like kings. Now, they all must adapt to new post-communist environment where they are scorned and losing all the privileges. Some, like Franz, are like ordinary police fighting against drug dealers. But Franz would soon find that some of his friends are on the other side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyMnhtGLlsCs6qFPAc6wh130epN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18575'),
  ('949072735314516593', 'Psy 2. Ostatnia krew', 1994, 'Action, Crime', 'Paweł Edelman, Władysław Pasikowski', 'Władysław Pasikowski', 'Bogusław Linda, Cezary Pazura, Artur Żmijewski, Magdalena Dandourian, Aleksander Bednarz, Edward Linde-Lubaszenko, Jan Machulski, Valeriy Priyomykhov', null, 'Franz Maurer, a compromised cop, former officer of the criminal department of the Warsaw''s police, is released from prison where he was doing time for his brutality and murders. He is awaited by Nowy, a former police colleague. Franz tries to go straight starting hard work in a steel mill. Nevertheless, he must leave the factory as a criminal with an uncertain past when he doesn''t join the strike organized by the workers'' union. At the same time, a merciless war continues in former Yugoslavia. Wolf and William, two high rank officers, come to Poland in order to organize a network selling and smuggling arms to Yugoslavia by way of Albania.', 'Franz Maurer, a compromised cop, former officer of the criminal department of the Warsaw''s police, is released from prison where he was doing time for his brutality and murders. He is awaited by Nowy, a former police colleague. Franz tries to go straight starting hard work in a steel mill. Nevertheless, he must leave the factory as a criminal with an uncertain past when he doesn''t join the strike organized by the workers'' union. At the same time, a merciless war continues in former Yugoslavia. Wolf and William, two high rank officers, come to Poland in order to organize a network selling and smuggling arms to Yugoslavia by way of Albania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezphEFk3mcuvHd8vgvifLQh7OKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24769'),
  ('743503875090587069', 'Psych 2: Lassie Come Home', 2020, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Steve Franks, Scott Williams', 'Steve Franks, Andy Berman, James Roday Rodriguez', 'James Roday Rodriguez, Dulé Hill, Timothy Omundson, Maggie Lawson, Corbin Bernsen, Kurt Fuller, Kirsten Nelson, Jazmyn Simon', 'PG', 'After Santa Barbara Police Chief Carlton Lassiter is ambushed and left for dead, Shawn and Gus return to help him and find themselves embroiled in a case involving the personal, the professional – and even the supernatural.', 'After Santa Barbara Police Chief Carlton Lassiter is ambushed and left for dead, Shawn and Gus return to help him and find themselves embroiled in a case involving the personal, the professional – and even the supernatural.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LXQUhkzo27jKotK7poHkNaw59B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582218'),
  ('127012198481440271', 'Psych 3: This Is Gus', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Steve Franks, Scott Williams, Ksenia Markova', 'James Roday Rodriguez, Steve Franks', 'James Roday Rodriguez, Dulé Hill, Timothy Omundson, Maggie Lawson, Kirsten Nelson, Jazmyn Simon, Corbin Bernsen, Allen Maldonado', 'PG', 'In preparation for a shotgun wedding before the birth of Baby Guster, Shawn and Gus go rogue in an attempt to track down Selene’s estranged husband, as Lassiter grapples with the future of his career.', 'In preparation for a shotgun wedding before the birth of Baby Guster, Shawn and Gus go rogue in an attempt to track down Selene’s estranged husband, as Lassiter grapples with the future of his career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tJRcfdQKmq8krlxeJcQB33lvKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829400'),
  ('247160380190547320', 'Psych Siddhartha', 2026, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Varun Reddy, Smaran Sai', 'Nandu Vijay Krishna, Varun Reddy', 'Yamini Bhaskar, Ganesh Kommara, Kasarla Shyam, Niklesh Sunkoj, Manoj Kumar Juloori', null, 'Siddharth''s life is a string of misfortunes, losing love, money, and dignity, making him the unwitting star of a slum-based comedy of errors. Hope only reappears in the form of Shravya, a no-nonsense single mother. However, just as Siddharth begins to rebuild his life and pursue a chance at love, his past resurfaces to threaten everything.', 'Siddharth''s life is a string of misfortunes, losing love, money, and dignity, making him the unwitting star of a slum-based comedy of errors. Hope only reappears in the form of Shravya, a no-nonsense single mother. However, just as Siddharth begins to rebuild his life and pursue a chance at love, his past resurfaces to threaten everything.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F9UZrHOeryYvgVaEfUMY3hk1OWg0.jpg', 'plex:movie:psych-siddhartha'),
  ('1005948525562778189', 'Psych-Out', 1968, 'Drama, Thriller, Music', 'Richard Rush, László Kovács, Elliot Schick', 'Betty Ulius, E. Hunter Willett', 'Susan Strasberg, Dean Stockwell, Jack Nicholson, Bruce Dern, Adam Roarke, Max Julien, Henry Jaglom, Linda Gaye Scott', 'R', 'Jenny, a deaf runaway who has just arrived in San Francisco''s Haight-Ashbury district to find her long-lost brother, a mysterious bearded sculptor known around town as The Seeker. She falls in with a psychedelic band, Mumblin'' Jim, whose members include Stoney, Ben, and Elwood. They hide her from the fuzz in their crash pad, a Victorian house crowded with love beads and necking couples. Mumblin'' Jim''s truth-seeking friend Dave considers the band''s pursuit of success "playing games," but he agrees to help Jennie anyway.', 'Jenny, a deaf runaway who has just arrived in San Francisco''s Haight-Ashbury district to find her long-lost brother, a mysterious bearded sculptor known around town as The Seeker. She falls in with a psychedelic band, Mumblin'' Jim, whose members include Stoney, Ben, and Elwood. They hide her from the fuzz in their crash pad, a Victorian house crowded with love beads and necking couples. Mumblin'' Jim''s truth-seeking friend Dave considers the band''s pursuit of success "playing games," but he agrees to help Jennie anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gl0waHdQJkcP7TxjPl4V8jeduI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63100'),
  ('311407626924146268', 'Psych: The Movie', 2017, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Steve Franks, Scott Williams', 'James Roday Rodriguez, Steve Franks', 'James Roday Rodriguez, Dulé Hill, Maggie Lawson, Corbin Bernsen, Kirsten Nelson, Zachary Levi, Robert LaSardo, Jazmyn Simon', 'PG', 'The ambitious friends come together during the holidays after a mystery assailant targets one of their own. A comedic thrill-ride follows, as the wild and unpredictable Psych team pursues the bad guys, justice … and, of course, food!', 'The ambitious friends come together during the holidays after a mystery assailant targets one of their own. A comedic thrill-ride follows, as the wild and unpredictable Psych team pursues the bad guys, justice … and, of course, food!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82Z6LEnkewH40pv6fa2Ci1CkSnd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457840'),
  ('921176818389795946', 'Psych:9', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Andrew Shortell, Shane Daly', 'Lawrence Robinson', 'Sara Foster, Cary Elwes, Michael Biehn, Gabriel Mann, Colleen Camp, Winter Ave Zoli, Susie Amy, Joel Kirby', 'R', 'A young woman with a troubled past takes a job at recently closed down hospital. Working the night shift alone she begins to experience a series of unsettling events that lead her to believe that the hospital may be connected to a number of recent murders in the area. To uncover the truth she will have to revisit the past behind the walls of Psych:9.', 'A young woman with a troubled past takes a job at recently closed down hospital. Working the night shift alone she begins to experience a series of unsettling events that lead her to believe that the hospital may be connected to a number of recent murders in the area. To uncover the truth she will have to revisit the past behind the walls of Psych:9.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGxy7Jd7VCSwpjMXJ7ZwWJuFGnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55045'),
  ('201705980047528105', 'Psyche 59', 1964, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Alexander Singer, Walter Lassally', 'Julian Zimet', 'Curd Jürgens, Patricia Neal, Samantha Eggar, Ian Bannen, Beatrix Lehmann, Elspeth March, Sandra Leo', null, 'An industrialist''s wife tries to remember the shocking sight that made her blind.', 'An industrialist''s wife tries to remember the shocking sight that made her blind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkmhr4mYCarZmlKJTUpN5hANssm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176813'),
  ('1057012405149691784', 'Psyched by the 4D Witch (A Tale of Demonology)', 1973, 'Horror', 'Victor Luminera, Milton Lawrence', 'Victor Luminera', 'Margo, Esoterica, Tom Yerian, Kelly Guthrie, Tracy Handfuss, Keith Erickson, Annette Michael', 'R', 'Novice witch Cindy is transported into a world of safe sex by the voice of Abigail from the 17th century.', 'Novice witch Cindy is transported into a world of safe sex by the voice of Abigail from the 17th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xP8zPnEpC9OjGwaKCqFd0T86qSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124135'),
  ('138630547174993004', 'Psychic Killer', 1975, 'Horror', 'Ray Danton, Herb Pearl', 'Ray Danton, Mikel Angel, Greydon Clark', 'Jim Hutton, Paul Burke, Julie Adams, Nehemiah Persoff, Neville Brand, Della Reese, Aldo Ray, Stack Pierce', 'PG', 'Mental patient Arnold Masters, hospitalized for a murder he didn''t commit, learns astral projection--the art of leaving one''s physical body and transporting the soul someplace else--from a fellow inmate. Upon his release, Arnold uses his new powers to bump off the people he holds responsible for his arrest, his mother''s death while he was imprisoned and the price of meat! Lt. Morgan and Lt. Anderson are the cops on his trail, while his caring shrink, Dr. Scott, tries to prevent any more deaths.', 'Mental patient Arnold Masters, hospitalized for a murder he didn''t commit, learns astral projection--the art of leaving one''s physical body and transporting the soul someplace else--from a fellow inmate. Upon his release, Arnold uses his new powers to bump off the people he holds responsible for his arrest, his mother''s death while he was imprisoned and the price of meat! Lt. Morgan and Lt. Anderson are the cops on his trail, while his caring shrink, Dr. Scott, tries to prevent any more deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOkdu9Dxlu85SIcJa6Y66MXl24y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68982'),
  ('777941626955617856', 'Psychic Kusuo', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Yuichi Fukuda', null, 'Kento Yamazaki, Kanna Hashimoto, Hirofumi Arai, Hideyuki Kasahara, Ryo Yoshizawa, Kento Kaku, Tsuyoshi Muro, Jiro Sato', null, 'Born a powerful psychic, high schooler Kusuo Saiki craves the simple life. But the weirdos in his class make it difficult to conceal his abilities.', 'Born a powerful psychic, high schooler Kusuo Saiki craves the simple life. But the weirdos in his class make it difficult to conceal his abilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8vgcpYYOs1ZmF47KJLnxeSQytc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447185'),
  ('604709735779422223', 'Psychic School Wars', 2012, 'Animation, Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Yoji Shimizu, Ryosuke Nakamura, Mieko Hosoi', 'Yuko Naito, Ryosuke Nakamura', 'Kana Hanazawa, Daisuke Ono, Yutaro Honjo, Mayu Watanabe, Taira Kikumoto, Ryohei Kimura, Kanae Itou', null, 'It''s a new school year at the local Junior High School i Kamakura. The school year starts off with a new transfer student Ryoichi Kyogoku who joins the 8th grade class. He has been ordered to join the school, and use his special gift of telepathy and take over their school. This boy who happens to be handsome, and be a charismatic person, gains popularity, and using his powers takes over the entire school, except for Seki. This begins a war to regain their freedom for their school and themselves.', 'It''s a new school year at the local Junior High School i Kamakura. The school year starts off with a new transfer student Ryoichi Kyogoku who joins the 8th grade class. He has been ordered to join the school, and use his special gift of telepathy and take over their school. This boy who happens to be handsome, and be a charismatic person, gains popularity, and using his powers takes over the entire school, except for Seki. This begins a war to regain their freedom for their school and themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1uNF6PN576T8ajHyC5QGKXj9gQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135915'),
  ('874449081667904232', 'Psycho', 1960, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Alfred Hitchcock, John L. Russell, Hilton A. Green', 'Joseph Stefano', 'Anthony Perkins, Janet Leigh, Vera Miles, John Gavin, Martin Balsam, John McIntire, Simon Oakland, Frank Albertson', 'R', 'When larcenous real estate clerk Marion Crane goes on the lam with a wad of cash and hopes of starting a new life, she ends up at the notorious Bates Motel, where manager Norman Bates cares for his housebound mother.', 'When larcenous real estate clerk Marion Crane goes on the lam with a wad of cash and hopes of starting a new life, she ends up at the notorious Bates Motel, where manager Norman Bates cares for his housebound mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yz4QVqPx3h1hD1DfqqQkCq3rmxW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539'),
