  ('529376270880715200', 'Psycho', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Mysskin, Tanveer Mir', 'Mysskin', 'Rajkumar Pitchumani, Aditi Rao Hydari, Udhayanidhi Stalin, Nithya Menen, Singampuli, Renuka, Ram, Shaji Chen', null, 'Based on the Buddhist tale of Angulimala, a dreaded serial killer, Psycho tells the story of a blind man who gets involved in a murder mystery. trying to save his lover from a psychopath who has kidnapped her.', 'Based on the Buddhist tale of Angulimala, a dreaded serial killer, Psycho tells the story of a blind man who gets involved in a murder mystery. trying to save his lover from a psychopath who has kidnapped her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTHrUUSqTNc1nyBzVGD4SbpqaIe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642889'),
  ('820898668008274158', 'Psycho a Go-Go', 1965, 'Crime, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Vilmos Zsigmond, Al Adamson', 'Mark Eden', 'Roy Morton, Tacey Robbins, Kirk Duncan, Tanya Maree, John Armond, Lyle Felice, Joey Benson, John Talbert', null, 'Jewel thieves quickly dispose of the loot when the alarm is raised, then track down the family upon whose truck they threw them, meanly interrogating them in the hope of getting them back.', 'Jewel thieves quickly dispose of the loot when the alarm is raised, then track down the family upon whose truck they threw them, meanly interrogating them in the hope of getting them back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTA1nAo9zk1iug3jFZa7pLHs8QH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29118'),
  ('844469627212823335', 'Psycho Beach Party', 2000, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Michael Shea, Michael Whitecar, Annette Hobday', 'Charles Busch', 'Lauren Ambrose, Thomas Gibson, Nicholas Brendon, Matt Keeslar, Charles Busch, Amy Adams, Kathleen Robertson, Jenica Bergere', 'NR', 'Chicklet is a sixteen-year old tomboy who''s desperate to be part of the in-crowd of Malibu beach surfers. She''s the typical American girl - except for one little problem: her personality is split into more slices than a pepperoni pizza.', 'Chicklet is a sixteen-year old tomboy who''s desperate to be part of the in-crowd of Malibu beach surfers. She''s the typical American girl - except for one little problem: her personality is split into more slices than a pepperoni pizza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28mzKFDyVzMVx9nhDrJQ3G2H7It.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27723'),
  ('477091546426425951', 'Psycho Cop', 1989, 'Horror', 'Wallace Potts', 'Wallace Potts', 'Robert R. Shafer, Jeff Qualle, Palmer Lee Todd, Dan Campbell, Cindy Guyer, Linda West, Greg Joujon-Roche, Julie Araskog', 'R', 'Officer Joe Vickers would probably make a good policeman if it weren''t for his two nasty habits. Firstly, he is a devoted satanist; secondly - he likes to kill people. When he meets a group of teenagers spending their vacation in a wood hut, he decides to investigate.', 'Officer Joe Vickers would probably make a good policeman if it weren''t for his two nasty habits. Firstly, he is a devoted satanist; secondly - he likes to kill people. When he meets a group of teenagers spending their vacation in a wood hut, he decides to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fK6Mq1xaitZC8pXpHwL2vdbIbm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29692'),
  ('105066778517748991', 'Psycho Cop Returns', 1993, 'Horror', 'Adam Rifkin, Adam Kane, David Andriole', 'Dan Povenmire', 'Robert R. Shafer, Barbara Niven, Miles Dougal, Rod Sweitzer, Julie Strain, Melanie Good, Nick Vallelonga, Maureen Flaherty', 'R', 'A group of office workers decide to have a party in the office building. Among other things, they want to have some drugs there. Their conversation on the subject is overheard by Joe Vickers, which is rather unfortunate for them, since Joe Vickers is a policeman. Even more unfortunate is the fact that Vickers is also an undead psychotic satanist, and instead of arresting them, he will make sure that nobody leaves the party alive...', 'A group of office workers decide to have a party in the office building. Among other things, they want to have some drugs there. Their conversation on the subject is overheard by Joe Vickers, which is rather unfortunate for them, since Joe Vickers is a policeman. Even more unfortunate is the fact that Vickers is also an undead psychotic satanist, and instead of arresting them, he will make sure that nobody leaves the party alive...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWCAJMEHEwGgmgHCO2MPg8p7lnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29693'),
  ('1072927114799396308', 'Psycho Diver: Soul Siren', 1997, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mamoru Kanbe', null, 'Junko Iwao, Atsuko Tanaka, Jouji Nakata, Toshiko Fujita, Yusaku Yara, Hiroshi Ito, Osamu Saka, Osamu Hosoi', 'NR', 'Yuki Kano has it all: fame, wealth, the world at her feet. There''s also something very wrong with her... from time to time, she''s totally unable to sing (which, for a pop star, is not good). Enter Bosujima, a "psycho diver" with the capability to enter people''s heads and straighten out what''s wrong with them. Well, most of the time, anyway.', 'Yuki Kano has it all: fame, wealth, the world at her feet. There''s also something very wrong with her... from time to time, she''s totally unable to sing (which, for a pop star, is not good). Enter Bosujima, a "psycho diver" with the capability to enter people''s heads and straighten out what''s wrong with them. Well, most of the time, anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSg723nKyOIqoZRprDn8ZsUIPE8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88879'),
