  ('1040778321607907338', 'Psycho Girls', 1986, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jerry Ciccoritti, Robert Bergman', 'Jerry Ciccoritti, Michael Bockner', 'John Haslett Cuff, Darlene Mignacco, Rose Graham, Agi Gallus, Michael A. Miranda, Pier Giorgio DiCicco, Michael Hoole, Dan Rose', 'R', 'A woman breaks out of an insane asylum, accompanied by two crazed inmates, to kill her sister.', 'A woman breaks out of an insane asylum, accompanied by two crazed inmates, to kill her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vs1rx4Dqnh5ZgDakxyJ69Yw6ekp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85683'),
  ('571097330976397367', 'Psycho Gothic Lolita', 2010, 'Horror, Action', 'Gô Ohara', 'Hisakatsu Kuroki', 'Rina Akiyama, Ruito Aoyagi, Yukihide Benny, Asami, Satoshi Hakuzen, James Mark, Misaki Momose, Fumie Nakajima', null, 'Yuki lives at home in peace until one day a unit of assassins breaks in and kill her mother. In order to revenge herself Yuki becomes a demon of vengeance by donning gothic lolita clothing, using a parasol as a deadly weapon, and executing the guilty in God''s name.', 'Yuki lives at home in peace until one day a unit of assassins breaks in and kill her mother. In order to revenge herself Yuki becomes a demon of vengeance by donning gothic lolita clothing, using a parasol as a deadly weapon, and executing the guilty in God''s name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIcpx9n3TmgyKNk3HdtwWbbTtuy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69326'),
  ('204923758509241529', 'Psycho Hannibal', 2001, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Seiji Miwa', null, 'Keisaku Kimura, Mayuko Sasaki, Miki Munemasa, Kazuhisa Kawahara', null, 'A series of bizarre murders. Psychometer Rinko cooperates with detectives in the investigation. The investigation is a difficult one, and the only clues are Rinko''s visions when she is in ecstasy, and the crazy smile of a creepy man that appears vaguely.', 'A series of bizarre murders. Psychometer Rinko cooperates with detectives in the investigation. The investigation is a difficult one, and the only clues are Rinko''s visions when she is in ecstasy, and the crazy smile of a creepy man that appears vaguely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nchukooee7oNaVxvUjxYtsYqPSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1200338'),
  ('248952701701902882', 'Psycho II', 1983, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Richard Franklin, Dean Cundey, Don Zepfel', 'Tom Holland', 'Anthony Perkins, Vera Miles, Meg Tilly, Robert Loggia, Dennis Franz, Hugh Gillin, Virginia Gregg, Claudia Bryar', 'R', 'Norman Bates is declared sane and released from the facility in which he was being held, despite the complaints of Lila Loomis, sister of his most famous victim. Is he really cured, or will he kill again?', 'Norman Bates is declared sane and released from the facility in which he was being held, despite the complaints of Lila Loomis, sister of his most famous victim. Is he really cured, or will he kill again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJAPRj3vHmjV4z97YK84iDovYlm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10576'),
  ('1026244837366742253', 'Psycho III', 1986, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Bruce Surtees, Anthony Perkins', 'Charles Edward Pogue', 'Anthony Perkins, Diana Scarwid, Jeff Fahey, Roberta Maxwell, Hugh Gillin, Lee Garlington, Robert Alan Browne, Gary Bayer', 'R', 'When Maureen Coyle, a suicidal nun who resembles Norman''s former victim, Marion Crane, arrives at the motel, all bets are off and "Mother" is less than happy.', 'When Maureen Coyle, a suicidal nun who resembles Norman''s former victim, Marion Crane, arrives at the motel, all bets are off and "Mother" is less than happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tgV4eeW0X7os7p3SYbNwDI0NYGa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12662'),
  ('221485202454123192', 'Psycho IV: The Beginning', 1990, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Mick Garris, Rodney Charters', 'Joseph Stefano', 'Anthony Perkins, Henry Thomas, Olivia Hussey, CCH Pounder, Warren Frost, Donna Mitchell, Thomas Schuster, Sharen Camille', 'R', 'When he hears talk radio host Fran Ambrose discussing the topic of matricide, Norman calls in under a false name to tell his story.', 'When he hears talk radio host Fran Ambrose discussing the topic of matricide, Norman calls in under a false name to tell his story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxWTkQRAvTvA6rbBhsdC4pdnHuq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40377'),
  ('1144032476222750599', 'Psycho Killer', 2026, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'Gavin Polone, Magnus Nordenhof Jønck', 'Andrew Kevin Walker', 'Georgina Campbell, James Preston Rogers, Malcolm McDowell, Logan Miller, Grace Dove, Aaron Merke, Joshua Banman, Cassandra Ebner', 'R', 'Following the brutal murder of her husband, a Kansas highway patrol officer sets out on a journey to track down the perpetrator. As the hunt progresses, she comes to realize the man responsible is a sadistic serial killer, and the depth of his mental depravity and his sinister agenda is more twisted than anyone could have imagined.', 'Following the brutal murder of her husband, a Kansas highway patrol officer sets out on a journey to track down the perpetrator. As the hunt progresses, she comes to realize the man responsible is a sadistic serial killer, and the depth of his mental depravity and his sinister agenda is more twisted than anyone could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xgxxmLivJXL8aF0HdZfpx8aAIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1107166'),
  ('846525008998242018', 'Psycho Sisters', 1998, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Pete Jacelone, Michael L. Raso, Timothy Healy', 'James L. Edwards', 'J.J. North, Theresa Lynn, Nancy Sirianni, Dakotah, John Knox, Anthony Bruno, Jeffrey Stackhouse, Sasha Graham', 'NR', 'Mean and domineering Jane and the sweet and ditsy Jackie are two radically contrasting sisters who suffer from severe trauma after witnessing the murder/suicide of their parents as well as seeing their other sibling Janice raped and killed by her assailants. The pair are deemed fit to re-enter society and get released from a sanitarium where they have undergone extensive rehabilitation therapy. However, Jane and Jackie prove to be anything but sane and harmless as they embark on a vicious spree in which they torture, murder, and mutilate any man luckless enough to cross their lethal paths.', 'Mean and domineering Jane and the sweet and ditsy Jackie are two radically contrasting sisters who suffer from severe trauma after witnessing the murder/suicide of their parents as well as seeing their other sibling Janice raped and killed by her assailants. The pair are deemed fit to re-enter society and get released from a sanitarium where they have undergone extensive rehabilitation therapy. However, Jane and Jackie prove to be anything but sane and harmless as they embark on a vicious spree in which they torture, murder, and mutilate any man luckless enough to cross their lethal paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BaPyShGNkx6jMKWzwJggOd6Ziq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116641'),
  ('805415922244215515', 'Psycho Therapy: The Shallow Tale of a Writer Who Decided to Write About a Serial Killer', 2025, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Natalie Kingston, Tolga Karaçelik', 'Tolga Karaçelik', 'Steve Buscemi, Britt Lower, John Magaro, Ward Horton, Olli Haaskivi, Sydney Cole Alexander, Jacob Ming-Trent, Nik Sadhnani', 'NR', 'A struggling writer in the midst of a divorce befriends a retired serial killer who incidentally becomes his marriage counselor by day, and killing counselor for his next book by night.', 'A struggling writer in the midst of a divorce befriends a retired serial killer who incidentally becomes his marriage counselor by day, and killing counselor for his next book by night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOMEIAisb6Az54UOhybwycuHOEU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681434'),
  ('725991011387120239', 'Psycho Yoga Instructor', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ilias Konstantakopoulos, Brian Herzlinger', 'Jay Black, Robert Black', 'Ashley Wood, Panos Vlahos, Lily Rains, Cathy Baron, Brady Smith, Steve Hofstetter, Ashley Platz', null, 'Justine Grace is desperate to sort out her life, her marriage to her husband Tom, and herself. When Domenic, a handsome yoga teacher, takes an interest in her, it seems like he might be the one to finally bring happiness to her life. However, he has ideas that go beyond yoga. Justine must find the strength within herself to save her marriage, save her life, and survive a sociopath as he tries to seduce her into the perfect pose.', 'Justine Grace is desperate to sort out her life, her marriage to her husband Tom, and herself. When Domenic, a handsome yoga teacher, takes an interest in her, it seems like he might be the one to finally bring happiness to her life. However, he has ideas that go beyond yoga. Justine must find the strength within herself to save her marriage, save her life, and survive a sociopath as he tries to seduce her into the perfect pose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TWRfinccNiQS61r49PTfNEs2vz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713598'),
  ('675094027599141120', 'Psycho-Pass 3: First Inspector', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Action, Crime, Animation', 'Masumi Hattori, Ilya Kuvshinov, Choe Gyeong-seok', 'Tow Ubukata, Makoto Fukami', 'Takahiro Sakurai, Junichi Suwabe, Yuichi Nakamura, Kaori Nazuka, Ayane Sakura, Yuki Kaji, Akio Otsuka, Hiroshi Naka', null, 'Inspector Kei Mikhail Ignatov finds himself involved with an organization named Bifrost with the possibility of freeing his wife if he betrays Unit One. Koichi Azusawa coordinates an assault on the Public Safety Bureau tower using his hacker Obata, locking down the building and kidnapping Inspector Arata Shindo. Azusawa demands that governor Karina Komiya resign from her position.', 'Inspector Kei Mikhail Ignatov finds himself involved with an organization named Bifrost with the possibility of freeing his wife if he betrays Unit One. Koichi Azusawa coordinates an assault on the Public Safety Bureau tower using his hacker Obata, locking down the building and kidnapping Inspector Arata Shindo. Azusawa demands that governor Karina Komiya resign from her position.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ln3Hr6UYvnnQXLIEMotdeo2BCK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655431'),
  ('196204679374988321', 'Psycho-Pass: Providence', 2023, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Naoyoshi Shiotani, Eiji Arai, Yoshikazu Iwanami', 'Makoto Fukami, Tow Ubukata', 'Kana Hanazawa, Tomokazu Seki, Kenji Nojima, Shizuka Itoh, Miyuki Sawashiro, Ayane Sakura, Takahiro Sakurai, Hiroki Touchi', 'R', 'While attending a meeting as a Chief Inspector of the Public Security Bureau, Akane Tsunemori received a report that an incident had occurred on a foreign vessel , and this was the beginning of a big and unexpected case.', 'While attending a meeting as a Chief Inspector of the Public Security Bureau, Akane Tsunemori received a report that an incident had occurred on a foreign vessel , and this was the beginning of a big and unexpected case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6T9dPpm8P8jqHIHEnEnKYXlPbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012652'),
  ('458851557505067090', 'Psycho-Pass: Sinners of the System - Case.1 Crime and Punishment', 2019, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Eiji Arai, Yoshikazu Iwanami, Shingo Nakamura', 'Ryo Yoshigami', 'Kenji Nojima, Tomokazu Seki, Kana Hanazawa, Ayane Sakura, Kinryu Arimoto, Hiroki Touchi, Masumi Asano, Kimiko Saito', 'R', 'In the winter of 2117, a runaway vehicle crashes into the Public Safety Bureau Building. The driver is identified as Izumi Yasaka, a psychological counselor at the Sanctuary, a Latent Criminal Isolation Facility in Aomori Prefecture. But right before her interrogation, Inspector Mika Shimotsuki and Enforcer Nobuchika Ginoza are tasked with promptly escorting Yasaka back to Aomori. What awaits them there is a False Paradise.', 'In the winter of 2117, a runaway vehicle crashes into the Public Safety Bureau Building. The driver is identified as Izumi Yasaka, a psychological counselor at the Sanctuary, a Latent Criminal Isolation Facility in Aomori Prefecture. But right before her interrogation, Inspector Mika Shimotsuki and Enforcer Nobuchika Ginoza are tasked with promptly escorting Yasaka back to Aomori. What awaits them there is a False Paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnG8ZcmQoncPB58RZwy3wofxm5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510242'),
  ('944883605965583616', 'Psycho-Pass: Sinners of the System - Case.2 First Guardian', 2019, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Eiji Arai, Yoshikazu Iwanami, Shinya Sugai', 'Makoto Fukami', 'Kenji Nojima, Tomokazu Seki, Kana Hanazawa, Ayane Sakura, Kinryu Arimoto, Hiroki Touchi, Masumi Asano, Kimiko Saito', 'R', '2112; the summer before Akane Tsunemori was assigned to Division One of the Public Safety Bureau''s Criminal Investigation Department. Teppei Sugo, an accomplished pilot of the Defense Army''s 15th Integrated Task Force, joins the military operation in Okinawa. Three months later, an unmanned combat drone opens fire on the Ministry of Defense in Tokyo. Enforcer Tomomi Masaoka of CID Division One is dispatched to Sugo''s military base to investigate the truth behind this case.', '2112; the summer before Akane Tsunemori was assigned to Division One of the Public Safety Bureau''s Criminal Investigation Department. Teppei Sugo, an accomplished pilot of the Defense Army''s 15th Integrated Task Force, joins the military operation in Okinawa. Three months later, an unmanned combat drone opens fire on the Ministry of Defense in Tokyo. Enforcer Tomomi Masaoka of CID Division One is dispatched to Sugo''s military base to investigate the truth behind this case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Xm1hgIcmKJGnaMetErNu5kA8qz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559562'),
  ('791035854561952625', 'Psycho-Pass: Sinners of the System - Case.3 On the Other Side of Love and Hate', 2019, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Shinya Sugai, Satoru Nakamura, Eiji Arai', 'Makoto Fukami', 'Tomokazu Seki, Sumire Morohoshi, Tomoyuki Shimura, Tsutomu Isobe, Wataru Takagi, Satoshi Tsuruoka', 'R', 'Following the incident in the Southeast Asia Union in 2116, Shinya Kogami resumes his vagrant journey. In a small South Asian nation, Kogami rescues a bus of refugees under attack by armed guerrilla forces. Among the refugees is a young lady by the name of Tenzin, who begs Kogami to teach her how to retaliate against the enemy. Just what does the girl who wishes for revenge and the man who has exacted revenge see as they gaze upon the edge of a world from which there is no escape?', 'Following the incident in the Southeast Asia Union in 2116, Shinya Kogami resumes his vagrant journey. In a small South Asian nation, Kogami rescues a bus of refugees under attack by armed guerrilla forces. Among the refugees is a young lady by the name of Tenzin, who begs Kogami to teach her how to retaliate against the enemy. Just what does the girl who wishes for revenge and the man who has exacted revenge see as they gaze upon the edge of a world from which there is no escape?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snAdedewKhxu1SU9ZUAh156Trlt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559566'),
  ('331829894189857017', 'PSYCHO-PASS: The Movie', 2015, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Eiji Arai, Atsushi Mimura, Yoshikazu Iwanami', 'Makoto Fukami, Gen Urobuchi', 'Kana Hanazawa, Tomokazu Seki, Kenji Nojima, Ayane Sakura, Takahiro Sakurai, Miyuki Sawashiro, Hiroki Touchi, Kazuhiro Yamaji', 'NR', 'In a futuristic Japan, the Sibyl System is charged with keeping the peace. When the state of SEAUn brings the Sibyl System in to test its effectiveness, it becomes a haven of peace and safety—for a time. Eventually, terrorists from SEAUn begin appearing in Japan, somehow slipping through the System''s security and attacking from within. Desperate for answers, Inspector Akane Tsunemori is sent overseas to bring the terrorists to justice. But when her investigation forces her into a standoff with an old ally, will she be able to pull the trigger?', 'In a futuristic Japan, the Sibyl System is charged with keeping the peace. When the state of SEAUn brings the Sibyl System in to test its effectiveness, it becomes a haven of peace and safety—for a time. Eventually, terrorists from SEAUn begin appearing in Japan, somehow slipping through the System''s security and attacking from within. Desperate for answers, Inspector Akane Tsunemori is sent overseas to bring the terrorists to justice. But when her investigation forces her into a standoff with an old ally, will she be able to pull the trigger?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUlhPosXp62uuTS0c2aINdg8cvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296917'),
  ('1060039707245694529', 'Psychokinesis', 2018, 'Fantasy, Action', 'Yeon Sang-ho, Byun Bong-sun, Song Hyun-suk', 'Yeon Sang-ho', 'Ryu Seung-ryong, Shim Eun-kyung, Park Jeong-min, Kim Min-jae, Jung Yu-mi, Yoo Seung-mok, Kim Young-sun, Ye Su-jeong', null, 'An ordinary guy suddenly finds he has superpowers he can use to help his spirited daughter and the people around them, but he also runs into trouble in the process.', 'An ordinary guy suddenly finds he has superpowers he can use to help his spirited daughter and the people around them, but he also runs into trouble in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyTAYYWHyfDcAXYmNa0ifm1JrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452015'),
  ('564909140882360911', 'Psychomagic: A Healing Art', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Pascale Montandon-Jodorowsky', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky', 'Alejandro Jodorowsky, Arthur H.', null, 'Explores the therapeutic work of director Alejandro Jodorowsky, showing by means of real acts, what Psychomagic is, its principle, how it is practiced, and how it is applied in life. Jodorowsky works directly with real, suffering people who are eager to solve their problems.', 'Explores the therapeutic work of director Alejandro Jodorowsky, showing by means of real acts, what Psychomagic is, its principle, how it is practiced, and how it is applied in life. Jodorowsky works directly with real, suffering people who are eager to solve their problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHvO0rQjHW4apPE0EBEp30Njm3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512229'),
  ('553157298092943538', 'Psychomania', 1973, 'Horror', 'Don Sharp, Ted Moore', 'Arnaud d''Usseau, Julian Zimet', 'Nicky Henson, George Sanders, Mary Larkin, Ann Michelle, Roy Holder, Denis Gilmore, Miles Greenwood, Beryl Reid', null, 'A gang of young people call themselves the Living Dead. They terrorize the population from their small town. After an agreement with the devil, if they kill themselves firmly believing in it, they will survive and gain eternal life. Following their leader, they commit suicide one after the other, but things don''t necessarily turn out as expected...', 'A gang of young people call themselves the Living Dead. They terrorize the population from their small town. After an agreement with the devil, if they kill themselves firmly believing in it, they will survive and gain eternal life. Following their leader, they commit suicide one after the other, but things don''t necessarily turn out as expected...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/698hIkRSMmZzY2trCADbgzvpVXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48350'),
  ('283732216146531128', 'Psychomentary', 2014, 'Horror', 'Luna Gualano, Gianni Faina, Luna Gualano', 'Giorgio Amato', 'Gianluca D''Ercole, Emiliano Rubbi, Luigi Moretti, Giulia Gualano, Vincenzo De Michele, Andrea Bonella, Roberta Radossi, Luna Gualano', null, 'One million Euro. The ransom that a masked man asks to free Lucia, Senator Silvestri’s young daughter. The case is followed by Captain Brunetti of the Special Operating Unit of the Carabinieri. However, once the ransom is paid, the kidnapper raises the stake and asks for ten million Euro for the other ten people he is detaining in an abandoned farmhouse: one million for every human life.', 'One million Euro. The ransom that a masked man asks to free Lucia, Senator Silvestri’s young daughter. The case is followed by Captain Brunetti of the Special Operating Unit of the Carabinieri. However, once the ransom is paid, the kidnapper raises the stake and asks for ten million Euro for the other ten people he is detaining in an abandoned farmhouse: one million for every human life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOZG8Ok7qy7eRiUZiboU6JSrusc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296315'),
  ('465348404199028859', 'Psychomontage', 1963, null, 'Eberhardt Kronhausen, Phyllis Kronhausen', null, null, null, 'Sexologists, psychologists, and proponents of sexual freedom, the Kronhausens here attempt to induce erotic response in the audience by carefully chosen visual stimuli and juxtapositions (aimed at both conscious and unconscious). Phallic symbols and open orifices, a tongue licking an orange, an unexpected finger entering the frame: almost any object or act, no matter how innocuous, the Kronhausens show, can be made to appear erotic, and reveals our predisposition towards ‘shaping’ visual evidence for purposes of erotic gratification.', 'Sexologists, psychologists, and proponents of sexual freedom, the Kronhausens here attempt to induce erotic response in the audience by carefully chosen visual stimuli and juxtapositions (aimed at both conscious and unconscious). Phallic symbols and open orifices, a tongue licking an orange, an unexpected finger entering the frame: almost any object or act, no matter how innocuous, the Kronhausens show, can be made to appear erotic, and reveals our predisposition towards ‘shaping’ visual evidence for purposes of erotic gratification.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhbYhC8VLnDOIdZk230cJ6xvfkI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195027'),
  ('1108927703054351257', 'Psychos in Love', 1987, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Gorman Bechard, Gorman Bechard', 'Gorman Bechard, Carmine Capobianco', 'Carmine Capobianco, Debi Thibeault, Frank Stewart, Cecelia Wilde, Ruth Collins, Donna Davidge, LeeAnne Baker, Angela Nicholas', null, 'A strip-joint owner and a manicurist find that they have many things in common, the foremost being that they are psychotic serial killers. They fall in love and are happy being the family that slays together, until one day they come up against a plumber who also happens to be a cannibal.', 'A strip-joint owner and a manicurist find that they have many things in common, the foremost being that they are psychotic serial killers. They fall in love and are happy being the family that slays together, until one day they come up against a plumber who also happens to be a cannibal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQwd8QDZTWfOZ9MnpKlYQSplaxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48789'),
  ('728818569793289126', 'Psychosexual', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Marco Vélez Esquivia, Nora Lengua Puche', 'Marco Vélez Esquivia', 'Estefania Piñeres, Jacques Toukhmanian, Raúl Ocampo, Andrea Esquivel, Walter Luengas, Jenny Gómez, Diana Ángel, Alejandra Villafañe', null, 'After finding her boyfriend cheating on her, a woman becomes obsessed with a YouTuber to the point that she thinks he''s the perfect man for her.', 'After finding her boyfriend cheating on her, a woman becomes obsessed with a YouTuber to the point that she thinks he''s the perfect man for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5cEKhHn2NSH18FxASF8UT0LfsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834734'),
  ('550821409575734672', 'Psychout for Murder', 1969, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rossano Brazzi, Renzo Petretto, Luciano Trasatti', 'Diana Crispo, Renato Polselli, Piero Regnoli', 'Adrienne La Russa, Rossano Brazzi, Nino Castelnuovo, Paola Pitagora, Alberto de Mendoza, Idelma Carlo, Renzo Petretto, Néstor Garay', 'R', 'Mario consigns his girlfriend Licia to a whorehouse for an evening in order to get the photographic goods to blackmail her father with. To get her out of the way, Licia is then consigned to a mental hospital by her father.', 'Mario consigns his girlfriend Licia to a whorehouse for an evening in order to get the photographic goods to blackmail her father with. To get her out of the way, Licia is then consigned to a mental hospital by her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZYqLQ0HOi0w5XFfV3nsQRolkuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104942'),
  ('94223843797205698', 'PT 109', 1963, 'Drama, War', 'Leslie H. Martinson, C.M. Florance, Robert Surtees', 'Richard L. Breen', 'Cliff Robertson, Ty Hardin, James Gregory, Robert Culp, Grant Williams, Lew Gallo, Errol John, Michael Pate', null, 'Dramatization of President John F. Kennedy''s war time experiences during which he captained a PT boat, took it to battle and had it sunk by a Japanese destroyer. He and the survivors had to make their way to an island, find food and shelter and signal the Navy for rescue.', 'Dramatization of President John F. Kennedy''s war time experiences during which he captained a PT boat, took it to battle and had it sunk by a Japanese destroyer. He and the survivors had to make their way to an island, find food and shelter and signal the Navy for rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61n1RcpXZbtYXWUxCjqutSFVEDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27858'),
  ('331223312313374600', 'Pterodactyl', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mark L. Lester, George Mooradian, Lloyd A. Simandl', 'Mark Sevi', 'Cameron Daddo, Coolio, Amy Sloan, George Calil, Ivo Cutzarida, Steve Braun, Mircea Monroe, Jessica Ferrarone', null, 'A dormant volcano deep with the Turkish forest holds within it a deadly secret. Perfectly preserved, a nest of pterodactyl eggs are ready to hatch...', 'A dormant volcano deep with the Turkish forest holds within it a deadly secret. Perfectly preserved, a nest of pterodactyl eggs are ready to hatch...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSSfDX8ixzA9Yb4nYIwEtqiKxPa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27860'),
  ('534831640085876274', 'PTU', 2003, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Au Kin-Yee', 'Simon Yam, Maggie Shiu, Lam Suet, Ruby Wong Cheuk-Ling, Eddy Ko Hung, Lo Hoi-Pang, Wong Tin-Lam, Jimmy Wong', null, 'Follows a police tactical unit during one dangerous night on the streets of Hong Kong as they try to recover a cop''s stolen gun. Things turn deadly when they run into a web of gangland crimes.', 'Follows a police tactical unit during one dangerous night on the streets of Hong Kong as they try to recover a cop''s stolen gun. Things turn deadly when they run into a web of gangland crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTpoWAe5Dx8MNlTOo4t4OXDwoX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25536'),
  ('475922991676616410', 'Pu-239', 2006, 'Drama', 'Scott Z. Burns, Alexandra Puia-Frenchkowski, Ovidiu Paunescu', 'Ken Kalfus, Scott Z. Burns', 'Paddy Considine, Oscar Isaac, Valeriu Pavel Dan, Kenneth Bryans, Radha Mitchell, Danya Baryshnikov, Connor McIntyre, Derek Hutchinson', 'R', 'A worker at a Russian nuclear facility gets exposed to a lethal dose of radiation. In order to provide for his family, he steals some plutonium and sets out to sell it on Moscow''s black market with the help of an incompetent criminal.', 'A worker at a Russian nuclear facility gets exposed to a lethal dose of radiation. In order to provide for his family, he steals some plutonium and sets out to sell it on Moscow''s black market with the help of an incompetent criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRyusBzphrpoEfMNff0jlR0ulQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26431'),
  ('672028191851365273', 'Puan', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Francisco Alonso, María Liz Siccardi, Santino Taratuto', 'María Alché, Benjamín Naishtat', 'Marcelo Subiotto, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Julieta Zylberberg, Alejandra Flechner, Mara Bestelli, Andrea Frigerio, Cristina Banegas, Damián Dreizik', null, 'When Marcelo Pena finally is about to be appointed Head of the Philosophy Department, the famous and seductive Professor Sujarchuk returns from Europe to claim the kingdom for himself.', 'When Marcelo Pena finally is about to be appointed Head of the Philosophy Department, the famous and seductive Professor Sujarchuk returns from Europe to claim the kingdom for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ufiq3lA0QXnC1aIztBIFXovY7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764442'),
  ('136590309723100742', 'Puberty Blues', 1981, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bruce Beresford, Donald McAlpine', 'Margaret Kelly', 'Nell Schofield, Jad Capelja, Tony Hughes, Jay Hackett, Ned Lander, Michael Shearman, Jeffrey Rhoe, Dean Dunstone', 'R', 'Two teenage surf chicks from the southern suburbs of Sydney ingratiate themselves with a new group of boys.', 'Two teenage surf chicks from the southern suburbs of Sydney ingratiate themselves with a new group of boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fLFEugxPXmK2ZosbHo6XIB5Php.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14630'),
  ('805631494135101877', 'Puberty: Sexual Education For Boys and Girls', 1991, 'Documentary', 'Ronald Deronge', 'André Singelijn', 'Hielde Daems, Willem Geyseghem', null, 'This sex education movie explore themes of body development, sexual hygiene, masturbation, menstruation, puberty, sex and giving birth.', 'This sex education movie explore themes of body development, sexual hygiene, masturbation, menstruation, puberty, sex and giving birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCxxipWjBwOHzwG5lPZBrtdJEp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458663'),
  ('2193190655755223', 'Public Access', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bryan Singer, Bruce Douglas Johnson', 'Christopher McQuarrie, Bryan Singer', 'Ron Marquette, Leigh Hunt, John Renshaw, Jennifer McManus, Brandon Boyce, Dina Brooks, Craig Stovall, Bruce Germaine', 'R', 'Brewster seems to be an almost too perfect example of idyllic small-town America, with everyone living in peace and harmony. So when newcomer Whiley Pritcher starts up his own local cable TV show with the question "what''s wrong with Brewster?", there surely can''t be any deep dark secrets in the town that are just waiting to come to the surface - or can there? And when the question becomes "who''s wrong with Brewster?" things start getting seriously nasty.', 'Brewster seems to be an almost too perfect example of idyllic small-town America, with everyone living in peace and harmony. So when newcomer Whiley Pritcher starts up his own local cable TV show with the question "what''s wrong with Brewster?", there surely can''t be any deep dark secrets in the town that are just waiting to come to the surface - or can there? And when the question becomes "who''s wrong with Brewster?" things start getting seriously nasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIuqSfr9z05ck4jDEJwAoqEKZLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77064'),
  ('378302314516115051', 'Public Enemies', 1996, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mark L. Lester, Mikhail Suslov', 'C. Courtney Joyner', 'Theresa Russell, Eric Roberts, Alyssa Milano, James Marsden, Richard Eden, Joe Dain, Dan Cortese, Frank Stallone Jr.', null, 'Ma Barker and her sons rob banks, shoot people and wind up at the top of the FBI''s Most Wanted list in the 1930s.', 'Ma Barker and her sons rob banks, shoot people and wind up at the top of the FBI''s Most Wanted list in the 1930s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRvXYxnbUvQlphZBYOf1bJ7lQiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49172'),
  ('76275418061798109', 'Public Enemies', 2009, 'Crime, History, Drama', 'Michael Mann, Dante Spinotti, Patrick Lumb', 'Ann Biderman, Ronan Bennett, Michael Mann', 'Johnny Depp, Christian Bale, Marion Cotillard, Jason Clarke, Rory Cochrane, Billy Crudup, Stephen Dorff, Stephen Lang', 'R', 'Depression-era bank robber John Dillinger''s charm and audacity endear him to much of America''s downtrodden public, but he''s also a thorn in the side of J. Edgar Hoover and the fledgling FBI. Desperate to capture the elusive outlaw, Hoover makes Dillinger his first Public Enemy Number One and assigns his top agent, Melvin Purvis, the task of bringing him in dead or alive.', 'Depression-era bank robber John Dillinger''s charm and audacity endear him to much of America''s downtrodden public, but he''s also a thorn in the side of J. Edgar Hoover and the fledgling FBI. Desperate to capture the elusive outlaw, Hoover makes Dillinger his first Public Enemy Number One and assigns his top agent, Melvin Purvis, the task of bringing him in dead or alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KgtekisQBrHRsm2cD5UOB6Ce3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11322'),
  ('786444978067066264', 'Public Enemies', 2014, 'Drama, TV Movie, History', 'Roland Suso Richter', 'Johannes W. Betz', 'Sebastian Rudolph, Francis Fulton-Smith, David Rott, Johann von Bülow, Franz Dinda, Max Hopp, Alexander Held, Nora Waldstätten', null, 'Under the slogan of the arms race of the superpowers, which escalates in the Cuban Missile Crisis in 1962 and brings the world to the brink of nuclear war, two exemplary post-war male figures challenge an almost archaic feud: Defense Minister Franz Josef Strauss and journalist Rudolf Augstein.', 'Under the slogan of the arms race of the superpowers, which escalates in the Cuban Missile Crisis in 1962 and brings the world to the brink of nuclear war, two exemplary post-war male figures challenge an almost archaic feud: Defense Minister Franz Josef Strauss and journalist Rudolf Augstein.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvcP9RrhXrNo3zUCW0R32hyppyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267198'),
  ('601566615498155913', 'Public Enemy', 2002, 'Action, Crime', 'Kang Woo-suk, Kim Sung-bok', 'Jung Yoon-sup', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Lee Sung-jae, Kang Shin-il, Kim Jung-hak, Do Yong-gu, Ahn Nae-sang, Lee Moon-sik, Sung Ji-ru', null, 'A notorious dirty cop makes an honest attempt to catch a serial killer who even murdered his own parents.', 'A notorious dirty cop makes an honest attempt to catch a serial killer who even murdered his own parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xNVM4UmFm27UUr52q7cxwYrrrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33171'),
  ('940110228907367524', 'Public Enemy Returns', 2008, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Kang Woo-suk, Shin Hak-sung, Kim Sung-bok', 'Jang Jin', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Jung Jae-young, Kang Shin-il, Kim Nam-gil, Kim Jung-hak, Bae Joong-sik, Lee Min-ho, Lee Moon-sik', null, 'Kang Chul-jung has been a detective fighting crime for 15 years and is at it again against a mob boss who recruits young kids to do his dirty work.', 'Kang Chul-jung has been a detective fighting crime for 15 years and is at it again against a mob boss who recruits young kids to do his dirty work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wr7CWangsK7jI6KQYxfDpcVsisO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65337'),
  ('1097678823699776009', 'Public Friends', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Edouard Pluvieux, Guillaume Schiffman', 'John Eledjam, Kev Adams, Grégory Boutboul', 'Kev Adams, Vincent Elbaz, Paul Bartel, Chloé Coulloud, John Eledjam, Majid Berhila, Anne Suarez, Guy Lecluyse', null, 'In order to make his little sick brother''s dream come true, Leo and his best mates organize a fake score...but on the d day, they make a mistake and the fake score becomes a real hold up.Here starts the extraordinary adventure of PUBLIC Amis.', 'In order to make his little sick brother''s dream come true, Leo and his best mates organize a fake score...but on the d day, they make a mistake and the fake score becomes a real hold up.Here starts the extraordinary adventure of PUBLIC Amis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DcYje54hmBsH3HK06PmMXp4fAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369781'),
  ('20934532414550883', 'Public Speaking', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Martin Scorsese, Ellen Kuras', null, 'Fran Lebowitz, Pablo Picasso, Pablo Casals, Thelonious Monk, James Baldwin, Serge Gainsbourg, Candy Darling, Andy Warhol', null, 'Martin Scorsese’s portrait of writer and social commentator Fran Lebowitz, celebrated for her sharp wit and observations on modern life. Filmed at New York’s Waverly Inn and intercut with archival footage and interviews, the documentary captures Lebowitz’s distinctive worldview through her spontaneous monologues and public appearances.', 'Martin Scorsese’s portrait of writer and social commentator Fran Lebowitz, celebrated for her sharp wit and observations on modern life. Filmed at New York’s Waverly Inn and intercut with archival footage and interviews, the documentary captures Lebowitz’s distinctive worldview through her spontaneous monologues and public appearances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vEqQpndZuydRbYueABgIMw34gH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54793'),
  ('943243470069666864', 'Public Telephone', 1980, 'Music, Documentary', 'Jean-Marie Périer', null, 'Jean-Louis Aubert, Corine Marienneau, Richard Kolinka, Louis Bertignac', null, 'Téléphone is a great success story in French rock: 300,000 albums sold in 1979. The group was born on December 16, 1976, at a surprise concert at the American Center in Paris. Four instrumentalists, four self-taught, four musicians untroubled by the successive waves of fashions from across the Atlantic and the Channel: Jean-Louis Aubert, singer and songwriter; Louis Bertignac, guitarist; Richard Kolinka, drummer; Corinne Marienneau, bassist. From titles: “Métro c''est trop”, “La bombe humaine”, “Crache ton venin”... Portraits and interviews, trances and crowd-pleasers at the Palais des Sports and the Fete de l''Humanité, a look behind the scenes. Jean-Marie Périer, with seven cameras in hand, now captures the phenomenon in a feature-length film. Camera movements, editing on a giant triple screen and Dolby Stereo sound all serve to highlight the quartet''s harmony and vitality.', 'Téléphone is a great success story in French rock: 300,000 albums sold in 1979. The group was born on December 16, 1976, at a surprise concert at the American Center in Paris. Four instrumentalists, four self-taught, four musicians untroubled by the successive waves of fashions from across the Atlantic and the Channel: Jean-Louis Aubert, singer and songwriter; Louis Bertignac, guitarist; Richard Kolinka, drummer; Corinne Marienneau, bassist. From titles: “Métro c''est trop”, “La bombe humaine”, “Crache ton venin”... Portraits and interviews, trances and crowd-pleasers at the Palais des Sports and the Fete de l''Humanité, a look behind the scenes. Jean-Marie Périer, with seven cameras in hand, now captures the phenomenon in a feature-length film. Camera movements, editing on a giant triple screen and Dolby Stereo sound all serve to highlight the quartet''s harmony and vitality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tamTHVlcf2fLdxd3C5OqTTtUb67.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68578'),
  ('676268933615333308', 'Puccini for Beginners', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Maria Maggenti', 'Maria Maggenti', 'Elizabeth Reaser, Gretchen Mol, Justin Kirk, Julianne Nicholson, Jennifer Dundas, Tina Benko, Brian Letscher, Kate Simses', null, 'When her inability to commit leads to a breakup with her girlfriend, opera-loving writer Allegra winds up in the bed of amiable professor Philip. He is so smitten with Allegra that he dumps his lover, Grace, and convinces Allegra to continue their affair. When Allegra meets Grace, sparks fly, and she begins a parallel romance, unaware that her new lover is the woman Philip left to be with her.', 'When her inability to commit leads to a breakup with her girlfriend, opera-loving writer Allegra winds up in the bed of amiable professor Philip. He is so smitten with Allegra that he dumps his lover, Grace, and convinces Allegra to continue their affair. When Allegra meets Grace, sparks fly, and she begins a parallel romance, unaware that her new lover is the woman Philip left to be with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5yBAYkXa6jSfBr0iayon8CkXC9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20405'),
  ('203563430192276905', 'Puce Moment', 1949, 'Fantasy, Music', 'Kenneth Anger, Curtis Harrington', 'Kenneth Anger', 'Yvonne Marquis', null, 'This film resulted from the unfinished short film Puce Women. The film opens with a camera watching 1920s style flapper gowns being taken off a dress rack. The dresses are removed and danced off the rack to music. (The original soundtrack was Verdi opera music; in the 1960s, Anger re-released the film with a new psychedelic folk-rock soundtrack performed by Jonathan Halper.) A long-lashed woman, Yvonne Marquis, dresses in the purple puce gown and walks to her vanity to apply perfume. She lies on a chaise lounge which then begins to move around the room and eventually out to a patio. Borzois appear and she prepares to take them for a walk.', 'This film resulted from the unfinished short film Puce Women. The film opens with a camera watching 1920s style flapper gowns being taken off a dress rack. The dresses are removed and danced off the rack to music. (The original soundtrack was Verdi opera music; in the 1960s, Anger re-released the film with a new psychedelic folk-rock soundtrack performed by Jonathan Halper.) A long-lashed woman, Yvonne Marquis, dresses in the purple puce gown and walks to her vanity to apply perfume. She lies on a chaise lounge which then begins to move around the room and eventually out to a patio. Borzois appear and she prepares to take them for a walk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sMKFvwnogVNRZdHd0JITAE3bqE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46781'),
  ('479248592958536447', 'Puddle Cruiser', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jay Chandrasekhar, Tony Foresta, Scott Ambrozy', 'Jay Chandrasekhar, Erik Stolhanske, Steve Lemme', 'Jay Chandrasekhar, Kevin Heffernan, Steve Lemme, Paul Soter, Erik Stolhanske, Zach Chapman, Alison Clapp, Kayren Butler', 'R', 'A student falls in love with a fellow student who is defending his buddies in university court. He "proves his love" (more like his masculinity) to her by playing rugby against her ex-boyfriend.', 'A student falls in love with a fellow student who is defending his buddies in university court. He "proves his love" (more like his masculinity) to her by playing rugby against her ex-boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EyVqjP2d6cWANdlA4TUoVIt7tf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13563'),
  ('254849895673653209', 'Pudhupettai', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Selvaraghavan, Arvind Krishna', 'Selvaraghavan', 'Dhanush, Sneha, N. Azhagamperumal, Sonia Agarwal, Nithish Veera, Prudhviraj, Bala Singh, Thennavan', null, 'The story of ‘Kokki’ Kumar, a carefree teenager from a Chennai slum who runs away from home in the wake of his mother’s death, gets recruited into a local gang and quickly evolves into the dreaded, psychotic right-hand man of a dirty politician.', 'The story of ‘Kokki’ Kumar, a carefree teenager from a Chennai slum who runs away from home in the wake of his mother’s death, gets recruited into a local gang and quickly evolves into the dreaded, psychotic right-hand man of a dirty politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDHgRk7Q0YjpXennMPUXpZrB1gQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69520'),
  ('609746864243638033', 'Pueblerina', 1949, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emilio Fernández, Gabriel Figueroa, Felipe Palomino', 'Emilio Fernández', 'Columba Domínguez, Roberto Cañedo, Arturo Soto Rangel, Manuel Dondé, Ismael Pérez ''Poncianito'', Luis Aceves Castañeda, Guillermo Cramer, Enriqueta Reza', null, 'Aurelio Rodríguez is released from jail, and tries to start a new life by marrying Paloma and working his land. But the local landowners, the brothers González, interfere with his plans.', 'Aurelio Rodríguez is released from jail, and tries to start a new life by marrying Paloma and working his land. But the local landowners, the brothers González, interfere with his plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFQmJaRjM61JZUTMO3NDoB88mhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116588'),
  ('583127932442303391', 'Pueblo Pluto', 1949, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'Mickey goes into a souvenir shop out west and leaves Pluto with a buffalo bone to chew on. A small dog comes to take it away and runs into a ring of cactus with it; Pluto is too big to enter the same way, so he comes in from above and finds himself stuck inside until the small dog helps.', 'Mickey goes into a souvenir shop out west and leaves Pluto with a buffalo bone to chew on. A small dog comes to take it away and runs into a ring of cactus with it; Pluto is too big to enter the same way, so he comes in from above and finds himself stuck inside until the small dog helps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTkrmqK0PCJJtm3z6jyTXG7RFbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115683'),
  ('418305055856181901', 'Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie -Walpurgisnacht: Rising-', 2026, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Yukihiro Miyamoto, Akiyuki Shinbo', 'Gen Urobuchi', 'Aoi Yuuki, Chiwa Saito, Kaori Mizuhashi, Eri Kitamura, Ai Nonaka, Kana Asumi, Emiri Kato', null, 'After the events of Rebellion, the world appears to be in balance—but that peace is fragile. As a new threat connected to Walpurgisnacht emerges, Homura Akemi is forced to face the consequences of her choices and question how far she is willing to go to protect Madoka.', 'After the events of Rebellion, the world appears to be in balance—but that peace is fragile. As a new threat connected to Walpurgisnacht emerges, Homura Akemi is forced to face the consequences of her choices and question how far she is willing to go to protect Madoka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4kCd4rMuN7G3VQQDUT6mLbrBqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:822653'),
  ('726143778099939160', 'Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part I: Beginnings', 2012, 'Thriller, Animation, Fantasy', 'Takahiro Sasaki, Yukihiro Miyamoto, Akiyuki Shinbo', 'Gen Urobuchi', 'Aoi Yuuki, Chiwa Saito, Eri Kitamura, Kaori Mizuhashi, Ai Nonaka, Emiri Kato, Ryoko Shintani, Yuko Goto', 'PG-13', 'Madoka Kaname, an ordinary middle-schooler, along with her best friend Sayaka Miki, are offered the chance to have any wish they want granted by the mysterious Kyubey, and become magical girls and fight witches. However, fellow magical girl Homura Akemi seems intent on stopping Madoka from becoming a magical girl at any cost. Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part I: Beginnings is a retelling of the first half of the TV anime series.', 'Madoka Kaname, an ordinary middle-schooler, along with her best friend Sayaka Miki, are offered the chance to have any wish they want granted by the mysterious Kyubey, and become magical girls and fight witches. However, fellow magical girl Homura Akemi seems intent on stopping Madoka from becoming a magical girl at any cost. Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part I: Beginnings is a retelling of the first half of the TV anime series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJjtXLRR1mV7kEUuSnCKDEmN94G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152042'),
  ('580199725959124253', 'Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part II: Eternal', 2012, 'Thriller, Animation, Fantasy', 'Yukihiro Miyamoto, Tomonari Suzuki, Erika Kawashima', 'Gen Urobuchi', 'Aoi Yuuki, Chiwa Saito, Eri Kitamura, Kaori Mizuhashi, Ai Nonaka, Emiri Kato, Ryoko Shintani, Yuko Goto', 'PG-13', 'As the young girls have discovered the truth about the cruel fate of a magical girl, one magical girl after another is destroyed. Throughout it all, there is one magical girl who continues to fight alone - Homura Akemi. Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part II: Eternal is a retelling of the second half of the TV anime series.', 'As the young girls have discovered the truth about the cruel fate of a magical girl, one magical girl after another is destroyed. Throughout it all, there is one magical girl who continues to fight alone - Homura Akemi. Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part II: Eternal is a retelling of the second half of the TV anime series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPrVi40JAScg92zKEpOQPHmYrZs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152044'),
  ('231871086591333190', 'Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part III: Rebellion', 2013, 'Mystery, Animation, Fantasy', 'Junichiro Taniguchi, Erika Kawashima, Yukihiro Miyamoto', 'Gen Urobuchi', 'Aoi Yuuki, Chiwa Saito, Eri Kitamura, Kaori Mizuhashi, Ai Nonaka, Kana Asumi, Emiri Kato, Yuko Goto', null, 'Following Madoka''s rewriting of the universe, sacrificing herself and her happy normal days to save all magical girls from the cruel fate that awaited them by wiping witches out of existence, the despair still manifest into creatures known as nightmares. Magical girl Homura Akemi continues to fight alone in the hope that she will be able to see Madoka smile again.', 'Following Madoka''s rewriting of the universe, sacrificing herself and her happy normal days to save all magical girls from the cruel fate that awaited them by wiping witches out of existence, the despair still manifest into creatures known as nightmares. Magical girl Homura Akemi continues to fight alone in the hope that she will be able to see Madoka smile again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68cts97TtCXcAlimoAHrHlQUNfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212162'),
  ('131895710905469516', 'Puente de coplas', 1965, 'Drama, Music', 'Santos Alcocer', 'Santos Alcocer, Manuel Atalaya, Félix Atalaya', 'Manuel Atalaya, Ángela Bravo, Aurora de Alba, Manuel de Juan, Antonio Molina, Rafael Farina, Sun de Sanders, Maruja Tamayo', null, 'Antonio and Rafael Lorca, two brothers with very different characters. Antonio returned to his farm after having made ​​a career as a singer in Latin America. Meanwhile, all these years has been to Rafael parental care and its fields and farms. When he returned to Spain Antonio realizes that Rafael is preparing his wedding with Carmen, the woman with whom he had always been in love.', 'Antonio and Rafael Lorca, two brothers with very different characters. Antonio returned to his farm after having made ​​a career as a singer in Latin America. Meanwhile, all these years has been to Rafael parental care and its fields and farms. When he returned to Spain Antonio realizes that Rafael is preparing his wedding with Carmen, the woman with whom he had always been in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBM8KSPZI60xzVXH1z0jTsLuCda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116886'),
  ('254408384895993840', 'Puerto Escondido', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Fabio Scamoni, Italo Petriccione', 'Enzo Monteleone, Diego Abatantuono, Gabriele Salvatores', 'Diego Abatantuono, Valeria Golino, Claudio Bisio, Antonio Catania, Renato Carpentieri, Elena Callegari, Leonardo Gajo, Corinna Agustoni', null, 'Targeted by a dirty cop after witnessing a murder, bank clerk Mario flees to Puerto Escondido, Mexico, where a couple of oddball Italian expats drags him into a journey of self-discovery and bad decisions.', 'Targeted by a dirty cop after witnessing a murder, bank clerk Mario flees to Puerto Escondido, Mexico, where a couple of oddball Italian expats drags him into a journey of self-discovery and bad decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5u3IX4yee6o46SkYdYGHBOIO0EH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46028'),
  ('1038773068658482188', 'Puerto Vallarta Squeeze', 2004, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Arthur Allan Seidelman, Chuy Chávez', 'Robert James Waller', 'Scott Glenn, Harvey Keitel, Craig Wasson, Giovanna Zacarías, Jonathan Brandis, Patrick David, Austin Miller, Will Collyer', null, 'An American government hit man on the run makes a pact with two travelers to help him disappear in the Mexican jungle.', 'An American government hit man on the run makes a pact with two travelers to help him disappear in the Mexican jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3u4uYQRksPpmvj1P1fdSqlY2Ez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34995'),
  ('776818488361708803', 'Puff, Puff, Pass', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Mekhi Phifer, Arthur Albert', 'Kent George, Ronnie Warner', 'Ronnie Warner, Danny Masterson, Mekhi Phifer, Ashley Scott, Terry Crews, Jason Stuart, LaVan Davis, Constance Marie', 'R', 'Danny Masterson (TV''s ''That ''70s Show'') leads a hilarious ensemble cast in a tale about two hapless stoners who get involved in a scheme to rip off a shady character named Mr. Big after the duo sours on rehab.', 'Danny Masterson (TV''s ''That ''70s Show'') leads a hilarious ensemble cast in a tale about two hapless stoners who get involved in a scheme to rip off a shady character named Mr. Big after the duo sours on rehab.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buDnPO63q8yjQGWQ1pFbjaRDeGQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24701'),
  ('837339782955314255', 'Puff, the Magic Dragon', 1978, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Charles Swenson, Fred Wolf', null, 'Burgess Meredith, Philip Tanzini, Peter Yarrow, Maitzi Morgan, Robert Ridgely, Regis Cordic, Frank Nelson, Charles Woolf', null, 'Jackie is a boy who is so trapped by his fears and doubts that he could not communicate with anyone. Then, a magic dragon named Puff comes to help Jackie by taking his soul force on a wonderous voyage to his island of Honah Lee. Along the way, they have adventures that nurture Jackie''s imagination and courage in unorthodox ways.', 'Jackie is a boy who is so trapped by his fears and doubts that he could not communicate with anyone. Then, a magic dragon named Puff comes to help Jackie by taking his soul force on a wonderous voyage to his island of Honah Lee. Along the way, they have adventures that nurture Jackie''s imagination and courage in unorthodox ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urxNw4gkTBZXmwuRo7yHSipCQjs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20183'),
  ('732983072562165540', 'Puff: Wonders of the Reef', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Nick Robinson, Pete West', 'Nick Robinson, Peta Ayers', 'Rose Byrne', 'PG', 'A baby pufferfish travels through a wondrous microworld full of fantastical creatures as he searches for a home on the Great Barrier Reef.', 'A baby pufferfish travels through a wondrous microworld full of fantastical creatures as he searches for a home on the Great Barrier Reef.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jW7VXaI955lIfegDlB0F5OShbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890601'),
  ('459489925972643598', 'Pufnstuf', 1970, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Hollingsworth Morse, Kenneth Peach, Chuck Colean', 'John Fenton Murray, Si Rose', 'Jack Wild, Billie Hayes, Martha Raye, Cass Elliot, Allan Melvin, Walker Edmiston, Don Messick, Roberto Gamonet', 'G', 'Jimmy (Jack Wild) ventures to Living Island with his magical, talking flute, Freddy. Once there, he befriends many of the island''s inhabitants, but the evil Witchiepoo (Billie Hayes) is determined to steal Freddy the flute away from the boy to impress the visiting Witches'' Council and win the Witch of the Year Award.', 'Jimmy (Jack Wild) ventures to Living Island with his magical, talking flute, Freddy. Once there, he befriends many of the island''s inhabitants, but the evil Witchiepoo (Billie Hayes) is determined to steal Freddy the flute away from the boy to impress the visiting Witches'' Council and win the Witch of the Year Award.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLmGDjivlcIbrQUS3NQ0xkjOqda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63859'),
  ('23419401410392861', 'Pukar', 2000, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, Santosh Sivan, Chota K. Naidu', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, Anjum Rajabali', 'Anil Kapoor, Madhuri Dixit, Danny Denzongpa, Namrata Shirodkar, Sudhir Joshi, Farida Jalal, Girish Karnad, Om Puri', null, 'Major Jaidev saves a politician from the clutches of a dreaded terrorist. However, the terrorist joins hands with his childhood friend Anjali to ruin his life.', 'Major Jaidev saves a politician from the clutches of a dreaded terrorist. However, the terrorist joins hands with his childhood friend Anjali to ruin his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CYvGwb1hmIQcBWjfpec599v7X4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41381'),
  ('753194881125510085', 'Pulgasari', 1985, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Shin Sang-ok, Chong Gon Jo, Jo Myong Hyon', 'Kim Se-Ryun', 'Chang Son Hui, Ham Gi Sop, Jong-uk Ri, Gwon Ri, Gyong-Ae Yu, Hye-chol Ro, Riyonun Ri, Kenpachirō Satsuma', null, 'In feudal Korea, a group of starving villagers grow weary of the orders handed down to them by their controlling king and set out to use a deadly monster under their control to push his armies back.', 'In feudal Korea, a group of starving villagers grow weary of the orders handed down to them by their controlling king and set out to use a deadly monster under their control to push his armies back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dp558lNk5iF3t9Pl08C22inVwXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26974'),
  ('6213021259781314', 'Pulimurugan', 2016, 'Action, Adventure', 'Vysakh, Shaji Padoor, Shaji Kumar', 'Uday Krishna', 'Mohanlal, Jagapati Babu, Lal, Vinu Mohan, Bala, Suraj Venjaramoodu, Kishore, Kamalinee Mukherjee', null, 'Murugan, with his tools and expertise, protects Puliyoor''s villagers from deadly tiger attacks. However, Daddy, an illegal drugs dealer, takes advantage of Murugan''s innocence and wrongly frames him.', 'Murugan, with his tools and expertise, protects Puliyoor''s villagers from deadly tiger attacks. However, Daddy, an illegal drugs dealer, takes advantage of Murugan''s innocence and wrongly frames him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onl4KNQ9Bso4sNRb3uM6RkRcVuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353501'),
  ('162062494641182169', 'Pull My Daisy', 1959, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Frank, Alfred Leslie', 'Jack Kerouac', 'Jack Kerouac, Allen Ginsberg, Gregory Corso, Peter Orlovsky, Larry Rivers, David Amram, Richard Bellamy, Alice Neel', null, 'Based on an incident in the life of Beat icon Neal Cassady and his wife, the painter Carolyn, the film tells the story of a railway brakeman whose wife invites a respected bishop over for dinner. However, the brakeman''s Bohemian friends crash the party, with comic results. Pull My Daisy is a film that typifies the Beat Generation. Directed by Robert Frank and Alfred Leslie, Daisy was adapted by Jack Kerouac from the third act of his play, Beat Generation; Kerouac also provided improvised narration.', 'Based on an incident in the life of Beat icon Neal Cassady and his wife, the painter Carolyn, the film tells the story of a railway brakeman whose wife invites a respected bishop over for dinner. However, the brakeman''s Bohemian friends crash the party, with comic results. Pull My Daisy is a film that typifies the Beat Generation. Directed by Robert Frank and Alfred Leslie, Daisy was adapted by Jack Kerouac from the third act of his play, Beat Generation; Kerouac also provided improvised narration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4yv7otvm9W1Os0YJbZxQOwMKlH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64204'),
  ('747712707723145201', 'Pullet Surprise', 1997, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Darrell Van Citters', null, 'Frank Gorshin, Stan Freberg', null, 'Pete Puma is trying to raid the henhouse Foghorn Leghorn is guarding; Foggy decides to have some fun with Pete.', 'Pete Puma is trying to raid the henhouse Foghorn Leghorn is guarding; Foggy decides to have some fun with Pete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jp5esB0T3ajD7u5jr37J9Fw1OT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50219'),
  ('887395616988925640', 'Pulling Strings', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pedro Pablo Ibarra, Fido Pérez-Gavilán', 'Issa López, Georgina Riedel, Oscar Orlando Torres', 'Jaime Camil, Omar Chaparro, Laura Ramsey, Renata Ybarra, Stockard Channing, Tom Arnold, Roberto Sosa, Carlos Macias', 'PG', 'Rachel is an intelligent, modern-day woman constantly on the move. Primarily focused on her career as a diplomatic consul for the U.S. embassy, she''s literally lived her life on the move, globe-trotting from city to city. Currently working in Mexico City and set to leave for London, Rachel''s world turns upside down on the eve of her own goodbye party when she gets drunk and passes out on the street. Saved by Alejandro, a handsome Mariachi singer and single father, Rachel wakes up in his apartment with no recollection of how she got there. Nor does she remember that she rejected his visa the day before, which he desperately needs for his daughter. Romance unexpectedly blossoms between the two, but either sparks or fists will fly after she finds out his secret.', 'Rachel is an intelligent, modern-day woman constantly on the move. Primarily focused on her career as a diplomatic consul for the U.S. embassy, she''s literally lived her life on the move, globe-trotting from city to city. Currently working in Mexico City and set to leave for London, Rachel''s world turns upside down on the eve of her own goodbye party when she gets drunk and passes out on the street. Saved by Alejandro, a handsome Mariachi singer and single father, Rachel wakes up in his apartment with no recollection of how she got there. Nor does she remember that she rejected his visa the day before, which he desperately needs for his daughter. Romance unexpectedly blossoms between the two, but either sparks or fists will fly after she finds out his secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCXpl44L4cd4SeZ3YeooPeGcd2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219553'),
  ('860439384564443462', 'Pullman', 2020, 'Drama, Adventure, Family', 'Toni Bestard, Edu Biurrun', 'Toni Bestard, Arturo Ruiz Serrano', null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rz0pyeH7viM0hV0GrsFbyWbyL0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695848'),
  ('210150505450481524', 'Pulp', 1972, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Mike Hodges, Michael Dryhurst, Ousama Rawi', 'Mike Hodges', 'Michael Caine, Mickey Rooney, Lionel Stander, Lizabeth Scott, Nadia Cassini, Dennis Price, Al Lettieri, Leopoldo Trieste', null, 'A seedy writer of sleazy pulp novels is recruited by a quirky, reclusive ex-actor to help him write his biography at his house in Malta.', 'A seedy writer of sleazy pulp novels is recruited by a quirky, reclusive ex-actor to help him write his biography at his house in Malta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNy4WK1pJFmOU1McKzNihyvuAWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28131'),
  ('287552974056507209', 'Pulp Fiction', 1994, 'Thriller, Crime, Comedy', 'Andrzej Sekula, Samantha Gore, Francis R. Mahony III', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'John Travolta, Samuel L. Jackson, Uma Thurman, Bruce Willis, Ving Rhames, Harvey Keitel, Eric Stoltz, Tim Roth', 'R', 'A burger-loving hit man, his philosophical partner, a drug-addled gangster''s moll and a washed-up boxer converge in this sprawling, comedic crime caper. Their adventures unfurl in three stories that ingeniously trip back and forth in time.', 'A burger-loving hit man, his philosophical partner, a drug-addled gangster''s moll and a washed-up boxer converge in this sprawling, comedic crime caper. Their adventures unfurl in three stories that ingeniously trip back and forth in time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQWk5YBFWF4bZaofAbv0tShwBvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680'),
  ('305368093043253271', 'Pulse', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Peter Lyons Collister, Paul Golding, Mike Topoozian', 'Paul Golding', 'Cliff DeYoung, Roxanne Hart, Joey Lawrence, Matthew Lawrence, Charles Tyner, Dennis Redfield, Robert Romanus, Myron Healey', 'PG-13', 'An intelligent pulse of electricity moves from house to house, terrorizing occupants through their own appliances. Having already destroyed one household in a quiet neighborhood, the pulse finds itself in the home of a boy and his divorced father.', 'An intelligent pulse of electricity moves from house to house, terrorizing occupants through their own appliances. Having already destroyed one household in a quiet neighborhood, the pulse finds itself in the home of a boy and his divorced father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esPbTOwiuKzNI8o20fxfRCdjK9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32033'),
  ('350475818564728385', 'Pulse', 2001, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Makio Ika, Yoshihisa Kato', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Kumiko Aso, Haruhiko Kato, Koyuki, Kurume Arisaka, Masatoshi Matsuo, Shinji Takeda, Kenji Mizuhashi, Shun Sugata', 'R', 'In the immense city of Tokyo, the darkness of the afterlife lures some of its inhabitants desperately trying to escape the sadness and isolation of the modern world.', 'In the immense city of Tokyo, the darkness of the afterlife lures some of its inhabitants desperately trying to escape the sadness and isolation of the modern world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3zEimDraIyMSasPMGDaNOrhnzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27324'),
  ('354660242166507345', 'Pulse', 2006, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery, Drama', 'Jim Sonzero, Mark Plummer', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Kristen Bell, Ian Somerhalder, Christina Milian, Rick Gonzalez, Jonathan Tucker, Samm Levine, Octavia Spencer, Ron Rifkin', 'PG-13', 'When the dead discover a means to contact the living through electronic devices, cellphones and computers become open gateways to monstrosities and destruction.', 'When the dead discover a means to contact the living through electronic devices, cellphones and computers become open gateways to monstrosities and destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ePdNzKVvGHsMMphfS3HeoMvuEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9682'),
  ('760661529643000456', 'Pulse', 2021, 'Drama', 'Serhii Chebotarenko, Yurii Korol', 'Yaroslav Voytseshek, Maksym Chernysh', 'Nataliia Babenko, Viktoriia Levchenko, Oleksandr Kobzar, Nataliia Dolia, Liliia Rebryk, Akhtem Seitablaiev, Roman Yasinovskyi, Maksym Samchyk', null, 'As a result of a terrible car accident, young Ukrainian athlete Oksana Boturchuk suffers several serious injuries, almost losing her eyesight. However, after long rehabilitation and a returning to incredible training, she is able to conquer a gold medal at the Paralympic Games in Beijing.', 'As a result of a terrible car accident, young Ukrainian athlete Oksana Boturchuk suffers several serious injuries, almost losing her eyesight. However, after long rehabilitation and a returning to incredible training, she is able to conquer a gold medal at the Paralympic Games in Beijing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6Eqc9s2vzOgXqnQPa4XkraHyK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608872'),
  ('446205849135655023', 'Pulse 2: Afterlife', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joel Soisson, Brandon Trost', 'Joel Soisson', 'Jamie Bamber, Georgina Rylance, Karley Scott Collins, Boti Bliss, Todd Giebenhain, Lee Garlington, Diane Ayala Goldner, Dodie Brown', 'R', 'The world has been reshaped by the invasion of ghosts via the wireless internet. Cities are deserted, technology has been destroyed and the few remaining human beings eschew anything electrical in order to avoid a confrontation with the soulless ghosts that now wander the planet. Most of the ghosts are doomed to a repetitive loop of something they did while they were still despairing humans (a man repeatedly hangs himself, for example), but there are some ghosts so locked in denial, they do not know they are dead. They continue to haunt their homes, wrapped in fear that their souls will soon be torn from them.', 'The world has been reshaped by the invasion of ghosts via the wireless internet. Cities are deserted, technology has been destroyed and the few remaining human beings eschew anything electrical in order to avoid a confrontation with the soulless ghosts that now wander the planet. Most of the ghosts are doomed to a repetitive loop of something they did while they were still despairing humans (a man repeatedly hangs himself, for example), but there are some ghosts so locked in denial, they do not know they are dead. They continue to haunt their homes, wrapped in fear that their souls will soon be torn from them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0SGvrvvTlGosfA16yPmp4HpfWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14212'),
  ('690851277601836448', 'Pulse 3', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joel Soisson, Brandon Trost', 'Joel Soisson', 'Rider Strong, Noureen DeWulf, Karley Scott Collins, Brittany Finamore, Georgina Rylance, Todd Giebenhain, Diane Ayala Goldner, William Prael', 'R', 'Seven years after the last attack by the "soulless ghosts" who haunted the human race twice before, the world is left void of all deadly electronics that almost destroyed it... or so we thought. Living a primitive existence on the outskirts of the city, human survivors are surviving without any trace of technology. That is until 16 year old Justine enters the city and, letting her curiosity get the best of her, opens a working laptop and unknowingly unleashes the most terrifying attack the survivors have ever faced. In a world already torn and without hope, can humanity make it through the toughest struggle of all time?', 'Seven years after the last attack by the "soulless ghosts" who haunted the human race twice before, the world is left void of all deadly electronics that almost destroyed it... or so we thought. Living a primitive existence on the outskirts of the city, human survivors are surviving without any trace of technology. That is until 16 year old Justine enters the city and, letting her curiosity get the best of her, opens a working laptop and unknowingly unleashes the most terrifying attack the survivors have ever faced. In a world already torn and without hope, can humanity make it through the toughest struggle of all time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBETskWqWuaqniogjdBqTMDNZ2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14255'),
  ('753472114104736959', 'Pulse Pounders', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Charles Band, Mac Ahlberg', 'Michael Cassutt, Danny Bilson, Paul De Meo', 'Richard Moll, Jeffrey Byron, David Gale, Velvet Rhodes, Helen Hunt, David Warner, Barbara Crampton, Jeffrey Combs', null, 'In this ''sequel'' anthology, the film offers a TRANCERS sequel written by original creators Danny Bilson and Paul DeMeo, a new Lovecraft adaptation THE EVIL CLERGYMAN, featuring Jeffrey Combs and Barbara Crampton, and finally a sequel to THE DUNGEONMASTER.', 'In this ''sequel'' anthology, the film offers a TRANCERS sequel written by original creators Danny Bilson and Paul DeMeo, a new Lovecraft adaptation THE EVIL CLERGYMAN, featuring Jeffrey Combs and Barbara Crampton, and finally a sequel to THE DUNGEONMASTER.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdmFH3crqUwl2SubqOCDJUoUepF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199347'),
  ('91557601493484964', 'Pumaman', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Alberto De Martino, Mario Vulpiani, Claudio Marson', 'Luigi Angelo, Massimo De Rita', 'Walter George Alton, Donald Pleasence, Miguel Ángel Fuentes, Sydne Rome, Silvano Tranquilli, Benito Stefanelli, Guido Lollobrigida, Peter Cellier', null, 'Thousands of years ago, aliens visited Earth and fathered the Pumaman, a man-god with supernatural powers entrusted by a gold mask with the ability to control people''s minds, which in present-day London, falls into the wrong hands.', 'Thousands of years ago, aliens visited Earth and fathered the Pumaman, a man-god with supernatural powers entrusted by a gold mask with the ability to control people''s minds, which in present-day London, falls into the wrong hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cmJeLWhqezudWa168KKy4REFbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31278'),
  ('718110862270881480', 'Pump Up the Volume', 1990, 'Music, Drama', 'Allan Moyle, Walt Lloyd, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Allan Moyle', 'Christian Slater, Samantha Mathis, Annie Ross, Scott Paulin, Mimi Kennedy, Andy Romano, Keith Stuart Thayer, Cheryl Pollak', 'R', 'Mark Hunter, a lonely high school student, uses his shortwave radio to moonlight as the popular pirate DJ "Hard Harry." When his show gets blamed for a teen committing suicide, the students clash with high school faculty and the authorities.', 'Mark Hunter, a lonely high school student, uses his shortwave radio to moonlight as the popular pirate DJ "Hard Harry." When his show gets blamed for a teen committing suicide, the students clash with high school faculty and the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1SyKrARJG2R7FyS4zkNdaekLAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8428'),
  ('130524053485729520', 'Pumping Iron', 1977, 'Documentary', 'George Butler, Robert Fiore, Robert Fiore', 'Charles Gaines, George Butler', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Lou Ferrigno, Mike Katz, Serge Nubret, Franco Columbu, Ed Corney, Ken Waller, Robbie Robinson', 'PG', 'Amateur and professional bodybuilders prepare for the 1975 Mr. Olympia and Mr. Universe contests as five-time champion Arnold Schwarzenegger defends his Mr. Olympia title against Serge Nubret and the shy young Lou Ferrigno.', 'Amateur and professional bodybuilders prepare for the 1975 Mr. Olympia and Mr. Universe contests as five-time champion Arnold Schwarzenegger defends his Mr. Olympia title against Serge Nubret and the shy young Lou Ferrigno.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24bh2SaydGoP9Jsi7eP2TkWGkLd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5205'),
  ('25827064339419387', 'Pumping Iron II: The Women', 1985, 'Documentary', 'George Butler, Dyanna Taylor', 'George Butler', 'Rachel McLish, Cory Everson, Gladys Portugues, Lori Birdsong, Bev Francis, Carla Dunlap, Steve Michalik, Steven Mark', 'NR', 'PUMPING IRON II: THE WOMEN, a film that is changing the way the world views the female physique-creating "a new definition of the female form." Join four women as they prepare for the 1983 Caesars Palace World Cup Championship: the sultry and curvaceous Rachel McLish, the current champion; the super-muscular Bev Francis, Rachel''s toughest competition; and newcomers Lori Bowen and Carla Dunlap.', 'PUMPING IRON II: THE WOMEN, a film that is changing the way the world views the female physique-creating "a new definition of the female form." Join four women as they prepare for the 1983 Caesars Palace World Cup Championship: the sultry and curvaceous Rachel McLish, the current champion; the super-muscular Bev Francis, Rachel''s toughest competition; and newcomers Lori Bowen and Carla Dunlap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWX3HkarmmIEFfTVmFuMBF15bE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164753'),
  ('495632733243570898', 'Pumpkin', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Adam Larson Broder, Anthony Abrams, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Adam Larson Broder', 'Christina Ricci, Hank Harris, Brenda Blethyn, Dominique Swain, Marisa Coughlan, Sam Ball, Harry Lennix, Nina Foch', 'R', 'Carolyn''s sorority sisters set their sights on the Sorority of the Year award and coaching challenged athletes is their ticket to the trophy. But when the queen of formals finds herself mentoring Pumpkin, a disabled athlete, their two worlds collide.', 'Carolyn''s sorority sisters set their sights on the Sorority of the Year award and coaching challenged athletes is their ticket to the trophy. But when the queen of formals finds herself mentoring Pumpkin, a disabled athlete, their two worlds collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25qW6cO2zqYBpqTw8BBIhBIUpl4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9719'),
  ('1064425197597346432', 'Pumpkin and Mayonnaise', 2017, 'Drama', 'Masanori Tominaga, Yuta Tsukinaga', 'Kiriko Nananan', 'Asami Usuda, Taiga Nakano, Joe Odagiri, Ken Mitsuishi, Kurumi Shimizu, Kodai Asaka, Ryuya Wakaba, Sario Okada', null, 'A struggling, unemployed musician living with his girlfriend looks to improve his life after he discovers how she''s been paying the rent.', 'A struggling, unemployed musician living with his girlfriend looks to improve his life after he discovers how she''s been paying the rent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKbqJ3fN9Sk9Q4NYKBRTIN3ilK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460118'),
  ('718774542543423963', 'Pumpkin Everything', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Matt Schween, Devin Keefe, Jeff Beesley', 'Paul Ditty', 'Taylor Cole, Corey Sevier, Michael Ironside, Amy Groening, Paul Essiembre, Paula Boudreau, Dutchess Cayetano, Rachael McLaren', 'G', 'Amy is a novelist who returns to her hometown to look after her stubborn grandfather, Tom, and his pumpkin-themed store. While there, she crosses paths with a man from her past.', 'Amy is a novelist who returns to her hometown to look after her stubborn grandfather, Tom, and his pumpkin-themed store. While there, she crosses paths with a man from her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfuocAC2EuJ5XtAGKhysSO2J00C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020481'),
  ('118606482630763412', 'Pumpkin Pie Wars', 2016, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Steven R. Monroe, Eric J. Goldstein, Johanne Michel', 'Nina Weinman', 'Julie Gonzalo, Rico Aragon, Michele Scarabelli, Jennifer Juniper Angeli, Peter Graham-Gaudreau, Janet Glassford, Dolores Drake, Rhonda Dent', 'G', 'Competing bakery owners, Faye McKenzie and Lydia Harper have been feuding for years with the Lake Shore County Harvest Festival’s annual pumpkin pie bake-off at the center of it all. The winner not only gets bragging rights and a trophy, but a substantial boost to her business, as well. This year, however, the women are passing the torch to their respective children, Casey and Sam, and when romantic sparks fly between them, this bake-off promises to be one to remember.', 'Competing bakery owners, Faye McKenzie and Lydia Harper have been feuding for years with the Lake Shore County Harvest Festival’s annual pumpkin pie bake-off at the center of it all. The winner not only gets bragging rights and a trophy, but a substantial boost to her business, as well. This year, however, the women are passing the torch to their respective children, Casey and Sam, and when romantic sparks fly between them, this bake-off promises to be one to remember.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Cf1XSafdv5t4reOV3FrVvi9PIb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413440'),
  ('14083324326169703', 'Pumpkinhead', 1988, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Stan Winston, Bojan Bazelli, Christine Larson', 'Gary Gerani, Mark Patrick Carducci', 'Lance Henriksen, Jeff East, John D''Aquino, Cynthia Bain, Kerry Remsen, Joel Hoffman, Kimberly Ross, Florence Schauffler', 'R', 'When a group of teenagers inadvertently kill his only son, Ed Harley seeks the powers of a backwoods witch to bring the child back to life.', 'When a group of teenagers inadvertently kill his only son, Ed Harley seeks the powers of a backwoods witch to bring the child back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gx7Gej5Srp3E13oqy1Kghtox2VZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26515'),
  ('277677808028431977', 'Pumpkinhead II: Blood Wings', 1995, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Jeff Burr, Bill Dill, Eric B. Sindon', 'Constantine Chachornia, Ivan Chachornia', 'Ami Dolenz, Andrew Robinson, Soleil Moon Frye, Steve Kanaly, J. Trevor Edmond, Gloria Hendry, Caren Kaye, Linnea Quigley', 'R', 'Thrill-seeking teenagers resurrect a demon from his grave and a bloody rampage for revenge begins.', 'Thrill-seeking teenagers resurrect a demon from his grave and a bloody rampage for revenge begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZIoluMNFq1KfMc4gJH0LLXxueq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35977'),
  ('327192305264128238', 'Pumpkinhead: Ashes to Ashes', 2006, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Jake West, Erik Wilson', 'John Werner', 'Doug Bradley, Lance Henriksen, Douglas Roberts, Tess Panzer, Lisa McAllister, Lynne Verrall, Philip Bowen, Emanuel Pârvu', 'R', 'He threw their loved ones into a swamp. Now they want revenge... But when a demon does their dirty work, it comes at a price.', 'He threw their loved ones into a swamp. Now they want revenge... But when a demon does their dirty work, it comes at a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qN5g3lrljKFEhXAAjAEHQuFfWAo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35978'),
  ('3148153755526969', 'Pumpkinhead: Blood Feud', 2007, 'Horror, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Michael Hurst, Erik Wilson, Oana Ene', 'Michael Hurst', 'Lance Henriksen, Rob Freeman, Amy Manson, Bradley Taylor, Richard Durden, Lynne Verrall, Claire Lams, Peter Barnes', 'R', 'During a bitter family feud, Jodie Hatfield, and her boyfriend Ricky McCoy, decide to leave town to avoid being found out, but are soon caught in the act. Wanting vengeance, he seeks out the monster Pumpkinhead, and resurrects it seek revenge on the family. Despite being warned away by the ghost of Ed Harley, his vengeance plan starts out, and the Hatfield family is soon under siege by the powerful demon. Not accepting the legend of the creature and believing their arch-rivals are the real cause, the two families attempt to go to war, only to be stopped when Pumpkinhead attacks the Hatfield house. Putting aside their differences, they band together to stave off the creature before it''s vengeance pact is completed.', 'During a bitter family feud, Jodie Hatfield, and her boyfriend Ricky McCoy, decide to leave town to avoid being found out, but are soon caught in the act. Wanting vengeance, he seeks out the monster Pumpkinhead, and resurrects it seek revenge on the family. Despite being warned away by the ghost of Ed Harley, his vengeance plan starts out, and the Hatfield family is soon under siege by the powerful demon. Not accepting the legend of the creature and believing their arch-rivals are the real cause, the two families attempt to go to war, only to be stopped when Pumpkinhead attacks the Hatfield house. Putting aside their differences, they band together to stave off the creature before it''s vengeance pact is completed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beh3X6LZKd7kai0RaxqeiP5WHHy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35979'),
  ('969373214171865238', 'Pumuckl and the Big Misunderstanding', 2025, 'Family, Comedy', 'Marcus H. Rosenmüller, Stefan Biebl', 'Korbinian Dufter, Matthias Pacht', 'Florian Brückner, Maximilian Schafroth, Matthias Bundschuh, Robert Palfrader, Stella Goritzki, David Zimmerschied, Mira Huber, Moritz Katzmair', null, 'This summer, Pumuckl and Eder have a lot going on: a turtle, a trip to the countryside and then neighbor Burke''s birthday! Perhaps too much - because with so many events going on, the two of them are barely able to maintain their friendship. And when a big misunderstanding arises, everything changes between Eder and Pumuckl...', 'This summer, Pumuckl and Eder have a lot going on: a turtle, a trip to the countryside and then neighbor Burke''s birthday! Perhaps too much - because with so many events going on, the two of them are barely able to maintain their friendship. And when a big misunderstanding arises, everything changes between Eder and Pumuckl...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctRbBJ35laTEuLnEi6Qj3etxs65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290937'),
  ('21790410749332040', 'Punch', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Han, Cho Yong-kyu, Jeon Byeong-yun', 'Kim Dong-woo', 'Yoo Ah-in, Kim Yun-seok, Park Soo-young, Lee Jasmine, Kim Young-jae, An Kil-kang, Park Hyo-ju, Kang Byul', null, 'A deadbeat teacher helps an angry, aimless teenager find direction in life during his final year of high school.', 'A deadbeat teacher helps an angry, aimless teenager find direction in life during his final year of high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO5IOFRHOIECJEdYIjP5my2OZSg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91078'),
  ('904691359845330209', 'Punch', 2022, 'Drama', 'Welby Ings, Matt Henley', 'Welby Ings', 'Tim Roth, Jordan Oosterhof, Conan Hayes, Abigail Laurent, Karl Willetts, Connor Johnston, Matt Hicks, Simon McConnon', null, 'Seventeen-year old Jim is a small-town boxing hero who carries the hopes and dreams of his father Stan on his shoulders. His growing relationship with local takatāpui Māori boy, Whetu, forces him to confront the truth about his sexuality, and choose his own future.', 'Seventeen-year old Jim is a small-town boxing hero who carries the hopes and dreams of his father Stan on his shoulders. His growing relationship with local takatāpui Māori boy, Whetu, forces him to confront the truth about his sexuality, and choose his own future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KvyFkSsjKC5FjSOYcgFQ0xGdor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942802'),
  ('801256546618526391', 'Punch and Judy', 1906, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A group of people watches a guignol (the French version of a Punch and Judy show). Outtake from a longer, now lost, film.', 'A group of people watches a guignol (the French version of a Punch and Judy show). Outtake from a longer, now lost, film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/447lbvy8DYiOWjglJkFpy1BM8b3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196338'),
  ('947371315637285159', 'Punch and Judy', 1966, 'Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Jiří Šafář', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Naděžda Munzarová, Bohuslav Šrámek, Jiří Procházka', null, 'Two puppets, Punch and Judy, do battle to the death over the custody of a live guinea pig.', 'Two puppets, Punch and Judy, do battle to the death over the custody of a live guinea pig.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MyLPubDrN9gVlA92F1QERSBxHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18954'),
  ('36588941932871778', 'Punch Drunks', 1934, 'Comedy', 'Lou Breslow, Henry Freulich', 'Jack Cluett', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Dorothy Granger, Al Hill, Chuck Callahan, Billy Bletcher, Larry McGrath', 'NR', 'Moe discovers Curley''s unknown boxing talent when he knocks out the Champ at a restaurant when Larry plays "Pop Goes the Weasal" on the violin. Moe becomes Curly''s manager, and they win every fight, with the help of Larry. At the championship game, though, Larry''s violin breaks. Curly is getting beat down bad when Larry makes his unexpected entrance and helps Curly prevail.', 'Moe discovers Curley''s unknown boxing talent when he knocks out the Champ at a restaurant when Larry plays "Pop Goes the Weasal" on the violin. Moe becomes Curly''s manager, and they win every fight, with the help of Larry. At the championship game, though, Larry''s violin breaks. Curly is getting beat down bad when Larry makes his unexpected entrance and helps Curly prevail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfcpwOUESEsubTDEHbzLRauMOwx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115039'),
  ('26202342356934408', 'Punch Trunk', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet, Robert C. Bruce, June Foray', null, 'A tiny elephant emerges from a banana boat and wanders about town, causing an uproar among the populace. Sightings are attributed variously to mass hysteria, insanity and dipsomania.', 'A tiny elephant emerges from a banana boat and wanders about town, causing an uproar among the populace. Sightings are attributed variously to mass hysteria, insanity and dipsomania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vU8ik46LgCoXmO8iT7O9SoWUoD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204019'),
  ('144883193200098936', 'Punch-Drunk Love', 2002, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Paul Thomas Anderson, Robert Elswit, Sonia Bhalla', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Adam Sandler, Emily Watson, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Luis Guzmán, Mary Lynn Rajskub, Robert Smigel, Jason Andrews, Don McManus', 'R', 'A socially awkward and volatile small business owner meets the love of his life after being threatened by a gang of scammers.', 'A socially awkward and volatile small business owner meets the love of his life after being threatened by a gang of scammers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htYp4yqFu4rzBEIa6j9jP8miDm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8051'),
  ('96552737544412481', 'Punchline', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Seltzer, Reynaldo Villalobos', 'David Seltzer', 'Sally Field, Tom Hanks, John Goodman, Mark Rydell, Kim Greist, Paul Mazursky, Damon Wayans, Taylor Negron', 'R', 'Lilah Krytsick is a mother and housewife who''s always believed she could be a stand-up comedian. Steven Gold is an experienced stand-up seemingly on the cusp of success. When the two meet, they form an unlikely friendship, and Steven tries to help the untried Lilah develop her stage act. Despite the objections of her family and some very wobbly beginnings, Lilah improves, and soon she finds herself competing with Steven for a coveted television spot.', 'Lilah Krytsick is a mother and housewife who''s always believed she could be a stand-up comedian. Steven Gold is an experienced stand-up seemingly on the cusp of success. When the two meet, they form an unlikely friendship, and Steven tries to help the untried Lilah develop her stage act. Despite the objections of her family and some very wobbly beginnings, Lilah improves, and soon she finds herself competing with Steven for a coveted television spot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgbLnnEJIGldXOMt6OWy3X1l0AC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40820'),
  ('586113566928792227', 'Puncture', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Adam Kassen, Helge Gerull, Mark Kassen', 'Chris Lopata', 'Chris Evans, Mark Kassen, Michael Biehn, Vinessa Shaw, Kate Burton, Brett Cullen, Marshall Bell, Jesse L. Martin', 'R', 'A lawyer who is a drug addict fights a medical-supplies corporation in court while battling his personal demons.', 'A lawyer who is a drug addict fights a medical-supplies corporation in court while battling his personal demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQD8NLW8ZsKHZMx9n7dLHSDgseH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72432'),
  ('661583552936917438', 'Puncture Wounds', 2014, 'Action, Drama', 'James Coyne, Giorgio Serafini, Sam McQueen', 'James Coyne', 'Cung Le, Dolph Lundgren, Vinnie Jones, Gianni Capaldi, Briana Evigan, James C. Burns, Jonathan Kowalsky, Jake Jacobson', 'R', 'After returning home from a traumatic tour of duty in Iraq, John finds himself struggling with PTSD. What little peace he had managed to build around him is shattered one fateful day when he rescues a local call girl from a group of violent Aryan Brotherhood pimps. Having killed several of the high-ranking brotherhood during the rescue, John and his family are now the prime targets of Hollis, the ruthless criminal leader of the group.', 'After returning home from a traumatic tour of duty in Iraq, John finds himself struggling with PTSD. What little peace he had managed to build around him is shattered one fateful day when he rescues a local call girl from a group of violent Aryan Brotherhood pimps. Having killed several of the high-ranking brotherhood during the rescue, John and his family are now the prime targets of Hollis, the ruthless criminal leader of the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwtKX0bf7fCCeBzbCcWELhADTaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252830'),
  ('633643391962019301', 'Punish Me', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Angelina Maccarone, Bernd Meiners', 'Susanne Billig', 'Kostja Ullmann, Maren Kroymann, Moritz Grove, Sıla Şahin, Ada Labahn, Markus Völlenklee, Stephanie Charlotta Koetz, Sophie Rogall', 'NR', 'Angelina Maccarone''s intense drama deals with the obsessive relationship between a confused teenager and an elder woman. Elsa Seifert successfully works as probation officer, but the relationship to her longtime companion is in trouble since their common daughter moved out. Then she gets to know Jan, a 16-years-old offender, who frankly offers to submit himself sexually to her. Although being shocked in the beginning, Elsa gets more and more attracted by the young man...', 'Angelina Maccarone''s intense drama deals with the obsessive relationship between a confused teenager and an elder woman. Elsa Seifert successfully works as probation officer, but the relationship to her longtime companion is in trouble since their common daughter moved out. Then she gets to know Jan, a 16-years-old offender, who frankly offers to submit himself sexually to her. Although being shocked in the beginning, Elsa gets more and more attracted by the young man...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDONHMpVRzd84VZSMg1UmQKTjYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100017'),
  ('876400297300151092', 'Punisher: War Zone', 2008, 'Action, Crime', 'Lexi Alexander, Guy Pigeon, Charlotte Rouleau', 'Matt Holloway, Art Marcum, Nick Santora', 'Ray Stevenson, Dominic West, Julie Benz, Colin Salmon, Doug Hutchison, Dash Mihok, Wayne Knight, Stephanie Janusauskas', 'R', 'Waging his one-man war on the world of organized crime, ruthless vigilante-hero Frank Castle sets his sights on overeager mob boss Billy Russoti. After Russoti is left horribly disfigured by Castle, he sets out for vengeance under his new alias: Jigsaw. With the "Punisher Task Force" hot on his trail and the FBI unable to take Jigsaw in, Frank must stand up to the formidable army that Jigsaw has recruited before more of his evil deeds go unpunished.', 'Waging his one-man war on the world of organized crime, ruthless vigilante-hero Frank Castle sets his sights on overeager mob boss Billy Russoti. After Russoti is left horribly disfigured by Castle, he sets out for vengeance under his new alias: Jigsaw. With the "Punisher Task Force" hot on his trail and the FBI unable to take Jigsaw in, Frank must stand up to the formidable army that Jigsaw has recruited before more of his evil deeds go unpunished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOvKJgYUIpfswGHAdW6159bPbvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13056'),
  ('244731397769818607', 'Punishment Park', 1971, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Peter Watkins, Barry Wilson, Joan Churchill', 'Peter Watkins', 'Patrick Boland, Carmen Argenziano, Kent Foreman, Luke Johnson, Katherine Quittner, Scott Turner, Stan Armsted, Mary Ellen Kleinhall', 'R', 'In this fictional documentary, U.S. prisons are at capacity, and President Nixon declares a state of emergency. All new prisoners, most of whom are connected to the antiwar movement, are now given the choice of jail time or spending three days in Punishment Park, where they will be hunted for sport by federal authorities. The prisoners invariably choose the latter option, but learn that, between the desert heat and the brutal police officers, their chances of survival are slim.', 'In this fictional documentary, U.S. prisons are at capacity, and President Nixon declares a state of emergency. All new prisoners, most of whom are connected to the antiwar movement, are now given the choice of jail time or spending three days in Punishment Park, where they will be hunted for sport by federal authorities. The prisoners invariably choose the latter option, but learn that, between the desert heat and the brutal police officers, their chances of survival are slim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ATUqZV6Bouf76aYabZ5R1KqdlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26513'),
  ('1075728445450702926', 'Punjabi House', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Mecartin, Raffi, Anandakuttan', 'Mecartin, Raffi', 'Dileep, Harisree Ashokan, Cochin Haneefa, Mohini, Lal, Janardhanan, Thilakan, Jomol', null, 'A fisherman saves a suicidal Unni, only to sell him to a Punjabi moneylender in Kerala. Unni is then forced to pose as a man with hearing and speech impairment, resulting in hilarious consequences.', 'A fisherman saves a suicidal Unni, only to sell him to a Punjabi moneylender in Kerala. Unni is then forced to pose as a man with hearing and speech impairment, resulting in hilarious consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1bbWKzG9RDZbemuEmTDCQWhGTc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234639'),
  ('254212419343425962', 'Punk', 2012, 'Drama', 'Jean-Stéphane Sauvaire, André Chemetoff', 'Camille Vizzavona, Jean-Stéphane Sauvaire, Georgina Tacou', 'Paul Bartel, Béatrice Dalle, Marie-Ange Casta, Bernie Bonvoisin, Carlos López, Alban Bigmouth, Ben Ragondin, Franck Creep', null, 'An intense and solitary teenager, Paul finds himself caught up in a journey for freedom, full of violence, betrayal and hope. Abandoned by his father, torn between his mother, with whom he maintains a tender if tormented relationship, and his punk friends, with whom he hangs out at concerts, parties and street fights, he lives fully in the present. At a concert, Paul meets Louise and falls in love. But something is missing, and he continues searching for the father who never recognized him.', 'An intense and solitary teenager, Paul finds himself caught up in a journey for freedom, full of violence, betrayal and hope. Abandoned by his father, torn between his mother, with whom he maintains a tender if tormented relationship, and his punk friends, with whom he hangs out at concerts, parties and street fights, he lives fully in the present. At a concert, Paul meets Louise and falls in love. But something is missing, and he continues searching for the father who never recognized him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HAR6oZpB62OXJ2VI8P5bzKekke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130733'),
  ('10430205886551636', 'Punk Berlin 1982', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Oskar Roehler', 'Oskar Roehler', 'Tom Schilling, Wilson Gonzalez Ochsenknecht, Emilia Schüle, Frederick Lau, Hannelore Hoger, Samuel Finzi, Alexander Scheer, Simon Böer', null, '1980: 19 year old Robert, fed up with Hippy phoniness and bourgeoise narrow mindedness alike, flees the German provinces for West Berlin. A tour de force through the glorious dirt of West Berlin ensues. Full of sex, drugs, love and PUNK.', '1980: 19 year old Robert, fed up with Hippy phoniness and bourgeoise narrow mindedness alike, flees the German provinces for West Berlin. A tour de force through the glorious dirt of West Berlin ensues. Full of sex, drugs, love and PUNK.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ru7GjFHs9QAFr89k4PuQGLjwuQz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331622'),
  ('54177733604174154', 'Punk in London', 1977, 'Documentary, Music', 'Wolfgang Büld, Sven Kirsten, Helge Weindler', 'Wolfgang Büld', 'Gaye Black, Kevin Rowland, Paul Simonon, Paul Weller, Bob Geldof, Poly Styrene, Paul Dean, Lora Logic', null, 'A visual record of London punk life in the late ''70s, filled with never-before-seen live concert footage and commentary from the Clash, the Jam, X-Ray Spex and the Electric Chairs.', 'A visual record of London punk life in the late ''70s, filled with never-before-seen live concert footage and commentary from the Clash, the Jam, X-Ray Spex and the Electric Chairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPzGgxHBH4SnjU5BbW5epW2EBsJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173341'),
  ('702149405096921113', 'Punk Vacation', 1987, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Stanley Lewis, Daryn Okada', 'Lance Smith, Harvey Richelson', 'Sandra Bogan, Stephen Fiachi, Roxanne Rogers, Don Martin, Louis Waldon, Patrick Allen Reynolds, Kevin Lewis, Billy Palmieri', null, 'A peaceful California town is shaken after the brutal murder of diner owner by a gang of vicious punks. When the daughter of the slain man attempts to avenge her father’s death, she’s held hostage by the gang resulting in an epic battle between punks and rednecks.', 'A peaceful California town is shaken after the brutal murder of diner owner by a gang of vicious punks. When the daughter of the slain man attempts to avenge her father’s death, she’s held hostage by the gang resulting in an epic battle between punks and rednecks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AidJmcpByV7Hr0gmwxJKawP88qe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207699'),
  ('1058461102888684465', 'Punk: Attitude', 2005, 'Documentary, Music', 'Don Letts', 'Don Letts', 'K.K. Barrett, Roberta Bayley, Jello Biafra, Glenn Branca, John Cale, John Cooper Clarke, Bob Gruen, Mary Harron', 'NR', 'From London''s 1970 mod scene to Sonic Youth, punk music has always been about attitude and anarchy. This comprehensive rockumentary traces the roots of punk, from The Velvet Underground and the New York Dolls to the Sex Pistols and The Clash.', 'From London''s 1970 mod scene to Sonic Youth, punk music has always been about attitude and anarchy. This comprehensive rockumentary traces the roots of punk, from The Velvet Underground and the New York Dolls to the Sex Pistols and The Clash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39JHwg6fahbtL2qSgfxcVLbYv1t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24616'),
  ('385472992872309248', 'Punk''s Not Dead', 2007, 'Documentary, Music', 'Susan Dynner', null, 'Henry Rollins, Fat Mike, Tim Armstrong, Frank Iero, Mike Ness, Dexter Holland, Benji Madden, Billie Joe Armstrong', null, 'On the edge of the 30th anniversary of punk rock, Punk''s Not Dead takes you into the sweaty underground clubs, backyard parties, recording studios, shopping malls and stadiums where punk rock music and culture continue to thrive.', 'On the edge of the 30th anniversary of punk rock, Punk''s Not Dead takes you into the sweaty underground clubs, backyard parties, recording studios, shopping malls and stadiums where punk rock music and culture continue to thrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcqqxXFBfRMo5hDsyUVtzU57zBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36746'),
  ('58884926005965908', 'Punto y Aparte', 2002, 'Family, Drama', 'Paco del Toro', null, 'Evangelina Sosa, José Luis Reséndez, Geraldine Bazán, Mauricio Islas', null, 'Aline with Valentín. Miroslava with Sergio. Two couples. Two different worlds. One only destiny. Reflected upon one another, their lives intertwine in everyday''s story. A story full of conflict and passion, triumph and failure. Thus, their lives get chained in beginnings and endings. For them, there''s a lot to choose, a lot to start and a lot to finish. Thus, Aline and Miroslava punctuate their life with a period, and a new paragraph.', 'Aline with Valentín. Miroslava with Sergio. Two couples. Two different worlds. One only destiny. Reflected upon one another, their lives intertwine in everyday''s story. A story full of conflict and passion, triumph and failure. Thus, their lives get chained in beginnings and endings. For them, there''s a lot to choose, a lot to start and a lot to finish. Thus, Aline and Miroslava punctuate their life with a period, and a new paragraph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofDt8du5I3fc5iRkWclfoi5xE6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329775'),
  ('29513600267826137', 'Pup on a Picnic', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Daws Butler', 'NR', 'Spike is taking his son on a picnic. Jerry keeps hiding in the basket, so Tom keeps disrupting the picnic while chasing him.', 'Spike is taking his son on a picnic. Jerry keeps hiding in the basket, so Tom keeps disrupting the picnic while chasing him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ra7vfY189lE1wD7UfirRz6Ab7ti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76008'),
  ('654406139092670632', 'Puparia', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Shingo Tamagawa', 'Shingo Tamagawa', null, null, 'Something is about to change drastically, and the only thing to do is to witness it.', 'Something is about to change drastically, and the only thing to do is to witness it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KRpbwNDrQ8cqKoVknoPqqtrpAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766423'),
  ('736664917467963914', 'Pupendo', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jan Hřebejk, Jan Malíř', 'Petr Jarchovský', 'Bolek Polívka, Eva Holubová, Jaroslav Dušek, Vilma Cibulková, Jiří Pecha, Pavel Liška, Nikola Pešková, Lukáš Baborský', null, 'Artist Bedřich Mára (Bolek Polivka) is unable to find much secure work due to his public antagonism toward the ruling Communist Party. He has a wife and two children. Life begins to change when art historian Alois Fábera (Jiři Pecha) begins working on a piece about Bedřich, leading to a job offer from a Party official. Things are looking up, until the wrong people hear portions of the historian''s writing.', 'Artist Bedřich Mára (Bolek Polivka) is unable to find much secure work due to his public antagonism toward the ruling Communist Party. He has a wife and two children. Life begins to change when art historian Alois Fábera (Jiři Pecha) begins working on a piece about Bedřich, leading to a job offer from a Party official. Things are looking up, until the wrong people hear portions of the historian''s writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fr9xvyqMOdwuvJUs4DYiUeExQ1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46288'),
  ('230646056396267406', 'Puppet Master 4', 1993, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Adolfo Bartoli, Jeff Burr, Douglas Aarniokoski', 'Todd Henschell, Douglas Aarniokoski, Steven E. Carr', 'Gordon Currie, Chandra West, Ash Adams, Teresa Hill, Guy Rolfe, Felton Perry, Stacie Randall, Michael Shamus Wiles', 'R', 'Blade, Tunneler, and Pinhead go toe-to-toe with a team of terrifying, gremlin-like creatures known as "Totems" that are sent by the Egyptian demon Sutekh to recapture the magic stolen by Toulon.', 'Blade, Tunneler, and Pinhead go toe-to-toe with a team of terrifying, gremlin-like creatures known as "Totems" that are sent by the Egyptian demon Sutekh to recapture the magic stolen by Toulon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRIpNpZVL73MGJ7E2ZYt03tggeX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26957'),
  ('435841157482809664', 'Puppet Master 5', 1994, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Jeff Burr, Adolfo Bartoli, Douglas Aarniokoski', 'Steven E. Carr, Jo Duffy, Todd Henschell', 'Gordon Currie, Chandra West, Ian Ogilvy, Teresa Hill, Guy Rolfe, Nicholas Guest, Willard E. Pugh, Diane McBain', 'R', 'Sutekh, the dark pharaoh from another dimension, sends his own puppet, Totem, to continue his quest to kill Rick and steal the magic which animates the puppets.', 'Sutekh, the dark pharaoh from another dimension, sends his own puppet, Totem, to continue his quest to kill Rick and steal the magic which animates the puppets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqA1w7IwFCwA4fAD9R8vwOm1w5l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26958'),
  ('1007199692284305517', 'Puppet Master II', 1990, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Thomas F. Denove, King Wilder, Howard Wexler', 'David Pabian', 'Elizabeth Maclellan, Collin Bernsen, Steve Welles, Greg Webb, Charlie Spradling, Jeff Celentano, Nita Talbot, Sage Allen', 'R', 'A new team of paranormal researchers has come to the hotel to investigate its murder-soaked past; the puppets -- led by a new member, Torch -- shed some light on the matter, as they tunnel, burn, strangle and hook to survive.', 'A new team of paranormal researchers has come to the hotel to investigate its murder-soaked past; the puppets -- led by a new member, Torch -- shed some light on the matter, as they tunnel, burn, strangle and hook to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dy5tzZFWFTjbNyG4KNP6yMjZ6l9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26954'),
  ('748781488188459096', 'Puppet Master III: Toulon''s Revenge', 1992, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'David DeCoteau, Adolfo Bartoli, David A. Weiner', 'C. Courtney Joyner', 'Guy Rolfe, Richard Lynch, Ian Abercrombie, Kristopher Logan, Aron Eisenberg, Walter Gotell, Sarah Douglas, Michelle Bauer', 'NR', 'After hearing that mystical toymaker Andre Toulon has managed to create a troupe of sentient, living puppets, Nazi underling Dr. Hess sets his sights on exploiting Toulon''s powers for the glory of the Reich.', 'After hearing that mystical toymaker Andre Toulon has managed to create a troupe of sentient, living puppets, Nazi underling Dr. Hess sets his sights on exploiting Toulon''s powers for the glory of the Reich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSSZGAEnSJ8ov81i7UVYcFOeThP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26956'),
  ('304233829445421607', 'Puppet Master vs Demonic Toys', 2004, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Ted Nicolaou, Gary Jones, Anton Bakarski', 'C. Courtney Joyner', 'Corey Feldman, Vanessa Angel, Danielle Keaton, Silvia Šuvadová, Nikolai Sotirov, Dessislava Maicheva, Velizar Binev, Angelina Hadjimitova', 'NR', 'A group of toymakers seek to use Andre Toulon''s formula, now in the hands of Toulon''s great-nephew Robert, to give life to a line of killer toys that they plan to unleash on Christmas Eve.', 'A group of toymakers seek to use Andre Toulon''s formula, now in the hands of Toulon''s great-nephew Robert, to give life to a line of killer toys that they plan to unleash on Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKr5H8GTFouv0t2GqRBmdqJghdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26962'),
  ('265731953824643371', 'Puppet Master X: Axis Rising', 2012, 'Horror, War, Science Fiction', 'Charles Band, Terrance Ryker', 'Shane Bitterling', 'Kip Canyon, Jean Louise O''Sullivan, Oto Brezina, Stephanie Sanditz, Brad Potts, Terumi Shimazu, Scott King, Ryan Dillon', 'NR', 'After foiling a plan to blow up an American arms plant, Danny and Beth quickly find that one of Toulon''s puppets has been kidnapped by the Nazis, and his life-giving serum has been synthesized to create a master race of unstoppable soldiers.', 'After foiling a plan to blow up an American arms plant, Danny and Beth quickly find that one of Toulon''s puppets has been kidnapped by the Nazis, and his life-giving serum has been synthesized to create a master race of unstoppable soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRKkCKwPCrXe3mZdCgLZnWy6wCn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139659'),
  ('479018735483504349', 'Puppet Master: Axis of Evil', 2010, 'Horror, Fantasy, War', 'David DeCoteau, Terrance Ryker, Fred Sun', 'Domonic Muir', 'Levi Fiehler, Jenna Gallaher, Taylor M. Graham, Tom Sandoval, Jerry Hoffman, Mike Brooks, Ada Chao, Aaron Riber', 'NR', 'Following the murder of Andre Toulon by Nazi assassins during the height of World War II, a young Danny Coogan finds his crate of mysterious puppets, and discovers their plan to attack a secret American manufacturing plant.', 'Following the murder of Andre Toulon by Nazi assassins during the height of World War II, a young Danny Coogan finds his crate of mysterious puppets, and discovers their plan to attack a secret American manufacturing plant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQ2gDpZIOFavS7WH3fq9uIxqiLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27651'),
  ('1097355324084419241', 'Puppet Master: Axis Termination', 2017, 'Fantasy, Horror, War', 'Charles Band, Howard Wexler, Jan Glaser', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'George Appleby, Tonya Kay, Paul Logan, Kevin Scott Allen, Tania Fox, Alynxia America, Lilou Vos, Danièle Romer', 'NR', 'To stop the Third Reich and the Nazi war machine from winning World War II and affecting the outcome of the free world, Toulon''s indestructible puppets join forces with the masters of psychic powers.', 'To stop the Third Reich and the Nazi war machine from winning World War II and affecting the outcome of the free world, Toulon''s indestructible puppets join forces with the masters of psychic powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSuRNNwX8wuO1DeEA1lghao6Tcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384978'),
  ('150086257628413984', 'Puppet Master: Doktor Death', 2022, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Dave Parker, Josh Apple', 'James Quinn', 'Melissa Moore, Laura Dennis, Erin Eva Butcher, Rick Montgomery Jr., Jenny Boswell, Ashton Wolf, Jesse Guilmette, Madeline Dee', null, 'Doktor Death comes crawling out of his trunk and is unleashed into a ramshackle nursing home.', 'Doktor Death comes crawling out of his trunk and is unleashed into a ramshackle nursing home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXyrjIQEONIaz6FBjfhjY8y8XYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779157'),
  ('719300529394584685', 'Puppet Master: The Legacy', 2003, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Charles Band, Mac Ahlberg', 'C. Courtney Joyner', 'Jacob Witkin, Kate Orsini, Ian Abercrombie, Sage Allen, Michelle Bauer, Stephen Blackehart, Gordon Currie, Brigitta Dau', 'NR', 'A rogue agent named Maclain breaks into the lab of Eric Weiss, who has spent his entire life fascinated by Andre Toulon''s supernatural ability to breathe life into his carefully crafted figurines.', 'A rogue agent named Maclain breaks into the lab of Eric Weiss, who has spent his entire life fascinated by Andre Toulon''s supernatural ability to breathe life into his carefully crafted figurines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMmSStLICth9rhfi697yzflmPWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26961'),
  ('919233276843694566', 'Puppet Master: The Littlest Reich', 2018, 'Fantasy, Horror, Comedy', 'Sonny Laguna, Tommy Wiklund, Tommy Wiklund', 'S. Craig Zahler', 'Thomas Lennon, Jenny Pellicer, Michael Paré, Barbara Crampton, Udo Kier, Nelson Franklin, Lo Mutuc, Alex Beh', 'NR', 'A recently divorced young man discovers a mint condition Blade doll in his deceased brother''s closet and plans to sell the toy at a convention in Oregon celebrating the 30th anniversary of the infamous Toulon Murders. All hell breaks loose during the auction when a strange force animates all of the puppets throughout the convention, setting them on a bloody killing spree.', 'A recently divorced young man discovers a mint condition Blade doll in his deceased brother''s closet and plans to sell the toy at a convention in Oregon celebrating the 30th anniversary of the infamous Toulon Murders. All hell breaks loose during the auction when a strange force animates all of the puppets throughout the convention, setting them on a bloody killing spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85r4oIFdr065RXpRHINjjkXEBkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396321'),
  ('1103359239939769826', 'Puppet on a Chain', 1970, 'Thriller', 'Geoffrey Reeve, Terence Churcher, Don Sharp', 'Alistair MacLean, Don Sharp', 'Sven-Bertil Taube, Barbara Parkins, Alexander Knox, Patrick Allen, Vladek Sheybal, Ania Marson, Penny Casdagli, Peter Hutchins', 'PG', 'Following a triple professional hit a U.S. agent, Paul Sherman, arrives in Amsterdam to investigate a heroin smuggling ring. He finds a city rife with drugs and a police force unable or unwilling to do much about it. With his incognito female fellow agent, Maggie, the American is soon stirring things up.', 'Following a triple professional hit a U.S. agent, Paul Sherman, arrives in Amsterdam to investigate a heroin smuggling ring. He finds a city rife with drugs and a police force unable or unwilling to do much about it. With his incognito female fellow agent, Maggie, the American is soon stirring things up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNM1z4fWyP9SnX4QokFmYfZb839.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32034'),
  ('766069098982208085', 'Puppet Princess', 2000, 'Animation, Action, Drama', 'Hirotoshi Takaya, Hitoshi Nishiyama, Susuki Tsutomu', 'Junichi Miyashita', 'Akiko Yajima, Norio Wakamoto, Kōji Nakata, Minoru Inaba, Mugihito, Takeshi Aono', null, 'Princess Rangiku lost her entire family to Lord Karimata, who invaded her home seeking her father''s life work, puppets with unique capabilities. As her duty, Rangiku sets out with three of her father''s greatest puppet warriors to seek revenge. She can manipulate these to battle the strongest of warriors, however manipulating the puppets leaves her own self vulnerable to direct attacks, so she seeks a ninja warrior named Manajiri to aid and protect her in her quest.', 'Princess Rangiku lost her entire family to Lord Karimata, who invaded her home seeking her father''s life work, puppets with unique capabilities. As her duty, Rangiku sets out with three of her father''s greatest puppet warriors to seek revenge. She can manipulate these to battle the strongest of warriors, however manipulating the puppets leaves her own self vulnerable to direct attacks, so she seeks a ninja warrior named Manajiri to aid and protect her in her quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGgWRqaTxHVfhU9NlVgCnjYSl7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55296'),
  ('489269530567141526', 'Puppetmaster', 1989, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'David Schmoeller, Hope Perello, Jerome Goldberg', 'David Schmoeller', 'Paul Le Mat, William Hickey, Irene Miracle, Jimmie F. Skaggs, Robin Frates, Matt Roe, Kathryn O''Reilly, Mews Small', 'R', 'After being contacted by their mysterious former colleague, four psychics arrive at a secluded hotel where they are stalked by a group of murderous puppets.', 'After being contacted by their mysterious former colleague, four psychics arrive at a secluded hotel where they are stalked by a group of murderous puppets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bcRspKbsM21HqLcxIBANbts3X7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26953'),
  ('1103111221760848808', 'Puppy', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Yarrow Cheney, Bruno Dequier', 'Yarrow Cheney', 'Pierre Coffin', 'G', 'A Minion, longing for a puppy, humorously tries to catch a dog, a squirrel, and even a ladybug, but none of his attempts succeed. Just as his hopes fade, a tiny UFO swoops down and abducts the ladybug. The Minion watches in fascination as the UFO, making adorable beeping noises, forms an unexpected bond with him, becoming his new "puppy." They share fun adventures, with the UFO using its space powers to entertain, playing music and enlarging snacks like cheese puffs and bananas. One evening, the UFO puppy shows the Minion its home in the stars and expresses a longing to return. The Minion, determined to help, sends an email with their picture to the UFO''s home planet, triggering a rescue party. Before leaving, the UFO uses its grow-ray to enlarge the ladybug into a puppy-sized companion. The Minion, surrounded by friends, joyfully accepts the new “puppy,” ready for more adventures together.', 'A Minion, longing for a puppy, humorously tries to catch a dog, a squirrel, and even a ladybug, but none of his attempts succeed. Just as his hopes fade, a tiny UFO swoops down and abducts the ladybug. The Minion watches in fascination as the UFO, making adorable beeping noises, forms an unexpected bond with him, becoming his new "puppy." They share fun adventures, with the UFO using its space powers to entertain, playing music and enlarging snacks like cheese puffs and bananas. One evening, the UFO puppy shows the Minion its home in the stars and expresses a longing to return. The Minion, determined to help, sends an email with their picture to the UFO''s home planet, triggering a rescue party. Before leaving, the UFO uses its grow-ray to enlarge the ladybug into a puppy-sized companion. The Minion, surrounded by friends, joyfully accepts the new “puppy,” ready for more adventures together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bapLpnoV3PUbgcZNDwg6Hxe75HI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229407'),
  ('429922731227174439', 'Puppy Bowl XXII', 2026, 'Family, Sport', null, null, 'Chai, Todd Graves, Isabel Klee, Steve Levy, Taylor Rooks', null, 'Follows the 22nd annual television event featuring 150 shelter dogs from 72 shelters across the United States, Puerto Rico and the British Virgin Islands competing in adoption-focused games.', 'Follows the 22nd annual television event featuring 150 shelter dogs from 72 shelters across the United States, Puerto Rico and the British Virgin Islands competing in adoption-focused games.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FOJWMtjGI8KR1mAlX80kaF2by2b.jpg', 'plex:movie:puppy-bowl-xxii'),
  ('803737955650406685', 'Puppy Love', 1933, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Marcellite Garner, Walt Disney', 'NR', 'Mickey''s in trouble when Pluto and Fifi eat Minnie''s chocolates.', 'Mickey''s in trouble when Pluto and Fifi eat Minnie''s chocolates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlyY7tN9Y3L3ZFMOmA9v71CYmBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161846'),
  ('1023159605521563096', 'Puppy Love', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stephen Chandler Whitehead, Trevor Cunningham, Matthew Johnson', 'Kirsten Guenther, Dan Scheinkman, Richard Alan Reid', 'Lucy Hale, Grant Gustin, Jane Seymour, Michael Hitchcock, Nore Davis, Alessandro Miro, Corey Woods, Sarah Almonte Peguero', 'R', 'After a disastrous first date, wild-child Nicole and socially-anxious Max vow to lose each other’s numbers until they learn that their dogs found a love match, and now puppies are on the way! The hilariously mismatched Nicole and Max are forced to become responsible co-parents, but may end up finding love themselves.', 'After a disastrous first date, wild-child Nicole and socially-anxious Max vow to lose each other’s numbers until they learn that their dogs found a love match, and now puppies are on the way! The hilariously mismatched Nicole and Max are forced to become responsible co-parents, but may end up finding love themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjpsW3sflsoxahFyFujvTnWUuqV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143319'),
  ('437899474460914466', 'Puppy Tale', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray, William Hanna', 'NR', 'Jerry rescues a bag of puppies from the river. Most of them run away as soon as Jerry releases them, but one stays behind. Jerry tries to get rid of it, but ultimately takes pity and invites the frisky pup inside, where he has to hide it from Tom, who keeps throwing it out.', 'Jerry rescues a bag of puppies from the river. Most of them run away as soon as Jerry releases them, but one stays behind. Jerry tries to get rid of it, but ultimately takes pity and invites the frisky pup inside, where he has to hide it from Tom, who keeps throwing it out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h11eVhCLstHPregJLtzLknGIhLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76009'),
