  ('1120336226335731538', 'Puppylove', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Delphine Lehericey, Sébastien Godefroy', 'Martin Coiffier, Delphine Lehericey', 'Solène Rigot, Audrey Bastien, Vincent Perez, Vadim Goldberg, Thomas Coumans, Joel Basman, Valérie Bodson, Eric da Costa', null, 'When a free-spirited girl befriends a young teenager, they leave childhood behind to embrace a dangerous world of clubbing and sex with strange men.', 'When a free-spirited girl befriends a young teenager, they leave childhood behind to embrace a dangerous world of clubbing and sex with strange men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkwHa1MmzMNEnejetEUZW4ZhYxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200112'),
  ('801560156077880713', 'Pups', 1999, 'Thriller, Action, Drama, Crime', 'Ash Baron-Cohen, Carlos Arguello', 'Ash Baron-Cohen', 'Mischa Barton, Cameron Van Hoy, Burt Reynolds, Adam Farrar, David Alan Graf, Kurt Loder, James Gordon, Darling Narita', 'R', 'When troubled teen boy Stevie (Cameron Van Hoy) and his girlfriend, Rocky (Mischa Barton), attempt to rob a bank without any forethought, the situation rapidly deteriorates. Soon the young couple is holding bank customers and employees hostage, while law enforcement gathers outside. Daniel Bender (Burt Reynolds), a veteran negotiator for the FBI, is charged with assessing the crime scene and ending the standoff as quickly as possible, but Stevie''s short fuse considerably complicates matters.', 'When troubled teen boy Stevie (Cameron Van Hoy) and his girlfriend, Rocky (Mischa Barton), attempt to rob a bank without any forethought, the situation rapidly deteriorates. Soon the young couple is holding bank customers and employees hostage, while law enforcement gathers outside. Daniel Bender (Burt Reynolds), a veteran negotiator for the FBI, is charged with assessing the crime scene and ending the standoff as quickly as possible, but Stevie''s short fuse considerably complicates matters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aa7pD9OHflWFTa2Me2AV7j7BOBX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54003'),
  ('260312399896666177', 'Pups Alone', 2021, 'Family, Comedy', 'Pascal Combes-Knoke, Alex Merkin', 'Brandon Burrows, Jason Gruich', 'Jerry O''Connell, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Rob Schneider, Danny Trejo, Malcolm McDowell, Keith David, Dolph Lundgren, Tyler Hollinger', 'PG', 'After receiving an exciting new job opportunity at a cutting edge Pet Invention company, Robert, his teenage daughter Jenna and their trusty and special border collie Charlie make the move to the new neighborhood, right before Christmas. Upon arriving, Robert meets his gorgeous next door neighbor Holly, and her sassy and spunky border collie Gidget. Before the sparks can fly, they are set upon my Robert’s conniving and obnoxious next door neighbor and project manager Victor, his neighborhood bully bulldog “Vinnie P” and the sycophantic sidekick Chihuahua “Jose”.', 'After receiving an exciting new job opportunity at a cutting edge Pet Invention company, Robert, his teenage daughter Jenna and their trusty and special border collie Charlie make the move to the new neighborhood, right before Christmas. Upon arriving, Robert meets his gorgeous next door neighbor Holly, and her sassy and spunky border collie Gidget. Before the sparks can fly, they are set upon my Robert’s conniving and obnoxious next door neighbor and project manager Victor, his neighborhood bully bulldog “Vinnie P” and the sycophantic sidekick Chihuahua “Jose”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MJo65VVurU1GKqr0oDHBim0as4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:761548'),
  ('1100001950379999419', 'Pups Is Pups', 1930, 'Comedy', 'Robert F. McGowan', null, 'Jackie Cooper, Bobby ''Wheezer'' Hutchins, Allen ''Farina'' Hoskins, Norman Chaney, Mary Ann Jackson, Dorothy DeBorba', null, 'The gang decides to enter their animals in a local pet show.', 'The gang decides to enter their animals in a local pet show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMmlCQ1EX0l8qrNEWDCEO04HFqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144788'),
