  ('258003375648259287', 'Pur week-end', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Doran, Christophe Offenstein', 'Philippe Lefebvre, Olivier Doran, Olivier Doran', 'Kad Merad, Bruno Solo, Valérie Benguigui, Philippe Lefebvre, Jean-Noël Brouté, Anne Marivin, Arnaud Henriet, François Berléand', null, 'Former school friends get together one weekend a year, this year in the mountains.', 'Former school friends get together one weekend a year, this year in the mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYTIvMqZDPdQkwjjVwaatj6bdNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57148'),
  ('1017894780992898992', 'Pura Vida Ibiza', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Gernot Roll, Gernot Roll', 'Oliver Huzly, Reinhard Klooss, Rudi Aargus', 'Tom Wlaschiha, Kristian Kiehling, Michael Krabbe, Julia Dietze, Katja Flint, Horst Krause, Hilmi Sözer, Tom Gerhardt', null, 'School''s over – and for brand-new high-school graduates Ben, Felix and Nick, it''s time to party! But when Ben embarrasses himself in public trying to declare his love for the gorgeous Carola, he and his pals make a quick exit by taking jobs as hosts in a vacation club on Ibiza, the Mediterranean hot spot for oversexed boys and underdressed girls! Instead of sun, sea and sex, however, it''s work, work and more work, as the three are kept busy around the clock by their sadistic boss Anna. And when Ben bumps into Carola and her super-cool DJ boyfriend, Ibiza starts feeling more like Alcatraz by the minute. Yet even as the mishaps pile up and the boys have to cope with stinging jellyfish, English hooligans and tequila hangovers, they refuse to give up their plan to throw the ultimate Ibiza party for the club, and especially for Carola. Summer is short, but these guys are going to make sure everyone remembers this one for a long time!', 'School''s over – and for brand-new high-school graduates Ben, Felix and Nick, it''s time to party! But when Ben embarrasses himself in public trying to declare his love for the gorgeous Carola, he and his pals make a quick exit by taking jobs as hosts in a vacation club on Ibiza, the Mediterranean hot spot for oversexed boys and underdressed girls! Instead of sun, sea and sex, however, it''s work, work and more work, as the three are kept busy around the clock by their sadistic boss Anna. And when Ben bumps into Carola and her super-cool DJ boyfriend, Ibiza starts feeling more like Alcatraz by the minute. Yet even as the mishaps pile up and the boys have to cope with stinging jellyfish, English hooligans and tequila hangovers, they refuse to give up their plan to throw the ultimate Ibiza party for the club, and especially for Carola. Summer is short, but these guys are going to make sure everyone remembers this one for a long time!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPeGL2T6cQWlEiwfaA4aXjyDprf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11073'),
  ('411830267602429731', 'Purana Mandir', 1984, 'Horror', 'Tulsi Ramsay, Shyam Ramsay, Gangu Ramsay', 'Kumar Ramsay', 'Mohnish Behl, Arti Gupta, Puneet Issar, Priti Sapru Walia, Pradeep Kumar, Anirudh Agarwal, Sadashiv Amrapurkar, Satish Shah', null, 'After a rich young girl learns about a demon and it''s terrible curse brought by her family for generations, she decides to go to her paternal village with her lover, and his friend, to find out the truth.', 'After a rich young girl learns about a demon and it''s terrible curse brought by her family for generations, she decides to go to her paternal village with her lover, and his friend, to find out the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DHzE0v9ShQXmxpeKyNfHCw4zIQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122895'),
  ('98305353141095187', 'Pure', 2002, 'Drama', 'Gillies MacKinnon, John de Borman, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Alison Hume', 'Molly Parker, Harry Eden, Keira Knightley, Vinnie Hunter, David Wenham, Nitin Ganatra, Levi Hayes, Rupert Procter', 'R', 'A young boy trying to deal with his mother''s heroin addiction befriends a waitress who helps him cope with the tough situation.', 'A young boy trying to deal with his mother''s heroin addiction befriends a waitress who helps him cope with the tough situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxlm722P1IvsMqKQ5P4QZXdiPht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18072'),
  ('968322090778193476', 'Pure', 2010, 'Drama', 'Simon Pramsten, Lisa Langseth', 'Lisa Langseth', 'Alicia Vikander, Samuel Fröler, Josephine Bauer, Martin Wallström, Frederik Nilsson, Ylva Gallon, Elisabeth Göransson, Anna Åström', null, 'Katarina is 20 years old. With a troubled past in a dreary suburb, her life seems to be already set in stone - until she discovers music. Everything changes when she hears a performance of Mozart’s ''Requiem'' at the Gothenburg Concert Hall that sends her reeling and opens up a beautiful new world. She feels that she has to change her life and get as far away from her ugly reality as possible. But the path she has to follow proves to be a treacherous one, filled with lies, betrayal and a dangerous liaison with the married conductor Adam. Yet Katarina is ready to do anything to gain her new identity.', 'Katarina is 20 years old. With a troubled past in a dreary suburb, her life seems to be already set in stone - until she discovers music. Everything changes when she hears a performance of Mozart’s ''Requiem'' at the Gothenburg Concert Hall that sends her reeling and opens up a beautiful new world. She feels that she has to change her life and get as far away from her ugly reality as possible. But the path she has to follow proves to be a treacherous one, filled with lies, betrayal and a dangerous liaison with the married conductor Adam. Yet Katarina is ready to do anything to gain her new identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqfv06HzaNmFuK9vX0AgvueuWwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58156'),
  ('884354607920162866', 'Pure', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Hannah Macpherson', 'Hannah Macpherson', 'Jahkara Smith, McKaley Miller, Scott Porter, Annalisa Cochrane, Ciara Bravo, Jim Klock, T.C. Carter, Madeleine Gardella', 'NR', 'Teen girls perform a secret ritual at a Purity Retreat and, when one of them begins to see a supernatural entity, the terrifying question becomes what is more dangerous: the demon they’ve unleashed, or the pressure of their controlling fathers.', 'Teen girls perform a secret ritual at a Purity Retreat and, when one of them begins to see a supernatural entity, the terrifying question becomes what is more dangerous: the demon they’ve unleashed, or the pressure of their controlling fathers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21zEfu8kCvVBroyFS9DPaYrEtm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616844'),
  ('211620970631760736', 'Pure Blood', 1982, 'Crime, Horror', 'Luis Ospina, Phil Pearle, Ramón F. Suárez', 'Luis Ospina, Alberto Quiroga', 'Florina Lemaitre, Carlos Mayolo, Humberto Arango, Gilberto Forero, Luis Alberto García, Patricia Bonilla, Alvaro Gutiérrez, Rita Escobar', null, 'Roberto Hurtado suffers from a rare disease that requires massive transfusions of blood from children or adolescents. His son blackmails three employees to get blood for him and they resort to unscrupulous methods to obtain it.', 'Roberto Hurtado suffers from a rare disease that requires massive transfusions of blood from children or adolescents. His son blackmails three employees to get blood for him and they resort to unscrupulous methods to obtain it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0LB8qEcntweDmxlH07O9TwNXjP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134245'),
  ('1095827515226390280', 'Pure Country', 1992, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Christopher Cain, Clifford C. Coleman, Bobby J. Foxworth', 'Rex McGee', 'George Strait, Lesley Ann Warren, Isabel Glasser, Kyle Chandler, John Doe, Rory Calhoun, Molly McClure, James Terry McIlvain', 'PG', 'Dusty Chandler is a super star in the country music world, but his shows have the style of a ''70s rock concert. One day he takes a walk - out of his overdone concerts to find his real country roots. He''s helped and hindered by friends and staff, but pushes on in his search for a real music style as well as a real romance.', 'Dusty Chandler is a super star in the country music world, but his shows have the style of a ''70s rock concert. One day he takes a walk - out of his overdone concerts to find his real country roots. He''s helped and hindered by friends and staff, but pushes on in his search for a real music style as well as a real romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVilYjaslgywSsDPqLeiW94Kc7R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22627'),
  ('51481446258258730', 'Pure Heart', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Satoshi Kaneda, Yuji Imai', 'Noriko Kozuru, Hirotoshi Kobayashi', 'Gakuto Furuhara, Takahashi Yuuta, Miki Isa, Hyota Fujiyama, Mitsuyoshi Shinoda', null, 'Through a coincidence Tozaki runs into Kurata, his first crush from high school. They begin a relationship, but Kurata''s jealousy starts causing problems.', 'Through a coincidence Tozaki runs into Kurata, his first crush from high school. They begin a relationship, but Kurata''s jealousy starts causing problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jKKmSjWZgCevnvLHF7pmWmBsl3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179400'),
  ('873708542673327244', 'Pure Hearts', 2006, 'Drama', 'Kenneth Kainz', 'Kim Fupz Aakeson', 'Anders Matthesen, Laura Bro, Morten Suurballe, Lisbet Dahl, Helle Hertz, Andrea Vagn Jensen, Lone Lindorff, Lise Stegger', null, 'To the mentally ill Kriss, the world is divided up into ''good and evil'', just like in the old B&W melodrama, ''Pure Hearts'', which Kriss and his fellow patient, Willy, spend their days repeatedly watching at the psychiatric ward. To Kriss this film is the bible. One day after a serious conflict with one of the hospital''s other patients their viewing rights are retracted. Kriss is deeply frustrated by this, until he realises that Linda, the young girl in the film, actually exists in the shape of the film''s star, the actress Ulla Vilstrup. Setting fire to the hospital, Kriss and Willy escape into the night, determined to find her, because life is what you make of it.', 'To the mentally ill Kriss, the world is divided up into ''good and evil'', just like in the old B&W melodrama, ''Pure Hearts'', which Kriss and his fellow patient, Willy, spend their days repeatedly watching at the psychiatric ward. To Kriss this film is the bible. One day after a serious conflict with one of the hospital''s other patients their viewing rights are retracted. Kriss is deeply frustrated by this, until he realises that Linda, the young girl in the film, actually exists in the shape of the film''s star, the actress Ulla Vilstrup. Setting fire to the hospital, Kriss and Willy escape into the night, determined to find her, because life is what you make of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7zXccdR3a5empuetzv8DRS6p1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13527'),
  ('170664033977274275', 'Pure Hearts', 2017, 'Drama', 'Claudio Cofrancesco, Tiziano Grasso, Chiara Di Giorgi', 'Adriano Chiarelli', 'Selene Caramazza, Simone Liberati, Barbora Bobuľová, Stefano Fresi, Edoardo Pesce, Antonella Attili, Federico Pacifici, Alexia Murray', null, 'Agnese and Stefano are profoundly different. She is only seventeen, lives with her mother – a harsh and devoted woman – is a regular church-goer and is about to take a vow of chastity to last until marriage. He is twenty-five, has a violent temper and a difficult past behind. He works as a warden in a car park that borders a Roma camp. Their unexpected meeting engenders a true sentiment, made of little stolen moments and mutual help.', 'Agnese and Stefano are profoundly different. She is only seventeen, lives with her mother – a harsh and devoted woman – is a regular church-goer and is about to take a vow of chastity to last until marriage. He is twenty-five, has a violent temper and a difficult past behind. He works as a warden in a car park that borders a Roma camp. Their unexpected meeting engenders a true sentiment, made of little stolen moments and mutual help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTVQ3wrch24qY7r460OrEHmJ9i1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453272'),
  ('385535005784849157', 'Pure Hearts: Into Chinese Showbiz', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bi Zhifei', 'Bi Zhifei', 'Bi Zhifei, Zhejian Zhu, Li Yanman, Sihan Chen, Zhang Zhirong, Jiang Long, Hao Xue, Yuanhui Wang', null, 'The movie portrays the unforgettable pleasures and sorrows among a kind and earnest acting instructor and his 17 good-looking students after entering the showbiz during their four years of college.', 'The movie portrays the unforgettable pleasures and sorrows among a kind and earnest acting instructor and his 17 good-looking students after entering the showbiz during their four years of college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svFkMyEuDSIQsEe5SVFKtkFN7t9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481933'),
  ('19464076588631197', 'Pure Imagination: The Story of ''Willy Wonka & the Chocolate Factory''', 2001, 'Documentary, Fantasy', 'J.M. Kenny', 'J.M. Kenny', 'Mel Stuart, David L. Wolper, Roald Dahl, David Seltzer, Gene Wilder, Peter Ostrum, Michael Böllner, Julie Dawn Cole', null, 'Retrospective documentary on the making of the cult classic "Willy Wonka & the Chocolate Factory."', 'Retrospective documentary on the making of the cult classic "Willy Wonka & the Chocolate Factory."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxzZeGmE456c5ujVrkV2B42mmD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413393'),
  ('74928727764168853', 'Pure Japanese', 2022, 'Action, Drama', 'Daishi Matsunaga, Takahiro Imai', 'Tatsuo Kobayashi', 'Dean Fujioka, Aju Makita, Tetsuya Bessho, Tetsu Watanabe, Jun Murakami, Daichi Kaneko, Ryutaro Ninomiya, Ron Mizuma', null, 'Action actor Tateishi Daisuke who struggles with loneliness after suffering a traumatic experience due to an accident during filming. One day, he comes across a senior high school girl Ayumi who is being harassed consistently by Chinese brokers and the local yakuza. He decides to protect her from them. However, after this incident, he comes to develop a mindset of seeing violence as a way to gain the affirmation and approval of others thus gradually loses himself and behaves in an extreme manner.', 'Action actor Tateishi Daisuke who struggles with loneliness after suffering a traumatic experience due to an accident during filming. One day, he comes across a senior high school girl Ayumi who is being harassed consistently by Chinese brokers and the local yakuza. He decides to protect her from them. However, after this incident, he comes to develop a mindset of seeing violence as a way to gain the affirmation and approval of others thus gradually loses himself and behaves in an extreme manner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7irmPdUauvgUEcyM5O3GhDlOhjd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890316'),
  ('887057919847030537', 'Pure Life', 2014, 'Adventure, Documentary, Drama', 'Jérémy Banster', null, 'Daniel Duval, Elli Medeiros, Jérémy Banster, Stany Coppet, Aurélien Recoing, Stany Coppet', null, '1949, a French explorer goes on a solitary expedition in the Amazon forest. He leaves behind him a diary that reflects the meaning of Pure Life and his encounters but leaves the mystery of his own disappearance unsolved. Based on a true story.', '1949, a French explorer goes on a solitary expedition in the Amazon forest. He leaves behind him a diary that reflects the meaning of Pure Life and his encounters but leaves the mystery of his own disappearance unsolved. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfP7gk24y4fumTBsx4iRonGa2fG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323615'),
  ('686372508105193212', 'Pure Luck', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nadia Tass, David Parker', 'Herschel Weingrod, Timothy Harris, Francis Veber', 'Martin Short, Danny Glover, Harry Shearer, Sheila Kelley, Sam Wanamaker, Scott Wilson, Sharlene Martin, Jorge Russek', 'PG', 'The daughter of a wealthy businessman has disappeared in Mexico, and all the efforts to find her have been unsuccessful. A psychologist, knowing that the girl has an ultra bad luck, persuades her father to send to Mexico one of his employees, an accountant with super bad luck, to find her. Perhaps he will be lucky, and his bad luck could help to find the unlucky girl.', 'The daughter of a wealthy businessman has disappeared in Mexico, and all the efforts to find her have been unsuccessful. A psychologist, knowing that the girl has an ultra bad luck, persuades her father to send to Mexico one of his employees, an accountant with super bad luck, to find her. Perhaps he will be lucky, and his bad luck could help to find the unlucky girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZFbRfsSa04TTHzqcEFZtk6YYPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19065'),
  ('1013621397314720813', 'Purely Belter', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mark Herman', 'Jonathan Tulloch, Mark Herman', 'Chris Beattie, Greg McLane, Charlie Hardwick, Roy Hudd, Tim Healy, Kevin Whately, Kerry Ann Christiansen, Jody Baldwin', null, 'Gerry and Sewell are broke. Gerry''s still at school and Sewell is unemployed. They both wish for better things in life. Owning two season tickets to their beloved football club is their biggest dream of all. The tickets cost £1000 - they''re £1000 short. But they are nothing if not resourceful, and they set themselves a mission to raise the cash. While they think up increasingly outlandish money making schemes - from selling junk to shoplifting and the odd bit of housebreaking - real life begins to interfere with the pair''s final scam going hilariously awry landing them in jail, only to discover that their punishment gets them exactly where they want to be!', 'Gerry and Sewell are broke. Gerry''s still at school and Sewell is unemployed. They both wish for better things in life. Owning two season tickets to their beloved football club is their biggest dream of all. The tickets cost £1000 - they''re £1000 short. But they are nothing if not resourceful, and they set themselves a mission to raise the cash. While they think up increasingly outlandish money making schemes - from selling junk to shoplifting and the odd bit of housebreaking - real life begins to interfere with the pair''s final scam going hilariously awry landing them in jail, only to discover that their punishment gets them exactly where they want to be!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fOyUtW8cosQZy4JnfzNyIlkR8I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38294'),
  ('329365953845038404', 'Pureza', 2022, 'Drama', 'Renato Barbieri, Felipe Reinheimer', 'Renato Barbieri', 'Dira Paes, Matheus Abreu, Mariana Nunes, Flávio Bauraqui, Sérgio Sartório, Claudio Barros, Gregório Benevides, Alberto Silva Neto', null, '"Pureza" tells a story of a mother, Pureza, who goes in search of her son, Abel, disappeared after leaving for the mining in the Amazon.', '"Pureza" tells a story of a mother, Pureza, who goes in search of her son, Abel, disappeared after leaving for the mining in the Amazon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wr7nV5OKTlV0DIBNaas5QWFCQan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651907'),
  ('431907128384805133', 'Purgatorio', 2009, 'Drama', 'Roberto Rochín', null, 'Ana Claudia Talancón, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Miguel Rodarte, Dolores Heredia', null, 'Three novellas are connected by the character of Don Julio. The old man lives alone in a hacienda which is being absorbed by the huge Mexico City. Don Julio escapes from the surrounding reality into the world of memories. Images from the past are so strong that they reawaken his old love for aunt Cecilia and young Clotilde.', 'Three novellas are connected by the character of Don Julio. The old man lives alone in a hacienda which is being absorbed by the huge Mexico City. Don Julio escapes from the surrounding reality into the world of memories. Images from the past are so strong that they reawaken his old love for aunt Cecilia and young Clotilde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJJ0Z8Z8M9Wf5LUXsebryssnE9m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74504'),
  ('531913059249394575', 'Purgatory', 1998, 'War, TV Movie, Action', 'Aleksandr Nevzorov, Viktor Mikhalchenko', 'Aleksandr Nevzorov', 'Aleksandr Baranov, Aleksandr Makarov, Dmitriy Nagiev, Sergey Rost, Aleksandr Shekhtel, Viktor Stepanov, Ivan Ganzha, Zed Korshoonoff', null, 'This is a story about the battle for a hospital building in Grozny (Chechnya) in January 1995 between Russian Army forces and Chechen rebels supported by Arabian mujahideen and international mercenaries. Although the story is fictional, most of the characters are based on real-life prototypes and events are the compilation of true events during the Grozny Siege in the First Chechen War.', 'This is a story about the battle for a hospital building in Grozny (Chechnya) in January 1995 between Russian Army forces and Chechen rebels supported by Arabian mujahideen and international mercenaries. Although the story is fictional, most of the characters are based on real-life prototypes and events are the compilation of true events during the Grozny Siege in the First Chechen War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MCMEAHc9HSVmmGc07ZsfvP3Xic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109535'),
  ('1087487486635050717', 'Purgatory', 1999, 'Fantasy, Western, TV Movie', 'Uli Edel, William Wages', 'Gordon T. Dawson', 'Sam Shepard, Eric Roberts, Randy Quaid, Peter Stormare, Brad Rowe, Donnie Wahlberg, JD Souther, Amelia Heinle', null, 'An outlaw band flees a posse and rides into Refuge, a small town where no one carries a gun, drinks, or swears. The town is actually Purgatory, and the peaceful inhabitants are all famous dead outlaws and criminals such as Doc Holiday and Wild Bill Hickok who must redeem themselves before gaining admittance to Heaven... or screw up and go to Hell.', 'An outlaw band flees a posse and rides into Refuge, a small town where no one carries a gun, drinks, or swears. The town is actually Purgatory, and the peaceful inhabitants are all famous dead outlaws and criminals such as Doc Holiday and Wild Bill Hickok who must redeem themselves before gaining admittance to Heaven... or screw up and go to Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNbVYDqrsMsPJSBYONcao8CkDZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23356'),
  ('263204151122781556', 'Purgatory', 2014, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Pau Teixidor', 'Sergio G. Sánchez', 'Oona Chaplin, Ana Fernández, Andrés Gertrúdix, Sergi Méndez', null, 'A woman must survive the night after she welcomes a neighbor''s child into her home.', 'A woman must survive the night after she welcomes a neighbor''s child into her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o22g7myLjN6ldiHFiQTroqVamEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256756'),
  ('117063366595219769', 'Purgatory', 2020, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Mateusz Pastewka, Anna Kondrat, Mariusz Nowakowski', 'Michał Kondrat', 'Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Philippe Tłokiński, Kamila Kamińska, Ida Nowakowska, Marcin Kwaśny, Olga Bończyk, Maria Niklińska, Małgorzata Lewińska', null, 'From the earliest times, people have wondered what awaits them after death? And although no one has managed to penetrate the core of the mystery, over the centuries there have been people who... knew and saw more. Fulla Horak, St. Faustina Kowalska, Bl. Father Stanisław Papczyński and St. Padre Pio - these are mystics who received the grace of being visited by the souls in Purgatory and who for a moment could see the final judgment, heaven, hell and what is most mysterious - purgatory.', 'From the earliest times, people have wondered what awaits them after death? And although no one has managed to penetrate the core of the mystery, over the centuries there have been people who... knew and saw more. Fulla Horak, St. Faustina Kowalska, Bl. Father Stanisław Papczyński and St. Padre Pio - these are mystics who received the grace of being visited by the souls in Purgatory and who for a moment could see the final judgment, heaven, hell and what is most mysterious - purgatory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lXD4C42gfh1M3cKf2u9O4LcXnc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787619'),
  ('864818931344133209', 'Purge', 2012, 'Drama, History', 'Rauno Ronkainen, Antti J. Jokinen, Karin Martinson', 'Antti J. Jokinen, Marko Leino', 'Laura Birn, Liisi Tandefelt, Amanda Pilke, Peter Franzén, Kristjan Sarv, Krista Kosonen, Tommi Korpela, Sonja Nüganen', null, 'Aliide experienced The Great Terror under Stalin’s regime, and decades after her hometown people were deported to Siberia, she lives alone in an isolated house. One night, she finds a young woman in her yard – Zara has just escaped from the claws of the Russian mafia that held her as a sex slave. Survivors both, Aliide and Zara engage in unearthing each other’s motives and gradually their stories merge into one, revealing the tragedy of a family during the cruelest years in Estonian history.', 'Aliide experienced The Great Terror under Stalin’s regime, and decades after her hometown people were deported to Siberia, she lives alone in an isolated house. One night, she finds a young woman in her yard – Zara has just escaped from the claws of the Russian mafia that held her as a sex slave. Survivors both, Aliide and Zara engage in unearthing each other’s motives and gradually their stories merge into one, revealing the tragedy of a family during the cruelest years in Estonian history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SJbQvi1cw2az0NSSQlX4xdaFFL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135225'),
  ('496335207860225793', 'Purl', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Kristen Lester, David Munier, Matthew Silas', 'Kristen Lester', 'Bret Parker, Emily Davis, Michael Daley, Michael Frederickson, Erik Langley, Jimmy Lillard, Austin Madison, Kelsey Mann', 'PG', 'Purl, an earnest ball of yarn, gets a job at a fast-paced, male-centered startup company. Things start to unravel as Purl tries to fit in with this tight-knit group, but she must ask herself how far is she willing to go to get the acceptance she yearns for and if, in the end, it is worth it.', 'Purl, an earnest ball of yarn, gets a job at a fast-paced, male-centered startup company. Things start to unravel as Purl tries to fit in with this tight-knit group, but she must ask herself how far is she willing to go to get the acceptance she yearns for and if, in the end, it is worth it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8to7TlVMBwMuDgi2DJ9rVJsobE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532953'),
  ('565384881954051371', 'Puro Mula', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Enrique Pérez Him', 'Ariel Escalante', 'Domingo Lemus, Daneri Gudiel, Jairon Salguero, Diego Girón, Douglas Vazques, Roberto Díaz Gomar, Pepe Orozco', null, 'Joel is a 28 year old slacker who gets up every morning to drink beer and play his guitar. His older sister interrupts his daily routine by asking him to take care of her 6 year old kid. Joel thinks he can handle it, but things get complicated when the kid disappears from the house.', 'Joel is a 28 year old slacker who gets up every morning to drink beer and play his guitar. His older sister interrupts his daily routine by asking him to take care of her 6 year old kid. Joel thinks he can handle it, but things get complicated when the kid disappears from the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tB8BfO9fXdowDU9q1SoSY5Ju3U4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172323'),
  ('1003571644680072310', 'Purple Butterfly', 2003, 'War, Drama, History', 'Lou Ye, Wang Yu', 'Lou Ye', 'Zhang Ziyi, Liu Ye, Feng Yuanzheng, Toru Nakamura, Li Bingbing, Kin Ei, Leni Lan, Yao Anlian', null, 'Ding Hui is a member of Purple Butterfly, a powerful resistance group in Japanese occupied Shanghai. An unexpected encounter reunites her with Itami, an ex-lover and officer with a secret police unit tasked with dismantling Purple Butterfly.', 'Ding Hui is a member of Purple Butterfly, a powerful resistance group in Japanese occupied Shanghai. An unexpected encounter reunites her with Itami, an ex-lover and officer with a secret police unit tasked with dismantling Purple Butterfly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAc6iJYzfq6aI56k5K7cclgGzVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34561'),
  ('953141700604862736', 'Purple Hearts', 1984, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Sidney J. Furie, Jan Kiesser', 'Rick Natkin, Sidney J. Furie', 'Ken Wahl, Cheryl Ladd, Stephen Lee, Annie McEnroe, Paul McCrane, Cyril O''Reilly, David Harris, Hillary B. Smith', 'R', 'A Navy surgeon and a nurse fall in love while serving in Vietnam during the war. Their affection for one another provides a striking contrast to the violence of warfare.', 'A Navy surgeon and a nurse fall in love while serving in Vietnam during the war. Their affection for one another provides a striking contrast to the violence of warfare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apf9Alygj7hGbSTGKpsqzKyvb7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42310'),
  ('495578717641368058', 'Purple Hearts', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Elizabeth Allen Rosenbaum, Matt Sakatani Roe, Ishai Setton', 'Liz W. Garcia, Kyle Jarrow', 'Sofia Carson, Nicholas Galitzine, John Harlan Kim, Chosen Jacobs, Anthony Ippolito, Linden Ashby, Kat Cunning, Nicholas Duvernay', 'PG-13', 'An aspiring musician agrees to a marriage of convenience with a soon-to-deploy Marine, but a tragedy soon turns their fake relationship all too real.', 'An aspiring musician agrees to a marriage of convenience with a soon-to-deploy Marine, but a tragedy soon turns their fake relationship all too real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JyNWkryifWbWXJyxcWh3pVya6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762975'),
  ('140783212194688864', 'Purple Noon', 1960, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'René Clément, Henri Decaë, Eugène Roman', 'Paul Gégauff, René Clément', 'Alain Delon, Marie Laforêt, Maurice Ronet, Erno Crisa, Frank Latimore, Billy Kearns, Ave Ninchi, Viviane Chantel', 'PG-13', 'Tom Ripley is a talented mimic, moocher, forger and all-around criminal improviser; but there''s more to Tom Ripley than even he can guess.', 'Tom Ripley is a talented mimic, moocher, forger and all-around criminal improviser; but there''s more to Tom Ripley than even he can guess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGVRU34izQwG8YQNfVOSfKPhD3S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10363'),
  ('105260147724250265', 'Purple People Eater', 1988, 'Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Linda Shayne, Peter Deming, Gregory Kent Simmons', 'Linda Shayne', 'Ned Beatty, Shelley Winters, Neil Patrick Harris, Peggy Lipton, Chubby Checker, Little Richard, James Houghton, Thora Birch', 'PG', 'A kid plays the old novelty song "Purple People Eater" and the creature actually appears. The two then proceed to help an elderly couple who are being evicted by their greedy landlord.', 'A kid plays the old novelty song "Purple People Eater" and the creature actually appears. The two then proceed to help an elderly couple who are being evicted by their greedy landlord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DjpY5mqzudxLOgGMruNJNUDpGy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79397'),
  ('429175460883750162', 'Purple Rain', 1984, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Albert Magnoli, Anthony Brand, Don Wilkerson', 'William Blinn, Albert Magnoli', 'Prince, Apollonia Kotero, Morris Day, Jerome Benton, Olga Karlatos, Clarence Williams III, Billy Sparks, Wendy Melvoin', 'R', 'A victim of his own anger, the Kid is a Minneapolis musician on the rise with his band, the Revolution, escaping a tumultuous home life through music. While trying to avoid making the same mistakes as his truculent father, the Kid navigates the club scene and a rocky relationship with a captivating singer, Apollonia. But another musician, Morris, looks to steal the Kid''s spotlight -- and his girl.', 'A victim of his own anger, the Kid is a Minneapolis musician on the rise with his band, the Revolution, escaping a tumultuous home life through music. While trying to avoid making the same mistakes as his truculent father, the Kid navigates the club scene and a rocky relationship with a captivating singer, Apollonia. But another musician, Morris, looks to steal the Kid''s spotlight -- and his girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkQmzaSuDj8QyXmwNhCceCAmwUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13763'),
  ('973486383790778884', 'Purple Storm', 1999, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Teddy Chan, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Clarence Yip, Aubrey Lam Oi-Wah, Jojo Hui Yuet-Chun', 'Daniel Wu, Kam Kwok-Leung, Emil Chau, Josie Ho, Joan Chen, Theresa Lee Yee-Hung, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Michael Tong Man-Lung', null, 'Khmer Rouge terrorist Kieron Chow and his unit arrive in Hong Kong for their latest mission. Todd, Chow''s son and fiercely loyal right-hand man, sustains a serious head wound. Now a total amnesiac, Todd wakes from a coma to find he''s been given a new life, one that may be the death of him. With the help of psychiatrist Shirley Kwan, anti-terrorist officer Mark Chan tries to convince Todd that he is actually an undercover cop sent to infiltrate Chow''s group. As fragments of his shattered memory return, Todd is forced to choose between his dark past and this one shot at redemption', 'Khmer Rouge terrorist Kieron Chow and his unit arrive in Hong Kong for their latest mission. Todd, Chow''s son and fiercely loyal right-hand man, sustains a serious head wound. Now a total amnesiac, Todd wakes from a coma to find he''s been given a new life, one that may be the death of him. With the help of psychiatrist Shirley Kwan, anti-terrorist officer Mark Chan tries to convince Todd that he is actually an undercover cop sent to infiltrate Chow''s group. As fragments of his shattered memory return, Todd is forced to choose between his dark past and this one shot at redemption', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSpgKFsFU9GDKgCbBD8e6i7Drqy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66740'),
  ('18877536100242708', 'Purple Sunset', 2001, 'Drama, War', 'Feng Xiaoning', 'Feng Xiaoning', 'Fu Dalong, Chie Maeda, Anna Dzenilalova, 王学伟', null, 'A Soviet Russian lady officer, a Chinese peasant and a Japanese schoolgirl must walk their way out of a forest toward the end of World War II, despite their mutual distrust of one another.', 'A Soviet Russian lady officer, a Chinese peasant and a Japanese schoolgirl must walk their way out of a forest toward the end of World War II, despite their mutual distrust of one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvqVuIR23Wc3Hk4N6cm36YDlpH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151804'),
  ('705427627885872070', 'Purple Violets', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Edward Burns, William Rexer', 'Edward Burns', 'Selma Blair, Patrick Wilson, Edward Burns, Debra Messing, Dennis Farina, Dara Coleman, Heather Goldenhersh, Sarah Hudnut', 'NR', 'Patti Petalson is a promising writer, but her marriage and conventional job keep her from her dream. She longs to return to her writing, especially after running into her first love Brian Callahan, a successful crime novelist. Kate is Patti''s best friend since college; she''s a tough-talking schoolteacher who plays therapist to all Patti''s problems, while she''s got a few of her own.', 'Patti Petalson is a promising writer, but her marriage and conventional job keep her from her dream. She longs to return to her writing, especially after running into her first love Brian Callahan, a successful crime novelist. Kate is Patti''s best friend since college; she''s a tough-talking schoolteacher who plays therapist to all Patti''s problems, while she''s got a few of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n61vWKkNn1cq8p6a0foAqgrcAwu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20065'),
  ('401501277954651393', 'Purpose of Cohabitation', 2016, 'Romance', 'Joo Sung-woo', null, 'Je Dong-hwa, Park Ha-yan, Joo Ye-bin, Hee Jeong-I, Lee Jun-hyeok', null, 'Seung-gu and Yoon-hye enjoy the honeymoon. The photographer, Seung-gu, sells a glance with his senior cousin who is a neighbor cousin on his way to work. Yoon Hye, who has no hesitation in managing her body, goes to the gym for a workout and hears the breakup of Tae Joon, the PT in charge. Tae-jun, who was living in the girlfriend''s house, is kicked out with a breakup, and to Tae-jun, where he can''t go, Yoon-hye rents out a room for his newlyweds to cover the repair cost of the ride. Offer your own rent. And their purposeful cohabitation begins…', 'Seung-gu and Yoon-hye enjoy the honeymoon. The photographer, Seung-gu, sells a glance with his senior cousin who is a neighbor cousin on his way to work. Yoon Hye, who has no hesitation in managing her body, goes to the gym for a workout and hears the breakup of Tae Joon, the PT in charge. Tae-jun, who was living in the girlfriend''s house, is kicked out with a breakup, and to Tae-jun, where he can''t go, Yoon-hye rents out a room for his newlyweds to cover the repair cost of the ride. Offer your own rent. And their purposeful cohabitation begins…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XrA9pyHNoxuxNHQmSX3VCtZ7Ev.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391907'),
  ('882439013162210', 'Purpose of Reunion', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jung Dae-man', 'Jo Hyeong-woo', 'Jo In-woo, Kim Yoo-yeon, Lee Hyeon-seong, Kim Neul-me, Yoo Seung-hyeon, Choi Go-eun, Lee Hyeon-joo, Kim Jang-dong', null, 'Dongchul, who is managing a small bar, is always enthusiastic about his school reunions. One day, Yujin, who has never showed up to a reunion, shows up at his bar. Her baby face and vitality make her unlike other married women and all the men fall for her, especially Dongchul. They start a relationship but it abruptly flames out due to the sudden arrival of Dongchul’s wife. As they get to know each other''s secrets, will their love be allowed to grow?', 'Dongchul, who is managing a small bar, is always enthusiastic about his school reunions. One day, Yujin, who has never showed up to a reunion, shows up at his bar. Her baby face and vitality make her unlike other married women and all the men fall for her, especially Dongchul. They start a relationship but it abruptly flames out due to the sudden arrival of Dongchul’s wife. As they get to know each other''s secrets, will their love be allowed to grow?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjlwGaT6tDs2fBIgFaepYiDhL6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351523'),
  ('1067126726373228915', 'Purpose of Reunion 2', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Seung Woo Jin', null, 'Lee Cheol-hee, Yoon Se-na, Ji Eun-seo, Min Joon, Kim Si-eon, Yoon Sul-hee, Jung Myung-seo, Jeong Yoon-I', null, 'I am a teacher! And you are a student! During school days, the first girl Daebeom fell in love with was a practice teacher. He hit on her daringly but she did nothing but treat him like a child. Grown up Daebeom always wants to see her again and one day he heard news that she will attend this alumni reunion. Daebeom decides to seduce her at the reunion. I should sleep with her!', 'I am a teacher! And you are a student! During school days, the first girl Daebeom fell in love with was a practice teacher. He hit on her daringly but she did nothing but treat him like a child. Grown up Daebeom always wants to see her again and one day he heard news that she will attend this alumni reunion. Daebeom decides to seduce her at the reunion. I should sleep with her!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJjTRTDxCgFFZ7TEkJk36lsc9G4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534171'),
  ('364321947557723015', 'Purpose of Reunion 3', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Do-si', null, 'Lee Min-wook, Ji Eun-seo, Baek Se-ri, Park Sharon, Jeon Beom-joon', null, 'Sung-hyeon reunites with first love, Jin-hye at a class reunion.', 'Sung-hyeon reunites with first love, Jin-hye at a class reunion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEwZspwNTkYkV75rvKlfGmvQTyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502235'),
  ('144902000013972695', 'Purr-Chance to Dream', 1967, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Washam', null, null, null, 'Tom has a nightmare of being pounded by a giant dog. Jerry lures Tom into a series of encounters with a miniature vicious bulldog.', 'Tom has a nightmare of being pounded by a giant dog. Jerry lures Tom into a series of encounters with a miniature vicious bulldog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7veUhRQ14qGeW9J74SqUfgM2Bu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219581'),
  ('1090363903116706636', 'Pursued', 1947, 'Western, Drama, Romance', 'Raoul Walsh, James Wong Howe, Russell Saunders', 'Niven Busch', 'Teresa Wright, Robert Mitchum, Judith Anderson, Dean Jagger, Alan Hale, John Rodney, Harry Carey, Jr., Clifton Young', null, 'A boy haunted by nightmares about the night his entire family was murdered is brought up by a neighboring family in the 1880s. He falls for his lovely adoptive sister but his nasty adoptive brother and mysterious uncle want him dead.', 'A boy haunted by nightmares about the night his entire family was murdered is brought up by a neighboring family in the 1880s. He falls for his lovely adoptive sister but his nasty adoptive brother and mysterious uncle want him dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UjUTgSGytAYsU4WCXmaBXLtlSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26761'),
  ('645281040715539137', 'Pursued', 2004, 'Thriller, Action', 'Kristoffer Tabori, Anthony C. Metchie, Mike Southon', 'Maggie April', 'Christian Slater, Estella Warren, Gil Bellows, Chelah Horsdal, Michael Clarke Duncan, Conchita Campbell, Sarah Strange, Ken Tremblett', 'R', 'A fast rising hi-tech executive must protect his career and family from the ruthless tactics of a homicidal corporate headhunter.', 'A fast rising hi-tech executive must protect his career and family from the ruthless tactics of a homicidal corporate headhunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEn9ZZuCS57EuwoqCM3vPC6TnS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39403'),
  ('11211513978139853', 'Pursuit', 1972, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Michael Crichton, Robert L. Morrison', 'Robert Dozier', 'Ben Gazzara, E.G. Marshall, Martin Sheen, William Windom, Joseph Wiseman, Jim McMullan, Will Kuluva, Hank Brandt', null, 'When government agent Steven Graves investigates political extremist James Wright, he uncovers a diabolical plot to blast lethal nerve gas into San Diego during the Republican Convention. What''s worse, a computer hacker has provided Wright with a psychological profile to help him outwit Graves. As Wright ingeniously eludes Graves, can Graves find a way to stop him before the ultimate nightmare begins?', 'When government agent Steven Graves investigates political extremist James Wright, he uncovers a diabolical plot to blast lethal nerve gas into San Diego during the Republican Convention. What''s worse, a computer hacker has provided Wright with a psychological profile to help him outwit Graves. As Wright ingeniously eludes Graves, can Graves find a way to stop him before the ultimate nightmare begins?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSwwhQdug1GU9n7OzEHPlYXqU18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52825'),
  ('353627545811697273', 'Pursuit', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Brian Skiba, Adam Biddle', 'Dawn Bursteen, Ben Fiore, Brian Skiba', 'Emile Hirsch, John Cusack, Jake Manley, Elizabeth Faith Ludlow, Graham Patrick Martin, Heather Marie Marsden, Chris Jai Alex, Aubrey Stevens', 'R', 'Detective Breslin crosses paths with Calloway, a ruthless hacker desperate to find his wife, who has been kidnapped by a drug cartel. When Calloway escapes police custody, Breslin joins forces with a no-nonsense female cop to reclaim his prisoner. But is Calloway’s crime-boss father somehow involved in this explosive situation?', 'Detective Breslin crosses paths with Calloway, a ruthless hacker desperate to find his wife, who has been kidnapped by a drug cartel. When Calloway escapes police custody, Breslin joins forces with a no-nonsense female cop to reclaim his prisoner. But is Calloway’s crime-boss father somehow involved in this explosive situation?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUU6blOmIu155vfIgzML3ZSsDrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:871799'),
  ('287928856383810235', 'Pursuit of Happiness', 1940, 'Documentary', 'Rudy Burckhardt, Rudy Burckhardt', null, null, null, 'Photographer Rudy Burckhardt shows us the ebb and flow of people rushing about Manhattan. Equally exhilarating in his novel approach to snap images quickly on the run, a method he inaugurated and that continues to the present day. In film, he added slow and fast motion, split-screens and superimpositions to his repertory.', 'Photographer Rudy Burckhardt shows us the ebb and flow of people rushing about Manhattan. Equally exhilarating in his novel approach to snap images quickly on the run, a method he inaugurated and that continues to the present day. In film, he added slow and fast motion, split-screens and superimpositions to his repertory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5FkytiK5B3Ns8BgTDQBk0nHWO3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236333'),
  ('686752196049319724', 'Pursuit to Algiers', 1945, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller, Adventure, Romance', 'Roy William Neill, Paul Ivano, Bernard B. Brown', 'Leonard Lee', 'Basil Rathbone, Nigel Bruce, Marjorie Riordan, Rosalind Ivan, Morton Lowry, Leslie Vincent, Martin Kosleck, Rex Evans', 'NR', 'After the King of Rovenia has been assassinated, Holmes and Watson are engaged to escort his son to Europe via Algiers, aboard a transatlantic ocean liner which also carries a number of suspicious persons, any of whom may be involved in a plot to also assassinate him.', 'After the King of Rovenia has been assassinated, Holmes and Watson are engaged to escort his son to Europe via Algiers, aboard a transatlantic ocean liner which also carries a number of suspicious persons, any of whom may be involved in a plot to also assassinate him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkhEUBlbiLULLJxSrbsYZdlwxdZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50401'),
  ('895653092517750149', 'Push', 1987, 'Animation', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, null, null, 'In a convenient world where vending machines offer just about everything, the hero procures whatever he needs from machines on his journey to see the creator. He tries to make a replacement purchase of the earth. But the creator declines his request, saying simply that there''s no such thing as a brand new earth. The simplicity of the story illustrates the depths of Osamu Tezuka''s despair at the earth''s degradation, forming the gist of this 4-minute work.', 'In a convenient world where vending machines offer just about everything, the hero procures whatever he needs from machines on his journey to see the creator. He tries to make a replacement purchase of the earth. But the creator declines his request, saying simply that there''s no such thing as a brand new earth. The simplicity of the story illustrates the depths of Osamu Tezuka''s despair at the earth''s degradation, forming the gist of this 4-minute work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDvHZZNKLrDOKBDK1aYSTfGQbmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85799'),
  ('153651479987567087', 'Push', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Paul McGuigan, Peter Sova, Michael N. Wong', 'David Bourla', 'Chris Evans, Dakota Fanning, Camilla Belle, Djimon Hounsou, Cliff Curtis, Ming-Na Wen, Joel Gretsch, Nate Mooney', 'PG-13', 'After his father, an assassin, is brutally murdered, Nick Gant vows revenge on Division, the covert government agency that dabbles in psychic warfare and experimental drugs. Hiding in Hong Kong''s underworld, Nick assembles a band of rogue psychics dedicated to destroying Division. Together with Cassie, a teenage clairvoyant, Nick goes in search of a missing girl and a stolen suitcase that could be the key to accomplishing their mutual goal.', 'After his father, an assassin, is brutally murdered, Nick Gant vows revenge on Division, the covert government agency that dabbles in psychic warfare and experimental drugs. Hiding in Hong Kong''s underworld, Nick assembles a band of rogue psychics dedicated to destroying Division. Together with Cassie, a teenage clairvoyant, Nick goes in search of a missing girl and a stolen suitcase that could be the key to accomplishing their mutual goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHStfRjQGstuqtUz4Q22lbFU58M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13455'),
  ('1064464594981080617', 'Push Comes to Shove', 1991, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bill Plympton', 'Bill Plympton', null, null, 'It''s the little things that really hurt.', 'It''s the little things that really hurt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAoj3KZtM1xbCS3ZGeWLRnOyNoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47490'),
  ('820980594046661411', 'Push-Button Kitty', 1952, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Lillian Randolph', 'NR', 'Tom''s being especially lazy, which makes it even easier for Mammy to toss him out when her new mouse-catching robot cat, Mechano, arrives. Mechano is frighteningly efficient, foiling several attempts by Jerry. Jerry turns this efficiency against him by unleashing several mechanical mice; the zealous robot makes a shambles of the house, and finally itself, in the process of chasing them down. Tom is welcomed back, but at the last moment, a key part of the robot had gone down Tom''s throat; Jerry activates it, and sends Tom chasing after one of the wind-up mice.', 'Tom''s being especially lazy, which makes it even easier for Mammy to toss him out when her new mouse-catching robot cat, Mechano, arrives. Mechano is frighteningly efficient, foiling several attempts by Jerry. Jerry turns this efficiency against him by unleashing several mechanical mice; the zealous robot makes a shambles of the house, and finally itself, in the process of chasing them down. Tom is welcomed back, but at the last moment, a key part of the robot had gone down Tom''s throat; Jerry activates it, and sends Tom chasing after one of the wind-up mice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CsQQC8zcVDpPL0fqgaOFftyMHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76015'),
  ('99750739885431285', 'Pushed off a Plane and Survived', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Manu Boyer', 'Richard Blaney, Gregory Small', 'Dayo Abanikanda, Hasani Vibez Comer, Tyler Lepley, Eva Marcille, Brendan Wentworth', 'TV-14', 'Follows Jaynie who miraculously cheats death after her husband''s betrayal when a skydiving trip turns into a nightmare and she plummets 4,000 feet, only to discover his web of lies and bring him to justice.', 'Follows Jaynie who miraculously cheats death after her husband''s betrayal when a skydiving trip turns into a nightmare and she plummets 4,000 feet, only to discover his web of lies and bring him to justice.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcfMIooZWp9GsyAGZM4fuvBF03I7.jpg', 'plex:movie:pushed-off-a-plane-and-survived'),
  ('595560058484652483', 'Pusher', 1996, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Morten Søborg, Xenia Lach-Nielsen', 'Jens Dahl, Nicolas Winding Refn', 'Kim Bodnia, Mads Mikkelsen, Laura Drasbæk, Zlatko Burić, Slavko Labović, Peter Andersson, Vanja Bajicic, Lisbeth Rasmussen', null, 'A drug pusher grows increasingly desperate after a botched deal leaves him with a large debt to a ruthless drug lord.', 'A drug pusher grows increasingly desperate after a botched deal leaves him with a large debt to a ruthless drug lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Myfvq4e2BySE5aosX8UzV9cUME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2061'),
  ('64964942577092691', 'Pusher', 2012, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Luis Prieto, Simon Dennis, Paolo Guglielmotti', 'Matthew Read', 'Richard Coyle, Bronson Webb, Agyness Deyn, Zlatko Burić, Paul Kaye, Mem Ferda, Neil Maskell, Nicolas Winding Refn', 'R', 'In London, a drug dealer grows increasingly desperate over the course of a week after a botched deal lands him in the merciless clutches of a ruthless crime lord. The more desperate his behavior, the more isolated he becomes until there is nothing left standing between him and the bullet his debtors intend to fire his way.', 'In London, a drug dealer grows increasingly desperate over the course of a week after a botched deal lands him in the merciless clutches of a ruthless crime lord. The more desperate his behavior, the more isolated he becomes until there is nothing left standing between him and the bullet his debtors intend to fire his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mk7lRaYcQK2y5jRo1C9Cdgr9JOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115276'),
  ('138823878515413448', 'Pusher II', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Morten Søborg, Niels Nørløv Hansen', 'Nicolas Winding Refn', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Leif Sylvester, Anne Sørensen, Kurt Nielsen, Øyvind Hagen-Traberg, Karsten Schrøder, Maria Erwolter, Dan Dommer', 'NR', 'Tonny is released from prison - again. This time he has his mind set on changing his broken down life, but that is easier said than done.', 'Tonny is released from prison - again. This time he has his mind set on changing his broken down life, but that is easier said than done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxvyw5NZBphzWliVdSzn7gSxUel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11328'),
  ('656936153671694881', 'Pusher III', 2005, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Morten Søborg, Niels Nørløv Hansen', 'Nicolas Winding Refn', 'Zlatko Burić, Marinela Dekic, Slavko Labović, Ramadan Huseini, Kurt Nielsen, Ilyas Agac, Kujtim Loki, Vasilije Bojičić', null, 'Milo is aging, he is planning his daughter''s 25th birthday, and his shipment of heroin turns out to be 10,000 pills of ecstasy. When Milo tries to sell the pills anyway, all Hell breaks loose and his only chance is to ask for help from his ex-henchman and old friend Radovan.', 'Milo is aging, he is planning his daughter''s 25th birthday, and his shipment of heroin turns out to be 10,000 pills of ecstasy. When Milo tries to sell the pills anyway, all Hell breaks loose and his only chance is to ask for help from his ex-henchman and old friend Radovan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLBQtXaKv9LDh7ie4yIvgrv5TmD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11330'),
  ('132098856254457592', 'Pushing Hands', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ang Lee, Jong Lin', 'James Schamus, Ang Lee', 'Lung Sihung, Wang Bozhao, Deb Snyder, Wang Lai, Fanny De Luz, Haan Lee, Wang Hung-Chang, Jeanne Kuo Chang', null, 'Mr. Chu is an elderly widower who teaches tai chi chuan in Beijing. He moves to America to live with his son''s family, but finds the cultural adjustment difficult. Since his daughter-in-law is a white woman who does not speak Chinese, Mr. Chu''s son, Alex, must mediate.', 'Mr. Chu is an elderly widower who teaches tai chi chuan in Beijing. He moves to America to live with his son''s family, but finds the cultural adjustment difficult. Since his daughter-in-law is a white woman who does not speak Chinese, Mr. Chu''s son, Alex, must mediate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2z7QvDFDYnjd7nQhAfMW1zDihXd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25296'),
  ('165337530566026434', 'Pushing Tin', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mike Newell, Gale Tattersall, David Webb', 'Glen Charles, Les Charles', 'John Cusack, Billy Bob Thornton, Cate Blanchett, Angelina Jolie, Jake Weber, Kurt Fuller, Vicki Lewis, Matt Ross', 'R', 'Two air traffic controllers who thrive on living dangerously compete to outdo each other on several levels.', 'Two air traffic controllers who thrive on living dangerously compete to outdo each other on several levels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61FWajJNKeS27DO4KgvS5LUgcHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12596'),
  ('75624509564621273', 'Pushover', 1954, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Richard Quine, Lester White, Jack Corrick', 'Roy Huggins', 'Fred MacMurray, Philip Carey, Kim Novak, Dorothy Malone, E.G. Marshall, Allen Nourse, James Anderson, Joe Bailey', 'NR', 'A police detective falls for the bank robber''s girlfriend he is supposed to be tailing.', 'A police detective falls for the bank robber''s girlfriend he is supposed to be tailing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fABS18Pm2jui9EyRQSHUONU9VmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31555'),
  ('938070893168033504', 'Pushpa 2 - The Rule', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Sukumar, Mirosław Kuba Brożek, Peter Hein', 'Sukumar, Vemareddi Thummallapalli', 'Allu Arjun, Rashmika Mandanna, Fahadh Faasil, Jagadeesh Bandari, Rao Ramesh, Sunil Varma, Anasuya Bharadwaj, Ajay', 'NR', 'As his smuggling empire grows, a brazen Pushpa longs for power and respect on his vengeful journey, while facing old rivals and new.', 'As his smuggling empire grows, a brazen Pushpa longs for power and respect on his vengeful journey, while facing old rivals and new.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhxZj3y59cK7JtGdV285dhDRaMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857598'),
  ('843721618719111166', 'Pushpa: The Rise', 2021, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Mirosław Kuba Brożek, K Devaraj, Sukumar', 'Sukumar', 'Allu Arjun, Rashmika Mandanna, Jagadeesh Bandari, Sunil Varma, Anasuya Bharadwaj, Dhananjay, Ajay Ghosh, Fahadh Faasil', null, 'As Pushpa, a labourer, rises in the world of red sandalwood smuggling, he ends up making many enemies. However, violence ensues when the police try to topple his illegal business.', 'As Pushpa, a labourer, rises in the world of red sandalwood smuggling, he ends up making many enemies. However, violence ensues when the police try to topple his illegal business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaRk2HgOirEeNuDCwwScmq7rKvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:690957'),
  ('258233282335765150', 'Pushpaka Vimana', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Singeetam Srinivasa Rao, B. C. Gowrishankar', 'Singeetam Srinivasa Rao', 'Kamal Haasan, Amala Akkineni, Tinnu Anand, Sameer Kakkar, Farida Jalal, K. S. Ramesh, Prathap Pothan, Loknath', 'PG-13', 'An unemployed man, who dreams of living it large, finds a rich man drunk and lying in the sewer. Things take a turn when he imprisons him and takes his identity to get a taste of his lifestyle.', 'An unemployed man, who dreams of living it large, finds a rich man drunk and lying in the sewer. Things take a turn when he imprisons him and takes his identity to get a taste of his lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azTpDHh87L89TtEsj77bWnV08Ew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36810'),
  ('546807839924510212', 'Puss ''n Boots Travels Around the World', 1976, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Hiroshi Shidara, Koichi Tsunoda', 'Tomoharu Katsumata', 'Osami Nabe, Eiko Masuyama, Takuzō Kamiyama, Chikao Ohtsuka, Kosei Tomita, Isamu Tanonaka, Joji Yanami, Osamu Kato', null, 'Brave cat Pero once had a bet with treacherous multimillionarie Grumon that he can travel around the world in 80 days. The stake is high, in case of success Grumon will give all of his fortune to Pero, but in case of failure Pero becomes slave of Grumon for the rest of his life. Pero departs together with his faithful friends behemoth Kato and brave Small Mouse. Grumon tries everything to prevent their arrival to the finish.', 'Brave cat Pero once had a bet with treacherous multimillionarie Grumon that he can travel around the world in 80 days. The stake is high, in case of success Grumon will give all of his fortune to Pero, but in case of failure Pero becomes slave of Grumon for the rest of his life. Pero departs together with his faithful friends behemoth Kato and brave Small Mouse. Grumon tries everything to prevent their arrival to the finish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIj0KDDPyaJ6HcqkdThTomnLQYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126150'),
  ('1045448328006769445', 'Puss ''n'' Boats', 1966, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Abe Levitow', null, null, null, 'Jerry''s a wharf mouse; he sees a load of cheese being loaded onto a cargo ship and tries a variety of tricks to board, but Tom is on guard.', 'Jerry''s a wharf mouse; he sees a load of cheese being loaded onto a cargo ship and tries a variety of tricks to board, but Tom is on guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2q6H2nV1fAI2VGxXaziQkRbflaK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234327'),
  ('388815043314124610', 'Puss Cafe', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Milton the cat is walking down the street and notices a yard full of delicious milk, birds, and fish not realizing it is guarded by Pluto. He shows his inferior minded pal Richard the set up and both help themselves to the goodies but are chased out by Pluto. From that point on, they try to get into the yard without waking Pluto using such tactics as sling-shooting Pluto out of the yard with his hammock and underwater diving for fish with a makeshift diving helmet.', 'Milton the cat is walking down the street and notices a yard full of delicious milk, birds, and fish not realizing it is guarded by Pluto. He shows his inferior minded pal Richard the set up and both help themselves to the goodies but are chased out by Pluto. From that point on, they try to get into the yard without waking Pluto using such tactics as sling-shooting Pluto out of the yard with his hammock and underwater diving for fish with a makeshift diving helmet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xF9oqIJzVdpqX8PjfF8FpaI4CYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51026'),
  ('569240013802762189', 'Puss Gets the Boot', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Lillian Randolph, Harry Lang, William Hanna', 'NR', 'Jasper is given an ultimatum by his master: break one more thing and you''re out. Rodent Jerry does his best to make sure that his tormentor "gets the boot".', 'Jasper is given an ultimatum by his master: break one more thing and you''re out. Rodent Jerry does his best to make sure that his tormentor "gets the boot".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YBzcEuKxSiWoWvGw1RU8CyrW1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40372'),
  ('487214643224014932', 'Puss in Book: Trapped in an Epic Tale', 2017, 'Family, Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Roy Burdine, Johnny Castuciano', 'Doug Langdale, Greg White', 'Eric Bauza, Jayma Mays, Maria Bamford, Jeff Bennett, Ron Funches, Jim Cummings, Carla Jimenez, Ariebella Makana', 'G', 'After tumbling into a magic storybook, Puss in Boots must fight, dance and romance his way through wild adventures as he searches for an escape.', 'After tumbling into a magic storybook, Puss in Boots must fight, dance and romance his way through wild adventures as he searches for an escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgLbNi7LBoXLikf6B5XrcT1yl79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462650'),
  ('807161086469460954', 'Puss in Boots', 1922, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'A boy falls for a princess, his cat for hers. But her father does not like the idea of a commoner marrying a noblewoman and kicks him out. After seeing a Rudolpho Valensino movie at the local theater his cat has the idea that he could try impressing the king as bullfighter, to win his daughters hand. Bullfighting is relatively easy, when you can hypnotize the bull, but why does his cat need new boots ?', 'A boy falls for a princess, his cat for hers. But her father does not like the idea of a commoner marrying a noblewoman and kicks him out. After seeing a Rudolpho Valensino movie at the local theater his cat has the idea that he could try impressing the king as bullfighter, to win his daughters hand. Bullfighting is relatively easy, when you can hypnotize the bull, but why does his cat need new boots ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMNCipJdwK29KnMhxSsNUZAmsCi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154480'),
  ('222265809543085556', 'Puss in Boots', 1968, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Valentina Brumberg, Zinaida Brumberg, Boris Kotov', 'Moris Slobodskoy', 'Igor Divov, Vasiliy Livanov, Anatoliy Papanov, Yevgeni Vesnik, Klara Rumyanova', null, 'Following the death of their miller father, his eldest son inherits the mill, the middle one a donkey, and the youngest a cat. While initially disappointed, the lad soon learns not only that the cat can talk but is quite resourceful.', 'Following the death of their miller father, his eldest son inherits the mill, the middle one a donkey, and the youngest a cat. While initially disappointed, the lad soon learns not only that the cat can talk but is quite resourceful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySz84uT3L8vFNoygEPsZwYSW0ou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160425'),
  ('640246767276156024', 'Puss in Boots', 1988, 'Fantasy, Family, Music', 'Eugene Marner, Avraham Karpick', 'Charles Perrault', 'Christopher Walken, Jason Connery, Carmela Marner, Yossi Graber, Amnon Meskin, Elki Jacobs, Michael Schneider, Ya''ackov Ben-Sira', 'G', 'Following the death of their miller father, his eldest son inherits the mill, the middle one a donkey, and the youngest a cat. While initially disappointed, the lad soon learns not only that the cat can talk but is quite resourceful.', 'Following the death of their miller father, his eldest son inherits the mill, the middle one a donkey, and the youngest a cat. While initially disappointed, the lad soon learns not only that the cat can talk but is quite resourceful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LBnNHR5kzIwLkPOaMMW7zgZLnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141879'),
  ('1103002238758515644', 'Puss in Boots', 1995, 'Animation', 'Aleksandr Dvigubskiy, Garri Bardin', 'Garri Bardin', 'Konstantin Raykin, Rogvold Sukhoverko', null, 'The cat in the bag arrives in Russia as part of humanitarian aid from America and gets young drunk and mountain-the patriot Karabasov, which offers to emigrate to America. Flying on the magic cat which uses the tail as a propeller, dropped over Europe. There conceited young man forgets about the invaluable services rendered him puss in boots, and he returns ungrateful back to Russia...', 'The cat in the bag arrives in Russia as part of humanitarian aid from America and gets young drunk and mountain-the patriot Karabasov, which offers to emigrate to America. Flying on the magic cat which uses the tail as a propeller, dropped over Europe. There conceited young man forgets about the invaluable services rendered him puss in boots, and he returns ungrateful back to Russia...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ApYiJDmkqOlrrr668QMJUItaQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151455'),
  ('580177723606537685', 'Puss in Boots', 2011, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Dan Golembeski, Chris Miller, Matt Johnson', 'Tom Wheeler', 'Antonio Banderas, Salma Hayek Pinault, Zach Galifianakis, Billy Bob Thornton, Amy Sedaris, Constance Marie, Mike Mitchell, Rich Dietl', 'PG', 'Long before he even met Shrek, the notorious fighter, lover and outlaw Puss in Boots becomes a hero when he sets off on an adventure with the tough and street smart Kitty Softpaws and the mastermind Humpty Dumpty to save his town. This is the true story of The Cat, The Myth, The Legend... The Boots.', 'Long before he even met Shrek, the notorious fighter, lover and outlaw Puss in Boots becomes a hero when he sets off on an adventure with the tough and street smart Kitty Softpaws and the mastermind Humpty Dumpty to save his town. This is the true story of The Cat, The Myth, The Legend... The Boots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4UkIqNYSTr4DPoHCVfLrL8mbre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417859'),
  ('854916064829354055', 'Puss in Boots: The Last Wish', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Joel Crawford, Januel Mercado', 'Paul Fisher, Tommy Swerdlow', 'Antonio Banderas, Salma Hayek Pinault, Harvey Guillén, Wagner Moura, Florence Pugh, Olivia Colman, Ray Winstone, Samson Kayo', 'PG', 'Puss in Boots discovers that his passion for adventure has taken its toll: He has burned through eight of his nine lives, leaving him with only one life left. Puss sets out on an epic journey to find the mythical Last Wish and restore his nine lives.', 'Puss in Boots discovers that his passion for adventure has taken its toll: He has burned through eight of his nine lives, leaving him with only one life left. Puss sets out on an epic journey to find the mythical Last Wish and restore his nine lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuf6dutpsT0vSVehic3EZIqkOBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315162'),
  ('1039943369111165876', 'Puss in Boots: The Three Diablos', 2012, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Raman Hui Shing-Ngai', 'Tom Wheeler', 'Antonio Banderas, Gilles Marini, Charlotte Newhouse, Chris Miller, Walt Dohrn, Bret Marnell, Miles Bakshi, Nina Zoe Bakshi', 'G', 'Puss in Boots is on a mission to recover the Princess'' stolen ruby from the notorious French thief, Whisperer. Reluctantly accompanied by three little kittens, Three Diablos, Puss must tame them before they endanger the mission.', 'Puss in Boots is on a mission to recover the Princess'' stolen ruby from the notorious French thief, Whisperer. Reluctantly accompanied by three little kittens, Three Diablos, Puss must tame them before they endanger the mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptvbHUWpU8Nh6vrmSvjx4ESDgfC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83201'),
  ('293617538054754887', 'Puss n'' Boots', 1961, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Roberto Rodríguez, Manuel San Fernando, Rosalío Solano', 'Sergio Magaña Hidalgo', 'Santanón, Antonio Raxel, Humberto Dupeyrón, Edmundo Benitez, Rocío Rosales, Luis Manuel Pelayo, Armando Gutiérrez, Ana María Hernández', null, 'Following the death of their miller father, his eldest son inherits the mill, the middle one a donkey, and the youngest a cat. While initially disappointed, the lad soon learns not only that the cat can talk but is quite resourceful.', 'Following the death of their miller father, his eldest son inherits the mill, the middle one a donkey, and the youngest a cat. While initially disappointed, the lad soon learns not only that the cat can talk but is quite resourceful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3C7V8BdwqQVDaeod5sRqL24ZMBU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126486'),
  ('812518547913939930', 'Puss n'' Booty', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Bea Benaderet, Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Woman wonders why her little pet birds keep disappearing. Rudolph the cat knows, but other than burping feathers, he''s not saying. But it looks like he''s met his match when the woman orders another bird from the pet shop: a little yellow canary named "Petey".', 'Woman wonders why her little pet birds keep disappearing. Rudolph the cat knows, but other than burping feathers, he''s not saying. But it looks like he''s met his match when the woman orders another bird from the pet shop: a little yellow canary named "Petey".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lusnIwyZYsmCBxnUKhy3xWSxz6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163125'),
  ('74452075432436033', 'Puss n'' Toots', 1942, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Lillian Randolph', 'NR', 'Tom is playing with Jerry when a cute lady cat is delivered to Mammy for her to take care of. Tom is smitten at first sight.', 'Tom is playing with Jerry when a cute lady cat is delivered to Mammy for her to take care of. Tom is smitten at first sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aj2X4KDO0kKA9lYKYVjh41dW7L1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40163'),
  ('724345878838236898', 'PussyCake', 2021, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Music', 'Matías Rispau, Pablo Parés, Román Kampelmacher', 'Maximiliano Ferzzola', 'Macarena Suárez Dagliano, Aldana Ruberto, Anahí Politi, Florencia Moreno, Sofia Rossi, Rodrigo Ferreyra, Amanda Nara, Diego Prinz', null, 'A struggling all-female rock band kicks off a new tour, hoping to rekindle their popularity. When they catch the attention of horrors from beyond our reality, the band realizes that being forgotten by their fans is the least of their problems.', 'A struggling all-female rock band kicks off a new tour, hoping to rekindle their popularity. When they catch the attention of horrors from beyond our reality, the band realizes that being forgotten by their fans is the least of their problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5450Y6bf32vfAYRZjz6G36azBYl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:910494'),
  ('101422350243141949', 'PUSSYCAT', 2010, 'Comedy, Animation, Horror', 'Takena Nagao', 'Takena Nagao', null, null, 'A pretty female cat gets into trouble. What''s gonna happen?', 'A pretty female cat gets into trouble. What''s gonna happen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYyZt2zVmDrqtV5gnzoPR6GrX7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451692'),
  ('809181780783771696', 'Pussycat, Pussycat, I Love You', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Rod Amateau, Francesco Cinieri, Mario Jurisic', 'Rod Amateau', 'Ian McShane, Anna Calder-Marshall, John Gavin, Severn Darden, Joyce Van Patten, Beba Lončar, Leopoldo Trieste, Katia Christine', 'R', 'An American playwright living in Rome consults a quack psychiatrist to combat his fears of balding and save his failing marriage.', 'An American playwright living in Rome consults a quack psychiatrist to combat his fears of balding and save his failing marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NG3iF6mli8QMJYNsbzWxzW04t4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140638'),
  ('843398847308322141', 'Put Grandma in the Freezer', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Serena Filippone, Elisa Becchere, Giulia Dappio', 'Fabio Bonifacci', 'Fabio De Luigi, Miriam Leone, Barbara Bouchet, Lucia Ocone, Marina Rocco, Susy Laude, Francesco Di Leva, Carlo Luca De Ruggieri', null, 'Simone, a clumsy financier, falls in love with Claudia, who’s living on her grandma’s retirement checks. When the old lady dies Claudia hides the body in a freezer, and sets up a fraud with the help of some friends to avoid bankruptcy.', 'Simone, a clumsy financier, falls in love with Claudia, who’s living on her grandma’s retirement checks. When the old lady dies Claudia hides the body in a freezer, and sets up a fraud with the help of some friends to avoid bankruptcy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7K2iPuEap1FpevNkWxFfKzKQk1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492353'),
  ('1052541614271922202', 'Put Your Devil Into My Hell', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Bitto Albertini, Pier Luigi Santi', 'Bitto Albertini, Marino Onorati', 'Antonio Cantafora, Melinda Pillon, Margaret Rose Keil, Piera Viotti, Renate Schmidt, Mario Frera, Mimmo Baldi, Luca Sportelli', null, 'Ricciardetto is a fourteenth-century playboy who wants at all costs to sleep with the wife of the mayor of Montelupone. He succeeds, but is caught between the covers with the woman and sentenced to death. He will be saved by a kind of pilgrim saint who is in love with him.', 'Ricciardetto is a fourteenth-century playboy who wants at all costs to sleep with the wife of the mayor of Montelupone. He succeeds, but is caught between the covers with the woman and sentenced to death. He will be saved by a kind of pilgrim saint who is in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMMU1WLpk8C5xiUwgGIbyYjC95R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391850'),
  ('74840803210768291', 'Put Your Soul on Your Hand and Walk', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Sepideh Farsi', 'Sepideh Farsi', 'Fatima Hassouna, Sepideh Farsi', null, 'An Iranian filmmaker participates in a series of video calls with a young Palestinian photojournalist who describes her life confined in Gaza during the current regional conflict.', 'An Iranian filmmaker participates in a series of video calls with a young Palestinian photojournalist who describes her life confined in Gaza during the current regional conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvX6kJY22996t8Jrvnw0N409qAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1465560'),
  ('494343045532172815', 'Put-Put Troubles', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Riley Thomson, Ralph Chadwick', null, 'Clarence Nash, Lee Millar', 'NR', 'Pluto is towing Donald and his little motorboat. He gets distracted by a frog, and the boat runs away from him. While Pluto is struggling with the frog, and then a bedspring, Donald struggles with the outboard motor, which either won''t start, or when it does start, has a tendency to destroy the boat.', 'Pluto is towing Donald and his little motorboat. He gets distracted by a frog, and the boat runs away from him. While Pluto is struggling with the frog, and then a bedspring, Donald struggles with the outboard motor, which either won''t start, or when it does start, has a tendency to destroy the boat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yZiHcuOmLjIyn38ySBlNt17D5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76028'),
  ('761286781066828256', 'Putin', 2025, 'Thriller, War, Crime', 'Patryk Vega, Michał Gościk, Karolina Puss', 'Patryk Vega', 'Sławomir Sobala, Thomas Kretschmann, Maksymilian Zieliński, Justyna Karłowska, Przemysław Bluszcz, Tomasz Dedek, Aron Jończyk, Michał Karmowski', 'R', 'A portrait of a formidable political figure, unraveling the contrasting facets of an iron-fisted tyrant and a man haunted by fear.', 'A portrait of a formidable political figure, unraveling the contrasting facets of an iron-fisted tyrant and a man haunted by fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3Q2MrpmaOrKfN2pInNvRNhYa4G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255795'),
  ('1073737008022375394', 'Putin''s Bears - The Most Dangerous Hackers in the World', 2024, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Jaïr Mahazri, David, Jonas', 'Jonas, David', 'Jonas, Claudia Haydt, Florian Flade, Hakan Tanriverdi, Kerstin Zettl-Schabath, Stephan Mayer, Tabea Rößner, Victor Zhora', null, 'They call themselves Fancy Bear, Cozy Bear or Voodoo Bear. Elite units of the Russian secret services are hidden behind these code names. They are among the most dangerous hackers in the world. The bears were already in the computer of then-Chancellor Angela Merkel in 2015, interfered in the US election campaign in 2016 and are currently influencing the war in Ukraine. The makers of the successful YouTube channel “Simplicissimus” in co-production with funk and SWR are back and show the destructive potential of state hacking with this documentary. With the help of leading German hackers, cyberspace experts and a lot of humor, they delicately demystify the Russian bears: Who are the people behind them? How do they operate? And what makes them so incredibly dangerous?', 'They call themselves Fancy Bear, Cozy Bear or Voodoo Bear. Elite units of the Russian secret services are hidden behind these code names. They are among the most dangerous hackers in the world. The bears were already in the computer of then-Chancellor Angela Merkel in 2015, interfered in the US election campaign in 2016 and are currently influencing the war in Ukraine. The makers of the successful YouTube channel “Simplicissimus” in co-production with funk and SWR are back and show the destructive potential of state hacking with this documentary. With the help of leading German hackers, cyberspace experts and a lot of humor, they delicately demystify the Russian bears: Who are the people behind them? How do they operate? And what makes them so incredibly dangerous?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QZ7AW1uppZxxeMayNYdmf4Lvab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1250101'),
  ('554249700935343234', 'Putin''s Palace: History of World''s Largest Bribe', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Felix Angermaier, Alexei Navalny', 'Alexei Navalny, Maria Pevchikh, Georgy Alburov', 'Alexei Navalny, Georgy Alburov, Vyacheslav Gimadi, Alina Kabaeva, Vladimir Putin, Anatoly Sobchak', null, 'After surviving poisoning by a Novichok nerve agent, Alexey Navalny made his most important film. Putin''s Palace: History of World''s Largest Bribe is about the palace near Gelendzhik that presumably belongs to Russian President Vladimir Putin. It also shows vineyards, corruption schemes and more.', 'After surviving poisoning by a Novichok nerve agent, Alexey Navalny made his most important film. Putin''s Palace: History of World''s Largest Bribe is about the palace near Gelendzhik that presumably belongs to Russian President Vladimir Putin. It also shows vineyards, corruption schemes and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCHGLwJfyBtesraJcK7xsOOFNtU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787721'),
  ('724516187738499894', 'Putney Swope', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Robert Downey Sr., Gerald Cotts', 'Robert Downey Sr.', 'Arnold Johnson, Stan Gottlieb, Allen Garfield, Archie Russell, Ramon Gordon, Bert Lawrence, Joe Madden, Antonio Fargas', 'R', 'Swope—the only black man on the executive board of an advertising firm—is accidentally put in charge after the death of the chairman.', 'Swope—the only black man on the executive board of an advertising firm—is accidentally put in charge after the death of the chairman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77hzrjyRGCuytrz6xYc8Cv2JPDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32575'),
  ('999519835675320350', 'Puttin'' on the Dog', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, null, 'NR', 'Jerry runs into a dog pound (and right on top of a napping Spike) to escape a rather mangy-looking Tom. To avoid being ripped to shreds, Tom borrows the head of a nearby dog statue. This easily fools the dogs, but not Jerry, and Tom keeps losing his newfound head...', 'Jerry runs into a dog pound (and right on top of a napping Spike) to escape a rather mangy-looking Tom. To avoid being ripped to shreds, Tom borrows the head of a nearby dog statue. This easily fools the dogs, but not Jerry, and Tom keeps losing his newfound head...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1gm966K8oyGwKxl7BftYDnKIcu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39842'),
  ('69989541592006576', 'Putting Pants on Philip', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Clyde Bruckman, George Stevens', 'H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Chester A. Bachman, Don Bailey, Sam Lufkin, Chet Brandenburg, Ed Brandenburg, Harvey Clark', null, 'Pompous J. Piedmont Mumblethunder greets his nephew from Scotland who arrives in kilts. He is immediately taken to a tailor for a pair of proper pants.', 'Pompous J. Piedmont Mumblethunder greets his nephew from Scotland who arrives in kilts. He is immediately taken to a tailor for a pair of proper pants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UBUovEv7mQzvl3UIOChbMm91Ql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50901'),
  ('1070652592801734404', 'Putty Tat Trouble', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Tweety Bird is shoveling out his nest atop a city pole after a snowstorm and is spotted by Sylvester Cat and a one-eyed orange tabby, who fight over Tweety. Tweety runs into a cellar where he befriends a wooden dunking bird. The two cats then chase Tweety into a park and onto a sheet of ice covering a pond. Tweety cuts a circle around the cats so that they fall into the freezing water and become bedridden with cold.', 'Tweety Bird is shoveling out his nest atop a city pole after a snowstorm and is spotted by Sylvester Cat and a one-eyed orange tabby, who fight over Tweety. Tweety runs into a cellar where he befriends a wooden dunking bird. The two cats then chase Tweety into a park and onto a sheet of ice covering a pond. Tweety cuts a circle around the cats so that they fall into the freezing water and become bedridden with cold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3grFW3l2G244Oj4r0PStxxrnmRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100339'),
  ('1135108954430447773', 'Puyo Puyo: Madou Monogatari', 1998, null, 'Hiroshi Kurimoto, Yoshiaki Iwasaki, Takashi Asami', 'Natsuki Yamaguchi', null, null, 'Short skits about the characters from the Puyo Puyo video game series.', 'Short skits about the characters from the Puyo Puyo video game series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wV23SRp8pvnxJuqQTE0U4fa8MMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582626'),
  ('407014530858685990', 'Puzzle', 1974, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Horror', 'Duccio Tessari, Giulio Albonico, Mario Forges Davanzati', 'Bruno Di Geronimo, Duccio Tessari, Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Senta Berger, Luc Merenda, Umberto Orsini, Anita Strindberg, Bruno Corazzari, Rosario Borelli, Manfred Freyberger, Tom Felleghy', null, 'In London, A man who has amnesia attempts to uncover the truth about his identity. A menacing individual accuses him of betrayal, and soon more pieces of his puzzling past begin to fall in place.', 'In London, A man who has amnesia attempts to uncover the truth about his identity. A menacing individual accuses him of betrayal, and soon more pieces of his puzzling past begin to fall in place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUe2BVWluOaIref31jRV7mmYRLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93142'),
  ('677512197214517646', 'Puzzle', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Eisuke Naito, Yoko Itakura', 'Eisuke Naito, Makoto Sasaki', 'Kaho, Shuhei Nomura, Kazuya Takahashi, Saori Yagi, Kokone Sasaki, Ryuzo Tanaka, Baku Ohwada, Keisuke Tomita', null, 'High school student Azusa jumps off from the rooftop of a school building, but she survives. One month later, the school is taken over by group of people wearing bizarre masks. A pregnant teacher is imprisoned, while the head director of the school and male students disappear. Azusa then finds pieces of a puzzle in an envelope given to her by classmate Shigeo. The puzzle pieces holds the key to solve the case. Azusa chases after Shigeo and she sees something which is unimaginable.', 'High school student Azusa jumps off from the rooftop of a school building, but she survives. One month later, the school is taken over by group of people wearing bizarre masks. A pregnant teacher is imprisoned, while the head director of the school and male students disappear. Azusa then finds pieces of a puzzle in an envelope given to her by classmate Shigeo. The puzzle pieces holds the key to solve the case. Azusa chases after Shigeo and she sees something which is unimaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iv7bb2mz5o9BSY7os3SOHFx1gfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278545'),
  ('654745396450673131', 'Puzzle', 2018, 'Drama', 'Marc Turtletaub, Christopher Norr, Chris Carroll', 'Natalia Smirnoff', 'Kelly Macdonald, Irrfan Khan, David Denman, Daniel Stewart Sherman, Austin Abrams, Bubba Weiler, Helen Coxe, Mandela Bellamy', 'R', 'After years of caring exclusively for the needs of her husband and children, Agnes, a devoted housewife living in a small town near New York, has found something she really enjoys doing: solving puzzles.', 'After years of caring exclusively for the needs of her husband and children, Agnes, a devoted housewife living in a small town near New York, has found something she really enjoys doing: solving puzzles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CfijsjOsPKzz2Dd1zoMF5VPmZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492998'),
  ('959175645377674066', 'Puzzle of a Downfall Child', 1970, 'Drama', 'Jerry Schatzberg, Adam Holender', 'Carole Eastman', 'Faye Dunaway, Barry Primus, Viveca Lindfors, Barry Morse, Roy Scheider, Ruth Jackson, John Heffernan, Sydney Walker', 'R', 'Lou Andreas Sand, a once famous model, recalls her past as she tries to make success in the modeling world of New York, her stressful workdays, her affair with Mark, an advertising executive, her friendship with photographer Aaron, and her downward spiral into ruin.', 'Lou Andreas Sand, a once famous model, recalls her past as she tries to make success in the modeling world of New York, her stressful workdays, her affair with Mark, an advertising executive, her friendship with photographer Aaron, and her downward spiral into ruin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovQKanEmgIFs8jJxAajuuBRez1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92937'),
  ('596575914431071199', 'Puzzlehead', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'James Bai', 'James Bai', 'Stephen Galaida, Robbie Shapiro, Chuck Ardezzone, John El Manahi, Edward Furs', 'NR', 'In a post apocalyptic world where technology is outlawed, Walter, a reclusive scientist, secretly creates a self-aware android, "Puzzlehead". Jealously erupts when Puzzlehead wins the affection of Julia, the beautiful shopgirl that Walter has longed for. The resulting sci-fi love triangle is a Frankensteinian fable that traps all three in a web of deception and the ultimate betrayal.', 'In a post apocalyptic world where technology is outlawed, Walter, a reclusive scientist, secretly creates a self-aware android, "Puzzlehead". Jealously erupts when Puzzlehead wins the affection of Julia, the beautiful shopgirl that Walter has longed for. The resulting sci-fi love triangle is a Frankensteinian fable that traps all three in a web of deception and the ultimate betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmF7J1x8aS5Pf6DJhFNJA63ThXJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18634'),
  ('576846263906473093', 'PVC-1', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Spiros Stathoulopoulos, Juan Pablo Salazar Barney', 'Dwight Istanbulian, Spiros Stathoulopoulos', 'Mérida Urquía, Daniel Páez, Alberto Zornoza, Hugo Pereira, Patricia Rueda, Andres Mahecha, Dario Pira, Wilmer Sanchez Medina', null, 'Ofelia, an innocent rural woman, fights against time for her life after a group of common criminals place a bomb collar on her to extort her husband for an insignificant sum of money.', 'Ofelia, an innocent rural woman, fights against time for her life after a group of common criminals place a bomb collar on her to extort her husband for an insignificant sum of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3bWGtqFbT9m02leUiOTl6miqCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40597'),
  ('448779804484560272', 'PVT Chat', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ben Hozie, Ben Hozie, Robert Brink', 'Ben Hozie', 'Peter Vack, Julia Fox, Keith Poulson, Buddy Duress, Nikki Belfiglio, Kevin Moccia, Atticus Cain, David J. White', 'NR', 'Jack is an internet gambler living in NYC. After the death of his roommate, he becomes fixated on Scarlet - a cam girl from San Francisco. His obsession reaches a boiling point when fantasy materializes in reality and Jack sees Scarlet on a rainy NYC Chinatown street.', 'Jack is an internet gambler living in NYC. After the death of his roommate, he becomes fixated on Scarlet - a cam girl from San Francisco. His obsession reaches a boiling point when fantasy materializes in reality and Jack sees Scarlet on a rainy NYC Chinatown street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvGBoCe0IPRlpwx5QsrRrcMmuLT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670129'),
  ('397813208775030568', 'Pyaar Impossible!', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jugal Hansraj, Rohan Khambati, Santosh Thundiyil', 'Uday Chopra', 'Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Uday Chopra, Advika Yadav, Anupam Kher, Dino Morea, Rahul Vohra, Jugal Hansraj, Mark Charnick', 'PG', 'Be-spectacled geek, Abhay falls in love with college hottie, Alisha and silently slinks away into the shadows when he realises she''s unattainable. Seven years later, he re-enters her life as the nanny and hopes to woo the single mom, this time at least. Does he succeed?', 'Be-spectacled geek, Abhay falls in love with college hottie, Alisha and silently slinks away into the shadows when he realises she''s unattainable. Seven years later, he re-enters her life as the nanny and hopes to woo the single mom, this time at least. Does he succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8aqtzrGYLVZQTKgi7wU8Qg0Ikg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29538'),
  ('1030507923142901070', 'Pyaar Ka Punchnama', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Luv Ranjan', 'Luv Ranjan', 'Kartik Aaryan, Raayo S. Bakhirta, Divyendu Sharma, Nushrratt Bharuccha, Sonnalli Seygall, Ishita Raj Sharma, Ranjit Batra, Padam Bhola', null, 'Nishant starts dating Charu while his roommates Rajat and Vikrant already have girlfriends in Neha and Rhea respectively. Trouble starts when the guys feel that their girlfriends are dominating them.', 'Nishant starts dating Charu while his roommates Rajat and Vikrant already have girlfriends in Neha and Rhea respectively. Trouble starts when the guys feel that their girlfriends are dominating them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKCuXtM3hpsm9kLu1Jlg5E79owb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65521'),
  ('817288723885502126', 'Pyaar Ka Punchnama 2', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Luv Ranjan, Sharib Sabri, Sharvari', null, 'Kartik Aaryan, Omkar Kapoor, Sunny Singh, Nushrratt Bharuccha, Sharat Saxena, Joy Badlani, Rumana Molla, Ishita Raj Sharma', null, 'After falling in love, three roommates experience changes in their lives.', 'After falling in love, three roommates experience changes in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EjMwAPh8ILLZloqr5U42BCoWMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363413'),
  ('872206899245240646', 'Pyaar Ke Side Effects', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Saket Chaudhary', 'Saket Chaudhary', 'Rahul Bose, Mallika Sherawat, Ranvir Shorey, Sharat Saxena, Sophiya Chaudhary, Suchitra Pillai, Tarana Raja, Aamir Bashir', null, 'Siddharth Bose lives a middle-classed lifestyle in Delhi along with his mother, and sister, Shalini. Their dad had abandoned them years ago. Shalini gets married to Kapil Sharma and moves in with him, while Siddharth works as a DJ with his friend, known simply as Nanoo. While performing for a ceremony, where Punjabi-speaking Trisha Mallick is about to wed India''s youngest C.E.O., Vivek Chaddha, Siddharth sneaks in to use the bathroom and finds out that the bride does not love the groom and is about to run away. He manages to convince her to stay put, uses the facility and leaves. He meets her six months later in Mumbai, and he finds out that she did run away, both are attracted to each other and start living together fairly harmoniously, even though Trisha is taller than him.', 'Siddharth Bose lives a middle-classed lifestyle in Delhi along with his mother, and sister, Shalini. Their dad had abandoned them years ago. Shalini gets married to Kapil Sharma and moves in with him, while Siddharth works as a DJ with his friend, known simply as Nanoo. While performing for a ceremony, where Punjabi-speaking Trisha Mallick is about to wed India''s youngest C.E.O., Vivek Chaddha, Siddharth sneaks in to use the bathroom and finds out that the bride does not love the groom and is about to run away. He manages to convince her to stay put, uses the facility and leaves. He meets her six months later in Mumbai, and he finds out that she did run away, both are attracted to each other and start living together fairly harmoniously, even though Trisha is taller than him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAMb2pLLYFd0JUOruj4zFETLBI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59362'),
  ('497880245163865400', 'Pyaar Kiya To Darna Kya', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sohail Khan, Rishi Vora, Rasool Ellore', 'Sohail Khan', 'Dharmendra, Salman Khan, Kajol, Arbaaz Khan, Anjala Zaveri, Kiran Kumar, Kunickaa Sadanand, Aasif Sheikh', null, 'A wealthy collegian falls in love with an heir apparent, but her domineering cousin orders her to end the affair.', 'A wealthy collegian falls in love with an heir apparent, but her domineering cousin orders her to end the affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWJPE15xbl1RkM9y4EgnwbtEiBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45533'),
  ('723588897787850877', 'Pyaar To Hona Hi Tha', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Anees Bazmee', null, 'Ajay Devgn, Kajol, Kashmera Shah, Om Puri, Tiku Talsania, Reema Lagoo, Harish Patel, Mushtaq Khan', null, 'Sanjana is desperate to revive her hopeless relationship with Rahul. However, when the brooding and mysterious Shekhar comes along, her heart starts gravitating towards a new possibility.', 'Sanjana is desperate to revive her hopeless relationship with Rahul. However, when the brooding and mysterious Shekhar comes along, her heart starts gravitating towards a new possibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AxLqNWoZIzvqdNAyb62JwDHr4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60397'),
