  ('783231814397783953', 'Pygmalion', 1938, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Leslie Howard, Anthony Asquith, Teddy Baird', 'W.P. Lipscomb, Cecil Lewis, Ian Dalrymple', 'Leslie Howard, Wendy Hiller, Wilfrid Lawson, Marie Lohr, Scott Sunderland, Jean Cadell, David Tree, Everley Gregg', null, 'When linguistics professor Henry Higgins boasts that he can pass off Cockney flower girl Eliza Doolittle as a princess with only six months'' training, Colonel George Pickering takes him up on the bet. Eliza moves into Higgins''s home and begins her rigorous training after the professor comes to a financial agreement with her dustman father, Alfred. But the plucky young woman is not the only one undergoing a transformation.', 'When linguistics professor Henry Higgins boasts that he can pass off Cockney flower girl Eliza Doolittle as a princess with only six months'' training, Colonel George Pickering takes him up on the bet. Eliza moves into Higgins''s home and begins her rigorous training after the professor comes to a financial agreement with her dustman father, Alfred. But the plucky young woman is not the only one undergoing a transformation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIrQHvgSEAfpaz3fBnrRpvo0e8u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25016'),
  ('924278829004155917', 'Pyramid of the Sun God', 1965, 'Adventure, Western', 'Robert Siodmak, Siegfried Hold', 'Robert A. Stemmle, Ladislas Fodor, Georg Marischka', 'Lex Barker, Gérard Barray, Rik Battaglia, Michèle Girardon, Alessandra Panaro, Theresa Lorca, Ralf Wolter, Hans Nielsen', null, 'Mexico, 1864. The country is divided by the struggle against the French occupation and emperor Maximilian. The German doctor Karl Sternau and his friend Andreas Hasenpfeffer come to love the country and support the cause of the proud Mexicans.', 'Mexico, 1864. The country is divided by the struggle against the French occupation and emperor Maximilian. The German doctor Karl Sternau and his friend Andreas Hasenpfeffer come to love the country and support the cause of the proud Mexicans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/je0XWOHTzGdKoLcLimsGgvTZOyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19195'),
  ('362135776920771623', 'Pyrates', 1991, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Noah Stern, Janusz Kamiński', 'Noah Stern', 'Kyra Sedgwick, Kevin Bacon, Bruce Payne, Kristin Dattilo, Deborah Falconer, Mickey Jones, Buckley Norris, Raymond O''Connor', 'R', 'As soon as they meet Ari and Sam get into a pretty passionate - and combustible - relationship. Indeed, the scenes of their rendezvous often seem reminiscent of the Chicago Fire. But the course of true flaming lust never runs true, and as they try to handle their all-consuming passion their two best friends endlessly meet to compare notes on developments.', 'As soon as they meet Ari and Sam get into a pretty passionate - and combustible - relationship. Indeed, the scenes of their rendezvous often seem reminiscent of the Chicago Fire. But the course of true flaming lust never runs true, and as they try to handle their all-consuming passion their two best friends endlessly meet to compare notes on developments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPrC6AVW9egAoLCmtFP3h9kXIgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106482'),
  ('520931875017487588', 'Pyro... The Thing Without a Face', 1964, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Manuel Berenguer, Julio Coll', 'Luis de los Arcos, Sidney W. Pink', 'Barry Sullivan, Martha Hyer, Sherry Moreland, Soledad Miranda, Fernando Hilbeck, Carlos Casaravilla, Marisenka, Luis Prendes', null, 'A married man has a brief affair, then goes back to his wife and children. His jilted mistress, believing that if he had no more family he''d come back to her, sets fire to his house, hoping to kill them. The man, unsuccessfully trying to rescue them, is horribly burned. After he undergoes an operation to reconstruct his face, he begins to plot his revenge against his former mistress.', 'A married man has a brief affair, then goes back to his wife and children. His jilted mistress, believing that if he had no more family he''d come back to her, sets fire to his house, hoping to kill them. The man, unsuccessfully trying to rescue them, is horribly burned. After he undergoes an operation to reconstruct his face, he begins to plot his revenge against his former mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9wgxr3Ku58BLvXKIzt3o5P5uxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28300'),
  ('782089381819316340', 'Python', 2000, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Richard Clabaugh, Patrick Rousseau, Christian McIntire', 'Paul Bogh, Chris Neal, Gary Hershberger', 'Frayne Rosanoff, Robert Englund, Casper Van Dien, William Zabka, Dana Barron, Sara Mornell, Wil Wheaton, Jenny McCarthy', 'R', 'After a military plane crashes outside of a small American town, its cargo — a genetically engineered, sixty-foot-long python — begins stalking and killing the locals.', 'After a military plane crashes outside of a small American town, its cargo — a genetically engineered, sixty-foot-long python — begins stalking and killing the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDbTpRHTRFWBK4j0FAWpE4M5WT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41275'),
  ('991812597719423623', 'Python 2', 2002, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Lee Alan McConnell, Azusa Ohno, Joel Morales', 'Jeff Rank', 'William Zabka, Dana Ashbrook, Alex Jolig, Simmone Mackinnon, Marcus Aurelius, Mike Mitchell, Anthony Nichols, Vladimir Kolev', 'PG-13', 'A man, his business partner, and his wife are enlisted to transport an unknown object from a Russian military base, only to discover that the object is a giant, genetically-altered python.', 'A man, his business partner, and his wife are enlisted to transport an unknown object from a Russian military base, only to discover that the object is a giant, genetically-altered python.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZHg7QqjmovEx2m43aJf7lFGDZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42250'),
