  ('874286333355461272', 'Q', 2007, 'Horror', 'Takaaki Ezura', null, 'Sayori Shiozaki, Kaoru Sakurako, Mikio Sato, Seigi Shimizu', null, 'Seven men and women caught in a strange death game are forced to survive!', 'Seven men and women caught in a strange death game are forced to survive!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7eiQsPxIg0ZWIHjUQVgdy3YQCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:780723'),
  ('270967326638967891', 'Q', 2020, 'Animation', 'Roberto Biadi', null, null, null, 'Uma Thurman boogies, Harvey Keitel whips out his gun, Hitler’s head is sliced in half. And Quentin Tarantino sits serenely through it all, impervious to the mayhem he’s created.', 'Uma Thurman boogies, Harvey Keitel whips out his gun, Hitler’s head is sliced in half. And Quentin Tarantino sits serenely through it all, impervious to the mayhem he’s created.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upTjQm6UNjsF3rVNwrqQHNiBQYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726952'),
  ('854258518483102548', 'Q', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Jude Chehab', 'Jude Chehab', 'Hiba Khodr, Ziad Chehab, Doria Mouneimne', null, 'An intimate portrayal of a quest for love and acceptance at any cost, Q depicts the influence of a secretive matriarchal religious order on filmmaker Jude Chehab’s family and the unspoken ties and consequences of loyalty that have bonded her mother, grandmother, and herself to the mysterious organization. A love story of a different kind, Q is a multigenerational tale of the eternal search for meaning.', 'An intimate portrayal of a quest for love and acceptance at any cost, Q depicts the influence of a secretive matriarchal religious order on filmmaker Jude Chehab’s family and the unspoken ties and consequences of loyalty that have bonded her mother, grandmother, and herself to the mysterious organization. A love story of a different kind, Q is a multigenerational tale of the eternal search for meaning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swYdcwg0H7unLsueblW5ZkfHmEY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115657'),
  ('849472652439607721', 'Q & A', 1990, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Sidney Lumet, Andrzej Bartkowiak', 'Sidney Lumet', 'Nick Nolte, Timothy Hutton, Armand Assante, Patrick O''Neal, Lee Richardson, Luis Guzmán, Charles S. Dutton, Jenny Lumet', 'R', 'A young district attorney seeking to prove a case against a corrupt police detective encounters a former lover and her new protector, a crime boss who refuses to help him.', 'A young district attorney seeking to prove a case against a corrupt police detective encounters a former lover and her new protector, a crime boss who refuses to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q45dAIysDhTNiLrqAyhEhWwxxCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31598'),
  ('332891012284492140', 'Q & Q', 1978, 'Family, Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Bram van Erkel, Theo van de Sande', 'Harrie Geelen', 'Erik van ''t Wout, Martin Perels, Bob de Lange, Onno Molenkamp, Tamar Baruch, Marlies van Alcmaer, Sacco van der Made, Cor Witschge', null, 'While the residents of Runichem are busy preparing for the approaching centenary, an art theft takes place in a villa. The same evening, an officer is shot at an alcohol check. When Wilbur tries to call home from the community center that night, the phone interferes and he hears a fragment of a conversation related to criminal activities. Wilbur and his friend Aristides decide to investigate this mysterious case, with the help of Akkie, daughter of inspector Swaan, and grandfather Quarles. This film is based on the second season of the Dutch tv series ''Q & Q''.', 'While the residents of Runichem are busy preparing for the approaching centenary, an art theft takes place in a villa. The same evening, an officer is shot at an alcohol check. When Wilbur tries to call home from the community center that night, the phone interferes and he hears a fragment of a conversation related to criminal activities. Wilbur and his friend Aristides decide to investigate this mysterious case, with the help of Akkie, daughter of inspector Swaan, and grandfather Quarles. This film is based on the second season of the Dutch tv series ''Q & Q''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwWFMcnfR16joXpECfuM2zIELQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728120'),
  ('909972205987305127', 'Q Planes', 1939, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Tim Whelan, Arthur B. Woods, Muir Mathieson', 'Ian Dalrymple', 'Ralph Richardson, Laurence Olivier, Valerie Hobson, George Merritt, George Curzon, Roy Emerton, Frank Fox, Gus McNaughton', 'NR', 'In England, an eccentric police inspector, an earnest test pilot and a spunky female reporter team up to solve the mystery of a series of test aircraft which have disappeared without a trace while over the ocean on their maiden flights; unaware, as they are, that a spy ring has been shooting the planes down with a ray machine hidden aboard a salvage vessel which is on hand to haul the downed aircraft aboard, crews and all.', 'In England, an eccentric police inspector, an earnest test pilot and a spunky female reporter team up to solve the mystery of a series of test aircraft which have disappeared without a trace while over the ocean on their maiden flights; unaware, as they are, that a spy ring has been shooting the planes down with a ray machine hidden aboard a salvage vessel which is on hand to haul the downed aircraft aboard, crews and all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fXAi6UTPtcegc7CUojcgUemL3z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43833'),
  ('907392882461520857', 'Qala', 2022, 'Drama, Music', 'Siddharth Diwan, Anvita Dutt', 'Anvita Dutt, Muhammad Asif Ali', 'Triptii Dimri, Swastika Mukherjee, Babil Khan, Amit Sial, Sameer Kochhar, Girija Oak, Swanand Kirkire, Tasveer Kamil', null, 'Haunted by her past, a talented singer with a rising career copes with the pressure of success, a mother''s disdain and the voices of doubt within her.', 'Haunted by her past, a talented singer with a rising career copes with the pressure of success, a mother''s disdain and the voices of doubt within her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4d2xoBGXMpfeQ6QgpVI4qm34bKP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934419'),
  ('581368041255670038', 'Qalb', 2024, 'Romance, Drama, Family', 'Sajid Yahiya, Sharon Sreenivas, Tinto P Devasia', 'Suhail Koya', 'Ranjith Sajeev, Neha Nazneen Shakil, Ashiq Khalid, Siddique, Sreedhanya Thekkedath, Kaarthik Shankar, Athira Patel, Lenaa', null, 'Qalb tells the story of two young hearts falling in love. The ride takes you through the 7 stages of love. The title song ''Qalbee'' describes the spiritual elements of love. Like faith there is no compulsion in love either.', 'Qalb tells the story of two young hearts falling in love. The ride takes you through the 7 stages of love. The title song ''Qalbee'' describes the spiritual elements of love. Like faith there is no compulsion in love either.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a49keeFVFV8LN3H7spGrVWuofTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967353'),
  ('75474131381582262', 'Qarib Qarib Singlle', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tanuja Chandra, Eeshit Narain', 'Gazal Dhaliwal, Tanuja Chandra', 'Irrfan Khan, Parvathy Thiruvothu, Neha Dhupia, Luke Kenny, Brijendra Kala, Isha Sharvani, Pushtii Shakti, Bajrangbali Singh', null, 'Yogi and Jaya, who have polar opposite personalities and sensibilities, meet via an online dating app. This encounter turns into so much more when the two travel to Rishikesh.', 'Yogi and Jaya, who have polar opposite personalities and sensibilities, meet via an online dating app. This encounter turns into so much more when the two travel to Rishikesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKEKZ0uTpKm743xsPOuhrfTBLL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479918'),
  ('976438959432112584', 'Qayamat Se Qayamat Tak', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mansoor Khan, Kiran Deohans', 'Nasir Hussain', 'Aamir Khan, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Dalip Tahil, Ravindra Kapoor, Faisal Hussain Khan, Goga Kapoor, Raj Zutshi, Alok Nath', null, 'Both Dhanraj Singh and Randhir Singh are two bitter and old time enemies. They faced a disastrous situation when their children, Raj and Rashmi fall deeply in love. They openly declare their hatred for one another and will do anything in their power, even kill - but they will not accept their children''s choice. But Raj and Rashmi are dedicated to their love and are not willing to accept the fact that their fathers are mutual enemies.', 'Both Dhanraj Singh and Randhir Singh are two bitter and old time enemies. They faced a disastrous situation when their children, Raj and Rashmi fall deeply in love. They openly declare their hatred for one another and will do anything in their power, even kill - but they will not accept their children''s choice. But Raj and Rashmi are dedicated to their love and are not willing to accept the fact that their fathers are mutual enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWF3RMf7SKfZx5CObQusnemnhmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27964'),
  ('1054897583465011104', 'Qayamat: City Under Threat', 2003, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Harry Baweja, Maninder Singh, Sanjay F. Gupta', 'Harry Baweja, Suparn Verma', 'Ajay Devgn, Suniel Shetty, Sanjay Kapoor, Arbaaz Khan, Chunky Panday, Isha Koppikar, Riya Sen, Neha Dhupia', null, 'CBI Officer Akram Sheikh is on the verge of nabbing three dreaded Pakistan-backed arms dealers, the brothers Ali and Abbas and their common moll Laila. When Sheikh busts an important arms deal conducted by his three targets, Ali-Abbas join forces with Gopal, a corrupt scientist to get hold of a deadly virus and take the tourists at the Elphinstone Jail resort as hostage. Akram Sheikh is now compelled to get help from Rachit, a criminal serving jail time who was a former associate of Ali-Abbas and the only person in history to have successfully escaped the Elphinstone jail . Along with a commando team, they try to pull off a rescue attempt by breaking in the jail and rescuing the hostages.', 'CBI Officer Akram Sheikh is on the verge of nabbing three dreaded Pakistan-backed arms dealers, the brothers Ali and Abbas and their common moll Laila. When Sheikh busts an important arms deal conducted by his three targets, Ali-Abbas join forces with Gopal, a corrupt scientist to get hold of a deadly virus and take the tourists at the Elphinstone Jail resort as hostage. Akram Sheikh is now compelled to get help from Rachit, a criminal serving jail time who was a former associate of Ali-Abbas and the only person in history to have successfully escaped the Elphinstone jail . Along with a commando team, they try to pull off a rescue attempt by breaking in the jail and rescuing the hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6m1X6pzhX2bFE6zcueymzyGgsEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318484'),
  ('937601173167861789', 'Qeysar', 1969, 'Crime, Drama', 'Masoud Kimiai, Maziar Parto', 'Masoud Kimiai', 'Behrouz Vossoughi, Pouri Banaei, Naser Malek Motiee, Jamshid Mashayekhi, Iran Daftari, Hassan Shahin, Bahman Mofid, Mir Mohammad Tajaddod', null, 'A young man''s drive to avenge for his sister and brother.', 'A young man''s drive to avenge for his sister and brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibV6C3Jplus4VSvZROllO0sGOXk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256786'),
  ('952559945035232171', 'Qivitoq', 1956, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Erik Balling, Poul Pedersen', 'Leck Fischer', 'Poul Reichhardt, Astrid Villaume, Gunnar Lauring, Randi Michelsen, Bjørn Watt-Boolsen, Kirsten Rolffes, Niels Platou, Justus Larsen', null, 'A young teacher, Eva Nygaard, arrives in Greenland from Denmark to surprise her fiancé, the Doctor Erik Halsøe, but is crushed to find he has not waited for her and he is about to be married to his assisting nurse. Eva travels to a small fishing village to await the next ship back to Denmark. There she enters into a tense and often confrontational relationship with Jens, a quiet moody Dane who manages a trading company outpost. Meanwhile, Jens is trying to persuade a Greenlander named Pavia to become a company fisherman, despite Pavia''s fear of alienating his fellow villagers and upsetting the spirit, Qivitoq.', 'A young teacher, Eva Nygaard, arrives in Greenland from Denmark to surprise her fiancé, the Doctor Erik Halsøe, but is crushed to find he has not waited for her and he is about to be married to his assisting nurse. Eva travels to a small fishing village to await the next ship back to Denmark. There she enters into a tense and often confrontational relationship with Jens, a quiet moody Dane who manages a trading company outpost. Meanwhile, Jens is trying to persuade a Greenlander named Pavia to become a company fisherman, despite Pavia''s fear of alienating his fellow villagers and upsetting the spirit, Qivitoq.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43QEW1ua4HMa1jVDS2FeDbmXUKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72519'),
  ('223425474286089225', 'QQQ', 2012, 'Animation', 'YungSung Song', null, null, null, 'Story of Qs. Three Qs and more make QQQ. QQQ spin and roll. And QQQ transform themselves, spinning. QQQ transform, spinning, rolling, swinging, turning, and traveling.', 'Story of Qs. Three Qs and more make QQQ. QQQ spin and roll. And QQQ transform themselves, spinning. QQQ transform, spinning, rolling, swinging, turning, and traveling.', null, 'tmdb:movie:390336'),
  ('193851107271131361', 'QT8: The First Eight', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Tara Wood, Jake Zortman, Shane Minshew', 'Tara Wood', 'Quentin Tarantino, Zoë Bell, Louis Black, Bruce Dern, Robert Forster, Jamie Foxx, Richard N. Gladstein, Jennifer Jason Leigh', null, 'A detailed account of the life and artistic career of legendary filmmaker Quentin Tarantino, from his early days as a video club manager to the scandalous fall in disgrace of producer Harvey Weinstein. A story about how to shoot eight great movies and become an icon of modern pop culture.', 'A detailed account of the life and artistic career of legendary filmmaker Quentin Tarantino, from his early days as a video club manager to the scandalous fall in disgrace of producer Harvey Weinstein. A story about how to shoot eight great movies and become an icon of modern pop culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGPwMYUeygsUAmo0NS8IPlhQEfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631143'),
  ('17931750864480752', 'Qu''est-ce qu''on va faire de Jacques ?', 2021, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Marie Garel-Weiss', 'Pierre Chosson, Marie Garel-Weiss, Hedi Sassi', 'Vincent Deniard, Maud Wyler, Claude Perron, Pascal Rénéric, Samir Guesmi, Jackie Berroyer, Christian Bouillette, Amélie Prévot', null, 'When their father dies, Louise, Fabien, and Estelle feel helpless as they confront the task of taking care of their schizophrenic brother Jacques. For Louise, the experience will be life-changing.', 'When their father dies, Louise, Fabien, and Estelle feel helpless as they confront the task of taking care of their schizophrenic brother Jacques. For Louise, the experience will be life-changing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tagFQeyTjgAvECPOIfRa7N8L6Hk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881413'),
  ('28216548227881244', 'Quack Shot', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Elmer Fudd goes duck hunting on a pond, where Daffy Duck proclaims himself guardian of all his web-footed cousins and retaliates against Elmer.', 'Elmer Fudd goes duck hunting on a pond, where Daffy Duck proclaims himself guardian of all his web-footed cousins and retaliates against Elmer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aghExfEoC0PSjX7KlhmiMr59qLu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235791'),
  ('1061848305403620776', 'Quackodile Tears', 1962, 'Animation', 'Arthur Davis', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', null, 'Daffy Duck is ordered by his loud-mouthed wife to sit on their egg in a nest. When Daffy adjusts the nest to make it more comfortable, the egg rolls away from him and into a crocodile hatchery, where it is indistinguishable from all the other eggs. When Daffy picks what he think is his egg from the crocodile hatchery, a male crocodile gives chase and does battle with Daffy for the egg.', 'Daffy Duck is ordered by his loud-mouthed wife to sit on their egg in a nest. When Daffy adjusts the nest to make it more comfortable, the egg rolls away from him and into a crocodile hatchery, where it is indistinguishable from all the other eggs. When Daffy picks what he think is his egg from the crocodile hatchery, a male crocodile gives chase and does battle with Daffy for the egg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aetgwh0QWNY468Y7mzFWA6B6fad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210823'),
  ('219984861063670578', 'Quadrille', 1938, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sacha Guitry, Robert Lefebvre, Jeanne Étiévant', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry, Gaby Morlay, Jacqueline Delubac, Georges Grey, Pauline Carton, Jacques Vitry, Louis Baldy, Louis Vonelly', null, 'The battle of the sexes as drawing room social satire. Philippe, a middle-aged newspaper editor, has lived for six years with Paulette, a successful stage actress. He tells her friend Claudine, a realistic and enterprising reporter, that he''s thinking of proposing. Into the mix steps Carl Erickson, a charming Hollywood matinée idol in Paris briefly. He meets Paulette, sees her act (his box seat compliments of Philippe), and sets out to seduce her. The next two days bring talk, tears, separation, despair, surprises, and, perhaps, reconciliation as characters speak "exactly half the truth." It''s a quadrille of changing partners.', 'The battle of the sexes as drawing room social satire. Philippe, a middle-aged newspaper editor, has lived for six years with Paulette, a successful stage actress. He tells her friend Claudine, a realistic and enterprising reporter, that he''s thinking of proposing. Into the mix steps Carl Erickson, a charming Hollywood matinée idol in Paris briefly. He meets Paulette, sees her act (his box seat compliments of Philippe), and sets out to seduce her. The next two days bring talk, tears, separation, despair, surprises, and, perhaps, reconciliation as characters speak "exactly half the truth." It''s a quadrille of changing partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMAPlVrpLKX9rs3AxP2LS1Xwpk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76703'),
  ('189308812319468012', 'Quadrophenia', 1979, 'Drama, Music', 'Franc Roddam, Brian Tufano, Patsy Pollock', 'Franc Roddam, Martin Stellman, Dave Humphries', 'Phil Daniels, Leslie Ash, Phil Davis, Mark Wingett, Sting, Ray Winstone, Garry Cooper, Gary Shail', 'R', 'Based on the 1973 rock opera album of the same name by The Who, this is the story of 60s teenager Jimmy. At work he slaves in a dead-end job. While after, he shops for tailored suits and rides his scooter as part of the London Mod scene.', 'Based on the 1973 rock opera album of the same name by The Who, this is the story of 60s teenager Jimmy. At work he slaves in a dead-end job. While after, he shops for tailored suits and rides his scooter as part of the London Mod scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sRR3pvrAZMG7GEvnR9XzqyHHfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10373'),
  ('298780415142923425', 'Qualcosa di Lilla', 2026, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Isabella Leoni', 'Isabella Leoni', 'Federica Pala, Alessandro Tersigni, Raffaella Rea, Margherita Buoncristiani, Miguel Bottini, Costantino Comito', null, 'The life of 15-year-old Nicole changes when Luce, who has suffered from bulimia since she was a child, joins her class. Consequently, Nicole also slides into the illness without realizing it. But above all, without anyone else noticing.', 'The life of 15-year-old Nicole changes when Luce, who has suffered from bulimia since she was a child, joins her class. Consequently, Nicole also slides into the illness without realizing it. But above all, without anyone else noticing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vg76jfHwt3MACPYCO9cgH6B66LU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1554116'),
  ('31860413398986321', 'Quality Street', 1937, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'George Stevens, Robert De Grasse, W. Argyle Nelson', 'Mortimer Offner, Allan Scott', 'Katharine Hepburn, Franchot Tone, Eric Blore, Fay Bainter, Cora Witherspoon, Estelle Winwood, Joan Fontaine, William Bakewell', 'NR', 'In the 1810s, an old maid poses as her own niece in order to teach her onetime beau a lesson.', 'In the 1810s, an old maid poses as her own niece in order to teach her onetime beau a lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO2qq9jqWmIkpEyHh5PKS3BGaeA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52237'),
  ('476475892137723024', 'Quality Time', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Holger Haase', 'Florian David Fitz, Jens-Frederik Otto', 'Florian David Fitz, Henry Hübchen, Marius V. Haas, Leslie Malton, Thekla Reuten, Jamie Bick, Felix von Manteuffel, Eva-Maria Kromer', null, 'You can’t choose your family – which is why Conrad limits his visits with his parents to an absolute minimum. When venomous, irritable Carl injures himself seriously in a fall, his reluctant son Conrad and the butt-of-all-jokes Jonas has no choice but to move back into his old childhood room. Three generations under one roof: a chance for reconciliation – or a total disaster?', 'You can’t choose your family – which is why Conrad limits his visits with his parents to an absolute minimum. When venomous, irritable Carl injures himself seriously in a fall, his reluctant son Conrad and the butt-of-all-jokes Jonas has no choice but to move back into his old childhood room. Three generations under one roof: a chance for reconciliation – or a total disaster?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpzJezYGChp6Wchj5eh1VQ9Dvua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217412'),
