  ('352749235742178468', 'Quantez', 1957, 'Western', 'Harry Keller, George Lollier, Carl E. Guthrie', 'R. Wright Campbell', 'Fred MacMurray, Dorothy Malone, James Barton, Sydney Chaplin, John Gavin, John Larch, Michael Ansara, Charles Soldani', 'NR', 'A gang of bank robbers with a posse in hot pursuit. Riding into the desert, they take refuge in Quantez, a small town they find deserted. Their horses tired and near death, they’re forced to stay the night — with the plan to cross the border into Mexico the next day.', 'A gang of bank robbers with a posse in hot pursuit. Riding into the desert, they take refuge in Quantez, a small town they find deserted. Their horses tired and near death, they’re forced to stay the night — with the plan to cross the border into Mexico the next day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPPeKrpYRjSrJMwSQMUv20aWbUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138373'),
  ('8225401651345347', 'Quanto Tempo o Tempo Tem', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Adriana Dutra, Walter Carvalho', 'Adriana Dutra, Flávia Guimarães', 'André Comte-Sponville, Marcelo Gleiser, Thierry Paquot, Arnaldo Jabor, Francis Wolff, Luiz Alberto Oliveira, Raymond Kurzweil, Erick Felinto', null, 'We live in a new age. We are always rushing, rushing for no reason, rushing for nothing. As though time had sped up. Everything implies speed, urgency. But ultimately, why does time seem so short? This film is about the director’s conflict about time and the lack of it in today’s world; she reflects on civilization and the future of existence.', 'We live in a new age. We are always rushing, rushing for no reason, rushing for nothing. As though time had sped up. Everything implies speed, urgency. But ultimately, why does time seem so short? This film is about the director’s conflict about time and the lack of it in today’s world; she reflects on civilization and the future of existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69E3b6J14lNjPbgnFBvdAz2D5rY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367432'),
  ('744816538865193489', 'Quantum Apocalypse', 2010, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie, Mystery, Drama', 'Justin Jones, Steven Parker', null, 'Jenna Craig, Gigi Edgley, Stephanie Jacobsen, Rhett Giles, Kristen Quintrall, Peter Jurasik, Randy Mulkey, Shirly Brener', null, 'A group of talented but rebellious ''rock-star scientists'' find themselves in a race against time to save Earth when a comet makes an unexpected turn towards our blue planet where all life may cease to exist within days if our small town heroes fail to find a solution.', 'A group of talented but rebellious ''rock-star scientists'' find themselves in a race against time to save Earth when a comet makes an unexpected turn towards our blue planet where all life may cease to exist within days if our small town heroes fail to find a solution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hMBhDknvIDFtkohTcggXvIwYxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32206'),
  ('732039926674657891', 'Quantum Love', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lisa Azuelos, Alain Duplantier', 'Lisa Azuelos', 'Sophie Marceau, François Cluzet, Lisa Azuelos, Alexandre Astier, Arthur Benzaquen, Jonathan Cohen, Niels Schneider, Stéphanie Murat', null, 'Pierre has been happily married for fifteen years and a good father. Still in love with his wife, he enjoys his wife and family and is content. One evening, he meets Elsa at a party and are immediately attracted to each other. Fifteen days later, they happen to meet again and the mutual attraction turns into infatuation. But his love for his wife and Elsa''s rule about not dating married men prevents them from taking the next step. Instead, they fantasize about each other, and soon the fantasies mingle with the reality.', 'Pierre has been happily married for fifteen years and a good father. Still in love with his wife, he enjoys his wife and family and is content. One evening, he meets Elsa at a party and are immediately attracted to each other. Fifteen days later, they happen to meet again and the mutual attraction turns into infatuation. But his love for his wife and Elsa''s rule about not dating married men prevents them from taking the next step. Instead, they fantasize about each other, and soon the fantasies mingle with the reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSqMurXHLrj4DgoLTJxfrMg3a10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256913'),
  ('1011019888554469439', 'Quantum of Solace', 2008, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Roberto Schaefer, Marc Forster, Dan Bradley', 'Robert Wade, Neal Purvis, Paul Haggis', 'Daniel Craig, Olga Kurylenko, Mathieu Amalric, Judi Dench, Giancarlo Giannini, Gemma Arterton, Jeffrey Wright, David Harbour', 'PG-13', 'Betrayed by Vesper, the woman he loved, 007 fights the urge to make his latest mission personal. Pursuing his determination to uncover the truth, Bond and M interrogate Mr. White, who reveals that the organization that blackmailed Vesper is far more complex and dangerous than anyone had imagined.', 'Betrayed by Vesper, the woman he loved, 007 fights the urge to make his latest mission personal. Pursuing his determination to uncover the truth, Bond and M interrogate Mr. White, who reveals that the organization that blackmailed Vesper is far more complex and dangerous than anyone had imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3DXXLJHGqMx9yYpXsql1XNljmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10764'),
  ('281487040798620371', 'Quantum Supremacy', 2026, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Jesse Baget, Philip C. Ruesch', 'Steven Barton', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Bill Oberst Jr., Simon Jackson', null, 'In a future threatened by rogue robots and an all-powerful AI, Captain Monroe and his crew race to prevent humanity''s downfall.', 'In a future threatened by rogue robots and an all-powerful AI, Captain Monroe and his crew race to prevent humanity''s downfall.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F4%2Fgracenote%2F4d9fb0660e81de4dbb71bdffe5ac6e00.jpg', 'plex:movie:quantum-supremacy'),
  ('884530251379878678', 'Quarantine', 2008, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'John Erick Dowdle, Ken Seng', 'John Erick Dowdle, Drew Dowdle, Jaume Balagueró', 'Dania Ramirez, Jennifer Carpenter, Jay Hernandez, Steve Harris, Greg Germann, Johnathon Schaech, Columbus Short, Andrew Fiscella', 'R', 'A television reporter and her cameraman are trapped inside a building quarantined by the CDC after the outbreak of a mysterious virus which turns humans into bloodthirsty killers.', 'A television reporter and her cameraman are trapped inside a building quarantined by the CDC after the outbreak of a mysterious virus which turns humans into bloodthirsty killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGfOD8IC1x4PqmnqRuA8KyCckia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13812'),
  ('441437330647565624', 'Quarantine 2: Terminal', 2011, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'John Pogue, Matthew Irving', 'John Pogue', 'Mercedes Mason, Josh Cooke, Bre Blair, Ignacio Serricchio, Tyler Kunkle, George Back, Jason Benjamin, Lamar Stewart', 'R', 'A plane is taken over by a mysterious virus. When the plane lands it is placed under quarantine. Now a group of survivors must band together to survive the quarantine.', 'A plane is taken over by a mysterious virus. When the plane lands it is placed under quarantine. Now a group of survivors must band together to survive the quarantine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouQOquRqqaO8sPAziD4BFoNO1Pb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59115'),
  ('43627296774131403', 'Quarries', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dean Alioto, John Woodside, Nils Taylor', 'Nils Taylor, Nicole Marie Johnson', 'Nicole Marie Johnson, Carrie Finklea, Leisha Hailey, Sara Mornell, Luke Edwards, Nicole DuPort, Joy McElveen, Rebecca McFadzien', null, 'To escape her abusive boyfriend, Kat joins a wilderness expedition with a group of women, all of whom are struggling with the uncertainty of life. What was supposed to be an opportunity for personal discovery quickly becomes a fight for survival, forcing each one to discover the strength within themselves that they didn''t even know they possessed. While being brazenly chased by a pack of predators, the strong quickly set themselves apart from the weak. In a battle of will, stamina, and heart, these very virtues present themselves at the most crucial moment. With death looming, each is left with what is truly important - the strength within oneself.', 'To escape her abusive boyfriend, Kat joins a wilderness expedition with a group of women, all of whom are struggling with the uncertainty of life. What was supposed to be an opportunity for personal discovery quickly becomes a fight for survival, forcing each one to discover the strength within themselves that they didn''t even know they possessed. While being brazenly chased by a pack of predators, the strong quickly set themselves apart from the weak. In a battle of will, stamina, and heart, these very virtues present themselves at the most crucial moment. With death looming, each is left with what is truly important - the strength within oneself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/134cvqia2qmJ0gG4hszaK87iuPW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444689'),
  ('700154758316257406', 'Quarter to Two Before Jesus Christ', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Jean Yanne, Mario Vulpiani', 'Jean Yanne', 'Coluche, Michel Serrault, Jean Yanne, Françoise Fabian, Michel Auclair, Mimi Coutelier, Darry Cowl, Paul Préboist', null, 'In antique Rome, a simple pepboy for chars becomes involved in a coup against Cesar. Rahatlocum is a North African Roman colony where Julius Caesar came to spend an expensive holiday. The revolt rumbles among the small people who find a leader in the person of Ben-Hur Marcel.', 'In antique Rome, a simple pepboy for chars becomes involved in a coup against Cesar. Rahatlocum is a North African Roman colony where Julius Caesar came to spend an expensive holiday. The revolt rumbles among the small people who find a leader in the person of Ben-Hur Marcel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ge2B2hzlaSpN8SCnBRwSq8m2mg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49398'),
  ('187312724166921054', 'Quarterback Princess', 1983, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Noel Black, Isidore Mankofsky, Jim Behnke', 'Rod Browning', 'Helen Hunt, Don Murray, Barbara Babcock, Carmen Argenziano, Dana Elcar, Beau Dremann, John Stockwell, Daphne Zuniga', 'PG', 'The Maida family has moved to Oregon, and daughter Tami wants to play quarterback for the high school football team. There''s just one problem. She''s a girl. With everyone from the coach to her next door neighbor against her, she''s out to prove that not only can she can play football, but she can win the state championship. (Based on a true story)', 'The Maida family has moved to Oregon, and daughter Tami wants to play quarterback for the high school football team. There''s just one problem. She''s a girl. With everyone from the coach to her next door neighbor against her, she''s out to prove that not only can she can play football, but she can win the state championship. (Based on a true story)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzXKi5wgx8JwvGHSogDL1Kyw08l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142216'),
  ('1082292141728938282', 'Quartet', 1948, 'Drama', 'Ken Annakin, Ralph Smart, Arthur Crabtree', 'R.C. Sherriff', 'W. Somerset Maugham, Basil Radford, Naunton Wayne, Mai Zetterling, Ian Fleming, Jack Raine, Angela Baddeley, James Robertson Justice', null, 'Somerset Maugham introduces four of his tales in this anthology film: "The Facts of Life," "The Alien Corn," "The Kite," and "The Colonel''s Lady."', 'Somerset Maugham introduces four of his tales in this anthology film: "The Facts of Life," "The Alien Corn," "The Kite," and "The Colonel''s Lady."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCPWlJus4LXWigzsRtJpJwlmD9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100257'),
  ('230955177247517265', 'Quartet', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Ivory, Pierre Lhomme, Hugues de Laugardière', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala, Michel Maingois', 'Isabelle Adjani, Maggie Smith, Alan Bates, Anthony Higgins, Suzanne Flon, Sheila Gish, Daniel Chatto, Pierre Clémenti', 'R', 'When her husband''s arrest leaves her penniless, a woman accepts an invitation to move in with a strange couple.', 'When her husband''s arrest leaves her penniless, a woman accepts an invitation to move in with a strange couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6mAdf5RoWBxnPNbDA3zgTPl91Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67022'),
  ('8996099111457082', 'Quartet', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Dustin Hoffman, John de Borman', 'Ronald Harwood', 'Maggie Smith, Tom Courtenay, Billy Connolly, Pauline Collins, Michael Gambon, Sheridan Smith, Jumayn Hunter, Shola Adewusi', 'PG-13', 'Cissy, Reggie, and Wilf are in a home for retired musicians. Every year, there is a concert to celebrate Composer Giuseppe Verdi''s birthday and they take part. Jean, who used to be married to Reggie, arrives at the home and disrupts their equilibrium. She still acts like a diva, but she refuses to sing. Still, the show must go on, and it does.', 'Cissy, Reggie, and Wilf are in a home for retired musicians. Every year, there is a concert to celebrate Composer Giuseppe Verdi''s birthday and they take part. Jean, who used to be married to Reggie, arrives at the home and disrupts their equilibrium. She still acts like a diva, but she refuses to sing. Still, the show must go on, and it does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDg2DfB5MuEoUeRFQqzBFVoWGep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121826'),
  ('784533617260222161', 'Quartet for the End of Time', 1983, 'Drama', 'Alfonso Cuarón, Ariel Velázquez', 'Alfonso Cuarón', 'Angel Torralba, Ramón Barragán, Guillermo García Cantú, Mariagna Prats, Rafael Sánchez Navarro', null, 'The story of a young man who lives alone in his house, and his indifference and solitude with the world around him.', 'The story of a young man who lives alone in his house, and his indifference and solitude with the world around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tH4cK6R7ZENCjb4L6JaduWfTsWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69910'),
  ('603103994016648332', 'Quasi', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kevin Heffernan, Joe Collins', 'Steve Lemme, Jay Chandrasekhar, Paul Soter', 'Brian Cox, Kevin Heffernan, Steve Lemme, Jay Chandrasekhar, Paul Soter, Erik Stolhanske, Adrianne Palicki, Gabriel Hogan', 'R', 'A hapless hunchback who only yearns for love, finds himself in the middle of a murderous feud between the Pope and the King of France when each orders the hunchback to kill the other.', 'A hapless hunchback who only yearns for love, finds himself in the middle of a murderous feud between the Pope and the King of France when each orders the hunchback to kill the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6uFA7r4VqqQeW4u9YtktheRXUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893752'),
  ('389380958063898135', 'Quasi at the Quackadero', 1976, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Sally Cruikshank', null, 'Sally Cruikshank, Kim Deitch', null, 'This surreal cartoon follows Quasi, Anita and their pet robot Rollo to the Quackadero, a futuristic amusement park where thoughts, time, dreams and memories become playthings for the weird and wacky clientele.', 'This surreal cartoon follows Quasi, Anita and their pet robot Rollo to the Quackadero, a futuristic amusement park where thoughts, time, dreams and memories become playthings for the weird and wacky clientele.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/267n9hyrtqYzk1SoJxfJSkAWEKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127327'),
  ('178516707752145780', 'Quasi orfano', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Umberto Riccioni Carteni, Saverio Di Biagio, Gian Filippo Corticelli', 'Dany Boon', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Vittoria Puccini, Antonio Gerardi, Grazia Schiavo, Adriano Pappalardo, Chiara Di Benedetto, Manuela Zero, Paolo Sassanelli', null, 'Valentino Tarocco invents a new life as a famous Milanese designer. He has removed all connection with the past, but an accident will bring him back to his twenties, causing him to recover his Apulian dialect and love for his origins.', 'Valentino Tarocco invents a new life as a famous Milanese designer. He has removed all connection with the past, but an accident will bring him back to his twenties, causing him to recover his Apulian dialect and love for his origins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JujtN4zZrHWUN9ATwDCBHLYHdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885298'),
  ('339875435873772709', 'Quasi''s Cabaret Trailer', 1980, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Sally Cruikshank', null, 'Sally Cruikshank', null, 'Created and produced as a sample of the proposed (never realized) animated feature. "It was like a 30''s musical in which Anita left the alligator farm to pursue her dream of opening the ultimate tropical nightclub. I had a script and storyboard [...] Nightclub of the future with live alligators and a tipsy train that serves drinks." -SC', 'Created and produced as a sample of the proposed (never realized) animated feature. "It was like a 30''s musical in which Anita left the alligator farm to pursue her dream of opening the ultimate tropical nightclub. I had a script and storyboard [...] Nightclub of the future with live alligators and a tipsy train that serves drinks." -SC', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BShQLFGUaK524CGmqYaap20U9N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347411'),
  ('582713576116399356', 'Quasimodo d''el Paris', 1999, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Patrick Timsit, Vincenzo Marano', 'Jean-François Halin, Patrick Timsit, Raffy Shart', 'Patrick Timsit, Mélanie Thierry, Richard Berry, Vincent Elbaz, Didier Flamand, Patrick Braoudé, Axelle Abbadie, Dominique Pinon', null, 'The location is the town of El Paris. When ten-year-old boy Quasimodo shows signs of deformity, his well-to-do parents place him in the charge of the town’s mysterious evangelist, Frollo. In exchange, they adopt a Cuban girl, Esméralda, from a lower social class. Ten years later, El Paris is menaced by a serial killer, and Quasimodo is the prime suspect.', 'The location is the town of El Paris. When ten-year-old boy Quasimodo shows signs of deformity, his well-to-do parents place him in the charge of the town’s mysterious evangelist, Frollo. In exchange, they adopt a Cuban girl, Esméralda, from a lower social class. Ten years later, El Paris is menaced by a serial killer, and Quasimodo is the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRKP7d7NlBQCquqxMwfhZuEJs2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61405'),
  ('1104547737307801340', 'Quatermass 2', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Val Guest, Gerald Gibbs, John Hollingsworth', 'Nigel Kneale, Val Guest', 'Brian Donlevy, John Longden, William Franklyn, Bryan Forbes, Charles Lloyd Pack, Tom Chatto, John Van Eyssen, Sidney James', null, 'In England, a group of space scientists led by Bernard Quatermass, who have developed plans for the first Moon colony, learn that a secret, ostensibly government-run, complex of identical design has been built in a remote part of England and is the focus of periodic falls of small, hollow "meteorites" originating in outer space. Quatermass determines to investigate and uncovers a terrifying extraterrestrial life form which has already begun action to take over the Earth.', 'In England, a group of space scientists led by Bernard Quatermass, who have developed plans for the first Moon colony, learn that a secret, ostensibly government-run, complex of identical design has been built in a remote part of England and is the focus of periodic falls of small, hollow "meteorites" originating in outer space. Quatermass determines to investigate and uncovers a terrifying extraterrestrial life form which has already begun action to take over the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJJtV5puzYAODgck0JTWVX8zjKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26278'),
  ('896742276849100708', 'Quatermass and the Pit', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Roy Ward Baker, Arthur Grant, Bernard Robinson', 'Nigel Kneale', 'Andrew Keir, James Donald, Barbara Shelley, Julian Glover, Bryan Marshall, Maurice Good, Duncan Lamont, Peter Copley', null, 'A mysterious artifact unearthed below a London Underground station proves to have powerful psychic effects on the people around.', 'A mysterious artifact unearthed below a London Underground station proves to have powerful psychic effects on the people around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvruSt4xRIbXO8gVxPzHupbf5A2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26912'),
  ('163019919981952262', 'Quatre étoiles', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Christian Vincent, Hélène Louvart', 'Olivier Dazat', 'José Garcia, Isabelle Carré, Renée Le Calm, François Cluzet, Michel Vuillermoz, Jean-Paul Bonnaire, Luis Rego, Marius Colucci', null, 'Franssou, a charming Parisian English teacher, who shares part of her life with a boring middle-aged lover, dreams of another life. So, when she unexpectedly inherits 50,000 euros, she grasps the opportunity and goes to the French Riviera in order to take it easy in luxury. In the four-star hotel where she rents a room she comes across Stéphane, a strange guy who is in the process of arranging Elton John''s next coming to the place. Intrigued by the noisy ostentatious fellow, she follows him until she finally comes into contact with him. She knows Stéphane is at bay and decides to take advantage of it.', 'Franssou, a charming Parisian English teacher, who shares part of her life with a boring middle-aged lover, dreams of another life. So, when she unexpectedly inherits 50,000 euros, she grasps the opportunity and goes to the French Riviera in order to take it easy in luxury. In the four-star hotel where she rents a room she comes across Stéphane, a strange guy who is in the process of arranging Elton John''s next coming to the place. Intrigued by the noisy ostentatious fellow, she follows him until she finally comes into contact with him. She knows Stéphane is at bay and decides to take advantage of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LMcFXMGSNpsgM6ikntBvNhE2o2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13739'),
  ('113655378757961113', 'Quatre Garçons pleins d''avenir', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Lilienfeld, Jacques Loiseleux, Michel Cénet', 'Jean-Patrick Benes, Laurent Molinaro, Jean-Paul Lilienfeld', 'Olivier Brocheriou, Stéphan Guérin-Tillié, Olivier Sitruk, Éric Berger, Thierry Lhermitte, Patrick Sébastien, Roland Giraud, Melisandre Meertens', null, 'The premise of four young men out to celebrate the end of their school exams has great promise as comedy material, a promise that is far from realized in this banal, unevenly paced, run-of-the-mill attempt at a supposedly funny story.', 'The premise of four young men out to celebrate the end of their school exams has great promise as comedy material, a promise that is far from realized in this banal, unevenly paced, run-of-the-mill attempt at a supposedly funny story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lv4eso7TJnIz5Oo9TVNwR60xBon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73057'),
