  ('636672124343204651', 'Quebec-Montreal', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ricardo Trogi, Steve Asselin', 'Jean-Philippe Pearson, Patrice Robitaille, Ricardo Trogi', 'Patrice Robitaille, Jean-Philippe Pearson, Stéphane Breton, François Létourneau, Isabelle Blais, Julie Le Breton, Pierre-François Legendre, Benoît Gouin', null, 'Quebec-Montreal: 250 km (150 miles) of asphalt, nine thirtysomething travelers, four cars, one destination. The journey becomes an opportunity to share points of view about life and to discuss troubling questions about our existence.', 'Quebec-Montreal: 250 km (150 miles) of asphalt, nine thirtysomething travelers, four cars, one destination. The journey becomes an opportunity to share points of view about life and to discuss troubling questions about our existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNx6QWA8g3z7Iszq907TZNgrOIk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61509'),
  ('1053258479170677721', 'Queen', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vikas Bahl, Chetana Kowshik, Deepa Alimchandani', 'Chaitally Parmar, Vikas Bahl', 'Kangana Ranaut, Rajkummar Rao, Lisa Haydon, Mish Boyko, Jeffrey Ho, Yogendra Tiku, Alka Badola Kaushal, Marco Canadea', null, 'Rani, a 24-year-old homely girl, decides to go on her honeymoon alone when her fiancé calls off the wedding. Traveling around Europe, she finds joy, makes friends, and gains new-found independence.', 'Rani, a 24-year-old homely girl, decides to go on her honeymoon alone when her fiancé calls off the wedding. Traveling around Europe, she finds joy, makes friends, and gains new-found independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKLp0X2RQOuA31R3AdaYtDdKIPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247645'),
  ('856612806073758937', 'Queen & Country', 2015, 'Drama', 'John Boorman, Seamus Deasy, Elena Doandesi', 'John Boorman', 'Callum Turner, Caleb Landry Jones, Pat Shortt, David Thewlis, Richard E. Grant, Tamsin Egerton, Vanessa Kirby, Aimee-Ffion Edwards', 'NR', 'In this sequel to Hope and Glory (1987), Bill Rohan has grown up and is drafted into the army, where he and his eccentric best mate, Percy, battle their snooty superiors on the base and look for love in town.', 'In this sequel to Hope and Glory (1987), Bill Rohan has grown up and is drafted into the army, where he and his eccentric best mate, Percy, battle their snooty superiors on the base and look for love in town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgFgNutcHskZFwE3Cfu8McXWjGl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266084'),
  ('98988142459945492', 'Queen & Slim', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Matthew Sewell, Tami Kumin, James Roque Jr.', 'Lena Waithe', 'Daniel Kaluuya, Jodie Turner-Smith, Bokeem Woodbine, Sturgill Simpson, Flea, Chloë Sevigny, Indya Moore, Benito Martinez', 'R', 'While on a forgettable first date together in Ohio, a black man and a black woman are pulled over for a minor traffic infraction. The situation escalates, with sudden and tragic results.', 'While on a forgettable first date together in Ohio, a black man and a black woman are pulled over for a minor traffic infraction. The situation escalates, with sudden and tragic results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfIJOmsiBcum6EGosiy5gTF6ihk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536743'),
  ('16371295628876661', 'Queen at Sea', 2026, 'Drama', 'Lance Hammer, Adolpho Veloso', 'Lance Hammer', 'Juliette Binoche, Tom Courtenay, Florence Hunt, Anna Calder-Marshall, Xenia Flint', null, 'As dementia erodes a woman''s ability to communicate her inner life, her husband and daughter struggle to act in her best interest, navigating love and the fragile boundaries between care, protection, and autonomy.', 'As dementia erodes a woman''s ability to communicate her inner life, her husband and daughter struggle to act in her best interest, navigating love and the fragile boundaries between care, protection, and autonomy.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6nPNmgnI7jMd18zqYHzvA0Qkbl6.jpg', 'plex:movie:queen-at-sea'),
  ('1118072778934707491', 'Queen Bee', 1955, 'Drama', 'Charles Lang, Ranald MacDougall, Irving J. Moore', 'Ranald MacDougall', 'Joan Crawford, Barry Sullivan, John Ireland, Lucy Marlow, Betsy Palmer, William Leslie, Fay Wray, Katherine Anderson', 'NR', 'A devilish Southern woman, married to a man who despises her, manages to manipulate those around her under the guise of being kind. But, when her sister-in-law is engaged to be married to the woman''s former lover and her husband starts up an affair with her cousin, visting from New York, things start to go awry and she sets a plan to destroy it all.', 'A devilish Southern woman, married to a man who despises her, manages to manipulate those around her under the guise of being kind. But, when her sister-in-law is engaged to be married to the woman''s former lover and her husband starts up an affair with her cousin, visting from New York, things start to go awry and she sets a plan to destroy it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQpJkS9RRqy3GdGScf7u2N4IUt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28296'),
  ('111027166447989412', 'Queen Bees', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Alice Brooks, Michael Lembeck', 'Donald Martin', 'Ellen Burstyn, James Caan, Ann-Margret, Jane Curtin, Christopher Lloyd, Loretta Devine, Elizabeth Mitchell, Matthew Barnes', 'PG-13', 'Helen is an independent widow who moves into the Pine Grove Senior Community and discovers it’s just like high school – full of cliques and flirtatious suitors. What she initially avoids leads her to exactly what she has been missing: new friendships and a chance at love again with newcomer Dan.', 'Helen is an independent widow who moves into the Pine Grove Senior Community and discovers it’s just like high school – full of cliques and flirtatious suitors. What she initially avoids leads her to exactly what she has been missing: new friendships and a chance at love again with newcomer Dan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peYRpielBbRHMGNYJnWyCsG7apA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553592'),
  ('171993049004184175', 'Queen Christina', 1934, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'Rouben Mamoulian, Douglas Shearer, William H. Daniels', 'Ben Hecht', 'Greta Garbo, John Gilbert, Ian Keith, Lewis Stone, Elizabeth Young, C. Aubrey Smith, Reginald Owen, David Torrence', null, 'Popular monarch Queen Christina of Sweden must choose between love and loyalty to her nation when she unexpectedly falls for a Spanish envoy.', 'Popular monarch Queen Christina of Sweden must choose between love and loyalty to her nation when she unexpectedly falls for a Spanish envoy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGGYwoBp21CzF7cMzNPcOr6i6iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31526'),
  ('38494053988535895', 'Queen Kelly', 1929, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erich von Stroheim, Gordon Pollock, Paul Ivano', 'Marian Ainslee', 'Gloria Swanson, Walter Byron, Seena Owen, Sylvia Ashton, Wilson Benge, Sidney Bracey, Rae Daggett, Robert Frazier', null, 'In Kronberg, Ruritania, the planned wedding of Queen Regina and Prince Wolfram is disrupted when the prince falls in love with Patricia Kelly, a beautiful orphan at the convent. The prince kidnaps Patricia and takes her to the palace, but the queen drives her out. After a botched suicide attempt, Patricia unwillingly allows her scurrilous aunt to marry her off to a decrepit scoundrel. Undaunted, Wolfram follows Patricia to her new home in East Africa.', 'In Kronberg, Ruritania, the planned wedding of Queen Regina and Prince Wolfram is disrupted when the prince falls in love with Patricia Kelly, a beautiful orphan at the convent. The prince kidnaps Patricia and takes her to the palace, but the queen drives her out. After a botched suicide attempt, Patricia unwillingly allows her scurrilous aunt to marry her off to a decrepit scoundrel. Undaunted, Wolfram follows Patricia to her new home in East Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86kEZyMwfYZIxO28EHqmoBYPqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42638'),
  ('608464440660304813', 'Queen Kong', 1976, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Frank Agrama, Ian Wilson', 'Frank Agrama, Ronald Dobrin, Fabio Piccioni', 'Robin Askwith, Rula Lenska, Valerie Leon, Roger Hammond, John Clive, Carol Drinkwater, Linda Hayden, Vicki Michelle', null, 'A female film crew journeys to Africa where a giant ape, Queen Kong, falls in love with the crew''s male star.', 'A female film crew journeys to Africa where a giant ape, Queen Kong, falls in love with the crew''s male star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RgT8W8pzsG8MF7RhKBVMcKoBHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56140'),
  ('1096774450005155791', 'Queen Margot', 1994, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Patrice Chéreau, Philippe Rousselot, Jérôme Enrico', 'Patrice Chéreau, Danièle Thompson', 'Isabelle Adjani, Daniel Auteuil, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Vincent Perez, Virna Lisi, Dominique Blanc, Pascal Greggory, Claudio Amendola', 'R', 'Paris, Kingdom of France, August 18, 1572. To avoid the outbreak of a religious war, the Catholic princess Marguerite de Valois, sister of the feeble King Charles IX, marries the Huguenot King Henry III of Navarre.', 'Paris, Kingdom of France, August 18, 1572. To avoid the outbreak of a religious war, the Catholic princess Marguerite de Valois, sister of the feeble King Charles IX, marries the Huguenot King Henry III of Navarre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uGkhBLiJMIkwohGPo3iB9AuwDg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10452'),
  ('819411465218938516', 'Queen Millennia', 1982, 'Action, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Yasuhiro Yamaguchi, Masayuki Akehi', 'Keisuke Fujikawa, Leiji Matsumoto', 'Keiko Han, Keiko Toda, Mami Koyama, Toru Furuya, Shigeru Chiba, Nachi Nozawa, Reiko Mutoh, Ichiryuusai Harumi', null, 'The planet LaMetal is on a collision (and conquering) course with the Earth, and the only one who can stop the forthcoming catastrophe is Queen Millennia, a former princess of LaMetal who has made Earth her home.', 'The planet LaMetal is on a collision (and conquering) course with the Earth, and the only one who can stop the forthcoming catastrophe is Queen Millennia, a former princess of LaMetal who has made Earth her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9pnTSzZME4B2asVrAoyhGlwfk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139287'),
  ('1089138649468645936', 'Queen of Atlantis', 1932, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'G.W. Pabst, Eugen Schüfftan, Ernst Körner', 'Ladislaus Vajda, Hermann Oberländer', 'Brigitte Helm, Heinz Klingenberg, Gustav Diessl, Vladimir Sokoloff, Tela Tchaï, Florelle, Mathias Wieman, Georges Tourreil', null, 'Two young officers, Saint-Avit and Morhange, get lost in the desert and find themselves prisoners of the beautiful Antinéa, queen of the city of Atlantis. Saint-Avit, blinded by his love for her, obeys her when she orders him to kill his comrade... With L’Atlantide, Pabst offers a psychoanalytic reading of Benoit’s novel, with a dominant female figure who enslaves her lovers before destroying them. The film’s fantasy dimension is disturbing, L’Atlantide bathes in a humid nightmare atmosphere, between the desperate search for a missing friend and the apparitions of an underworld lost in the desert. A long, discursive flashback suggests the Parisian origins of Antinéa, born from the marriage between Clémentine, a pretty, light-thighed French Cancan dancer, and an Arab prince seduced during a theatrical performance. But again, it''s impossible to know whether these are the ramblings of an old alcoholic or the strange truth.', 'Two young officers, Saint-Avit and Morhange, get lost in the desert and find themselves prisoners of the beautiful Antinéa, queen of the city of Atlantis. Saint-Avit, blinded by his love for her, obeys her when she orders him to kill his comrade... With L’Atlantide, Pabst offers a psychoanalytic reading of Benoit’s novel, with a dominant female figure who enslaves her lovers before destroying them. The film’s fantasy dimension is disturbing, L’Atlantide bathes in a humid nightmare atmosphere, between the desperate search for a missing friend and the apparitions of an underworld lost in the desert. A long, discursive flashback suggests the Parisian origins of Antinéa, born from the marriage between Clémentine, a pretty, light-thighed French Cancan dancer, and an Arab prince seduced during a theatrical performance. But again, it''s impossible to know whether these are the ramblings of an old alcoholic or the strange truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61i4uVvdJVrXwI9xL586x0Q9HXU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3474'),
  ('1121288711824496893', 'Queen of Blood', 1966, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Curtis Harrington, Vilis Lapenieks', 'Curtis Harrington', 'Florence Marly, Basil Rathbone, John Saxon, Judi Meredith, Dennis Hopper, Robert Boon, Don Eitner, Virgil Frye', null, 'A spaceship is sent to Mars after an alien distress signal is picked up. They find one survivor, but when a crew member is found drained of blood it''s evident they have rescued a bloodsucking monster. Uses footage from Encounter in Space (1963).', 'A spaceship is sent to Mars after an alien distress signal is picked up. They find one survivor, but when a crew member is found drained of blood it''s evident they have rescued a bloodsucking monster. Uses footage from Encounter in Space (1963).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9tKCHTbbWTOxj7AsYPfnz4ybwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27642'),
  ('813883705799626046', 'Queen of Chess', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Rory Kennedy, Imre Juhász', null, 'Judit Polgar, Garry Kasparov', null, 'A Hungarian girl dreams of conquering international men’s chess. After a 15-year battle against world champion Garry Kasparov and her domineering father, Judit Polgár revolutionizes the sport’s patriarchal culture to become one of the greatest chess prodigies in history and the greatest woman chess player of all time.', 'A Hungarian girl dreams of conquering international men’s chess. After a 15-year battle against world champion Garry Kasparov and her domineering father, Judit Polgár revolutionizes the sport’s patriarchal culture to become one of the greatest chess prodigies in history and the greatest woman chess player of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ag5TZNcK3vHdCCpZIY8syjwzgfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1596291'),
  ('424749686891349615', 'Queen of Condoms', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Silvana Ceschi, Reto Stamm', 'Silvana Ceschi, Reto Stamm', 'Jesús Jiménez Escobar, Daniel Jiménez Krause, Dictys Jiménez Krause, Monika Krause', null, 'Ceschi and Stamm''s documentary tells the incredible story of Monika Krause, a former East German citizen, who became Fidel Castro''s Sexual Education Minister. After 20 years in Cuba, Krause set the Cuban sexual revolution in motion: in favor of a woman''s right to sexual fulfillment and legal abortion, and against exclusion of homosexuals, she acquired the title "Queen of Condoms". A film about potent female agitators, staunch macho men and Caribbean love lives.', 'Ceschi and Stamm''s documentary tells the incredible story of Monika Krause, a former East German citizen, who became Fidel Castro''s Sexual Education Minister. After 20 years in Cuba, Krause set the Cuban sexual revolution in motion: in favor of a woman''s right to sexual fulfillment and legal abortion, and against exclusion of homosexuals, she acquired the title "Queen of Condoms". A film about potent female agitators, staunch macho men and Caribbean love lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cYGYpfWnHx8UtRRQe9ZmWGau1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428080'),
  ('467949991570157106', 'Queen of Diamonds', 1991, 'Drama', 'Nina Menkes, Kelley Miller, Daniel Villarreal', 'Nina Menkes', 'Tinka Menkes, Emmellda Beech, Jeff Douglas, Emmellda F. Beech, Kathryn Francomacaro, Jeffrey Eget, Daniel Villarreal, Perfecto Mangual', null, 'Firdaus is a Blackjack dealer in a Las Vegas landscape juxtaposed between glittering casino lights and the deteriorating desert oasis. Negotiating a missing husband and neighboring domestic violence, Firdaus’ world unfolds as a fragmented interplay between repetition and repressed anger.', 'Firdaus is a Blackjack dealer in a Las Vegas landscape juxtaposed between glittering casino lights and the deteriorating desert oasis. Negotiating a missing husband and neighboring domestic violence, Firdaus’ world unfolds as a fragmented interplay between repetition and repressed anger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tt4LOPvxu5fhGC3VZiuaASprS0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173270'),
  ('13422443961314393', 'Queen of Earth', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alex Ross Perry, Sean Price Williams', 'Alex Ross Perry', 'Elisabeth Moss, Katherine Waterston, Patrick Fugit, Kentucker Audley, Keith Poulson, Kate Lyn Sheil, Craig Butta, Daniel April', 'NR', 'Two women retreat to a lake house to get a break from the pressures of the outside world, only to realize how disconnected from each other they have become, allowing their suspicions to bleed into reality.', 'Two women retreat to a lake house to get a break from the pressures of the outside world, only to realize how disconnected from each other they have become, allowing their suspicions to bleed into reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnkTFRx3fPh6NTSBYmSSjkp48SC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300542'),
  ('353934642665761013', 'Queen of Hearts', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mike Southon, Jon Amiel', 'Tony Grisoni', 'Anita Zagaria, Joseph Long, Eileen Way, Vittorio Duse, Vittorio Amandola, Ian Hawkes, Tat Whalley, Sidney Kean', null, 'Eddie Luca is the youngest son in a family of Italian immigrants who has moved to London. Beginning from nowhere, they open a cafe in an Italian neighbourhood. One day their father loses the cafe, the home and his wedding ring by gambling.', 'Eddie Luca is the youngest son in a family of Italian immigrants who has moved to London. Beginning from nowhere, they open a cafe in an Italian neighbourhood. One day their father loses the cafe, the home and his wedding ring by gambling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSDjgFrDvlKWM9G1ZhQAkK7srzh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120637'),
  ('821597200649057669', 'Queen of Hearts', 2019, 'Drama', 'May el-Toukhy, Jasper Spanning', 'Maren Louise Käehne, May el-Toukhy', 'Trine Dyrholm, Gustav Lindh, Magnus Krepper, Liv Esmår Dannemann, Silja Esmår Dannemann, Stine Gyldenkerne, Preben Kristensen, Frederikke Dahl Hansen', null, 'Anne, a brilliant and dedicated advocacy lawyer specialising in society’s most vulnerable, children and young adults, lives what appears to be the picture-perfect life with her doctor-husband, Peter, and their twin daughters. When her estranged teenage stepson, Gustav, moves in with them, Anne’s escalating desire leads her down a dangerous rabbit hole which, once exposed, unleashes a sequence of events destined to destroy her world.', 'Anne, a brilliant and dedicated advocacy lawyer specialising in society’s most vulnerable, children and young adults, lives what appears to be the picture-perfect life with her doctor-husband, Peter, and their twin daughters. When her estranged teenage stepson, Gustav, moves in with them, Anne’s escalating desire leads her down a dangerous rabbit hole which, once exposed, unleashes a sequence of events destined to destroy her world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfFVDIgovEfQZn53VRKLV2JQnRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519465'),
  ('409290043954592638', 'Queen of Katwe', 2016, 'Drama', 'Mira Nair, Sean Bobbitt, Paula Case', 'William Wheeler', 'Madina Nalwanga, David Oyelowo, Lupita Nyong''o, Martin Kabanza, Taryn "Kay" Kyaze, Esther Tebandeke, Ntare Guma Mbaho Mwine, Ethan Nazario Lubega', 'PG', 'A young girl overcomes her disadvantaged upbringing in the slums of Uganda to become a Chess master.', 'A young girl overcomes her disadvantaged upbringing in the slums of Uganda to become a Chess master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8V2ud6uhV7qH6wEDoQ4Ujw99ji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317557'),
  ('491587553709958805', 'Queen of Niendorf', 2017, 'Drama, Family', 'Joya Thome, Lydia Richter', 'Philipp Wunderlich, Joya Thome', 'Lisa Moell, Mex Schlüpfer, Denny Sonnenschein, Salim Fazzani, Sophie Kluge, Cornelius Schwalm, Til Schindler, Tino Mewes', null, 'The summer holidays have just begun in Brandenburg, but ten-year-old Lea isn’t going to camp this year with her friends as she normally would. One afternoon she spots five boys lifting a large blue oil barrel over the fence of a paint factory and driving away with their loot on a bicycle trailer. Lea''s curiosity is piqued. The next chance she gets, she follows the boys and discovers they built a raft on a small lake. The raft is the boys'' property and under no circumstances girls are allowed in their gang. But Lea wants to be part of it very badly and takes them up on a dare. Soon summer is full of adventure.', 'The summer holidays have just begun in Brandenburg, but ten-year-old Lea isn’t going to camp this year with her friends as she normally would. One afternoon she spots five boys lifting a large blue oil barrel over the fence of a paint factory and driving away with their loot on a bicycle trailer. Lea''s curiosity is piqued. The next chance she gets, she follows the boys and discovers they built a raft on a small lake. The raft is the boys'' property and under no circumstances girls are allowed in their gang. But Lea wants to be part of it very badly and takes them up on a dare. Soon summer is full of adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDgjoxjklo1pruZMtSM1wtMxZH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466351'),
  ('159813091215400193', 'Queen of Outer Space', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Edward Bernds, William P. Whitley, William Beaudine Jr.', 'Charles Beaumont', 'Zsa Zsa Gabor, Eric Fleming, Dave Willock, Laurie Mitchell, Lisa Davis, Paul Birch, Patrick Waltz, Barbara Darrow', 'NR', 'A mission to Venus discovers the planet inhabited only by women led by their evil Queen Yllana. Yllana had all the men of Venus killed, now that''s she met Earth men, she wants them dead, too.', 'A mission to Venus discovers the planet inhabited only by women led by their evil Queen Yllana. Yllana had all the men of Venus killed, now that''s she met Earth men, she wants them dead, too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qslv5q9eWmncZySDaMNdvNpsOa2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43135'),
  ('1111239919474478483', 'Queen of Spades', 2021, 'Horror', 'Patrick White', 'Patrick White, John Ainslie', 'Ava Preston, Kaelen Ohm, Jamie Bloch, Eric Osborne, Nabil Rajo, Krista Marchand, Daniel Kash, Michelle Leblanc', 'NR', 'According to legend, an ominous entity known as the Queen of Spades can be summoned by performing an ancient ritual. Four teenagers summon the Queen of Spades, but they could never imagine the horrors that await them.', 'According to legend, an ominous entity known as the Queen of Spades can be summoned by performing an ancient ritual. Four teenagers summon the Queen of Spades, but they could never imagine the horrors that await them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IKBzVBPLXu9p5cfEfdJjHdlafV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829358'),
  ('627655341348639324', 'Queen of Spades: The Dark Rite', 2015, 'Horror', 'Svyatoslav Podgaevsky, Mariya Gogotova, Aleksandr Privalov', 'Svyatoslav Podgaevsky', 'Alina Babak, Valeriya Dmitrieva, Igor Khripunov, Evgeniya Loza, Sergey Pokhodaev, Valentin Sadiki, Vladimir Seleznyov, Mariya Fomina', null, 'There is an ancient ritual known to humankind for more than a hundred years...According to the legend, an ominous entity known as The Queen of Spades can be summoned by drawing a door and staircase on a mirror in the darkness, and by saying her name three times. The Queen of Spades gets her energy from reflective objects; she cuts locks of hair from those asleep, and those that see her go mad or die. Four teenagers decide to call The Queen of Spades as a joke. But when one of them dies of a sudden heart attack, the group realizes they are up against something inexplicable and deadly dangerous.', 'There is an ancient ritual known to humankind for more than a hundred years...According to the legend, an ominous entity known as The Queen of Spades can be summoned by drawing a door and staircase on a mirror in the darkness, and by saying her name three times. The Queen of Spades gets her energy from reflective objects; she cuts locks of hair from those asleep, and those that see her go mad or die. Four teenagers decide to call The Queen of Spades as a joke. But when one of them dies of a sudden heart attack, the group realizes they are up against something inexplicable and deadly dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBN7kp13viC1ND6RyqKxzQfw5ep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358962'),
  ('325441407480438784', 'Queen of Spades: Through the Looking Glass', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Alexandr Domogarov Jr., Alexey Strelov', 'Nikolay Mitropolsky, Ivan Kapitonov, Anna Nasedkina', 'Angelina Strechina, Daniil Muravev-Izotov, Vladislav Konoplev, Klaudia Bochar, Igor Yashanin, Valery Pankov, Vladimir Kanukhin, Alyona Shvidenkova', null, 'The sinister ghost of the Queen of Spades is out for blood, her victims the students of an old boarding school shrouded in gloomy rumors. Exploring the school’s abandoned wing, the teenagers discover a mirror covered in mysterious drawings. Facing it, they playfully recite an incantation which renders their innermost desires a reality - at the expense of nothing less than their souls.', 'The sinister ghost of the Queen of Spades is out for blood, her victims the students of an old boarding school shrouded in gloomy rumors. Exploring the school’s abandoned wing, the teenagers discover a mirror covered in mysterious drawings. Facing it, they playfully recite an incantation which renders their innermost desires a reality - at the expense of nothing less than their souls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drZ7hFMRXKYWTGd8dw9syuZeIO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575361'),
  ('430271249814640779', 'Queen of the Amazons', 1947, 'Adventure', 'Edward Finney, Wesley Barry, Robert Pittack', 'Roger Merton', 'Robert Lowery, Patricia Morison, J. Edward Bromberg, John Miljan, Amira Moustafa, Keith Richards, Bruce Edwards, Wilson Benge', 'NR', 'Jean Preston is determined to find her fiancée, Greg Jones, who went on a safari and didn’t come back when expected. She travels to Akbar, India with Greg’s father, Colonel Jones, Wayne Monroe and the Professor. She asks about Jones at the front desk of the hotel where she stays.', 'Jean Preston is determined to find her fiancée, Greg Jones, who went on a safari and didn’t come back when expected. She travels to Akbar, India with Greg’s father, Colonel Jones, Wayne Monroe and the Professor. She asks about Jones at the front desk of the hotel where she stays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvAe5FiU2oCbmYiMwrXxEjkXzoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23340'),
  ('400272147248935502', 'Queen of the Damned', 2002, 'Fantasy, Horror, Romance', 'Michael Rymer, Ian Baker, Ian Jones', 'Michael Petroni, Scott Abbott', 'Aaliyah, Stuart Townsend, Marguerite Moreau, Vincent Perez, Paul McGann, Lena Olin, Claudia Black, Bruce Spence', 'R', 'Vampire Lestat awakens from his slumber and becomes a rock star. But chaos strikes when his music awakens Akasha, the vampire queen, who may not rest until she makes Lestat her new king.', 'Vampire Lestat awakens from his slumber and becomes a rock star. But chaos strikes when his music awakens Akasha, the vampire queen, who may not rest until she makes Lestat her new king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MMpvQYgOz8K6lzlIVMXWjLzUPC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11979'),
  ('943480012086378721', 'Queen of the Desert', 2015, 'Drama, Adventure, History', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger, Lorenzo Bertolazzi', 'Werner Herzog', 'Nicole Kidman, James Franco, Robert Pattinson, Damian Lewis, Jay Abdo, Jenny Agutter, David Calder, Christopher Fulford', null, 'A chronicle of Gertrude Bell''s life, a traveler, writer, archaeologist, explorer, cartographer, and political attaché for the British Empire in the Near and Middle East at the dawn of the twentieth century. Her knowledge of the tribal leaders is used by the British to establish the Kingdoms of Iraq, Jordan and Saudi Arabia.', 'A chronicle of Gertrude Bell''s life, a traveler, writer, archaeologist, explorer, cartographer, and political attaché for the British Empire in the Near and Middle East at the dawn of the twentieth century. Her knowledge of the tribal leaders is used by the British to establish the Kingdoms of Iraq, Jordan and Saudi Arabia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnav7efMoc9LwNMd96Ayymk3jYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157843'),
  ('170592715690664327', 'Queen of The Night', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kim Je-young, Lee Jae-hyuk', 'Kim Je-young', 'Chun Jung-myung, Kim Min-joung, Kim Ki-bang, Lee Mi-do, Lee Joo-won, Han Jung-soo, Han Bo-reum, Park Jin-young', null, 'A timid husband discovers the shady hidden past of his supposedly perfect wife.', 'A timid husband discovers the shady hidden past of his supposedly perfect wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocj0FuozRjbE388QeDc1kf1R053.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255553'),
  ('163109951041964428', 'Queen of the Ring', 2025, 'History, Drama', 'Ash Avildsen, Paul Lindsay, Gene Michael Smith', 'Ash Avildsen', 'Emily Bett Rickards, Josh Lucas, Walton Goggins, Gavin Casalegno, Marie Avgeropoulos, Tyler Posey, Francesca Eastwood, Kailey Dawn Latimer', 'PG-13', 'In a time when pro wrestling for women was illegal all over the country, a small town single mother embraces the danger to change culture as she dominates America''s most masculine sport to become the first million dollar female athlete in history.', 'In a time when pro wrestling for women was illegal all over the country, a small town single mother embraces the danger to change culture as she dominates America''s most masculine sport to become the first million dollar female athlete in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5ugZxTNHFFm1gAt4eYJbFVKsBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1144932'),
  ('455620798601476542', 'Queen of Underworld', 1991, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Sherman Wong', 'Wong Jing', 'Amy Yip Chi-Mei, Shing Fui-On, Pal Sinn Lap-Man, Gigi Lai Chi, Pauline Chan Bo-Lin, Patrick Hon Jun, Blackie Ko Sau-Leung, Otomo Rena', null, 'Popular Hong Kong actress Amy Yip plays Sister Har -- a seminal figure in 1960s and ''70s Hong Kong nightlife -- in this biographical film that follows the scenester''s rise and fall from the upper echelons of society to the glamour and excess of Hong Kong''s teeming underworld. A truly fascinating portrait of the allure and excess that were part of the fabric of Asia''s favorite playground.', 'Popular Hong Kong actress Amy Yip plays Sister Har -- a seminal figure in 1960s and ''70s Hong Kong nightlife -- in this biographical film that follows the scenester''s rise and fall from the upper echelons of society to the glamour and excess of Hong Kong''s teeming underworld. A truly fascinating portrait of the allure and excess that were part of the fabric of Asia''s favorite playground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfoMaUMlOIfBr2mGHBkDxF8Z1t1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274790'),
  ('1105759921732432238', 'Queen to Play', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Caroline Bottaro', 'Caroline Bottaro', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Kevin Kline, Valérie Lagrange, Francis Renaud, Alexandra Gentil, Alice Pol, Élisabeth Vitali, Jennifer Beals', null, 'Hélène, a housekeeper at a ritzy hotel in Corsica, is devoted to her family but lacks any passion in her own life. When she sees a handsome couple play a passionate game of chess, she becomes inspired to play herself. Hélène''s working-class husband and spoiled daughter are soon bewildered by her obsession with chess. They also grow suspicious of Hélène''s close relationship with Dr. Kröger, her eccentric American expat tutor.', 'Hélène, a housekeeper at a ritzy hotel in Corsica, is devoted to her family but lacks any passion in her own life. When she sees a handsome couple play a passionate game of chess, she becomes inspired to play herself. Hélène''s working-class husband and spoiled daughter are soon bewildered by her obsession with chess. They also grow suspicious of Hélène''s close relationship with Dr. Kröger, her eccentric American expat tutor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d168CM9USKT9rx4xgvxeys5KWgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42973'),
  ('194731679424495400', 'Queen: A Night at the Odeon', 1975, 'Music', 'Tom Corcoran', null, 'Freddie Mercury, Brian May, Roger Taylor, John Deacon', 'PG-13', 'Queen’s legendary Hammersmith Odeon show on Christmas Eve 1975 is one of the best recorded and dynamic early shows available. It occurs a month after A Night At The Opera was released and soon after it hit number one and was video taped for The Old Grey Whistle Test hosted by Bob Harris for BBC television. Most of the show was taped, but the BBC cameras were turned off when Queen came back onstage after the “Jailhouse Rock” encore to play a few more songs. The cameramen couldn’t capture this part of the show so after thirty-five years it remains unseen.', 'Queen’s legendary Hammersmith Odeon show on Christmas Eve 1975 is one of the best recorded and dynamic early shows available. It occurs a month after A Night At The Opera was released and soon after it hit number one and was video taped for The Old Grey Whistle Test hosted by Bob Harris for BBC television. Most of the show was taped, but the BBC cameras were turned off when Queen came back onstage after the “Jailhouse Rock” encore to play a few more songs. The cameramen couldn’t capture this part of the show so after thirty-five years it remains unseen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5Njag41Exc5AqlqvxqayXK4I8d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49572'),
  ('253911899874352251', 'Queen: Days of Our Lives', 2011, 'Music, Documentary', 'Matt O''Casey, Ric Clark, Ken Morse', null, 'Freddie Mercury, Brian May, John Deacon, Roger Taylor, Roy Thomas Baker, Jim Beach, Paul Gambaccini, Peter Hince', null, 'In 1971, four college students got together to form a rock band. Since then, that certain band called Queen have released 26 albums and sold over 300 million records worldwide. The popularity of Freddie Mercury, Brian May, Roger Taylor and John Deacon is stronger than ever 40 years on. But it was no bed of roses. No pleasure cruise. Queen had their share of kicks in the face, but they came through and this is how they did it, set against the backdrop of brilliant music and stunning live performances from every corner of the globe. In this film, for the first time, it is the band that tells their story. Featuring brand new interviews with the band and unseen archive footage (including their recently unearthed, first ever TV performance), it is a compelling story told with intelligence, wit, plenty of humor and painful honesty.', 'In 1971, four college students got together to form a rock band. Since then, that certain band called Queen have released 26 albums and sold over 300 million records worldwide. The popularity of Freddie Mercury, Brian May, Roger Taylor and John Deacon is stronger than ever 40 years on. But it was no bed of roses. No pleasure cruise. Queen had their share of kicks in the face, but they came through and this is how they did it, set against the backdrop of brilliant music and stunning live performances from every corner of the globe. In this film, for the first time, it is the band that tells their story. Featuring brand new interviews with the band and unseen archive footage (including their recently unearthed, first ever TV performance), it is a compelling story told with intelligence, wit, plenty of humor and painful honesty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhQxEEXdLUYQfXpTS05JvywH7Ht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74406'),
  ('921158252411262295', 'Queen: Live at Wembley Stadium', 1986, 'Music', 'Gavin Taylor', null, 'Freddie Mercury, Brian May, Roger Taylor, John Deacon, Spike Edney', 'PG', 'One of the world''s biggest bands returns to the scene of their Live Aid triumph (one year earlier in 1985) to play all their greatest hits in front of a packed Wembley Stadium.', 'One of the world''s biggest bands returns to the scene of their Live Aid triumph (one year earlier in 1985) to play all their greatest hits in front of a packed Wembley Stadium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/he2VSGKspGL4iSFe0ggGMcvYlQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20575'),
  ('677573554915669996', 'Queen: Live In Rio', 1985, 'Music, Documentary', 'Aloysio Legey', null, 'Freddie Mercury, Brian May, Roger Taylor, John Deacon', 'NR', 'British rock''s greatest entertainers play to more than 300,000 people in Rio, Brazil, headlining the first Rock in Rio festival in January 1985.', 'British rock''s greatest entertainers play to more than 300,000 people in Rio, Brazil, headlining the first Rock in Rio festival in January 1985.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OCHTNSCA52W9sbLCSF6IXUlFM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67192'),
  ('118119316716416265', 'Queenpins', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Andrew Wehde, Aron Gaudet, Gita Pullapilly', 'Gita Pullapilly, Aron Gaudet', 'Kristen Bell, Kirby Howell-Baptiste, Vince Vaughn, Paul Walter Hauser, Joel McHale, Bebe Rexha, Dayo Okeniyi, Nick Cassavetes', 'R', 'Bored and frustrated suburban homemaker Connie and her best pal JoJo, a vlogger with dreams, turn a hobby into a multi-million-dollar counterfeit coupon caper. After firing off a letter to the conglomerate behind a box of cereal gone stale, and receiving an apology along with dozens of freebies, the duo hatch an illegal coupon club scheme that scams millions from mega-corporations and delivers deals to legions of fellow coupon clippers. On the trail to total coupon dominance, a hapless Loss Prevention Officer from the local supermarket chain joins forces with a determined U.S. Postal Inspector in hot pursuit of these newly minted “Queenpins” of pink collar crime.', 'Bored and frustrated suburban homemaker Connie and her best pal JoJo, a vlogger with dreams, turn a hobby into a multi-million-dollar counterfeit coupon caper. After firing off a letter to the conglomerate behind a box of cereal gone stale, and receiving an apology along with dozens of freebies, the duo hatch an illegal coupon club scheme that scams millions from mega-corporations and delivers deals to legions of fellow coupon clippers. On the trail to total coupon dominance, a hapless Loss Prevention Officer from the local supermarket chain joins forces with a determined U.S. Postal Inspector in hot pursuit of these newly minted “Queenpins” of pink collar crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5Uz76EOwj9rAsdGxYL8IZGPV2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628914'),
  ('279115502874052129', 'Queens', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Manuel Gómez Pereira, Juan Amorós, Luis San Narciso', 'Yolanda García Serrano, Joaquín Oristrell, Manuel Gómez Pereira', 'Carmen Maura, Verónica Forqué, Marisa Paredes, Mercedes Sampietro, Betiana Blum, Gustavo Salmerón, Unax Ugalde, Hugo Silva', null, 'In Spain, a couple of days before a collective gay wedding, the lives of five mothers, whose sons will get married, become entwined.', 'In Spain, a couple of days before a collective gay wedding, the lives of five mothers, whose sons will get married, become entwined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YPrDhdlF6iPSbfPkdtpe1Ylq2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31822'),
  ('134000847893564388', 'Queens', 2024, 'Drama', 'Klaudia Reynicke, Charlie Almagro Casado, Diego Romero', 'Diego Vega Vidal, Klaudia Reynicke', 'Abril Gjurinovic, Luana Vega, Jimena Lindo, Gonzalo Molina, Susi Sánchez, Denise Arregui, Fabrizio Aguilar, Tatiana Astengo', null, 'Surrounded by social and political chaos in Lima during the summer of 1992, Lucia, Aurora, and their mother, Elena, plan to leave and seek opportunities in the United States. Their farewell involves reconnecting with their estranged father, Carlos, adding turbulence to the regrets, hopes, and fears of their emotional departure.', 'Surrounded by social and political chaos in Lima during the summer of 1992, Lucia, Aurora, and their mother, Elena, plan to leave and seek opportunities in the United States. Their farewell involves reconnecting with their estranged father, Carlos, adding turbulence to the regrets, hopes, and fears of their emotional departure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPfAK3qU4MqyOE0sLuvlVLhQxnd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214478'),
  ('300809213429730639', 'Queens Logic', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Steve Rash, Amir Mokri', 'Tony Spiridakis', 'Kevin Bacon, Jamie Lee Curtis, Linda Fiorentino, John Malkovich, Joe Mantegna, Ken Olin, Tony Spiridakis, Tom Waits', 'R', 'When childhood friends Al, Dennis and Eliot get together for Ray''s wedding, which may or may not happen, they end up on a roller-coaster ride through reality. During one tumultuous, crazy weekend, they face adulthood and each other with new found maturity and discover what Queens Logic is all about. This comedy takes a look at friendship, loyalty, and love.', 'When childhood friends Al, Dennis and Eliot get together for Ray''s wedding, which may or may not happen, they end up on a roller-coaster ride through reality. During one tumultuous, crazy weekend, they face adulthood and each other with new found maturity and discover what Queens Logic is all about. This comedy takes a look at friendship, loyalty, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hFeEhS6xr7f0JUNu5m0okitJai.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49792'),
  ('305374888982501335', 'Queens of Drama', 2024, 'Music, Romance, Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Alexis Langlois, Anaïs Couette, Angel Adhera', 'Alexis Langlois, Thomas Colineau, Carlotta Coco', 'Louiza Aura, Gio Ventura, Bilal Hassani, Alma Jodorowsky, Nana Benamer, Asia Argento, Thomas Poitevin, Mona Soyoc', null, 'It''s 2055 and Steevyshady, an obsessive Mimi Madamour stan, tells us of their idol’s mad destiny from the very peak of her career in 2005, all the way down to the pits of hell, a downfall brought about by her love story with punk icon Billie Kohler. Over the course of half a century we follow these drama queens as they top the charts and set sail on the course of mad queer love.', 'It''s 2055 and Steevyshady, an obsessive Mimi Madamour stan, tells us of their idol’s mad destiny from the very peak of her career in 2005, all the way down to the pits of hell, a downfall brought about by her love story with punk icon Billie Kohler. Over the course of half a century we follow these drama queens as they top the charts and set sail on the course of mad queer love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lm49kZp4rUV4rHBesXcpaLri9l1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001376'),
  ('771826940835417276', 'Queens of Evil', 1970, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Tonino Cervi, Sergio D''Offizi, Ilde Muscio', 'Raoul Katz, Antonio Troiso, Tonino Cervi', 'Ray Lovelock, Ida Galli, Silvia Monti, Haydée Politoff, Gianni Santuccio, Geraldine Hooper, Claudio Gora, Guido Alberti', null, 'A young hippie kills a man, and seeks refuge at the lakeside house of three beautiful sisters, who seem to be hiding a dark secret.', 'A young hippie kills a man, and seeks refuge at the lakeside house of three beautiful sisters, who seem to be hiding a dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soOH148Wi2nrjT3NYiPhFHuKeZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88486'),
  ('238781577345223655', 'Queens of Joy', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Olga Gibelinda, Kyrylo Nikrashevych', 'Olga Gibelinda, Ivanna Khitsinska', null, null, 'Amidst the maelstrom of war in Ukraine, three drag queens -Diva Monroe, Marlene, and Aura- refuse to abandon their homeland. Instead of fleeing, they choose to fight: for freedom, the LGBTQ+ community, and their very existence. From the glamour of the show to the brutality of war, the film follows their lives - filled with loss, fear, as well as indomitable courage. Marlen grapples with old wounds, Diva Monroe finds herself once more, and Aura fights for a place both in the army and onto the stage. A charity drag show they organize to support Ukraine turns into a symbol of unity and resilience. The film is a story of self- discovery, love, hope, and the power to find joy even in the darkest of times.', 'Amidst the maelstrom of war in Ukraine, three drag queens -Diva Monroe, Marlene, and Aura- refuse to abandon their homeland. Instead of fleeing, they choose to fight: for freedom, the LGBTQ+ community, and their very existence. From the glamour of the show to the brutality of war, the film follows their lives - filled with loss, fear, as well as indomitable courage. Marlen grapples with old wounds, Diva Monroe finds herself once more, and Aura fights for a place both in the army and onto the stage. A charity drag show they organize to support Ukraine turns into a symbol of unity and resilience. The film is a story of self- discovery, love, hope, and the power to find joy even in the darkest of times.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6rQXCW5NK91sVnQbQFxIW16lyL4.jpg', 'plex:movie:queens-of-joy'),
  ('845953707982780395', 'Queens of the Dead', 2025, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Tina Romero, Shannon Madden', 'Erin Judge, Tina Romero', 'Katy O''Brian, Jaquel Spivey, Nina West, Tómas Matos, Margaret Cho, Jack Haven, Quincy Dunn-Baker, Cheyenne Jackson', null, 'When a zombie apocalypse breaks out in Brooklyn on the night of a giant warehouse party, an eclectic group of drag queens, club kids, & frenemies must put aside their drama and use their unique skills to fight against the brain-thirsty, scrolling undead.', 'When a zombie apocalypse breaks out in Brooklyn on the night of a giant warehouse party, an eclectic group of drag queens, club kids, & frenemies must put aside their drama and use their unique skills to fight against the brain-thirsty, scrolling undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mY8JqSMBSiXZh9EbGqUjpF6aacu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318435'),
  ('816800706831235696', 'Queens of The Field', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Mohamed Hamidi', 'Camille Fontaine, Alain-Michel Blanc, Mohamed Hamidi', 'Kad Merad, Alban Ivanov, Céline Sallette, Sabrina Ouazani, Laure Calamy, Guillaume Gouix, Myra Tyliann, Manika Auxire', null, 'After its football team is disqualified for insulting a referee during a major game, a small country town risks losing its funding along with its field. To avoid this disaster, there is only one solution: creating a new team made up exclusively of women to defend the city’s colors! But in a community where football has always been an activity reserved for men, these women’s new status will be sure to shake up the daily lives of the town’s residents…', 'After its football team is disqualified for insulting a referee during a major game, a small country town risks losing its funding along with its field. To avoid this disaster, there is only one solution: creating a new team made up exclusively of women to defend the city’s colors! But in a community where football has always been an activity reserved for men, these women’s new status will be sure to shake up the daily lives of the town’s residents…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzfEsACN1ma7ArFjFC5JvuThvov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613345'),
  ('1002432803042597064', 'Queens of the Ring', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Marc Rudnicki, Frédéric Drouilhat, Antoine Monod', 'Manon Dillys, Hélène Le Gal, Marie Pavlenko', 'Marilou Berry, Nathalie Baye, André Dussollier, Audrey Fleurot, Corinne Masiero, Isabelle Nanty, Cyril Gueï, Jacques Frantz', null, 'More than anything, 30-year-old Rose longs to be reunited with Mickaël, her estranged 11-year-old son who has been placed with a foster family and blames his mother for their long separation. When she discovers that Mickaël is crazy about wrestling, Rose thinks she''s found a way to melt the ice: she''ll put together a tag team with three girlfriends from the store where all four work as checkout girls...', 'More than anything, 30-year-old Rose longs to be reunited with Mickaël, her estranged 11-year-old son who has been placed with a foster family and blames his mother for their long separation. When she discovers that Mickaël is crazy about wrestling, Rose thinks she''s found a way to melt the ice: she''ll put together a tag team with three girlfriends from the store where all four work as checkout girls...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tattcNlGtbIcK7iQguVED1j6sMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202215'),
  ('390978160855029688', 'Queens on the Run', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Jorge Macaya', 'Martha Higareda', 'Martha Higareda, Paola Nuñez, Alejandra Ambrosi, Valeria Vera, Claudia Pineda, Ricardo Muñoz Senior, Ricardo Reynaud, Mauricio Isaac', null, 'When four women finally take the road trip they planned in high school, they have no idea of the things they''ll bump into... sometimes literally.', 'When four women finally take the road trip they planned in high school, they have no idea of the things they''ll bump into... sometimes literally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pufQnUSzjrf70cHR3mGxG0eXHem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1101799'),
  ('309424575123383794', 'Queer', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sayombhu Mukdeeprom, Luca Guadagnino, Daniel Bedusa', 'Justin Kuritzkes', 'Daniel Craig, Drew Starkey, Jason Schwartzman, Lesley Manville, Henry Zaga, Drew Droege, Andra Ursuta, Lisandro Alonso', 'R', 'In 1950s Mexico City, William Lee, an American ex-pat in his late forties, leads a solitary life amidst a small American community. However, the arrival in town of Eugene Allerton, a young student, stirs William into finally establishing a meaningful connection with someone.', 'In 1950s Mexico City, William Lee, an American ex-pat in his late forties, leads a solitary life amidst a small American community. However, the arrival in town of Eugene Allerton, a young student, stirs William into finally establishing a meaningful connection with someone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xe4b2TMciLKA1C0JlhWxb4ENLln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059128'),
  ('240118697633143736', 'Queer Duck: The Movie', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Xeth Feinberg', 'Mike Reiss', 'Jim J. Bullock, Jackie Hoffman, Kevin Michael Richardson, Billy West, Estelle Harris, Mark Hamill, Tim Curry, Andy Dick', 'PG-13', 'Queer Duck and his partner of 18 months (a lifetime in gay years), Stephen Arlo "Openly" Gator, hit a relationship crisis when the fey fowl is wooed by a brassy Broadway broad. Queer Duck wonders if he''d be happier being straight, while Gator the waiter spills his problems to a compassionate Conan O''Brien.', 'Queer Duck and his partner of 18 months (a lifetime in gay years), Stephen Arlo "Openly" Gator, hit a relationship crisis when the fey fowl is wooed by a brassy Broadway broad. Queer Duck wonders if he''d be happier being straight, while Gator the waiter spills his problems to a compassionate Conan O''Brien.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6d0gZsEc3oS7jw0527FjMDU9o5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34728'),
  ('1149844249462289728', 'Queer World', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Zeki Ökten, Zeki Demirkubuz', 'Umur Bugay', 'Kemal Sunal, Jale Aylanç, Erdal Gülver, Ayberk Çölok, Cezmi Baskın, Orhan Çağman, Selçuk Uluergüven, Şebnem Gürsoy', null, 'Living in an Ankara shantytown, Mehmet plays the clarinet at a nightclub to support his family. When their home is sold to a contractor by his brother-in-law, the gap between Mehmet’s dreams and reality significantly grows.', 'Living in an Ankara shantytown, Mehmet plays the clarinet at a nightclub to support his family. When their home is sold to a contractor by his brother-in-law, the gap between Mehmet’s dreams and reality significantly grows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgS7rtdYMyOCkArO6OU4kufpGFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436061'),
  ('181064441728036502', 'Quel bravo ragazzo', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Alessandra Gori, Davide Boschin, Enrico Lando', 'Enrico Lando, Gianluca Ansanelli, Andrea Agnello', 'Herbert Ballerina, Tony Sperandeo, Enrico Lo Verso, Antonino Bruschetta, Daniela Virgilio, Mario Pupella, Maccio Capatonda, Beniamino Marcone', null, 'On his deathbed, a powerful Mafia boss names his estranged son heir to his criminal empire: however, his men discover too late that the son at issue is an idiotic manchild.', 'On his deathbed, a powerful Mafia boss names his estranged son heir to his criminal empire: however, his men discover too late that the son at issue is an idiotic manchild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmmnyjIspgcyeQdW7wLsWcz9UmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424014'),
