  ('583733543635987190', 'Quello che le ragazze non dicono', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Clarita Di Giovanni', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Irene Ferri, Martina Colombari, Carlotta Miti, Sabrina Paravicini, Lia Tanzi, Vincenzo Peluso, Paolo Calissano, Walter Nudo', null, 'Francesca, Paola, Laura, and Alicia are four friends who all fall in love with the same man, a musician named Gigi. Alicia is a woman who fears compromising in her relationships, Laura is an overprotected dreamer, Paola is a lawyer who seeks true love, and Francesca is a dancer on a TV show', 'Francesca, Paola, Laura, and Alicia are four friends who all fall in love with the same man, a musician named Gigi. Alicia is a woman who fears compromising in her relationships, Laura is an overprotected dreamer, Paola is a lawyer who seeks true love, and Francesca is a dancer on a TV show', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sovfxrgZNgBJEWpx6TKmKjliWYa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62025'),
  ('911264236646744236', 'Quentin Durward', 1955, 'Adventure, History, Romance', 'Richard Thorpe, Christopher Challis', 'Robert Ardrey, George Froeschel', 'Robert Taylor, Kay Kendall, Robert Morley, George Cole, Alec Clunes, Duncan Lamont, Laya Raki, Marius Goring', null, 'During the 15th century reign of France''s King Louis XI, a young Scottish man is sent by his English Lord to woo a French lady on his behalf. The plan goes awry when the young man falls in love with her. Based on the classic novel by Sir Walter Scott.', 'During the 15th century reign of France''s King Louis XI, a young Scottish man is sent by his English Lord to woo a French lady on his behalf. The plan goes awry when the young man falls in love with her. Based on the classic novel by Sir Walter Scott.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3r7MM1pYTLT2fpxMVvIASRNfPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76231'),
  ('175910615796239222', 'Querelle', 1982, 'Drama, Crime', 'Josef Vavra, Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Harry Baer', 'Burkhard Driest, Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Brad Davis, Franco Nero, Jeanne Moreau, Laurent Malet, Hanno Pöschl, Günther Kaufmann, Burkhard Driest, Roger Fritz', 'R', 'A handsome Belgian sailor on shore leave in the port of Brest, who is also a drug smuggler and murderer, embarks upon a voyage of highly charged and violent homosexual self-discovery that will change him forever from the man he once was.', 'A handsome Belgian sailor on shore leave in the port of Brest, who is also a drug smuggler and murderer, embarks upon a voyage of highly charged and violent homosexual self-discovery that will change him forever from the man he once was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNATtWnC7DJYOnbKTlHbQ58bVd9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42135'),
