  ('564718534786628995', 'Queremos un hijo tuyo', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Leopoldo Villaseñor', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Fernando Esteso, Silvia Aguilar, Florinda Chico, Ricardo Merino, Loreta Tovar, Isabel Luque, Francisco Camoiras, Tito García', null, 'Amancio is an entrepreneur who needs a son to inherit the shares of the Company to continue controlling the business. But it has a small problem, can not have children. One day, Amancio learns that the farm has on the field there is a gardener who has terrorized the inhabitants of a nearby town, for their ability to conquer women. So he decides to take his wife to the farm in order to stay in a state of good hope.', 'Amancio is an entrepreneur who needs a son to inherit the shares of the Company to continue controlling the business. But it has a small problem, can not have children. One day, Amancio learns that the farm has on the field there is a gardener who has terrorized the inhabitants of a nearby town, for their ability to conquer women. So he decides to take his wife to the farm in order to stay in a state of good hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQ6nKdRpvLzZRv81WyURQ3g6LvX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121497'),
  ('134851681421323472', 'Querô', 2007, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hélcio Alemão Nagamine, Carlos Cortez', 'Carlos Cortez', 'Maxwell Nascimento, Maria Luísa Mendonça, Ângela Leal, Aílton Graça, Milhem Cortaz, Cláudia Juliana, Eliseu Paranhos, Giulio Lopes', null, 'Querô is an orphan teenager, living alone near the docks in Santos, Brazil. His mother, a prostitute, died when he was a baby, and he was raised in the bordello where she worked. Believing he rules his own destiny, he refuses to compromise with anyone else, the corrupt policemen always chasing him, the oppressive discipline in the juvenile institution Febem, or the drug dealers who try to lure him. But this independence has a price.', 'Querô is an orphan teenager, living alone near the docks in Santos, Brazil. His mother, a prostitute, died when he was a baby, and he was raised in the bordello where she worked. Believing he rules his own destiny, he refuses to compromise with anyone else, the corrupt policemen always chasing him, the oppressive discipline in the juvenile institution Febem, or the drug dealers who try to lure him. But this independence has a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZXhCMSoapkSGqnYRhKcpxQfYA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46645'),
  ('915289803647954208', 'Query', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sophie Kargman, Irvin Y. Liu, Lara Aslanian', 'Ryan Farhoudi, Sophie Kargman', 'Justice Smith, Graham Patrick Martin, Armie Hammer, Olivia Sui', null, 'A leisurely day belies its uninvited end as Jay and Alex, best friends and roommates, challenge one another on their opinions of sexuality.', 'A leisurely day belies its uninvited end as Jay and Alex, best friends and roommates, challenge one another on their opinions of sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGTahyg0SX9cejcKj9P14NqXdgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701189'),
  ('947787561210157115', 'Quest', 1984, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Saul Bass, Elaine Bass', null, 'John Abbott, Noah Hathaway, David Comfort, Damian Cavalieri, Jay W. MacIntosh, Bill Erwin, Les Tremayne, Sam Fontana', null, 'On a distant planet, descendants of a crashed spaceship are subjected to mysterious forces that cause them to age and die in just eight days. They must also live in caves to escape the bitter cold of night and the killing heat of day. One young boy is determined to find his way back to the ship that brought them there. But how will he accomplish this in the short time left to him?', 'On a distant planet, descendants of a crashed spaceship are subjected to mysterious forces that cause them to age and die in just eight days. They must also live in caves to escape the bitter cold of night and the killing heat of day. One young boy is determined to find his way back to the ship that brought them there. But how will he accomplish this in the short time left to him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2GbO8TsLVKr5TUOG23kPAYer7O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114442'),
  ('1043503193164347091', 'Quest', 1997, 'Animation', 'Tyron Montgomery, Tyron Montgomery', 'Thomas Stellmach, Tyron Montgomery', null, null, 'A being made of sand wakes up in the desert. It finds a bottle near him, but it''s empty. The noise of dropping water can be heard not far away. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2010.', 'A being made of sand wakes up in the desert. It finds a bottle near him, but it''s empty. The noise of dropping water can be heard not far away. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sLAbUSlWIFys4yYKqlgUBFt1MDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93114'),
  ('468823003177673311', 'Quest for Camelot', 1998, 'Fantasy, Animation, Drama, Romance, Family', 'Frederik Du Chau', 'Kirk DeMicco, William Schifrin, Jacqueline Feather', 'Jessalyn Gilsig, Andrea Corr, Cary Elwes, Bryan White, Gary Oldman, Eric Idle, Don Rickles, Jane Seymour', 'G', 'During the times of King Arthur, Kayley is a brave girl who dreams of following her late father as a Knight of the Round Table. The evil Ruber wants to invade Camelot and take the throne of King Arthur, and Kayley has to stop him.', 'During the times of King Arthur, Kayley is a brave girl who dreams of following her late father as a Knight of the Round Table. The evil Ruber wants to invade Camelot and take the throne of King Arthur, and Kayley has to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLfFEQ9HTw0HRvBkW3nI9RUze03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18937'),
  ('970905886859290092', 'Quest for Fire', 1981, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Claude Agostini, Raymond Larose', 'Gérard Brach', 'Everett McGill, Ron Perlman, Nicholas Kadi, Rae Dawn Chong, Gary Schwartz, Naseer El-Kadi, Franck-Olivier Bonnet, Jean-Michel Kindt', 'R', 'In the prehistoric world, a Cro-Magnon tribe depends on an ever-burning source of fire, which eventually extinguishes. Lacking the knowledge to start a new fire, the tribe sends three warriors on a quest for more. With the tribe''s future at stake, the warriors make their way across a treacherous landscape full of hostile tribes and monstrous beasts. On their journey, they encounter Ika, a woman who has the knowledge they seek.', 'In the prehistoric world, a Cro-Magnon tribe depends on an ever-burning source of fire, which eventually extinguishes. Lacking the knowledge to start a new fire, the tribe sends three warriors on a quest for more. With the tribe''s future at stake, the warriors make their way across a treacherous landscape full of hostile tribes and monstrous beasts. On their journey, they encounter Ika, a woman who has the knowledge they seek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyzW1M00xfHKNtmTlT6wJ3F4pNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62204'),
  ('16073308822878830', 'Quest for Love', 1971, 'Romance, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Ralph Thomas, Ernest Steward', 'Terence Feely', 'Joan Collins, Tom Bell, Denholm Elliott, Laurence Naismith, Geraldine Gardner, Geraldine Moffat, David Weston, Dudley Foster', null, 'After a scientific experiment goes horribly wrong during a demonstration, a scientist finds himself trapped in an alternate reality that bears some similarities to our own, but also has some striking differences. In this other reality the Second World War had never occurred, mankind had not yet traveled into Space and Mt. Everest had not yet been conquered, just to name a few things. Also in this other reality he is no longer a scientist but rather a well known author. After a personal tragedy in this alternate world, he finds himself back in his own world and desperately trying to locate the woman he fell in love with in the other world. Little does she know, however, that her life depends on him finding her.', 'After a scientific experiment goes horribly wrong during a demonstration, a scientist finds himself trapped in an alternate reality that bears some similarities to our own, but also has some striking differences. In this other reality the Second World War had never occurred, mankind had not yet traveled into Space and Mt. Everest had not yet been conquered, just to name a few things. Also in this other reality he is no longer a scientist but rather a well known author. After a personal tragedy in this alternate world, he finds himself back in his own world and desperately trying to locate the woman he fell in love with in the other world. Little does she know, however, that her life depends on him finding her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMPs8BLvfsm4TmzlozRf8y7grIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114201'),
  ('269482079410177334', 'Quest for the Mighty Sword', 1990, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Joe D''Amato, Carlo Maria Cordio, Joe D''Amato', null, 'Eric Allan Kramer, Margaret Lenzey, Donald O''Brien, Dina Morrone, Chris Murphy, Laura Gemser, Marisa Mell, Domenico Semeraro', null, 'Once upon a time a god gave a mighty sword to the king of Aquiles to bring justice to his people. Now he wants it back - but the king rather gives his life than the sword. Goddess Dehamira, who spoke for him, is being taken all her privileges and banned in a circle of fire, until a human arrives who''s strong enough to free her. When prince Ator becomes 18, he gets the sword from the mean sorcerer gnome Grindl, to free Dehamira and his people. On his journey he has to fight against dragons and other fantastic figures.', 'Once upon a time a god gave a mighty sword to the king of Aquiles to bring justice to his people. Now he wants it back - but the king rather gives his life than the sword. Goddess Dehamira, who spoke for him, is being taken all her privileges and banned in a circle of fire, until a human arrives who''s strong enough to free her. When prince Ator becomes 18, he gets the sword from the mean sorcerer gnome Grindl, to free Dehamira and his people. On his journey he has to fight against dragons and other fantastic figures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZPbJAmvjippEd731kjN4IXi2O0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5086'),
  ('1090085241758020782', 'Quest of the Delta Knights', 1993, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'James Dodson, James Dodson', 'Redge Mahaffey', 'David Warner, Corbin Allred, David Kriegel, Brigid Brannagh, Olivia Hussey, Sarah Douglas, Richard Kind, Peter Sands', 'PG', 'A secret society, the Delta Knights, attempts to save a medieval society from the evil over-lady.', 'A secret society, the Delta Knights, attempts to save a medieval society from the evil over-lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mw5zQqCma6ogkh5j3NxiO2QTYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84633'),
  ('249363030472285950', 'Questa notte è ancora nostra', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Gian Filippo Corticelli, Paolo Genovese, Luca Miniero', 'Luca Miniero, Fausto Brizzi, Paolo Genovese', 'Nicolas Vaporidis, Valentina Izumi, Massimiliano Bruno, Ilaria Spada, Maurizio Mattioli, Franco Califano, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Hal Yamanouchi', null, 'When a producer refuses to cut Massimo and his band a record unless they hire an "ethnic" singer to spice up the act, he tries to seduce Jing, a Chinese girl with a beautiful voice disinterested in both him and rock, to get her on board. She pretends to cave in in order to escape an arranged marriage, but in the weeks preceding the concert the two begin to grow closer, complicating the secretly fake nature of their relationship.', 'When a producer refuses to cut Massimo and his band a record unless they hire an "ethnic" singer to spice up the act, he tries to seduce Jing, a Chinese girl with a beautiful voice disinterested in both him and rock, to get her on board. She pretends to cave in in order to escape an arranged marriage, but in the weeks preceding the concert the two begin to grow closer, complicating the secretly fake nature of their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNkDjAoGssuV0hQkSIDADL8Udt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68063'),
  ('894926515965122950', 'Questi fantasmi!', 2024, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Antonello Emidi', 'Massimo Gaudioso, Filippo Gili', 'Massimiliano Gallo, Anna Foglietta, Alessio Lapice, Maurizio Casagrande, Gea Martire, Viviana Cangiano, Toni Laudadio, Lello Serao', null, 'Pasquale Lojacono moves into a large flat with his wife Maria following a special agreement with the owner: in exchange for free accommodation, Pasquale must dispel rumours that the house is haunted by ghosts. The protagonist begins to receive regular sums of money from spirits who, according to him, are particularly generous and supportive towards him. As time goes by, however, it turns out that the source of his fortune is a ghost who, having become Maria''s lover, wants to silence him and plan an escape with her. Added to this unusual love triangle are the doorman, his sister and the lover''s family, each of whom, in their own way, exploits the rumours of ghosts for their own gain under the gaze of Professor Santanna, who observes and comments on the inexplicable events with Pasquale from the window of the flat opposite.', 'Pasquale Lojacono moves into a large flat with his wife Maria following a special agreement with the owner: in exchange for free accommodation, Pasquale must dispel rumours that the house is haunted by ghosts. The protagonist begins to receive regular sums of money from spirits who, according to him, are particularly generous and supportive towards him. As time goes by, however, it turns out that the source of his fortune is a ghost who, having become Maria''s lover, wants to silence him and plan an escape with her. Added to this unusual love triangle are the doorman, his sister and the lover''s family, each of whom, in their own way, exploits the rumours of ghosts for their own gain under the gaze of Professor Santanna, who observes and comments on the inexplicable events with Pasquale from the window of the flat opposite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3u2XMsXwXds5t10ALAF66zp0gVb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1299364'),
  ('509573819615131446', 'Questo Piccolo Grande Amore', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Riccardo Donna, Federico Schlatter, Francesco Vedovati', 'Claudio Baglioni, Ivan Cotroneo', 'Emanuele Bosi, Maria P. Petruolo, Daniela Giordano, Mariella Valentini, Claudio Cotugno, Valentino Campitelli, Giulia Amato, Veronica Corsi', null, 'From the album of the same name by Claudio Baglioni the film tells the love story of two teenagers during the legendary seventies. A story so overwhelming as to compel the world to retreat, to step aside. Andrea and Giulia come from two different worlds, have different friends, and two different lives who call them strongly in opposite directions. Will they keep their love alive in spite of everything?', 'From the album of the same name by Claudio Baglioni the film tells the love story of two teenagers during the legendary seventies. A story so overwhelming as to compel the world to retreat, to step aside. Andrea and Giulia come from two different worlds, have different friends, and two different lives who call them strongly in opposite directions. Will they keep their love alive in spite of everything?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXV9u5kEUmRqP1IazGud0kYQvYq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41427'),
  ('216892383178241553', 'Qui c''est les plus forts ?', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Charlotte de Turckheim, Dominique Bouilleret', 'Clément Koch, Charlotte de Turckheim', 'Alice Pol, Audrey Lamy, Bruno Sanches, Grégory Fitoussi, Daniel Njo Lobé, Barbara Bolotner, Julia Piaton, Enzo Tomasini', null, 'Samantha, who works in a chicken factory in Saint-Étienne, loses her job. She lives with her best-friend Céline. She is also her little sister Kim''s guardian and must find another job quickly or run the risk of losing her sister. She meets Paul, a lawyer who would like to raise a child with his partner. As a result, he asks Samantha if she would like to be hired as his surrogate.', 'Samantha, who works in a chicken factory in Saint-Étienne, loses her job. She lives with her best-friend Céline. She is also her little sister Kim''s guardian and must find another job quickly or run the risk of losing her sister. She meets Paul, a lawyer who would like to raise a child with his partner. As a result, he asks Samantha if she would like to be hired as his surrogate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWMojbLJaCSksdCUPhcvj8bJDzT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342149'),
  ('289080364077112932', 'Qui sème l''amour...', 2016, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie, Romance', 'Lorenzo Gabriele', 'Lorenzo Gabriele', 'Evelyne Buyle, Julie de Bona, David Baïot, Alix Bénézech, Léopoldine Serre, Sébastien Libessart, Valérie Flan, Cyrielle Alvarez', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUYF9F18uX5R2Ec5aW36UN6WZW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401977'),
  ('587302617472404561', 'Quick', 1993, 'Action, Crime', 'Rick King, Geza Sinkovics, Jeff Okabayashi', 'Frederick Bailey', 'Teri Polo, Martin Donovan, Jeff Fahey, Robert Davi, Tia Carrere, Michael McGrady, Jason Tomlins, Brian Brophy', 'R', 'A female assassin named "Quick" is hired to bring in a Mafia accountant, who is under police protection. Double crossed by the mafia, she takes her hostage to California to retrieve $3M that he took before running. The mafia and Quick''s untrustworthy boyfriend are on the trail.', 'A female assassin named "Quick" is hired to bring in a Mafia accountant, who is under police protection. Double crossed by the mafia, she takes her hostage to California to retrieve $3M that he took before running. The mafia and Quick''s untrustworthy boyfriend are on the trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4SzWNTgaIX9hNHHflc2RhByD7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95429'),
  ('713057418676107991', 'Quick', 2011, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Lee Seung-jun, Cho Beom-gu, Kim Yeong-ho', 'Park Soo-jin', 'Lee Min-ki, Kang Ye-won, Kim In-kwon, Ko Chang-seok, Kim Byong-chul, Kim Eun-ok, Yoon Je-moon, Yoo Seung-mok', null, 'A biker is forced to deliver a ticking time bomb by a mysterious caller who has put an explosive helmet on his ex-girlfriend.', 'A biker is forced to deliver a ticking time bomb by a mysterious caller who has put an explosive helmet on his ex-girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oiYbq0y8I0y4nybzjl8WImKso7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77175'),
  ('628012801542165383', 'Quick Billy', 1971, 'Western, Documentary', 'Bruce Baillie', null, null, null, 'A psychedelic montage of home movie footage gives way to a silent western story.', 'A psychedelic montage of home movie footage gives way to a silent western story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dX6F2VDIiQY8ovjFc4cdhWyesd2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170923'),
  ('1073644032308594030', 'Quick Change', 1990, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Howard Franklin, Bill Murray, Michael Chapman', 'Howard Franklin', 'Bill Murray, Geena Davis, Randy Quaid, Jason Robards, Stanley Tucci, Phil Hartman, Kathryn Grody, Tony Shalhoub', 'R', 'With the aid of his girlfriend, Phyllis Potter, and best friend, Loomis, Grimm enters a Manhattan bank dressed as a clown, creates a hostage situation and executes a flawless robbery. The only thing left for the trio to do is make their getaway out of the city and to the airport. It sounds simple enough, but it seems that fate deserts them immediately after the bank heist. One mishap after another conspires to keep these robbers from reaching freedom.', 'With the aid of his girlfriend, Phyllis Potter, and best friend, Loomis, Grimm enters a Manhattan bank dressed as a clown, creates a hostage situation and executes a flawless robbery. The only thing left for the trio to do is make their getaway out of the city and to the airport. It sounds simple enough, but it seems that fate deserts them immediately after the bank heist. One mishap after another conspires to keep these robbers from reaching freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8q0VQYwOhhuRFMsyzdZ5JoB676g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10729'),
  ('667155469126478986', 'Quick Millions', 1931, 'Crime, Drama', 'Rowland Brown, Joseph H. August', 'Ben Hecht', 'Spencer Tracy, Marguerite Churchill, Sally Eilers, Bob Burns, John Wray, Warner Richmond, George Raft, John Swor', 'NR', 'A truck driver "too lazy to work and too nervous to steal" gets mixed up in racketeering. Naturally his underhanded business practices make him a pillar of the community.', 'A truck driver "too lazy to work and too nervous to steal" gets mixed up in racketeering. Naturally his underhanded business practices make him a pillar of the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NDXUrJzSOtn3v8rhLkTi6mXoN5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159047'),
  ('968712418865265681', 'Quick-draw Okatsu', 1969, 'Crime, Action', 'Nobuo Nakagawa, Masahiko Iimura, Atsushi Mihori', 'Kōji Takada', 'Junko Miyazono, Kenji Imai, Yuriko Mishima, Yukie Kagawa, Masaomi Kondo, Harumi Sone, Tomisaburō Wakayama, Kō Nishimura', null, 'This film focuses on Okatsu; the adopted daughter of a master swordsman. She is a master with a sword herself and her talents far overshadow that of her brother, and real child of the man who adopted her. Her brother unfortunately has a gambling habit, and it plunges the family into trouble when he loses a lot of money in a crooked dice game. After releasing he is unable to pay the debt he owes; the blame is shouldered by the father, who is killed, leading Okatsu on a path of revenge.', 'This film focuses on Okatsu; the adopted daughter of a master swordsman. She is a master with a sword herself and her talents far overshadow that of her brother, and real child of the man who adopted her. Her brother unfortunately has a gambling habit, and it plunges the family into trouble when he loses a lot of money in a crooked dice game. After releasing he is unable to pay the debt he owes; the blame is shouldered by the father, who is killed, leading Okatsu on a path of revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjxMB4hWf9qotfSn9eMkO9Qfyw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64669'),
  ('215866631974938812', 'Quicker''n a Wink', 1940, 'Documentary', 'George Sidney, Walter Lundin', 'Buddy Adler', 'Pete Smith, Harold E. Edgerton', null, 'In this Pete Smith Specialty short, Dr. Harold E. Edgerton demonstrates stroboscopic photography, which he helped develop. This process allows us to see in slow motion what happens during events that occur too fast to be seen by the naked eye. Examples shown here include a bullet in flight as it shatters a light bulb, the moment of impact when a kicker kicks a football, and the motion of a hummingbird''s wings as it hovers.', 'In this Pete Smith Specialty short, Dr. Harold E. Edgerton demonstrates stroboscopic photography, which he helped develop. This process allows us to see in slow motion what happens during events that occur too fast to be seen by the naked eye. Examples shown here include a bullet in flight as it shatters a light bulb, the moment of impact when a kicker kicks a football, and the motion of a hummingbird''s wings as it hovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cVIqlRji31SEcbmdIxOYF4fE5X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236799'),
  ('907187049249854095', 'Quicksand', 1950, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Irving Pichel, Lionel Lindon', 'Robert Smith', 'Mickey Rooney, Jeanne Cagney, Barbara Bates, Peter Lorre, Taylor Holmes, Art Smith, Wally Cassell, Richard Lane', 'NR', 'Young auto mechanic Dan Brady takes $20 from a cash register at work to go on a date with blonde femme fatale Vera Novak. Brady intends to put the money back before it is missed, but the garage''s bookkeeper shows up earlier than scheduled. As Brady scrambles to cover evidence of his petty theft, he fast finds himself drawn into an ever worsening "quicksand" of crime.', 'Young auto mechanic Dan Brady takes $20 from a cash register at work to go on a date with blonde femme fatale Vera Novak. Brady intends to put the money back before it is missed, but the garage''s bookkeeper shows up earlier than scheduled. As Brady scrambles to cover evidence of his petty theft, he fast finds himself drawn into an ever worsening "quicksand" of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTtFvxrHpLECgLE86zStkHYxTyx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23342'),
  ('18600171259150743', 'Quicksand', 2003, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Mackenzie, Walter McGill', 'Timothy Prager', 'Michael Keaton, Michael Caine, Judith Godrèche, Rade Šerbedžija, Matthew Marsh, Xander Berkeley, Kathleen Wilhoite, Rachel Ferjani', 'R', 'The workaholic head of the compliance section of a New York bank flies to Monaco to investigate unusual deposits from an offshore bank and meets a down-on-his-luck international film star who has become embroiled in criminal activities.', 'The workaholic head of the compliance section of a New York bank flies to Monaco to investigate unusual deposits from an offshore bank and meets a down-on-his-luck international film star who has become embroiled in criminal activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XYJiltOE8AYsjMq1lkcGCTqC6Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47517'),
  ('340253145781689155', 'Quicksand', 2023, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Andres Beltran', 'Matt Pitts', 'Carolina Gaitán, Allan Hawco, Sebastián Eslava, Andrés Castañeda, Allison Castrillón, Juan Manuel Combariza, Juan Camilo Pérez', null, 'A married couple on the brink of divorce becomes trapped in quicksand while hiking through a Colombian rainforest. It’s a struggle for survival as they battle the elements of the jungle and must work together in order to escape.', 'A married couple on the brink of divorce becomes trapped in quicksand while hiking through a Colombian rainforest. It’s a struggle for survival as they battle the elements of the jungle and must work together in order to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVLfO3CbVg8p5Qcaifq6AidOe2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:954388'),
  ('1047062239254729682', 'Quicksilver', 1986, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Thomas Michael Donnelly, Thomas Del Ruth, John P. Watson', 'Thomas Michael Donnelly', 'Kevin Bacon, Jami Gertz, Paul Rodríguez, Rudy Ramos, Laurence Fishburne, Louie Anderson, Gerald S. O''Loughlin, Andrew Smith', 'PG', 'Jack Casey used to be a hot-shot stock market whiz kid. After a disastrous professional decision, his life in the fast lane is over. He loses his nerve and joins a speed delivery firm which relies on bicycles to avoid traffic jams of San Francisco, is attracted to a fellow bicycler, Terri, and befriends Hector, a budding entrepreneur. Can Jack regain his nerve and his self-respect, and rebuild his life on a more sound basis?', 'Jack Casey used to be a hot-shot stock market whiz kid. After a disastrous professional decision, his life in the fast lane is over. He loses his nerve and joins a speed delivery firm which relies on bicycles to avoid traffic jams of San Francisco, is attracted to a fellow bicycler, Terri, and befriends Hector, a budding entrepreneur. Can Jack regain his nerve and his self-respect, and rebuild his life on a more sound basis?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9E5eUvyIJoygfmKX36EmoRvOMGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21332'),
  ('187579705237002063', 'Quicksilver Highway', 1997, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Mick Garris, Venita Ozols-Graham, Dirk Craft', 'Mick Garris', 'Christopher Lloyd, Matt Frewer, Raphael Sbarge, Missy Crider, Silas Weir Mitchell, Bill Nunn, Veronica Cartwright, Bill Bolender', 'PG-13', 'Aaron Quicksilver is a mysterious storyteller whose listeners invariably end up as the subjects of his gruesome, grisly tales. He tells a new bride stranded on a desert highway a horrifying account of a set of carnivorous toy teeth, then entrains a pickpocket with the spine chilling story of an army of murderous, disembodied hands.', 'Aaron Quicksilver is a mysterious storyteller whose listeners invariably end up as the subjects of his gruesome, grisly tales. He tells a new bride stranded on a desert highway a horrifying account of a set of carnivorous toy teeth, then entrains a pickpocket with the spine chilling story of an army of murderous, disembodied hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktKeyB6yNo81wD60NxZvb7f1nZz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26215'),
  ('173258078431567959', 'Quid Pro Quo', 2008, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Carlos Brooks, Michael McDonough', 'Carlos Brooks', 'Nick Stahl, Vera Farmiga, Jacob Pitts, Aimee Mullins, James Frain, Kate Burton, Jessica Hecht, Dylan Bruno', null, 'A semi-paralyzed radio reporter is sent out to investigate a story that leads him into an odd subculture and on a journey of disturbing self-realization.', 'A semi-paralyzed radio reporter is sent out to investigate a story that leads him into an odd subculture and on a journey of disturbing self-realization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHVnQhe46JfQE5Kh3psDaYP7Rj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15662'),
  ('386322046924784670', 'Quién te cantará', 2018, 'Music, Drama, Mystery', 'Eduard Grau, Carlos Vermut', 'Carlos Vermut', 'Najwa Nimri, Eva Llorach, Carme Elias, Natalia de Molina, Julián Villagrán, Ignacio Mateos, Catalina Sopelana, Carolina Yuste', null, 'Lila, a famous retired singer, loses her memory after suffering an accident, just as she planned her return to the stage.', 'Lila, a famous retired singer, loses her memory after suffering an accident, just as she planned her return to the stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHiwX3sXVFoM5Hj8yfkysmMGs9p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438373'),
  ('824058739372221829', 'Quiero tu vida', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Beto Casillas, Jorge Colón', 'Jorge Colón, José Tamez', 'Erick Elías, Zuria Vega, Jesús Zavala, Bárbara de Regil, Natalia Téllez, Jesús Ochoa, Moisés Arizmendi, Itza Sodi', 'PG-13', 'A former pro football player must retire after a life-altering injury, and as the years passes he wishes to know how his life would''ve turned out had he remained a star.', 'A former pro football player must retire after a life-altering injury, and as the years passes he wishes to know how his life would''ve turned out had he remained a star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hk2kW6uwTEa8cxDeF1UPfIpEYkF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118721'),
  ('811803306167427155', 'Quiet', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sylvana Squicciarini, Marianne Lukacs, Luis Alejandro Pérez', 'Luis Alejandro Pérez', 'Max Salgado, René Miranda, Ignacia Uribe, Javier Castillo, Steevens Benjamin, Andrés Rebolledo, Alejandro Trejo, Paula Zúñiga', null, 'Martin and Charly spend their time making rap music. One night they find a loaded gun on a hill, while Sol searches for her lost dog. Although apparently unrelated, these stories are intimately linked, forming a portrait of teenagers in their difficult passage to adulthood.', 'Martin and Charly spend their time making rap music. One night they find a loaded gun on a hill, while Sol searches for her lost dog. Although apparently unrelated, these stories are intimately linked, forming a portrait of teenagers in their difficult passage to adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOKbJBvXovM3kdh0KasyTbi2gTB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679890'),
  ('1082247366122798612', 'Quiet as a Mouse', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Hofmann, Marcus Mittermeier', 'Jan Henrik Stahlberg', 'Jan Henrik Stahlberg, Fritz Roth, Wanda Perdelwitz, Joachim Kretzer, Dieter Dost, Wolfgang Grindemann, Markus von Lingen, Oliver Urbanski', null, 'A pseudo documentary study of an archetypal German who tries to model his world according to his ideas of law and (sexual) order.', 'A pseudo documentary study of an archetypal German who tries to model his world according to his ideas of law and (sexual) order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRssTl8YW09r889GFMG24eipgNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4896'),
  ('991632382011877657', 'Quiet Bliss', 2014, 'Drama', 'Michele D''Attanasio, Edoardo Winspeare, Dario di Viesto', 'Alessandro Valenti, Edoardo Winspeare, Anna Boccadamo', 'Celeste Casciaro, Laura Licchetta, Anna Boccadamo, Barbara De Matteis, Gustavo Caputo, Angelico Ferrarese, Amerigo Russo, Antonio Carluccio', null, 'Salento in southern Italy. A small family-run textile factory is forced to close and three generations of women must now struggle to keep the wolf from the door. In order to settle their debts their home is sold. Now that her brother has emigrated, it falls to energetic Adele to find a way out of their crisis.', 'Salento in southern Italy. A small family-run textile factory is forced to close and three generations of women must now struggle to keep the wolf from the door. In order to settle their debts their home is sold. Now that her brother has emigrated, it falls to energetic Adele to find a way out of their crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ExasCFOvwRGeNxJaz5cFIoiLM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255549'),
  ('807745436954846442', 'Quiet Chaos', 2008, 'Romance, Drama', 'Antonello Grimaldi, Ciro Scognamiglio, Loredana Conte', 'Laura Paolucci, Francesco Piccolo, Nanni Moretti', 'Nanni Moretti, Alessandro Gassmann, Valeria Golino, Isabella Ferrari, Blu Yoshimi, Hippolyte Girardot, Kasia Smutniak, Denis Podalydès', null, 'Pietro is a successful businessman with a wife and a daughter. One day he helps his brother save two women from drowning at the beach. When he returns home he finds that his wife has died. Now Pietro has to take care of his daughter, Claudia. When he drives her to school soon after, he decides to wait for her all day in front of the school, and soon that''s what he does every day.', 'Pietro is a successful businessman with a wife and a daughter. One day he helps his brother save two women from drowning at the beach. When he returns home he finds that his wife has died. Now Pietro has to take care of his daughter, Claudia. When he drives her to school soon after, he decides to wait for her all day in front of the school, and soon that''s what he does every day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wx2fd6UnFBQRKV6dTBKhRze4ep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22274'),
  ('762047711870978764', 'Quiet City', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aaron Katz, Andrew Reed', 'Aaron Katz, Erin Fisher, Cris Lankenau', 'Erin Fisher, Cris Lankenau, Sarah Hellman, Joe Swanberg, Tucker Stone, Keegan DeWitt, Karrie Crouse, Liz Bender', null, 'Jamie is 21. She''s from Atlanta. She''s come to Brooklyn to visit her friend Samantha, but she can''t find her. Jamie meets a stranger named Charlie on the subway and spends 24 hours hanging out with him.', 'Jamie is 21. She''s from Atlanta. She''s come to Brooklyn to visit her friend Samantha, but she can''t find her. Jamie meets a stranger named Charlie on the subway and spends 24 hours hanging out with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWeR5wKhyyyPL5rUPazzsjhZVgY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46883'),
  ('21196860000524516', 'Quiet Comes the Dawn', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Pavel Sidorov, Ivan Burlakov', 'Evgeniy Kolyadintsev', 'Aleksandra Drozdova, Anastasia Kuimova, Oksana Akinshina, Anna Slyu, Alexander Molochnikov, Oleg Vasilkov, Kuzma Kotrelev, Valeriy Kukhareshin', null, 'Female protagonist’s brother dies under mysterious circumstances. Extremely vivid nightmares begin to haunt her and she decides to turn to the Institute of somnology for help. Along with other patients, they are induced into a «collective lucid dream». But at the dawn, they will awake to a completely different reality that is more horrifying than any nightmare.', 'Female protagonist’s brother dies under mysterious circumstances. Extremely vivid nightmares begin to haunt her and she decides to turn to the Institute of somnology for help. Along with other patients, they are induced into a «collective lucid dream». But at the dawn, they will awake to a completely different reality that is more horrifying than any nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpfPbQj0mt0Xgh6YnhhOZD97qXf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571430'),
  ('835938484528995846', 'Quiet Cool', 1986, 'Crime, Action', 'Clay Borris, Jacques Haitkin', 'Susan Canova Vercellino, Clay Borris', 'James Remar, Adam Coleman Howard, Daphne Ashbrook, Jared Martin, Nick Cassavetes, Joey Sagal, Chris Mulkey, Clayton Landey', 'R', 'Joe Dylanne, a tough New York City police officer, is summoned to Northern California at the behest of Katy Greer, an old flame. Katy desperately needs Joe''s help after the brutal killings of much of her family at the hands of rural marijuana dealers. Upon arriving in the area, Joe discovers that local law enforcement isn''t helpful, and he must team up with Katy''s survivalist nephew, to take down the murderous criminals.', 'Joe Dylanne, a tough New York City police officer, is summoned to Northern California at the behest of Katy Greer, an old flame. Katy desperately needs Joe''s help after the brutal killings of much of her family at the hands of rural marijuana dealers. Upon arriving in the area, Joe discovers that local law enforcement isn''t helpful, and he must team up with Katy''s survivalist nephew, to take down the murderous criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvFo8mlGDfAEeG3Z2G9F1bzgjsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80611'),
  ('397819566195382159', 'Quiet Days in Clichy', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jens Jørgen Thorsen', 'Jens Jørgen Thorsen', 'Paul Valjean, Wayne Rodda, Ulla Koppel, Avi Sagild, Susanne Krage, Lisbet Lundquist, Olaf Ussing, Klaus Pagh', null, 'Joey is a struggling writer with no money. His roommate Carl is a charming stud with a taste for young girls. Together, these two insatiable dreamers will laugh, love and screw their way through a decadent Paris paved with wanton women, wild orgies and outrageous erotic adventures.', 'Joey is a struggling writer with no money. His roommate Carl is a charming stud with a taste for young girls. Together, these two insatiable dreamers will laugh, love and screw their way through a decadent Paris paved with wanton women, wild orgies and outrageous erotic adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liVNctVdb6j6xdY6MwxcIvnxQGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62759'),
  ('591180763908987997', 'Quiet Days in Clichy', 1990, 'Drama', 'Jean Rabier, Claude Chabrol', 'Claude Chabrol, Ugo Leonzio', 'Andrew McCarthy, Nigel Havers, Barbara De Rossi, Stéphanie Tchou-Cotta, Mario Adorf, Stéphane Audran, Eva Grimaldi, Anna Galiena', null, 'Expatriate Henry Miller indulges in a variety of sexual escapades while struggling to establish himself as a serious writer in Paris.', 'Expatriate Henry Miller indulges in a variety of sexual escapades while struggling to establish himself as a serious writer in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5l7TeAv21BCQNZr5FqVGiuyGagh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76205'),
  ('216697742980002820', 'Quiet Flows the Don', 1957, 'Drama, History', 'Sergei Gerasimov, Vladimir Rapoport', 'Sergei Gerasimov', 'Danylo Ilchenko, Anastasiya Filippova, Pyotr Glebov, Nikolai Smirnov, Lyudmila Khityaeva, Natalya Arkhangelskaya, Aleksei Blagovestov, Elina Bystritskaya', null, 'Based on the novel of the same name by Mikhail Sholokhov, about the fate of people broken by the First World War, the October Revolution of 1917 and the Civil War in Russia (1917-1922), about the collapse of the foundations and ideals of the Don Cossacks of Russia at the beginning of the XX century, about the personal tragedy of the protagonist — Grigoriy Melekhov.', 'Based on the novel of the same name by Mikhail Sholokhov, about the fate of people broken by the First World War, the October Revolution of 1917 and the Civil War in Russia (1917-1922), about the collapse of the foundations and ideals of the Don Cossacks of Russia at the beginning of the XX century, about the personal tragedy of the protagonist — Grigoriy Melekhov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psWmDwVk13qMqEUXKECKip22mar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109991'),
  ('84477973440679692', 'Quiet Is the Night', 1978, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jerzy Stawicki, Tadeusz Chmielewski, Halina Chmielewska', 'Tadeusz Chmielewski', 'Tomasz Zaliwski, Piotr Łysak, Henryk Bista, Mirosław Konarowski, Jerzy Bończak, Bolesław Smela, Antonina Barczewska, Halina Kowalska', null, 'In 1920s Poland, a police commissioner leads the investigation into a series of brutal murders of young boys as the case grows increasingly unsettling and personal.', 'In 1920s Poland, a police commissioner leads the investigation into a series of brutal murders of young boys as the case grows increasingly unsettling and personal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXXzXvaHkLDWNJ7pVI1YJapJNtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103398'),
  ('943156770572009829', 'Quiet Please, Murder', 1943, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Joseph MacDonald, Emil Newman, John Francis Larkin', 'John Francis Larkin', 'George Sanders, Gail Patrick, Richard Denning, Lynne Roberts, Sidney Blackmer, Kurt Katch, Margaret Brayton, Charles Tannen', 'NR', 'A forger steals and kills for a rare book from a library in order to make forgeries to sell to rich suckers.', 'A forger steals and kills for a rare book from a library in order to make forgeries to sell to rich suckers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lgyZPoppBe5L15YKOI2MFLUes3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36611'),
  ('256210865970219606', 'Quiet Please!', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Billy Bletcher, William Hanna', 'NR', 'The family dog warns Tom not to make any noise so he can take a nap. Jerry hears this and immediately devises plans to ensure that the dog''s nap will be interrupted.', 'The family dog warns Tom not to make any noise so he can take a nap. Jerry hears this and immediately devises plans to ensure that the dog''s nap will be interrupted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bjQZvLNJ5ZpV9UkW9dkwOtRZWv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40164'),
  ('511714136050152280', 'Quigley Down Under', 1990, 'Western', 'Simon Wincer, David Eggby, Ross Berryman', 'John Hill', 'Tom Selleck, Laura San Giacomo, Alan Rickman, Chris Haywood, Ron Haddrick, Tony Bonner, Jerome Ehlers, Conor McDermottroe', 'PG-13', 'American Matt Quigley answers Australian land baron Elliott Marston''s ad for a sharpshooter to kill the dingoes on his property. But when Quigley finds out that Marston''s real target is the aborigines, Quigley hits the road. Now, even American expatriate Crazy Cora can''t keep Quigley safe in his cat-and-mouse game with the homicidal Marston.', 'American Matt Quigley answers Australian land baron Elliott Marston''s ad for a sharpshooter to kill the dingoes on his property. But when Quigley finds out that Marston''s real target is the aborigines, Quigley hits the road. Now, even American expatriate Crazy Cora can''t keep Quigley safe in his cat-and-mouse game with the homicidal Marston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRgeovNyj1pARroKclXzJhOwPbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9588'),
  ('488456022171847291', 'Quill: The Life of a Guide Dog', 2004, 'Drama', 'Yōichi Sai, Junichi Fujisawa', 'Shōichi Maruyama, Yoshihiro Nakamura', 'Kaoru Kobayashi, Kippei Shiina, Teruyuki Kagawa, Keiko Toda, Tomoka Kurotani, Kozo Sato, Taro Ishida, Yukika Sakuratani', null, 'A Labrador retriever named Quill begins specialized training as a guide dog from an early age, then the canine is paired with a blind man who is initially reluctant to rely on his new partner.', 'A Labrador retriever named Quill begins specialized training as a guide dog from an early age, then the canine is paired with a blind man who is initially reluctant to rely on his new partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97KHrHEnvVFGrhC5kupwqwcIHjv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49258'),
  ('342605180354214169', 'Quills', 2000, 'Drama', 'Philip Kaufman, Rogier Stoffers, Mark Raggett', 'Doug Wright', 'Geoffrey Rush, Kate Winslet, Joaquin Phoenix, Michael Caine, Billie Whitelaw, Patrick Malahide, Amelia Warner, Jane Menelaus', 'R', 'In early 19th-century France, the Marquis de Sade is confined to an asylum where his forbidden writings continue to circulate beyond its walls. As the authorities tighten control, a clash unfolds between the Marquis’ unyielding imagination, the reformist ideals of the Abbé in charge, and the repressive measures of a doctor sent to silence him. Desire, power, and censorship collide in a battle over freedom of expression.', 'In early 19th-century France, the Marquis de Sade is confined to an asylum where his forbidden writings continue to circulate beyond its walls. As the authorities tighten control, a clash unfolds between the Marquis’ unyielding imagination, the reformist ideals of the Abbé in charge, and the repressive measures of a doctor sent to silence him. Desire, power, and censorship collide in a battle over freedom of expression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvGdw3BpvJV2wHmK2qY0N7XHqET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10876'),
  ('926143299500310108', 'Quilombo', 1984, 'History, Drama', 'Carlos Diegues, Nelson Nadotti, Antônio Pitanga', 'Carlos Diegues', 'Tony Tornado, Antônio Pompêo, Zezé Motta, Maurício do Valle, Grande Otelo, Zózimo Bulbul, Milton Gonçalves, Daniel Filho', null, 'Quilombo dos Palmares was a real-life democratic society, created in Brazil in the 17th century. This incredibly elaborate (and surprisingly little-known) film traces the origins of Quilombo, which began as a community of freed slaves. The colony becomes a safe harbor for other outcasts of the world, including Indians and Jews. Ganga Zumba (Toni Tornado) becomes president of Quilombo, the first freely elected leader in the Western Hemisphere. Naturally, the ruling Portuguese want to subjugate Zumba and his followers, but the Quilombians are ready for their would-be oppressors. The end of this Brave New World is not pleasant, but the followers of Zumba and his ideals take to the hills, where they honor his memory to this day. Writer/director Carlos Diegues takes every available opportunity to compare the rise and fall of Quilombo with the state of affairs in modern-day Brazil.', 'Quilombo dos Palmares was a real-life democratic society, created in Brazil in the 17th century. This incredibly elaborate (and surprisingly little-known) film traces the origins of Quilombo, which began as a community of freed slaves. The colony becomes a safe harbor for other outcasts of the world, including Indians and Jews. Ganga Zumba (Toni Tornado) becomes president of Quilombo, the first freely elected leader in the Western Hemisphere. Naturally, the ruling Portuguese want to subjugate Zumba and his followers, but the Quilombians are ready for their would-be oppressors. The end of this Brave New World is not pleasant, but the followers of Zumba and his ideals take to the hills, where they honor his memory to this day. Writer/director Carlos Diegues takes every available opportunity to compare the rise and fall of Quilombo with the state of affairs in modern-day Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hOSb7Hw1kNYNMa9XbTvEUtdXo9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198480'),
  ('1069719033449804658', 'Quinceañera', 2006, 'Drama', 'Richard Glatzer, Wash Westmoreland, Eric Steelberg', 'Wash Westmoreland, Richard Glatzer', 'Emily Rios, Jesse García, Chalo González, David W. Ross, Jason L. Wood, Ramiro Iniguez, Araceli Guzman-Rico, Jesus Castanos', null, 'As Magdalena''s 15th birthday approaches, her simple, blissful life is complicated by the discovery that she''s pregnant. Kicked out of her house, she finds a new family with her great-granduncle and gay cousin.', 'As Magdalena''s 15th birthday approaches, her simple, blissful life is complicated by the discovery that she''s pregnant. Kicked out of her house, she finds a new family with her great-granduncle and gay cousin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJv276uU9K0Z9MRhz6F3BEEetEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64499'),
  ('298417275003498299', 'Quincy', 2018, 'Documentary, Music', 'Rashida Jones, Alan Hicks', 'Rashida Jones, Alan Hicks', 'Quincy Jones, Rashida Jones, Tom Hanks, Oprah Winfrey, John Legend, Will Smith, Peggy Lipton, Mary J. Blige', null, 'An intimate look into the life of icon Quincy Jones. A unique force in music and popular culture for 70 years, Jones has transcended racial and cultural boundaries; his story is inextricably woven into the fabric of America. Jones came to prominence in the 1950s as a jazz arranger and conductor before working on pop music and film scores. He moved easily between musical genres, producing major pop hits of the early 1960s and serving as an arranger and conductor for several collaborations in the same time period.', 'An intimate look into the life of icon Quincy Jones. A unique force in music and popular culture for 70 years, Jones has transcended racial and cultural boundaries; his story is inextricably woven into the fabric of America. Jones came to prominence in the 1950s as a jazz arranger and conductor before working on pop music and film scores. He moved easily between musical genres, producing major pop hits of the early 1960s and serving as an arranger and conductor for several collaborations in the same time period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYtY9CRLyz4dXqTOiimdMF7Nt4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504561'),
  ('231014554525922480', 'Quintet', 1979, 'Science Fiction', 'Robert Altman, Jean Boffety', 'Patricia Resnick, Frank Barhydt, Robert Altman', 'Paul Newman, Vittorio Gassman, Fernando Rey, Bibi Andersson, Brigitte Fossey, Nina van Pallandt, Craig Richard Nelson, David Langton', 'R', 'During a future ice age, dying humanity occupies its remaining time by playing a board game called Quintet. For one small group, this obsession is not enough. They play the game with living pieces, and only the winner survives.', 'During a future ice age, dying humanity occupies its remaining time by playing a board game called Quintet. For one small group, this obsession is not enough. They play the game with living pieces, and only the winner survives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhsKLo7VNd1ENBODVZYtS1m3X7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45169'),
  ('290430644821729459', 'Quints', 2000, 'Drama, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bill Corcoran, Michael Storey', 'Matthew Weisman', 'Kimberly J. Brown, Daniel Roebuck, Elizabeth Morehead, Shadia Simmons, Jake Epstein, Robin Duke, Vince Corazza, Don Knotts', 'G', 'A teenager goes to desperate lengths to get attention when her mother gives birth to quints.', 'A teenager goes to desperate lengths to get attention when her mother gives birth to quints.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2DoMJ4Ecz7s3gOXa67cTHd5Cw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101514'),
  ('334798622132943077', 'Quite Like Paradise', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Edgar San Juan', 'Hipatia Argüero, Edgar San Juan, Luis Spota', 'Andrea Arcangeli, Esmeralda Pimentel, Karol Sevilla, Miguel Rodarte, Maurizio Lombardi, Enrique Arreola, Gerardo Taracena, Alberto Estrella', null, 'Ugo Conti, charismatic Italian aristocrat and influencer, arrives in Mexico where he seduces the Mexican high society. When he meets Frida Becker again, the love of his past, he will end up in the center of a struggle for political power.', 'Ugo Conti, charismatic Italian aristocrat and influencer, arrives in Mexico where he seduces the Mexican high society. When he meets Frida Becker again, the love of his past, he will end up in the center of a struggle for political power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8VZVAMGPKl4Tm4XHAvrtAb5pKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232732'),
  ('39124703187415640', 'Quitting', 2001, 'Drama', 'Zhang Yang, Wang Yu', 'Xin Huo, Zhang Yang', 'Jia Hongsheng, Jia Fengsen, Tong Wang, Zhu Hongmao', null, 'An actor becomes increasingly introverted and psychotic and his entire family attempts to intervene.', 'An actor becomes increasingly introverted and psychotic and his entire family attempts to intervene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKI7U9liteQkeGVDSQE0MoVYi8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87481'),
  ('1054343195290970077', 'Quixote', 1965, 'Drama', 'Bruce Baillie', null, null, null, 'Co-founder of Canyon Cinema and the San Francisco Cinematheque and one of the godparents of experimental film, Bruce Baillie (1931-2020) has forged a singular path in his visionary explorations of the world, his exquisite treatment of light and fragmented storytelling influencing successive generations of like-minded filmmakers. Shot on a cross-country journey during 1964 and 1965, is the Baillie film most in need of rediscovery. Joining the ranks of Bob Dylan, Robert Frank and Jack Kerouac in chronicling a tumultuous period in American history from the road, Baillie sets out "to show how in the conquest of our environment in the New World, Americans have isolated themselves from nature and from one another."', 'Co-founder of Canyon Cinema and the San Francisco Cinematheque and one of the godparents of experimental film, Bruce Baillie (1931-2020) has forged a singular path in his visionary explorations of the world, his exquisite treatment of light and fragmented storytelling influencing successive generations of like-minded filmmakers. Shot on a cross-country journey during 1964 and 1965, is the Baillie film most in need of rediscovery. Joining the ranks of Bob Dylan, Robert Frank and Jack Kerouac in chronicling a tumultuous period in American history from the road, Baillie sets out "to show how in the conquest of our environment in the New World, Americans have isolated themselves from nature and from one another."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5AarFzQo74z1bZnnsFRxbn5dxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126313'),
  ('852395497504453602', 'Quiz Lady', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Jessica Yu, Kayse Goodell, Adrian Peng Correia', 'Jen D''Angelo', 'Awkwafina, Sandra Oh, Will Ferrell, Jason Schwartzman, Holland Taylor, Angela Trimbur, Tawny Newsome, Tony Hale', 'R', 'A brilliant but tightly wound, gameshow-obsessed young woman, Anne, and her estranged, train-wreck of a sister, Jenny, must work together to help cover their mother''s gambling debts. When Anne''s beloved dog is kidnapped, they set out on a wild, cross-country trek to get the cash the only way they know how: by turning Anne into a bona-fide gameshow champion.', 'A brilliant but tightly wound, gameshow-obsessed young woman, Anne, and her estranged, train-wreck of a sister, Jenny, must work together to help cover their mother''s gambling debts. When Anne''s beloved dog is kidnapped, they set out on a wild, cross-country trek to get the cash the only way they know how: by turning Anne into a bona-fide gameshow champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqKiprkTUfXWi8bOjCl0lHtCwod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787781'),
  ('479244170761247859', 'Quiz Show', 1994, 'History, Drama', 'Michael Ballhaus, Robert Redford, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Paul Attanasio', 'John Turturro, Rob Morrow, Ralph Fiennes, Paul Scofield, David Paymer, Hank Azaria, Christopher McDonald, Johann Carlo', 'PG-13', 'Herbert Stempel''s transformation into an unexpected television personality unfolds as he secures victory on the cherished American game show, ''Twenty-One.'' However, when the show introduces the highly skilled contestant Charles Van Doren to replace Stempel, it compels Stempel to let out his frustrations and call out the show as rigged. Lawyer Richard Goodwin steps in and attempts to uncover the orchestrated deception behind the scenes.', 'Herbert Stempel''s transformation into an unexpected television personality unfolds as he secures victory on the cherished American game show, ''Twenty-One.'' However, when the show introduces the highly skilled contestant Charles Van Doren to replace Stempel, it compels Stempel to let out his frustrations and call out the show as rigged. Lawyer Richard Goodwin steps in and attempts to uncover the orchestrated deception behind the scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoGJo1h3Hl2exXPVcG9UXWDENtX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11450'),
  ('164625142948597661', 'Quo Vadis', 1951, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Robert Surtees, Mervyn LeRoy, William V. Skall', 'John Lee Mahin, Sonya Levien, S. N. Behrman', 'Robert Taylor, Deborah Kerr, Leo Genn, Peter Ustinov, Patricia Laffan, Finlay Currie, Abraham Sofaer, Marina Berti', 'NR', 'After fierce Roman commander Marcus Vinicius becomes infatuated with beautiful Christian hostage Lygia, he begins to question the tyrannical leadership of the despotic emperor Nero.', 'After fierce Roman commander Marcus Vinicius becomes infatuated with beautiful Christian hostage Lygia, he begins to question the tyrannical leadership of the despotic emperor Nero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqF1dattMNiwGjPSphu2VSi558Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11620'),
  ('661408927658474947', 'Quo Vadis', 2001, 'Drama, History', 'Jerzy Kawalerowicz', 'Jerzy Kawalerowicz', 'Paweł Deląg, Magdalena Mielcarz, Bogusław Linda, Michał Bajor, Jerzy Trela, Franciszek Pieczka, Krzysztof Majchrzak, Rafał Kubacki', null, 'Ancient Rome, during the time of Emperor Nero. Vinicius, a young patrician, falls in love with the beautiful Lygia, the daughter of a Barbarian commander who was killed in battle, and wants her for his concubine. For Lygia, a Christian, being a pagan''s concubine is a severe sin and disgrace. However, when Vinicius is wounded, Lygia cares for him, and starts to reciprocate his feelings. Vinicius, in return, becomes interested in Christian learning and asks Apostle Peter to teach him. In the meantime, Emperor Nero accuses Christians of having started a great fire in Rome. He encourages the imprisonment, torture and murder of his Christian subjects.', 'Ancient Rome, during the time of Emperor Nero. Vinicius, a young patrician, falls in love with the beautiful Lygia, the daughter of a Barbarian commander who was killed in battle, and wants her for his concubine. For Lygia, a Christian, being a pagan''s concubine is a severe sin and disgrace. However, when Vinicius is wounded, Lygia cares for him, and starts to reciprocate his feelings. Vinicius, in return, becomes interested in Christian learning and asks Apostle Peter to teach him. In the meantime, Emperor Nero accuses Christians of having started a great fire in Rome. He encourages the imprisonment, torture and murder of his Christian subjects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzePNmvU9Kczxu60TUoyzVED5xy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59219'),
  ('340834398754783273', 'Quo Vadis, Baby?', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gabriele Salvatores', 'Grazia Verasani', 'Angela Baraldi, Gigio Alberti, Claudia Zanella, Elio Germano, Andrea Renzi, Luigi Maria Burruano, Gennaro Diana, Bebo Storti', null, 'A private detective investigates her sister''s suicide 16 years earlier.', 'A private detective investigates her sister''s suicide 16 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCOTD5YY7eIFokOCinIByjM8Iwi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41593'),
  ('50112319388484840', 'Quotation Gang Part 1', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery, Action, Thriller', 'Vivek Kumar Kannan, Arun Bathmanaban', 'Vivek Kumar Kannan', 'Jackie Shroff, Priyamani, Sunny Leone, Sara Arjun, Ashraf Mallisery, Pradeep Kumar Subramaniyan, Jayaprakash, Akshaya', null, 'In the forests of Mumbai, Mustafa leads a ruthless contract killing gang with strict principles. His wife Padma is calm and silent, while Shakunthala, a brave gang member, saves a teenager named Iraa from drug peddlers. Shakunthala’s adopted sister Seerat returns from Kashmir with her lover Rubina after avenging a molestation. As Mustafa’s gang members are mysteriously killed, he invites all contract killers for a feast, leading to a bloody attack. The story unfolds with a shocking twist revealing the mastermind behind the gang attack, inspired by true events.', 'In the forests of Mumbai, Mustafa leads a ruthless contract killing gang with strict principles. His wife Padma is calm and silent, while Shakunthala, a brave gang member, saves a teenager named Iraa from drug peddlers. Shakunthala’s adopted sister Seerat returns from Kashmir with her lover Rubina after avenging a molestation. As Mustafa’s gang members are mysteriously killed, he invites all contract killers for a feast, leading to a bloody attack. The story unfolds with a shocking twist revealing the mastermind behind the gang attack, inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPKCt1gX8Yk33AuD9d95pmgbjvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1202268'),
  ('573623345717117010', 'Qurbani', 1980, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Feroz Khan, Kamal Bose', null, 'Feroz Khan, Vinod Khanna, Zeenat Aman, Amjad Khan, Shakti Kapoor, Amrish Puri, Kader Khan, Aruna Irani', null, 'Cabaret dancer and singer, Sheela has two admirers: small-time thief Rajesh and eligible young widower Amar. They are best friends and don''t realize that they love the same woman. An enemy in the guise of Vikram Singh makes both men''s lives miserable by exposing their realities to each other, turning their friendship upside-down.', 'Cabaret dancer and singer, Sheela has two admirers: small-time thief Rajesh and eligible young widower Amar. They are best friends and don''t realize that they love the same woman. An enemy in the guise of Vikram Singh makes both men''s lives miserable by exposing their realities to each other, turning their friendship upside-down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jkQAxALX0Th0HQCRWiuETRedNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183659'),
  ('210172898276608100', 'Qwerty', 2007, 'Thriller', 'Paolo Dy', 'Paolo Dy', 'Michael W. Williams, Cathy Azanza, Miguel Faustmann, Arvin Trinidad, Altair Alonso, Niccolo Manahan, Boyd Tinio, Irra Cenina', null, 'A mentally-afflicted young man is accused of murdering his longtime benefactor. The real truth of what happened lies in his mad obsession with his supposed victim''s old typewriter, on which he types relentlessly, day and night.', 'A mentally-afflicted young man is accused of murdering his longtime benefactor. The real truth of what happened lies in his mad obsession with his supposed victim''s old typewriter, on which he types relentlessly, day and night.', null, 'tmdb:movie:212056'),
  ('373249019610216825', 'Qwerty', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Chil Kong', 'Erin Quill', 'Olivia Oguma, Robert Sudduth, Beverly Leech, Angela Arimento, Chairman Barnes, Peggy Lu, Willam Belli, Sara Maraffino', null, 'Conglomerated Assets, a brokerage firm is sinking fast as its CEO checks out and leaves the company to his inept film school drop out son. Enter Quincy, Waverly, Erica, Rudy, Tina and Yasmine. Team QWERTY--six sexy secretaries that must save the day.', 'Conglomerated Assets, a brokerage firm is sinking fast as its CEO checks out and leaves the company to his inept film school drop out son. Enter Quincy, Waverly, Erica, Rudy, Tina and Yasmine. Team QWERTY--six sexy secretaries that must save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9JNlLGc9qaISY3KDru3XXiFnoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750145'),
  ('163550962153940444', 'Qwerty', 2012, 'Comedy', 'David Wagenaar, Bill Sebastian', 'Juliet McDaniel', 'Dana Pupkin, Eric Hailey, Bill Redding, Joel Wiersema, Mike McNamara, Claire Tuft, Katherine Banks, Eliza Toser', null, 'Before introverted word-nerd Zoe gains the courage to enter the National Scrabble Championship, she meets her emotional match in Marty, an irascible recluse. She finds him equally pitted against the opposing forces in her life - other people - including family, co-workers and a couple of particularly irksome adversaries standing in the way of her dream to become the world''s second female National Scrabble Champion.', 'Before introverted word-nerd Zoe gains the courage to enter the National Scrabble Championship, she meets her emotional match in Marty, an irascible recluse. She finds him equally pitted against the opposing forces in her life - other people - including family, co-workers and a couple of particularly irksome adversaries standing in the way of her dream to become the world''s second female National Scrabble Champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqDoM8XXURgMUsjg4PtO9umzR2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123587'),
  ('986842981347927722', 'Qwerty', 2017, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'John McAmis', 'John McAmis', null, null, 'A grieving young inventor finds solace in repairing an antique typewriter.', 'A grieving young inventor finds solace in repairing an antique typewriter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOz6h7rkDIjuIiTOYiNsQdwjfq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457157'),
  ('18617846219279154', 'R', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tobias Lindholm, Michael Noer, Magnus Nordenhof Jønck', 'Michael Noer, Tobias Lindholm', 'Pilou Asbæk, Dulfi Al-Jabouri, Roland Møller, Jacob Gredsted, Omar Shargawi, Kim Winther, Jorg Beutnagel, Sune Nørgaard', null, 'The R of the title stands for the young protagonist, Rune, fearlessly played by Pilou Asbæk. Imprisoned for violent assault, he''s a cocky, good-looking young man placed in the hardcore ward, where his survival depends on quickly learning the prison''s parallel world of rules, honor, and obligations. R also stands for Rachid, a young Muslim prisoner who becomes Rune''s friend and accomplice, defying the rigid racial stratifications among the inmates.', 'The R of the title stands for the young protagonist, Rune, fearlessly played by Pilou Asbæk. Imprisoned for violent assault, he''s a cocky, good-looking young man placed in the hardcore ward, where his survival depends on quickly learning the prison''s parallel world of rules, honor, and obligations. R also stands for Rachid, a young Muslim prisoner who becomes Rune''s friend and accomplice, defying the rigid racial stratifications among the inmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxMgFBcEkBPhoikocUBqXS3i6TP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49207'),
  ('610999717852211803', 'R U Invited?', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Robert L. Camina, Israel Luna', 'Israel Luna', 'Oscar Contreras, John de los Santos, Christopher Jones, David Matherly, Gabriel Praddo, Phil Harrington, Brandon Dixon, Israel Luna', null, 'Five friends receive invitations to an underground sex party. However, to qualify for attendance each invitee must submit revealing photos as a "screening" process." As the party draws near, issues of monogamy, weight &amp; appearance, discrimination, drug use, and promiscuity arise. Friendships are tested and pushed to their boundaries, personalities collide, sexual histories are revealed, and relationship survival is in question.', 'Five friends receive invitations to an underground sex party. However, to qualify for attendance each invitee must submit revealing photos as a "screening" process." As the party draws near, issues of monogamy, weight &amp; appearance, discrimination, drug use, and promiscuity arise. Friendships are tested and pushed to their boundaries, personalities collide, sexual histories are revealed, and relationship survival is in question.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpElbbZ6lcyc0qZp2IpDBC0AtLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84958'),
  ('404487187481141609', 'R-Point', 2004, 'Action, History, Horror', 'Kong Su-chang, Han Jong-hun, Hyeong-jing Seok', null, 'Kam Woo-sung, Son Byung-ho, Park Won-sang, Oh Tae-kyung, Lee Sun-kyun, Son Jin-ho, Moon Young-dong, Jung Kyung-ho', null, 'On 07 January 1972, the South Korean base in Nha-Trang, Vietnam, receives a radio transmission from a missing platoon presumed dead.', 'On 07 January 1972, the South Korean base in Nha-Trang, Vietnam, receives a radio transmission from a missing platoon presumed dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93Zn3ews5S0KiChq9mW5TkrhWi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16138'),
  ('142584549496954924', 'R-Rated Idol Seung-ha''s Fancy Walk', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choi Jin-chul', null, 'Seung Ha, Seo Bo-ra, Si Hoo, Gil Dong', null, 'Seo-yeon is being tutored by Woo-hyeon who is younger than her. She grew interested in her tutor, Woo-hyun, the first time she met him, and he is also fond of Seo-yeon. Seo-yeon succeeded in seducing Woo-hyeon with the help of her friend Min-joo. Even if Min-joo is aware of what Seo-yeon feels, she approaches Woo-hyeon. Seo-yeon gets mad at her best friend when she met Woo-hyeon. Min-joo, aware of the fact that it''s her faultis also angered by Seo-yeon''s appearance and tells her to meet Jeong-soo, her friend. Seo-yeon is also angry and tells Min-joo that she have to meet Jeong-soo as well. A bittersweet story about a man who is a very close friend is just about to start.', 'Seo-yeon is being tutored by Woo-hyeon who is younger than her. She grew interested in her tutor, Woo-hyun, the first time she met him, and he is also fond of Seo-yeon. Seo-yeon succeeded in seducing Woo-hyeon with the help of her friend Min-joo. Even if Min-joo is aware of what Seo-yeon feels, she approaches Woo-hyeon. Seo-yeon gets mad at her best friend when she met Woo-hyeon. Min-joo, aware of the fact that it''s her faultis also angered by Seo-yeon''s appearance and tells her to meet Jeong-soo, her friend. Seo-yeon is also angry and tells Min-joo that she have to meet Jeong-soo as well. A bittersweet story about a man who is a very close friend is just about to start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0jd4v2490rC9oqwnEOVJ6KNK3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724108'),
  ('702911276537073260', 'R... Rajkumar', 2013, 'Action, Romance', 'Prabhu Deva, Durgesh Raje, Mohana Krishna', 'Ravi S. Sundaram, Prabhu Deva, Sunil Kumar Agrawal', 'Shahid Kapoor, Sonakshi Sinha, Mukul Dev, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Sonu Sood, Asrani, Srihari, Poonam Jhawer', null, 'Rajkumar, an aimless youth, works for a drug baron and is sent to kill a rival dealer. His life is changed forever when he meets Chanda, and has no idea she is the adopted daughter of the man he is supposed to kill.', 'Rajkumar, an aimless youth, works for a drug baron and is sent to kill a rival dealer. His life is changed forever when he meets Chanda, and has no idea she is the adopted daughter of the man he is supposed to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wURYkClPhuWaZz936eUEWWVzUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240614'),
  ('152074469268844642', 'R.A.D.A.R.: The Adventures of the Bionic Dog', 2023, 'Family, Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure', 'Scott Vandiver, Christian Cashmir', 'April Smallwood', 'Dean Cain, Ezra James Lerario, Caroline Elle Abrams, Paul Wilson, Victoria White, Andrew Key, Ricky Wayne', 'PG', 'Gabe and Kylie hunt for lost pirate treasure, hoping to bring tourists to their sleepy Florida town — and save Gabe’s mom’s diner. When they find a precious sapphire, they’re helped by R.A.D.A.R., a clever dog who’s actually a robot! But the mad scientist who invented the treasure-hunting dog wants to steal him back — along with the town’s famous sapphire! Can Gabe and Kylie protect the dog, guard the jewel, and save the town?', 'Gabe and Kylie hunt for lost pirate treasure, hoping to bring tourists to their sleepy Florida town — and save Gabe’s mom’s diner. When they find a precious sapphire, they’re helped by R.A.D.A.R., a clever dog who’s actually a robot! But the mad scientist who invented the treasure-hunting dog wants to steal him back — along with the town’s famous sapphire! Can Gabe and Kylie protect the dog, guard the jewel, and save the town?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bS8yOrOZ8DMxW4DfrBJxvlAtkVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1116410'),
  ('77512736506341684', 'R.A.I.D. Special Unit', 2017, 'Action, Comedy', 'Dany Boon, Denis Rouden', 'Dany Boon, Sarah Kaminsky', 'Alice Pol, Dany Boon, Michel Blanc, Yvan Attal, Sabine Azéma, Patrick Mille, François Levantal, Florent Peyre', null, 'The story of a woman who dreams to join an intervention group in the police department called RAID. Unfortunately, she is rather clumsy and both her family (and soon to be family-in-law) and a veteran of the RAID do not approve. However, Johanna is determined to prove them wrong.', 'The story of a woman who dreams to join an intervention group in the police department called RAID. Unfortunately, she is rather clumsy and both her family (and soon to be family-in-law) and a veteran of the RAID do not approve. However, Johanna is determined to prove them wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RQoRqtsQ9pZpcg7Hcb5fa5eCNx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382597'),
  ('988304725230808978', 'R.I.A.', 2021, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Richard Colton', 'Richard Colton', 'Luke Goss, Jess Impiazzi, Dean Cain, Charlie Clapham, Kimberly Wyatt, Amber Doig-Thorne, Amar Adatia, Leon Ockenden', null, 'In 2040, a female humanoid A.I. is hacked by her husband and forced to kidnap the U.S. vice president''s son and execute him on live TV, as the culprit seeks revenge for his own son''s death.', 'In 2040, a female humanoid A.I. is hacked by her husband and forced to kidnap the U.S. vice president''s son and execute him on live TV, as the culprit seeks revenge for his own son''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKo5y8mCJncnIH8cNA8l7cLcxow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:694938'),
