  ('168792136524705176', 'R()und Brackets', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Michele Lunella, Antonio Centomani, Vassili Karis', 'Michele Lunella, Noa Palotto, Manuela Pincitore', 'Karim Capuano, Raffaella Lecciso, Rocco Pietrantonio, Francesca D''Auria, Pippo Pelo, Éva Henger, Enzo Fischetti, Nello Iorio', null, 'Vanessa, a runaway bride, and Emanuela became friends on the ferry to a tourist resort. Together they will take part of the chaotic life of the resort.', 'Vanessa, a runaway bride, and Emanuela became friends on the ferry to a tourist resort. Together they will take part of the chaotic life of the resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOj9joAzPZ1XtwuiD3e8xRBcMfa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64974'),
  ('531264789185906217', 'R♥️J', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Megan Scherner, Carey Williams, Diego Madrigal', 'Carey Williams, Rickie Castaneda, Alexey Sobolev', 'Camaron Engels, Francesca Noel, RJ Cyler, Siddiq Saunderson, Diego Tinoco, David Zayas, Dakota Shapiro, Moe Irvin', null, 'Told entirely through social media and smartphone screens, this bold adaptation of Romeo and Juliet reinvents the world’s most enduring love story with style and lyricism, with black and brown youth at the heart of it all.', 'Told entirely through social media and smartphone screens, this bold adaptation of Romeo and Juliet reinvents the world’s most enduring love story with style and lyricism, with black and brown youth at the heart of it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6G1rG8G6aCCclAERcnDRPGsVeJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713377'),
