  ('844168631404938085', 'Ra.One', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Anubhav Sinha, Andy Gill, Nicola Pecorini', 'Kanika Dhillon, Anubhav Sinha, Mustaq Sheikh', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Arjun Rampal, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Armaan Verma, Tom Wu, Shahana Goswami, Dalip Tahil, Satish Shah', 'NR', 'When the titular antagonist of an action game takes on physical form, it''s up to the game''s less powerful protagonist to save the world.', 'When the titular antagonist of an action game takes on physical form, it''s up to the game''s less powerful protagonist to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwC3rbgCI0frJpRxVm74Ak3ktpU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41517'),
  ('262550007659102126', 'Raabta', 2017, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Dinesh Vijan, Mukesh Chhabra, Hajnalka Vajay', null, 'Sushant Singh Rajput, Kriti Sanon, Jim Sarbh, Vikas Verma, Rajkummar Rao, Karan Singh Chhabra, Varun Sharma, Deepika Padukone', null, 'An inseparable couple Saira and Shiva find themselves in a complicated situation when a stranger claims to be her reincarnated lover from their previous lifetime, hellbent on destroying their relationship and winning her back.', 'An inseparable couple Saira and Shiva find themselves in a complicated situation when a stranger claims to be her reincarnated lover from their previous lifetime, hellbent on destroying their relationship and winning her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovdpOhdgYqhDmy3uYGhNN16CKzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456562'),
  ('788930782297907221', 'Raajneeti', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Prakash Jha, Sachin K. Krishn, Abhisar Bose', 'Prakash Jha, Anjum Rajabali', 'Ajay Devgn, Ranbir Kapoor, Manoj Bajpayee, Katrina Kaif, Arjun Rampal, Nana Patekar, Naseeruddin Shah, Sarah Thompson', null, 'It is the story of a fiercely fought election campaign, where money power and corruption are the accepted norms, and where treachery and manipulation are routinely used weapons. As the personal drama of these conflict-ridden characters unfolds against this gritty backdrop, love and friendship become mere baits, and relationships get sacrificed at the altar of political alignments. The darkness that rises from their souls threatens to envelope all that they hold precious. Until eventually, in the crescendo of increasing violence, the line between good and evil blurs, making it impossible to distinguish heroes from villains. Raajneeti is the story of Indian democracy. And its ugly underside. It is about politics. And beyond.', 'It is the story of a fiercely fought election campaign, where money power and corruption are the accepted norms, and where treachery and manipulation are routinely used weapons. As the personal drama of these conflict-ridden characters unfolds against this gritty backdrop, love and friendship become mere baits, and relationships get sacrificed at the altar of political alignments. The darkness that rises from their souls threatens to envelope all that they hold precious. Until eventually, in the crescendo of increasing violence, the line between good and evil blurs, making it impossible to distinguish heroes from villains. Raajneeti is the story of Indian democracy. And its ugly underside. It is about politics. And beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZJeKk1vzekp2xfGecwYoUZGzoB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37951'),
