  ('955007774093780198', 'Raanjhanaa', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aanand L. Rai, Rahul Tanwar, Vishal Sinha', 'Himanshu Sharma', 'Dhanush, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Abhay Deol, Swara Bhasker, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Shilpi Marwaha, Kumud Mishra, Saniya Anklesaria', 'G', 'A small-town boy needs to break through the class divide to gain acceptance from his childhood sweetheart who is in love with big city ideals.', 'A small-town boy needs to break through the class divide to gain acceptance from his childhood sweetheart who is in love with big city ideals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wi1Qv5nPo0ddJgjA0baD9MR3NC0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191121'),
  ('1050640309625008194', 'Raat', 1992, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Ram Gopal Varma, Teja', 'Ram Gopal Varma', 'Revathi, Chinna, Rohini Hattangadi, Akash Khurana, Om Puri, Anant Nag, Jaya Mathur, Master Atit', null, 'The Sharma family re-locate to a semi-urban locality in a house that has a "reputation". The Sharma family consists of Mr. Sharma, his wife Shalini Sharma, only daughter Manisha Sharma or "Mini" as they affectionately call her; and their grandchild Bunty, as his parents had been killed in an accident. Strange things start happening, with a return of a dead kitten, and the brutal murder of Manisha''s friend, Reshmi; an attempt to kill Mr. Sharma and Manisha''s boyfriend, Deepak. What is the force behind these brutalities? Is it natural or supernatural?', 'The Sharma family re-locate to a semi-urban locality in a house that has a "reputation". The Sharma family consists of Mr. Sharma, his wife Shalini Sharma, only daughter Manisha Sharma or "Mini" as they affectionately call her; and their grandchild Bunty, as his parents had been killed in an accident. Strange things start happening, with a return of a dead kitten, and the brutal murder of Manisha''s friend, Reshmi; an attempt to kill Mr. Sharma and Manisha''s boyfriend, Deepak. What is the force behind these brutalities? Is it natural or supernatural?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krQAgqZuxMZ2szXSTzZsOrJOKHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228012'),
  ('492152644278969773', 'Raat Akeli Hai', 2020, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Honey Trehan, Taran Bajaj, Vivek Soni', 'Smita Singh', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Radhika Apte, Padmavati Rao, Shweta Tripathi Sharma, Aditya Srivastava, Nishant Dahiya, Shivani Raghuvanshi, Khalid Tyabji', null, 'When a newly married landlord is murdered, a misfit cop’s investigation is complicated by the victim’s secretive family and his own conflicted heart.', 'When a newly married landlord is murdered, a misfit cop’s investigation is complicated by the victim’s secretive family and his own conflicted heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQPWcvQiv1D1xBlpnn5o0hepXkX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589615'),
  ('1027081534656166119', 'Raat Akeli Hai - The Bansal Murders', 2025, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Honey Trehan, Sirsha Ray, Taran Bajaj', 'Smita Singh', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Radhika Apte, Chitrangada Singh, Rajat Kapoor, Revathi, Deepti Naval, Sanjay Kapoor, Ila Arun', 'R', 'When members of the Bansal family are found murdered, Inspector Jatil Yadav uncovers a trail of greed, betrayal and secrets tied to a deadly conspiracy.', 'When members of the Bansal family are found murdered, Inspector Jatil Yadav uncovers a trail of greed, betrayal and secrets tied to a deadly conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBhae2KNhk0R6cvVppoCo389gs6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1415974'),
