  ('782825432986839314', 'Rabbit Hood', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Errol Flynn', 'NR', 'While trespassing in the royal gardens in search of carrots, Bugs runs afoul of the Sheriff of Nottingham, who tries to apprehend him for poaching. Of course Bugs sets out to endlessly turn the tables on the hapless sheriff.', 'While trespassing in the royal gardens in search of carrots, Bugs runs afoul of the Sheriff of Nottingham, who tries to apprehend him for poaching. Of course Bugs sets out to endlessly turn the tables on the hapless sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3U2x9OzTjEZOdXlnWEaHLT45wI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88601'),
