  ('481842727843091324', 'Rabbit of Seville', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Behind the Hollywood Bowl stage which is playing the opera The Barber of Seville, Bugs Bunny flees into the backstage area with Elmer Fudd in close pursuit. Seeing his opportunity to fight on his terms, Bugs raises the curtain on Elmer, trapping him on stage. As the orchestra begins playing, Bugs comes into play as the barber who is going to make sure that Elmer is going to get a grooming he will never forget.', 'Behind the Hollywood Bowl stage which is playing the opera The Barber of Seville, Bugs Bunny flees into the backstage area with Elmer Fudd in close pursuit. Seeing his opportunity to fight on his terms, Bugs raises the curtain on Elmer, trapping him on stage. As the orchestra begins playing, Bugs comes into play as the barber who is going to make sure that Elmer is going to get a grooming he will never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27VEl23uM1aDxR9if2Ncs8IbSmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52971'),
  ('523367785187391937', 'Rabbit on the Moon', 2004, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jorge Ramírez Suárez', 'Jorge Ramírez Suárez', 'Bruno Bichir, Lorraine Pilkington, Jesús Ochoa, Adam Kotz, Álvaro Guerrero, Sharon Zundel, Itari Marta, Annabel Mullion', null, 'Though around them a criminal world seethes, Julie and Antonio are a young and loving couple with a new baby and a solid, white-collar sense of stability. But when a loose social connection suddenly ties them to a major political assassination, the two become innocents desperately trying to adapt to a world of murderous politicians and police that, moment to moment, threatens their lives', 'Though around them a criminal world seethes, Julie and Antonio are a young and loving couple with a new baby and a solid, white-collar sense of stability. But when a loose social connection suddenly ties them to a major political assassination, the two become innocents desperately trying to adapt to a world of murderous politicians and police that, moment to moment, threatens their lives', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ht6pLga8Fxa8Jpl9ybhpxizoYP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116881'),
