  ('753712757488561211', 'Rabia', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mareike Engelhardt, Agnès Godard, Pierre Py', 'Céline Martelet, Bastian Wiegelmann, Mareike Engelhardt', 'Megan Northam, Lubna Azabal, Natacha Krief, Lena Lauzemis, Klara Wöedermann, Maria Wöedermann, Lena Urzendowsky, Christine Gautier', null, 'Driven by the promise of a new life, Jessica and her best friend Laila left for Syria to join Daech. But when they arrive, they find themselves locked up in a women’s house run by the authoritarian and charismatic Madame.', 'Driven by the promise of a new life, Jessica and her best friend Laila left for Syria to join Daech. But when they arrive, they find themselves locked up in a women’s house run by the authoritarian and charismatic Madame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h05EsRVWWrmLDlEsXhRIUWUSogH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999142'),
  ('714434117398563591', 'Rabid', 1977, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Cronenberg, René Verzier, John Fretz', 'David Cronenberg', 'Marilyn Chambers, Terri Hanauer, Frank Moore, Joe Silver, Howard Ryshpan, Patricia Gage, Susan Roman, Roger Periard', 'R', 'After undergoing radical surgery for injuries from a motorcycle accident, a young woman develops a retractable, vampiric stinger in her armpit and a thirst for human blood.', 'After undergoing radical surgery for injuries from a motorcycle accident, a young woman develops a retractable, vampiric stinger in her armpit and a thirst for human blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIsuIWnvDozlQP4ya6OZEXqDecj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29437'),
  ('512305142554050194', 'Rabid', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Emily Pope, Catherine Wallace, Sylvia Soska', 'David Cronenberg', 'Laura Vandervoort, Benjamin Hollingsworth, Ted Atherton, Hanneke Talbot, Stephen Huszar, Mackenzie Gray, Stephen McHattie, Kevin Hanchard', 'NR', 'The quiet Rose works in women''s fashion clothing, hoping to be a designer. A traffic accident damages her face. She gets experimental stem cell treatment, leaving her stronger and prettier than ever - but there''s a side effect.', 'The quiet Rose works in women''s fashion clothing, hoping to be a designer. A traffic accident damages her face. She gets experimental stem cell treatment, leaving her stronger and prettier than ever - but there''s a side effect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwhu63aaXjuR9PzSf1nk92rpD9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384756'),
  ('119312326277900146', 'Rabid Dogs', 1973, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Mario Bava, Emilio Varriano, Mario Garriba', 'Alessandro Parenzo, Mario Bava, Cesare Frugoni', 'Riccardo Cucciolla, Don Backy, Lea Lander, Maurice Poli, George Eastman, Marisa Fabbri, Erika Dario, Luigi Antonio Guerra', 'NR', 'Following a bungled robbery, three violent criminals take a young woman, a middle-aged man, and a child hostage and force them to drive them outside Rome to help them make a clean getaway.', 'Following a bungled robbery, three violent criminals take a young woman, a middle-aged man, and a child hostage and force them to drive them outside Rome to help them make a clean getaway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coPfiRtfFvbEOJra64hnlXMsY8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5482'),
  ('302769109506904049', 'Rabid Dogs', 2015, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Éric Hannezo, Kamal Derkaoui, Nathalie Lacoste', 'Mario Bava', 'Lambert Wilson, Virginie Ledoyen, Guillaume Gouix, François Arnaud, Franck Gastambide, Laurent Lucas, Pierre Lebeau, Gabrielle Lazure', null, 'After a bank job goes badly wrong, three desperate criminals take a young woman and a father and child hostage - it''s the beginning of a frantic and violent road trip that not all of them will survive.', 'After a bank job goes badly wrong, three desperate criminals take a young woman and a father and child hostage - it''s the beginning of a frantic and violent road trip that not all of them will survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1fyTGVZtk07UBA1jixAELNmAAF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:344120'),
  ('339420497044277284', 'Rabid Grannies', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Emmanuel Kervyn, Hugo Labye', 'Emmanuel Kervyn', 'Catherine Aymerie, Caroline Braekman, Richard Cotica, Danielle Daven, Patricia Davia, Robert Du Bois, Florine Elslande, Anne-Marie Fox', 'R', 'A large family gathers in the country side for their very elderly grannies'' birthday. One gift happens to be from their ostracized, black sheep nephew, and upon opening it, the two loveable grannies turn into rabid, flesh-eating monsters.', 'A large family gathers in the country side for their very elderly grannies'' birthday. One gift happens to be from their ostracized, black sheep nephew, and upon opening it, the two loveable grannies turn into rabid, flesh-eating monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7M2Ptj3unacWHjFO8YKLCB4iej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21381'),
  ('68499225867530997', 'Rabies', 2010, 'Horror', 'Aharon Keshales, Navot Papushado, Guy Raz', 'Aharon Keshales, Navot Papushado', 'Lior Ashkenazi, Ania Bukstein, Danny Geva, Yael Grobglas, Henry David, Ran Danker, Yaron Motolla, Menashe Noy', null, 'A brother and sister who run away from home find sanctuary in a deserted nature reserve. When the sister falls into the trap of a psychopathic killer, the brother sets out on a race against time to find help. In a twist of fate the rescue of the sister becomes inadvertently intertwined with the lives of a group of young tennis players, a ranger and his dog, as well as a team of policemen.', 'A brother and sister who run away from home find sanctuary in a deserted nature reserve. When the sister falls into the trap of a psychopathic killer, the brother sets out on a race against time to find help. In a twist of fate the rescue of the sister becomes inadvertently intertwined with the lives of a group of young tennis players, a ranger and his dog, as well as a team of policemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DKOU6KZBt10iC0QntVWYaTlSMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74586'),
  ('904651857512938643', 'Rabindranath Tagore', 1961, 'Documentary, History', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Satyajit Ray, Rabindranath Tagore, Raya Chatterjee, Sovanlal Ganguli, Smaran Ghosal, Purnendu Mukherjee, Kallol Bose, Subir Bose', null, 'Docudrama about the life of Rabindranath Tagore, Indian polymath—poet, writer, playwright, composer, philosopher, social reformer and painter, who reshaped Bengali literature and music as well as Indian art, becoming in 1913 the first non-European and the first lyricist to win the Nobel Prize in Literature. The film was released during Tagore''s birth centenary year.', 'Docudrama about the life of Rabindranath Tagore, Indian polymath—poet, writer, playwright, composer, philosopher, social reformer and painter, who reshaped Bengali literature and music as well as Indian art, becoming in 1913 the first non-European and the first lyricist to win the Nobel Prize in Literature. The film was released during Tagore''s birth centenary year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0VpazRssYIJDdu2GwNnGgWOTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159213'),
  ('546979209156707475', 'Rabiye Kurnaz vs. George W. Bush', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Andreas Dresen, Andreas Höfer', 'Laila Stieler', 'Meltem Kaptan, Alexander Scheer, Charly Hübner, Abdullah Emre Öztürk, Nazmi Kırık, Sevda Polat, Jeanette Spassova, Abak Safaei-Rad', null, 'Desperate to help her son, Rabiye Kurnaz, a housewife and loving mother from Bremen, goes to the police, notifies authorities and almost despairs at their impotence and in the end, against all the odds, something truly remarkable happens.', 'Desperate to help her son, Rabiye Kurnaz, a housewife and loving mother from Bremen, goes to the police, notifies authorities and almost despairs at their impotence and in the end, against all the odds, something truly remarkable happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BmgTsU9EPhnQKz4doNifwcV0Fz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915960'),
  ('752545352899362734', 'Race', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla, Ravi Yadav', 'Shiraz Ahmed', 'Saif Ali Khan, Akshaye Khanna, Bipasha Basu, Katrina Kaif, Anil Kapoor, Sameera Reddy, Dalip Tahil, Kiku Sharda', null, 'The plot thickens around two horse-racing competitors when three beautiful women come into their lives and a murder is committed.', 'The plot thickens around two horse-racing competitors when three beautiful women come into their lives and a murder is committed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krMI3hRmlgKcuNc3XBWtl8APasR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19658'),
  ('170661520581847906', 'Race', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Stephen Hopkins, Peter Levy, Isabelle Guay', 'Joe Shrapnel, Anna Waterhouse', 'Stephan James, Jason Sudeikis, Eli Goree, Shanice Banton, Carice van Houten, Jeremy Irons, William Hurt, David Kross', 'PG-13', 'Based on the story of Jesse Owens, the athlete whose quest to become the greatest track and field athlete in history thrusts him onto the world stage of the 1936 Olympics, where he faces off against Adolf Hitler''s vision of Aryan supremacy.', 'Based on the story of Jesse Owens, the athlete whose quest to become the greatest track and field athlete in history thrusts him onto the world stage of the 1936 Olympics, where he faces off against Adolf Hitler''s vision of Aryan supremacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubbNizkhjEYw06XB7b0YMgsHXG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323677'),
  ('587304944380934293', 'Race 1', 2021, 'Action, Drama', 'Jem Chen', 'Jay Chern, Jem Chen', 'Hannah Quinlivan, Tsao Yu-ning, Van Fan, Alan Kuo, Ven Kao, Nolay Piho, Evonne Hsu, Ken Lin', null, 'The once dominating LIONS team gradually declined after the death of team leader Lao Shen. Unwilling to retire, Li Yi Fei and his new partner-the first female driver in league history, Lu Li li did not get along, and the two did not give in to each other, which made the team''s situation worse. The second-generation new team leader, Ah Shen, who is not optimistic, has to pin his hopes on Du Jie Ke, an otaku who can only play simulator racing. Du Jie Ke, who has no actual combat experience, does not have the strength to participate in the competition, but in order to catch up with Lily, he works hard. Faced with his racing performance and the concerns of his family, Li Yi Fei decided to retreat behind the scenes and let Lily and Du Jie Ke form a new partnership. Outside the Lions team, there is a strong opponent Song Jie, and there are misunderstandings and conflicts that need to be resolved. In the fierce battle, they regained their original aspirations.', 'The once dominating LIONS team gradually declined after the death of team leader Lao Shen. Unwilling to retire, Li Yi Fei and his new partner-the first female driver in league history, Lu Li li did not get along, and the two did not give in to each other, which made the team''s situation worse. The second-generation new team leader, Ah Shen, who is not optimistic, has to pin his hopes on Du Jie Ke, an otaku who can only play simulator racing. Du Jie Ke, who has no actual combat experience, does not have the strength to participate in the competition, but in order to catch up with Lily, he works hard. Faced with his racing performance and the concerns of his family, Li Yi Fei decided to retreat behind the scenes and let Lily and Du Jie Ke form a new partnership. Outside the Lions team, there is a strong opponent Song Jie, and there are misunderstandings and conflicts that need to be resolved. In the fierce battle, they regained their original aspirations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KeaT99qgLFclO36mM8jLSCSIlc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:781456'),
  ('259763509823626893', 'Race 2', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla, Ravi Yadav', 'Shiraz Ahmed', 'Saif Ali Khan, John Abraham, Deepika Padukone, Jacqueline Fernandez, Anil Kapoor, Ameesha Patel, Bipasha Basu, Rajesh Khattar', 'NR', 'Ranvir Singh encounters the Indian mafia in Turkey as he carries out a mission to avenge his lover''s death.', 'Ranvir Singh encounters the Indian mafia in Turkey as he carries out a mission to avenge his lover''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUe3rzMvVsbi63z3EKA8egjFBv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44749'),
  ('244501682169062005', 'Race 3', 2018, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Adventure', 'Remo D''Souza, Ayananka Bose, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Abdul Rafay Chandio Baloch', 'Salman Khan, Anil Kapoor, Bobby Deol, Jacqueline Fernandez, Daisy Shah, Saqib Saleem, Freddy Daruwala, Manav Vij', null, 'The Singh family comprises of Shamsher his step-son Sikandar, twins Suraj and Sanjana. They run a business of illegal arms and trade with the help of their friend Yash. Things get dramatic when Jessica meets Sikandar and the family ties are strained under each character’s ulterior motives.', 'The Singh family comprises of Shamsher his step-son Sikandar, twins Suraj and Sanjana. They run a business of illegal arms and trade with the help of their friend Yash. Things get dramatic when Jessica meets Sikandar and the family ties are strained under each character’s ulterior motives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtnA5mmNumYkeevokar6IskyrZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496320'),
  ('1028315421070477039', 'Race Against Pandemic', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Maya Dykes', null, 'Gerogina Sutcliffe', null, 'Healthcare systems are overwhelmed, economies are disrupted and governments impose lockdowns to contain the spread of the virus. Where did this novel coronavirus come from? In what way was it manifesting itself in humans? How was it being spread? We uncover the vital questions scientists ask as they grapple to understand this new virus, and its potential threat. We also speak to the scientists and experts leading the fight against this latest pandemic to develop vaccines and treatments in a bid to halt the coronavirus'' relentless spread.', 'Healthcare systems are overwhelmed, economies are disrupted and governments impose lockdowns to contain the spread of the virus. Where did this novel coronavirus come from? In what way was it manifesting itself in humans? How was it being spread? We uncover the vital questions scientists ask as they grapple to understand this new virus, and its potential threat. We also speak to the scientists and experts leading the fight against this latest pandemic to develop vaccines and treatments in a bid to halt the coronavirus'' relentless spread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFzet0kWyVHdMPHKz2E3FRqqlQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716419'),
  ('292337951208934402', 'Race d''Ep!', 1979, 'History, Drama, Documentary', 'Lionel Soukaz, Guy Hocquenghem', 'Guy Hocquenghem, Lionel Soukaz', 'Elizar Van Effenterre, Gilles Sandier, Pierre Hahn, Jean Demelier, Yves Jacquemard, Jean-Michel Sénécal, Claire Amiard, Adeline André', null, '"Race d’Ep!" (which literally translates to "Breed of Faggots") was made by the “father of queer theory,” Guy Hocquenghem, in collaboration with radical queer filmmaker and provocateur Lionel Soukaz. The film traces the history of modern homosexuality through the twentieth century, from early sexology and the nudes of Baron von Gloeden to gay liberation and cruising on the streets of Paris. Influenced by the groundbreaking work of Michel Foucault on the history of sexuality and reflecting the revolutionary queer activism of its day, "Race d’Ep!" is a shockingly frank, sex-filled experimental documentary about gay culture emerging from the shadows.', '"Race d’Ep!" (which literally translates to "Breed of Faggots") was made by the “father of queer theory,” Guy Hocquenghem, in collaboration with radical queer filmmaker and provocateur Lionel Soukaz. The film traces the history of modern homosexuality through the twentieth century, from early sexology and the nudes of Baron von Gloeden to gay liberation and cruising on the streets of Paris. Influenced by the groundbreaking work of Michel Foucault on the history of sexuality and reflecting the revolutionary queer activism of its day, "Race d’Ep!" is a shockingly frank, sex-filled experimental documentary about gay culture emerging from the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kdmeosjHBq2z6wLOIZPfswncv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258661'),
  ('844568978486981155', 'Race for Glory: Audi vs. Lancia', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Stefano Mordini, Luigi Martinucci, Gastone Salerno', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Filippo Bologna, Stefano Mordini', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Volker Bruch, Daniel Brühl, Katie Clarkson-Hill, Esther Garrel, Giorgio Montanini, Gianmaria Martini, Haley Bennett', 'R', 'Inspired by true events that occurred during the fierce rivalry between Germany (Audi) and Italy (Lancia) at the 1983 Rally World Championships.', 'Inspired by true events that occurred during the fierce rivalry between Germany (Audi) and Italy (Lancia) at the 1983 Rally World Championships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovoybG8mCn6nQ6i5WoC8DdR08c2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:972433'),
  ('753311878122589452', 'Race for the Yankee Zephyr', 1981, 'Action, Adventure', 'David Hemmings, Vincent Monton, Douglas Milsome', 'Everett De Roche', 'Ken Wahl, Lesley Ann Warren, Donald Pleasence, George Peppard, Bruno Lawrence, Grant Tilly, Frank Taurua', null, 'In a lake high in the mountains of New Zealand hunter Gibbie Gibson discovers a plane wreck from WW2. When he tells it around, a gang of crooks follows and threatens him and his daughter, because they know there are 50 million dollars in the wreck. Helicopter pilot Barney helps Gibbie against them, risking his life thereby.', 'In a lake high in the mountains of New Zealand hunter Gibbie Gibson discovers a plane wreck from WW2. When he tells it around, a gang of crooks follows and threatens him and his daughter, because they know there are 50 million dollars in the wreck. Helicopter pilot Barney helps Gibbie against them, risking his life thereby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GM4f4QduTsoyrP03dQz5PzghGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86295'),
  ('955096527217152518', 'Race for Your Life, Charlie Brown', 1977, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Bill Melendez, Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Duncan Watson, Bill Melendez, Gail Davis, Melanie Kohn, Liam Martin, Stuart Brotman, Jimmy Ahrens, Greg Felton', 'G', 'The Peanuts gang, including Snoopy and Woodstock, have gone off to summer camp. After a few days of the usual summer-camp activities, they all take part in a rafting race. Battling treacherous rapids, wild animals and bullies from a rival tent, the teams make their way downriver to the finish line.', 'The Peanuts gang, including Snoopy and Woodstock, have gone off to summer camp. After a few days of the usual summer-camp activities, they all take part in a rafting race. Battling treacherous rapids, wild animals and bullies from a rival tent, the teams make their way downriver to the finish line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkrTxae5BkW6DwNbEsD568ZKVPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31718'),
