  ('1079990013130415550', 'Race the Sun', 1996, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Charles T. Kanganis, Catherine Mansill, David Burr', 'Barry Morrow', 'Halle Berry, Casey Affleck, Eliza Dushku, Steve Zahn, Kevin Tighe, Anthony Ruivivar, Nadja Pionilla, Jim Belushi', 'PG', 'A bunch of high school misfits in Hawaii, introduced by their new teacher, attend a science fair in which they draw up inspiration to build their own solar car and win a trip to compete in the 1990 World Solar Challenge in Australia.', 'A bunch of high school misfits in Hawaii, introduced by their new teacher, attend a science fair in which they draw up inspiration to build their own solar car and win a trip to compete in the 1990 World Solar Challenge in Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQA7TXgmEi35Zab6fHQ8VZ7Zhfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55731'),
  ('926380447334754564', 'Race to Freedom: Um Bok-dong', 2019, 'Drama', 'Choi Chul-su, Kim Yoo-sung, Park Yong-su', 'Kim Yoo-sung', 'Rain, Kang So-ra, Lee Beom-soo, Ko Chang-seok, Kim Hie-won, Min Hyo-rin, Lee Si-eon, Park Jin-joo', null, 'During the Japanese colonial rule of Korea, while people are in despair, Jae-ho tries to raise morale by winning cycle championship. Bok-dong, who started cycling with Jae-ho just to make a forture, becomes a symbol of hope for Koreans by defeating Japanese cyclists.', 'During the Japanese colonial rule of Korea, while people are in despair, Jae-ho tries to raise morale by winning cycle championship. Bok-dong, who started cycling with Jae-ho just to make a forture, becomes a symbol of hope for Koreans by defeating Japanese cyclists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47GtpFMRQc2phuFTyvQKwPEGNlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571783'),
