  ('989080521846675814', 'Rachel, Rachel', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul Newman, Alex Hapsas, Robert J. Koster', 'Stewart Stern', 'Joanne Woodward, James Olson, Kate Harrington, Estelle Parsons, Donald Moffat, Terry Kiser, Frank Corsaro, Bernard Barrow', 'R', 'Rachel is a 35-year-old school teacher who has no man in her life and lives with her mother. When a man from the big city returns and asks her out, she begins to have to make decisions about her life and where she wants it to go.', 'Rachel is a 35-year-old school teacher who has no man in her life and lives with her mother. When a man from the big city returns and asks her out, she begins to have to make decisions about her life and where she wants it to go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67flKS1FKxIiYUjXPqRc39hb9LX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42635'),
  ('135633146201148461', 'Rachel''s Game', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Thierry Klifa, Sarah Teper, Vianney Perez', 'Thierry Klifa, Gaëlle Macé, Jeanne Herry', 'Fanny Ardant, Mathieu Kassovitz, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Michel Vuillermoz, Laetitia Dosch, Ben Attal, Théo Navarro-Mussy, Zbeida Belhajamor', null, 'Home cook Rachel, a sort of Ma Dalton, has raised her sons Sam and Jeremiah, and her grandson, Nathan, in the cult of conning. From bad plans to petty theft, this friendly family of broken arms is always after the big score. Luck or fate, during a burglary, they steal a painting by Tamara de Lempicka without knowing its value. Céleste, a shrewd and charming detective, sets out in pursuit.', 'Home cook Rachel, a sort of Ma Dalton, has raised her sons Sam and Jeremiah, and her grandson, Nathan, in the cult of conning. From bad plans to petty theft, this friendly family of broken arms is always after the big score. Luck or fate, during a burglary, they steal a painting by Tamara de Lempicka without knowing its value. Céleste, a shrewd and charming detective, sets out in pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LNCy3hvtCgsXBkg9FyPCdfWkMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999151'),
  ('991158656020124854', 'Racing Extinction', 2015, 'Adventure, Documentary', 'Louie Psihoyos', 'Mark Monroe', 'Elon Musk, Jane Goodall, Louie Psihoyos, Leilani Münter, Charles Hambleton, Heather Dawn Rally, Joel Sartore, Paul Hilton', null, 'An unlikely team of activists and innovators hatches a bold mission to save endangered species.', 'An unlikely team of activists and innovators hatches a bold mission to save endangered species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gydw7e4QCWrp5qExSJSvzyPJ42E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300792'),
  ('639766550475150723', 'Racing Stripes', 2005, 'Comedy, Family', 'Frederik Du Chau, David Eggby, Philip A. Patterson', 'David Schmidt', 'Frankie Muniz, Hayden Panettiere, Bruce Greenwood, Mandy Moore, Wendie Malick, M. Emmet Walsh, Snoop Dogg, Michael Clarke Duncan', 'PG', 'Shattered illusions are hard to repair -- especially for a good-hearted zebra named Stripes who''s spent his life on a Kentucky farm amidst the sorely mistaken notion that he''s a debonair thoroughbred. Once he faces the fact that his stark stripes mark him as different, he decides he''ll race anyway. And with help from the young girl who raised him, he just might end up in the winner''s circle.', 'Shattered illusions are hard to repair -- especially for a good-hearted zebra named Stripes who''s spent his life on a Kentucky farm amidst the sorely mistaken notion that he''s a debonair thoroughbred. Once he faces the fact that his stark stripes mark him as different, he decides he''ll race anyway. And with help from the young girl who raised him, he just might end up in the winner''s circle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epDsuf5oUdzTFYHqV2IRcyy8Rwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6439'),
  ('989027255845315027', 'Racing with the Moon', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard Benjamin, John Bailey, William S. Beasley', 'Steve Kloves', 'Sean Penn, Nicolas Cage, Elizabeth McGovern, John Karlen, Rutanya Alda, Max Showalter, Crispin Glover, Barbara Howard', 'PG', 'In a small coastal California town, Henry and Nicky are pals from blue collar families with only a short time before they ship off to World War II. Henry begins romancing new-to-town Caddie Winger, believing her to be wealthy. Mischievous and irresponsible, Nicky gets into trouble which forces the other two to become involved, testing their relationship, as well as the friendship between the boys.', 'In a small coastal California town, Henry and Nicky are pals from blue collar families with only a short time before they ship off to World War II. Henry begins romancing new-to-town Caddie Winger, believing her to be wealthy. Mischievous and irresponsible, Nicky gets into trouble which forces the other two to become involved, testing their relationship, as well as the friendship between the boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOITApisPEKYB4it1hRACHD6u1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47359'),
  ('1008104670992054624', 'Racionais MC''s: From the Streets of São Paulo', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'Flávio Rebouças, Juliana Vicente', 'Juliana Vicente', 'Mano Brown, KL Jay, Ice Blue, Edi Rock, Ice-T, Dexter', 'R', 'Armed with music and a message, influential hip-hop group Racionais MC''s turned their street poetry into a powerful movement in Brazil and beyond.', 'Armed with music and a message, influential hip-hop group Racionais MC''s turned their street poetry into a powerful movement in Brazil and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuAti3pkylfx0EyhfRUPpxK6Xkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033303'),
