  ('35043006757007079', 'Rad', 1986, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Hal Needham, Richard Leiterman, Val Stefoff', 'Geoffrey Edwards, Sam Bernard', 'Bill Allen, Lori Loughlin, Talia Shire, Ray Walston, Alfie Wise, Jack Weston, Laura Jacoby, H.B. Haggerty', 'PG', 'A BMX racer, who lives in a small town with his mother and sister, is faced with a tough decision, qualify for Helltrack or take his SATs in order to attend college.', 'A BMX racer, who lives in a small town with his mother and sister, is faced with a tough decision, qualify for Helltrack or take his SATs in order to attend college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yg7TR7U4f2xRrVrM0IyDUGuFSHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13841'),
  ('103486238716530727', 'Radar Men from the Moon', 1952, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Fred C. Brannon', 'Ronald Davidson', 'George D. Wallace, Aline Towne, Roy Barcroft, William Bakewell, Peter Brocco, Clayton Moore, Robert Stevenson, Don Walters', 'NR', 'Commando Cody, ''Sky Marshal of the Universe'', works with American scientists Joan Gilbert and Ted Richards in the development of a flying suit and a rocket to the Moon. When the nation''s defences are being sabotaged and destroyed, Cody learns that an atomic-gun is being used and that the men on the moon are the culprits.', 'Commando Cody, ''Sky Marshal of the Universe'', works with American scientists Joan Gilbert and Ted Richards in the development of a flying suit and a rocket to the Moon. When the nation''s defences are being sabotaged and destroyed, Cody learns that an atomic-gun is being used and that the men on the moon are the culprits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pYrj4h2w5wkgTbbff4KS1MYP60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44608'),
