  ('142533526846569674', 'Rafferty and the Gold Dust Twins', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Woolsey, Dick Richards', 'John Kaye', 'Alan Arkin, Sally Kellerman, Mackenzie Phillips, Alex Rocco, Charles Martin Smith, Harry Dean Stanton, George O''Hanlon, Jr., Barbara Colby', null, 'Hapless driving instructor and former Gunnery Sergeant Rafferty, living in squalor near Hollywood, California, doesn''t put up too much of a fight when two ladies hitch a ride and attempt to kidnap him in their attempt to get to New Orleans; while initially put off, Rafferty finds he''s charmed by the kooky pair of misfits and the three of them drive to Las Vegas, Nevada and later Tucson, Arizona, where their bond eventually unravels.', 'Hapless driving instructor and former Gunnery Sergeant Rafferty, living in squalor near Hollywood, California, doesn''t put up too much of a fight when two ladies hitch a ride and attempt to kidnap him in their attempt to get to New Orleans; while initially put off, Rafferty finds he''s charmed by the kooky pair of misfits and the three of them drive to Las Vegas, Nevada and later Tucson, Arizona, where their bond eventually unravels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7iAvOtV6vh2ZOCzcLIDU1wiHBP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111149'),
  ('817376251251040908', 'Raffles', 1930, 'Adventure, Crime, Romance', 'George Fitzmaurice, H. Bruce Humberstone, George Barnes', 'Sidney Howard', 'Ronald Colman, Kay Francis, David Torrence, Frederick Kerr, Bramwell Fletcher, John Rogers, Wilson Benge, Alison Skipworth', null, 'A distinguished English gentleman has a secret life--he is the notorious jewel thief the press has dubbed "The Amateur Cracksman". When he meets a woman and falls in love he decides to "retire" from that life, but an old friend comes to him with a predicament that entails him committing one last job.', 'A distinguished English gentleman has a secret life--he is the notorious jewel thief the press has dubbed "The Amateur Cracksman". When he meets a woman and falls in love he decides to "retire" from that life, but an old friend comes to him with a predicament that entails him committing one last job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOeP2d3JO1Q8bLgphb9zyEM3spG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104439'),
  ('778159284016751164', 'Raffles', 1939, 'Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Sam Wood, Walter Mayo, Gregg Toland', 'John Van Druten, Sidney Howard', 'David Niven, Olivia de Havilland, May Whitty, Dudley Digges, Douglas Walton, E. E. Clive, Lionel Pape, Margaret Seddon', 'NR', 'Man about town and First Class cricketer A.J. Raffles keeps himself solvent with daring robberies. Meeting Gwen from his schooldays and falling in love all over again, he spends the weekend with her parents, Lord and Lady Melrose. A necklace presents an irresistible temptation, but also in attendance is Scotland Yard''s finest, finally on the trail.', 'Man about town and First Class cricketer A.J. Raffles keeps himself solvent with daring robberies. Meeting Gwen from his schooldays and falling in love all over again, he spends the weekend with her parents, Lord and Lady Melrose. A necklace presents an irresistible temptation, but also in attendance is Scotland Yard''s finest, finally on the trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suUhtPpuB2DVXuEUVOF9aiLcj5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200654'),
  ('1123957914438145748', 'Rafiki', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wanuri Kahiu, Christopher Wessels', 'Jenna Cato Bass, Wanuri Kahiu', 'Samantha Mugatsia, Sheila Munyiva, Jimmi Gathu, Nini Wacera, Dennis Musyoka, Patricia Amira, Neville Misati, Muthoni Gathecha', null, 'Kena and Ziki long for something more. Despite the political rivalry between their families, the girls resist and remain close friends, supporting each other to pursue their dreams in a conservative society. When love blossoms between them, the two girls will be forced to choose between happiness and safety.', 'Kena and Ziki long for something more. Despite the political rivalry between their families, the girls resist and remain close friends, supporting each other to pursue their dreams in a conservative society. When love blossoms between them, the two girls will be forced to choose between happiness and safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/letzgJyVmYYahcYNCYhzn75TyyE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517987'),
