  ('276904474075781425', 'Rage', 2016, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Sang-il Lee, Norimichi Kasamatsu', 'Sang-il Lee, Shuichi Yoshida', 'Ken Watanabe, Mirai Moriyama, Aoi Miyazaki, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Go Ayano, Suzu Hirose, Kenichi Matsuyama, Hideko Hara', null, 'A man brutally murders a married couple and leaves the word “ikari” (“rage”) written with their blood. The killer undergoes plastic surgery and flees. At three different locations in Japan, a male stranger appears. People suspect that the stranger might be the murderer.', 'A man brutally murders a married couple and leaves the word “ikari” (“rage”) written with their blood. The killer undergoes plastic surgery and flees. At three different locations in Japan, a male stranger appears. People suspect that the stranger might be the murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxqL09YSNA7Le75NBA4yOD8wjh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359344'),
  ('618450796777980481', 'Rage', 2018, 'Drama', 'Martin Bertier, Carolina Dias, Sérgio Tréfaut', 'Fátima Ribeiro, Sérgio Tréfaut', 'Isabel Ruth, Leonor Silveira, Hugo Bentes, Kaio César, Rita Cabaço, Adriano Luz, Lia Gama, Diogo Dória', null, 'Alentejo, Portugal, 1950. In a desolate region, where the wind seems to speak, where misery and hunger reign over poorest, a desperate man takes his revenge on those who caused his ruin during the darkest night, unable to get honestly the bread needed to feed his family in the daylight.', 'Alentejo, Portugal, 1950. In a desolate region, where the wind seems to speak, where misery and hunger reign over poorest, a desperate man takes his revenge on those who caused his ruin during the darkest night, unable to get honestly the bread needed to feed his family in the daylight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rOMG0FI0x1qgu148WYuDfNm5Lc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510228'),
  ('761082501291494897', 'Rage', 2020, 'Romance, Horror', 'Cesar Wolfenstein', 'Cesar Wolfenstein', 'Nancy Rodriguez, Berenice Garcia, Axel Altamirano, Marek Tokarcik', null, 'Eva, a teenage girl who lives with her devout and strict father, is corrupted behind closed doors by her tatted and pierced friend Lillith.', 'Eva, a teenage girl who lives with her devout and strict father, is corrupted behind closed doors by her tatted and pierced friend Lillith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwO5jNlEnyn5RGfptEQYULSOyrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:694096'),
  ('1009742894108949789', 'Rage', 2023, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Jorge Michel Grau, Santiago Sánchez S.', 'Jorge Michel Grau', 'Maximiliano Nájar Márquez, Juan Manuel Bernal, Mayra Batalla, Francisco Barreiro, Angelina Peláez, Gilberto Barraza, Octavio Michel Grau, Marco Antonio Argueta', null, 'Alan and his father Alberto flee from the painful loss of his mother. While hiding in a secluded housing unit, Alan discovers hidden messages from his uncle that lead him to believe that his father is a werewolf. His life and his neighbors’ lives are in danger. Alan decides to do something once for all. Destroying the beast does not seem a far-fetched plan in the violent reality he lives day by day.', 'Alan and his father Alberto flee from the painful loss of his mother. While hiding in a secluded housing unit, Alan discovers hidden messages from his uncle that lead him to believe that his father is a werewolf. His life and his neighbors’ lives are in danger. Alan decides to do something once for all. Destroying the beast does not seem a far-fetched plan in the violent reality he lives day by day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOUqBfCtfud4ixOiftKom5ULfgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1129932'),
  ('573233841267138786', 'Rage and Honor', 1992, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Terence H. Winkless, Thomas L. Callaway, James Lawrence Spencer', 'Terence H. Winkless', 'Cynthia Rothrock, Richard Norton, Brian Thompson, Catherine Bach, Stephen Davies, Terri Treas, Toshishiro Obata, Patrick Malone', 'R', 'Witnessing a drug deal involving local gang members and cops, an Australian police officer feels he can no longer be just an observer. He joins forces with a local teacher, who just happens to be a karate expert, and together they try to take back the streets.', 'Witnessing a drug deal involving local gang members and cops, an Australian police officer feels he can no longer be just an observer. He joins forces with a local teacher, who just happens to be a karate expert, and together they try to take back the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hp45EzXPChmbTx0QunUaFmBB3RN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66853'),
