  ('1098839980230177646', 'Rage at Dawn', 1955, 'Action, Western', 'Tim Whelan, Ray Rennahan, Nathan Barragar', 'Horace McCoy', 'Randolph Scott, Forrest Tucker, Mala Powers, J. Carrol Naish, Edgar Buchanan, Myron Healey, Denver Pyle, Kenneth Tobey', 'NR', 'In this film''s version of the story, four of the Reno Brothers are corrupt robbers and killers while a fifth, Clint is a respected Indiana farmer. A sister, Laura, who has inherited the family home, serves the outlaw brothers as a housekeeper and cook. One brother is killed when they go after a bank, the men of the town appear to have been waiting for them…', 'In this film''s version of the story, four of the Reno Brothers are corrupt robbers and killers while a fifth, Clint is a respected Indiana farmer. A sister, Laura, who has inherited the family home, serves the outlaw brothers as a housekeeper and cook. One brother is killed when they go after a bank, the men of the town appear to have been waiting for them…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oL49nHaB2SnhCDUHLcqqSBzcoXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22408'),
