  ('824458815161599646', 'Rage Net', 1988, 'Animation', 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Another of Brakhage’s works of “moving visual thinking,” Rage Net reminds one of the vibrant pioneering experiments of European animators of the 1920s.', 'Another of Brakhage’s works of “moving visual thinking,” Rage Net reminds one of the vibrant pioneering experiments of European animators of the 1920s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slk5efZaeqnJY6O8iBZOr0ZmOjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126200'),
