  ('129144384251174143', 'Rage to Kill', 1988, 'Action, Thriller', 'David Winters, Neal Sundstrom', 'Ian Yule, David Winters', 'James Ryan, Oliver Reed, Cameron Mitchell, Henry Cele, Ian Yule, Maxine John, Sydney Chama, Liam Cundill', null, 'Race-car driver Blaine Striker grows concerned about his younger brother, a student at a medical school on the Caribbean island of St. Heron. General Turner has led a violent coup on this island and may be planning to blow up the school in order to blame the destruction on counterrevolutionaries. Striker infiltrates St. Heron, is captured, stripped to his tighty-whiteys, and electrotortured. He escapes, joins forces with the counterrevolutionaries, and foils a plot to assemble Russian missiles on the island.', 'Race-car driver Blaine Striker grows concerned about his younger brother, a student at a medical school on the Caribbean island of St. Heron. General Turner has led a violent coup on this island and may be planning to blow up the school in order to blame the destruction on counterrevolutionaries. Striker infiltrates St. Heron, is captured, stripped to his tighty-whiteys, and electrotortured. He escapes, joins forces with the counterrevolutionaries, and foils a plot to assemble Russian missiles on the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5vRP3Bfm7C70jjKMJrbzIYpIRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292754'),
  ('766672919139572691', 'Raggedy Ann & Andy: A Musical Adventure!', 1977, 'Animation, Adventure, Music, Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Richard Williams, Al Rezek, Dick Mingalone', 'Max Wilk, Patricia Thackray', 'Claire Williams, Didi Conn, Mark Baker, Fred Stuthman, Niki Flacks, George S. Irving, Arnold Stang, Joe Silver', 'G', 'Raggedy Ann and Andy, along with other toys, reside in the nursery of a little girl named Marcella. During Marcella''s seventh birthday, Babette, from France, is introduced as the new doll from a large package. Meanwhile, the lecherous Captain Contagious kidnaps Babette in his pirate ship and escapes from the nursery. Ann and Andy must explore and find Babette in the Deep Deep Woods to save her.', 'Raggedy Ann and Andy, along with other toys, reside in the nursery of a little girl named Marcella. During Marcella''s seventh birthday, Babette, from France, is introduced as the new doll from a large package. Meanwhile, the lecherous Captain Contagious kidnaps Babette in his pirate ship and escapes from the nursery. Ann and Andy must explore and find Babette in the Deep Deep Woods to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdfIZdSKV1myFdgN4LVVbYDGJHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36748'),
  ('216374853625498269', 'Raggedy Ann & Andy: The Great Santa Claus Caper', 1978, 'Animation, Family', 'Chuck Jones', 'Chuck Jones', 'June Foray, Daws Butler, Les Tremayne', 'G', 'When inventor/efficiency expert Alexander Graham Wolf plots to take over Santa''s workshop, Comet asks for help from Raggedy Ann, Andy and their dog, Raggedy Arthur.', 'When inventor/efficiency expert Alexander Graham Wolf plots to take over Santa''s workshop, Comet asks for help from Raggedy Ann, Andy and their dog, Raggedy Arthur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBx2A4938OiJeD8NVKbDtoNPqQS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32933'),
  ('1116716448918209274', 'Raggedy Man', 1981, 'Drama', 'Jack Fisk, Ralf D. Bode', 'William D. Wittliff', 'Sissy Spacek, Eric Roberts, Sam Shepard, William Sanderson, Tracey Walter, R.G. Armstrong, Henry Thomas, Carey Hollis Jr.', 'PG', 'Nita, a divorced mother of two boys, is stuck working as a telephone operator in a small Texas town in World War II. Her friendship with a sailor on leave causes tongues to wag in town.', 'Nita, a divorced mother of two boys, is stuck working as a telephone operator in a small Texas town in World War II. Her friendship with a sailor on leave causes tongues to wag in town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYYAq3645BZPwdmfw7rsSTp8HFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96966'),
  ('729534245147836778', 'Raging Angels', 1995, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Alan Smithee, Bryan England, Michael A. Allowitz', 'David Markov, Chris Bittler, Kevin Rock', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Diane Ladd, Monet Mazur, Michael Paré, Arielle Dombasle, Shelley Winters, Aileen Allado-Jones, Michael Bishop', 'R', 'Two musicians are unknowingly drawn into a supernatural scheme.', 'Two musicians are unknowingly drawn into a supernatural scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHpqWuEDWhRFdwAjmvfdPdi1iml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84726'),
  ('223728562666002484', 'Raging Fire', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Adventure, Mystery', 'Edmond Fung Yuen-Man, Donnie Yen, Benny Chan Muk-Sing', 'Tim Tong Yiu-Leung, Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Ryan Ling Wai-Chun', 'Donnie Yen, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Qin Lan, Ray Lui, Simon Yam, Ben Yuen Foo-Wah, Ben Lam Kwok-Bun, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong', 'NR', 'Cheung Sung-bong is a highly respected cop with a long history of success in dangerous cases. However, his past soon comes back to haunt him when a former protégé resurfaces, seeking revenge.', 'Cheung Sung-bong is a highly respected cop with a long history of success in dangerous cases. However, his past soon comes back to haunt him when a former protégé resurfaces, seeking revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flFQEHlW4omcU47jwgNKPw7SpF3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513692'),
  ('253499805706493577', 'Raging Grace', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror, Comedy, Mystery', 'Paris Zarcilla, Joel Honeywell, Carlotta Beck Peccoz', 'Paris Zarcilla, Pancake Zarcilla', 'Leanne Best, Max Eigenmann, Jaeden Paige Boadilla, Rob Pomfret, Eva Jane Willis, David Hayman, Caleb Johnston-Miller, Oliver Wellington', null, 'An undocumented Filipina immigrant lands a job as a careworker for a seemingly terminal old man, securing a better life for her and her daughter. But a dark discovery threatens to destroy everything she’s strived for and holds dear.', 'An undocumented Filipina immigrant lands a job as a careworker for a seemingly terminal old man, securing a better life for her and her daughter. But a dark discovery threatens to destroy everything she’s strived for and holds dear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mu7vmxuZGAUZCJ5jxqpmpk0CPFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879689'),
  ('501609654707478224', 'Raging Phoenix', 2009, 'Thriller, Action', 'Rashane Limtrakul, Tiwa Moeithaisong, Chalerm Wongpim', 'Sompope Vejchapipat', 'JeeJa Yanin, Kazu Patrick Tang, Nui Saendaeng, Sompong Leartvimolkasame, Boonprasert Salangam, Roongtawan Jindasing, Marc Hoang, David Bueno', null, 'A young girl joins hands with a group of kung-fu masters to stop a notorious gang from abducting young women. However, the mission is compromised after they fail to locate the gang''s hideout.', 'A young girl joins hands with a group of kung-fu masters to stop a notorious gang from abducting young women. However, the mission is compromised after they fail to locate the gang''s hideout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56XtvAUgRzd2rfF8Jt02qBHFdBF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25855'),
  ('279671687575498882', 'Raging Rose', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julia Kowalski, Simon Beaufils', 'Julia Kowalski', 'Liv Henneguier, Yoann Zimmer, Andrzej Chyra, Artur Steranko, Léa Mesnil, Jean-Baptiste Sagory, Fabienne Rocaboy, Juliane Lepoureau', null, 'Jozef travels from Poland to France to work and to find his son Roman, who he abandoned 15 years earlier. Jozef works for a Polish immigrant family that has successfully settled in France. Rose, the family’s teenaged daughter, volunteers to help him find his son. Roman happens to go to the same school as Rose, and she finds him attractive. After an unexpectedly wonderful experience with Roman, she falls desperately in love with him.', 'Jozef travels from Poland to France to work and to find his son Roman, who he abandoned 15 years earlier. Jozef works for a Polish immigrant family that has successfully settled in France. Rose, the family’s teenaged daughter, volunteers to help him find his son. Roman happens to go to the same school as Rose, and she finds him attractive. After an unexpectedly wonderful experience with Roman, she falls desperately in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TKbkdrqss1BNDNA9gjcmnTi2w7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361260'),
  ('1013852623943560459', 'Raging Sharks', 2005, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Danny Lerner, Bilyana Buchmann, Emil Topuzov', 'Les Weldon', 'Corin Nemec, Vanessa Angel, Corbin Bernsen, Todd Jensen, Elise Muller, Simona Williams, Atanas Srebrev, Emil Markov', null, 'An oceanic observation station is in desperate trouble after a sudden shark attack wrecked the oxygen supply. The accompanying ship, a coast guard cruiser, and other ships in and around the Bermuda triangle are attacked as well. The US Navy sends a submarine to investigate, but soon they too are under attack.', 'An oceanic observation station is in desperate trouble after a sudden shark attack wrecked the oxygen supply. The accompanying ship, a coast guard cruiser, and other ships in and around the Bermuda triangle are attacked as well. The US Navy sends a submarine to investigate, but soon they too are under attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RcJpjgIG8fU4EwmmLg9OKLfRmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27727'),
  ('462022365338380193', 'Raging Sun, Raging Sky', 2009, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Julián Hernández, Alejandro Cantú', 'Julián Hernández', 'Jorge Becerra, Javier Oliván, Joaquín Rodríguez, Juan Carlos Torres, Fabian Storniolo, Harold Torres, Baltimore Beltrán, Ruben Santiago', null, 'A story of love, sex and destiny. Youthful Kieri and Ryo share a deep and passionate love for each other. Kieri sets off in search of his soul mate after Ryo is kidnapped. A female spirit is with Kieri as he searches for Ryo. Ryo escapes and the pair will have to work hard to prove their love for each other as obstacles are placed in their path along the way.', 'A story of love, sex and destiny. Youthful Kieri and Ryo share a deep and passionate love for each other. Kieri sets off in search of his soul mate after Ryo is kidnapped. A female spirit is with Kieri as he searches for Ryo. Ryo escapes and the pair will have to work hard to prove their love for each other as obstacles are placed in their path along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDGjcNtjcqU8jPSh4ide0Sm8x1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161246'),
  ('448453086768729834', 'Ragini MMS', 2011, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Pavan Kirpalani, Tribhuvan Babu Sadineni', 'Mayank Tewaari', 'Kainaz Motivala, Rajkummar Rao, Rajat Kaul, Janice, Shernaza, Mangala Ahire, Vinod Rawat, Harshraj Shroff', null, 'Out to relax and have fun at a farmhouse, a couple experience horror at the hands of an unknown entity', 'Out to relax and have fun at a farmhouse, a couple experience horror at the hands of an unknown entity', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eABMkxPnI3Rfkv0qJw0XyuXQ2iC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66841'),
  ('54359831090082498', 'Ragini MMS 2', 2014, 'Horror', 'Bhushan Patel', 'Ishita Moitra', 'Sunny Leone, Saahil Prem, Parvin Dabas, Sandhya Mridul, Divya Dutta, Soniya Mehra, Anita Hassanandani Reddy, Karan Veer Mehra', null, 'A sleazy film director''s decision to shoot his latest erotic horror movie in a notorious haunted house angers the vengeful spirit of its past inhabitant.', 'A sleazy film director''s decision to shoot his latest erotic horror movie in a notorious haunted house angers the vengeful spirit of its past inhabitant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dshVXLMzT1cJirbwYR477u4z5dJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260266'),
  ('118324715151770567', 'Ragnarok', 2013, 'Action, Adventure', 'Mikkel Brænne Sandemose, Daniel Voldheim, Kristian Mejdell Nissen', 'John Kåre Raake', 'Pål Sverre Hagen, Nicolai Cleve Broch, Sofia Helin, Bjørn Sundquist, Maria Annette Tanderød Berglyd, Julian Podolski, Terje Strømdahl, Kyrre Haugen Sydness', null, 'Archaeologist Sigurd Svendsen discovers that the Oseberg ship hides a secret from the Viking Age. Along with his two children put Sigurd out on a quest to find the truth. The mystery leads them into "No Man''s Land" between Norway and Russia where no man traveling in modern times. Old runes take on new meaning when the secret they uncover is more frightening than anyone could have imagined.', 'Archaeologist Sigurd Svendsen discovers that the Oseberg ship hides a secret from the Viking Age. Along with his two children put Sigurd out on a quest to find the truth. The mystery leads them into "No Man''s Land" between Norway and Russia where no man traveling in modern times. Old runes take on new meaning when the secret they uncover is more frightening than anyone could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7io1VfX1sRta46vb4aHBnHWgCGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140818'),
  ('1083526257480217303', 'Rags', 2012, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Bille Woodruff, Glen Winter', 'Jason Fuchs, Hilary Galanoy, Elizabeth Hackett', 'Keke Palmer, Max Schneider, Isaiah Mustafa, Avan Jogia, Drake Bell, Burkely Duffield, Robert Moloney, Keenan Tracey', null, 'Rags follows the story of Charlie Prince, an orphan living with his acerbic and unloving stepfather and spoiled, simple-minded stepbrothers. Charlie''s dream is to be a singer, and while he is vocally talented and can write music, he can''t seem to catch a break. Kadee Worth, on the other hand, is the daughter of music mogul Reginald Worth and is an international pop phenomenon. While the world knows her as a glamorous superstar, she is secretly frustrated with singing other people''s songs and wearing clothes other people choose for her. Kadee wants the world to hear and see her true talent. Despite every obstacle that gets thrown in their way, once Charlie and Kadee find one another, they each finally get what they have been looking for – a voice, a stage, an audience and each other.', 'Rags follows the story of Charlie Prince, an orphan living with his acerbic and unloving stepfather and spoiled, simple-minded stepbrothers. Charlie''s dream is to be a singer, and while he is vocally talented and can write music, he can''t seem to catch a break. Kadee Worth, on the other hand, is the daughter of music mogul Reginald Worth and is an international pop phenomenon. While the world knows her as a glamorous superstar, she is secretly frustrated with singing other people''s songs and wearing clothes other people choose for her. Kadee wants the world to hear and see her true talent. Despite every obstacle that gets thrown in their way, once Charlie and Kadee find one another, they each finally get what they have been looking for – a voice, a stage, an audience and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CfrXWMeGcMlisL1YRCgpFMWiER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110490'),
  ('47177159919501466', 'Ragtime', 1981, 'Drama, History', 'Miloš Forman, Miroslav Ondříček, Michael Stevenson', 'Michael Weller', 'James Cagney, Brad Dourif, Moses Gunn, Elizabeth McGovern, Kenneth McMillan, Pat O''Brien, Donald O''Connor, James Olson', 'PG', 'A young black pianist becomes embroiled in the lives of an upper-class white family set among the racial tensions, infidelity, violence, and other nostalgic events in early 1900s New York City.', 'A young black pianist becomes embroiled in the lives of an upper-class white family set among the racial tensions, infidelity, violence, and other nostalgic events in early 1900s New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRjyakxRrMfj6sgyUJte9mVI1D9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25566'),
  ('904415297004215927', 'Rahasya', 2015, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Manish Gupta', 'Manish Gupta', 'Kay Kay Menon, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Tisca Chopra, Mita Vashisht, Shivkumar Subramaniam, Kunal Sharma, Ashwini Kalsekar, Nimai Bali', null, 'Only child of a doctor couple is murdered in her sleep inside their large duplex apartment.', 'Only child of a doctor couple is murdered in her sleep inside their large duplex apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kU5E9jP1a6IVmm8F3syqsKbF4W2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325389'),
  ('993555772836946955', 'Rahtree Reborn', 2009, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Yuthlert Sippapak, Yukontorn Mingmongkon, Ittisak Eusunthornwattana', 'Yuthlert Sippapak', 'Chermarn Boonyasak, Mario Maurer, Santisuk Promsiri, Nattawan Saksiri, Chantana Kittiyapan, Somlek Sakdikul, Suthon Wechkama, Saichia Wongwirot', null, 'Buppha is reincarnated as a young girl who is deserted by her mother to the stepfather barber. With anger, he often beats her. She turns to be a problem child who also does not get along with classmates.', 'Buppha is reincarnated as a young girl who is deserted by her mother to the stepfather barber. With anger, he often beats her. She turns to be a problem child who also does not get along with classmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLXv53JP108znsLIJcZ6aBnoGxC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62174'),
  ('326632523443429114', 'Rahtree: Flower of the Night', 2003, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Yuthlert Sippapak, Prapop Duangpikul', 'Yuthlert Sippapak', 'Chermarn Boonyasak, Kris Srepoomseth, Chompunuch Piyapanee, Sirisin Siripornsmathikul, Ampon Rattanawong, Traiphop Buaban, Supoj Pongpancharoen, Somjai Sukjai', null, 'A playboy cons a girl into bed and then leaves her after finding out she is pregnant with his child. She commits suicide alone in her apartment and her ghost haunts those nearby.', 'A playboy cons a girl into bed and then leaves her after finding out she is pregnant with his child. She commits suicide alone in her apartment and her ghost haunts those nearby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0trxLRDJroZUWS1XD11FjzeFcg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160266'),
  ('867005233613381860', 'Rahu Ketu', 2026, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Mystery, Romance, Adventure', 'Vipul Vig, Manoj Soni, Vaibhav Vishant', 'Vipul Vig', 'Pulkit Samrat, Varun Sharma, Shalini Pandey, Chunky Panday, Piyush Mishra', null, 'A writer''s magical notebook brings two bumbling characters to life. When a cunning girl steals the notebook, Rahu and Ketu must retrieve it while battling a drug mafia, discovering their true potential along the way.', 'A writer''s magical notebook brings two bumbling characters to life. When a cunning girl steals the notebook, Rahu and Ketu must retrieve it while battling a drug mafia, discovering their true potential along the way.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvmAVhMEgQ7puyRyaJMNCUe2QJWN.jpg', 'plex:movie:rahu-ketu-2026'),
  ('795804019989566117', 'Rahul', 2001, 'Drama', 'Prakash Jha', null, 'Neha, Yash Pathak, Rajeshwari Sachdev, Gulshan Grover, Parikshat Sahni, Mahesh Thakur, Manish Wadhwa, Tanvi Hegde', null, 'Mira (Neha) comes from a very wealthy family, however, she wants to get married to Akash Sharma (Jatin Grewal), who is not so wealthy. Against the wishes of her mother and brother, Mira gets married to Akash. The bad memories are left behind when Mira''s family finally "forgives" them, at the birth of baby-boy, Rahul (Yash Pathak). With the family with such a acrimonious past, coming together, their marriage deteriorates, to such an extent that they have to involve the police and the courts for purposes of custody. The only obstacle coming between the couple from getting married again to different people are marred by Rahul, who is unable to accept his parents'' divorce.', 'Mira (Neha) comes from a very wealthy family, however, she wants to get married to Akash Sharma (Jatin Grewal), who is not so wealthy. Against the wishes of her mother and brother, Mira gets married to Akash. The bad memories are left behind when Mira''s family finally "forgives" them, at the birth of baby-boy, Rahul (Yash Pathak). With the family with such a acrimonious past, coming together, their marriage deteriorates, to such an extent that they have to involve the police and the courts for purposes of custody. The only obstacle coming between the couple from getting married again to different people are marred by Rahul, who is unable to accept his parents'' divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2B3Xfp24iH8DheYXBFPRIpWp8r6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304139'),
  ('956000656182211538', 'RahXephon: Pluralitas Concentio', 2003, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Tomoki Kyoda, Yutaka Izubuchi, Yasuhiro Irie', 'Tomoki Kyoda', 'Hiro Shimono, Aya Hisakawa, Hirofumi Nojima, Houko Kuwashima, Ichiko Hashimoto, Jouji Nakata, Mitsuru Miyamoto, Yumi Kakazu', null, 'Ayato and Haruka are middle-school sweethearts whose lives take a dire turn when the mysterious Mu invade Tokyo in the year 2012. Protecting humanity from the Mu may be Ayato''s destiny, but what he really wants is to regain the relationship he once had with Haruka... a love that will have to transcend space, time, and reality itself.', 'Ayato and Haruka are middle-school sweethearts whose lives take a dire turn when the mysterious Mu invade Tokyo in the year 2012. Protecting humanity from the Mu may be Ayato''s destiny, but what he really wants is to regain the relationship he once had with Haruka... a love that will have to transcend space, time, and reality itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wK8yAt16bfQBaKBatAJxYRdpu9Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16860'),
  ('637797597850677401', 'Rai', 1995, 'Drama', 'Thomas Gilou, Bernard Bolzinger, Patrick Roques', 'Cyril Collard, Djamila Djabri, Massoud Hattou', 'Samy Naceri, Tabatha Cash, Fatiha Berber, Édouard Baer, Léa Drucker, Kouider Abdelmoumeni, Jo Prestia, Sandrine Le Berre', null, 'Raï is about a gang of youths in a Parisian suburb.This is the multicultural environment in which Mezz, Aziz, Laurent, Nordine, Poisson and the others have grown up. There is no future in Garges-les-Gonesses. Unemployment is high, drugs and violence are a part of everyday life. The opportunity to escape seems nonexistent.', 'Raï is about a gang of youths in a Parisian suburb.This is the multicultural environment in which Mezz, Aziz, Laurent, Nordine, Poisson and the others have grown up. There is no future in Garges-les-Gonesses. Unemployment is high, drugs and violence are a part of everyday life. The opportunity to escape seems nonexistent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/901dyJNYGpfBaBTLp1Crv8OcgvF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40910'),
  ('698903494700939393', 'Raid', 2003, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Tapio Piirainen, Jasmin Louhivuori, Timo Heinänen', 'Harri Nykänen, Tapio Piirainen', 'Kai Lehtinen, Mari Rantasila, Oiva Lohtander, Kirsti Valve, Pekka Huotari, Juha Muje, Markku Maalismaa, Harry Baer', null, 'Raid is a mysterious drifter and ex-criminal who comes and goes as he pleases. He has been away from the country for an extended period of time but learns on his return that his ex-girlfriend Tarja has presumably died in a fire that he soon discovers was a larceny. He is also contacted by inspector Jansson, who he knows from the past regarding the murder of a protestor. Raid begins his investigation and soon finds that there''s more to the cases than meets the eye.', 'Raid is a mysterious drifter and ex-criminal who comes and goes as he pleases. He has been away from the country for an extended period of time but learns on his return that his ex-girlfriend Tarja has presumably died in a fire that he soon discovers was a larceny. He is also contacted by inspector Jansson, who he knows from the past regarding the murder of a protestor. Raid begins his investigation and soon finds that there''s more to the cases than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvZP1504zfdegmLlOeKKbbGIxAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20375'),
  ('1048437716893013307', 'Raid', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Raj Kumar Gupta, Alphonse Roy', 'Ritesh Shah', 'Ajay Devgn, Saurabh Shukla, Ileana D''Cruz, Gayathri Iyer, Sheeba Chaddha, Amit Sial, Saanand Verma, Sulagna Panigrahi', null, 'After receiving an anonymous tip, a tax officer leads a raid on the mansion of the most powerful figure in Lucknow, a member of parliament who has been evading income tax for years.', 'After receiving an anonymous tip, a tax officer leads a raid on the mansion of the most powerful figure in Lucknow, a member of parliament who has been evading income tax for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qx3m9mRUmDZUVQeAe7CAzFX7xCB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503838'),
  ('978638524326571174', 'Raid 2', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Raj Kumar Gupta, Sudhir K Chaudhary, Nav Nirman Singh', 'Raj Kumar Gupta, Ritesh Shah, Jaideep Yadav', 'Ajay Devgn, Riteish Deshmukh, Vaani Kapoor, Saurabh Shukla, Rajat Kapoor, Sushil Dahiya, Amit Sial, Supriya Pathak', null, 'Set seven years after the events of the first film, it follows the return of IRS officer Amay Patnaik, who is attempting to take down a seemingly benevolent politician.', 'Set seven years after the events of the first film, it follows the return of IRS officer Amay Patnaik, who is attempting to take down a seemingly benevolent politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/562SAxZP1sLuYqDDTuODu3hdGyx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1227128'),
  ('730472426858990434', 'Raid on Entebbe', 1976, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie, History', 'Irvin Kershner, Bill Butler', 'Barry Beckerman', 'Charles Bronson, Peter Finch, Yaphet Kotto, Martin Balsam, Horst Buchholz, John Saxon, Jack Warden, Sylvia Sidney', null, 'Based on a true operation by Israeli commandos. An Air France flight is hijacked by the Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine. The airplane landed in Uganda. The terrorists released some passengers, keeping 94 Jews and 12 air crew hostage. The Israeli government would not negotiate. A rescue plan was devised, and less than 100 commandos were flown across Africa to rescue the passengers in surprisingly successful operation.', 'Based on a true operation by Israeli commandos. An Air France flight is hijacked by the Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine. The airplane landed in Uganda. The terrorists released some passengers, keeping 94 Jews and 12 air crew hostage. The Israeli government would not negotiate. A rescue plan was devised, and less than 100 commandos were flown across Africa to rescue the passengers in surprisingly successful operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cv8pNmEztyV680TeTqp5m9duX0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31690'),
  ('133927580041716598', 'Raid on Rommel', 1971, 'War, Action', 'Earl Rath, James Fargo, Henry Hathaway', 'Richard M. Bluel', 'Richard Burton, John Colicos, Wolfgang Preiss, Clinton Greyn, Danielle De Metz, Karl-Otto Alberty, Christopher Cary, John Orchard', 'PG', 'Captain Foster plans on raiding German-occupied Tobruk with hand- picked commandos, but a mixup leaves him with a medical unit led by a Quaker conscientious objector.', 'Captain Foster plans on raiding German-occupied Tobruk with hand- picked commandos, but a mixup leaves him with a medical unit led by a Quaker conscientious objector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXsYwl8p4MWPC0lvZRItgHlR7vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53657'),
  ('171917184650365706', 'Raid on the Lethal Zone', 2023, 'Action', 'Herman Yau, Mandy Ngai Man-Yin', null, 'Ou Hao, Jason Koo, Yu Haoming, Alan Aruna, Huang Yao, Shao Bing, Gao Zhiting, Wang Yutian', null, 'In the 1990s, an armed police team in the south-western border of China encounter floods and drug traffickers while on a mission, resulting in heavy casualties. In order to avenge their dead comrades, the survivors launched a final confrontation against the drug dealers.', 'In the 1990s, an armed police team in the south-western border of China encounter floods and drug traffickers while on a mission, resulting in heavy casualties. In order to avenge their dead comrades, the survivors launched a final confrontation against the drug dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VSuB0kB5wtLfs9wLpUieRa6vvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1126608'),
  ('550880021784297578', 'Raiders of Atlantis', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli, Ruggero Deodato', 'Tito Carpi, Vincenzo Mannino', 'Christopher Connelly, Gioia Scola, Tony King, Stefano Mingardo, Ivan Rassimov, Giancarlo Prati, Bruce Baron, George Hilton', null, 'A team of scientists working to raise a sunken Russian nuclear submarine on an ocean platform off the coast of Miami, Florida, unearth an ancient Atlantean relic from the sea floor and bring in an expert to make some sense of it. But while attempting to raise the sub, radioactive leakage from its missles triggers the re-emergence of Atlantis, and the resulting tidal wave destroys the platform and leaves only a small group of survivors. Rescued by two Vietnamvets-turned-heavies who are out relaxing after their latest job, their boat eventually runs aground on a Carribean island nearby where, upon going ashore, it is discovered that everything has been destroyed and everybody killed. The culprits, a vicious group of well-armed raiders, and their leader, Crystal Skull, are descendants of Atlantis'' original race who set about reclaiming the world and adding the survivors to the list of victims as they struggle to stay alive and defeat the raiders and send Atlantis back to the ocean floor.', 'A team of scientists working to raise a sunken Russian nuclear submarine on an ocean platform off the coast of Miami, Florida, unearth an ancient Atlantean relic from the sea floor and bring in an expert to make some sense of it. But while attempting to raise the sub, radioactive leakage from its missles triggers the re-emergence of Atlantis, and the resulting tidal wave destroys the platform and leaves only a small group of survivors. Rescued by two Vietnamvets-turned-heavies who are out relaxing after their latest job, their boat eventually runs aground on a Carribean island nearby where, upon going ashore, it is discovered that everything has been destroyed and everybody killed. The culprits, a vicious group of well-armed raiders, and their leader, Crystal Skull, are descendants of Atlantis'' original race who set about reclaiming the world and adding the survivors to the list of victims as they struggle to stay alive and defeat the raiders and send Atlantis back to the ocean floor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNeaKk9Wy345IvoU1h67J2IdldS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29173'),
  ('287397058785366951', 'Raiders of the Living Dead', 1986, 'Horror', 'Samuel M. Sherman, Douglas Meltzer', 'Brett Piper, Samuel M. Sherman', 'Scott Schwartz, Robert Deveau, Donna Asali, Robert Allen, Robert A. Sacchetti, Zita Johann, Corri Burt, Leonard Corman', 'PG-13', 'In an abandoned prison, a doctor has revived executed convicts as the living dead. Teenager, Jonathan creates a laser gun from a videodisc player and pursues the walking dead, aided by his girlfriend and grandfather. Also tracking down the zombies is a tabloid reporter.', 'In an abandoned prison, a doctor has revived executed convicts as the living dead. Teenager, Jonathan creates a laser gun from a videodisc player and pursues the walking dead, aided by his girlfriend and grandfather. Also tracking down the zombies is a tabloid reporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SfKZpV0Scw74lluMwLtWTXVGFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45031'),
  ('911294239169425024', 'Raiders of the Lost Ark', 1981, 'Adventure, Action', 'Steven Spielberg, Douglas Slocombe, Michael D. Moore', 'Lawrence Kasdan', 'Harrison Ford, Karen Allen, Paul Freeman, John Rhys-Davies, Ronald Lacey, Wolf Kahler, Anthony Higgins, Denholm Elliott', 'PG', 'When Dr. Indiana Jones – the tweed-suited professor who just happens to be a celebrated archaeologist – is hired by the government to locate the legendary Ark of the Covenant, he finds himself up against the entire Nazi regime.', 'When Dr. Indiana Jones – the tweed-suited professor who just happens to be a celebrated archaeologist – is hired by the government to locate the legendary Ark of the Covenant, he finds himself up against the entire Nazi regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceG9VzoRAVGwivFU403Wc3AHRys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85'),
  ('626644198159849424', 'Raiders of the Lost Library', 2022, 'Action, Adventure', 'Vasily Grigolyunas, Gleb Orlov, Varvara Belous', 'Andrey Zolotarev', 'Tikhon Zhiznevsky, Aleksey Serebryakov, Diana Pozharskaya, Artyom Tkachenko, Sergey Gazarov, Andrey Trushin, Pavel Gayduchenko, Albina Evtushevskaya', null, 'During the construction of the metropolitan metro, workers discover a precious salary, which proves that the legendary Library of Ivan the Terrible exists. But the find turns out to be forgotten for many years, and already in our time it falls into the hands of the unsuspecting Ilya. Now his life is in danger, because powerful forces are hunting for an ancient artifact.', 'During the construction of the metropolitan metro, workers discover a precious salary, which proves that the legendary Library of Ivan the Terrible exists. But the find turns out to be forgotten for many years, and already in our time it falls into the hands of the unsuspecting Ilya. Now his life is in danger, because powerful forces are hunting for an ancient artifact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lc0KueWbDDwIsg76JnPohA7jday.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732684'),
  ('228595169483527711', 'Raiders!: The Story of the Greatest Fan Film Ever Made', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Jeremy Coon, Tim Skousen, Tim Irwin', 'Tim Skousen, Jeremy Coon', 'John Rhys-Davies, Eli Roth, Eric Zala, Chris Strompolos, Jayson Lamb, Kurt Zala, Angela Rodriguez, Guy Klender', null, 'In 1982, three 11 year-olds in Mississippi set out to remake their favorite film: Raiders of the Lost Ark. It took seven turbulent years that tested the limits of their friendship and nearly burned down their mother''s house. By the end, they had completed every scene except one... the explosive airplane scene. 30 years later, they attempt to finally realize their childhood dream by building a replica of the 75 foot "Flying Wing" plane from Raiders in a mud pit in the backwoods of Mississippi... and then blow it up! This is the story behind the making of what is known as "the greatest fan film ever made."', 'In 1982, three 11 year-olds in Mississippi set out to remake their favorite film: Raiders of the Lost Ark. It took seven turbulent years that tested the limits of their friendship and nearly burned down their mother''s house. By the end, they had completed every scene except one... the explosive airplane scene. 30 years later, they attempt to finally realize their childhood dream by building a replica of the 75 foot "Flying Wing" plane from Raiders in a mud pit in the backwoods of Mississippi... and then blow it up! This is the story behind the making of what is known as "the greatest fan film ever made."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaFbT76lzFpPhwX3vHWEgNGSgkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329697'),
  ('364298373805467032', 'Raigyo', 1997, 'Drama', 'Takahisa Zeze, Kōichi Saitō, Rei Sakamoto', 'Takahisa Zeze, Kishū Izuchi', 'Moe Sakura, Takeshi Itō, Takuji Suzuki, Kazuma Honda, Bunmei Tobayama, Kazuhiro Sano, Tomohiro Okada, Kazuya Sasaki', null, 'A black clad woman murders a man that she had just met by chance through a phone sex club.', 'A black clad woman murders a man that she had just met by chance through a phone sex club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVVRdRLuYSlWp350QJ5l78BLhSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36279'),
  ('49944718787446707', 'Railroad Man', 1999, 'Drama', 'Yasuo Furuhata, Daisaku Kimura', 'Yoshiki Iwama', 'Ken Takakura, Hirosue Ryoko, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Masanobu Ando, Ken Shimura, Shinobu Otake, Tomoko Naraoka, Yoshiko Tanaka', null, 'A railway stationmaster at a dying end-of-the-line village in Hokkaido is haunted by memories of his dead wife and daughter. When the railroad line is scheduled to be closed, he is offered a job at a hotel, but he is emotionally unable to part with his career as a railroader. His life takes a turn when he meets a young woman with an interest in trains who resembles his daughter.', 'A railway stationmaster at a dying end-of-the-line village in Hokkaido is haunted by memories of his dead wife and daughter. When the railroad line is scheduled to be closed, he is offered a job at a hotel, but he is emotionally unable to part with his career as a railroader. His life takes a turn when he meets a young woman with an interest in trains who resembles his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJJA9ZuTzEItugZ5wfT7Nh8xI5Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68837'),
  ('926596899836887462', 'Railroad Tigers', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family, War', 'Ding Sheng, Ding Yu', 'Ding Sheng, He Keke', 'Jackie Chan, Huang Zitao, Jaycee Chan, Wang Kai, Xu Fan, Hiroyuki Ikeuchi, Sang Ping, Alan Ng Wing-Lun', 'NR', 'A railroad worker in China in 1941 leads a team of freedom fighters against the Japanese in order to get food for the poor.', 'A railroad worker in China in 1941 leads a team of freedom fighters against the Japanese in order to get food for the poor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aSkP9geZCbqIoxjF7Jy9dT8UfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377447'),
