  ('635568436177167694', 'Rails Into Laramie', 1954, 'Western', 'Jesse Hibbs, Maury Gertsman', 'Borden Chase, Joseph Hoffman, D.D. Beauchamp', 'John Payne, Mari Blanchard, Dan Duryea, Joyce Mackenzie, Barton MacLane, Ralph Dumke, Harry Shannon, James Griffith', 'NR', 'A federal agent arrives in Laramie to try to find out who is behind the efforts to stop the construction of a new railroad track.', 'A federal agent arrives in Laramie to try to find out who is behind the efforts to stop the construction of a new railroad track.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSLFh1PLLJLPJeTT2i6cS7lbLVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232358'),
