  ('972816570083978394', 'Railway Station', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Witold Stok', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', null, null, 'Warsaw''s Central Railway Station. ''Someone has fallen asleep, someone''s waiting for somebody else. Maybe they''ll come, maybe they won''t. The film is about people looking for something.', 'Warsaw''s Central Railway Station. ''Someone has fallen asleep, someone''s waiting for somebody else. Maybe they''ll come, maybe they won''t. The film is about people looking for something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4xG9QoCx2zXc8iP3jQVLYDHiMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125'),
  ('136459293343974799', 'Rain', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Joris Ivens, Mannus Franken, Joris Ivens', 'Mannus Franken, Joris Ivens', null, null, 'A lyrical portrait of Amsterdam and its changing appearance during a rain-shower.', 'A lyrical portrait of Amsterdam and its changing appearance during a rain-shower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rRANEg8Wr2Z3QWP0EKPUXURTO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128284'),
  ('680476107520915488', 'Rain', 1932, 'Drama', 'Lewis Milestone, Oliver T. Marsh, Nate Watt', 'Maxwell Anderson', 'Joan Crawford, Walter Huston, Matt Moore, Guy Kibbee, William Gargan, Beulah Bondi, Kendall Lee, Fred Howard', 'NR', 'Due to a possible cholera epidemic onboard, passengers on a ship are forced to disembark at Pago Pago, a small village on a Pacific island where it incessantly rains. Among the stranded passengers are Sadie Thompson, a prostitute, and Alfred Davidson, a fanatic missionary who will try to redeem her.', 'Due to a possible cholera epidemic onboard, passengers on a ship are forced to disembark at Pago Pago, a small village on a Pacific island where it incessantly rains. Among the stranded passengers are Sadie Thompson, a prostitute, and Alfred Davidson, a fanatic missionary who will try to redeem her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loiZCnkxAiSDyFmCAsUoTm62CAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61369'),
  ('312569834339754722', 'Rain', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Toon, Christine Jeffs', 'Christine Jeffs', 'Alicia Fulford-Wierzbicki, Sarah Peirse, Alistair Browning, Marton Csokas, Alastair Browning, Aaron Murphy, Alison Routledge, David Taylor', null, 'Janey is on vacation with her family at their beach house on the Mahurangi Peninsula in New Zealand. Her parents, Ed and Kate, are on the verge of divorce and sit around drinking whiskey all day, while Janey and Jim are left to their own devices. Cady, a local boaty who is having an affair with Kate, catches Janey''s pubescent eye.', 'Janey is on vacation with her family at their beach house on the Mahurangi Peninsula in New Zealand. Her parents, Ed and Kate, are on the verge of divorce and sit around drinking whiskey all day, while Janey and Jim are left to their own devices. Cady, a local boaty who is having an affair with Kate, catches Janey''s pubescent eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56TiWd7pdzYuFzObofLbKhFff7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69324'),
  ('1097105647497119734', 'Rain', 2008, 'Drama', 'Paula Hernández, Juan Lovece, Verónica Bruno', 'Paula Hernández', 'Valeria Bertuccelli, Ernesto Alterio, Inés Baum, Osvaldo Djeredjian, Alejo Mango, Edgardo Castro, Matias Umpierrez, Néstor Carniglia', null, 'Buenos Aires. It rains. Alma is in her car, stuck in Buenos Aires'' traffic. She has recently broken-up with her boyfriend, and she has been living in her little car since then. Suddenly, Roberto gets into the car. He''s wet and hurt, he''s tired of the rain, of broken dreams. He has come back after thirty years abroad. In this new city he has nothing and nobody, just a father in coma, whom he has no relationship. He promises to leave the car as soon as the rain ceases. Alma, not knowing exactly why lets him in. That night will be different. And the next few days too. There''s something new to find in the depth of their hearts.', 'Buenos Aires. It rains. Alma is in her car, stuck in Buenos Aires'' traffic. She has recently broken-up with her boyfriend, and she has been living in her little car since then. Suddenly, Roberto gets into the car. He''s wet and hurt, he''s tired of the rain, of broken dreams. He has come back after thirty years abroad. In this new city he has nothing and nobody, just a father in coma, whom he has no relationship. He promises to leave the car as soon as the rain ceases. Alma, not knowing exactly why lets him in. That night will be different. And the next few days too. There''s something new to find in the depth of their hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55J372rWzOCKT3UgRHZqhwj9SQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127445'),
  ('399805162532701309', 'Rain Fall', 2009, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'Max Mannix', 'Barry Eisler', 'Kippei Shiina, Gary Oldman, Misa Shimizu, Dirk Hunter, Akira Emoto, Shigemitsu Ogi, Toshiyuki Kitami, Takeshi Wakamatsu', null, 'A hit man looks to protect the daughter of one of his victims against CIA assassins.', 'A hit man looks to protect the daughter of one of his victims against CIA assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpcy33dy2fkUeUI45OZuDql1KVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27944'),
  ('1109679988137801420', 'Rain in the Sunshine', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance, Family', 'Hiroyasu Ishida, Yojiro Arai, Yoshikazu Iwanami', 'Hiroyasu Ishida', 'Anju Inami, Saori Hayami, Azusa Sato, Nozomi Furuki, Sakura Nakamura, Takayuki Tochizaki, Marika Kouno, Yuuki Kuwahara', null, 'Schoolboy Hinata has a big crush on his classmate Shigure, but is too shy to tell her. On the day Shigure is leaving, Hinata flies off on the wings of a bird chasing after her to tell how he feels!', 'Schoolboy Hinata has a big crush on his classmate Shigure, but is too shy to tell her. On the day Shigure is leaving, Hinata flies off on the wings of a bird chasing after her to tell how he feels!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hE41HOF9jGCNUyceyaUNDNNS52K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273450'),
  ('247222493945642157', 'Rain Main', 1998, 'Drama', 'Abolhassan Davoodi', 'Abolhassan Davoodi', 'Faramarz Gharibian, Mahtab Keramati, Roya Teymourian, Keyhan Maleki', null, 'A doctor graples with family difficulties while trying to find a cure for cancer.', 'A doctor graples with family difficulties while trying to find a cure for cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4TQvOfwpgY3seqOXWWyIEMz04P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842768'),
  ('867041906987386476', 'Rain Man', 1988, 'Drama', 'Barry Levinson, John Seale, Cara Giallanza', 'Ronald Bass, Barry Morrow', 'Dustin Hoffman, Tom Cruise, Valeria Golino, Gerald R. Molen, Jack Murdock, Michael D. Roberts, Ralph Seymour, Lucinda Jenney', 'R', 'When car dealer Charlie Babbitt learns that his estranged father has died, he returns home to Cincinnati, where he discovers that he has a savant older brother named Raymond and that his father''s $3 million fortune is being left to the mental institution in which Raymond lives. Motivated by his father''s money, Charlie checks Raymond out of the facility in order to return with him to Los Angeles. The brothers'' cross-country trip ends up changing both their lives.', 'When car dealer Charlie Babbitt learns that his estranged father has died, he returns home to Cincinnati, where he discovers that he has a savant older brother named Raymond and that his father''s $3 million fortune is being left to the mental institution in which Raymond lives. Motivated by his father''s money, Charlie checks Raymond out of the facility in order to return with him to Los Angeles. The brothers'' cross-country trip ends up changing both their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTNHwO896WKkaoPtpMMS74d8VNi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380'),
  ('1123719257383122045', 'Rain of Homs', 2017, 'Drama', 'Joud Saeed', null, null, null, 'Homs, the hero of the story, its old city wrote the story of Youssef and Yara in their search only for life, nothing but life, during the siege that lasted for a hundred and a few days. They did not choose to stay, did not choose the war, they fled from death so it searched for them.', 'Homs, the hero of the story, its old city wrote the story of Youssef and Yara in their search only for life, nothing but life, during the siege that lasted for a hundred and a few days. They did not choose to stay, did not choose the war, they fled from death so it searched for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpek1Xs87bIqMeQlhKgE2poa2hS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664407'),
  ('580405823103541450', 'Rain over Santiago', 1975, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Helvio Soto, Georges Barsky', 'Helvio Soto', 'Bibi Andersson, André Dussollier, Nicole Calfan, Riccardo Cucciolla, Bernard Fresson, Annie Girardot, Maurice Garrel, Serge Marquand', null, 'A semi-fictional account on the fatidic September 11, 1973, when the military commanded by General Pinochet took over the power from socialist president Salvador Allende, initiating a dictatorship that lasted until 1988 causing the deaths and disappearances of many people.', 'A semi-fictional account on the fatidic September 11, 1973, when the military commanded by General Pinochet took over the power from socialist president Salvador Allende, initiating a dictatorship that lasted until 1988 causing the deaths and disappearances of many people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BtHK9V8rDdgQgNUzmzqkZgH1DS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67441'),
  ('537842237867514142', 'Rain Town', 2011, 'Animation, Drama', 'Hiroyasu Ishida', 'Hiroyasu Ishida', null, null, 'In this town, since who knows when, rain has never stopped. Residents moved out to suburbs and high ground around. People’s memories are now deeply submerged. But into this forgotten rainy town sometimes, someone wanders.', 'In this town, since who knows when, rain has never stopped. Residents moved out to suburbs and high ground around. People’s memories are now deeply submerged. But into this forgotten rainy town sometimes, someone wanders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfeOjiQWXIAaxCYwUrPzoy1poXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230622'),
  ('740670971851809597', 'Rainbow', 1944, 'War, Drama', 'Boris Monastyrsky, Mark Donskoy, Oleksandr Babiy', 'Wanda Wasilewska', 'Nina Alisova, Nataliia Uzhvii, Yelena Tyapkina, Hans Klering, Anton Dunaiskyi, Valentyna Ivashova, Anna Lisyanskaya, Vladimir Chobur', null, 'The German conquerors are above nothing, not even the slaughter of small children, to break the spirit of their Soviet captives. Suffering more than most is Olga, a Soviet partisan who returns to the village to bear her child, only to endure the cruelest of arbitrary tortures at the hands of the Nazis. Eventually, the villagers rise up against their oppressors-but unexpectedly do not wipe them out, choosing instead to force the surviving Nazis to stand trial for their atrocities in a postwar "people''s court." (It is also implied that those who collaborated with the Germans will be dealt with in the same evenhanded fashion).', 'The German conquerors are above nothing, not even the slaughter of small children, to break the spirit of their Soviet captives. Suffering more than most is Olga, a Soviet partisan who returns to the village to bear her child, only to endure the cruelest of arbitrary tortures at the hands of the Nazis. Eventually, the villagers rise up against their oppressors-but unexpectedly do not wipe them out, choosing instead to force the surviving Nazis to stand trial for their atrocities in a postwar "people''s court." (It is also implied that those who collaborated with the Germans will be dealt with in the same evenhanded fashion).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33xp516eCDIUlXLz1L5UObQhXBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76271'),
  ('1126001601827800243', 'Rainbow', 2022, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Paco León, Marc Miró, Estrella Asensio', 'Paco León, Javier Gullón', 'Dora Postigo, Carmen Maura, Carmen Machi, Luis Bermejo, Áyax Pedrosa, Hovik Keuchkerian, Wekaforé Jibril, Cuentos Rosales', 'R', 'In search of her mother, a teenager and her eccentric group of companions set off on a journey, trying to avoid the clutches of a wicked woman.', 'In search of her mother, a teenager and her eccentric group of companions set off on a journey, trying to avoid the clutches of a wicked woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RVajiBhqJVwKIhUqSnRWBWhZA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960170'),
  ('662219869481621071', 'Rainbow Brite and the Star Stealer', 1985, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Kimio Yabuki, Bernard Deyriès, Hirokata Takahashi', 'Howard R. Cohen, Jean Chalopin, Howard R. Cohen', 'Bettina Bush, Pat Fraley, Peter Cullen, Robbie Lee, Andre Stojka, David Mendenhall, Rhonda Aldrich, Les Tremayne', 'G', 'Rainbow Brite, and her magical horse Starlite, must stop an evil princess and her underlings from taking over the planet Spectra. When they meet Orin, the wise Sprite tries to make the two children get along and work together to stop the evil Princess. Orin tells them that they can only destroy her by combining their own powers against her. Getting in the way of their mission is the sinister Murky Dismal and his bumbling assistant Lurky who, as usual, are lavishing in the new gloom created by the darkening of Spectra, as well as trying to steal Rainbow''s magical color belt.', 'Rainbow Brite, and her magical horse Starlite, must stop an evil princess and her underlings from taking over the planet Spectra. When they meet Orin, the wise Sprite tries to make the two children get along and work together to stop the evil Princess. Orin tells them that they can only destroy her by combining their own powers against her. Getting in the way of their mission is the sinister Murky Dismal and his bumbling assistant Lurky who, as usual, are lavishing in the new gloom created by the darkening of Spectra, as well as trying to steal Rainbow''s magical color belt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkWcd5DQSob8P4chI02yPLe52jd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47296'),
  ('489504333997569612', 'Rainbow Dance', 1936, 'Music, Animation', 'Len Lye', null, 'Rupert Doone', null, 'Rainbow Dance is a 1936 British animated film released by the GPO Film Unit. This is Lye''s second film. It uses the Gasparcolor process.', 'Rainbow Dance is a 1936 British animated film released by the GPO Film Unit. This is Lye''s second film. It uses the Gasparcolor process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eD0BQMWA5tJMQXntE3sHg5oOiVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145860'),
  ('572977995531508162', 'Rainbow Days', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ken Iizuka', 'Rika Nezu', 'Reo Sano, Taishi Nakagawa, Mahiro Takasugi, Ryusei Yokohama, Ai Yoshikawa, Yuri Tsunematsu, Mayu Hotta, Nozomi Bando', null, 'Nijiiro Days follows the colorful lives and romantic relationships of four high school boys—Natsuki Hashiba, a dreamer with delusions of love; Tomoya Matsunaga, a narcissistic playboy who has multiple girlfriends; Keiichi Katakura, a kinky sadist who always carries a whip; and Tsuyoshi Naoe, an otaku who has a cosplaying girlfriend.', 'Nijiiro Days follows the colorful lives and romantic relationships of four high school boys—Natsuki Hashiba, a dreamer with delusions of love; Tomoya Matsunaga, a narcissistic playboy who has multiple girlfriends; Keiichi Katakura, a kinky sadist who always carries a whip; and Tsuyoshi Naoe, an otaku who has a cosplaying girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7JamhiOwL9IVtDI56elUnidCr7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494082'),
  ('475687109441079133', 'Rainbow Eyes', 2007, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Yun-ho Yang, Baek Dong-hyeon, Park Gun-woo', 'Han Jeung-ae, Yun-ho Yang, Lee Jeong-sub', 'Kim Kang-woo, Kim Gyu-ri, Lee Soo-kyung, Park Won-sang, Jeon Chang-geol, Choi Deok-moon, Kim Sung-ryung, Kim Yoo-jung', null, 'Officers Cho Kyung-yoon and Park Eun-joo are on the hunt a killer following duo of ghastly murders. The victims carry a common military past, and the secret of their past must be unraveled to find the killer.', 'Officers Cho Kyung-yoon and Park Eun-joo are on the hunt a killer following duo of ghastly murders. The victims carry a common military past, and the secret of their past must be unraveled to find the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjm0T2PEG8ZqJiu4qwUDN5BQns7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38000'),
  ('663997871761911627', 'Rainbow in Mars', 2026, 'Adventure, Drama, Family, Science Fiction', 'Upie Guava, Muhamad Hafiz, Radytia Rubbik, Daffa Cisco Adhyaksal', 'Upie Guava, Alim Sudio', 'Keinaya Messi Gusti, Lutesha, Rio Dewanto, Livy Renata, Myesha Lin', 'TV-G', 'In the 2100s, as Earth faces a water crisis, Pelangi, the first child born on Mars, teams up with malfunctioning robots to find Zeolit Omega, a rare mineral that could save humanity, while a powerful corporation tries to seize it.', 'In the 2100s, as Earth faces a water crisis, Pelangi, the first child born on Mars, teams up with malfunctioning robots to find Zeolit Omega, a rare mineral that could save humanity, while a powerful corporation tries to seize it.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1ATBn02gkCFxxWfFHZPj53Cp25m.jpg', 'plex:movie:rainbow-in-mars'),
  ('159480058099960944', 'Rainbow Kids', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Kensho Yamashita, Kojiro Sato', 'Kihachi Okamoto', 'Ken Ogata, Tanie Kitabayashi, Toru Kazama, Hiroshi Nishikawa, Katsuyasu Uchida, Shigeru Kōyama, Kumi Mizuno, Ittoku Kishibe', null, 'A wealthy matriarch is kidnapped by a gang of three. She is insulted by the amount of money they propose to demand as ransom, and a strange interchange of roles takes place.', 'A wealthy matriarch is kidnapped by a gang of three. She is insulted by the amount of money they propose to demand as ransom, and a strange interchange of roles takes place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXPPm7nt4Lf12IBoGjVzFLQ28lI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299789'),
  ('632756902533688728', 'Rainbow Song', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Naoto Kumazawa', 'Shunji Iwai, Ami Sakurai, Miyuki Saito', 'Hayato Ichihara, Juri Ueno, Yu Aoi, Shoko Aida, Fumiyo Kohinata, Ami Suzuki, Wakana Sakai, Hiroyuki Onoue', null, 'Tomoya Kishida is working as a staffer in a television studio when he hears about the death of his close friend, Aoi Sato. This sparks his recollection of the events in life they shared from meeting at a record store, shooting a short film as part of their university film club, to saying their last goodbyes. Though in love with each other, neither had the courage to confess their feelings before it was too late.', 'Tomoya Kishida is working as a staffer in a television studio when he hears about the death of his close friend, Aoi Sato. This sparks his recollection of the events in life they shared from meeting at a record store, shooting a short film as part of their university film club, to saying their last goodbyes. Though in love with each other, neither had the courage to confess their feelings before it was too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekEECcNnVXZ49S0My8sftEn9pD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45349'),
  ('228404811412161708', 'Rainbow Valley', 1935, 'Western', 'Robert N. Bradbury, William Hyer', 'Lindsley Parsons', 'John Wayne, Lucile Browne, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, LeRoy Mason, Lloyd Ingraham, Jay Wilsey, Frank Ball, Bert Dillard', 'NR', 'John Martin is a government agent working under cover. Leading citizen Morgan calls in gunman Galt who blows Martin''s cover.', 'John Martin is a government agent working under cover. Leading citizen Morgan calls in gunman Galt who blows Martin''s cover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AwQ9QlqniVL638ipiC7lnxRgkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53781'),
  ('395294096335690741', 'Rainbow: A Private Affair', 2017, 'War, Drama', 'Alessio De Leonardis, Simone Zampagni, Giuseppe Costantino', 'Paolo Taviani, Vittorio Taviani', 'Luca Marinelli, Valentina Bellè, Francesca Agostini, Lorenzo Richelmy, Anna Ferruzzo, Marco Brinzi, Francesco Turbanti, Giulio Beranek', null, 'Summer 1943, Piedmont, Italy. Milton loves Fulvia who plays with his love: she only likes the depth of his thought and the letters he writes to her. One year later, Milton has joined the Resistance and fights beside other partisans. He learns during a conversation that Fulvia was secretly in love with his best friend Giorgio, a partisan like him. Milton decides to go find Giorgio in the Langhe region of Italy with all its misty hills...But Giorgio has just been arrested by the Fascists.', 'Summer 1943, Piedmont, Italy. Milton loves Fulvia who plays with his love: she only likes the depth of his thought and the letters he writes to her. One year later, Milton has joined the Resistance and fights beside other partisans. He learns during a conversation that Fulvia was secretly in love with his best friend Giorgio, a partisan like him. Milton decides to go find Giorgio in the Langhe region of Italy with all its misty hills...But Giorgio has just been arrested by the Fascists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AG2j8ug2sKVF9Mz58xwxTEO6IO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474944'),
  ('48471514895951115', 'Raincoat', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rituparno Ghosh, Avik Mukhopadhyay', 'Usha Ganguly, Rituparno Ghosh', 'Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Ajay Devgn, Annu Kapoor, Mouli Ganguly, Pradip Adhikari, Kailash Koppikar, Kameshwar Mishra, Dilip Patra', null, 'Tells the story of two lovers, separated by destiny, who meet again one day. This encounter allows each to realize the truth about the lives they are living.', 'Tells the story of two lovers, separated by destiny, who meet again one day. This encounter allows each to realize the truth about the lives they are living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doz7H7x8MA7NBJdlqg8P0xCeK6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41252'),
  ('377380377752803308', 'Raining Blood', 2014, 'Thriller, Comedy, Horror', 'Noboru Iguchi, Yasutaka Nagano', 'Noboru Iguchi', 'Yuki Yamada, Ito Ohno, Yuki Morinaga, Mari Iriki, Suzuka Morita, Airi Yamamoto, Asami, Kokone Sasaki', null, 'One day, Naoto receives a package. Inside he finds a book, ‘LIVE’. At the same time, he receives an image on mobile phone of his mother being kidnapped and a call from a mysterious man. “If you don’ t want us to inject the killer virus in your mother, find the hints hidden in the novel and head for the goal in the death race!” Naoto starts running to save his mother with the book in his hand.', 'One day, Naoto receives a package. Inside he finds a book, ‘LIVE’. At the same time, he receives an image on mobile phone of his mother being kidnapped and a call from a mysterious man. “If you don’ t want us to inject the killer virus in your mother, find the hints hidden in the novel and head for the goal in the death race!” Naoto starts running to save his mother with the book in his hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qz4HgerNnLPsKoBEgqWNbUVwCjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282800'),
  ('561888982510792264', 'Raining Cats and Dogs', 2019, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Édouard Deluc, Renaud Chassaing', 'Chloé Larouchi, Laura Piani, Édouard Deluc', 'Philippe Rebbot, Pablo Pauly, Laure Calamy, Solène Rigot, Élodie Bouchez, Jean-Luc Bideau, Brigitte Fossey, Ambre Hasaj', null, 'Two down-on-their-luck strangers become improbable companions in misfortune.', 'Two down-on-their-luck strangers become improbable companions in misfortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTzYX1q99xV1rfQO89MaWl8QNqH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641569'),
  ('1106451257789826028', 'Raining Cats and Frogs', 2003, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Jacques-Rémy Girerd', 'Jacques-Rémy Girerd, Antoine Lanciaux, Iouri Tcherenkov', 'Coline Girerd, Michel Piccoli, Kevin Hervé, Laurentine Milebo, Manuela Gourary, Luis Rego, Annie Girardot, Jacques Higelin', null, 'It''s a catastrophe! A flood has hit our planet and an unusual group of people are all that remains. Led by Ferdinand, a modern day Noah, this little group have managed to defy the furiously raging elements. People and animals alike are dragged through this incredible whirlpool of an adventure.', 'It''s a catastrophe! A flood has hit our planet and an unusual group of people are all that remains. Led by Ferdinand, a modern day Noah, this little group have managed to defy the furiously raging elements. People and animals alike are dragged through this incredible whirlpool of an adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6E3mk4NChtf38uMYsc0cvAe5IA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22624'),
  ('321211040741511463', 'Raining in the Mountain', 1979, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'King Hu, Fred Tan, Tung Lin', 'King Hu', 'Hsu Feng, Sun Yueh, Tung Lin, Tien Feng, Chen Hui-Lou, Paul Chun Pui, Shih Chun, Wu Chia-Hsiang', null, 'In Ming Dynasty China, the retiring abbot of a Buddhist monastery invites two dignitaries to help him choose a successor, not suspecting that both of them have hired help to steal a priceless parchment kept in the temple.', 'In Ming Dynasty China, the retiring abbot of a Buddhist monastery invites two dignitaries to help him choose a successor, not suspecting that both of them have hired help to steal a priceless parchment kept in the temple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCwFM4nFM2o6Q7ES7JOBcyTc3wZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76294'),
  ('790071083081798625', 'Raining Stones', 1993, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ken Loach, Barry Ackroyd', 'Jim Allen', 'Bruce Jones, Julie Brown, Gemma Phoenix, Ricky Tomlinson, Tom Hickey, Mike Fallon, Ronnie Ravey, Lee Brennan', null, 'Proud, though poor, Bob wants his little girl to have a beautiful (and costly) brand-new dress for her First Communion. His stubbornness and determination get him into trouble as he turns to more and more questionable measures, in his desperation to raise the needed money. This tragic flaw leads him to risk all that he loves and values, his beloved family, indeed even his immortal soul and salvation, in blind pursuit of that goal.', 'Proud, though poor, Bob wants his little girl to have a beautiful (and costly) brand-new dress for her First Communion. His stubbornness and determination get him into trouble as he turns to more and more questionable measures, in his desperation to raise the needed money. This tragic flaw leads him to risk all that he loves and values, his beloved family, indeed even his immortal soul and salvation, in blind pursuit of that goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkkfaTOTgeQ8iq0yQn4y8MvGkG8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62463'),
  ('976034670669654913', 'Rains Over Babel', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Gala del Sol, Sten Tadashi Olson', 'Gala del Sol', 'Jhon Narváez, John Alex Castillo, Sofia Buenaventura, Saray Nohemi Rebolledo Ospino, Felipe Aguilar Rodríguez', null, 'A group of misfits converges at Babel, a legendary dive bar that doubles as purgatory, where La Flaca-the city''s Grim Reaper-presides. Here, souls gamble years of their lives with her, daring to outwit Death Herself.', 'A group of misfits converges at Babel, a legendary dive bar that doubles as purgatory, where La Flaca-the city''s Grim Reaper-presides. Here, souls gamble years of their lives with her, daring to outwit Death Herself.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F4%2Fgracenote%2F4f96d858b81a7e9db80430cef12d0b09.jpg', 'plex:movie:rains-over-babel'),
  ('1023834611872035361', 'Raintree County', 1957, 'Romance, Drama, History', 'Edward Dmytryk, Robert Surtees, Ridgeway Callow', 'Millard Kaufman', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Montgomery Clift, Eva Marie Saint, Nigel Patrick, Lee Marvin, Rod Taylor, Agnes Moorehead, Walter Abel', 'NR', 'In 1859, idealist John Wickliff Shawnessey, a resident of Raintree County, Indiana, is distracted from his high school sweetheart Nell Gaither by Susanna Drake, a rich New Orleans girl. This love triangle is further complicated by the American Civil War, and dark family history.', 'In 1859, idealist John Wickliff Shawnessey, a resident of Raintree County, Indiana, is distracted from his high school sweetheart Nell Gaither by Susanna Drake, a rich New Orleans girl. This love triangle is further complicated by the American Civil War, and dark family history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23JBLEhaOi1ltOTzFOR5r60bVn9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65488'),
  ('1064427531625520837', 'Rainy Dog', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Takashi Miike, Li Yi-xu', 'Seigo Inoue', 'Show Aikawa, Gao Ming-Chun, Chen Xian-mei, Jianqin He, Blackie Ko Sau-Leung, Chang Li-Wei, Chang Shih, Billy Ching Sau-Yat', null, 'A Japanese assassin stranded in Taiwan must take work from a local crime boss to make ends meet when suddenly a woman from his past delivers a son to him.', 'A Japanese assassin stranded in Taiwan must take work from a local crime boss to make ends meet when suddenly a woman from his past delivers a son to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQVopy34WweVuBdMXWWlzJ5G1V1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36244'),
  ('1136851536160434652', 'Raise a Glass to Love', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'David Weaver, Shawn Seifert, Jason Still', 'Emily Schmitt', 'Laura Osnes, Juan Pablo Di Pace, Matthew James Dowden, Lini Evans, Amanda Wong, Eric Keenleyside, Beverley Elliott, Arpad Balogh', 'G', 'Aspiring Master Sommelier Jenna returns to her family vineyard to study and is intrigued by the natural methods of the handsome new, Argentinian winemaker, Marcelo.', 'Aspiring Master Sommelier Jenna returns to her family vineyard to study and is intrigued by the natural methods of the handsome new, Argentinian winemaker, Marcelo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XThRPWJJh4aBjuULVwNN1zEgQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858908'),
  ('302771991679508077', 'Raise the Titanic', 1980, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Jerry Jameson, Matthew F. Leonetti, Michael D. Moore', 'Adam Kennedy', 'Jason Robards, Richard Jordan, David Selby, Anne Archer, Alec Guinness, Bo Brundin, M. Emmet Walsh, J.D. Cannon', 'PG', 'To obtain a supply of a rare mineral, a ship raising operation is conducted for the only known source, the Titanic.', 'To obtain a supply of a rare mineral, a ship raising operation is conducted for the only known source, the Titanic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XvukyvRCbkYKKv1TdtlyNxvzEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24575'),
  ('124709915925509297', 'Raise Your Voice', 2004, 'Music, Drama, Romance, Family', 'Sean McNamara, Jeffrey F. January, David Brookwell', 'Mitch Rotter', 'Hilary Duff, Oliver James, David Keith, Johnny Lewis, Rita Wilson, Dana Davis, Lauren C. Mayhew, Kat Dennings', 'PG', 'A coming-of-age story centered around a small-town singer brokenhearted by the death of her brother in a car crash, who had secretly submitted her for a summer session at a performing arts academy in Los Angeles. In the academy, she experiences a whole new way of life in the big city, far from the small town lifestyle she''s used to.', 'A coming-of-age story centered around a small-town singer brokenhearted by the death of her brother in a car crash, who had secretly submitted her for a summer session at a performing arts academy in Los Angeles. In the academy, she experiences a whole new way of life in the big city, far from the small town lifestyle she''s used to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3waZREH25DZ8XqZSndCxZ7IiVzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14024'),
  ('629048710123410016', 'Raising Arizona', 1987, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Joel Coen, Barry Sonnenfeld, Jon Kilik', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Nicolas Cage, Holly Hunter, Trey Wilson, John Goodman, William Forsythe, Sam McMurray, Frances McDormand, Randall ''Tex'' Cobb', 'PG-13', 'When a childless couple—an ex-con and an ex-cop—take one of a wealthy family’s quintuplets to raise as their own, their lives grow more complicated than anticipated.', 'When a childless couple—an ex-con and an ex-cop—take one of a wealthy family’s quintuplets to raise as their own, their lives grow more complicated than anticipated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niKyjOqiB4XVl0BqgKTHIlHOCeF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378'),
  ('454989912557303178', 'Raising Cain', 1992, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Brian De Palma, Stephen H. Burum, James Dyer', 'Brian De Palma', 'John Lithgow, Lolita Davidovich, Steven Bauer, Frances Sternhagen, Gregg Henry, Tom Bower, Mel Harris, Teri Austin', 'R', 'Child psychologist Carter Nix is a loving and caring family man, but under this appearance lies a dark and troubled past. Grappling with the consequences of this past on his own psyche and the influence of his returning father and violent brother Cain, Carter becomes involved in a series of murders and kidnappings. Meanwhile, his wife Jenny rekindles an old love affair, placing herself in the crosshairs of her increasingly unstable husband.', 'Child psychologist Carter Nix is a loving and caring family man, but under this appearance lies a dark and troubled past. Grappling with the consequences of this past on his own psyche and the influence of his returning father and violent brother Cain, Carter becomes involved in a series of murders and kidnappings. Meanwhile, his wife Jenny rekindles an old love affair, placing herself in the crosshairs of her increasingly unstable husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vRn138vnZeUNFe32qTuPGKkVLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13937'),
  ('46537422530815652', 'Raising Helen', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Minsky, Garry Marshall, Michael Stone', 'Michael Begler, Jack Amiel', 'Kate Hudson, John Corbett, Joan Cusack, Hayden Panettiere, Spencer Breslin, Abigail Breslin, Helen Mirren, Felicity Huffman', 'PG-13', 'Helen Harris has a glamorous, big-city life working for one of New York''s hottest modeling agencies. But suddenly her free-spirited life gets turned upside down when she must chose between the life she''s always loved, and the new loves of her life!', 'Helen Harris has a glamorous, big-city life working for one of New York''s hottest modeling agencies. But suddenly her free-spirited life gets turned upside down when she must chose between the life she''s always loved, and the new loves of her life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubZin4oGXYp6hCn3WU6nrBre62y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4599'),
  ('529594737521876788', 'Raising the Bar', 2017, 'Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Clay Glen, Hugh Freytag', 'Clay Glen', 'Kelli Berglund, Emily Morris, Chris Koch, Jordyn Wieber, David John Clark, Peta Shannon, Lili Karamalikis, Tess Fowler', 'PG', '16-year-old Kelly quits an elite gymnastics program and moves to Australia. To help out a new friend and show up an old rival she re-enters competitive gymnastics, she''ll have to find a way to move forward while making amends with her past.', '16-year-old Kelly quits an elite gymnastics program and moves to Australia. To help out a new friend and show up an old rival she re-enters competitive gymnastics, she''ll have to find a way to move forward while making amends with her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PmeOpZK9Qvnsuo02TqBO1wHecR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396289'),
  ('246065050191649279', 'Raising the Wind', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Gerald Thomas, Alan Hume, Jack Causey', 'Bruce Montgomery', 'James Robertson Justice, Leslie Phillips, Paul Massie, Kenneth Williams, Liz Fraser, Eric Barker, Jennifer Jayne, Jimmy Thompson', null, '''Carry On'' director Gerald Thomas helms this comedy caper featuring early appearances by James Robertson Justice, Sid James, Leslie Phillips, Kenneth Williams, Liz Fraser and Eric Barker. The film follows the hi-jinks of a group of music students who move into a shared flat in order to cut costs and have somewhere to practice their instruments. Things get tricky when Mervyn Hughes (Phillips) accidentally sells one of his compositions to an advertising agency and risks losing his scholarship. Can he and his friends find a way to raise the money to buy back the song rights?', '''Carry On'' director Gerald Thomas helms this comedy caper featuring early appearances by James Robertson Justice, Sid James, Leslie Phillips, Kenneth Williams, Liz Fraser and Eric Barker. The film follows the hi-jinks of a group of music students who move into a shared flat in order to cut costs and have somewhere to practice their instruments. Things get tricky when Mervyn Hughes (Phillips) accidentally sells one of his compositions to an advertising agency and risks losing his scholarship. Can he and his friends find a way to raise the money to buy back the song rights?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2xFuCpQGD2TaAIfVnaYYl0EgRXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47834'),
  ('50407780047465790', 'Raising Victor Vargas', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Sollett, Tim Orr, Mariela Comitini', 'Peter Sollett', 'Victor Rasuk, Judy Marte, Melonie Díaz, Altagracia Guzman, Silvestre Rasuk, Krystal Rodriguez, Kevin Rivera, Wilfree Vasquez', null, 'Victor, a Lower East Side teenager, as he deals with his eccentric family, including his strict grandmother, his bratty sister, and a younger brother who completely idolizes him. Along the way he tries to win the affections of Judy, who is very careful and calculating when it comes to how she deals with men.', 'Victor, a Lower East Side teenager, as he deals with his eccentric family, including his strict grandmother, his bratty sister, and a younger brother who completely idolizes him. Along the way he tries to win the affections of Judy, who is very careful and calculating when it comes to how she deals with men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMHMtMBca8VNxjYICc1WHK1Qqe5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25461'),
  ('680865972258878083', 'Raja', 1995, 'Action, Romance', 'Indra Kumar', 'Rajeev Kaul, Naushir Khatau, Tanveer Khan', 'Madhuri Dixit, Sanjay Kapoor, Mukesh Khanna, Dalip Tahil, Rita Bhaduri, Paresh Rawal, Tiku Talsania, Himani Shivpuri', null, 'Rana Mahednra Pratap Garewal (Mukesh Khanna) is a wealthy businessman along with his brother Vishwa (Dalip Tahil). They are both good friends with Brijnath (Paresh Rawal) who is not as wealthy. Rana''s younger sister Madhu (Madhuri Dixit) is a good friend of Brijnath''s younger brother Raja (Sanjay Kapoor). Seeing this Rana and Birju both arrange for Raja and Madhu to marry when they are older but Rana quickly backs out and insults Birju because of his social status.', 'Rana Mahednra Pratap Garewal (Mukesh Khanna) is a wealthy businessman along with his brother Vishwa (Dalip Tahil). They are both good friends with Brijnath (Paresh Rawal) who is not as wealthy. Rana''s younger sister Madhu (Madhuri Dixit) is a good friend of Brijnath''s younger brother Raja (Sanjay Kapoor). Seeing this Rana and Birju both arrange for Raja and Madhu to marry when they are older but Rana quickly backs out and insults Birju because of his social status.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UDwr2CnaVRKKJ6UZh4jRbTVV2f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205075'),
  ('1105698824766534266', 'Raja', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Doillon, Hélène Louvart', 'Jacques Doillon', 'Pascal Greggory, Najat Benssallem, Ilham Abdelwaheb, Hassan Khissal, Ahmed Akensouss, Oum El Aid Ait Youss, Zineb Ouchita', 'NR', 'Raja is a nineteen year old orphan literally and figuratively scarred by life. Fred is an emotionally bankrupt westerner living amid his plush gardens and palm trees. Set against the backdrop of contemporary Marrakech, Raja is a cross-cultural drama about a wealthy middle-aged Frenchman''s complex relationship with this poor local girl. Fred''s attempts to seduce Raja, and their mutual attempts at manipulation, are fractured by their gross disparity of income, age and cultural sophistication.', 'Raja is a nineteen year old orphan literally and figuratively scarred by life. Fred is an emotionally bankrupt westerner living amid his plush gardens and palm trees. Set against the backdrop of contemporary Marrakech, Raja is a cross-cultural drama about a wealthy middle-aged Frenchman''s complex relationship with this poor local girl. Fred''s attempts to seduce Raja, and their mutual attempts at manipulation, are fractured by their gross disparity of income, age and cultural sophistication.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w92IsCXBuP1kqFZWBbK6FqeUfNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50900'),
  ('536346244813484365', 'Raja Babu', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Dhawan', 'K. Bhagyaraj', 'Govinda, Karisma Kapoor, Shakti Kapoor, Kader Khan, Aruna Irani, Prem Chopra, Gulshan Grover, Javed Khan', null, 'Raja Babu is a rich, spoiled, country bumpkin who lives a carefree, luxury lifestyle until the girl he loves rejects him and his parents reveal that he was adopted.', 'Raja Babu is a rich, spoiled, country bumpkin who lives a carefree, luxury lifestyle until the girl he loves rejects him and his parents reveal that he was adopted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56dEONvFlidzOxZy9c8pOOWDPmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211819'),
