  ('549909755324499459', 'Raja Natwarlal', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Kunal Deshmukh', 'Parveez Shaikh', 'Emraan Hashmi, Humaima Malick, Paresh Rawal, Kay Kay Menon, Deepak Tijori, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Vishwanath Chatterjee', null, 'Based on the story of a notorious real-life con man, this twisty Bollywood thriller revolves around cunning fraudster Raja Natwarlal, who pulls off a series of two-bit scams in Mumbai on his way to a big swindle. A small-time con man wants to get into the big leagues and take on a Goliath in the world of scams.', 'Based on the story of a notorious real-life con man, this twisty Bollywood thriller revolves around cunning fraudster Raja Natwarlal, who pulls off a series of two-bit scams in Mumbai on his way to a big swindle. A small-time con man wants to get into the big leagues and take on a Goliath in the world of scams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhg3DSZjgRhUrO28U8n7QJLPpCl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287859'),
  ('589722674662614709', 'Raja Rani', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'George C. Williams, Atlee', 'Atlee', 'Arya, Nayanthara, Nazriya Nazim, Jai Sampath, Santhanam, Sathyan Sivakumar, Manobala, Rajendran', null, 'John and Regina, who dislike each other, are forced to get married and lead troubled lives. However, things take a turn when the couple suffers a sudden tragedy.', 'John and Regina, who dislike each other, are forced to get married and lead troubled lives. However, things take a turn when the couple suffers a sudden tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szdy0Tmyc5zrz025JSTWx6EYICR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224330'),
