  ('611362237594296239', 'Rakht Charitra', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ram Gopal Varma, Amol Rathod, Pradeep Khairwar', 'Ram Gopal Varma', 'Vivek Oberoi, Shatrughan Sinha, Abhimanyu Singh, Sushant Singh, Radhika Apte, Sudeepa, Kota Srinivasa Rao, Ashish Vidhyarthi', null, 'Based on the life of Paritala Ravindra, the film follows his life from just a college student to being a politician in the state of Andhra Pradesh.', 'Based on the life of Paritala Ravindra, the film follows his life from just a college student to being a politician in the state of Andhra Pradesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPFW3LMUKUNfj5jaPJVPXZP5U06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49028'),
  ('881633335164397345', 'Rakht Charitra 2', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ram Gopal Varma, P. S. Vinod, Amol Rathod', 'Ram Gopal Varma', 'Suriya, Vivek Oberoi, Priyamani, Radhika Apte, Shatrughan Sinha, Ajaz Khan, Sudeepa, Anupam Shyam', null, 'The sequel carries forward the tale of power and revenge which exploded in Rakht Charitra 1. The rebel leader turned politician, Pratap consolidates his political base but is forced to retread the path of vengeance once again after a rival from the past, Surya Narayan Reddy chooses to avenge the assassination of his family. Surya swears vengeance against Pratap after his family is wiped out in a bomb attack and Pratap is hell bent on decimating his enemy, even if it means separating ways with his mentor and political veteran, Shivaji.', 'The sequel carries forward the tale of power and revenge which exploded in Rakht Charitra 1. The rebel leader turned politician, Pratap consolidates his political base but is forced to retread the path of vengeance once again after a rival from the past, Surya Narayan Reddy chooses to avenge the assassination of his family. Surya swears vengeance against Pratap after his family is wiped out in a bomb attack and Pratap is hell bent on decimating his enemy, even if it means separating ways with his mentor and political veteran, Shivaji.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lx36zIYVOHfLVklyFlPYMCmlY7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55808'),
  ('180063971742787115', 'Rakka', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror, War', 'Neill Blomkamp, Gabriel Williams, Steynie LeGrange', 'Neill Blomkamp, Thomas Sweterlitsch', 'Sigourney Weaver, Eugene Khumbanyiwa, Robert Hobbs, Carly Pope, Brandon Auret, Michael Huff, Jay Anstey, Alec Gillis', null, 'A story of broken humanity following the invasion of a technologically superior alien species. Bleak, harrowing, and unrelenting, the humans must find enough courage to go on fighting.', 'A story of broken humanity following the invasion of a technologically superior alien species. Bleak, harrowing, and unrelenting, the humans must find enough courage to go on fighting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wVeP9BHsQul7CRgdrfiUt1Rds1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461955'),
  ('910658779348185375', 'Rakkasapuradhol', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Ravi Saranga, William David, Ravindra Babu, Sukesh Sattegala', 'Ravi Saranga, Kranthi Kumar', 'Ashik Kusugolli, Narasimha Jalahalli, Sugar Candy, Kraanti Kumar, Devraj Sulok', null, 'A troubled cop in rural India confronts his own demons while pursuing a complex case that tests his moral boundaries and beliefs.', 'A troubled cop in rural India confronts his own demons while pursuing a complex case that tests his moral boundaries and beliefs.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaOGcRUDWdY5XAzZXVtynDS7ZW0A.jpg', 'plex:movie:rakkasapuradhol'),
  ('795698946155090905', 'Rakkauden risti', 1946, 'Drama, Romance', 'Teuvo Tulio, Uno Pihlström', 'Nisse Hirn', 'Regina Linnanheimo, Oscar Tengström, Ville Salminen, Rauli Tuomi, Tuli Arjo, Lauri Korpela, Hilly Lindqvist, Senja Soitso', null, 'The daughter of a lighthouse keeper runs away with a shipwrecked businessman to the city. But instead of her dreams, she ends up selling herself in the streets, until a painter finds her as an ideal model for his next painting. In English known as Cross of Love.', 'The daughter of a lighthouse keeper runs away with a shipwrecked businessman to the city. But instead of her dreams, she ends up selling herself in the streets, until a painter finds her as an ideal model for his next painting. In English known as Cross of Love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZ1cFxDq8Hny8h8r5b58fh0cQPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291905'),
  ('1008004734134583040', 'Rakkhosh', 2026, 'Action, Romance', 'Mehedi Hasan Hridoy', null, 'Siam Ahmed, Susmita Chatterjee, Shataf Figar, Ali Raj, Samm Bhattacharyya, Abrar Athar, Sadnima Binte Noman, Sujata', null, 'The story about a man pushed to his limits by love and greed, who eventually embraces his darker side to seek justice or revenge in a world filled with "monsters."', 'The story about a man pushed to his limits by love and greed, who eventually embraces his darker side to seek justice or revenge in a world filled with "monsters."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2fCCiq14zbk7VGyUAgZvqIMxr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1510583'),
  ('561674243398785794', 'Raksha Bandhan', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Mukesh Chhabra, Vishesh Deepak Sareen, K.U. Mohanan', 'Kanika Dhillon, Himanshu Sharma', 'Akshay Kumar, Bhumi Pednekar, Sadia Khateeb, Sahejmeen Kaur, Smrithi Srikanth, Deepika Khanna, Sahil Mehta, Neeraj Sood', null, 'Lala Kedarnath is blessed with 4 sisters. But his only worry is to find suitable grooms for each of them, as only then can he marry his childhood love. To what lengths will he go to succeed?', 'Lala Kedarnath is blessed with 4 sisters. But his only worry is to find suitable grooms for each of them, as only then can he marry his childhood love. To what lengths will he go to succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykefXRqhM7HVnLWPtXWcWCcvBy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729700'),
