  ('193164770661309107', 'Ramayana', 2026, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy', 'Nitesh Tiwari, Pankaj Kumar, Mahesh Limaye', 'Shridhar Raghavan', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Yash, Sai Pallavi, Ravi Dubey, Sunny Deol, Suhail Nayyar, Rakul Preet Singh, Sheeba Chaddha', null, 'An ancient epic follows a young prince and princess whose marriage and subsequent exile mark the beginning of a legendary journey. Their story of love, duty and destiny sets the stage for greater challenges ahead.', 'An ancient epic follows a young prince and princess whose marriage and subsequent exile mark the beginning of a legendary journey. Their story of love, duty and destiny sets the stage for greater challenges ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3yZZw7zIsWo6m9xJStfjDauIZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656908'),
  ('1034408004301703109', 'Ramayana : The Legend of Prince Rama', 1993, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Ram Mohan, Yûgô Sakô, Vanraj Bhatia', 'Narendra Sharma, Rani Burra, Koichi Sasaki', 'Nikhil Kapoor, Raell Padamsee, Uday Mathan, Mishal Verma, Noel Godin, Denzil Smith, Rahul Bose, Bulbul Mukherjee', 'PG', 'In Ayodhya, the royal palace of Kosala Kingdom in Ancient India, four princes were born to three queens, each of whom grew to great stature. Banished for 14 years due to court intrigue, Prince Rama retreated to the forest with his beautiful wife Sita. When Rama vanquishes the demons of the forest, he invites the wrath of the demon king Ravana, who kidnaps Sita. Based on the Indian epic the Ramayana.', 'In Ayodhya, the royal palace of Kosala Kingdom in Ancient India, four princes were born to three queens, each of whom grew to great stature. Banished for 14 years due to court intrigue, Prince Rama retreated to the forest with his beautiful wife Sita. When Rama vanquishes the demons of the forest, he invites the wrath of the demon king Ravana, who kidnaps Sita. Based on the Indian epic the Ramayana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnwUw88Zq5tS0BFNvDwhISQ7p8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84092'),
  ('607586147302459248', 'Rambling Rose', 1991, 'Drama', 'Martha Coolidge, Johnny E. Jensen', 'Calder Willingham', 'Laura Dern, Robert Duvall, Diane Ladd, Lukas Haas, John Heard, Kevin Conway, Robert John Burke, Lisa Jakub', 'R', 'In the Deep South of the 1930s, Rose is taken in by the Hillyer family to serve as housemaid so that she can avoid falling into a life of prostitution. Her appearence and personality is such that all men fall for her, and she knows it. She can''t help herself from getting into trouble with men.', 'In the Deep South of the 1930s, Rose is taken in by the Hillyer family to serve as housemaid so that she can avoid falling into a life of prostitution. Her appearence and personality is such that all men fall for her, and she knows it. She can''t help herself from getting into trouble with men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAoluBzewlMqRH4mgFJvr4EPOMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32221'),
  ('21250389596272407', 'Rambo', 2008, 'Action, Thriller, War', 'Sylvester Stallone, Glen MacPherson, Christine Reins', 'Art Monterastelli, Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Julie Benz, Matthew Marsden, Graham McTavish, Reynaldo Gallegos, Tim Kang, Jake La Botz, Maung Maung Khin', 'R', 'In Thailand, ex-Green Beret John James Rambo joins a group of mercenaries to venture into war-torn neighboring Myanmar to rescue a group of Christian aid workers who have been kidnapped by a ruthless local infantry unit.', 'In Thailand, ex-Green Beret John James Rambo joins a group of mercenaries to venture into war-torn neighboring Myanmar to rescue a group of Christian aid workers who have been kidnapped by a ruthless local infantry unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mInub5c8o00H7EJ1TrjAqOzIuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7555'),
  ('542585283754826787', 'Rambo III', 1988, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, War', 'Peter MacDonald, John Stanier, Michael Stevenson', 'Sylvester Stallone, Sheldon Lettich', 'Sylvester Stallone, Richard Crenna, Marc de Jonge, Kurtwood Smith, Spiros Focás, Sasson Gabai, Doudi Shoua, Randy Raney', 'R', 'Combat has taken its toll on Rambo, but he''s finally begun to find inner peace in a monastery. When Rambo''s friend and mentor Col. Trautman asks for his help on a top secret mission to Afghanistan, Rambo declines but must reconsider when Trautman is captured.', 'Combat has taken its toll on Rambo, but he''s finally begun to find inner peace in a monastery. When Rambo''s friend and mentor Col. Trautman asks for his help on a top secret mission to Afghanistan, Rambo declines but must reconsider when Trautman is captured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uycbt9iVlAnKkQIisqUWuO8hVcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1370'),
  ('993358983016655115', 'Rambo: First Blood Part II', 1985, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, War', 'George P. Cosmatos, Jack Cardiff, Roy Barnes', 'James Cameron, Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Richard Crenna, Charles Napier, Steven Berkoff, Julia Nickson, Martin Kove, George Cheung, Andy Wood', 'R', 'John Rambo is released from prison by the government for a top-secret covert mission to the last place on Earth he''d want to return - the jungles of Vietnam.', 'John Rambo is released from prison by the government for a top-secret covert mission to the last place on Earth he''d want to return - the jungles of Vietnam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzPdwOitmTleVE3YPMfIQgLh84p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1369'),
  ('682438051296032640', 'Rambo: Last Blood', 2019, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Adrian Grünberg, Brendan Galvin, Charlie Watson', 'Matthew Cirulnick, Sylvester Stallone', 'Sylvester Stallone, Paz Vega, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Adriana Barraza, Yvette Monreal, Joaquín Cosío, Pascacio López, Óscar Jaenada', 'R', 'After fighting his demons for decades, John Rambo now lives in peace on his family ranch in Arizona, but his rest is interrupted when Gabriela, the granddaughter of his housekeeper María, disappears after crossing the border into Mexico to meet her biological father. Rambo, who has become a true father figure for Gabriela over the years, undertakes a desperate and dangerous journey to find her.', 'After fighting his demons for decades, John Rambo now lives in peace on his family ranch in Arizona, but his rest is interrupted when Gabriela, the granddaughter of his housekeeper María, disappears after crossing the border into Mexico to meet her biological father. Rambo, who has become a true father figure for Gabriela over the years, undertakes a desperate and dangerous journey to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTQ3J8oTTKofAVLYnds2cHUz9KO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522938'),
  ('950148758904595517', 'Ramen Heads', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Koki Shigeno', null, 'Osamu Tomita, Shôta Iida, Kumiko Ishida, Katsuya Kobayashi, Yûki Ohnishi, Tom Takahashi', null, 'In Ramen Heads, Osamu Tomita, Japan''s reigning king of ramen, takes us deep into his world, revealing every single step of his obsessive approach to creating the perfect soup and noodles, and his relentless search for the highest-quality ingredients.', 'In Ramen Heads, Osamu Tomita, Japan''s reigning king of ramen, takes us deep into his world, revealing every single step of his obsessive approach to creating the perfect soup and noodles, and his relentless search for the highest-quality ingredients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fESgRBsrocLOxR215pldcQZChWk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455146'),
  ('995403903423447719', 'Ramen Shop', 2018, 'Drama', 'Hiroyasu Kitagawa, Brian Gothong Tan, Eric Khoo', 'Wong Kim Hoh, Tan Fong Cheng', 'Takumi Saitoh, Seiko Matsuda, Jeanette Aw, Tsuyoshi Ihara, Mark Lee, Tetsuya Bessho, Beatrice Chien, Gisele Chiam', null, 'Masato is a young ramen chef in Japan. When he finds his late mother''s journal after the sudden death of his emotionally distant father, he takes it with him to her native country, Singapore, hoping to piece together the story of his family and his life.', 'Masato is a young ramen chef in Japan. When he finds his late mother''s journal after the sudden death of his emotionally distant father, he takes it with him to her native country, Singapore, hoping to piece together the story of his family and his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3PF0LTjWHTRASdfoj5mU9UiwHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500890'),
  ('779006892390309695', 'Ramji Rao Speaking', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Siddique, Lal', 'Siddique, Lal', 'Saikumar, Mukesh, Innocent, Rekha, Devan, Vijayaraghavan, Mamukkoya, Sukumari', null, 'The story revolves around three unemployed people who get involved in a kidnapping saga due to a case of mistaken identity.', 'The story revolves around three unemployed people who get involved in a kidnapping saga due to a case of mistaken identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJ1k4tWjLZUpTY46liLDSfu7Vfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150768'),
  ('827236109470188769', 'Rammbock: Berlin Undead', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Marvin Kren, Kathrin Krückeberg', 'Benjamin Hessler', 'Michael Fuith, Theo Trebs, Anka Graczyk, Emily Cox, Katelijne Philips-Lebon, Steffen Münster, Andreas Schröders, Harald Geil', 'R', 'When lovelorn Michael arrives in Berlin to return a set of keys to his ex-girlfriend, Gabi, as an excuse to see her again, he finds her apartment empty save for a couple of plumbers making repairs to the central heating. Just as Michael learns from the plumber’s apprentice, Harper, that Gabi has popped out for a while but will return soon, the apprentice is attacked by his boss who has unexpectedly and inexplicably transformed into a raging madman. Together, Michael and Harper manage to bundle the crazed plumber out of the apartment and barricade themselves safely inside. Within minutes, they find themselves trapped in apartment block under siege from a horde of similarly insane people, apparently hungry for human flesh.', 'When lovelorn Michael arrives in Berlin to return a set of keys to his ex-girlfriend, Gabi, as an excuse to see her again, he finds her apartment empty save for a couple of plumbers making repairs to the central heating. Just as Michael learns from the plumber’s apprentice, Harper, that Gabi has popped out for a while but will return soon, the apprentice is attacked by his boss who has unexpectedly and inexplicably transformed into a raging madman. Together, Michael and Harper manage to bundle the crazed plumber out of the apartment and barricade themselves safely inside. Within minutes, they find themselves trapped in apartment block under siege from a horde of similarly insane people, apparently hungry for human flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZiQZSSgkUByHGpva5FsYo7Drzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49901'),
  ('999443266284556644', 'Rammstein in Amerika', 2015, 'Documentary, Music', 'Hannes Rossacher', null, 'Till Lindemann, Richard Kruspe, Paul Landers, Oliver Riedel, Christoph Schneider, Christian Lorenz, Iggy Pop, Scott Ian', null, 'The concert film celebrates the band’s legendary show in New York’s Madison Square Garden – Rammstein’s return to the US after a ten-year absence. In HD and 5.1 surround sound. For the documentary, Rammstein provided extensive, previously unreleased footage and photos from the band archive. In numerous interviews from various periods in the band’s history, the band members speak about their experiences across the Atlantic.', 'The concert film celebrates the band’s legendary show in New York’s Madison Square Garden – Rammstein’s return to the US after a ten-year absence. In HD and 5.1 surround sound. For the documentary, Rammstein provided extensive, previously unreleased footage and photos from the band archive. In numerous interviews from various periods in the band’s history, the band members speak about their experiences across the Atlantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBxFphQ3RtLw71nZ2IcEQmyRe6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361631'),
  ('548465122013408454', 'Rammstein: Völkerball', 2006, 'Music, Documentary', 'Hamish Hamilton', null, 'Till Lindemann, Richard Kruspe, Paul Landers, Oliver Riedel, Christoph Schneider, Christian Lorenz', null, 'Völkerball shows concert-performances by the band in England, France, Japan and Russia. The Special Edition is extended by a second DVD, which contains the documentaries "Anaconda in the net" by Mathilde Bonnefoy and the "Making of the album Reise, Reise" by Rammstein guitarist Paul Landers. The limited edition was released as a large black and white photo-book with photos by Frederic Batier.', 'Völkerball shows concert-performances by the band in England, France, Japan and Russia. The Special Edition is extended by a second DVD, which contains the documentaries "Anaconda in the net" by Mathilde Bonnefoy and the "Making of the album Reise, Reise" by Rammstein guitarist Paul Landers. The limited edition was released as a large black and white photo-book with photos by Frederic Batier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxosDzLNqNLKVuaqOZB0ycC0SKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22097'),
  ('714795688873641931', 'Ramona', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Andrea Bagney, Pol Orpinell', 'Andrea Bagney', 'Lourdes Hernández, Bruno Lastra, Francesco Carril, Agustín Mateo, Rafael Ordorika, Rocío González Cela, Sergio Uguet de Resayre, Javier Carrasco', null, 'After living in London for several years, Ramona and her boyfriend Nico, return to Madrid where she hopes to re-start her acting career. The evening before her first audition she meets Bruno, an older man. The following day, at the audition, she discovers that Bruno is the director of the film.', 'After living in London for several years, Ramona and her boyfriend Nico, return to Madrid where she hopes to re-start her acting career. The evening before her first audition she meets Bruno, an older man. The following day, at the audition, she discovers that Bruno is the director of the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2rrZrhDq9BhaBelbmj0u0z9S7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:953661'),
  ('304208041449316806', 'Ramona and Beezus', 2010, 'Comedy, Family', 'John Bailey, Elizabeth Allen Rosenbaum', 'Nick Pustay, Laurie Craig', 'Joey King, Selena Gomez, John Corbett, Bridget Moynahan, Ginnifer Goodwin, Josh Duhamel, Sandra Oh, Hutch Dano', 'G', 'Ramona is a little girl with a very big imagination and a nose for mischief. Her playful antics keep everyone in her loving family on their toes, including her older sister Beezus, who''s just trying to survive her first year of high school. Through all the ups and downs of childhood, Ramona and Beezus learn that anything''s possible when you believe in yourself and rely on each other.', 'Ramona is a little girl with a very big imagination and a nose for mischief. Her playful antics keep everyone in her loving family on their toes, including her older sister Beezus, who''s just trying to survive her first year of high school. Through all the ups and downs of childhood, Ramona and Beezus learn that anything''s possible when you believe in yourself and rely on each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bW1YWFyocIY8DDgwOUroZG2FYNe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38843'),
  ('1020718334575522569', 'Rampage', 1963, 'Adventure', 'Phil Karlson, Harold Lipstein', 'Robert I. Holt, Marguerite Roberts', 'Robert Mitchum, Elsa Martinelli, Jack Hawkins, Sabu, Émile Genest, Stefan Schnabel, Cely Carillo, David Cadiente', null, 'In colonial Malaysia, British big game-hunter Otto Abbot and American trapper Harry Stanton clash over the ethics of catching versus killing animals and over Abbot''s mistress, Anna.', 'In colonial Malaysia, British big game-hunter Otto Abbot and American trapper Harry Stanton clash over the ethics of catching versus killing animals and over Abbot''s mistress, Anna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLDkn8XdyL2W8lhQzLMsU5DoPq5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104658'),
  ('660354128731834196', 'Rampage', 1986, 'Adventure, Action', 'Çetin İnanç', 'Çetin İnanç', 'Serdar Kebapçılar, Osman Betin, Sümer Tilmaç, Hüseyin Peyda, Tuğrul Meteer, Sami Hazinses, Mehmet Samsa, Yılmaz Kurt', null, 'A Turkish commando must infiltrate and capture a group of terrorists living in the mountains.', 'A Turkish commando must infiltrate and capture a group of terrorists living in the mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tONmdHmgZejrUA01CTg8VPD0MDl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17288'),
  ('868922997387928845', 'Rampage', 1987, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'William Friedkin, Robert D. Yeoman', 'William P. Wood, William Friedkin', 'Michael Biehn, Alex McArthur, Nicholas Campbell, Deborah Van Valkenburgh, John Harkins, Art LaFleur, Billy Green Bush, Royce D. Applegate', 'R', 'Liberal district attorney decides to seek the death penalty for a man who slaughtered a family at Christmastime, then drank their blood. He escapes, though, and starts killing again.', 'Liberal district attorney decides to seek the death penalty for a man who slaughtered a family at Christmastime, then drank their blood. He escapes, though, and starts killing again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7W1S6ARQl2yJL9bgNUUqiVuph1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99749'),
  ('881120859391640886', 'Rampage', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Uwe Boll, Richard Worden, Mathias Neumann', 'Uwe Boll', 'Brendan Fletcher, Shaun Sipos, Michael Paré, Matt Frewer, Lynda Boyd, Robert Clarke, Malcolm Stewart, Steffen Mennekes', 'R', 'The boredom of small town life is eating Bill Williamson alive. Feeling constrained and claustrophobic in the meaningless drudgery of everyday life and helpless against overwhelming global dissolution, Bill begins a descent into madness. His shockingly violent plan will shake the very foundations of society by painting the streets red with blood.', 'The boredom of small town life is eating Bill Williamson alive. Feeling constrained and claustrophobic in the meaningless drudgery of everyday life and helpless against overwhelming global dissolution, Bill begins a descent into madness. His shockingly violent plan will shake the very foundations of society by painting the streets red with blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZZlA5obgTrQMyAF16yqCiVxHlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38780'),
  ('1111013948548757378', 'Rampage', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Brad Peyton, Jaron Presant, Shawn D. Bronson', 'Ryan Condal, Carlton Cuse, Ryan Engle', 'Dwayne Johnson, Naomie Harris, Malin Åkerman, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Jake Lacy, Joe Manganiello, Marley Shelton, P.J. Byrne', 'PG-13', 'Primatologist Davis Okoye shares an unshakable bond with George, the extraordinarily intelligent, silverback gorilla who has been in his care since birth. But a rogue genetic experiment gone awry mutates this gentle ape into a raging creature of enormous size. To make matters worse, it’s soon discovered there are other similarly altered animals. As these newly created alpha predators tear across North America, destroying everything in their path, Okoye teams with a discredited genetic engineer to secure an antidote, fighting his way through an ever-changing battlefield, not only to halt a global catastrophe but to save the fearsome creature that was once his friend.', 'Primatologist Davis Okoye shares an unshakable bond with George, the extraordinarily intelligent, silverback gorilla who has been in his care since birth. But a rogue genetic experiment gone awry mutates this gentle ape into a raging creature of enormous size. To make matters worse, it’s soon discovered there are other similarly altered animals. As these newly created alpha predators tear across North America, destroying everything in their path, Okoye teams with a discredited genetic engineer to secure an antidote, fighting his way through an ever-changing battlefield, not only to halt a global catastrophe but to save the fearsome creature that was once his friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MGADip4thVSErP34FAAfzFBTZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427641'),
  ('466627686867085607', 'Rampage at Apache Wells', 1965, 'Adventure, Western', 'Harald Philipp, Heinz Hölscher', 'Fred Denger, Harald Philipp', 'Stewart Granger, Pierre Brice, Harald Leipnitz, Heinz Erhardt, Terence Hill, Macha Méril, Walter Barnes, Antje Weisgerber', 'NR', '''The Oilprince'' is an unscrupulous businessman. He looks forward to a lucrative deal with the "Western Arizona Bank''. He sells the bank oil wells at Shelly Lake that do actually not exist. The Oilprince learns that the colonists would like to settle at Shelly Lake. So The Oilprince exchanges the scout of the settlers by one of his minions to give them another route. But soon The Oilprince has to recognize that he has not counted on Winnetou, the righteous leader of the Apaches, and his blood brother Old Surehand.', '''The Oilprince'' is an unscrupulous businessman. He looks forward to a lucrative deal with the "Western Arizona Bank''. He sells the bank oil wells at Shelly Lake that do actually not exist. The Oilprince learns that the colonists would like to settle at Shelly Lake. So The Oilprince exchanges the scout of the settlers by one of his minions to give them another route. But soon The Oilprince has to recognize that he has not counted on Winnetou, the righteous leader of the Apaches, and his blood brother Old Surehand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfqEVP55iiL8aqeNjWc1ci1c9nA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19199'),
  ('289518005646496143', 'Rampage: Capital Punishment', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Uwe Boll, Mathias Neumann, Andrew Holmes', 'Brendan Fletcher, Uwe Boll', 'Brendan Fletcher, Lochlyn Munro, Mike Dopud, Michaela Mann, Bruce Blain, John Sampson, Nathan Lehfeldt, Uwe Boll', 'NR', 'A man takes over a TV station and holds a number of hostages as a political platform to awaken humanity, instead of money.', 'A man takes over a TV station and holds a number of hostages as a political platform to awaken humanity, instead of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pd5OlT9fHCnlsFnIcCbJTDZsJvE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250388'),
  ('214664545823120888', 'Rampage: President Down', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Pohorly, Uwe Boll, Mathias Neumann', 'Brendan Fletcher, Uwe Boll', 'Brendan Fletcher, Steve Baran, Ryan McDonell, Scott Patey, Yan-Kay Crystal Lowe, Loretta Walsh, Zain Meghji, Bruce Blain', null, 'Bill Williamson is back, alive and well and doing a recon mission around D.C. This time he wants to cause a major population disruption within the USA which result in devastating consequences reverberating throughout the world. His new mission this time to bring down The President of the United States and his Secret Service detail. Bill brings with him all the freak-in havoc and acidity of the previous 2 movies.', 'Bill Williamson is back, alive and well and doing a recon mission around D.C. This time he wants to cause a major population disruption within the USA which result in devastating consequences reverberating throughout the world. His new mission this time to bring down The President of the United States and his Secret Service detail. Bill brings with him all the freak-in havoc and acidity of the previous 2 movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntVqmu3vVZrIax3bza81fWUtSJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395925'),
  ('342120575319977592', 'Rampant', 2018, 'Action, Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Lee Seong-je, Lee Byeong-hoon, Kim Sung-hoon', 'Hwang Jo-yoon, Won Shin-yun', 'Hyun Bin, Jang Dong-gun, Jo Woo-jin, Jeong Man-sik, Lee Sun-bin, Kim Eui-sung, Kim Tae-woo, Jo Dal-hwan', 'NR', 'Ancient Korea, 17th century. While the paranoid King Lee Jo of Joseon, vassal of the Qing dynasty, feels surrounded by conspirators and rebels, a dark evil emerges from the bowels of a merchant ship and the exiled Prince Lee Cheung returns to the royal court, ignoring that he will have to lead the few capable of defeating the ambitious humans and the bloody monsters who threaten to destroy the kingdom.', 'Ancient Korea, 17th century. While the paranoid King Lee Jo of Joseon, vassal of the Qing dynasty, feels surrounded by conspirators and rebels, a dark evil emerges from the bowels of a merchant ship and the exiled Prince Lee Cheung returns to the royal court, ignoring that he will have to lead the few capable of defeating the ambitious humans and the bloody monsters who threaten to destroy the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88F0FLFknAIdnPfXxWuSqnICD4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537190'),
  ('179111367834088483', 'Rampart', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', 'Oren Moverman, Bobby Bukowski, William Paul Clark', 'James Ellroy, Oren Moverman', 'Woody Harrelson, Robin Wright, Sigourney Weaver, Ned Beatty, Ben Foster, Ice Cube, Anne Heche, Cynthia Nixon', 'R', 'The story follows veteran police officer Dave Brown, the last of the renegade cops, as he struggles to take care of his family, and fights for his own survival.', 'The story follows veteran police officer Dave Brown, the last of the renegade cops, as he struggles to take care of his family, and fights for his own survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUlYwDmkytszsDvyIPn66pdqgZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75622'),
  ('616552880559062678', 'Rampo Noir', 2005, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Hisayasu Satō, Akio Jissoji, Suguru Takeuchi', 'Akio Satsukawa, Suguru Takeuchi, Shirō Yumeno', 'Tadanobu Asano, Hiroki Narimiya, Ryuhei Matsuda, Yukiko Okamoto, Nao Omori, Minori Terada, Yumi Yoshiyuki, Yuko Daike', null, 'An anthology film consisting of four segments based on literary works by Edogawa Ranpo.', 'An anthology film consisting of four segments based on literary works by Edogawa Ranpo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xktqY1aq0944nlcAcXcQt38XOpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47408'),
  ('1102462514581851688', 'Ramprasad Ki Tehrvi', 2021, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Seema Pahwa', 'Seema Pahwa', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Parambrata Chatterjee, Konkona Sen Sharma, Manoj Pahwa, Vinay Pathak, Supriya Pathak, Sarika Singh, Vineet Kumar', null, 'Ramprasad''s entire family gathers under one roof for 13 days after his death, to perform and observe the Hindu traditions and rituals called the tehrvi. During the course, the family’s dynamics, politics, and insecurities come out, and then they realise that the importance of people and things are only evident in retrospect.', 'Ramprasad''s entire family gathers under one roof for 13 days after his death, to perform and observe the Hindu traditions and rituals called the tehrvi. During the course, the family’s dynamics, politics, and insecurities come out, and then they realise that the importance of people and things are only evident in retrospect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isiZRJmqQ0Wu7ELJrBdqD8P2HI6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643807'),
  ('768736981754565152', 'Ramrod', 1947, 'Western', 'Russell Harlan, André de Toth', 'Cecile Kramer, Jack Moffitt, C. Graham Baker', 'Joel McCrea, Veronica Lake, Don DeFore, Donald Crisp, Preston Foster, Arleen Whelan, Charles Ruggles, Lloyd Bridges', 'NR', 'A cattle-vs.-sheepman feud loses Connie Dickason her fiance, but gains her his ranch, which she determines to run alone in opposition to Frank Ivey, "boss" of the valley, whom her father Ben wanted her to marry. She hires recovering alcoholic Dave Nash as foreman and a crew of Ivey''s enemies. Ivey fights back with violence and destruction, but Dave is determined to counter him legally... a feeling not shared by his associates. Connie''s boast that, as a woman, she doesn''t need guns proves justified, but plenty of gunplay results.', 'A cattle-vs.-sheepman feud loses Connie Dickason her fiance, but gains her his ranch, which she determines to run alone in opposition to Frank Ivey, "boss" of the valley, whom her father Ben wanted her to marry. She hires recovering alcoholic Dave Nash as foreman and a crew of Ivey''s enemies. Ivey fights back with violence and destruction, but Dave is determined to counter him legally... a feeling not shared by his associates. Connie''s boast that, as a woman, she doesn''t need guns proves justified, but plenty of gunplay results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NWwT1YhZKcSDben3OZiEbAlaRY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60541'),
  ('486313651289976759', 'Rams', 2015, 'Drama', 'Grímur Hákonarson, Sturla Brandth Grøvlen', 'Grímur Hákonarson', 'Sigurður Sigurjónsson, Theodór Júlíusson, Charlotte Bøving, Jón Benónýsson, Gunnar Jónsson, Sveinn Ólafur Gunnarsson, Þorleifur Einarsson, Ingrid Jónsdóttir', 'R', 'In a secluded valley in Iceland, Gummi and Kiddi live side by side, tending to their sheep. Their ancestral sheep-stock is considered one of the country’s best and the two brothers are repeatedly awarded for their prized rams who carry an ancient lineage. Although they share the land and a way of life, Gummi and Kiddi have not spoken to each other in four decades. When a lethal disease suddenly infects Kiddi’s sheep, the entire valley comes under threat. The authorities decide to cull all the animals in the area to contain the outbreak. But Gummi and Kiddi don’t give up so easily – and each brother tries to stave off the disaster in his own fashion: Kiddi by using his rifle and Gummi by using his wits.', 'In a secluded valley in Iceland, Gummi and Kiddi live side by side, tending to their sheep. Their ancestral sheep-stock is considered one of the country’s best and the two brothers are repeatedly awarded for their prized rams who carry an ancient lineage. Although they share the land and a way of life, Gummi and Kiddi have not spoken to each other in four decades. When a lethal disease suddenly infects Kiddi’s sheep, the entire valley comes under threat. The authorities decide to cull all the animals in the area to contain the outbreak. But Gummi and Kiddi don’t give up so easily – and each brother tries to stave off the disaster in his own fashion: Kiddi by using his rifle and Gummi by using his wits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pk75njhxcxTJAl0FJ1V2ROGIEy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336222'),
  ('203727351786795749', 'Rams', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jeremy Sims', 'Grímur Hákonarson', 'Sam Neill, Michael Caton, Miranda Richardson, Wayne Blair, Asher Keddie, Leon Ford, Hayley McElhinney, Travis McMahon', null, 'In remote Western Australia, two estranged farmer brothers, Colin and Les, are at war. But when Les'' prize ram is diagnosed with a rare and lethal illness, authorities order a purge of every sheep in the valley—so the brothers must work together to reunite their family, save their herd, and bring their community back together.', 'In remote Western Australia, two estranged farmer brothers, Colin and Les, are at war. But when Les'' prize ram is diagnosed with a rare and lethal illness, authorities order a purge of every sheep in the valley—so the brothers must work together to reunite their family, save their herd, and bring their community back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2WkyqJE2QiXkFPi8MZiYUiwbeL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659994'),
  ('1092958691345916857', 'Ran', 1985, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Takao Saitō, Shoji Ueda, Asakazu Nakai', 'Hideo Oguni, Akira Kurosawa, Masato Ide', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Akira Terao, Jinpachi Nezu, Daisuke Ryū, Mieko Harada, Yoshiko Miyazaki, Mansai Nomura, Hisashi Igawa', 'R', 'Shakespeare''s King Lear is reimagined as a singular historical epic set in sixteenth-century Japan where an aging warlord divides his kingdom between his three sons.', 'Shakespeare''s King Lear is reimagined as a singular historical epic set in sixteenth-century Japan where an aging warlord divides his kingdom between his three sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gKWXRVgesduqHDfR8siXppfELO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11645'),
  ('395167912987886134', 'Rana: The Legend of Shadow Lake', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Adventure', 'Bill Rebane, Bill Rebane, Bela St. Jon', 'Lyoma Denetz, Jerry Gregoris, Mike Landers', 'Paul Callaway, Richard Lange, Glenn Scherer, Brad Ellingson, Karen McDiarmind, Alan Ross, Julie Wheaton, Jerry Gregoris', null, 'After a terrifying youth encounter with a strange half man/half frog monster living in a lake that killed his father, a young man returns to search for the monster''s hidden treasure, and to see if the legendary creature really was killed.', 'After a terrifying youth encounter with a strange half man/half frog monster living in a lake that killed his father, a young man returns to search for the monster''s hidden treasure, and to see if the legendary creature really was killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mwJX5yiB1U9ZMXUXwymlnUwdvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214198'),
  ('597636662996599197', 'Ranapati Shivray Swari Agra', 2026, 'Drama, History', 'Digpal Lanjekar', 'Digpal Lanjekar', 'Abhijeet Shwetachandra, Sameer Dharmadhikari, Ajay Purkar, Puneet Issar, Mrinal Kulkarni', null, 'A captive king turns the tables on his Mughal captors, engineering an ingenious escape from Agra that will echo through centuries of Indian history.', 'A captive king turns the tables on his Mughal captors, engineering an ingenious escape from Agra that will echo through centuries of Indian history.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2268tC1Udy7FkZ0Zm2bANUBXBRt.jpg', 'plex:movie:ranapati-shivray-swari-agra'),
  ('494519101209244312', 'Rancho Deluxe', 1975, 'Comedy, Western', 'Frank Perry, William A. Fraker, David Hamburger', 'Thomas McGuane', 'Jeff Bridges, Sam Waterston, Elizabeth Ashley, Clifton James, Slim Pickens, Charlene Dallas, Harry Dean Stanton, Richard Bright', 'R', 'Two drifters, of widely varying backgrounds, rustle cattle and try to avoid being caught in contemporary Montana.', 'Two drifters, of widely varying backgrounds, rustle cattle and try to avoid being caught in contemporary Montana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YiawzqRAQZ6BdPLJfvzFFxm18k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42261'),
