  ('13819702144215293', 'Random Hearts', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Philippe Rousselot, Sydney Pollack', 'Kurt Luedtke, Darryl Ponicsan', 'Harrison Ford, Kristin Scott Thomas, Charles S. Dutton, Richard Jenkins, Dennis Haysbert, Sydney Pollack, Susanna Thompson, Peter Coyote', 'R', 'After losing their spouses in a plane crash, an internal affairs cop and a congresswoman find each other''s keys in each other''s loved ones'' possessions and discover that the two were having an affair.', 'After losing their spouses in a plane crash, an internal affairs cop and a congresswoman find each other''s keys in each other''s loved ones'' possessions and discover that the two were having an affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7LoKDWDesvYD7DXDh9Ewlxtcx8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12618'),
  ('596057012645533445', 'Randy Rides Alone', 1934, 'Action, Western', 'Harry L. Fraser, Archie Stout', 'Harry L. Fraser', 'John Wayne, Alberta Vaughn, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Earl Dwire, Artie Ortego, Tex Phelps, Tex Palmer, Mack V. Wright', 'NR', 'Bandits lead by Matt the Mute enter a bar and kill multiple people. Randy Bowers comes to town and is framed by Matt the Mute, who is working with the sheriff (who doesn''t know Matt is really a criminal). Randy escapes with the help of the niece of the dead owner of the bar. Bowers ends up running from the sheriff, and ends up in the cave in which the bandits have their hide-out…', 'Bandits lead by Matt the Mute enter a bar and kill multiple people. Randy Bowers comes to town and is framed by Matt the Mute, who is working with the sheriff (who doesn''t know Matt is really a criminal). Randy escapes with the help of the niece of the dead owner of the bar. Bowers ends up running from the sheriff, and ends up in the cave in which the bandits have their hide-out…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hlA9T78zEwGBNJcVN4RmM6HYPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22602'),
  ('606132966380549941', 'Rang De', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Venky Atluri, P. C. Sreeram, Siddhartha Swayambhoo', 'Venky Atluri', 'Nithiin, Keerthy Suresh, Naresh, Kausalya, Rohini, Brahmaji, Vennela Kishore, Vineeth Radhakrishnan', null, 'Arjun detests Anu because she has always stolen his thunder ever since she step foot in their colony years ago. Will he ever find it in his heart to love her like she loves him?', 'Arjun detests Anu because she has always stolen his thunder ever since she step foot in their colony years ago. Will he ever find it in his heart to love her like she loves him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1USrpUYiRkAj8ArEG5jUUXCCEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795104'),
  ('1095461023304063372', 'Rang De Basanti', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, History, Romance', 'Rakeysh Omprakash Mehra, Binod Pradhan, Ramnath Shetty', 'Rakeysh Omprakash Mehra, Renzil D''Silva', 'Aamir Khan, Siddharth, Kunal Kapoor, Sharman Joshi, Atul Kulkarni, Alice Patten, Soha Ali Khan, R. Madhavan', 'PG-13', 'After a group of friends graduate from Delhi University, they listlessly haunt their old campus, until a British filmmaker casts them in a film she''s making about freedom fighters under British rule. Although the group is largely apolitical, the tragic death of a friend owing to local government corruption awakens their patriotism. Inspired by the freedom fighters they represent in the film, the friends collectively decide to avenge the killing.', 'After a group of friends graduate from Delhi University, they listlessly haunt their old campus, until a British filmmaker casts them in a film she''s making about freedom fighters under British rule. Although the group is largely apolitical, the tragic death of a friend owing to local government corruption awakens their patriotism. Inspired by the freedom fighters they represent in the film, the friends collectively decide to avenge the killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1bF8CHzEu621bPSIg6XiUNAabh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7913'),
  ('968089246799288342', 'Rang Rasiya', 2014, 'Drama, History', 'Ketan Mehta', 'Sanjeev Dutta, Ketan Mehta', 'Randeep Hooda, Nandana Sen, Paresh Rawal, Rashaana Shah, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Sachin Khedekar, Darshan Jariwala, Vikram Gokhale', null, 'A look a the life of 19th century Indian painter Raja Ravi Varma.', 'A look a the life of 19th century Indian painter Raja Ravi Varma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2ypUUowSJvGjoHAfJXtuFpvTmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302431'),
  ('573306809637656224', 'Rangasthalam', 2018, 'Action, Drama', 'Thota Srinivas, Srikanth Odela, Palnati Surya Pratap', 'Palnati Surya Pratap', 'Ram Charan, Aadhi Pinisetty, Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Jagapati Babu, Prakash Raj, Anasuya Bharadwaj, Mahesh Achanta, Naresh', 'PG-13', 'Chitti Babu begins to suspect his elder brother''s life is in danger after they team up to lock horns with their village president and overthrow his unlawful 30 year old regime.', 'Chitti Babu begins to suspect his elder brother''s life is in danger after they team up to lock horns with their village president and overthrow his unlawful 30 year old regime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiEzDgBBFC25Zd6z0r7sMngn5vr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461126'),
  ('792667814408090219', 'Range 15', 2016, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Ross Patterson, Jesús Hernández', 'Ross Patterson, Nick Palmisciano, Billy Jay', 'Sean Astin, Keith David, Danny Trejo, William Shatner, Mindy Robinson, Bryan Callen, Ross Patterson, Ron Jeremy', null, 'A group of veterans wake up after a night of partying to find out that the zombie apocalypse has spread across the United States. Together, they must fight their way across the country in order to find a cure for the outbreak and restore freedom before it''s too late.', 'A group of veterans wake up after a night of partying to find out that the zombie apocalypse has spread across the United States. Together, they must fight their way across the country in order to find a cure for the outbreak and restore freedom before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bnV3UBCoU8kikdg3gy2ys9GijJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402976'),
