  ('1148773076687374381', 'Raped On The Beach', 1971, 'Drama, Romance', 'Renzo Cerrato, Jacqueline Audry, Edmond Séchan', 'Pierluigi Ciriaci, Giovanni Simonelli', 'Carole André, Christine Caron, Angelo Infanti, Marisa Solinas, Tiberio Murgia, Giustino Durano, Luigi Barbini, Pietro Tordi', null, 'A young girl witnesses a violent and ultimately fatal act between her mother and another man and it emotionally scars her for years to come. As a young woman, she takes a vacation with a more worldly girlfriend to Sardinia, and in doing so, attracts the attention of a young man in the village. Despite her interest in the man her haunted past prevents her from developing a normal relationship with him.', 'A young girl witnesses a violent and ultimately fatal act between her mother and another man and it emotionally scars her for years to come. As a young woman, she takes a vacation with a more worldly girlfriend to Sardinia, and in doing so, attracts the attention of a young man in the village. Despite her interest in the man her haunted past prevents her from developing a normal relationship with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2dFoAcErrnttCx86RxRP7CqIx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125182'),
  ('808445412675657606', 'Rapeman 1', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Takao Nagaishi, Ryuji Kawasaki', 'Jun Furushô', 'Hiroyuki Okita, Sakae Umezu, Atsuko Takano, Minako Ogawa, Junko Asahina, Masanori Irie, Kenzō Ogiwara, Akira Otani', null, 'In this first installment of the series - we are introduced to Keisuke: mild mannered school-teacher by day - avenging angel of rape by night - and his goofy Uncle, who together run Rapeman Services. Their "services" are called-upon by a nightclub owner who tells a sob story about having her boyfriend, a current political candidate, stolen by his secretary, and asks Rapeman to "take care of her" as an act of revenge. This is done per the nightclub owner''s request - but we soon find that the story was just a cover to cause a bigger scandal that involves rival a seedy rival politician and the Yakuza...', 'In this first installment of the series - we are introduced to Keisuke: mild mannered school-teacher by day - avenging angel of rape by night - and his goofy Uncle, who together run Rapeman Services. Their "services" are called-upon by a nightclub owner who tells a sob story about having her boyfriend, a current political candidate, stolen by his secretary, and asks Rapeman to "take care of her" as an act of revenge. This is done per the nightclub owner''s request - but we soon find that the story was just a cover to cause a bigger scandal that involves rival a seedy rival politician and the Yakuza...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqOxRRowJHsFEi9r0ELiUivflk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106726'),
