  ('854580398944932705', 'Raptor', 2001, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jim Wynorski, Andrea V. Rossotto, D. Milton Johnson', 'Jim Wynorski, Frances Doel', 'Eric Roberts, Corbin Bernsen, Melissa Brasselle, Tim Abell, William Langlois, Harrison Page, Lorissa McComas, Frank Novak', 'R', 'When a series of unexplained vicious animal attacks strikes his community, Sheriff Jim Tanner and his assistant Barbara trace them back to a Dr. Hyde, a former military researcher whose government funding for a dinosaur cloning project was cut. When the Pentagon discovers Hyde obtained foreign backing to continue his experiments, they send in a strike team to save Tanner and Barbara and stop Hyde.', 'When a series of unexplained vicious animal attacks strikes his community, Sheriff Jim Tanner and his assistant Barbara trace them back to a Dr. Hyde, a former military researcher whose government funding for a dinosaur cloning project was cut. When the Pentagon discovers Hyde obtained foreign backing to continue his experiments, they send in a strike team to save Tanner and Barbara and stop Hyde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIY0CsTaxV3OxvtwV9NdtPa7uWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9938'),
