  ('852390007027728136', 'Rara', 2016, 'Drama', 'Pepa San Martín, Enrique Stindt, Marianne Mayer-Beckh', 'Pepa San Martín, Alicia Scherson', 'Julia Lübbert, Emilia Ossandón, Mariana Loyola, Agustina Muñoz, Coca Guazzini, Daniel Muñoz, Claudia Celedón, Sigrid Alegría', null, 'Since their parents split up, Sara and her younger sister live with their mother, whose new partner is a woman. Everyday life for the four of them is hardly any different than it is for other families. But not everyone sees it that way – Sara''s father in particular has his doubts. As Sara’s 13th birthday approaches, she feels rather overwhelmed: her first crush, a body in the midst of changes and to top it off, conflicts over loyalty with her parents.', 'Since their parents split up, Sara and her younger sister live with their mother, whose new partner is a woman. Everyday life for the four of them is hardly any different than it is for other families. But not everyone sees it that way – Sara''s father in particular has his doubts. As Sara’s 13th birthday approaches, she feels rather overwhelmed: her first crush, a body in the midst of changes and to top it off, conflicts over loyalty with her parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsgx02RjFAxGuG9X9KvzxkzFwbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382906'),
