  ('1113659625881152643', 'Rasputin', 1984, 'Drama, History, Action, War', 'Ernst Hofbauer, Olaf R. Benold, Franz Xaver Lederle', 'C.M. Sherland, Ernst Hofbauer', 'Alexander Conte, Uschi Karnat, Werner Singh, Eleonore Melzer, Marianne Wäckerle, Rolf Ernser, Sascha Atzenbeck, Ralph Wieck', null, 'The monk Rasputin is summoned by the Russian nobility to use his healing powers to heal the dying heir to the Russian Empire.', 'The monk Rasputin is summoned by the Russian nobility to use his healing powers to heal the dying heir to the Russian Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5VrBkLEImzY2EAIC7XzuhcKtx0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343114'),
  ('160221888085403999', 'Rasputin', 1996, 'History, Drama, TV Movie', 'Uli Edel, Elemér Ragályi', 'Peter Pruce', 'Alan Rickman, Greta Scacchi, Ian McKellen, David Warner, John Wood, James Frain, Ian Hogg, Sheila Ruskin', 'R', 'Into an era seething with war and revolution, a man comes with an incredible power to heal a nation...or destroy it. Based on the true story of one of the most powerful and mysterious figures in Russian history.', 'Into an era seething with war and revolution, a man comes with an incredible power to heal a nation...or destroy it. Based on the true story of one of the most powerful and mysterious figures in Russian history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16UlqPiJA5WTGzrLjth05xSHcfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46827'),
  ('23108361602984342', 'Rasputin', 2013, 'History, TV Movie', 'Ennio Guarnieri, Josée Dayan, Tatyana Statsman', 'Irakli Kvirikadze, Vincent Fargeat, Philippe Besson', 'Gérard Depardieu, Fanny Ardant, Vladimir Mashkov, Irina Alfyorova, Yuri Kolokolnikov, Konstantin Khabenskiy, Kseniya Rappoport, Anna Mikhalkova', null, 'A group of Russian noblemen want to maintain the monarchy and plan to kill Rasputin.', 'A group of Russian noblemen want to maintain the monarchy and plan to kill Rasputin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngkemGuEYWfIt08aHjBm73d3n2h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82123'),
  ('518763760855951148', 'Rasputin and the Empress', 1932, 'Drama, History', 'Richard Boleslawski, Douglas Shearer, William H. Daniels', 'Ben Hecht', 'John Barrymore, Ethel Barrymore, Lionel Barrymore, Ralph Morgan, Tad Alexander, Diana Wynyard, C. Henry Gordon, Edward Arnold', 'NR', 'The story of corrupt, power-hungry, manipulative Grigori Rasputin''s influence on members of the Russian Imperial family and others, and what resulted.', 'The story of corrupt, power-hungry, manipulative Grigori Rasputin''s influence on members of the Russian Imperial family and others, and what resulted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txLqNjctfiVbCyxIKa261W5tz70.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43132'),
  ('847873372582328560', 'Rasputin: The Mad Monk', 1966, 'Horror', 'Michael Reed, Don Sharp, Bert Batt', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Christopher Lee, Barbara Shelley, Richard Pasco, Francis Matthews, Suzan Farmer, Dinsdale Landen, Renée Asherson, Derek Francis', null, 'Rasputin, a crazed and debauched monk wreaks havoc at the local inn one night, chopping off the hand of one of the drinkers. As the bitter locals plan their revenge, the evil Rasputin works his power over the beautiful women who serve at the Tsar''s palace. Even the Tsarina herself is seduced by his evil ways and, as his influence begins to dominate government policy, there is only one course of action left... to destroy him before he destroys them all.', 'Rasputin, a crazed and debauched monk wreaks havoc at the local inn one night, chopping off the hand of one of the drinkers. As the bitter locals plan their revenge, the evil Rasputin works his power over the beautiful women who serve at the Tsar''s palace. Even the Tsarina herself is seduced by his evil ways and, as his influence begins to dominate government policy, there is only one course of action left... to destroy him before he destroys them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kACUmeHoIUPWiavUyKE1Tzkzldk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28669'),
  ('544945867139745058', 'Rat', 2000, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Steve Barron, Brendan Galvin, Ciara Gormley', 'Wesley Burrowes', 'Imelda Staunton, Frank Kelly, David Wilmot, Kerry Condon, Andrew Lovern, Pete Postlethwaite, Ed Byrne, Niall Tóibín', 'PG', 'After a night of drinking Guiness at the local watering hole, an ordinary, working-class, family man in Dublin''s life is turned upside-down when he wakes up as a rat.', 'After a night of drinking Guiness at the local watering hole, an ordinary, working-class, family man in Dublin''s life is turned upside-down when he wakes up as a rat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeav7AvVZYXIOWhBd0Ps2wNMWbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118052'),
  ('1149731574727949808', 'Rat Fever', 2012, 'Drama', 'Cláudio Assis, Walter Carvalho', 'Hilton Lacerda', 'Irandhir Santos, Matheus Nachtergaele, Nanda Costa, Conceição Camaroti, Tânia Granussi, Maria Gladys, Ângela Leal, Juliano Cazarré', null, 'Zizo, a radical and anarchist poet living in a marginal quarter of Recife in the north eastern state of Pernambuco, distributes his social angst-filled thoughts through a publication named Febre do Rato, and spews poetry to anyone who’d listen. Our character always revolves within the universe that he has created around himself. A very particular world, in which satisfying the unfortunate is a mixture of a kind of benefit with high dose of malice.', 'Zizo, a radical and anarchist poet living in a marginal quarter of Recife in the north eastern state of Pernambuco, distributes his social angst-filled thoughts through a publication named Febre do Rato, and spews poetry to anyone who’d listen. Our character always revolves within the universe that he has created around himself. A very particular world, in which satisfying the unfortunate is a mixture of a kind of benefit with high dose of malice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWhRVK8mlUZpNkt4Wo3Z3hHrzgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133569'),
  ('638924593503268417', 'Rat Life and Diet in North America', 1968, 'Drama', 'Joyce Wieland', null, null, null, '“This film is against the corporate military industrial structure of global village.”', '“This film is against the corporate military industrial structure of global village.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbFiPk30W3HZhn4Ux0zO6QRA62k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128186'),
  ('1012872614091747585', 'Rat Man', 1988, 'Horror', 'Roberto Girometti, Rita Antonelli, Marcello Cannone', 'Elisa Briganti', 'David Warbeck, Janet Ågren, Eva Grimaldi, Luisa Menon, Werner Pochath, Nelson de la Rosa, Pepito Guerra, Anna Silvia Grullon', null, 'After a model is brutally murdered on a Caribbean island, her sister''s investigation uncovers a horrifying rat-like creature.', 'After a model is brutally murdered on a Caribbean island, her sister''s investigation uncovers a horrifying rat-like creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bqFnf9wLJOFgKZIG7I1je3f2vP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94016'),
  ('906891451701382674', 'Rat Race', 1980, 'Comedy', 'François Leterrier', 'Gérard Lauzier, François Leterrier', 'Christian Clavier, Nathalie Baye, Anémone, Eddy Mitchell, Catherine Serre, Maureen Kerwin, Marc Porel', null, 'Young dynamic executive, married and father of two children, Jérôme Ozendron dreams of writing and escaping a life he considers mediocre. The meeting with a former comrade, who had become an actor, brought him into contact with the world of cinema. He meets, Natacha, a cover girl, for whom he is ready to give up, wife and children. Then he becomes the lover of Lilianne, a marginal who persecutes and pursues him. He quit his job to devote himself to writing a novel. But nothing goes as he wants.', 'Young dynamic executive, married and father of two children, Jérôme Ozendron dreams of writing and escaping a life he considers mediocre. The meeting with a former comrade, who had become an actor, brought him into contact with the world of cinema. He meets, Natacha, a cover girl, for whom he is ready to give up, wife and children. Then he becomes the lover of Lilianne, a marginal who persecutes and pursues him. He quit his job to devote himself to writing a novel. But nothing goes as he wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aemu6pB04w9Ul7YbvwZ2xeYUpsz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51437'),
  ('1043768945349478190', 'Rat Race', 2001, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Jerry Zucker, Thomas E. Ackerman, Susan Turner', 'Andy Breckman', 'Gloria Allred, Breckin Meyer, Cuba Gooding Jr., Lanei Chapman, Amy Smart, Seth Green, Vince Vieluf, Whoopi Goldberg', 'PG-13', 'In an ensemble film about easy money, greed, manipulation and bad driving, a Las Vegas casino tycoon entertains his wealthiest high rollers -- a group that will bet on anything -- by pitting six ordinary people against each other in a wild dash for $2 million jammed into a locker hundreds of miles away. The tycoon and his wealthy friends monitor each racer''s every move to keep track of their favorites. The only rule in this race is that there are no rules.', 'In an ensemble film about easy money, greed, manipulation and bad driving, a Las Vegas casino tycoon entertains his wealthiest high rollers -- a group that will bet on anything -- by pitting six ordinary people against each other in a wild dash for $2 million jammed into a locker hundreds of miles away. The tycoon and his wealthy friends monitor each racer''s every move to keep track of their favorites. The only rule in this race is that there are no rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dpim9bLdi5uh55idJ6HxA7eZH4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9896'),
  ('823193067403531652', 'Ratas De La Ciudad', 1985, 'Action, Drama', 'Antonio de Anda, Valentín Trujillo', 'Valentín Trujillo, Gilberto de Anda', 'Valentín Trujillo, Rodolfo de Anda, Angélica Chain, Roberto ''El Flaco'' Guzmán, Isaura Espinoza, Humberto Elizondo, Juan Gallardo, Marcia Bell', null, 'A father on the search for his missing child discovers a revealing and shocking drama. The true adventures of thousands of juvenile criminals who live in a big city. They live in ghettos, in a world ful of violence, corruption and hate. They form gangs who attack and rob innocent victims, leaving a trail of terror behind.', 'A father on the search for his missing child discovers a revealing and shocking drama. The true adventures of thousands of juvenile criminals who live in a big city. They live in ghettos, in a world ful of violence, corruption and hate. They form gangs who attack and rob innocent victims, leaving a trail of terror behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hnCjxxGkfMFRSZL017eRHZX5Hi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90002'),
  ('803397905132983532', 'Ratataplan', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Mario Battistoni, Marco Mandelli', 'Maurizio Nichetti', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Angela Finocchiaro, Edy Angelillo, Lidia Biondi, Roland Topor, Giorgio White, Gero Caldarelli, Enrico Grazioli', null, 'Misadventures of Colombo, an engineer in Milano. He is the only winner of an admission test for a job, and just for this reason he isn''t hired. So he becomes a barman, and he discovers a special formula that turns simple water into the "Immortality drink". He is robbed of the magic water copyright. So he tries to set up a theatrical company, but the first show is a fiasco. Since finding a normal job seems a mission impossible, he tries to set the sentimental side of his life. He targets the most beautiful girl of his building, and for her he builds a robot able to dance like Tony Manero (John Travolta''s character in Saturday Night Fever (1977)). The robot gets drunk (!). It is another fiasco. So he targets an ugly girl and finally with her succeeds to live his surreal world for ever.', 'Misadventures of Colombo, an engineer in Milano. He is the only winner of an admission test for a job, and just for this reason he isn''t hired. So he becomes a barman, and he discovers a special formula that turns simple water into the "Immortality drink". He is robbed of the magic water copyright. So he tries to set up a theatrical company, but the first show is a fiasco. Since finding a normal job seems a mission impossible, he tries to set the sentimental side of his life. He targets the most beautiful girl of his building, and for her he builds a robot able to dance like Tony Manero (John Travolta''s character in Saturday Night Fever (1977)). The robot gets drunk (!). It is another fiasco. So he targets an ugly girl and finally with her succeeds to live his surreal world for ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9c6eHZhFShG4N3pwC2UMxwQk4EA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64817'),
  ('218304365819086353', 'Ratatoing', 2014, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Otto Evon, Chad Nigeringston, Michelle Gabriel', 'Marcos Hirsh', 'Douglas Guedes, Elisa Vilon, Sidney Ross, Cleber Martins, Claudio Satiro, Francisco Freitas, Raul Schlosser, Fernanda Padilha', 'G', 'Marcelle Toing, owner of the best restaurant in Rio de Janeiro, must go on missions to steal ingredients from human restaurants to keep his meals the best.', 'Marcelle Toing, owner of the best restaurant in Rio de Janeiro, must go on missions to steal ingredients from human restaurants to keep his meals the best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfg9WD96WldG7Q0ue9WlwqYb83w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199739'),
  ('398321759054408089', 'Ratatouille', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Brad Bird, Robert Anderson, David DeVan', 'Brad Bird', 'Patton Oswalt, Ian Holm, Lou Romano, Brian Dennehy, Peter Sohn, Peter O''Toole, Brad Garrett, Janeane Garofalo', 'G', 'Remy, a rat living in Paris, possesses a palate far more refined than that of his fellow comrades. He dreams of becoming a chef, determined to create culinary masterpieces rather than scavenge for scraps. When fate deposits him in the sewers beneath one of Paris’s most famous restaurants, he finds himself ideally placed to fulfill his dream. Forming an unusual alliance with a bumbling young kitchen worker, Remy begins a daring culinary double life. Together, they must outwit the scheming Head Chef Skinner, evade Remy’s disapproving colony, and impress renowned food critic Anton Ego, who strikes fear in the hearts of chefs all throughout France.', 'Remy, a rat living in Paris, possesses a palate far more refined than that of his fellow comrades. He dreams of becoming a chef, determined to create culinary masterpieces rather than scavenge for scraps. When fate deposits him in the sewers beneath one of Paris’s most famous restaurants, he finds himself ideally placed to fulfill his dream. Forming an unusual alliance with a bumbling young kitchen worker, Remy begins a daring culinary double life. Together, they must outwit the scheming Head Chef Skinner, evade Remy’s disapproving colony, and impress renowned food critic Anton Ego, who strikes fear in the hearts of chefs all throughout France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3vaWRPSf6WjDSamIkKDs1iQWna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2062'),
  ('320439091746790695', 'Ratcatcher', 1999, 'Drama', 'Lynne Ramsay, Alwin H. Küchler, John Armstrong', 'Lynne Ramsay', 'William Eadie, Tommy Flanagan, Mandy Matthews, Michelle Stewart, Lynne Ramsay Jr., Leanne Mullen, John Miller, Jackie Quinn', 'NR', 'James Gillespie is 12 years old. The world he knew is changing. Haunted by a secret, he has become a stranger in his own family. He is drawn to the canal where he creates a world of his own. He finds an awkward tenderness with Margaret Anne, a vulnerable 14 year old expressing a need for love in all the wrong ways, and befriends Kenny, who possesses an unusual innocence in spite of the harsh surroundings.', 'James Gillespie is 12 years old. The world he knew is changing. Haunted by a secret, he has become a stranger in his own family. He is drawn to the canal where he creates a world of his own. He finds an awkward tenderness with Margaret Anne, a vulnerable 14 year old expressing a need for love in all the wrong ways, and befriends Kenny, who possesses an unusual innocence in spite of the harsh surroundings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvrN33jql75Bd0I0i75oSJ9pXzX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29698'),
  ('1047367091720605013', 'Ratchet & Clank', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Jericca Cleland, Kevin Munroe, Ian Blum', 'T.J. Fixman, Kevin Munroe, Gerry Swallow', 'James Arnold Taylor, David Kaye, Jim Ward, Paul Giamatti, Armin Shimerman, Rosario Dawson, Bella Thorne, Vincent Tong', 'PG', 'When the galaxy comes under the threat of a nefarious space captain, a mechanic and his newfound robot ally join an elite squad of combatants to save the universe.', 'When the galaxy comes under the threat of a nefarious space captain, a mechanic and his newfound robot ally join an elite squad of combatants to save the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/649xP2LST4VIrZ5cLPw7Ys9movF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234004'),
  ('1112493642051333681', 'Rate Your Date', 2019, 'Comedy', 'David Dietl', null, 'Marc Benjamin, Nilam Farooq, Edin Hasanović, Alicia von Rittberg, Anatole Taubman, Rainer Bock, Anke Engelke, Helmfried von Lüttichau', null, 'Teresa und Patricia are best friends. Despite the big differences between date-experienced Teresa and romantically predisposed single-mother Patricia, they have one thing in common: they have enough of bad dates and are sick of stupid dudes, bad surprises and broken hearts. When Teresa meets the neurotic programmer Anton, who is completely inexperienced in the field of romance, they come up with a genius business idea: together with the womanizer and start-up founder Paul, they develop an app with which potential dates can be categorized. In this manner, users can paint a picture of what they''re getting themselves into. However, quite quickly they find out that people can''t be easily fit into boxes and that matters of the heart shouldn''t be left to an algorithm...', 'Teresa und Patricia are best friends. Despite the big differences between date-experienced Teresa and romantically predisposed single-mother Patricia, they have one thing in common: they have enough of bad dates and are sick of stupid dudes, bad surprises and broken hearts. When Teresa meets the neurotic programmer Anton, who is completely inexperienced in the field of romance, they come up with a genius business idea: together with the womanizer and start-up founder Paul, they develop an app with which potential dates can be categorized. In this manner, users can paint a picture of what they''re getting themselves into. However, quite quickly they find out that people can''t be easily fit into boxes and that matters of the heart shouldn''t be left to an algorithm...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlid8VU4DOgnqroMf0KDCCrzxei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570658'),
  ('1143098182440361849', 'Rated R', 2008, 'Drama', 'Félix Sabroso, Dunia Ayaso, David Azcano', 'Dunia Ayaso, Félix Sabroso', 'Candela Peña, Goya Toledo, Mar Flores, Luis Zahera, Antonio de la Torre, Julio Vélez, Jorge Calvo, Juan Viadas', null, 'Madrid, Spain, 1975. Sandra, Lina and Eva are three beautiful women who work as actresses in erotic movies. After meeting during a shoot, they become friends and begin to share experiences, concerns and successes in an era of increasing openness, although true freedom is still far away and demands a price hard to pay.', 'Madrid, Spain, 1975. Sandra, Lina and Eva are three beautiful women who work as actresses in erotic movies. After meeting during a shoot, they become friends and begin to share experiences, concerns and successes in an era of increasing openness, although true freedom is still far away and demands a price hard to pay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuiuvwmMDMWIsEciTzBarGyDSN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99214'),
  ('641221096922743760', 'Rated X', 2000, 'Drama', 'Emilio Estevez, Paul Sarossy', 'Norman Snider, David Hollander, Anne Meredith', 'Charlie Sheen, Emilio Estevez, Rafer Weigel, Tracy Hutson, Megan Ward, Terry O''Quinn, Danielle Brett, Nicole De Boer', null, 'Based on the true story of Jim and Artie Mitchell, two brothers who entered the porn industry in the early 60''s. After creating such legendary porn films as "Behind the Green Door" and "Inside Marily Chambers", they later became addicted to drugs and began a downward spiral leading to bankruptcy and murder.', 'Based on the true story of Jim and Artie Mitchell, two brothers who entered the porn industry in the early 60''s. After creating such legendary porn films as "Behind the Green Door" and "Inside Marily Chambers", they later became addicted to drugs and began a downward spiral leading to bankruptcy and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpe15WtOff8oRBoX4C7l80cTVVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27859'),
  ('677648560029657498', 'Raton Pass', 1951, 'Western', 'Edwin L. Marin, Wilfrid M. Cline, Oren Haglund', 'James R. Webb, Thomas W. Blackburn', 'Dennis Morgan, Patricia Neal, Steve Cochran, Scott Forbes, Dorothy Hart, Basil Ruysdael, Louis Jean Heydt, Roland Winters', 'NR', 'Raton Pass is a curious western based on the rules of Community Property. Dennis Morgan and Patricia Neal portray a recently married husband and wife, each of whom owns half of a huge cattle ranch. Neal is a tad more ambitious than her husband, and with the help of a little legal chicanery she tries to obtain Morgan''s half of the spread. He balks, so she hires a few gunslingers to press the issue. In a 1951 western, the greedy party usually came to a sorry end; Raton Pass adheres strictly to tradition.', 'Raton Pass is a curious western based on the rules of Community Property. Dennis Morgan and Patricia Neal portray a recently married husband and wife, each of whom owns half of a huge cattle ranch. Neal is a tad more ambitious than her husband, and with the help of a little legal chicanery she tries to obtain Morgan''s half of the spread. He balks, so she hires a few gunslingers to press the issue. In a 1951 western, the greedy party usually came to a sorry end; Raton Pass adheres strictly to tradition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/baB6FNYcL6cmF41BXUi4PUSBab9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234140'),
  ('119470752122757599', 'Rats', 2003, 'Horror', 'Tibor Takács, Barry Gravelle', 'Jace Anderson, Adam Gierasch', 'Sara Downing, Amy Parks, Bailey Chase, Michael Zelniker, Sean Cullen, Michael Hagerty, Tarri Markel, Ron Perlman', 'R', 'The Brookedale Psychiatric Hospital is a crumbling institution which barely has enough money to remain open. Formerly a prison, it sits atop a warren of tunnels and sewage system viaducts. But Brookdale has a secret - a secret known by only one person. There''s something living in the tunnels - something that''s developed a taste for human blood...', 'The Brookedale Psychiatric Hospital is a crumbling institution which barely has enough money to remain open. Formerly a prison, it sits atop a warren of tunnels and sewage system viaducts. But Brookdale has a secret - a secret known by only one person. There''s something living in the tunnels - something that''s developed a taste for human blood...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVP3Ssc4CJBqT1D7bO5ATm23fkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29556'),
  ('1039887748534722802', 'Rats', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Morgan Spurlock', null, 'Ed Sheehan, Bobby Corrigan', null, 'Based on Robert Sullivan’s bestselling book, Morgan Spurlock and his team travel around the world to bring viewers face to face with rats while delving into humans’ complicated relationship with the creepy creatures.', 'Based on Robert Sullivan’s bestselling book, Morgan Spurlock and his team travel around the world to bring viewers face to face with rats while delving into humans’ complicated relationship with the creepy creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/plypMjxhpRo5IyMm9Pmlxj3WpJb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410794'),
  ('471458245603052084', 'Rats: Night of Terror', 1984, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bruno Mattei, Henry Frogers, Franco Delli Colli', 'Claudio Fragasso, Hervé Piccini', 'Ottaviano Dell''Acqua, Geretta Geretta, Massimo Vanni, Gianni Franco, Ann-Gisel Glass, Henry Luciani, Cindy Leadbetter, Moune Duvivier', 'NR', 'One hundred years after a nuclear war has devastated the planet, society has been reborn into two factions; the underground society and the scavangers above in the wastelands. A group of scavangers on bikes come across a town infested with flesh eating rats, and soon the gore is spilling everywhere.', 'One hundred years after a nuclear war has devastated the planet, society has been reborn into two factions; the underground society and the scavangers above in the wastelands. A group of scavangers on bikes come across a town infested with flesh eating rats, and soon the gore is spilling everywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aa2pwEECMyKDjaGwTfpBhLR8TKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83223'),
  ('139800370005338726', 'Ratsasan', 2018, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'G. V. Perumal Varadhan, Ram Kumar, P. V. Shankar', 'Ram Kumar', 'Vishnu Vishal, Amala Paul, Suzane George, Munishkanth, Kaali Venkat, Radha Ravi, Ammu Abhirami, Monekha Siva', null, 'A serial killer is murdering school girls, and a newbie cop has to track him down before the victim count increases.', 'A serial killer is murdering school girls, and a newbie cop has to track him down before the victim count increases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mruUFlrVKiL994y3vvQBT8R2Vnf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412862'),
  ('297382939622527082', 'Ratter', 2015, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Branden Kramer, Stefan Haverkamp', 'Branden Kramer', 'Ashley Benson, Matt McGorry, Rebecca Naomi Jones, Jon Bass, Kaili Vernoff, Ted Koch, Tali Custer, Michael William Freeman', 'NR', 'Emma is a young and beautiful graduate student just starting a new life in New York City. Like most people her age, she is always connected - her phone and laptop are constant companions, documenting her most intimate moments. What she doesn''t realize is that she''s sharing her life with an uninvited and dangerous guest. A hacker is following Emma’s every move. When the voyeuristic thrill of watching her digitally isn''t enough, the situation escalates to a dangerous and terrifying level.', 'Emma is a young and beautiful graduate student just starting a new life in New York City. Like most people her age, she is always connected - her phone and laptop are constant companions, documenting her most intimate moments. What she doesn''t realize is that she''s sharing her life with an uninvited and dangerous guest. A hacker is following Emma’s every move. When the voyeuristic thrill of watching her digitally isn''t enough, the situation escalates to a dangerous and terrifying level.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSwYyxa12OqcrVnW6qPGqIBFyh2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320048'),
  ('296321876870694563', 'Rattle of a Simple Man', 1964, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Muriel Box', 'Charles Dyer', 'Harry H. Corbett, Diane Cilento, Thora Hird, Michael Medwin, Charles Dyer, Hugh Futcher, Brian Wilde, Alexander Davion', null, 'Percy Winthram is a naive young man who still lives at home with his mum. In London for the Cup Final with his friends, he finds himself in a Soho strip club, where he meets blonde hostess Cyrenne. Accepting a bet from friend Ginger, he accompanies Cyrenne back to her flat, and a boast-worthy night of lust seems to be on the cards. However, drained of beer and bravado, Percy''s innocence and vulnerability become all too evident.', 'Percy Winthram is a naive young man who still lives at home with his mum. In London for the Cup Final with his friends, he finds himself in a Soho strip club, where he meets blonde hostess Cyrenne. Accepting a bet from friend Ginger, he accompanies Cyrenne back to her flat, and a boast-worthy night of lust seems to be on the cards. However, drained of beer and bravado, Percy''s innocence and vulnerability become all too evident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOAQIJvX2YwwSqz2wSLZKNhaVwb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236387'),
  ('754118534741852186', 'Rattlers', 1976, 'Horror', 'John McCauley, Irv Goodnoff', 'Jerry Golding, John McCauley', 'Sam Chew Jr., Elisabeth Chauvet, Dan Priest, Ronald Gold, Al Dunlap, Dan Balentine, Gary Van Ormand, Darwin Joston', 'PG', 'A herpetologist investigating a series of fatal rattlesnake attacks discovers that the creatures have been infected by a mysterious nerve gas disposed of in the desert by the military.', 'A herpetologist investigating a series of fatal rattlesnake attacks discovers that the creatures have been infected by a mysterious nerve gas disposed of in the desert by the military.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZeOL9ugk7Mo0c6FV0vchTBaxxt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112481'),
  ('341411243819439086', 'Rattlesnake', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Zak Hilditch, Peter McGrew, Doug Metzger', 'Zak Hilditch', 'Carmen Ejogo, Theo Rossi, Emma Greenwell, Debrianna Mansini, Rio Alexander, Josh Kemble, Joy Jacobson, Tim Stafford', null, 'After a mysterious woman saves her daughter from a deadly snakebite, a single mother must repay the debt by killing a stranger before sundown.', 'After a mysterious woman saves her daughter from a deadly snakebite, a single mother must repay the debt by killing a stranger before sundown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cEr3S3Atr4eRlHmMOA1GvaX0f4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560362'),
  ('393208565636796517', 'Rattrapage', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Noirhomme, Tristan Séguéla', 'Olivier Demangel, Tristan Séguéla', 'Jimmy Labeeu, Anthony Sonigo, Vincent Desagnat, Tanguy Onakoy, Max Baissette de Malglaive, Ramzy Bedia, Albert Delpy, Baptiste Lorber', null, 'Guillaume and his friends have planned to attend the biggest electronic music festical to celebrate their passing school… but Guillaume has to take the test once again and has to go over everything over the weekend.', 'Guillaume and his friends have planned to attend the biggest electronic music festical to celebrate their passing school… but Guillaume has to take the test once again and has to go over everything over the weekend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRgotVcWfas25gCA2wYhRCPL6dl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432622'),
  ('331828792214078471', 'Rauf', 2016, 'Family, Drama, Romance', 'Soner Caner, Barış Kaya', 'Naz Çaybaşı', 'Alen Hüseyin Gürsoy, Yavuz Gürbüz, Şeyda Sözüer, Veli Ubic, Muhammed Ubic', null, 'Rauf hopes to win over his big crush, the older Zana, with the help of the colour pink. But what does pink really look like anyways, and will he even be able to find it in his snowy little Kurdish village up in the mountains? Meanwhile, disturbing rumours sweep in from the outside world.', 'Rauf hopes to win over his big crush, the older Zana, with the help of the colour pink. But what does pink really look like anyways, and will he even be able to find it in his snowy little Kurdish village up in the mountains? Meanwhile, disturbing rumours sweep in from the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1KtXETGUyg9TkWJ0NenMmKWCrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389116'),
  ('868007221224753301', 'Raul: O Início, o Fim e o Meio', 2012, 'Music, Documentary', 'Lula Carvalho, Walter Carvalho, Evaldo Mocarzel', 'Leonardo Gudel', 'Raul Seixas, André Midani, Plínio Seixas, Maria Eugênia Seixas, Zé Walter, Waldir Serrão, Olival Viana Filho, Bráulio Tavares', null, 'As the world boiled in the rush of Easy Rider bikes, in the frenetic pace of Elvis Presley, in Beatniks poets, in the explosion of counterculture, a boy from Bahia gave birth to Rock in Brazil. A runaway flying saucer that abducted the hearts and minds of thousands of fans, Raul Seixas, a man who became a myth. Raul died young because he lived intensely. Rock n ''roll, free love, alternative society, drugs, black magic, military dictatorship, women and daughters. A man who wanted to live from his work and died for it. The beginning, the end and the middle are confused, because the story is not over. The film reveals through rare images of archive, meeting with relatives, conversations with artists, producers and friends, the trajectory of the legend of Rock.', 'As the world boiled in the rush of Easy Rider bikes, in the frenetic pace of Elvis Presley, in Beatniks poets, in the explosion of counterculture, a boy from Bahia gave birth to Rock in Brazil. A runaway flying saucer that abducted the hearts and minds of thousands of fans, Raul Seixas, a man who became a myth. Raul died young because he lived intensely. Rock n ''roll, free love, alternative society, drugs, black magic, military dictatorship, women and daughters. A man who wanted to live from his work and died for it. The beginning, the end and the middle are confused, because the story is not over. The film reveals through rare images of archive, meeting with relatives, conversations with artists, producers and friends, the trajectory of the legend of Rock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okfYRfPbX70WazoK2vU9Wc1yr65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129414'),
  ('874445829311256040', 'Raus', 2019, 'Drama', 'Philipp Hirsch, Ralf Noack', 'Philipp Hirsch, Thomas Böltken', 'Matti Schmidt-Schaller, Milena Tscharntke, Tom Gronau, Enno Trebs, Matilda Merkel, Tijan Marei, Frederik Schmid, Michael S. Ruscheinsky', null, 'Glocke had a simple plan to set the pimp Hermann''s SUV on fire, become an internet star and impress Lena. Instead, he drops into a mobile toilette and becomes a webfail. He decides to follow the web call to hike and search for the drop-out Friedrich. Together with Judith, Steffi, Elias and Paule he heads of into the Harz. As access to internet and smartphones are not allowed the plan to start all over again works and the adventure brings the five together. But each teenager has a secret of their own and soon the hike leads the teens to face their past.', 'Glocke had a simple plan to set the pimp Hermann''s SUV on fire, become an internet star and impress Lena. Instead, he drops into a mobile toilette and becomes a webfail. He decides to follow the web call to hike and search for the drop-out Friedrich. Together with Judith, Steffi, Elias and Paule he heads of into the Harz. As access to internet and smartphones are not allowed the plan to start all over again works and the adventure brings the five together. But each teenager has a secret of their own and soon the hike leads the teens to face their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqZpFfESpcEVZAvIQwMZya18uxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423669'),
  ('1027648642394850187', 'Rautakauppias Uuno Turhapuro, presidentin vävy', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Ere Kokkonen, Henrik Paersch, Martti Kakko', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Marjatta Raita, Marita Nordberg, Tapio Hämäläinen, Spede Pasanen, Simo Salminen, Juhani Kumpulainen, Liisa Paatso', null, 'Uuno''s father-in-law is running for president and to avoid embarrassment pressures Uuno to finally get a job, which he does at a hardware store. Meanwhile, a political rival sends a bionic female agent to seduce Uuno in hopes of creating a scandal, and Uuno develops a ploy where he pretends to be his long-lost brother from America.', 'Uuno''s father-in-law is running for president and to avoid embarrassment pressures Uuno to finally get a job, which he does at a hardware store. Meanwhile, a political rival sends a bionic female agent to seduce Uuno in hopes of creating a scandal, and Uuno develops a ploy where he pretends to be his long-lost brother from America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SWtF4uDKdcz52Ospt2Zswvgp9n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55558'),
  ('586497211803402337', 'Ravage', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Teddy Grennan, Vernon Guinn, Christopher Walters', 'Teddy Grennan', 'Annabelle Dexter-Jones, Robert Longstreet, Bruce Dern, Michael Weaver, Ross Partridge, Christopher Pinkalla, Eric Nelsen, Drake Shannon', null, 'When a nature photographer explains to the Police how she fought her way out of the Watchatoomy Valley, they dismiss her crazed and violent story as a meth-induced nightmare. But when they discover that she''s telling the truth, it''s too late.', 'When a nature photographer explains to the Police how she fought her way out of the Watchatoomy Valley, they dismiss her crazed and violent story as a meth-induced nightmare. But when they discover that she''s telling the truth, it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m24I9519Y6p5ajeaMB2lbFIQgYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637969'),
  ('415099943446991710', 'Ravagers', 1979, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Richard Compton, Vincent Saizis', 'Donald S. Sanford', 'Richard Harris, Ernest Borgnine, Ann Turkel, Art Carney, Anthony James, Woody Strode, Alana Stewart, Seymour Cassel', 'PG', 'In a post-apocalyptic world divided between two groups called the Flockers and the Ravagers, an adventurer and his "pleasure girl" try to find their way to a rumored safe haven called the Land of Genesis.', 'In a post-apocalyptic world divided between two groups called the Flockers and the Ravagers, an adventurer and his "pleasure girl" try to find their way to a rumored safe haven called the Land of Genesis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36c0zedU7fB8ZbO9kkycqiOk9VR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108061'),
  ('988579606856621661', 'Ravanaprabhu', 2001, 'Action, Drama', 'Ranjith, P. Sukumar', 'Ranjith', 'Mohanlal, Napoleon, Vasundhara Das, Siddique, Vijayaraghavan, Manoj K Jayan, Jagathy Sreekumar, Jagadish', null, 'Karthikeyan, a liquor baron, sets out to take back his ancestral house which was usurped by Shekharan. To seek revenge, Karthikeyan abducts Shekharan''s daughter and ends up falling in love with her.', 'Karthikeyan, a liquor baron, sets out to take back his ancestral house which was usurped by Shekharan. To seek revenge, Karthikeyan abducts Shekharan''s daughter and ends up falling in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnnIQ5jotRzefDN8ISp3reYJf4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240160'),
  ('1068929416113772013', 'Ravanello pallido', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Costantino, Italo Petriccione', 'Luciana Littizzetto, Fabio Bonifacci', 'Luciana Littizzetto, Massimo Venturiello, Renato Scarpa, Neri Marcorè, Gianfranco Barra, Margherita Antonelli, Michele Di Mauro, Giancarlo Previati', null, 'Gemma works as an employee in the office of an agency that is responsible for launching novice models into their first career steps. However, Gemma does not work in a peaceful atmosphere due to her particularly demanding employer and the harassment she suffers from her own clients. Equally unhappy is her love life, which is why her only friend, as well as her trusted hairdresser, dyes her hair pink. It is from that moment that her life changes radically.', 'Gemma works as an employee in the office of an agency that is responsible for launching novice models into their first career steps. However, Gemma does not work in a peaceful atmosphere due to her particularly demanding employer and the harassment she suffers from her own clients. Equally unhappy is her love life, which is why her only friend, as well as her trusted hairdresser, dyes her hair pink. It is from that moment that her life changes radically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qY5bIfq6jV1YoOZ8w9UoaZMk1bM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33497'),
  ('1141344119195226003', 'Raven', 1996, 'Action, Thriller', 'Russell Solberg, Charles Croughwell', 'Joe Hart', 'Burt Reynolds, Matt Battaglia, Krista Allen, Richard Gant, David Ackroyd, Angela Harry, Walter Olkewicz, Madison Mason', null, 'Martin Grant has been hiding for years to escape his past as a ruthless mercenary in the elite force Raven Team. He''s recently been engaged and are trying to forget the nightmares of murder and betrayal. Martin was convinced, that he could escape... But no one escapes from the Raven Teams ruthless leader Raven. At least not alive. Raven is back with a new team to hunt down and eliminate Grant...', 'Martin Grant has been hiding for years to escape his past as a ruthless mercenary in the elite force Raven Team. He''s recently been engaged and are trying to forget the nightmares of murder and betrayal. Martin was convinced, that he could escape... But no one escapes from the Raven Teams ruthless leader Raven. At least not alive. Raven is back with a new team to hunt down and eliminate Grant...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3F74Rzv4opK4foi8LTr81dDqLyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36876'),
  ('61365449479137758', 'Raven Hawk', 1996, 'Drama, Action, TV Movie', 'George Mooradian, Albert Pyun, David L. Butler', 'Kevin Alyn Elders', 'Rachel McLish, John Enos III, Ed Lauter, Matt Clark, Michael Champion, Mitch Pileggi, Mitchell Ryan, Nicholas Guest', null, 'A Native-American woman, who was framed for the murders of her parents years before, returns to her reservation to seek revenge.', 'A Native-American woman, who was framed for the murders of her parents years before, returns to her reservation to seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9DJNi0p46JOa0YFy2MXBqFcQaz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215763'),
  ('349199123715199727', 'Raven''s End', 1963, 'Drama', 'Bo Widerberg, Jan Lindeström', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Thommy Berggren, Emy Storm, Keve Hjelm, Ingvar Hirdwall, Christina Frambäck, Agneta Prytz, Nina Widerberg, Louise Gustafsson', null, 'In 1936, aspiring writer Anders, along with his friend Sixten, is desperate to escape his working-class upbringing. Anders'' father is an unemployed alcoholic and his mother slaves away at a laundry to support the family. A ray of hope comes Anders'' way when he finishes his first novel and submits it to a publisher. But after his girlfriend gets pregnant, his future dims before his eyes once more.', 'In 1936, aspiring writer Anders, along with his friend Sixten, is desperate to escape his working-class upbringing. Anders'' father is an unemployed alcoholic and his mother slaves away at a laundry to support the family. A ray of hope comes Anders'' way when he finishes his first novel and submits it to a publisher. But after his girlfriend gets pregnant, his future dims before his eyes once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOct6yh6AFO4DyPiklDq0TYS02L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47206'),
  ('328588782355894777', 'Raven''s Hollow', 2022, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Christopher Hatton', 'Christopher Hatton, Chuck Reeves', 'Melanie Zanetti, William Moseley, Kate Dickie, David Hayman, Callum Woodhouse, Callum McGowan, Kyle Rowe, Oberon K.A. Adjepong', null, 'West Point cadet Edgar Allan Poe and four other cadets on a training exercise in upstate New York are drawn by a gruesome discovery into a forgotten community where they find a township guarding a frightening secret.', 'West Point cadet Edgar Allan Poe and four other cadets on a training exercise in upstate New York are drawn by a gruesome discovery into a forgotten community where they find a township guarding a frightening secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woYqEqtro2AMWHmwBy9429zB17x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996581'),
  ('1092127512337373331', 'Ravenous', 1999, 'Adventure, Western, Horror, Comedy', 'Antonia Bird, Anthony B. Richmond, Ricardo Spinacé', 'Ted Griffin', 'Guy Pearce, Robert Carlyle, David Arquette, Jeremy Davies, Jeffrey Jones, John Spencer, Stephen Spinella, Neal McDonough', 'R', 'After arriving at his new, remote Army outpost, Capt. John Boyd and his regiment aid a wounded frontiersman who recounts a horrifying tale of a wagon train murdered by its supposed guide – a vicious U.S. Army colonel gone rogue. Fearing the worst, the regiment heads out into the wilderness to verify the gruesome claims.', 'After arriving at his new, remote Army outpost, Capt. John Boyd and his regiment aid a wounded frontiersman who recounts a horrifying tale of a wagon train murdered by its supposed guide – a vicious U.S. Army colonel gone rogue. Fearing the worst, the regiment heads out into the wilderness to verify the gruesome claims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tJc9vIVYctNCajC1dU1oVcmIsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10212'),
  ('373732162506600094', 'Ravenous', 2017, 'Horror, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Robin Aubert, Steeve Desrosiers', 'Robin Aubert', 'Marc-André Grondin, Monia Chokri, Charlotte St-Martin, Micheline Lanctôt, Marie-Ginette Guay, Brigitte Poupart, Édouard Tremblay-Grenier, Luc Proulx', null, 'In an isolated rural community of Quebec, Canada, some inhabitants attack other people, hungry for human flesh. A few survivors gather and go deep into the forest to escape them.', 'In an isolated rural community of Quebec, Canada, some inhabitants attack other people, hungry for human flesh. A few survivors gather and go deep into the forest to escape them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6iSHI9PfkPwL6oEtmHRvqmIFBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415010'),
  ('297835885564275036', 'Ravioli Oli', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Andrey Nikiforov, Magomed Khalukhaev, Kirill Shunaev, Yury Semenov, Daria Liskova', 'Andrey Nikiforov, Roman Ivanov, Olga Malysheva, Nikita Pankov, Dmitry Kaznacheev, Dmitriy Kaznacheev', 'Olga Buzova, Vladimir Yaglych, Maksim Lagashkin, Wolfgang Cerny, Eva Smirnova', null, 'Russian pop diva Olga Buzova once again trusts the wrong man - Vadim tricks her into buying a loss-making provincial dumpling factory. Olga will have to go to the city of Nizhny Teplyshki to solve the problem and get rid of the unplanned business, but she will face resistance from local residents.', 'Russian pop diva Olga Buzova once again trusts the wrong man - Vadim tricks her into buying a loss-making provincial dumpling factory. Olga will have to go to the city of Nizhny Teplyshki to solve the problem and get rid of the unplanned business, but she will face resistance from local residents.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Flqn4mt8VQd5eT2avljgz7ddr3Xn.jpg', 'plex:movie:ravioli-oli'),
  ('50057736205681313', 'Raw', 2017, 'Horror, Drama', 'Julia Ducournau, Ruben Impens, Ingrid de Ribaucourt', 'Julia Ducournau', 'Garance Marillier, Ella Rumpf, Rabah Nait Oufella, Laurent Lucas, Joana Preiss, Bouli Lanners, Marion Vernoux, Thomas Mustin', 'R', 'In Justine''s family everyone is a vet and a vegetarian. At 16, she''s a gifted teen ready to take on her first year in vet school, where her older sister also studies. There, she gets no time to settle: hazing starts right away. Justine is forced to eat raw meat for the first time in her life. Unexpected consequences emerge as her true self begins to form.', 'In Justine''s family everyone is a vet and a vegetarian. At 16, she''s a gifted teen ready to take on her first year in vet school, where her older sister also studies. There, she gets no time to settle: hazing starts right away. Justine is forced to eat raw meat for the first time in her life. Unexpected consequences emerge as her true self begins to form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kc8jT1MAiKM0iwdjAwC5lQrTNry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393519'),
  ('701098472416233533', 'Raw Deal', 1948, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Anthony Mann, John Alton, Irving Friedman', 'Leopold Atlas, John C. Higgins', 'Dennis O''Keefe, Claire Trevor, Marsha Hunt, John Ireland, Raymond Burr, Curt Conway, Chili Williams, Richard Fraser', null, 'Joe Sullivan is itching to get out of prison. He''s taken the rap for his accomplice Rick, a sadistic mobster who owes him $50,000 from the job they pulled. Rick sets up an escape for Joe, assuming that Joe will be killed while fleeing. But with the help of his love-struck girl Pat and his sympathetic legal caseworker Ann, Joe gets further than Rick intended...', 'Joe Sullivan is itching to get out of prison. He''s taken the rap for his accomplice Rick, a sadistic mobster who owes him $50,000 from the job they pulled. Rick sets up an escape for Joe, assuming that Joe will be killed while fleeing. But with the help of his love-struck girl Pat and his sympathetic legal caseworker Ann, Joe gets further than Rick intended...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLC4VnigxhC4ovSZdH2JUjuXoYY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26167'),
  ('963499119408971387', 'Raw Deal', 1986, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Alex Thomson, John Irvin, Rod Schumacher', 'Norman Wexler, Gary DeVore', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Kathryn Harrold, Sam Wanamaker, Paul Shenar, Robert Davi, Ed Lauter, Darren McGavin, Joe Regalbuto', 'R', 'Mark Kaminsky is kicked out of the FBI for his rough treatment of a suspect. He winds up as the sheriff of a small town in North Carolina. FBI Chief Harry Shannon, whose son has been killed by a mobster named Patrovina, enlists Kaminsky in a personal vendetta with a promise of reinstatement into the FBI if Patrovina is taken down. To accomplish this, he must go undercover and join Patrovina''s gang.', 'Mark Kaminsky is kicked out of the FBI for his rough treatment of a suspect. He winds up as the sheriff of a small town in North Carolina. FBI Chief Harry Shannon, whose son has been killed by a mobster named Patrovina, enlists Kaminsky in a personal vendetta with a promise of reinstatement into the FBI if Patrovina is taken down. To accomplish this, he must go undercover and join Patrovina''s gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y2GgDyNJFELoSIVlRhFQSs23Uo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2099'),
  ('607840976841217603', 'Raw Edge', 1956, 'Romance, Western', 'John Sherwood, Joseph E. Kenney, Maury Gertsman', 'Harry Essex, Robert Hill', 'Rory Calhoun, Yvonne De Carlo, Mara Corday, Neville Brand, Rex Reason, Emile Meyer, Herbert Rudley, Robert J. Wilke', 'NR', 'A Texan arrives in Oregon and seeks justice for his innocently-hanged brother.', 'A Texan arrives in Oregon and seeks justice for his innocently-hanged brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxuo9YrBCD878zqpTk5CsPQJs6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126550'),
  ('41568566453176955', 'Raw Force', 1982, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Edward D. Murphy, Frank E. Johnson, Barbara Greenwood', 'Edward D. Murphy', 'Geoffrey Binney, Hope Holiday, Jillian Kesner, John Dresden, Jennifer Holmes, Carl Anthony, Carla Reynolds, Mark Tanous', 'R', 'A group of martial arts students are en route to an island that supposedly is home to the ghosts of martial artists who have lost their honor. A Hitler lookalike and his gang are running a female slavery operation on the island as well. Soon, the two groups meet and all sorts of crazy things happen which include cannibal monks, piranhas, zombies, and more!', 'A group of martial arts students are en route to an island that supposedly is home to the ghosts of martial artists who have lost their honor. A Hitler lookalike and his gang are running a female slavery operation on the island as well. Soon, the two groups meet and all sorts of crazy things happen which include cannibal monks, piranhas, zombies, and more!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tREHKq24p5vpMcOUy17Mbch70uv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30644'),
  ('22703091797855718', 'Raw Justice', 1994, 'Thriller, Action', 'David A. Prior', 'David A. Prior', 'Robert Hays, David Keith, Pamela Anderson, Leo Rossi, Stacy Keach, Ted Prior, Charles Napier, Javi Mulero', 'R', 'The mayor of a small town hires a bounty hunter to find his daughter''s killer, but it turns out to be a very dangerous job.', 'The mayor of a small town hires a bounty hunter to find his daughter''s killer, but it turns out to be a very dangerous job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tijFjcSlOMuvb07NKEgnYi7JOL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34750'),
  ('1011791200037280663', 'Raw Love', 2008, 'Romance, Drama', 'Martín Deus, Juan Chappa, Aureliano Gentile', 'Martín Deus', 'Valentino Arocena, Felipe Villanueva, Katja Alemann, Juan Pablo Cámara, Hugo Rodríguez, Natan Skigin, Nicolás Videla, Liliana Pace', null, 'A portrait of the last days of high school. Two friends spend all day long together, but this will inevitably come to an end. A beautiful sincere story of mixed emotions and secrets that dare not speak loud.', 'A portrait of the last days of high school. Two friends spend all day long together, but this will inevitably come to an end. A beautiful sincere story of mixed emotions and secrets that dare not speak loud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b5NK9WGEU5KQgAsr5x9jdvmI4y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99043'),
  ('345918671515362426', 'Raw Nerve', 1991, 'Action, Thriller, Horror', 'David A. Prior, Andrew Parke, Nano Segler', 'David A. Prior, Lawrence L. Simeone', 'Glenn Ford, Sandahl Bergman, Randall ''Tex'' Cobb, Ted Prior, Traci Lords, Jan-Michael Vincent, Red West, Graham Timbes', 'R', 'Race car driver Jimmy Clayton has mind-shattering visions of young women being ruthlessly murdered. An investigative reporter catches wind of Jimmy''s tale and tries to help him put the blood-soaked pieces together.', 'Race car driver Jimmy Clayton has mind-shattering visions of young women being ruthlessly murdered. An investigative reporter catches wind of Jimmy''s tale and tries to help him put the blood-soaked pieces together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMK2vC37Khsc5lTVg9MKcZc0SPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115201'),
  ('584714401173434871', 'Raw! Raw! Rooster!', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Daws Butler', null, 'Foghorn''s annoying college buddy, Rhode Island Red, comes for a visit and then won''t leave.', 'Foghorn''s annoying college buddy, Rhode Island Red, comes for a visit and then won''t leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqd4o4qNJ3mn5Bxtk2w0m7lKVnQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235133'),
  ('854763398637076460', 'Rawhead Rex', 1986, 'Horror', 'George Pavlou, Gay Brabazon, Nick McCarthy', 'Clive Barker', 'David Dukes, Niall Tóibín, Cora Lunny, Ronan Wilmot, Donal McCann, Heinrich von Schellendorf, Kelly Piper, Niall O''Brien', 'R', 'Ireland will never be the same after Rawhead Rex, a particularly nasty demon, is released from his underground prison by an unwitting farmer. The film follows Rex''s cross country rampage, while a man struggles to stop it.', 'Ireland will never be the same after Rawhead Rex, a particularly nasty demon, is released from his underground prison by an unwitting farmer. The film follows Rex''s cross country rampage, while a man struggles to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIEaIVlV5XRIUVoaptsymIexaL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13511'),
  ('617978993656603610', 'Rawhide', 1951, 'Western', 'Henry Hathaway, Milton Krasner, Abe Steinberg', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Tyrone Power, Susan Hayward, Hugh Marlowe, Dean Jagger, Edgar Buchanan, Jack Elam, George Tobias, Jeff Corey', 'NR', 'At a desolate relay station in the west, a stagecoach attendant and a stranded woman traveller are held captive by a band of escaped convicts.', 'At a desolate relay station in the west, a stagecoach attendant and a stranded woman traveller are held captive by a band of escaped convicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LoxiswQPlhg5PfAjMSNqn1N0TV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43380'),
  ('666185639763074222', 'Ray', 2004, 'Drama, Music', 'Taylor Hackford, Paweł Edelman, John Bucklin', 'James L. White', 'Jamie Foxx, Kerry Washington, Regina King, Harry Lennix, Clifton Powell, Bokeem Woodbine, Sharon Warren, C.J. Sanders', 'PG-13', 'Born on a sharecropping plantation in Northern Florida, Ray Charles went blind at seven. Inspired by a fiercely independent mom who insisted he make his own way, He found his calling and his gift behind a piano keyboard. Touring across the Southern musical circuit, the soulful singer gained a reputation and then exploded with worldwide fame when he pioneered coupling gospel and country together.', 'Born on a sharecropping plantation in Northern Florida, Ray Charles went blind at seven. Inspired by a fiercely independent mom who insisted he make his own way, He found his calling and his gift behind a piano keyboard. Touring across the Southern musical circuit, the soulful singer gained a reputation and then exploded with worldwide fame when he pioneered coupling gospel and country together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSPC7sO2XYNL9QcMmK88tuUALL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1677'),
  ('304270132569467965', 'Ray Charles - Live in France 1961', 2011, 'Music, Documentary', 'Bruno Riou-Maillard, Jean-Christophe Averty', null, 'Ray Charles', null, 'Lost for 50 years, these newly discovered concerts were filmed at the 1961 Antibes Jazz Festival in France and show Ray Charles in his prime period with the original Raeletts and his most legendary band (including David "Fathead" Newman and Hank Crawford). These first concerts he ever gave in Europe opened the door for Ray Charles to become one of the most revered international stars America has ever produced.', 'Lost for 50 years, these newly discovered concerts were filmed at the 1961 Antibes Jazz Festival in France and show Ray Charles in his prime period with the original Raeletts and his most legendary band (including David "Fathead" Newman and Hank Crawford). These first concerts he ever gave in Europe opened the door for Ray Charles to become one of the most revered international stars America has ever produced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9CvbW6lmCexh66SeYLKSVSUAr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649788'),
  ('331515032294528688', 'Ray Donovan: The Movie', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'David Hollander, David Franco', 'Liev Schreiber, David Hollander', 'Liev Schreiber, Eddie Marsan, Dash Mihok, Pooch Hall, Kerris Dorsey, Kate Moennig, Kerry Condon, Jon Voight', 'R', 'A showdown decades in the making brings the Donovan family legacy full circle. As the events that made Ray who he is today finally come to light, the Donovans find themselves drawn back to Boston to face the past. Each of them struggles to overcome their violent upbringing, but destiny dies hard, and only their fierce love for each other keeps them in the fight.', 'A showdown decades in the making brings the Donovan family legacy full circle. As the events that made Ray who he is today finally come to light, the Donovans find themselves drawn back to Boston to face the past. Each of them struggles to overcome their violent upbringing, but destiny dies hard, and only their fierce love for each other keeps them in the fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sw1EvOeXMGRZGWr18R4EiZs036.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800425'),
  ('701987211139972000', 'Ray Gunn', null, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Mystery, Crime', 'Brad Bird, Yarrow Cheney, Regina Diaz Torre', 'Brad Bird, Matthew Robbins', 'Sam Rockwell, Scarlett Johansson, Tom Waits, John Ratzenberger, Jamie Costa', null, 'In Metropia, a gigantic city in an alternate future as seen from 1939, Raymond Gunn—the worlds last human private eye—is drawn into a case involving aliens, murder, and multimedia star Venus Nova, whose scandals threaten to destroy her career.', 'In Metropia, a gigantic city in an alternate future as seen from 1939, Raymond Gunn—the worlds last human private eye—is drawn into a case involving aliens, murder, and multimedia star Venus Nova, whose scandals threaten to destroy her career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0LZCYpIp1X9tnoexAlADtku9a3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:940009'),
  ('989339697706729132', 'Ray''s Male Heterosexual Dance Hall', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Bryan Gordon, Philip H. Lathrop', 'Bryan Gordon', 'John Achorn, Tim Choate, Joe D''Angerio, Boyd Gaines, Darryl Henriques, Tommy Hinkley, Matt Landers, Sam McMurray', null, 'In this short film, our unemployed hero finds that getting that great job depends a lot on whom you choose to dance with at Ray''s Male Heterosexual Dance Hall.', 'In this short film, our unemployed hero finds that getting that great job depends a lot on whom you choose to dance with at Ray''s Male Heterosexual Dance Hall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLPhTmLfyw4r1Jt7TACW11LOuK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211375'),
  ('684537500490308648', 'Raya and the Last Dragon', 2021, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Paul Briggs, Don Hall, Carlos López Estrada', 'Qui Nguyen, Adele Lim', 'Kelly Marie Tran, Awkwafina, Gemma Chan, Alan Tudyk, Izaac Wang, Benedict Wong, Daniel Dae Kim, Thalia Tran', 'PG', 'Long ago, in the fantasy world of Kumandra, humans and dragons lived together in harmony. But when an evil force threatened the land, the dragons sacrificed themselves to save humanity. Now, 500 years later, that same evil has returned and it’s up to a lone warrior, Raya, to track down the legendary last dragon to restore the fractured land and its divided people.', 'Long ago, in the fantasy world of Kumandra, humans and dragons lived together in harmony. But when an evil force threatened the land, the dragons sacrificed themselves to save humanity. Now, 500 years later, that same evil has returned and it’s up to a lone warrior, Raya, to track down the legendary last dragon to restore the fractured land and its divided people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nVhgCzxKbK47OLIKxCR1syulOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527774'),
  ('865626887629900126', 'Raymond & Ray', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Igor Jadue-Lillo, John McKeown, Magdalene Serpa', 'Rodrigo García', 'Ewan McGregor, Ethan Hawke, Maribel Verdú, Sophie Okonedo, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Todd Louiso, Tom Bower, Maxim Swinton', 'R', 'Half brothers Raymond and Ray reunite when their estranged father dies—and discover that his final wish was for them to dig his grave. Together, they process who they''ve become as men, both because of their father and in spite of him.', 'Half brothers Raymond and Ray reunite when their estranged father dies—and discover that his final wish was for them to dig his grave. Together, they process who they''ve become as men, both because of their father and in spite of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdKZmSQHD17JjGUYkluhpttgJRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869025'),
  ('545290072131884007', 'Rayudu Gari Thaluka', 2026, 'Action', 'Korrapati Naveen Sree', 'Srinivas Ulisetti', 'Satya Eesha, Kittayya, Ulisetti Srinivas, Srujanakshitha, Suman Talwar', null, 'There is a powerful and influential man named Rayudu. Even the government fears him. He is involved in numerous illegal businesses, including political dealings, criminal activities, and real estate encroachments.', 'There is a powerful and influential man named Rayudu. Even the government fears him. He is involved in numerous illegal businesses, including political dealings, criminal activities, and real estate encroachments.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMGJkZGM5NzgtNmFlMC00MTAzLThkNWQtMmY3ZWFjMWY5M2YzXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:rayudu-gari-thaluka'),
  ('527402045675262419', 'Rayya and Sekina', 1952, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Salah Abu Seif, Ramses Naguib, Wahid Farid', 'ElSayed Bedir, Salah Abu Seif, Lotfi Othman', 'Anwar Wagdi, Farid Shawqy, Shoukry Sarhan, Samira Ahmed, Negma Ibrahim, Zouzou Hamdy ElHakim, Reyaad ElQasabgy, Said Khalil', null, 'In Alexandria a terrifying phenomenon of the disappearance of women, spreads terror in the city. Police work to unravel its secrets. Officer Ahmed is preparing a plan to uncover who''s behind it and it turns out to be the gang of Raya and Sakina, who were targeting women to steal their jewelry.', 'In Alexandria a terrifying phenomenon of the disappearance of women, spreads terror in the city. Police work to unravel its secrets. Officer Ahmed is preparing a plan to uncover who''s behind it and it turns out to be the gang of Raya and Sakina, who were targeting women to steal their jewelry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuBzpQvemLeckKjkH1Iidw7wJRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260112'),
  ('318329198535188764', 'Raza', 1942, 'Drama, History, War', 'José Luis Sáenz de Heredia, Manuel Rosellón, José F. Aguayo', 'Antonio Román, José Luis Sáenz de Heredia', 'Alfredo Mayo, Ana Mariscal, José Nieto, Blanca de Silos, Rosina Mendía, Pilar Soler, Julio Rey de las Heras, Luis Arroyo', null, 'The troubled story of the Churruca family, a noble lineage of brave seamen, descendants of Cosme Damián Churruca, the Spanish hero of the Battle of Trafalgar; from the Spanish-American War (1898) to the end of the Spanish Civil War (1936-39). (In 1950, a new cut of the film was released with less ideological depth and ten minutes shorter.)', 'The troubled story of the Churruca family, a noble lineage of brave seamen, descendants of Cosme Damián Churruca, the Spanish hero of the Battle of Trafalgar; from the Spanish-American War (1898) to the end of the Spanish Civil War (1936-39). (In 1950, a new cut of the film was released with less ideological depth and ten minutes shorter.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zr5lcm9uKAYgUOzS50PZjuSMvkM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185633'),
  ('503912760437293065', 'Raze', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dylan O''Brien, Josh C. Waller', 'Robert Beaucage', 'Zoë Bell, Rebecca Marshall, Sherilyn Fenn, Rachel Nichols, Amy Johnston, Doug Jones, Bruce Thomas, Adrienne Wilkinson', null, 'After Sabrina is abducted, she finds herself in an underground lair, forced to do battle with other innocent women for the amusement of unseen spectators. Each of these reluctant warriors has something to lose, but only one will remain when the game is done.', 'After Sabrina is abducted, she finds herself in an underground lair, forced to do battle with other innocent women for the amusement of unseen spectators. Each of these reluctant warriors has something to lose, but only one will remain when the game is done.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlv1nVSyXzfATNGnegR7XnzQUJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174682'),
  ('1132775772569807350', 'Razor Blade Smile', 1998, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jake West, Jim Solan', 'Jake West', 'Eileen Daly, Christopher Adamson, Jonathan Coote, Kevin Howarth, David Warbeck, Heidi James, Isabel Brook, Louisa Moore', 'R', 'A 19th century woman, who has become one of the undead, acts as a hired killer in modern times. When she starts knocking off part of the elite businessmen, "The Illuminati", who secretly are taking over business and the government, she becomes the target of a hired Scotland Yard detective. Of course, the head of "The Illuminati" is the vampire who first gave her immortality', 'A 19th century woman, who has become one of the undead, acts as a hired killer in modern times. When she starts knocking off part of the elite businessmen, "The Illuminati", who secretly are taking over business and the government, she becomes the target of a hired Scotland Yard detective. Of course, the head of "The Illuminati" is the vampire who first gave her immortality', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMVuGc7VU9Sp4SLz544QhjtWtjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28766'),
  ('385392699525539752', 'Razorback', 1984, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Russell Mulcahy, Dean Semler, Stuart Freeman', 'Everett De Roche', 'Gregory Harrison, Arkie Whiteley, Bill Kerr, Chris Haywood, David Argue, Judy Morris, John Howard, John Ewart', 'R', 'In the Australian outback a vicious wild boar kills and causes havoc to a small community.', 'In the Australian outback a vicious wild boar kills and causes havoc to a small community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/227exUUzUWkCYOVoPxap5RaVmTM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26178'),
  ('305377827097341941', 'Razortooth', 2007, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Patricia Harrington, Rich Paisley', 'Jack Monroe, Matt Holly', 'Kathleen LaGue, Doug Swander, Matt Holly, Simon Page, Tim Colceri, Kate Gersten, Brandon Breault, Josh Gad', null, 'When four college students trek to the Everglades to conduct extra-credit research for their biology professor, they become prey to a huge man-eating eel with nasty incisors that’s been terrorizing a nearby Florida community, based on a true story concerning an exotic species of eels that are released in the southeast from Asia. They breathe air and can survive on land.', 'When four college students trek to the Everglades to conduct extra-credit research for their biology professor, they become prey to a huge man-eating eel with nasty incisors that’s been terrorizing a nearby Florida community, based on a true story concerning an exotic species of eels that are released in the southeast from Asia. They breathe air and can survive on land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oppAZ5Eh83Zlaf4eSj72FT5znI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24683'),
  ('241193461501050890', 'Razzia', 1955, 'Crime, Drama', 'Henri Decoin, Pierre Montazel, Michel Legrand', 'Henri Decoin, Maurice Griffe', 'Jean Gabin, Magali Noël, Lino Ventura, Albert Rémy, Paul Frankeur, Pierre-Louis, Marcel Dalio, Jacqueline Porel', 'NR', 'Henri, the Man from Nantes, comes back to his country after a successful stay in the United States, where he was working for Liski, the drug dealer. With the fame of being a tough guy preceding him, he sets himself to the task of knowing why the French operations were not so profitable - and soon he is master of all links of the organization. He can now get it honed to perfection - or destroy it. Only... the Police are following his every step.', 'Henri, the Man from Nantes, comes back to his country after a successful stay in the United States, where he was working for Liski, the drug dealer. With the fame of being a tough guy preceding him, he sets himself to the task of knowing why the French operations were not so profitable - and soon he is master of all links of the organization. He can now get it honed to perfection - or destroy it. Only... the Police are following his every step.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MLzcPe7MJj6wWIsgUazTCMK4hd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44256'),
  ('540559017989994920', 'Razzia', 2017, 'Drama', 'Nabil Ayouch, Virginie Surdej', 'Maryam Touzani', 'Maryam Touzani, Arieh Worthalter, Amine Ennaji, Abdelilah Rachid, Abdellah Didane, Dounia Binebine, Saadia Ladib, Younes Bouab', null, 'Morocco, from the past to the present. Five people who are connected to each other – Abdallah, Salima, Joe, Hakim, and Inès – without realizing it. Different faces, different struggles, but one same breath. One city, Casablanca as a fragment of reality, as the myth of a film entirely shot in Hollywood studios, which reality has come back to claim.', 'Morocco, from the past to the present. Five people who are connected to each other – Abdallah, Salima, Joe, Hakim, and Inès – without realizing it. Different faces, different struggles, but one same breath. One city, Casablanca as a fragment of reality, as the myth of a film entirely shot in Hollywood studios, which reality has come back to claim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDUWahnW7j0c31GrtiT5sfg2tPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473324'),
