  ('850307501437733080', 'RBG', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Betsy West, Claudia Raschke, Julie Cohen', null, 'Ruth Bader Ginsburg, Jane C. Ginsburg, James Steven Ginsburg, Nina Totenberg, Clara Spera, Gloria Steinem, Bill Clinton, Sharron Frontiero', 'PG', 'Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg now 84, and still inspired by the lawyers who defended free speech during the Red Scare, Ginsburg refuses to relinquish her passionate duty, steadily fighting for equal rights for all citizens under the law. Through intimate interviews and unprecedented access to Ginsburg’s life outside the court, RBG tells the electric story of Ginsburg’s consuming love affairs with both the Constitution and her beloved husband Marty—and of a life’s work that led her to become an icon of justice in the highest court in the land.', 'Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg now 84, and still inspired by the lawyers who defended free speech during the Red Scare, Ginsburg refuses to relinquish her passionate duty, steadily fighting for equal rights for all citizens under the law. Through intimate interviews and unprecedented access to Ginsburg’s life outside the court, RBG tells the electric story of Ginsburg’s consuming love affairs with both the Constitution and her beloved husband Marty—and of a life’s work that led her to become an icon of justice in the highest court in the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIenhDe9DuvxODJOIpMjBheYlcS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493099'),
  ('636184635431275281', 'RDX: Robert Dony Xavier', 2023, 'Action, Drama', 'Nahas Hidayath, Alex J. Pulickal', 'Adarsh Sukumaran, Shabas Rasheed', 'Shane Nigam, Antony Varghese, Neeraj Madhav, Lal, Babu Antony, Baiju Santhosh, Maala Parvathi, Mahima Nambiar', null, 'Once-menacing, anger fueled, trained martial arts fighters Robert, Dony and Xavier settle down to peaceful lives, after a significant event prompts them. Fate orchestrates their reunion and return from exile to their fighting ways, when their history linger ominously and one of them faces a violent attack.', 'Once-menacing, anger fueled, trained martial arts fighters Robert, Dony and Xavier settle down to peaceful lives, after a significant event prompts them. Fate orchestrates their reunion and return from exile to their fighting ways, when their history linger ominously and one of them faces a violent attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6QRQ0bHGt9Wc1BBTZsa1iB2PAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997391'),
  ('403428822837758797', 'RE', 2014, 'Drama, Horror', 'Andreas Lindergård', 'Andreas Lindergård', 'Jenny Lampa, Ariadna Kozlovski, Hanna Sjögren', null, 'Emma returns to her childhood home only to find her past catching up with her.', 'Emma returns to her childhood home only to find her past catching up with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jii5C9iGtY0a1YDHblnPFUzu0Vw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308259'),
  ('42462549257069266', 'Re - The God of Sun', 1970, 'Animation', 'Henryk Ryszka', 'Henryk Ryszka, Grażyna Hejn', null, null, 'A swarm of slaves in ancient Egypt moves massive boulders to erect a statue of Re, the god of the sun. Erecting impressive structures required knowledge and exact measurements. However, the statue''s massive hand falls down and crushes the builders. The statue has been awe-inspiring for many centuries. Meditations on the religious nature of man.', 'A swarm of slaves in ancient Egypt moves massive boulders to erect a statue of Re, the god of the sun. Erecting impressive structures required knowledge and exact measurements. However, the statue''s massive hand falls down and crushes the builders. The statue has been awe-inspiring for many centuries. Meditations on the religious nature of man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8Eo7VIZ0BTYjVyv6tRBPr9htPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:906337'),
  ('470954936253340604', 'Re-Animated', 2006, 'Comedy, Family, Animation, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Bruce Hurwit', 'Tim McKeon, Adam Pava', 'Dominic Janes, Bil Dwyer, Rachel Quaintance, Jennifer De Minco, Neil Flynn, Tucker Barkley, Ellen Greene, Eunice Cho', 'NR', 'Jimmy is the kid everybody ignores and uses. One day, he gets into a freak accident. The only way for him to survive is a brain transplant. He gets the brain of Milt Appleday, a famous cartoon creator. And when he wakes up, he can see cartoons!', 'Jimmy is the kid everybody ignores and uses. One day, he gets into a freak accident. The only way for him to survive is a brain transplant. He gets the brain of Milt Appleday, a famous cartoon creator. And when he wakes up, he can see cartoons!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53gL2ncVs9U46drnPbAC4UUB5Rj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212518'),
  ('1140139577804999395', 'Re-Animator', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'Mac Ahlberg, Stuart Gordon', 'William Norris, Dennis Paoli, Stuart Gordon', 'Jeffrey Combs, Bruce Abbott, Barbara Crampton, David Gale, Robert Sampson, Carolyn Purdy-Gordon, Peter Kent, Ian Patrick Williams', 'NR', 'Conducting clandestine experiments within the morgue at Miskatonic University, scientist Herbert West reveals to a fellow graduate student his groundbreaking work concerning the re-animation of fresh corpses.', 'Conducting clandestine experiments within the morgue at Miskatonic University, scientist Herbert West reveals to a fellow graduate student his groundbreaking work concerning the re-animation of fresh corpses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hY6AUl92cL9GdZx031UWFiGETt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1694'),
  ('1119432302059485483', 'Re-Animator Resurrectus', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Perry Martin', 'Perry Martin', 'Bruce Abbott, Jeffrey Combs, Barbara Crampton, Stuart Gordon, Brian Yuzna', null, 'Features interviews with the cast and crew of Re-Animator (1985), except for the late David Gale.', 'Features interviews with the cast and crew of Re-Animator (1985), except for the late David Gale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPtAplUDzU3ImNWsP7pmxVdpVyE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83039'),
  ('692341717324254469', 'Re-Births', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Santi Zegarra, Eden Maury', 'Santi Zegarra', 'Giovanna Rincón, Roman Sorokine, Cate Naluwooza, Yi Chen, Maddy Soya', null, 'A documentary film depicting five intimate portraits of migrants who fled their country of origin to seek refuge in France and find a space of freedom where they can fully experience their sexuality and their sexual identity: Giovanna, woman transgender of Colombian origin, Roman, Russian transgender man, Cate, Ugandan lesbian mother, Yi Chen, young Chinese gay man…', 'A documentary film depicting five intimate portraits of migrants who fled their country of origin to seek refuge in France and find a space of freedom where they can fully experience their sexuality and their sexual identity: Giovanna, woman transgender of Colombian origin, Roman, Russian transgender man, Cate, Ugandan lesbian mother, Yi Chen, young Chinese gay man…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dC3y4IJW0yClaKBaMqXxVQ6nOXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807223'),
  ('982999530420594749', 'Re-BORN', 2022, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Lee Min-seob, Kim Tae-hun, Jung Seung-hoon', null, 'Lee You-mi, Song Duk-ho, Kim Min-seok, Park Kyung-hye, Jin Goo, Um Mun-suk, Jeong Man-sik, Gong Seung-yeon', null, 'Synopsis 1. "Today''s Superpower" (26min, 오늘의 초능력, o-neul-eui cho-neung-ryeok) by Lee Min-seob People who claim to be able to use superpowers once a day gathered! But why can''t they use their superpowers? Do they really have superpowers in the first place? 2. "1+1" (30min, 1+1) by Han Jay "Toot! I''m 1+1!" One day, the same alter ego as me appeared! 3. "Jangah & Chichung" (35min, 장아치청, jang-a-chi-cheong) by Kim Tae-hoon-II "Burp!" Once you start burping, there''s nothing you can do. A comedy action movie limited to 60 minutes, filled with real superpowers by superheroes. 4. "LOVE SICK" (23min, 러브씩, reo-beu-ssik) by Jung Seung-hoon A year after the end of the zombie crisis, Seung-beom prepares an unforgettable proposal for his girlfriend Ji-yoon who saved him.', 'Synopsis 1. "Today''s Superpower" (26min, 오늘의 초능력, o-neul-eui cho-neung-ryeok) by Lee Min-seob People who claim to be able to use superpowers once a day gathered! But why can''t they use their superpowers? Do they really have superpowers in the first place? 2. "1+1" (30min, 1+1) by Han Jay "Toot! I''m 1+1!" One day, the same alter ego as me appeared! 3. "Jangah & Chichung" (35min, 장아치청, jang-a-chi-cheong) by Kim Tae-hoon-II "Burp!" Once you start burping, there''s nothing you can do. A comedy action movie limited to 60 minutes, filled with real superpowers by superheroes. 4. "LOVE SICK" (23min, 러브씩, reo-beu-ssik) by Jung Seung-hoon A year after the end of the zombie crisis, Seung-beom prepares an unforgettable proposal for his girlfriend Ji-yoon who saved him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6o2bebPFlGEw2Ql1IYz1wT29utl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:990701'),
  ('544909500439738165', 'Re-Cut', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Fritz Manger, Adam Silver', 'Dylan Manger, Fritz Manger', 'Ross Kohn, Meredith Phillips, Austin Basis, Tim DeZarn, Tim DeZarn, Richard Trapp, Richard Trapp', 'R', 'When twin girls are found dead in their family’s barn, reality star turned TV-reporter Meredith Phillips and her de-facto camera crew are dispatched to rural Wisconsin to investigate the gruesome deaths. In their relentless drive to break the story, the reporters become entangled in a deadly mystery and uncover the small town’s shocking secret. Edited together from the crew’s multiple cameras, the film documents their struggle to survive the most terrifying night of their lives and becomes the only evidence of a crime too horrific to imagine.', 'When twin girls are found dead in their family’s barn, reality star turned TV-reporter Meredith Phillips and her de-facto camera crew are dispatched to rural Wisconsin to investigate the gruesome deaths. In their relentless drive to break the story, the reporters become entangled in a deadly mystery and uncover the small town’s shocking secret. Edited together from the crew’s multiple cameras, the film documents their struggle to survive the most terrifying night of their lives and becomes the only evidence of a crime too horrific to imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b76EyFy1akO0nEHleChVpUetTW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62105'),
  ('1138077516371053414', 'Re-cycle', 2006, 'Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Danny Pang Phat, Decha Srimantra', 'Cub Chin Kong-Hon', 'Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Zeng Yaqi, Lau Siu-Ming, Lawrence Chou Chun-Wai, Rain Lee Choi-Wah, Jetrin Wattanasin, Cheang Pou-Soi, Viraiwon Jauwseng', null, 'Ting-yin, a young novelist, is struggling to come up with a followup to her best-selling trilogy of romance novels. After drafting her first chapter, she stops and deletes the file from her computer. She then starts seeing strange, unexplainable things and finds that she is experiencing the supernatural events that she described in her novel-to-be.', 'Ting-yin, a young novelist, is struggling to come up with a followup to her best-selling trilogy of romance novels. After drafting her first chapter, she stops and deletes the file from her computer. She then starts seeing strange, unexplainable things and finds that she is experiencing the supernatural events that she described in her novel-to-be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zZQ0UBeA3UbdhgqCURHK0VymIY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13402'),
  ('1035990505854612966', 'Re-Elected', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Kristin Kinsey, Max Radbill', 'Max Radbill, Eric Looney', 'Natasha Mercado, Cameron Gilliam, Chloe Mikala, Matthew DeHoff, Kayvon Kaliush, Erik Alexis, Matthew Friend, Gabriel F. Bellotti', null, 'Friends battle former U.S. presidents when they come back from the dead as zombies on the Fourth of July.', 'Friends battle former U.S. presidents when they come back from the dead as zombies on the Fourth of July.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZqYQwRve5DSPopmZWdyvY9DVMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583984'),
  ('831518157706485781', 'Re-emigrantes', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Óscar Parra de Carrizosa, Óscar Parra de Carrizosa, Gema G. Regal', 'Mario Bravo, Gema G. Regal, Óscar Parra de Carrizosa', 'Fernando Esteso, José Agustín Durán, Jesús Carrillo, Valentín Paredes, Zack Molina, Álvaro Palomo, Víctor Octavio, Marta Oliva', null, 'After a terrible streak, the Briones family decides to return to their hometown, Villanueva de los Molinos, that rural arcadia where streams of honey flow and harmony is the currency among its people. Or not. Once there, Santiago, the head of the family, accompanied by his children Damián, Antoñito, Pólar, and Rosendo, will try to adapt to their new life by doing all kinds of jobs, from agricultural tasks to taking care of the mayor’s elderly mother.', 'After a terrible streak, the Briones family decides to return to their hometown, Villanueva de los Molinos, that rural arcadia where streams of honey flow and harmony is the currency among its people. Or not. Once there, Santiago, the head of the family, accompanied by his children Damián, Antoñito, Pólar, and Rosendo, will try to adapt to their new life by doing all kinds of jobs, from agricultural tasks to taking care of the mayor’s elderly mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JQPdgVJaoaPaCcIeutX45jzT7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418745'),
