  ('238000999252058120', 'Re-Kill', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Valeri Milev, Michael Hurst, Anton Bakarski', 'Michael Hurst', 'Roger Cross, Bruce Payne, Scott Adkins, Daniella Alonso, Jesse García, Dimiter Doichinov, Yo Santhaveesuk, Layke Anderson', 'R', 'Five years after a zombie outbreak, the men and women of R-Division hunt down and destroy the undead. When they see signs of a second outbreak, they fear humanity may not survive.', 'Five years after a zombie outbreak, the men and women of R-Division hunt down and destroy the undead. When they see signs of a second outbreak, they fear humanity may not survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpofLYUv0aJmDNxyUZux0wTFXJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106845'),
  ('1140661855273988992', 'Re-Wind', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Hisayasu Satō, Satoshi Shimomoto, Takaaki Hashiguchi', 'Shirō Yumeno', 'Kiyomi Itō, Kazuhiro Sano, Sayaka Hitomi, Reika Kazami, Yukio Ono, Rino Shimazaki, Masae Abe, Yukitsugu Suzuki', null, 'An investigation into a videotape that shows the results of a brutal murder committed using a knife-equipped camera.', 'An investigation into a videotape that shows the results of a brutal murder committed using a knife-equipped camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ei5ZduECrvHiOZfjTgY3UURwYu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87297'),
  ('180422226926729161', 'RE:BORN', 2016, 'Action, Crime', 'Yuji Shimomura, Tetsuya Kudô', 'Tak Sakaguchi', 'Tak Sakaguchi, Yura Kondo, Takumi Saitoh, Mariko Shinoda, Hitomi Hasebe, Masanori Mimoto, Makoto Sakaguchi, Hiroko Yashiki', 'NR', 'A former special forces operative struggling to contain the destructive impulses of his past goes on a rampage against a squad of ruthless assassins.', 'A former special forces operative struggling to contain the destructive impulses of his past goes on a rampage against a squad of ruthless assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y14VzRr1er9DNiJffToo763esMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408866'),
  ('950470251313683704', 'Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- Memory Snow', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Yoshito Mikamo, Kazuomi Koga, Tatsuya Koyanagi', 'Masahiro Yokotani', 'Yusuke Kobayashi, Rie Takahashi, Inori Minase, Yumi Uchiyama, Rie Murakawa, Satomi Arai, Takehito Koyasu', null, 'Subaru finally gets to take a breather, but he does not waste any time as he prepares for a date with his beloved Emilia. He scouts the nearby village for the right dating spot, and with the help of the village children, he finds a wonderful location. With that, he is well prepared for his date! Unfortunately for Subaru, cold weather suddenly sweeps across Roswaal''s mansion on his important day, leaving him with no choice but to postpone the date. Overnight, it becomes even colder and unbearable. Subaru must get to the bottom of this because, at this rate, his date will be the least of his worries.', 'Subaru finally gets to take a breather, but he does not waste any time as he prepares for a date with his beloved Emilia. He scouts the nearby village for the right dating spot, and with the help of the village children, he finds a wonderful location. With that, he is well prepared for his date! Unfortunately for Subaru, cold weather suddenly sweeps across Roswaal''s mansion on his important day, leaving him with no choice but to postpone the date. Overnight, it becomes even colder and unbearable. Subaru must get to the bottom of this because, at this rate, his date will be the least of his worries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7XwmyE5ue9hjk65fEWpO2hGU2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532321'),
  ('263078266957362249', 'Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- The Frozen Bond', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Kazuhiro Ota, Kyuta Sakai, Yusuke Kubo', null, 'Rie Takahashi, Yumi Uchiyama, Yusuke Kobayashi, Inori Minase, Satomi Arai, Rie Murakawa, Takehito Koyasu', null, 'A prequel story set seven years before the beginning of the Re:ZERO series. Emilia lives in a secluded forest covered in snow with the spirit Puck. The forest holds a secret: the elves who once lived there have been frozen into ice. Emilia is feared by the people living on the outskirts of the forest, but makes a humble living selling magic stones and warding off Magic Beasts. One day, however, her peaceful life is disrupted when the Great Spirit of Fire Melakuera decides to lay his judgment upon her.', 'A prequel story set seven years before the beginning of the Re:ZERO series. Emilia lives in a secluded forest covered in snow with the spirit Puck. The forest holds a secret: the elves who once lived there have been frozen into ice. Emilia is feared by the people living on the outskirts of the forest, but makes a humble living selling magic stones and warding off Magic Beasts. One day, however, her peaceful life is disrupted when the Great Spirit of Fire Melakuera decides to lay his judgment upon her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ca2ZsUa4Qeik2IwlXFzV51hdxh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566451'),
  ('356553063356069529', 'Re/Member', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Eiichiro Hasumi', 'Harumi Doki', 'Kanna Hashimoto, Gordon Maeda, Kotaro Daigo, Fuju Kamio, Maika Yamamoto, Mayuu Yokota, Shuntaro Yanagi, Naomi Nishida', 'PG-13', 'Six high schoolers stuck in a murderous time loop must find the scattered remains of an unknown victim to break the curse and finally see another day.', 'Six high schoolers stuck in a murderous time loop must find the scattered remains of an unknown victim to break the curse and finally see another day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCTmZ93aBZ1FwHntiDpa2Lj92zs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:991814'),
  ('971423868918692200', 'Re/Member: The Last Night', 2025, 'Horror', 'Eiichiro Hasumi', 'Harumi Doki, Yuki Hara', 'Kanna Hashimoto, Gordon Maeda, Kaito Sakurai, Marin Honda, Seira Anzai, Fuku Suzuki, Yoshino Kimura, Takeaki Yoshida', 'R', 'Three years after completing a deadly game, high schoolers trapped in a looping nightmare must survive brutal encounters and unravel a terrifying curse.', 'Three years after completing a deadly game, high schoolers trapped in a looping nightmare must survive brutal encounters and unravel a terrifying curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3X6GAx6Q71Uxh9GkhLmioGR2zF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1451398'),
  ('121673427058885632', 'Reach for Glory', 1962, 'Drama', 'Philip Leacock, Robert Huke, David Tomblin', 'John Kohn, Jud Kinberg', 'Harry Andrews, Kay Walsh, Michael Anderson Jr., Richard Vernon, Russell Waters, Patricia Hayes, Oliver Grimm, Martin Tomlinson', null, 'During World War II, teenage boys in a small English town are consumed with jingoism and brutal war games, hoping dearly that the war won''t end before they can fight in it.', 'During World War II, teenage boys in a small English town are consumed with jingoism and brutal war games, hoping dearly that the war won''t end before they can fight in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38amRQR7IbstqIar6lDj6bYYLQI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284756'),
  ('487851773096993621', 'Reach for the Sky', 1956, 'War, Drama', 'Lewis Gilbert, Jack Asher, Basil Keys', 'Lewis Gilbert', 'Kenneth More, Muriel Pavlow, Lyndon Brook, Lee Patterson, Alexander Knox, Dorothy Alison, Michael Warre, Sydney Tafler', null, 'The true story of airman Douglas Bader who overcame the loss of both legs in a 1931 flying accident to become a successful fighter pilot and wing leader during World War II.', 'The true story of airman Douglas Bader who overcame the loss of both legs in a 1931 flying accident to become a successful fighter pilot and wing leader during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OKZUqjoIC71vkJ8SUR7DzvXAvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22350'),
  ('182923991221754057', 'Reach Me', 2014, 'Drama', 'John Herzfeld, Vern Nobles Jr.', 'John Herzfeld', 'Sylvester Stallone, Kyra Sedgwick, Thomas Jane, Terry Crews, Lauren Cohan, Kelsey Grammer, Danny Trejo, Omari Hardwick', 'R', 'Each member of a group of people has a connection to a self-help book authored by a reclusive former football coach.', 'Each member of a group of people has a connection to a self-help book authored by a reclusive former football coach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJl2GTmQsL6ygHabO2YLVA8Kb9i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251994'),
  ('906263686781912835', 'Reach the Rock', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'William Ryan, John J. Campbell', 'John Hughes', 'William Sadler, Alessandro Nivola, Bruce Norris, Karen Sillas, Brooke Langton, Richard Hamilton, Norman Reedus', 'R', 'A small town troublemaker, directionless and alienated, ends up spending a night in a jail cell, where he and the police chief engage in a battle of wills and wit.', 'A small town troublemaker, directionless and alienated, ends up spending a night in a jail cell, where he and the police chief engage in a battle of wills and wit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FotjYP8T86YJv0wsbmFcT0nxgp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63709'),
  ('568665349855592932', 'Reaching for the Moon', 1930, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Edmund Goulding, Ray June', 'Edmund Goulding, Elsie Janis', 'Douglas Fairbanks, Bebe Daniels, Edward Everett Horton, Claud Allister, Jack Mulhall, Walter Walker, June MacCloy, Helen Jerome Eddy', 'NR', 'Wall Street wizard, Larry Day, new to the ways of love, is coached by his valet. He follows Vivian Benton on an ocean liner, where cocktails, laced with a "love potion," work their magic. He then loses his fortune in the market crash and feels he has also lost his girl.', 'Wall Street wizard, Larry Day, new to the ways of love, is coached by his valet. He follows Vivian Benton on an ocean liner, where cocktails, laced with a "love potion," work their magic. He then loses his fortune in the market crash and feels he has also lost his girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGX6zPdey85sfMxJvHdwbVZKqKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32290'),
  ('504504328474494185', 'Reaching for the Moon', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bruno Barreto, Mauro Pinheiro Jr.', 'Matthew Chapman, Bruno Barreto', 'Miranda Otto, Glória Pires, Tracy Middendorf, Treat Williams, Marcello Airoldi, Lola Kirke, Luciana Souza, Tânia Costa', 'NR', 'In 1951, New York poet Elizabeth Bishop travels to Rio de Janeiro to visit Mary, a college friend. The shy Elizabeth is overwhelmed by Brazilian sensuality. She is the antithesis to Mary’s dashing partner, architect Lota de Macedo Soares. Mary is jealous, but unconventional Lota is determined to have both women at all costs. This eternal triangle plays out against the backdrop of the military coup of 1964. Bishop’s moving poems are at the core of a film which lushly illustrates a crucial phase in the life of this influential Pulitzer prize-winning poet.', 'In 1951, New York poet Elizabeth Bishop travels to Rio de Janeiro to visit Mary, a college friend. The shy Elizabeth is overwhelmed by Brazilian sensuality. She is the antithesis to Mary’s dashing partner, architect Lota de Macedo Soares. Mary is jealous, but unconventional Lota is determined to have both women at all costs. This eternal triangle plays out against the backdrop of the military coup of 1964. Bishop’s moving poems are at the core of a film which lushly illustrates a crucial phase in the life of this influential Pulitzer prize-winning poet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTatiV0yzfLFLbBsFARNFYnTidL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167683'),
  ('29962638242957895', 'Read It and Weep', 2006, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Paul Hoen, Gordon Lonsdale', null, 'Kay Panabaker, Danielle Panabaker, Alexandra Krosney, Robin Riker, Jason Dolley, Allison Scagliotti, Tom Virtue, Connie Young', 'G', 'A young girl turns into an A-List celebrity over night when her private journal is accidently published and becomes a best-seller.', 'A young girl turns into an A-List celebrity over night when her private journal is accidently published and becomes a best-seller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3p953ahyS8xxnBA0h1ajPz437UR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4641'),
  ('1101969884791437866', 'Read Lips', 1980, 'Comedy, Action', 'Yang Chuan, Fung Hak-On, Danny Chow Yun-Kin', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Frankie Chan Fan-Kei, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Danny Chow Yun-Kin, Sidney Yim, Cheung Miu-Lin, Gam Biu, Tong Tin-Hei', null, 'Frankie Chan plays a movie dubber who can read lips.', 'Frankie Chan plays a movie dubber who can read lips.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7SOJOMhbh3WBimRYPj4MH9wf5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449488'),
  ('146519920599086505', 'Read My Lips', 2001, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Jacques Audiard, Mathieu Vadepied, Serge Onteniente', 'Tonino Benacquista, Jacques Audiard', 'Vincent Cassel, Emmanuelle Devos, Olivier Gourmet, Olivier Perrier, Olivia Bonamy, Bernard Alane, Céline Samie, Pierre Diot', null, 'She is almost deaf and she lip-reads. He is an ex-convict. She wants to help him. He thinks no one can help except himself.', 'She is almost deaf and she lip-reads. He is an ex-convict. She wants to help him. He thinks no one can help except himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YIkOan9JzbBVAQRvq5fIjHHBAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6173'),
  ('50323135375856178', 'Reading Lolita in Tehran', 2024, 'Drama', 'Eran Riklis, Hélène Louvart', 'Marjorie David', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Zar Amir Ebrahimi, Mina Kavani, Bahar Beihaghi, Isabella Nefar, Raha Rahbari, Lara Wolf, Shahbaz Noshir', null, 'As Islamic morality squads stage arbitrary raids in Tehran and as fundamentalists seize hold of the universities, Azar Nafisi, an inspired teacher, secretly gathers six of her most committed female students to read forbidden western classics. Unaccustomed to being asked to speak their minds, they soon removed their veils, their stories intertwining with the novels they read: just like the heroines of Nabokov, F. Scott Fitzgerald, Henry James or Jane Austen, the women in Nafisi’s living room dare to dream, hope and love as we experience the complexity of the lives of individuals facing political, moral and personal siege.', 'As Islamic morality squads stage arbitrary raids in Tehran and as fundamentalists seize hold of the universities, Azar Nafisi, an inspired teacher, secretly gathers six of her most committed female students to read forbidden western classics. Unaccustomed to being asked to speak their minds, they soon removed their veils, their stories intertwining with the novels they read: just like the heroines of Nabokov, F. Scott Fitzgerald, Henry James or Jane Austen, the women in Nafisi’s living room dare to dream, hope and love as we experience the complexity of the lives of individuals facing political, moral and personal siege.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4f3uSsiTpFFMH0PUiT0gNShqUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096846'),
  ('966064284703198764', 'Ready', 2011, 'Action, Comedy', 'Anees Bazmee, Sunil Patel, Shahid Hasan', 'Rajeev Kaul, Ikram Akhtar, Rajan Aggarwal', 'Salman Khan, Asin Thottumkal, Paresh Rawal, Sudesh Lehri, Sharat Saxena, Akhilendra Mishra, Mahesh Manjrekar, Manoj Joshi', null, 'Prem believes Sanjana is the girl chosen by his dad and falls in love with her. However, she is a runaway bride escaping from a marriage set up by her mafia uncles against her wishes. On learning the truth, he devises a plan to win her over from her uncles who intend to usurp her huge inheritance.', 'Prem believes Sanjana is the girl chosen by his dad and falls in love with her. However, she is a runaway bride escaping from a marriage set up by her mafia uncles against her wishes. On learning the truth, he devises a plan to win her over from her uncles who intend to usurp her huge inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umfKMUkXXPfMUoOq60nXjDbQOCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65946'),
  ('713301056782582917', 'Ready or Not', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Stephanie Collins, Laura Hokstad, Gino Sandoval', 'Guy Busick, R. Christopher Murphy', 'Samara Weaving, Mark O''Brien, Adam Brody, Henry Czerny, Andie MacDowell, Melanie Scrofano, Kristian Bruun, Elyse Levesque', 'R', 'A young bride''s wedding night turns into her worst nightmare when her ridiculously rich in-laws force her to play a gruesome game of hide-and-seek.', 'A young bride''s wedding night turns into her worst nightmare when her ridiculously rich in-laws force her to play a gruesome game of hide-and-seek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJD9KQFoObZmxAS1je56SIFVNJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567609'),
  ('786680780173849303', 'Ready or Not: Here I Come', 2026, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Matt Bettinelli-Olpin, Tyler Gillett, Andrew M. Robinson', 'Guy Busick, R. Christopher Murphy', 'Samara Weaving, Kathryn Newton, Elijah Wood, Sarah Michelle Gellar, Shawn Hatosy, David Cronenberg, Dan Beirne, Olivia Cheng', 'R', 'Moments after surviving an all-out attack from the Le Domas family, Grace discovers she’s reached the next level of the nightmarish game — and this time with her estranged sister Faith at her side. Grace has one chance to survive, keep her sister alive, and claim the High Seat of the Council that controls the world. Four rival families are hunting her for the throne, and whoever wins rules it all.', 'Moments after surviving an all-out attack from the Le Domas family, Grace discovers she’s reached the next level of the nightmarish game — and this time with her estranged sister Faith at her side. Grace has one chance to survive, keep her sister alive, and claim the High Seat of the Council that controls the world. Four rival families are hunting her for the throne, and whoever wins rules it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRf89HVEtBZiSnOXXWDhZOfuTwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266127'),
  ('412302957360031864', 'Ready Player One', 2018, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, Adam Somner', 'Ernest Cline, Zak Penn', 'Tye Sheridan, Olivia Cooke, Ben Mendelsohn, Lena Waithe, T.J. Miller, Simon Pegg, Mark Rylance, Philip Zhao', 'PG-13', 'When the creator of a popular video game system dies, a virtual contest is created to compete for his fortune.', 'When the creator of a popular video game system dies, a virtual contest is created to compete for his fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pU1ULUq8D3iRxl1fdX2lZIzdHuI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333339'),
