  ('825417604422251295', 'Reagan', 2024, 'History, Drama', 'Michael Melamed, Matt Mosley, Dawn R. Ferry', 'Howard Klausner', 'Dennis Quaid, Penelope Ann Miller, Jon Voight, Kevin Dillon, Olek Krupa, David Henrie, Mark Moses, Xander Berkeley', 'PG-13', 'Told through the voice of former KGB agent Viktor Petrovich, whose life becomes inextricably linked with Ronald Reagan''s when Reagan first caught the Soviets’ attention as an actor in Hollywood, Reagan overcomes the odds to become the 40th president of the United States.', 'Told through the voice of former KGB agent Viktor Petrovich, whose life becomes inextricably linked with Ronald Reagan''s when Reagan first caught the Soviets’ attention as an actor in Hollywood, Reagan overcomes the odds to become the 40th president of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o21NB4f5fNk1dtrRlyAmA0C0cb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647245'),
  ('725939257774807416', 'Real', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Akiko Ashizawa', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Sachiko Tanaka', 'Takeru Satoh, Haruka Ayase, Joe Odagiri, Shota Sometani, Keisuke Horibe, Yutaka Matsushige, Kyoko Koizumi, Kenta Hamano', null, 'Neurosurgeon Koichi uses an experimental technique to enter the brain of his beloved Atsumi, who is in a coma after attempting suicide. In his quest, Koichi drifts steadily further into the sweltering marshes of the spirit. It is soon no longer clear what is real and what is not.', 'Neurosurgeon Koichi uses an experimental technique to enter the brain of his beloved Atsumi, who is in a coma after attempting suicide. In his quest, Koichi drifts steadily further into the sweltering marshes of the spirit. It is soon no longer clear what is real and what is not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0caz3LUT1jXh3mgL0QXDzDzeuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180891'),
  ('1031629082403232202', 'Real', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Lee Sa-rang, Shin Kyung-man, Kim Jeong-won', 'Lee Jeong-sub', 'Kim Soo-hyun, Sung Dong-il, Lee Sung-min, Sulli, Jo Woo-jin, Kim Hong-pa, Jeong In-kyeom, Choi Kwon', null, 'Jang Tae-Young is a popular trouble shooter in the criminal world. He is cold and ambitious. He dreams of building a casino hotel one day. A reporter then goes to Jang Tae-Young.', 'Jang Tae-Young is a popular trouble shooter in the criminal world. He is cold and ambitious. He dreams of building a casino hotel one day. A reporter then goes to Jang Tae-Young.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccmDZaOKBwDKW8wPs4rV64ue9wN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437633'),
  ('1058487654864251665', 'Real Fiction', 2000, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Ju Jin-mo, Shim Yi Young, Lee Je-rak, Son Min-seok, Bae Joong-sik, Yang Seung-byeong, Lee Deok-jin, Kim Gi-yeon', null, 'A repressed artist receives ritual abuse from those who pass him as he paints portraits in the park. Gradually becoming more frustrated, anger builds up within the artist, leading him to embark upon a quest to gain revenge on all those who have humiliated him.', 'A repressed artist receives ritual abuse from those who pass him as he paints portraits in the park. Gradually becoming more frustrated, anger builds up within the artist, leading him to embark upon a quest to gain revenge on all those who have humiliated him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7KTWS9ZaKrrbNCmSvf75Y17uKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25651'),
  ('192437160036025318', 'Real Gangsters', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'Frank D''Angelo, Jeremy Major', 'Philip Morton, Frank D''Angelo', 'Robert Loggia, John Savage, Steven Bauer, Margot Kidder, Nick Mancuso, Michael Paré, Robert Mangiardi, Frank D''Angelo', null, 'Real Gangsters tells the story of the Lo Giacamo family, one of the most successful crime syndicates in New York City. Run by cousins Vincent Lo Giacamo and Jack Lo Giacamo, Real Gangsters shows how these two men maintain control of their dangerous extended family and volatile business ventures by very different means.', 'Real Gangsters tells the story of the Lo Giacamo family, one of the most successful crime syndicates in New York City. Run by cousins Vincent Lo Giacamo and Jack Lo Giacamo, Real Gangsters shows how these two men maintain control of their dangerous extended family and volatile business ventures by very different means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8zenFep4WpmYGUZYfwC1IWMMBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261903'),
  ('446816153363066751', 'Real Genius', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Martha Coolidge, Vilmos Zsigmond, Stephen McEveety', 'Neal Israel, Pat Proft, PJ Torokvei', 'Val Kilmer, Gabriel Jarret, Michelle Meyrink, William Atherton, Robert Prescott, Louis Giambalvo, Jon Gries, Ed Lauter', 'PG', 'When teenage geniuses Mitch Taylor and Chris Knight, working on an advanced laser project, learn that the military wants to use it as a weapon, they decide to thwart the plan.', 'When teenage geniuses Mitch Taylor and Chris Knight, working on an advanced laser project, learn that the military wants to use it as a weapon, they decide to thwart the plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8az0Tr8hEGDmrUH9WlFz1QIKsMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14370'),
  ('943421097486791767', 'Real Girl', 2018, 'Romance', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Takashi Komatsu, Hideaki Murakami', 'Minato Takano, Tsutomu Hanabusa', 'Ayami Nakajo, Hayato Sano, Hiroya Shimizu, Yuri Tsunematsu, Moka Kamishiraishi, Takahiro Miura, Sayaka Kanda, Mari Hamada', null, 'Hikaru Tsutsui is a high school student. He enjoys animation and video games in the virtual world, but he doesn''t enjoy his real life. People at his school don''t even know he exists. One day, he cleans up the pool at his school with beautiful Iroha Ikarashi. Iroha approaches Hikaru and confesses that she likes him.', 'Hikaru Tsutsui is a high school student. He enjoys animation and video games in the virtual world, but he doesn''t enjoy his real life. People at his school don''t even know he exists. One day, he cleans up the pool at his school with beautiful Iroha Ikarashi. Iroha approaches Hikaru and confesses that she likes him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JLCQHBbKUH0jw4mPdW8BqD9drG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539073'),
  ('840371682984606617', 'Real Lies', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Émile Gaudreault', 'Pierre-Michel Tremblay, Émile Gaudreault', 'Stéphane Rousseau, Mathieu Quesnel, Julie Le Breton, Guylaine Tremblay, Normand D''Amour, Charles-Alexandre Dubé, Marie-Ève Milot, Catherine de Léan', 'PG', 'Marco Valois wants to direct a serious movie inspired by the life of a soldier living with post-traumatic stress disorder. He soon realizes that the young soldier home from Afghanistan won''t open up that easily. Marco, willing to do just about anything to get his story, follows Éric Lebel to his hometown.', 'Marco Valois wants to direct a serious movie inspired by the life of a soldier living with post-traumatic stress disorder. He soon realizes that the young soldier home from Afghanistan won''t open up that easily. Marco, willing to do just about anything to get his story, follows Éric Lebel to his hometown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzaK9JUN1TbyfxbIGX1vBwUfqbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275585'),
  ('596874149290003593', 'Real Life', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Albert Brooks, David McGiffert, Rafael Elortegui', 'Monica Johnson, Albert Brooks, Harry Shearer', 'Albert Brooks, Charles Grodin, Frances Lee McCain, Lisa Urette, Robert Stirrat, Matthew Tobin, J.A. Preston, Mort Lindsey', 'PG', 'A pushy, narcissistic filmmaker persuades a Phoenix family to let him and his crew film their everyday lives, in the manner of the ground-breaking PBS series "An American Family".', 'A pushy, narcissistic filmmaker persuades a Phoenix family to let him and his crew film their everyday lives, in the manner of the ground-breaking PBS series "An American Family".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihN6hpMI8IUGgUvivU5HUT2M16c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33250'),
  ('442506782459169882', 'Real Love', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Claire Burger, Julien Poupard', 'Claire Burger', 'Bouli Lanners, Justine Lacroix, Sarah Henochsberg, Cécile Remy-Boutang, Antonia Buresi, Célia Mayer, Lorenzo Demanget, Tiago Gandra', null, 'Forbach, East of France, today. Mario, a man without much ambition, except where love is concerned, is back to square one after his wife left home. He now must raise his two adolescent daughters by himself, while going through some sort of a teenage crisis of his own. 14-year-old Frida blames her father for their mother''s leaving and she develops ambivalent feelings towards her new girlfriend. 17-year-old Niki will soon leave home. Until then, she lives the good life. Mario can''t help but lose the women he loves. Yet they must all agree to let one another go.', 'Forbach, East of France, today. Mario, a man without much ambition, except where love is concerned, is back to square one after his wife left home. He now must raise his two adolescent daughters by himself, while going through some sort of a teenage crisis of his own. 14-year-old Frida blames her father for their mother''s leaving and she develops ambivalent feelings towards her new girlfriend. 17-year-old Niki will soon leave home. Until then, she lives the good life. Mario can''t help but lose the women he loves. Yet they must all agree to let one another go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c57VybgJzqiAp9uozh2xrcZupL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512865'),
  ('294397326762562077', 'Real Men', 1987, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Dennis Feldman, Dick Ziker, John A. Alonzo', 'Dennis Feldman', 'Jim Belushi, John Ritter, Barbara Barrie, Bill Morey, Isa Jank, Gail Barle, Mark Herrier, Matthew Brooks', 'PG-13', 'A womanizing CIA agent and an insecure insurance agent are paired together to make sure a deal goes through with aliens for the future of mankind.', 'A womanizing CIA agent and an insecure insurance agent are paired together to make sure a deal goes through with aliens for the future of mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48RNciPt5K9myWDPcfNhLWUYLgf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44801'),
  ('439369022345374503', 'Real Murders: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery', 2015, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Drama, Crime', 'David Markowitz, Todd Elyzen, Aaron Wintringham', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Marilu Henner, Lexa Doig, Bruce Dawson, Peter Benson, Robin Dunne, Miranda Frigon, Jacqueline Samuda', null, 'Aurora finds a member of her crime buff group, the Real Murders Club, killed in a manner that eerily resembles the crime the club was about to discuss. As other brutal "copycat" killings follow, Aurora will have to uncover the person behind the terrifying game.', 'Aurora finds a member of her crime buff group, the Real Murders Club, killed in a manner that eerily resembles the crime the club was about to discuss. As other brutal "copycat" killings follow, Aurora will have to uncover the person behind the terrifying game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boxsHCnOoAoQpXPfBf8olF6rT9w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339580'),
  ('857882537860104495', 'Real Steel', 2011, 'Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Shawn Levy, Mauro Fiore, Seth Reed', 'John Gatins', 'Hugh Jackman, Dakota Goyo, Evangeline Lilly, Kevin Durand, Anthony Mackie, Hope Davis, James Rebhorn, Karl Yune', 'PG-13', 'Charlie Kenton is a washed-up fighter who retired from the ring when robots took over the sport. After his robot is trashed, he reluctantly teams up with his estranged son to rebuild and train an unlikely contender.', 'Charlie Kenton is a washed-up fighter who retired from the ring when robots took over the sport. After his robot is trashed, he reluctantly teams up with his estranged son to rebuild and train an unlikely contender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GIeI5K5YdDUkR3mNQBoScpSFEf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39254'),
  ('777596776135573568', 'Real Time', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rudolf Blahacek, Randall Cole', 'Randall Cole', 'Randy Quaid, Jay Baruchel, Jayne Eastwood, Lucy Filippone, Jeff Pustil, Ella Chan', null, 'Real Time is a comedic drama about a compulsive gambler given one hour to live by the man hired to kill him.', 'Real Time is a comedic drama about a compulsive gambler given one hour to live by the man hired to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m51dVhSJy5wA4R4RmDJSNoYObs5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13835'),
  ('1004352446738208058', 'Real Women Have Curves', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Patricia Cardoso, Mark Molina, Julian Petrillo', 'George LaVoo, Josefina Lopez', 'America Ferrera, Lupe Ontiveros, Ingrid Oliu, George López, Brian Sites, Soledad St. Hilaire, Lourdes Perez Nido, Jorge Cervera Jr.', 'PG-13', 'In East Los Angeles, an 18-year-old struggles between her ambitions of going to college and the desires of her domineering mother for her to get married, have children, and oversee the small, rundown family-owned textile factory.', 'In East Los Angeles, an 18-year-old struggles between her ambitions of going to college and the desires of her domineering mother for her to get married, have children, and oversee the small, rundown family-owned textile factory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziemD3ATULYKt399FkO1ZhAwrOH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30309'),
  ('786960097751281159', 'Real: The Plan Behind History', 2017, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo Bittencourt', 'Mikael de Albuquerque', 'Emílio Orciollo Netto, Norival Rizzo, Tato Gabus Mendes, Mariana Lima, Carlos Meceni, Guilherme Weber, Fernando Eiras, Giulio Lopes', null, 'In May 1993, Brazil experienced one of the worst economic crises in its history. The government then decides to set up a real task force to solve the problem. Confined to a bunker as a way of shielding the operations of growing political pressures, the special economic team will have to do its best to reach agreement and create the Plano Real.', 'In May 1993, Brazil experienced one of the worst economic crises in its history. The government then decides to set up a real task force to solve the problem. Confined to a bunker as a way of shielding the operations of growing political pressures, the special economic team will have to do its best to reach agreement and create the Plano Real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQPISvLsHqxw4qB0V9CB9aOcprz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450600'),
  ('194222653503248134', 'Reality', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Matteo Garrone, Marco Onorato', 'Ugo Chiti, Maurizio Braucci, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Aniello Arena, Loredana Simioli, Nando Paone, Graziella Marina, Nello Iorio, Nunzia Schiano, Rosaria D''Urso, Giuseppina Cervizzi', null, 'A dark comedy centering on the lives of a Neapolitan based family whose father, a fish merchant, is so infatuated with the reality TV show "Grande Fratello" (the Italian version of "Big Brother") he starts living his life as if he were on it.', 'A dark comedy centering on the lives of a Neapolitan based family whose father, a fish merchant, is so infatuated with the reality TV show "Grande Fratello" (the Italian version of "Big Brother") he starts living his life as if he were on it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bl2Hy8yyHXmTSDLz3NMxIe9wgIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103758'),
  ('1089012832494240501', 'Reality', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Quentin Dupieux, Quentin Dupieux, David James McKenzie', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Alain Chabat, Jonathan Lambert, Élodie Bouchez, Kyla Kenedy, Eric Wareheim, John Glover, Lola Delon, Matt Battaglia', 'NR', 'A wanna-be director is given 48 hours by a producer to find the best groan of pain, worthy of an Oscar, as the only condition to back his film.', 'A wanna-be director is given 48 hours by a producer to find the best groan of pain, worthy of an Oscar, as the only condition to back his film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6aty0lfqsTefZ5xduwT7D44N1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179150'),
