  ('657682939807430269', 'Reality Bites', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Ben Stiller, Emmanuel Lubezki', 'Helen Childress', 'Winona Ryder, Ethan Hawke, Janeane Garofalo, Steve Zahn, Ben Stiller, Swoosie Kurtz, Harry O''Reilly, Susan Norfleet', 'PG-13', 'A small circle of friends suffering from post-collegiate blues must confront the hard truth about life, love and the pursuit of gainful employment. As they struggle to map out survival guides for the future, the Gen-X quartet soon begins to realize that reality isn''t all it''s cracked up to be.', 'A small circle of friends suffering from post-collegiate blues must confront the hard truth about life, love and the pursuit of gainful employment. As they struggle to map out survival guides for the future, the Gen-X quartet soon begins to realize that reality isn''t all it''s cracked up to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGDhodtpkpxkrFqokenGNJlzt6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2788'),
  ('996353336208795717', 'Reality+', 2014, 'Science Fiction', 'Philip Lozano, Coralie Fargeat, Christian Alzieu', 'Coralie Fargeat', 'Vincent Colombe, Aurélien Muller, Vanessa Hessler, Aurélia Poirier, Samuel Trépanier', 'NR', 'Vincent, a young Parisian uncomfortable with his appearance, installs a brain chip named Reality+ which allows users to see themselves and fellow users with their dream body. However, Reality+ only works over 12-hour intervals, proving infuriating for Vincent as he falls for Stella, another user.', 'Vincent, a young Parisian uncomfortable with his appearance, installs a brain chip named Reality+ which allows users to see themselves and fellow users with their dream body. However, Reality+ only works over 12-hour intervals, proving infuriating for Vincent as he falls for Stella, another user.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGWtHwkC9eNU0lwSyqOJP0ZvA4o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367181'),
  ('372171430097294041', 'Realive', 2016, 'Science Fiction', 'Mateo Gil, Pau Esteve Birba', 'Mateo Gil', 'Tom Hughes, Charlotte Le Bon, Oona Chaplin, Barry Ward, Julio Perillán, Rafael Cebrian, Bruno Sevilla, Daniel Horvath', null, 'Marc, a successful, ambitious man, is diagnosed with terminal cancer, and is given a few months to live. Unable to accept death, he decides to cryogenically freeze himself. The love of his life is devastated. Seventy years later, Marc becomes the first cryogenic resuscitated person in history. But this doesn''t happen in the idealized way he dreamt of.', 'Marc, a successful, ambitious man, is diagnosed with terminal cancer, and is given a few months to live. Unable to accept death, he decides to cryogenically freeze himself. The love of his life is devastated. Seventy years later, Marc becomes the first cryogenic resuscitated person in history. But this doesn''t happen in the idealized way he dreamt of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FsN7qGW1U7Oi52vx3eVoGn9r8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399612'),
  ('1006840311998957822', 'Really Happy Someday', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'J. Stevens', 'Breton Lalama, J. Stevens', 'Katharine King So, Lauren Beatty, Xavier Lopez, Khadijah Roberts-Abdullah, Aisha Evelyna', 'Not Rated', 'Z, a transmasculine theatre performer, bombs a pivotal musical theatre audition, unable to control his voice after starting testosterone 12 months earlier. To save his own life and livelihood, Z must rediscover himself and his voice.', 'Z, a transmasculine theatre performer, bombs a pivotal musical theatre audition, unable to control his voice after starting testosterone 12 months earlier. To save his own life and livelihood, Z must rediscover himself and his voice.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F1%2Fgracenote%2F1be75e59f2bf1413a8a6784d3799951b.jpg', 'plex:movie:really-happy-someday'),
  ('159503772850316789', 'Really Love', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Angel Kristi Williams, Shawn Peters', 'Felicia Pride, Angel Kristi Williams', 'Kofi Siriboe, Yootha Wong-Loi-Sing, Uzo Aduba, Tristan Mack Wilds, Naturi Naughton, Jade Eshete, Suzzanne Douglas, Blair Underwood', null, 'A rising black painter tries to break into a competitive art world while balancing an unexpected romance with an ambitious law student.', 'A rising black painter tries to break into a competitive art world while balancing an unexpected romance with an ambitious law student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqqEHkLUdOyoDYcvXi0lUEeQ748.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665894'),
  ('103963602522051813', 'Really Scent', 1959, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Abe Levitow', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Pepe le Pew arrives in New Orleans, where Fabrette the black cat has been cursed with white stripes like a skunk, interfering with her chances to get married. Of course, a skunk is her perfect match... if she can stand the smell!', 'Pepe le Pew arrives in New Orleans, where Fabrette the black cat has been cursed with white stripes like a skunk, interfering with her chances to get married. Of course, a skunk is her perfect match... if she can stand the smell!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spVhHFbdzJ7drvLj1xZ4r1PYuuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198981'),
  ('952145654893110179', 'Realm of Terracotta', 2021, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Yongchang Lin, Ding Liang', 'Yun Xu', 'Merijn Oerlemans, Belinda Vermeer, Andy van Veen, Rik Sinkeldam, Horace Cohen, Gover Meit, Fred Butter, André Dongelmans', null, 'In the underground world, there are not only terracotta warriors and horses, but also a variety of bronze relics, resurrected bronze beasts and an underground creature called the "Earth Horn". The hero, Meng Yuan, is an odd-job figurine in the underground Qin tombs. He works with the mysterious girl Shi Yu to capture the Earth Horn and goes through dangerous situations, but unexpectedly discovers the mystery of the endless battle between the Earth Horn and the terracotta warriors', 'In the underground world, there are not only terracotta warriors and horses, but also a variety of bronze relics, resurrected bronze beasts and an underground creature called the "Earth Horn". The hero, Meng Yuan, is an odd-job figurine in the underground Qin tombs. He works with the mysterious girl Shi Yu to capture the Earth Horn and goes through dangerous situations, but unexpectedly discovers the mystery of the endless battle between the Earth Horn and the terracotta warriors', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48uip87WgekvqtoPGwuGPwxbCPm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844158'),
  ('651275392140137088', 'Realms', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Daric Gates', 'Kevin Summerfield', 'Ryan Kelley, Madison McKinley, Praiya Suandokmai, Panthila Fuklin, Pichaya Nitipaisalkul', null, 'After a high-speed police chase leads to an unexpected crash, two Americans bank robbers and their three local hostages take shelter in a mysterious manor in the woods. As the criminals plot their next move and the hostages try to escape, they begin to realize no one is safe from the evil lurking inside the house.', 'After a high-speed police chase leads to an unexpected crash, two Americans bank robbers and their three local hostages take shelter in a mysterious manor in the woods. As the criminals plot their next move and the hostages try to escape, they begin to realize no one is safe from the evil lurking inside the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3CLStp0Prl8qIebBe6TJLmHZAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548859'),
  ('807759077423958469', 'Reap the Wild Wind', 1942, 'Adventure, Action, Romance', 'Cecil B. DeMille, William V. Skall, Victor Milner', 'Alan Le May, Charles Bennett, Jesse Lasky Jr.', 'Paulette Goddard, Ray Milland, John Wayne, Raymond Massey, Robert Preston, Lynne Overman, Susan Hayward, Charles Bickford', 'NR', 'The Florida Keys in 1840, where the implacable hurricanes of the Caribbean scream, where the salvagers of Key West, like the intrepid and beautiful Loxi Claiborne and her crew, reap, aboard frail schooners, the harvest of the wild wind, facing the shark teeth of the reefs to rescue the sailors and the cargo from the shipwrecks caused by the scavengers of the sea.', 'The Florida Keys in 1840, where the implacable hurricanes of the Caribbean scream, where the salvagers of Key West, like the intrepid and beautiful Loxi Claiborne and her crew, reap, aboard frail schooners, the harvest of the wild wind, facing the shark teeth of the reefs to rescue the sailors and the cargo from the shipwrecks caused by the scavengers of the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coWMXDjxSFBPT3phsTKcKjVQbwq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63617'),
  ('875585150516787221', 'Reap What You Sew: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery', 2018, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Eddy Hardy, Ross Langill, Terry Ingram', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Marilu Henner, Lexa Doig, Peter Benson, James Rittinger, Britt Irvin, Jesse Moss, Ellie Harvie', 'G', 'Internet sensation and old family friend of Aurora Teagarden, Poppy Wilson, has returned to Lawrenceton to start her new embroidery business. But not everyone is happy with Poppy''s success when she turns up dead. To find the killer, Roe must follow the unsettling truths that lead her—into the path of the killer.', 'Internet sensation and old family friend of Aurora Teagarden, Poppy Wilson, has returned to Lawrenceton to start her new embroidery business. But not everyone is happy with Poppy''s success when she turns up dead. To find the killer, Roe must follow the unsettling truths that lead her—into the path of the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGDaMV6ow7Tz4FfDV8dWAJVhUzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515696'),
  ('627756660327269143', 'Reaper', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Horror', 'Wen-Han Shih, Hiroyuki Haga, Grimm December', 'James Jurdi, Mark James', 'Danny Trejo, Vinnie Jones, Jake Busey, Shayla Beesley, James Jurdi, Christopher Judge, Justin Henry, William Shockley', null, 'Criminals and a beautiful but cunning hitchhiker must battle a supernatural force known as the Reaper.', 'Criminals and a beautiful but cunning hitchhiker must battle a supernatural force known as the Reaper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qptmMcqLdwLjLa7hXimDrjLOfwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298026'),
  ('235712754587388828', 'Rear Window', 1954, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Robert Burks, Herbert Coleman', 'John Michael Hayes', 'James Stewart, Grace Kelly, Wendell Corey, Thelma Ritter, Raymond Burr, Judith Evelyn, Ross Bagdasarian, Georgine Darcy', 'PG', 'A wheelchair-bound photographer spies on his neighbors from his apartment window and becomes convinced one of them has committed murder.', 'A wheelchair-bound photographer spies on his neighbors from his apartment window and becomes convinced one of them has committed murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ILVF0eJxHMddjxeQhswFtpMtqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567'),
  ('718653146057787687', 'Rear Window', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ken Kelsch, Jeff Bleckner, Vebe Borge', null, 'Christopher Reeve, Daryl Hannah, Robert Forster, Ruben Santiago-Hudson, Anne Twomey, Ritchie Coster, Allison Mackie, Ali Marsh', null, 'Jason Kemp, a recently paralyzed architect, lives in a high-tech apartment filled with assistive technology. As a quadriplegic confined to his home, he passes the long hours by spying on his neighbors from his apartment window. His innocent pastime takes a deadly turn when he believes he witnesses a murder. Determined to uncover the truth, Jason continues to dig deeper - eventually finding himself locked in a deadly game of cat and mouse.', 'Jason Kemp, a recently paralyzed architect, lives in a high-tech apartment filled with assistive technology. As a quadriplegic confined to his home, he passes the long hours by spying on his neighbors from his apartment window. His innocent pastime takes a deadly turn when he believes he witnesses a murder. Determined to uncover the truth, Jason continues to dig deeper - eventually finding himself locked in a deadly game of cat and mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmbPjkZhlnt0JEOU9xMYtbjNXuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11603'),
