  ('74203504935527015', 'Reason, Debate and a Story', 1974, 'Drama', 'Ritwik Ghatak, Baby Islam, Deepak Das', 'Ritwik Ghatak', 'Ritwik Ghatak, Tripti Mitra, Shaonli Mitra, Sugata Burman, Bijon Bhattacharya, Ranen Ray Choudhury, Partha Pratim Chowdhury, Utpal Dutt', null, 'Four men, each peculiar in his own way, embark on a quest to reason with the estranged wife of the protagonist. This is considered to be Ghatak''s autobiographical film.', 'Four men, each peculiar in his own way, embark on a quest to reason with the estranged wife of the protagonist. This is considered to be Ghatak''s autobiographical film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feOp4pjWUhwjLBZvNbfirLpn1SG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167494'),
  ('833130818211811099', 'Reasonable Doubt', 2014, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Peter Howitt, Brian Pearson, Candice Elzinga', 'Peter A. Dowling', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Dominic Cooper, Erin Karpluk, Gloria Reuben, Ryan Robbins, Philippe Brenninkmeyer, Dylan Taylor, Lane Styles', 'R', 'When up-and-coming District Attorney Mitch Brockden commits a fatal hit-and-run, he feels compelled to throw the case against the accused criminal who was found with the body and blamed for the crime. Following the trial, Mitch''s worst fears come true when he realizes that he acquitted a guilty man, and he soon finds himself on the hunt for the killer before more victims pile up.', 'When up-and-coming District Attorney Mitch Brockden commits a fatal hit-and-run, he feels compelled to throw the case against the accused criminal who was found with the body and blamed for the crime. Following the trial, Mitch''s worst fears come true when he realizes that he acquitted a guilty man, and he soon finds himself on the hunt for the killer before more victims pile up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0BUpxa6E8PYoZWbx5g6CxbdalX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240916'),
  ('986905503493886919', 'Reassemblage: From the Firelight to the Screen', 1983, 'Documentary', 'Trịnh T. Minh-hà', 'Trịnh T. Minh-hà', null, null, 'A complex visual study of the women of rural Senegal. Through a complicity of interaction between film and spectator, Reassemblage reflects on documentary filmmaking and the ethnographic representation of cultures.', 'A complex visual study of the women of rural Senegal. Through a complicity of interaction between film and spectator, Reassemblage reflects on documentary filmmaking and the ethnographic representation of cultures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVM4h5OhZvnVWW9I9TttKuJq9VK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136055'),
  ('1134543301423667229', 'Reba McEntire''s The Hammer', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jüs Percy, Jeff Beesley, Tyler Walzak', 'Karen Wyscarver, Sanford Golden', 'Reba McEntire, Melissa Peterman, Rex Linn, Kay Metchie, Matty Finochio, Jill Morrison, Primo Allon, Vanesa Tomasino', 'PG-13', 'After a judge passes away under suspicious circumstances, Kim Wheeler, an attorney who is appointed as a judge for Nevada''s 5th district after the former judge''s death, finds herself covering a circuit that stretches between Las Vegas and Reno — a rugged, often desolate area where anything and everything can happen. As the investigation into the death intensifies, Kim''s sister Kris, who runs the local brothel, becomes the prime suspect.', 'After a judge passes away under suspicious circumstances, Kim Wheeler, an attorney who is appointed as a judge for Nevada''s 5th district after the former judge''s death, finds herself covering a circuit that stretches between Las Vegas and Reno — a rugged, often desolate area where anything and everything can happen. As the investigation into the death intensifies, Kim''s sister Kris, who runs the local brothel, becomes the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRdPHk5EOLwqqAhkKzufAHPCBLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1011869'),
  ('130481202618513577', 'Rebecca', 2020, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ben Wheatley, Laurie Rose, Ben Howard', 'Jane Goldman, Anna Waterhouse, Joe Shrapnel', 'Lily James, Armie Hammer, Kristin Scott Thomas, Keeley Hawes, Ann Dowd, Sam Riley, Tom Goodman-Hill, Mark Lewis Jones', 'PG-13', 'After a whirlwind romance with a wealthy widower, a naïve bride moves to his family estate but can''t escape the haunting shadow of his late wife.', 'After a whirlwind romance with a wealthy widower, a naïve bride moves to his family estate but can''t escape the haunting shadow of his late wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGhllBArW7ImDycSMIG5bj6GEPL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505379'),
  ('551335464964125874', 'Rebecca of Sunnybrook Farm', 1938, 'Drama, Family, Music', 'Allan Dwan, Arthur C. Miller', 'Don Ettlinger, Karl Tunberg', 'Shirley Temple, Randolph Scott, Jack Haley, Gloria Stuart, Phyllis Brooks, Helen Westley, Slim Summerville, Bill Robinson', 'G', 'Rebecca''s Uncle Harry leaves her with Aunt Miranda who forbids her to associate with show people. But neighbor Anthony Kent is a talent scout who secretly set it up for her to broadcast.', 'Rebecca''s Uncle Harry leaves her with Aunt Miranda who forbids her to associate with show people. But neighbor Anthony Kent is a talent scout who secretly set it up for her to broadcast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOhc4f50v5hX2GnYm9NBbAzMzY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38716'),
  ('904335047850713084', 'Rebel', 1985, 'War, Romance', 'Michael Jenkins, Peter James', 'Michael Jenkins, Bob Herbert', 'Matt Dillon, Debra Byrne, Bryan Brown, Bill Hunter, Ray Barrett, Julie Nihill, John O''May, Kim Deacon', 'R', 'This drama is set in World War II Australia, where an American Marine, Rebel is recuperating from wounds suffered in battle. He is weary of war and is intent on going AWOL and escaping from Australia. He becomes infatuated with a local singer, Kathy and pursues her. Kathy is married and initially is not interested in him, but later begins to love Rebel. Kathy receives a letter advising her that her husband was killed in battle. The local police and the U.S. Military are searching for Rebel as an AWOL soldier. Rebel arranges to escape Austalia by a cargo ship, but eventually allows himself to be arrested in order to keep the local police from arresting Kathy for harboring him', 'This drama is set in World War II Australia, where an American Marine, Rebel is recuperating from wounds suffered in battle. He is weary of war and is intent on going AWOL and escaping from Australia. He becomes infatuated with a local singer, Kathy and pursues her. Kathy is married and initially is not interested in him, but later begins to love Rebel. Kathy receives a letter advising her that her husband was killed in battle. The local police and the U.S. Military are searching for Rebel as an AWOL soldier. Rebel arranges to escape Austalia by a cargo ship, but eventually allows himself to be arrested in order to keep the local police from arresting Kathy for harboring him', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5rVF5ta4RIwRRXMm9BoctQVITw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123156'),
  ('234722401949663850', 'Rebel', 2012, 'Action', 'Raghava Lawrence, C. Ramprasad', 'Raghava Lawrence', 'Prabhas, Tamannaah Bhatia, Deeksha Seth, Brahmanandam, Mukesh Rishi, Chalapathi Rao, Sayaji Shinde, Ali Basha', null, 'After his parents are brutally murdered, a man goes on a quest to find his parents'' killers. He finds that his own uncle is involved in the killings.', 'After his parents are brutally murdered, a man goes on a quest to find his parents'' killers. He finds that his own uncle is involved in the killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwD0qvuk75C0a3uI7WT04BbZb2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135870'),
  ('918267490934534822', 'Rebel', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Bilall Fallah, Adil El Arbi, Ester Swennen', 'Adil El Arbi, Bilall Fallah, Jan Van Dyck', 'Aboubakr Bensaïhi, Lubna Azabal, Tara Abboud, Amir El Arbi, Younes Bouab, Kamal Moummad, Fouad Hajji, Nassim Rachi', 'NR', 'Kamal resolves to change his life for the better, and so leaves Belgium to help victims of the war in Syria. But when he arrives, he is forced to join a militia and is left stranded in Raqqa. Back home, his younger brother Nassim quickly becomes easy prey for radical recruiters, who promise to reunite him with his brother. Their mother, Leila, fights to protect the only thing she has left: her youngest son.', 'Kamal resolves to change his life for the better, and so leaves Belgium to help victims of the war in Syria. But when he arrives, he is forced to join a militia and is left stranded in Raqqa. Back home, his younger brother Nassim quickly becomes easy prey for radical recruiters, who promise to reunite him with his brother. Their mother, Leila, fights to protect the only thing she has left: her youngest son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ddPvvVL4Fba226RI8un8br66KL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853332'),
  ('397548952542765165', 'Rebel in the Rye', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jessica Pollini, Julie A. Bloom, Vincent Giarratano', 'Danny Strong', 'Nicholas Hoult, Kevin Spacey, Victor Garber, Hope Davis, Zoey Deutch, Lucy Boynton, Brian d''Arcy James, Eric Bogosian', 'PG-13', 'The life of celebrated but reclusive author J.D. Salinger, who gained worldwide fame with the publication of his novel The Catcher in the Rye.', 'The life of celebrated but reclusive author J.D. Salinger, who gained worldwide fame with the publication of his novel The Catcher in the Rye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjmMtBIqg65MPOJXOtoLCKYjVUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390056'),
  ('417974852097014282', 'Rebel Moon - Part One: A Child of Fire', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Zack Snyder, Zack Snyder, Eli Snyder', 'Zack Snyder, Shay Hatten, Kurt Johnstad', 'Sofia Boutella, Michiel Huisman, Ed Skrein, Djimon Hounsou, Bae Doona, Staz Nair, Charlie Hunnam, Ray Fisher', 'PG-13', 'When the ruthless forces of the Motherworld threaten a quiet farming village on a distant moon, a mysterious outsider becomes its best hope for survival.', 'When the ruthless forces of the Motherworld threaten a quiet farming village on a distant moon, a mysterious outsider becomes its best hope for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui4DrH1cKk2vkHshcUcGt2lKxCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848326'),
