  ('185657564719244757', 'Rebel Rabbit', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'The signs indicate current bounty prices: $50 for a fox, $75 for a bear, only 2 cents for a rabbit. Bugs is insulted.', 'The signs indicate current bounty prices: $50 for a fox, $75 for a bear, only 2 cents for a rabbit. Bugs is insulted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vi9dK1ZrTxaaPI2EsC5iB19vhAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100343'),
  ('80800244730673560', 'Rebel Ridge', 2024, 'Crime, Action, Thriller, Drama', 'David Gallego, Jeremy Saulnier, Jeremy Woolsey', 'Jeremy Saulnier', 'Aaron Pierre, Don Johnson, AnnaSophia Robb, Emory Cohen, David Denman, Oscar Gale, Steve Zissis, Daniel Chung', 'R', 'A former Marine confronts corruption in a small town when local law enforcement unjustly seizes the bag of cash he needs to post his cousin''s bail.', 'A former Marine confronts corruption in a small town when local law enforcement unjustly seizes the bag of cash he needs to post his cousin''s bail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEt2GSz9z5rSVpIHMiGdtf0czyf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646097'),
  ('793404020170347662', 'Rebel Without a Cause', 1955, 'Drama', 'Ernest Haller, Nicholas Ray, Robert Farfan', 'Stewart Stern', 'James Dean, Natalie Wood, Sal Mineo, Jim Backus, Ann Doran, Corey Allen, William Hopper, Rochelle Hudson', 'PG-13', 'After moving to a new town, troublemaking teen Jim Stark is supposed to have a clean slate, although being the new kid in town brings its own problems. While searching for some stability, Stark forms a bond with a disturbed classmate, Plato, and falls for local girl Judy. However, Judy is the girlfriend of neighborhood tough, Buzz. When Buzz violently confronts Jim and challenges him to a drag race, the new kid''s real troubles begin.', 'After moving to a new town, troublemaking teen Jim Stark is supposed to have a clean slate, although being the new kid in town brings its own problems. While searching for some stability, Stark forms a bond with a disturbed classmate, Plato, and falls for local girl Judy. However, Judy is the girlfriend of neighborhood tough, Buzz. When Buzz violently confronts Jim and challenges him to a drag race, the new kid''s real troubles begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHStsC8rRRfIjqRN38BQsLh6S7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221'),
  ('513494083618173932', 'Rebelde Sin Casa', 1960, null, 'Benito Alazraki', null, 'Germán Valdés, Ana Bertha Lepe, Óscar Ortiz de Pinedo, Carlos Riquelme, Marcelo Chávez, Arturo Soto Rangel', null, 'Tin Tan interfered in a bank robbery, then got arrested when the perp.s escaped. Crooks and police are both after him...', 'Tin Tan interfered in a bank robbery, then got arrested when the perp.s escaped. Crooks and police are both after him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNbfEzaD25ZH2sCtW37VGbr1j2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300169'),
  ('162689114517621506', 'Rebellion', 2009, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Herman Yau', 'Herman Yau, Yin-Yee Tin', 'Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Elanne Kwong Yeuk-Lam, Chapman To Man-Chat, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Jun Kung, Conroy Chan Chi-Chung, Paul Wong Koon-Chung, Anson Leung Chun-Yat', null, 'After a top gangster is murdered, his second-in-command must prevent an uprising by rival gangs.', 'After a top gangster is murdered, his second-in-command must prevent an uprising by rival gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoDGwRyQ8WFdwHFneqvKXINXqVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37850'),
  ('136114133505251081', 'Rebellion', 2011, 'Drama, Action, History', 'Marc Koninckx, Mathieu Kassovitz', 'Benoît Jaubert, Pierre Geller, Mathieu Kassovitz', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Iabe Lapacas, Malik Zidi, Alexandre Steiger, Daniel Martin, Philippe Torreton, Sylvie Testud, Jean-Philippe Puymartin', null, 'April 1988, Ouvéa Island, New Caledonia. 30 gendarmes are taken hostage by a group of Kanak freedom fighters. 300 soldiers are sent from France to re-establish order. 2 men confront each other: Philippe Legorjus, chief of the terrorist squad, and Alphonse Dianou, head of the kidnappers. Through their shared values, they will attempt to make discussion triumph. But, in the middle of a presidential election, when the stakes are political, order isn''t always dictated by morality. A violent and troubling epic that marks the return of Mathieu Kassovitz in front and behind the camera.', 'April 1988, Ouvéa Island, New Caledonia. 30 gendarmes are taken hostage by a group of Kanak freedom fighters. 300 soldiers are sent from France to re-establish order. 2 men confront each other: Philippe Legorjus, chief of the terrorist squad, and Alphonse Dianou, head of the kidnappers. Through their shared values, they will attempt to make discussion triumph. But, in the middle of a presidential election, when the stakes are political, order isn''t always dictated by morality. A violent and troubling epic that marks the return of Mathieu Kassovitz in front and behind the camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HF02jsytCLnQxGKYbJoznJcKPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76609'),
  ('380042512548867500', 'Rebellion', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller, Music, History', 'José Luis Rugeles, Mauricio Vidal', 'Chucky García, José Luis Rugeles, Martín Mauregui', 'Jhon Narváez, Angie Cepeda, Martín Seefeld, Ronier, Matías Agresott Taborda, Juan Miguel Paez, Edgar Quijada, Gustavo García Pantera', null, 'Joe Arroyo and his musicians will embark together on this psychedelic journey through various hotel rooms. Rebelión is the portrait of a genius in the depths of his intimacy, the throb of a soul in love and tormented by that great love: music. It is a timeless journey through his life, passing through the dark and lonely place where the creative act happens, where his talent is on the surface and his emotions are free, as well as his whims. The story takes place in hotel rooms, overflowing with chaos and the genius of Joe. A hotel room that are many and that, in turn, contains the agony of the genius who sabotages everything he loves to remain free.', 'Joe Arroyo and his musicians will embark together on this psychedelic journey through various hotel rooms. Rebelión is the portrait of a genius in the depths of his intimacy, the throb of a soul in love and tormented by that great love: music. It is a timeless journey through his life, passing through the dark and lonely place where the creative act happens, where his talent is on the surface and his emotions are free, as well as his whims. The story takes place in hotel rooms, overflowing with chaos and the genius of Joe. A hotel room that are many and that, in turn, contains the agony of the genius who sabotages everything he loves to remain free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mKlDzSjeUKx2P1CikAUOnXTGFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032603'),
  ('727146706851481740', 'Rebellion in Patagonia', 1974, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Héctor Olivera, Norberto Castronuovo, Teo Kofman', 'Osvaldo Bayer, Fernando Ayala, Héctor Olivera', 'Héctor Alterio, Luis Brandoni, Federico Luppi, Pepe Soriano, Héctor Pellegrini, Carlos Muñoz Arosa, Maurice Jouvet, Jorge Rivera López', 'NR', 'In 1920, workers from Patagonia, in Southern Argentina, gather around an anarcho-syndicalist society and go on strike, demanding better working conditions. When the situation turns unsustainable, President Yrigoyen sends Lieutenant Colonel Zavala to impose order.', 'In 1920, workers from Patagonia, in Southern Argentina, gather around an anarcho-syndicalist society and go on strike, demanding better working conditions. When the situation turns unsustainable, President Yrigoyen sends Lieutenant Colonel Zavala to impose order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oj6OeVMhquRV64gIjxbyoHgaSCL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64978'),
  ('556981146389312252', 'Rebellion of the Hanged', 1954, 'Drama, Adventure, History', 'Alfredo B. Crevenna, Emilio Fernández, Gabriel Figueroa', 'John Bright', 'Pedro Armendáriz, Ariadna Welter, Víctor Junco, Carlos López Moctezuma, Amanda del Llano, Jaime Fernández, Luis Aceves Castañeda, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Sr.', null, 'A peasant who works in a mahogany camp in the Mexican jungles with his family is disgusted with the miserable living conditions imposed upon himself and his co-workers, the peasant finally spearheads a revolt against the sadistic bosses.', 'A peasant who works in a mahogany camp in the Mexican jungles with his family is disgusted with the miserable living conditions imposed upon himself and his co-workers, the peasant finally spearheads a revolt against the sadistic bosses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEEZQYd2fL5vWsdSqKezlkiI6k8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320010'),
  ('876981441835036716', 'Rebels', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Thibaud Ponce, Allan Mauduit, Alain Carsoux', 'Jérémie Guez, Allan Mauduit', 'Cécile de France, Audrey Lamy, Yolande Moreau, Simon Abkarian, Samuel Jouy, Béatrice Agenin, Patrick Ridremont, Tom Lecocq', null, 'Sandra, a young woman forced to leave the south of France to flee a violent husband. Without attachment, she returned to Boulogne-sur-Mer, the city of her childhood which she left almost 15 years ago. She finds her mother there and a world she left behind. Without money, she is hired in a fish cannery where she befriends two workers. But one day, one of her colleagues tackles her insistently, she defends herself and kills him accidentally.', 'Sandra, a young woman forced to leave the south of France to flee a violent husband. Without attachment, she returned to Boulogne-sur-Mer, the city of her childhood which she left almost 15 years ago. She finds her mother there and a world she left behind. Without money, she is hired in a fish cannery where she befriends two workers. But one day, one of her colleagues tackles her insistently, she defends herself and kills him accidentally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpZqsW1tScm62fhTPzCj2dFBTS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569814'),
  ('783866059204496146', 'Rebels @School', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Ilse Warringa, Jan Albert de Weerd, Rick David', 'Ilse Warringa', 'Ilse Warringa, Leny Breederveld, Beppie Melissen, Aiko Beemsterboer, Jennifer Hoffman, Dragan Bakema, Rian Gerritsen, Arnoud Bos', null, 'The eccentric Miss Ank tries to pick up the pieces at her primary after the loss of their principal. Faced with a shortage of teachers, and increasingly demanding parents, the board hires an interim head to get things in order. Pretty soon e-teaching takes over, with an actual robot replacing the teachers, and CCTV enabling over-involved parents to keep a constant eye on what’s happening. Finding themselves up against this heartless new regime, pupils and teachers decide to join forces and rebel.', 'The eccentric Miss Ank tries to pick up the pieces at her primary after the loss of their principal. Faced with a shortage of teachers, and increasingly demanding parents, the board hires an interim head to get things in order. Pretty soon e-teaching takes over, with an actual robot replacing the teachers, and CCTV enabling over-involved parents to keep a constant eye on what’s happening. Finding themselves up against this heartless new regime, pupils and teachers decide to join forces and rebel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cOA7E80cLDU0aiXk8E7UxW5HIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:830426'),
  ('196040639899039001', 'Rebels of the Neon God', 1994, 'Drama, Crime', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Liao Pen-jung, Yang Lang-Tsung', 'Tsai Ming-liang', 'Lee Kang-sheng, Chen Chao-jung, Wang Yu-wen, Jen Chang-bin, Miao Tian, Lu Yi-ching', 'NR', 'In Taipei, four youths face alienation, loneliness, and moments of existential crisis amidst a series of minor crimes.', 'In Taipei, four youths face alienation, loneliness, and moments of existential crisis amidst a series of minor crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgbqeCQ9uT2ER46QFJeURp9rcWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57564'),
  ('646984805940210954', 'Rebirth', 2011, 'Drama, Crime', 'Izuru Narushima, Junichi Fujisawa', 'Satoko Okudera', 'Mao Inoue, Hiromi Nagasaku, Eiko Koike, Yōko Moriguchi, Tetsushi Tanaka, Miwako Ichikawa, Mitsuru Hirata, Gekidan Hitori', null, 'After the collapse of their relationship, Kiwako abducts the 6-month old child of a man she was having an affair with. Raising the child as her own, it is four years before the authorities catch up with her and the young child.', 'After the collapse of their relationship, Kiwako abducts the 6-month old child of a man she was having an affair with. Raising the child as her own, it is four years before the authorities catch up with her and the young child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrhbwBBWI2BSUDp3hiy8PmulCqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94054'),
  ('778387281972897092', 'Rebirth', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Saul Herckis, Danielle de Arakal, Karl Mueller', 'Karl Mueller', 'Fran Kranz, Adam Goldberg, Nicky Whelan, Harry Hamlin, Kat Foster, Eric Ladin, Pat Healy, Luis Gerardo Méndez', null, 'A man''s life is turned inside out after a visit from his college friend leads him into the unexpected.', 'A man''s life is turned inside out after a visit from his college friend leads him into the unexpected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBI7uS5DDfWBPfMmlxUvgn0PePa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369033'),
  ('692322673479621472', 'Rebirth of Mothra', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Family', 'Okihiro Yoneda, Yoshinori Sekiguchi, Kunio Miyoshi', 'Masumi Suetanii', 'Megumi Kobayashi, Sayaka Yamaguchi, Aki Hano, Kazuki Futami, Maya Fujisawa, Hitomi Takahashi, Kenjiro Nashimoto, Nagare Hagiwara', null, 'A new Mothra takes to the air and battles against Desghidorah to save all of humanity.', 'A new Mothra takes to the air and battles against Desghidorah to save all of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d122gkszmtSYfOrSi3i9mVfUciI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36214'),
  ('901453176701834209', 'Rebirth of Mothra II', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Adventure, Family, Action', 'Kunio Miyoshi, Koichi Kawakita, Kenji Suzuki', 'Masumi Suetanii', 'Sayaka Yamaguchi, Megumi Kobayashi, Aki Hano, Masaki Otake, Shimada Maganao, Atsushi Okuno, Hajime Okayama, Maho Nonami', null, 'The fairies from Infant Island discover a lost city, as well as a giant monster that is attracted to environmental calamities.', 'The fairies from Infant Island discover a lost city, as well as a giant monster that is attracted to environmental calamities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijMxhIsAhkBbvjLuCxpnnY4zM2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36212'),
  ('155140366668329375', 'Rebirth of Mothra III', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Okihiro Yoneda, Yoshinori Sekiguchi, Masaaki Tezuka', 'Masumi Suetanii', 'Megumi Kobayashi, Misato Tate, Aki Hano, Atsushi Ônita, Tsutomu Kitagawa, Koichi Ueda, Sayaka Yamaguchi, Shirô Namiki', null, 'To save the world, Mothra goes back in time in an attempt to defeat a younger King Ghidorah.', 'To save the world, Mothra goes back in time in an attempt to defeat a younger King Ghidorah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66VuRKWT894rwEQJKzu48DltjJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36247'),
  ('1059655557433104417', 'Reborn', 1981, 'Drama, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Bigas Luna', 'Bigas Luna, Robert Dunn', 'Dennis Hopper, Michael Moriarty, Francisco Rabal, Antonella Murgia, Àngel Jové, Kit Massengill, Jo Perkins, Charles Bacarisse', null, 'A man discovers that his girlfriend is a "stigmata" (someone whose hands and feet mysteriously bleed in the same places where Jesus Christ was crucified) and tries to keep her out of the hands of a greedy TV preacher who plans to exploit her to make money for himself.', 'A man discovers that his girlfriend is a "stigmata" (someone whose hands and feet mysteriously bleed in the same places where Jesus Christ was crucified) and tries to keep her out of the hands of a greedy TV preacher who plans to exploit her to make money for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugoZF68Tk3FiAgIIxX8QJ8RKMbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115869'),
  ('589909257731500867', 'Reborn', 2018, 'Horror', 'Julian Richards, Brian Sowell, Jeff Shiffman', 'Michael Mahin', 'Barbara Crampton, Kayleigh Gilbert, Michael Paré, Rae Dawn Chong, Monte Markham, Chaz Bono, Alexa Marie, Bob Bancroft', null, 'A stillborn baby girl is abducted by a deranged morgue attendant and brought back to life by electro-kinetic power. On her sixteenth birthday, traumatized Tess escapes captivity and sets out to find her birth mother leaving a trail of horrifying violent destruction and chilling chaos behind her.', 'A stillborn baby girl is abducted by a deranged morgue attendant and brought back to life by electro-kinetic power. On her sixteenth birthday, traumatized Tess escapes captivity and sets out to find her birth mother leaving a trail of horrifying violent destruction and chilling chaos behind her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibPT9S9zA2Q3ung84PRrBoUdPa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554636'),
  ('444124837405301298', 'Rebound', 2005, 'Comedy, Family', 'Steve Carr, Glen MacPherson', 'William Wolff, Jon Lucas, John J. Strauss', 'Martin Lawrence, Wendy Raquel Robinson, Breckin Meyer, Horatio Sanz, Patrick Warburton, Oren Williams, Megan Mullally, Eddy Martin', 'PG', 'An acclaimed college hoops coach is demoted to a junior varsity team after a public meltdown.', 'An acclaimed college hoops coach is demoted to a junior varsity team after a public meltdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4l0Q1lAf4aV3h1LJQ00EpxVQefr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7233'),
  ('312469251631893968', 'Rebound', 2023, 'Drama', 'Chang Hang-jun, Mun Yong-gun, Park Ji-sung', 'Kwon Sung-hui, Kim Eun-hee', 'Ahn Jae-hong, Lee Sin-young, Jeong Jin-woon, Kim Taek, Jung Gun-joo, Kim Min, Ahn Ji-ho, Lee Jun-hyeok', null, 'This true story retells the incredible tale of the 2012 National High School Basketball Championship, in which a new coach and six players from the weakest basketball team ran nonstop for eight days.', 'This true story retells the incredible tale of the 2012 National High School Basketball Championship, in which a new coach and six players from the weakest basketball team ran nonstop for eight days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cioCtpRThVQB5UDnwDSGIljIu3j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936243'),
  ('930372750092995199', 'Rebound: The Legend of Earl ''The Goat'' Manigault', 1996, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Eriq La Salle, Alar Kivilo', 'Larry Golin, Alan Swyer', 'Don Cheadle, James Earl Jones, Michael Beach, Ronny Cox, Loretta Devine, Glynn Turman, Monica Calhoun, Michael Ralph', null, 'A dramatization of the life of Earl ''The Goat'' Manigault (Don Cheadle), with a lot of factual based occurrences. A reformed junkie returns from prison to clean up his act and devote the rest of his life to the young kids of Harlem. 1996 was the 25th anniversary of the first tournament named after him.', 'A dramatization of the life of Earl ''The Goat'' Manigault (Don Cheadle), with a lot of factual based occurrences. A reformed junkie returns from prison to clean up his act and devote the rest of his life to the young kids of Harlem. 1996 was the 25th anniversary of the first tournament named after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x37YaL5yrmNMX8LvJAKNIjIpIxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29804'),
  ('645627764297262448', 'Rebuilding', 2025, 'Drama', 'Max Walker-Silverman, Laura Klein, Kat Hess', 'Max Walker-Silverman', 'Josh O''Connor, Meghann Fahy, Lily LaTorre, Kali Reis, Amy Madigan, Jefferson Mays, Nancy Morlan, Sam Engbring', 'PG', 'After wildfires take his ranch, a cowboy named Dusty winds up in a FEMA camp, finding community with others who lost homes, including his daughter and ex-wife.', 'After wildfires take his ranch, a cowboy named Dusty winds up in a FEMA camp, finding community with others who lost homes, including his daughter and ex-wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cDCGKBA6XANFDw4km9GvDnFBHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1211442'),
  ('498133091647181859', 'Rebus-Film Nr. 1', 1925, 'Animation', 'Paul Leni, Guido Seeber', 'Paul Leni, Hans Brennert', null, null, 'An "extra" shown in two parts at the movie theater, before and after a feature: part one gives the clues to six words in a crossword puzzle, part two gives the answers. In addition to the visual clues, which are clips of a party, an Asian country, a European city, table games, winter, and bullfighting, there are montages of street scenes and spinning objects. A simple cartoon character, Mr. Rebus, walks the audience through the clues, and title cards encourage the participation of the theatergoers.', 'An "extra" shown in two parts at the movie theater, before and after a feature: part one gives the clues to six words in a crossword puzzle, part two gives the answers. In addition to the visual clues, which are clips of a party, an Asian country, a European city, table games, winter, and bullfighting, there are montages of street scenes and spinning objects. A simple cartoon character, Mr. Rebus, walks the audience through the clues, and title cards encourage the participation of the theatergoers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJNt2fOqejPjqrJqh7H3LqtMFpV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184434'),
  ('553284156604704362', 'Recalled', 2021, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Lee Seung-bin, Kim Gi-tae, Seo You-min', 'Seo You-min', 'Seo Yea-ji, Kim Kang-woo, Sung Hyuk, Park Sang-wook, Bae Yu-ram, Yeom Hye-ran, Park Bom-I, Gong Yu-rim', null, 'Soo-jin, who lost her memories due to a horrible incident, starts suspecting her husband. She is confused between reality and illusion, truth and lies.', 'Soo-jin, who lost her memories due to a horrible incident, starts suspecting her husband. She is confused between reality and illusion, truth and lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTXwu4Ux8QJ1iwBprwVRbEtPa90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602302'),
  ('902245899384391585', 'Recently, My Sister Is Unusual', 2014, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Iggy Coen, Yuki Aoyama, Yuji Imai', 'Takehiko Minato, Iggy Coen', 'Tenka Hashimoto, Yūkichi Kobayashi, Mayu Mitsui, Mika Yano, Kazue Akita, Reiko Hayama, Tsunaki Fukushima, Ini Kusano', null, 'Mitsuki and Yuya become stepsister and stepbrother because of their parents'' marriage. Mitsuki can''t get along with her new family and Yuya doesn''t know how to approach his new stepsister. One day, Mitsuki becomes possessed by the spirit of Hiyori. Hiyori likes Yuya and believes Yuya can help her get to heaven. Hiyori places a leather chastity belt upon on Mitsuki and a plan takes place to help send Hiyori to heaven.', 'Mitsuki and Yuya become stepsister and stepbrother because of their parents'' marriage. Mitsuki can''t get along with her new family and Yuya doesn''t know how to approach his new stepsister. One day, Mitsuki becomes possessed by the spirit of Hiyori. Hiyori likes Yuya and believes Yuya can help her get to heaven. Hiyori places a leather chastity belt upon on Mitsuki and a plan takes place to help send Hiyori to heaven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vG56lYDARmQ8uDpvNLqOSxJiBrc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297021'),
  ('26818980252684512', 'Recep Ivedik', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Buse Dalan, Togan Gökbakar, Ertunç Şenkay', 'Serkan Altuniğne, Şahan Gökbakar, Mehmet Ali Bayhan', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Fatma Toptaş, Tuluğ Çizgen, Lemi Filozof, Hakan Bilgin, Berna Biber, Volkan Cal, Vural Buldu', null, 'A man finds the wallet of a rich man and takes a rigorous trip in an old car to return it, finding an old love and a new life of luxury awaiting.', 'A man finds the wallet of a rich man and takes a rigorous trip in an old car to return it, finding an old love and a new life of luxury awaiting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heKqSDyQuVzPrQIuvY5mqC3oc6M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31060'),
  ('246556504987351746', 'Recep Ivedik 2', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Togan Gökbakar, Ertunç Şenkay', 'Togan Gökbakar, Şahan Gökbakar, Serkan Altuniğne', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Gülşen Özbakan, Efe Babacan, Çağrı Büyüksayar, Zeynep Çamcı, Ayfer Çalgıcı, Asiye Dinçsoy, Faruk Aksoy', null, 'When his grandmother takes ill, foolish brute Recep tries to satisfy her wishes by getting a job and attempting to find a suitable wife.', 'When his grandmother takes ill, foolish brute Recep tries to satisfy her wishes by getting a job and attempting to find a suitable wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuokr2itBRbbaLT0bjTykC252KJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31061'),
  ('348464082181957281', 'Recep Ivedik 3', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Togan Gökbakar, Ertunç Şenkay', 'Serkan Altuniğne, Togan Gökbakar, Can Ali Sabuncu', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Zeynep Çamcı, Vahdet Çakar, Ayhan Işık, Cihan Culfa, Fatma Edizer', null, 'Recep Ivedik has been depressed since the death of his grandmother. Everyone who tries to help him fails. A young girl named Zeynep, who can''t find an apartment, stays with Recep. Initially, the two can''t stand each others but after a while, they grow close. Despite many adventures together, Recep''s depression won''t go away. That is until he experiences something he had never experienced before.', 'Recep Ivedik has been depressed since the death of his grandmother. Everyone who tries to help him fails. A young girl named Zeynep, who can''t find an apartment, stays with Recep. Initially, the two can''t stand each others but after a while, they grow close. Despite many adventures together, Recep''s depression won''t go away. That is until he experiences something he had never experienced before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tT4gR2KesVdY6KaFDZ0BUOBsEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32926'),
  ('306315283756533462', 'Recep Ivedik 4', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Müge Manuş, Togan Gökbakar, Gérard Simon', 'Şahan Gökbakar', 'Şahan Gökbakar, İrfan Kangı, Cem Korkmaz, Barış Bulut, Ece İncebay, Ekrem Aral Tuna, Aziz Karakaya, Berna Üçkaleler', null, 'Recep Ivedik coaches the children football team in his neighborhood. For the training he uses the only free piece of land as football field on which he used to play football as a child. Recep notices sadly that this piece of land was sold to a businessman. So as not to loose this for the neighborhood and the children valuable piece of land he decides to re-buy it on his own. With his own methods he does not receive the money. The participation in a competition with a big price is the only solution of his problem ...', 'Recep Ivedik coaches the children football team in his neighborhood. For the training he uses the only free piece of land as football field on which he used to play football as a child. Recep notices sadly that this piece of land was sold to a businessman. So as not to loose this for the neighborhood and the children valuable piece of land he decides to re-buy it on his own. With his own methods he does not receive the money. The participation in a competition with a big price is the only solution of his problem ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQna16mActTddarn63rfIy5ld61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257343'),
  ('245149226895081089', 'Recep Ivedik 5', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Simon, Togan Gökbakar', 'Togan Gökbakar, Şahan Gökbakar', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Deniz Ceylan, Orkan Varan, Nurullah Çelebi, Tanfer Yaşar German, Ayşe Gülerman', null, 'During his visit of condolence to Ismet''s funeral, Recep Ivedik feels sorry about Ismet''s remaining family members due to his latest unfinished job contract which would cause hard financial situation for the family. Therefore, Recep decides to finish Ismet''s last job by replacing himself as a bus driver and to transport group of athletes. Although Recep and his accompanying friend Nurullah were expecting this could be a short trip, they learn that it is not because they have to transport young national athletes to sports organization in a foreign country. This becomes the beginning for them to have irreversible adventure. When they are on the road, unfortunate things happen and crisis appears for the team. Recep, who believes only in victory, takes control of the situation and develops his own methods in order to make the team successful while he face with all funny events.', 'During his visit of condolence to Ismet''s funeral, Recep Ivedik feels sorry about Ismet''s remaining family members due to his latest unfinished job contract which would cause hard financial situation for the family. Therefore, Recep decides to finish Ismet''s last job by replacing himself as a bus driver and to transport group of athletes. Although Recep and his accompanying friend Nurullah were expecting this could be a short trip, they learn that it is not because they have to transport young national athletes to sports organization in a foreign country. This becomes the beginning for them to have irreversible adventure. When they are on the road, unfortunate things happen and crisis appears for the team. Recep, who believes only in victory, takes control of the situation and develops his own methods in order to make the team successful while he face with all funny events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPIYxH4A0JV5vUVggBGE1lIlUaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438703'),
  ('538526411258026766', 'Recep Ivedik 6', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Kader Ezgeç, Gérard Simon, Togan Gökbakar', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Togan Gökbakar', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Nurullah Çelebi, Somer Karvan, Furkan Bayraktar, Mustafa Dok, Eray Sel, Serra Menderes', null, 'Recep İvedik is at home watching television, when postman brings him a surprise invitation for the annual dried beans festival of Konya province. Very excited with the news, Recep convinces his best friend Nurullah to join him but due to a miscommunication with the travel agency, they get plane tickets for Kenya, Africa, instead of Konya, Turkey. After arriving at Kenya and getting on a safari tour, our hapless companions find themselves lost in endless savannah and at the middle of two rival local tribes. Many adventures await Recep in this unfamiliar and exotic land, who will try anything and everything to return home, mostly to hilarious results.', 'Recep İvedik is at home watching television, when postman brings him a surprise invitation for the annual dried beans festival of Konya province. Very excited with the news, Recep convinces his best friend Nurullah to join him but due to a miscommunication with the travel agency, they get plane tickets for Kenya, Africa, instead of Konya, Turkey. After arriving at Kenya and getting on a safari tour, our hapless companions find themselves lost in endless savannah and at the middle of two rival local tribes. Many adventures await Recep in this unfamiliar and exotic land, who will try anything and everything to return home, mostly to hilarious results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WSQTBAs6sVBhAP2VsphYsrTY9E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625489'),
  ('723161959754009624', 'Recep Ivedik 7', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Togan Gökbakar, Gérard Simon', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Togan Gökbakar', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Nurullah Çelebi, Öznur Serçeler, İrfan Kangı, Murat Ergür, Eray Türk, Murat Dalkılıç, Zeki Eker', null, 'Recep and Nurullah decide to go village house, which is inherited from his grandma. Recep finds out the existence of a big project, that will damage the village and the surrounding forests. Villagers will fight against the project with Recep''s leadership.', 'Recep and Nurullah decide to go village house, which is inherited from his grandma. Recep finds out the existence of a big project, that will damage the village and the surrounding forests. Villagers will fight against the project with Recep''s leadership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTTo0PlRBzupo3zj8EoJXzYnj1i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:952062'),
  ('906096244746400260', 'Recep Ivedik 8', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Togan Gökbakar', 'Şahan Gökbakar', 'Şahan Gökbakar, Merve Mutlu', null, '8th installment of Recep İvedik. Plot TBA.', '8th installment of Recep İvedik. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3j9T9MkttObsQgn9KgyYwdr0bFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1584720'),
  ('361329632202847302', 'Recess Christmas: Miracle On Third Street', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Chuck Sheetz, Susie Dietter, Howy Parkins', 'Paul Germain, Joe Ansolabehere, Steve Bannos', 'Michael McKean, Courtland Mead, Ashley Johnson, Jason Davis, James Earl Jones, Rickey D''Shon Collins, Andrew Lawrence, Bobbi Page', null, 'Principal Prickly gets his car stuck in a snowbank and decides it has to be the Recess gang''s fault, but the teachers look back and remember all the good times they''ve had with T.J. and the rest of the gang.', 'Principal Prickly gets his car stuck in a snowbank and decides it has to be the Recess gang''s fault, but the teachers look back and remember all the good times they''ve had with T.J. and the rest of the gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PMkJzVcVyojiyOYIOuwz1ca2uH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77518'),
  ('789029183161109714', 'Recess: All Growed Down', 2003, 'Family, Comedy, Animation', 'Howy Parkins, Brenda Piluso, Chuck Sheetz', 'Elijah Aron, Bart Jennett, Peter Gaffney', 'Myles Jeffrey, Pamela Adlon, Dabney Coleman, Ashley Johnson, Allyce Beasley, Rickey D''Shon Collins, Jason Davis, Courtland Mead', 'G', 'T.J. and The Recess Gang are kidnapped by the Third Street School''s kindergartners, who are in turn being bullied by a new kid in their class.', 'T.J. and The Recess Gang are kidnapped by the Third Street School''s kindergartners, who are in turn being bullied by a new kid in their class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdk7yXdoJoXZ9nhBo1lkea0TbfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84331'),
  ('956459390502007974', 'Recess: School''s Out', 2001, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Sheetz, Paul Germain', 'Jonathan Greenberg', 'Andrew Lawrence, Rickey D''Shon Collins, Pamela Adlon, Ashley Johnson, Jason Davis, Courtland Mead, April Winchell, Dabney Coleman', 'G', 'The school year is finally ending, and T.J. Detweiler is looking forward to summer. But boredom quickly sets in when his friends leave for camp — until T.J. uncovers an evil plot to do away with summer vacation! A crazy former principal, Dr. Benedict, is planning to use a laser beam to alter the weather and create permanent winter. Faced with the dire threat of year-round school, T.J. rounds up the RECESS gang and bands together with some unexpected allies — Miss Finster and Principal Prickly — in a nonstop adventure to save everyone''s summer break. As the kids discover the heroes inside themselves, a platoon of wacky characters, far-out music, and sci-fi surprises turn this madcap mission into a major victory for fun!', 'The school year is finally ending, and T.J. Detweiler is looking forward to summer. But boredom quickly sets in when his friends leave for camp — until T.J. uncovers an evil plot to do away with summer vacation! A crazy former principal, Dr. Benedict, is planning to use a laser beam to alter the weather and create permanent winter. Faced with the dire threat of year-round school, T.J. rounds up the RECESS gang and bands together with some unexpected allies — Miss Finster and Principal Prickly — in a nonstop adventure to save everyone''s summer break. As the kids discover the heroes inside themselves, a platoon of wacky characters, far-out music, and sci-fi surprises turn this madcap mission into a major victory for fun!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsUCoeTwCNIrvDrUiWlTCgyRFZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19405'),
  ('204632120289395898', 'Recess: Taking the Fifth Grade', 2003, 'Family, Comedy, Animation', 'Howy Parkins', 'Elijah Aron, Bart Jennett', 'Rickey D''Shon Collins, Jason Davis, Myles Jeffrey, Ashley Johnson, Courtland Mead, Pamela Adlon, Allyce Beasley, April Winchell', 'G', 'Everyone''s favorite fourth graders have graduated! It''s an all-new school year for the kids — and the gang hits the fifth grade running! But they''re stopped in their tracks when they discover some unwelcome changes — no pizza, no playground... no lockers! And to make things worse, their teacher turns out to be the cantankerous Miss Finster! It''s all too much for T.J., who is determined to find a way to stand up for what the gang believes in and improve the school they love! The fifth grade brings out the best in everyone... even Miss Finster and Principal Prickly!', 'Everyone''s favorite fourth graders have graduated! It''s an all-new school year for the kids — and the gang hits the fifth grade running! But they''re stopped in their tracks when they discover some unwelcome changes — no pizza, no playground... no lockers! And to make things worse, their teacher turns out to be the cantankerous Miss Finster! It''s all too much for T.J., who is determined to find a way to stand up for what the gang believes in and improve the school they love! The fifth grade brings out the best in everyone... even Miss Finster and Principal Prickly!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfYgZce45Hqo20MDBCfWsox2y4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405894'),
  ('268480963848291616', 'Recipe for Love', 2014, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Ron Oliver, C. Kim Miles, Kevin Leslie', 'Michael J. Murray', 'Danielle Panabaker, Shawn Roberts, Pascale Hutton, Karen Holness, Nelson Wong, Laura Soltis, Lori Triolo, Peter DeLuise', 'G', 'Lauren Hennessey has always loved to cook and is a proud perfectionist at her job at "Food & Entertainment Magazine''s" test kitchen while she dreams of being able to finally afford culinary school in Paris. When her boss offers her a bonus if she agrees to ghostwrite the cookbook of a difficult celebrity chef, Lauren sees her dream becoming a reality as soon as she can tame the notorious bad boy chef in question, Dexter Durant. Slowly peeling back the layers of Dexter''s tough-guy persona, she starts seeing a different, vulnerable side to this big-shot chef. Suddenly, their dueling culinary styles become the perfect complement in the kitchen and an attraction between them starts to boil over.', 'Lauren Hennessey has always loved to cook and is a proud perfectionist at her job at "Food & Entertainment Magazine''s" test kitchen while she dreams of being able to finally afford culinary school in Paris. When her boss offers her a bonus if she agrees to ghostwrite the cookbook of a difficult celebrity chef, Lauren sees her dream becoming a reality as soon as she can tame the notorious bad boy chef in question, Dexter Durant. Slowly peeling back the layers of Dexter''s tough-guy persona, she starts seeing a different, vulnerable side to this big-shot chef. Suddenly, their dueling culinary styles become the perfect complement in the kitchen and an attraction between them starts to boil over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufxmSBb5CbmxdruL45WQYsW4mEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293205'),
  ('1093027176470863156', 'Recipes to Stay Together', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rafael Montero, Alan Coton, Enrique Vargas Torres', 'Carolina Rivera, Cecilia Pérez Grovas', 'Arcelia Ramírez, Demián Bichir, Germán Dehesa, Rodolfo Arias, Maya Mishalska, Juan Manuel Bernal, Alpha Acosta, Angélica Aragón', null, '"Cilantro y perejil" is a comedy about couples from the same family, hit by the economic crisis in Mexico. The plot turns around the eternal question of whether it is worth it to live as a couple. The conclusions are fun, unpredictable and very human. After ending a ten-year marriage, Carlos and Susana try to fall in love with other people without success. As the days go by, Carlos realizes that without Susana he is unable to do many things, including distinguishing cilantro from parsley.', '"Cilantro y perejil" is a comedy about couples from the same family, hit by the economic crisis in Mexico. The plot turns around the eternal question of whether it is worth it to live as a couple. The conclusions are fun, unpredictable and very human. After ending a ten-year marriage, Carlos and Susana try to fall in love with other people without success. As the days go by, Carlos realizes that without Susana he is unable to do many things, including distinguishing cilantro from parsley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iykUgReZmpv8AzitrWpLx4UHmLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73522'),
  ('92455636559334851', 'Reckless', 1935, 'Music, Drama, Comedy', 'Victor Fleming, George J. Folsey', 'P.J. Wolfson', 'Jean Harlow, William Powell, Franchot Tone, May Robson, Ted Healy, Nat Pendleton, Rosalind Russell, Mickey Rooney', 'NR', 'A theatrical star, born on the wrong side of the tracks, marries a drunken blue-blood millionaire.', 'A theatrical star, born on the wrong side of the tracks, marries a drunken blue-blood millionaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r43PCgtyx9KTrE6FNnhoxl1k1hP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50080'),
  ('968132236746976493', 'Reckless', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Foley, Michael Ballhaus, Gary Daigler', 'Chris Columbus', 'Aidan Quinn, Daryl Hannah, Kenneth McMillan, Cliff DeYoung, Lois Smith, Adam Baldwin, Dan Hedaya, Billy Jayne', 'R', 'Teenager Johnny Rourke is reckless. Born on the wrong side of the tracks, he breaks the law and girls'' hearts with equal cool. Cheerleader Tracey Prescott is reckless too. She dumps her conventional life and boring boyfriend to follow Johnny wherever his dangerous path leads.', 'Teenager Johnny Rourke is reckless. Born on the wrong side of the tracks, he breaks the law and girls'' hearts with equal cool. Cheerleader Tracey Prescott is reckless too. She dumps her conventional life and boring boyfriend to follow Johnny wherever his dangerous path leads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmPWfm3oN8LkRoe9zWBQALkSbu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38702'),
  ('594998419310683868', 'Reckless', 2018, 'Comedy, Action', 'Roberto Forza, Marco Ponti', 'Marco Ponti', 'Lorenzo Richelmy, Matilda De Angelis, Eugenio Franceschini, Antonio Gerardi, Massimiliano Gallo, Michela Cescon, Gigio Alberti, Libero De Rienzo', null, 'A broke mechanic turns a bank loan denial into an impromptu robbery that puts him on the run with his best friend and a starlet they hold hostage.', 'A broke mechanic turns a bank loan denial into an impromptu robbery that puts him on the run with his best friend and a starlet they hold hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeqtgkxDiXwOhXcm6BqDk0T5z9u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526990'),
  ('564587378752510504', 'Reckless', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller, Comedy, Martial Arts', 'Elliott Montello', 'Stu Small', 'Scott Adkins, Vinnie Jones, Nicole Deon, Kris Johnson, Dean Gaffney', null, 'A former convict on parole must outwit the police to get his share of an old heist.', 'A former convict on parole must outwit the police to get his share of an old heist.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F76jjEatL53KYooIrDQK9wsk4rm1.jpg', 'plex:movie:reckless-2026'),
  ('893821929957075486', 'Reckless Kelly', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Yahoo Serious, Tanya Jackson, Kevin Hayward', 'David Roach, Warwick Ross, Lulu Pinkus', 'Yahoo Serious, Melora Hardin, Alexei Sayle, Hugo Weaving, Kathleen Freeman, John Pinette, Bob Maza, Martin Ferrero', 'PG', 'A satirical take on a modern day Ned Kelly who is forced to Hollywood in order to make enough money to save his family''s land. As it goes against his belief, he cannot simply rob banks for his own benefit (all money goes to the poor). Ned is forced to find another way to come up with the $1 million required to save his family island.', 'A satirical take on a modern day Ned Kelly who is forced to Hollywood in order to make enough money to save his family''s land. As it goes against his belief, he cannot simply rob banks for his own benefit (all money goes to the poor). Ned is forced to find another way to come up with the $1 million required to save his family island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufTt0YqzlZvNjht4YVEqzXWtaXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44664'),
  ('352505410734179991', 'Reckless Summer', 2021, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Julie Allione, Rodolphe Tissot', 'Vincent Poymiro, Fanny Burdino, Marianne Pujas', 'Louisiane Gouverneur, Vincent Deniard, Aymeric Fougeron, Sarah Suco, Alexandre Steiger, Marie Dompnier, Camille Beaurain, Noémie Moncel', null, '15-year-old Solange lives in a little town in the French Alps. When her parents get divorced, she discovers her femininity and has her first sexual experiences.', '15-year-old Solange lives in a little town in the French Alps. When her parents get divorced, she discovers her femininity and has her first sexual experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qTbPPJCV0RM5Lpb2QIpDzpxrB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869922'),
  ('1004182854318900074', 'Reclaim', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Scott Kevan, Rod Smith, Colleen Comer', 'Luke Davies, Carmine Gaeta', 'John Cusack, Ryan Phillippe, Rachelle Lefevre, Jacki Weaver, Luis Guzmán, Briana Roy, Jandres Burgos, Veronica Faye Foo', 'R', 'After their newly adopted daughter goes missing in a small town, Steven and Shannon will stop at nothing to uncover the truth behind her disappearance and the dangerous secret behind the adoption agency they trusted. Risking their own lives, they will discover just what being a parent means and how far they will go to get their child back.', 'After their newly adopted daughter goes missing in a small town, Steven and Shannon will stop at nothing to uncover the truth behind her disappearance and the dangerous secret behind the adoption agency they trusted. Risking their own lives, they will discover just what being a parent means and how far they will go to get their child back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cphb4lOZwv7Dt15YjysaaGQbiXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286654'),
  ('504471457054648894', 'Reclaim Your Brain', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hans Weingartner, Christine A. Maier', 'Hans Weingartner, Katharina Held', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Elsa Sophie Gambard, Gregor Bloéb, Milan Peschel, Simone Hanselmann, Franziska Knuppe, Thorsten Feller, Vinzenz Kiefer', null, 'Frustrated, because he is forced to produce bad TV-shows, a manager of a TV-station, enters the station and manipulates the ratings, to initiate a TV-revolution.', 'Frustrated, because he is forced to produce bad TV-shows, a manager of a TV-station, enters the station and manipulates the ratings, to initiate a TV-revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15zoYqclJF6bcHHL0wZ4nsNJ1Qi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1912'),
  ('1044325402423439394', 'Recoil', 1998, 'Action', 'Ken Blakey, Art Camacho, Spiro Razatos', 'Richard Preston Jr.', 'Gary Daniels, Gregory McKinney, Thomas Kopache, Billy Maddox, John Sanderford, Robin Curtis, Maurice Lamont, Richard Foronjy', null, 'Detective Ray Morgan accidentally kills the son of a mob boss. The mob boss orders to have Morgan killed unknowing that the assassin killed Morgan''s wife and kids. Now Morgan''s out for revenge..and he''ll do it his own way', 'Detective Ray Morgan accidentally kills the son of a mob boss. The mob boss orders to have Morgan killed unknowing that the assassin killed Morgan''s wife and kids. Now Morgan''s out for revenge..and he''ll do it his own way', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htJS85dyIbpjX8O1MuHUPHRqxfM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134791'),
  ('378433575853451568', 'Recoil', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Terry Miles, Bruce Chun', 'John Sullivan', 'Steve Austin, Serinda Swan, Danny Trejo, Lochlyn Munro, Noel Gugliemi, Adam Greydon Reid, Camille Solari, Tygh Runyan', 'R', 'A cop turns vigilante after his family is murdered, exacting vengeance on the killers - and then on all criminals who have slipped through the system.', 'A cop turns vigilante after his family is murdered, exacting vengeance on the killers - and then on all criminals who have slipped through the system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5K0EDKAP4OvmCujhwdc8gVxbPT0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91333'),
  ('492917234877683241', 'Recollections of the Yellow House', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama', 'João César Monteiro, José António Loureiro, Inês de Medeiros', 'João César Monteiro', 'João César Monteiro, Manuela de Freitas, Luis Miguel Cintra, Henrique Viana, António Terrinha, Violeta Sarzedas, Madalena Lua, João Pedro Bénard', null, 'Lisbon, 1989. A middle-aged poor man, tormented by an illness, lives in a cheap room in a family boarding house, in the old section of the city''s waterfront.', 'Lisbon, 1989. A middle-aged poor man, tormented by an illness, lives in a cheap room in a family boarding house, in the old section of the city''s waterfront.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8kUzrxzOKtGhHdxUWMDtCGfIS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73930'),
  ('1051911313594827123', 'Recon', 2019, 'War, Thriller', 'Robert Port, Andrew Bikichky, Edd Lukas', 'Robert Port', 'Alexander Ludwig, RJ Fetherstonhaugh, Mitch Ainley, Chris Brochu, Christopher Crema, Franco Nero, Sam Keeley, Tyler Hynes', null, 'Four American soldiers in WW2, after witnessing the vicious murder of an innocent civilian at the hands of their platoon Sergeant, are sent on a reconnaissance/suicide mission led by a local partisan.', 'Four American soldiers in WW2, after witnessing the vicious murder of an innocent civilian at the hands of their platoon Sergeant, are sent on a reconnaissance/suicide mission led by a local partisan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ft6sLJZYmr9Bh3Owr7zicHH1XhP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717042'),
  ('76957032890733254', 'Reconstruction', 1968, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lucian Pintilie, Edith Mandel, Sergiu Huzum', 'Lucian Pintilie, Horia Pătrașcu', 'George Constantin, Emil Botta, George Mihăiță, Vladimir Găitan, Ernest Maftei, Ileana Popovici, Ștefan Moisescu, Niky Volcz', null, 'A prosecutor, policemen and teacher take the students Vuica and Nicu to a restaurant to re-enact their drunken brawl there, and have it filmed to show the effects of alcoholism.', 'A prosecutor, policemen and teacher take the students Vuica and Nicu to a restaurant to re-enact their drunken brawl there, and have it filmed to show the effects of alcoholism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Yfea4XRSQA8gMxkjdexThqo86o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35166'),
  ('952760877306720471', 'Reconstruction', 1970, 'Crime, Drama', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Giorgos Arvanitis, Christos Paliyannopoulos', 'Thanasis Valtinos, Stratis Karras', 'Toula Stathopoulou, Yannis Totsikas, Thanos Grammenos, Petros Hoedas, Mihalis Fotopoulos, Yannis Balaskas, Mersoula Kapsali, Fokas Kapsalis', null, 'An immigrant returns to his village after many years, only to find that no one is waiting for him. When his wife and her lover murder him, an investigator attempts to reconstruct the crime, while a film crew documents the event.', 'An immigrant returns to his village after many years, only to find that no one is waiting for him. When his wife and her lover murder him, an investigator attempts to reconstruct the crime, while a film crew documents the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jM3Gnf75zTrZGA9aIGoKWxdEmEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85769'),
  ('1052927329006323325', 'Reconstruction', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christoffer Boe, Morten Green, Manuel Alberto Claro', 'Christoffer Boe, Mogens Rukov', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Maria Bonnevie, Krister Henriksson, Nicolas Bro, Peter Steen, Klaus Mulbjerg, Ida Dwinger, Helle Fagralid', null, 'Late one evening Alex suddenly abandons his girlfriend, Simone, to pursue the beautiful Aimee. In his encounter with Aimee time and place dissolve for him and he becomes a stranger to Simone, to whom he cannot return.', 'Late one evening Alex suddenly abandons his girlfriend, Simone, to pursue the beautiful Aimee. In his encounter with Aimee time and place dissolve for him and he becomes a stranger to Simone, to whom he cannot return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWke9pUnvJ1S3LRL5b0CDs621Pa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29456'),
  ('951134609652692057', 'Recontraloca', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Giovanni Ciccia, Mario Bassino', null, 'Gianella Neyra, Giovanni Ciccia, Carlos Carlín, Rossana Fernández-Maldonado, Nicolás Galindo, Rebeca Escribens, Patricia Portocarrero, Gonzalo Torres', null, 'When a woman visits a Chinese doctor, she discovers her pain is due to pent-up rage, and the only cure is to fully express herself, whatever may come.', 'When a woman visits a Chinese doctor, she discovers her pain is due to pent-up rage, and the only cure is to fully express herself, whatever may come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8P8cHDgXL23FjurP2zLd7usMQPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622429'),
  ('815437790436379992', 'Record 957', 1928, 'Music', 'Germaine Dulac, Alfred Guichard', null, null, null, 'Dulac’s three 1929 "abstract" films, Record 957, Αrabesques, and Themes and Variations, were the results of a long period of reflection by the filmmaker, who sought to create a "pure" or "integral" cinema that would capture the essence of the new medium and owe nothing to the other arts. Each of these three studies was designed to be played silent. The first one, Record 957, is conceived of as a "visual impression […] in listening to Frédéric Chopin''s Preludes n. 5 and 6." Its title and its opening shot of lightplay on a spinning record not only announce the film''s dominant cyclical motif, but also evoke one of the filmmaker’s major sources of inspiration in Loie Fuller''s serpentine dances.', 'Dulac’s three 1929 "abstract" films, Record 957, Αrabesques, and Themes and Variations, were the results of a long period of reflection by the filmmaker, who sought to create a "pure" or "integral" cinema that would capture the essence of the new medium and owe nothing to the other arts. Each of these three studies was designed to be played silent. The first one, Record 957, is conceived of as a "visual impression […] in listening to Frédéric Chopin''s Preludes n. 5 and 6." Its title and its opening shot of lightplay on a spinning record not only announce the film''s dominant cyclical motif, but also evoke one of the filmmaker’s major sources of inspiration in Loie Fuller''s serpentine dances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MzFR35Ap7Kv4G9qfOLP6fMnkUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231850'),
  ('973960779573295772', 'Record of a Tenement Gentleman', 1947, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Yûharu Atsuta', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Tadao Ikeda', 'Chōko Iida, Hōhi Aoki, Mitsuko Yoshikawa, Chishū Ryū, Eitarō Ozawa, Reikichi Kawamura, Hideko Mimura, Takeshi Sakamoto', null, 'An errant salaryman''s son gets lost until a man from the Tokyo tenements brings him to vendor Tane, who''s reluctant to let the kid board.', 'An errant salaryman''s son gets lost until a man from the Tokyo tenements brings him to vendor Tane, who''s reluctant to let the kid board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmlYp4hlIu59QCnBZ3A1tQ7UCVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74126'),
  ('821893843516507688', 'Recount', 2008, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Jay Roach, Jim Denault', 'Danny Strong', 'Kevin Spacey, Bob Balaban, Ed Begley Jr., Laura Dern, John Hurt, Denis Leary, Bruce McGill, Tom Wilkinson', null, 'In 2000, the election of the U.S. Presidential boiled down to a few precious votes in the state of Florida — and a recount that would add "hanging chad" to every American''s vocabulary.', 'In 2000, the election of the U.S. Presidential boiled down to a few precious votes in the state of Florida — and a recount that would add "hanging chad" to every American''s vocabulary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7I3WMof3AJuLkildBxpGZkuvQwj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14050'),
  ('379161878782904981', 'Recovery', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Darrell Wheat', 'Kyle Arrington', 'Rachel DiPillo, Kirby Bliss Blanton, Alex Shaffer, Michael Filipowich, John Pirruccello, James Landry Hébert, Samuel Larsen, Jose Abril', 'R', 'The night before their high school graduation, Jessie and her friends are guided by a ''Find My iPhone'' app to recover her lost device from a house whose demented tenants are hell bent on making her a flesh and blood member of the family.', 'The night before their high school graduation, Jessie and her friends are guided by a ''Find My iPhone'' app to recover her lost device from a house whose demented tenants are hell bent on making her a flesh and blood member of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uIuw63NgUwXQKVtshIwLQP1sX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421848'),
  ('955685259328754141', 'Recreation', 1956, 'Animation', 'Robert Breer', 'Noël Burch', null, null, 'Featuring a commentary by Noël Burch (in nonsense French), Recreation''s rapid-fire montage of single-frame images of incredible density and intensity has been compared to contemporary Beat poetry.', 'Featuring a commentary by Noël Burch (in nonsense French), Recreation''s rapid-fire montage of single-frame images of incredible density and intensity has been compared to contemporary Beat poetry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejzmgvIwomyO0O3PIAFAQrvdzyy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209744'),
  ('216313490766563064', 'Récréation à la Martinière', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Auguste Lumière, Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'Students in Lyon.', 'Students in Lyon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AmhA7865VtrZDmnNPvU2kXJThW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212185'),
  ('664008217892660668', 'Récréations', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Claire Simon, Claire Simon', null, null, null, 'As French kindergarteners pour forth for recess, play takes on epic proportions. In every corner, some miniature drama is unfolding. Violence, love, jealousy, treachery are all here! This is human society in the making.', 'As French kindergarteners pour forth for recess, play takes on epic proportions. In every corner, some miniature drama is unfolding. Violence, love, jealousy, treachery are all here! This is human society in the making.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqnm3jYhkG1rZ0Wsaqrf8rPh4TB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383867'),
  ('864757588249410232', 'Recruited', 2026, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Andrey Panteleev', 'Andrey Panteleev, Yuliya Lemark', 'Aleksandr Metelkin, Ivan Okhlobystin, Anastasiya Chernikova', null, 'Andrey Romanov finds himself at the epicenter of a clash between Russian and Western intelligence services. Together with his team of top Russian special agents, he is recruited by GRU officer Maksim Kolosov for a special mission into enemy territory. The group''s goal is to find out what is happening in a secret laboratory near the border of the country, where work is underway on a new biological weapon. Andrey also has a personal goal - revenge. The enemy''s team is led by his father''s killer. Andrey''s group is completely secret; almost no one knows about its true purpose. Everything does not go according to plan when it becomes clear that there is a "mole" among them. And suspicion falls on Andrey himself. Kolosov will have to make the most difficult decision in his life: trust intelligence data and destroy the agent, or, in spite of everything, in memory of his friendship with Andrey''s father, give the guy a chance to complete the task. The lives of millions of people depend on this decision.', 'Andrey Romanov finds himself at the epicenter of a clash between Russian and Western intelligence services. Together with his team of top Russian special agents, he is recruited by GRU officer Maksim Kolosov for a special mission into enemy territory. The group''s goal is to find out what is happening in a secret laboratory near the border of the country, where work is underway on a new biological weapon. Andrey also has a personal goal - revenge. The enemy''s team is led by his father''s killer. Andrey''s group is completely secret; almost no one knows about its true purpose. Everything does not go according to plan when it becomes clear that there is a "mole" among them. And suspicion falls on Andrey himself. Kolosov will have to make the most difficult decision in his life: trust intelligence data and destroy the agent, or, in spite of everything, in memory of his friendship with Andrey''s father, give the guy a chance to complete the task. The lives of millions of people depend on this decision.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2For81MYTaO2KIwT7lB6XroSfYm1u.jpg', 'plex:movie:zaverbovannyy'),
  ('433724467172873889', 'Recurrence', 2022, 'Crime', 'Alejandro Montiel', 'Mili Roque Pitt, Alejandro Montiel, Florencia Etcheves', 'Luisana Lopilato, Mauricio Paniagua, Inés Estévez, Ariel Staltari, Paulina García, Malena Narvay, Aquiles Casabella, Benjamín Del Cerro', null, 'Years after moving to a remote town, ex-cop Pipa is pulled back into the dark world she thought she''d left behind when a corpse appears on her property.', 'Years after moving to a remote town, ex-cop Pipa is pulled back into the dark world she thought she''d left behind when a corpse appears on her property.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Rgp0TpqtdJf3DoVJWeGiESSTH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798223'),
  ('1003232295649941800', 'Red', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Chris Gore', null, 'Lawrence Tierney, Scott Spiegel', null, 'Based on the true story of Louis "Red" Deutsch. A New Jersey bar-owner is plagued with prank phone calls that prompt him to flip into psychotic, profanity-laden rages.', 'Based on the true story of Louis "Red" Deutsch. A New Jersey bar-owner is plagued with prank phone calls that prompt him to flip into psychotic, profanity-laden rages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvTlzYHT5ZLI3n6Ksb7HzOC1ikh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147696'),
  ('941250749445485945', 'Red', 2003, 'Drama', 'Flávio Frederico', 'Flávio Frederico', null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 'tmdb:movie:988355'),
  ('720357019306822373', 'Red', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lucky McKee, Trygve Allister Diesen, Harald Gunnar Paalgard', 'Jack Ketchum', 'Brian Cox, Noel Fisher, Kyle Gallner, Shiloh Fernandez, Kim Dickens, Marcia Bennett, Richard Riehle, Tom Sizemore', 'R', 'Avery, a reclusive older man, has a best friend in his dog, Red. When three teens kill Red without reason, Avery sets out for justice and redemption, attempting to follow the letter of the law. But when the law fails him, and the boys'' father clearly defines right and wrong in his own way, Avery must avenge himself by any means possible.', 'Avery, a reclusive older man, has a best friend in his dog, Red. When three teens kill Red without reason, Avery sets out for justice and redemption, attempting to follow the letter of the law. But when the law fails him, and the boys'' father clearly defines right and wrong in his own way, Avery must avenge himself by any means possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCDOdRVL4SQcUJWA9SAOpTeggIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13200'),
  ('507410382902910419', 'Red', 2020, 'Drama', 'Scott Sullivan', 'Scott Sullivan', 'Alexia Ioannides, Jade Harlow, Parker Queenan, Jance Enslin, Noelle Cope', null, 'Red is the story of three teens in rural Pennsylvania who are torn apart by the closet. James and Lizzy''s seemingly normal relationship is shattered by Aaron, the guy James hooked up with and who is unable to bear their secret and confronts James.', 'Red is the story of three teens in rural Pennsylvania who are torn apart by the closet. James and Lizzy''s seemingly normal relationship is shattered by Aaron, the guy James hooked up with and who is unable to bear their secret and confronts James.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGwtC6LtOXnmRVNdAtLbSHqYfy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:699014'),
  ('707185199021299965', 'Red', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kishore Tirumala, Sameer Reddy', 'Kishore Tirumala', 'Ram Pothineni, Nivetha Pethuraj, Malavika Sharma, Amritha Aiyer, Sampath Raj, Vennela Kishore, Nassar, Posani Krishna Murali', null, 'When civil engineer Siddharth is arrested for a murder on the basis of a pictorial evidence, cops discover his lookalike Aditya and realize they have only 48 hours to solve the case.', 'When civil engineer Siddharth is arrested for a murder on the basis of a pictorial evidence, cops discover his lookalike Aditya and realize they have only 48 hours to solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cEEDAHhMGtoWfYXJxelVMRwLu0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681435'),
