  ('695516367419530470', 'Red', 2023, 'Drama', 'Mia Evans, Xana Sterling, Analy Rangel-Chavez', null, 'Isabel Hoyt, Kees Nachbahr, Kai Symons, Adam Schuh, James Lammers', null, 'An ambitious young woman starts her first day on the job in a sales position and realizes it''s not what she bargained for, when everyone starts questioning her ability to fit into her new role.', 'An ambitious young woman starts her first day on the job in a sales position and realizes it''s not what she bargained for, when everyone starts questioning her ability to fit into her new role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sz3VMvAoGkmGI9z9ME3FnjCrVFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1101547'),
  ('474482680551117132', 'RED', null, null, 'Alexandre Charleux, Victoria Bruneel', 'Alexandre Charleux, Victoria Bruneel', null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pkRM9wLjeedUEo84z87TfERknK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860964'),
  ('415684508754712408', 'RED', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Schwentke, Florian Ballhaus, Andrew M. Robinson', 'Jon Hoeber, Erich Hoeber', 'Bruce Willis, John Malkovich, Morgan Freeman, Helen Mirren, Mary-Louise Parker, Karl Urban, Richard Dreyfuss, Brian Cox', 'PG-13', 'After surviving an assault from a squad of hit men, retired CIA black ops agent Frank Moses reassembles his old team for an all-out war. Frank reunites with old Joe, crazy Marvin and wily Victoria to uncover a massive conspiracy that threatens their lives. Only their expert training will allow them to survive a near-impossible mission -- breaking into CIA headquarters.', 'After surviving an assault from a squad of hit men, retired CIA black ops agent Frank Moses reassembles his old team for an all-out war. Frank reunites with old Joe, crazy Marvin and wily Victoria to uncover a massive conspiracy that threatens their lives. Only their expert training will allow them to survive a near-impossible mission -- breaking into CIA headquarters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eeK3OB5PeSRQD7BpZcGZKkehG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39514'),
  ('280453646031612605', 'RED 2', 2013, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Dean Parisot, Enrique Chediak, Dominic Masters', 'Jon Hoeber, Erich Hoeber', 'Bruce Willis, John Malkovich, Mary-Louise Parker, Dan Jeannotte, Anthony Hopkins, Helen Mirren, Catherine Zeta-Jones, Lee Byung-hun', 'PG-13', 'Retired C.I.A. agent Frank Moses reunites his unlikely team of elite operatives for a global quest to track down a missing portable nuclear device.', 'Retired C.I.A. agent Frank Moses reunites his unlikely team of elite operatives for a global quest to track down a missing portable nuclear device.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbksijr6g340yFWRgI4JfwrtM9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146216'),
  ('942244422523129627', 'Red Amnesia', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Wang Xiaoshuai, Wu Di', 'Wang Xiaoshuai, Li Fei, Fang Lei', 'Lü Zhong, Feng Yuanzheng, Qin Hailu, Qin Hao, Huang Suying, Shi Liu, Zhang Songwen, Cao Weiyu', null, 'A retired widow has her daily routine derailed when she starts receiving mysterious, anonymous phone calls.', 'A retired widow has her daily routine derailed when she starts receiving mysterious, anonymous phone calls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2qCaThbIDQgJMjdbLQnm5xAeW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283711'),
  ('185515168561536316', 'Red and Black', 1942, 'Drama, War', 'Carlos Arévalo, Alfredo Fraile, Andrés Pérez Cubero', 'Carlos Arévalo', 'Conchita Montenegro, Ismael Merlo, Quique Camoiras, Luisa España, Ana de Siria, Emilio G. Ruiz, José Sepúlveda, Rafaela Satorrés', null, 'Since childhood, Luisa and Miguel have always been good friends; but several years later, as adults, when Spain faces the abyss of the Civil War (1936-1939), they support ideologically opposed camps.', 'Since childhood, Luisa and Miguel have always been good friends; but several years later, as adults, when Spain faces the abyss of the Civil War (1936-1939), they support ideologically opposed camps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gatT98t3gZCcy3riLao3UwgxZJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183237'),
  ('87210391981090679', 'Red Angel', 1966, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Setsuo Kobayashi, Shû Sakiyama', 'Ryōzō Kasahara', 'Ayako Wakao, Shinsuke Ashida, Yūsuke Kawazu, Ranko Akagi, Jōtarō Senba, Daihachi Kita, Jun Osanai, Daigo Inoue', null, 'In 1939, Sakura Nishi is a young army nurse who is sent to the field hospitals in China during the Sino-Japanese war. She has to assist the surgeon Dr. Okabe with an incredible number of amputations. In the crowded wards, she gives sympathy to some of the soldiers, including sexually servicing one who has lost both arms and has no hope of returning home. She falls in love with Dr. Okabe, and follows him to the front, even though he is impotent from his morphine addiction.', 'In 1939, Sakura Nishi is a young army nurse who is sent to the field hospitals in China during the Sino-Japanese war. She has to assist the surgeon Dr. Okabe with an incredible number of amputations. In the crowded wards, she gives sympathy to some of the soldiers, including sexually servicing one who has lost both arms and has no hope of returning home. She falls in love with Dr. Okabe, and follows him to the front, even though he is impotent from his morphine addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ci0WIBCFoIrtN3q1alk8KUW52n2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90560'),
  ('821000309760837428', 'Red Army', 2015, 'Documentary, History', 'Gabe Polsky, Svetlana Cvetko, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Gabe Polsky', 'Viacheslav Fetisov, Vladimir Pozner, Vladimir Krutov, Alex Kasatonov, Vladislav Tretiak, Felix Nechepore, Tatiana Tarasova, Scotty Bowman', 'PG', 'A documentary highlighting the Soviet Union''s legendary and enigmatic hockey training culture and world-dominating team through the eyes of the team''s Captain Slava Fetisov, following his shift from hockey star and celebrated national hero to political enemy.', 'A documentary highlighting the Soviet Union''s legendary and enigmatic hockey training culture and world-dominating team through the eyes of the team''s Captain Slava Fetisov, following his shift from hockey star and celebrated national hero to political enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2e6I7A8AgNTfB1MeNZfhh9Q4ES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256876'),
  ('839271529689414365', 'Red Army/PFLP: Declaration of World War', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Masao Adachi, Kōji Wakamatsu', 'Masao Adachi', 'Rokihiro Toga, Aoi Nakajima, Susumu Iwabuchi, Masao Matsuda, Masao Adachi, Fusako Shigenobu, Leila Khaled, Ghassan Kanafani', null, 'On their way back from the Cannes Film Festival in 1971, filmmakers Wakamatsu Koji and Adachi Masao visited Lebanon to meet Japan''s Red Army faction and the Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine to shoot a newsreel film promoting the Palestinian resistance. Conceived as a ‘declaration of world war’ that implicates us all, the directors capture the everyday banality of military training and preparation exercises for imminent battle.', 'On their way back from the Cannes Film Festival in 1971, filmmakers Wakamatsu Koji and Adachi Masao visited Lebanon to meet Japan''s Red Army faction and the Popular Front for the Liberation of Palestine to shoot a newsreel film promoting the Palestinian resistance. Conceived as a ‘declaration of world war’ that implicates us all, the directors capture the everyday banality of military training and preparation exercises for imminent battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYO59YajzKqThHg1HLajAvFSsIq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191543'),
  ('330778470215176293', 'Red Bells Part I: Mexico in Flames', 1982, 'Drama, Western', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Vadim Yusov, Igor Petrov', 'Valentin Ezhov, Sergey Bondarchuk, Ricardo Garibay', 'Franco Nero, Ursula Andress, Jorge Luke, Blanca Guerra, Heraclio Zepeda, Jorge Reynoso, Roberto Ruy, Trinidad Esclava', null, 'American journalist John Reed travels to Mexico during the Mexican Revolution and interviews Francisco Villa. At the same time, we learn about his relationship with his lover Mabel Dodge, his participation in the Patterson strike, and his work as a reporter during World War I.', 'American journalist John Reed travels to Mexico during the Mexican Revolution and interviews Francisco Villa. At the same time, we learn about his relationship with his lover Mabel Dodge, his participation in the Patterson strike, and his work as a reporter during World War I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xA3wOiwXILTvFNFhZerFsRneDtD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206648'),
  ('1112465439072296221', 'Red Bells Part II: I Saw the Birth of a New World', 1982, 'Drama, History, Western', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Vadim Yusov', 'Antonio Saguera, Sergey Bondarchuk', 'Franco Nero, Anatoly Ustyzhaninov, Sydne Rome, Bohdan Stupka, Valeriy Barinov, Irina Skobtseva, Olegar Fedoro, Boris Belyakov', null, 'The second part of Soviet filmmaker Sergei Bondarchuk''s epic biography of John Reed. It is October 1917 and the American journalist has found himself and his wife, Louise Bryant, in Petrograd on the eve of the Bolshevik revolution.', 'The second part of Soviet filmmaker Sergei Bondarchuk''s epic biography of John Reed. It is October 1917 and the American journalist has found himself and his wife, Louise Bryant, in Petrograd on the eve of the Bolshevik revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vnnNMPTpdM6INRxUKksX8ZwaGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196803'),
  ('703626361080105711', 'Red Blooded American Girl', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David Blyth, Ludek Bogner, John Bradshaw', 'Allan Moyle', 'Andrew Stevens, Heather Thomas, Christopher Plummer, Kim Coates, Lydie Denier, Andrew Jackson, Anne Hatcheson, Lionel Williams', 'R', 'A young woman is transformed into a vampire by a virus. The vampire doctor who''s treating her hires a young scientist to find a cure. He and the girl fall for each other hard, but she, mad from hunger, escapes to wreak havoc on the city', 'A young woman is transformed into a vampire by a virus. The vampire doctor who''s treating her hires a young scientist to find a cure. He and the girl fall for each other hard, but she, mad from hunger, escapes to wreak havoc on the city', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7H7huxExncyYq0A3G8Ese7U7pnR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68117'),
  ('46025625800466548', 'Red Bracelets: The Beginning', 2019, 'Drama', 'Felix Binder', null, 'Tim Oliver Schultz, Luise Befort, Timur Bartels, Robert Schupp, Rouven Israel, Jörn Hentschel, Katinka Auberger, Dominik Buch', null, 'In this prequel to the TV series, the individual fates of the members of the later "Red Bracelets" and how they came together are told.', 'In this prequel to the TV series, the individual fates of the members of the later "Red Bracelets" and how they came together are told.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6nZCbeTPrTekE8HSFZUsfXtTnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573568'),
  ('1093513466158056951', 'Red Carpet', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Luiz Alberto Pereira, Uli Burtin', 'Luiz Alberto Pereira, Rosa Nepomuceno', 'Matheus Nachtergaele, Gorete Milagres, Vinícius Miranda, Fernanda Ventura, Manoel Messias, Rosi Campos, Aílton Graça, Martha Meola', null, 'Quinzinho has a promise to keep: to take his son, Neco, to the city to watch a Mazzaropi movie. They live in a small farm in São Paulo. In this odyssey through the towns of São Paulo, he also takes his wife Zulmira, who goes unwillingly, and their donkey Policarpo. On their journey, they find regional peculiarities and undergo magical situations related to popular belief.', 'Quinzinho has a promise to keep: to take his son, Neco, to the city to watch a Mazzaropi movie. They live in a small farm in São Paulo. In this odyssey through the towns of São Paulo, he also takes his wife Zulmira, who goes unwillingly, and their donkey Policarpo. On their journey, they find regional peculiarities and undergo magical situations related to popular belief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlUeXfZcR6zXGhJZ58vkw673Z1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24510'),
