  ('777460139799192370', 'Red Dust', 1990, 'War, Romance', 'Yim Ho, Poon Hang-Sang', 'Yim Ho, Sanmao', 'Brigitte Lin, Ronald Chin Han, Maggie Cheung, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Josephine Koo Mei-Wah, Yim Ho, Li Xiaoli, Zhang Guowen', null, 'Stretching across the canvas of the Sino-Japanese War of the 30s, the subsequent Japanese surrender in 1945, and the onslaught of Communism, this film depicts an ill-fated romance between a talented lady novelist and a Chinese traitor working with the Japanese who fall victim to the mayhem of war and their tragic inability to reconcile political differences.', 'Stretching across the canvas of the Sino-Japanese War of the 30s, the subsequent Japanese surrender in 1945, and the onslaught of Communism, this film depicts an ill-fated romance between a talented lady novelist and a Chinese traitor working with the Japanese who fall victim to the mayhem of war and their tragic inability to reconcile political differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edNbYZ603ULrrRcjGqcOm4ZOftC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156201'),
  ('40904856211066390', 'Red Dust', 2004, 'Drama', 'Tom Hooper, Larry Smith', 'Troy Kennedy Martin', 'Chiwetel Ejiofor, Hilary Swank, Jamie Bartlett, Ian Roberts, Marius Weyers, Nomhlé Nkyonyeni, Greg Latter, Elize Cawood', null, 'Sarah Barcant, a lawyer in New York City who grew up in South Africa, returns to her childhood dwelling place to intercede for Alex Mpondo, a Black South African politician who was tortured during apartheid.', 'Sarah Barcant, a lawyer in New York City who grew up in South Africa, returns to her childhood dwelling place to intercede for Alex Mpondo, a Black South African politician who was tortured during apartheid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2MmLzkWv3Wx3phsMQqFgyB3plJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13542'),
  ('1123634371168382334', 'Red Dwarf: The Promised Land', 2020, 'Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Linda Glover, Doug Naylor, Ian Adrian', 'Doug Naylor', 'Chris Barrie, Craig Charles, Danny John-Jules, Robert Llewellyn, Norman Lovett, Ray Fearon, Tom Bennett, Mandeep Dhillon', 'NR', 'The posse meet three cat clerics who worship Lister as their God. Lister vows to help them as they''re being hunted by Rodon, the ruthless feral cat leader who has vowed to wipe out all cats who worship anyone but him.', 'The posse meet three cat clerics who worship Lister as their God. Lister vows to help them as they''re being hunted by Rodon, the ruthless feral cat leader who has vowed to wipe out all cats who worship anyone but him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kHfpn1MYQrB5MUbSoFP8eHbyJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664806'),
  ('727789459536442061', 'Red Eagle: The Movie', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History', 'José Ramón Ayerra', 'Juan María Ruiz Córdoba, Pilar Nadal, Guillermo Cisneros', 'David Janer, Javier Gutiérrez, Francis Lorenzo, Inma Cuesta, Miryam Gallego, Roberto Álamo, Pepa Aniorte, Xabier Elorriaga', null, 'Early XVII century. A summit between France, England, Portugal and the Pope is to take place in Spain, home of the masked hero known as Red Eagle. The countries are coming together under the guise of looking for a solution to the conflict between Spain and Portugal; however, the ulterior motive is to attack the Kingdom of Spain. The Marchioness of Santillana and her fellow conspirators have hired an assassin to finish off the Red Eagle to guarantee the outcome of their plot. The townspeople and the whole kingdom will be at the mercy of the traitors, but the Red Eagle will be there to help them.', 'Early XVII century. A summit between France, England, Portugal and the Pope is to take place in Spain, home of the masked hero known as Red Eagle. The countries are coming together under the guise of looking for a solution to the conflict between Spain and Portugal; however, the ulterior motive is to attack the Kingdom of Spain. The Marchioness of Santillana and her fellow conspirators have hired an assassin to finish off the Red Eagle to guarantee the outcome of their plot. The townspeople and the whole kingdom will be at the mercy of the traitors, but the Red Eagle will be there to help them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0gFv2xIwjwuY1y2lLpQ4N5yVan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76201'),
  ('309144791602066984', 'Red Eye', 2005, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Wes Craven, Robert D. Yeoman, Richard Fojo', 'Carl Ellsworth', 'Rachel McAdams, Cillian Murphy, Brian Cox, Jayma Mays, Jack Scalia, Robert Pine, Terry Press, Brittany Oaks', 'PG-13', 'An overnight flight to Miami quickly becomes a battle for survival when Lisa realizes her seatmate plans to use her as part of a chilling assassination plot against the Deputy Secretary of Homeland Security. If she refuses to cooperate, her own father will be killed. As the miles tick by, she''s in a race against time to find a way to warn the potential victims before it''s too late.', 'An overnight flight to Miami quickly becomes a battle for survival when Lisa realizes her seatmate plans to use her as part of a chilling assassination plot against the Deputy Secretary of Homeland Security. If she refuses to cooperate, her own father will be killed. As the miles tick by, she''s in a race against time to find a way to warn the potential victims before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j33szyBdJjrmnItyUgPBsqaBECE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11460'),
  ('836089292496064012', 'Red Faction: Origins', 2011, 'Science Fiction', 'Michael Nankin, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Andrew Kreisberg', 'Tamzin Merchant, Danielle Nicolet, Brian J. Smith, Kate Vernon, Devon Graye, Robert Patrick, Sarah Brown, Ana Mulvoy-Ten', null, 'In the year 2125, Alec Mason led the Martian Colonies to freedom in the hit action game Red Faction: Guerrilla. Now, Syfy and THQ are teaming up to continue the saga of conflict on Mars 25 years later in an all-new Original Movie, Red Faction: Origins. Stargate Universe''s Brian J. Smith stars as Jake Mason, son of revolutionary hero Alec Mason (Terminator 2''s Robert Patrick) and a Red Faction ranger. Fighting to preserve Martian freedom, Jake encounters a powerful new enemy in a dangerous and mysterious group led by the charismatic Adam Hale (Torchwood''s Gareth David-Lloyd) and holding secrets that will rock the Mason clan. Jake must now battle the relentless regime and somehow reunite a family torn apart by war. Red Faction: Origins also stars Battlestar Galactica''s Kate Vernon and The Tudors'' Tamzin Merchant, and will feature music from Bear McCreary (Battlestar Galactica).', 'In the year 2125, Alec Mason led the Martian Colonies to freedom in the hit action game Red Faction: Guerrilla. Now, Syfy and THQ are teaming up to continue the saga of conflict on Mars 25 years later in an all-new Original Movie, Red Faction: Origins. Stargate Universe''s Brian J. Smith stars as Jake Mason, son of revolutionary hero Alec Mason (Terminator 2''s Robert Patrick) and a Red Faction ranger. Fighting to preserve Martian freedom, Jake encounters a powerful new enemy in a dangerous and mysterious group led by the charismatic Adam Hale (Torchwood''s Gareth David-Lloyd) and holding secrets that will rock the Mason clan. Jake must now battle the relentless regime and somehow reunite a family torn apart by war. Red Faction: Origins also stars Battlestar Galactica''s Kate Vernon and The Tudors'' Tamzin Merchant, and will feature music from Bear McCreary (Battlestar Galactica).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r16e0nXP2DmCZxH7WGeXbeSsudR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65945'),
  ('1060668925243464505', 'Red Family', 2013, 'Drama', 'Lee Ju-hyoung, Park Ji-sung', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Yu-mi, Son Byung-ho, Jung Woo, Park So-young, Oh Jae-moo, Park Byung-eun, Kang Eun-jin, Kim Hee-chang', null, 'A growing friendship with their neighbors softens the resolve of a group of North Korean spies who are posing as an ordinary South Korean family.', 'A growing friendship with their neighbors softens the resolve of a group of North Korean spies who are posing as an ordinary South Korean family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8JHYSEDo4zpfBjjISdkhbkMNDaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241885'),
  ('694112352014032759', 'Red Finger', 2011, 'Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Nobuhiro Doi', 'Takeharu Sakurai, Keisuke Makino', 'Hiroshi Abe, Meisa Kuroki, Junpei Mizobata, Naomi Nishida, Sumie Sasaki, Tetta Sugimoto, Yasuko Tomita, Tsutomu Yamazaki', null, 'A 7 years girl is found dead in the local park’s toilet. Kaga Kyouichiro, who was asked to find the girl, and his cousin Matsumiya Shuhei who’s assigned to investigate the murder case, have to work together to crack the case. Their evidence lead them to Maehara’s, a family with parents, a son and a senile grandmother.', 'A 7 years girl is found dead in the local park’s toilet. Kaga Kyouichiro, who was asked to find the girl, and his cousin Matsumiya Shuhei who’s assigned to investigate the murder case, have to work together to crack the case. Their evidence lead them to Maehara’s, a family with parents, a son and a senile grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLfq1h4WVijlQW0pPkS2nlPx6iy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154260'),
  ('520366650207900378', 'Red Firecracker, Green Firecracker', 1994, 'Drama', 'He Ping, Lun Yang', 'Daying Ye', 'Ning Jing, Wu Gang', null, 'A woman inherits her father''s fireworks factory, as he had no son. The business does well and everything works in an orderly fashion until one day, an itinerant painter is hired to decorate the doors and vases at the factory. The woman, forbidden to marry and thereby involve outsiders in the factory ownership, finds herself drawn to the headstrong painter. When they fall in love, the situation throws her entire life into disarray', 'A woman inherits her father''s fireworks factory, as he had no son. The business does well and everything works in an orderly fashion until one day, an itinerant painter is hired to decorate the doors and vases at the factory. The woman, forbidden to marry and thereby involve outsiders in the factory ownership, finds herself drawn to the headstrong painter. When they fall in love, the situation throws her entire life into disarray', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmW9WnTTBib4XTiLOYtLOlxvh5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159185'),
  ('898953973595851714', 'Red Fish', 1955, 'Drama, Thriller', 'José Antonio Nieves Conde, Francisco Sempere, José Algueró', 'Carlos Blanco', 'Arturo de Córdova, Emma Penella, Félix Dafauce, Pilar Soler, Félix Acaso, Manuel de Juan, María de las Rivas, Montserrat Blanch', null, 'Ivón, a chorus girl, Hugo, a failed writer, and Carlos, Hugo''s young son, arrive at a seaside hotel on a stormy night.', 'Ivón, a chorus girl, Hugo, a failed writer, and Carlos, Hugo''s young son, arrive at a seaside hotel on a stormy night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7bzWpmDnpo8cFVAPv7KHlXiejO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114745'),
  ('323057960482316003', 'Red Garters', 1954, 'Western, Music', 'George Marshall', 'Michael Fessier', 'Rosemary Clooney, Jack Carson, Guy Mitchell, Pat Crowley, Gene Barry, Cass Daley, Frank Faylen, Reginald Owen', null, 'A spirited cast kicks up its heels in a lively musical spoof of cowboy films crammed with spur-jangling tunes by Jay Livingstone and Ray Evans and decked out with colorfully stylized, Oscar.-nominated sets. Rosemary Clooney heads up the high-kicking, red-gartered girls of the Red Dog Saloon. They can-can. but she won''t-won''t unless Jason (Jack Carson) asks her to get hitched. Guy Mitchell and Gene Barry are gun-totin'' polecats who think they''ve got a feud to settle. And Frank Faylen and Buddy Ebsen are among the folks who hope the gunslingers get itchy fingered - so they can hold a town barbecue during the funeral!', 'A spirited cast kicks up its heels in a lively musical spoof of cowboy films crammed with spur-jangling tunes by Jay Livingstone and Ray Evans and decked out with colorfully stylized, Oscar.-nominated sets. Rosemary Clooney heads up the high-kicking, red-gartered girls of the Red Dog Saloon. They can-can. but she won''t-won''t unless Jason (Jack Carson) asks her to get hitched. Guy Mitchell and Gene Barry are gun-totin'' polecats who think they''ve got a feud to settle. And Frank Faylen and Buddy Ebsen are among the folks who hope the gunslingers get itchy fingered - so they can hold a town barbecue during the funeral!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXEcCewF9HIaGaSsnvHB2546mBu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156566'),
  ('558659256321254902', 'Red Ghost', 2021, 'War, Drama, History', 'Andrey Bogatyrev, Darya Solod, Timur Saitgaraev', 'Pavel Poluychik, Sergey Kraynev, Armen Vatyan', 'Aleksei Shevchenkov, Vladimir Gostyukhin, Yura Borisov, Polina Chernyshova, Wolfgang Cerny, Mikhail Gorevoy, Olga Stashkevich, Pavel Abramenkov', null, 'December 30, 1941. Vyazma (''Vyazemsky cauldron'') is a small detachment of Soviet soldiers, by fatal coincidence, in an unequal battle with a special unit of the Wehrmacht. However, none of them think about giving up. Each of them was ready to sacrifice his life in order to protect his native land. None of these brave people was born a hero. The myth of the red ghost is a heroic deed without a soldier''s Soviet soldier in the Great Patriotic War who instilled in the animals, deadly fear of German soldiers. In place of one of the dead hero was inserted another, and the born myth of the invincible Soviet soldier. The film ''Red Ghost'' is about the hope that each soldier will have.', 'December 30, 1941. Vyazma (''Vyazemsky cauldron'') is a small detachment of Soviet soldiers, by fatal coincidence, in an unequal battle with a special unit of the Wehrmacht. However, none of them think about giving up. Each of them was ready to sacrifice his life in order to protect his native land. None of these brave people was born a hero. The myth of the red ghost is a heroic deed without a soldier''s Soviet soldier in the Great Patriotic War who instilled in the animals, deadly fear of German soldiers. In place of one of the dead hero was inserted another, and the born myth of the invincible Soviet soldier. The film ''Red Ghost'' is about the hope that each soldier will have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OFF92pkqDgR5d5yp0JhdjXXwrc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575842'),
  ('910230591067966564', 'Red Haired Alibi', 1932, 'Drama, Crime', 'Christy Cabanne, Harry Forbes', 'Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'Merna Kennedy, Theodore von Eltz, Grant Withers, Purnell Pratt, Huntley Gordon, Fred Kelsey, Arthur Hoyt, Paul Porcasi', null, 'A young woman new to the big city gets a job as a man''s companion. What she doesn''t know is that the man is a notorious gangster.', 'A young woman new to the big city gets a job as a man''s companion. What she doesn''t know is that the man is a notorious gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgEvuXQZ08b6Qw2DfGMVQjJ5qnl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156447'),
  ('904893372178216341', 'Red Headed Stranger', 1986, 'Western', 'Neil Roach, William D. Wittliff, Tommy Thompson', 'William D. Wittliff', 'Willie Nelson, Morgan Fairchild, R.G. Armstrong, Royal Dano, Katharine Ross, Sonny Carl Davis, Ted J. Crum, Marinell Madden', null, 'Reverend Julian Shay (Willie Nelson) strode into the saloon, pulled out his six-shooter, and killed his adulterous wife (Morgan Fairchild) and the man she had left him for. It was the beginning of his violent transformation from God-Loving preacher to ruthless outlaw.', 'Reverend Julian Shay (Willie Nelson) strode into the saloon, pulled out his six-shooter, and killed his adulterous wife (Morgan Fairchild) and the man she had left him for. It was the beginning of his violent transformation from God-Loving preacher to ruthless outlaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WLUJi91mDriXUQ0cG6IiYWaIzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218480'),
  ('3755117694339255', 'Red Heat', 1985, 'Thriller', 'Robert Collector, Wolfgang Dickmann', 'Robert Collector', 'Linda Blair, Sylvia Kristel, Sue Kiel, William Ostrander, Elisabeth Volkmann, Albert Fortell, Herb Andress, Barbara Spitz', 'R', 'East Germans abduct a U.S. coed (Linda Blair) and throw her in a women''s prison run by a brutal inmate (Sylvia Kristel).', 'East Germans abduct a U.S. coed (Linda Blair) and throw her in a women''s prison run by a brutal inmate (Sylvia Kristel).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zhOo9K9boeingLb5EGzvKIhOWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73120'),
  ('1107416301992875520', 'Red Heat', 1988, 'Action, Crime', 'Matthew F. Leonetti, Walter Hill, James Dyer', 'Troy Kennedy Martin, Harry Kleiner, Walter Hill', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Jim Belushi, Peter Boyle, Ed O''Ross, Laurence Fishburne, Gina Gershon, Richard Bright, Brent Jennings', 'R', 'A tough Russian policeman is forced to partner up with a cocky Chicago police detective when he is sent to Chicago to apprehend a Georgian drug lord who killed his partner and fled the country.', 'A tough Russian policeman is forced to partner up with a cocky Chicago police detective when he is sent to Chicago to apprehend a Georgian drug lord who killed his partner and fled the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoJTHXmO01EZgT0p1YTsGBEQxLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9604'),
  ('922313875307587995', 'Red Hill', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Western', 'Patrick Hughes, Tim Hudson, Cameron Watt', 'Patrick Hughes', 'Ryan Kwanten, Steve Bisley, Tom E. Lewis, Claire van der Boom, Christopher Davis, Kevin Harrington, Richard Sutherland, Kenneth Radley', 'R', 'Young police officer Shane Cooper''s first day on duty, after relocating to the small town of Red Hill, rapidly turns into a nightmare. News of a prison break, involving convicted murderer Jimmy Conway, sends the local law enforcement officers - led by the town''s ruling presence, Old Bill - into a panic and leads to a terrifying and bloody confrontation.', 'Young police officer Shane Cooper''s first day on duty, after relocating to the small town of Red Hill, rapidly turns into a nightmare. News of a prison break, involving convicted murderer Jimmy Conway, sends the local law enforcement officers - led by the town''s ruling presence, Old Bill - into a panic and leads to a terrifying and bloody confrontation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLELMBUdDoqJvPDE7CcYn0Ny6y8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45569'),
  ('1097968896255723031', 'Red Hollywood', 1996, 'Documentary, History', 'Thom Andersen, Noël Burch', 'Thom Andersen, Noël Burch', 'Billy Woodberry, Eric Johnston, John Howard Lawson, Paul Jarrico, Ring Lardner, Jr., Alfred Lewis Levitt, Abraham Polonsky, Ayn Rand', null, 'A documentary that examines the films made by the victims of the Hollywood Blacklist and offers a radically different perspective on a key period in the history of American cinema.', 'A documentary that examines the films made by the victims of the Hollywood Blacklist and offers a radically different perspective on a key period in the history of American cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6j3a3n4g63Ikh9Oip2HJfhiS6B5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164144'),
  ('820779657790259737', 'Red Hot Mamma', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer, Willard Bowsky, Sammy Timberg', null, 'Bonnie Poe', null, 'Betty Boop, sleepless on a freezing night, builds a nice hot fire which proves too much of a good thing; in a dream she visits Hell, sings "Hell''s Bells," and makes Hell freeze over!', 'Betty Boop, sleepless on a freezing night, builds a nice hot fire which proves too much of a good thing; in a dream she visits Hell, sings "Hell''s Bells," and makes Hell freeze over!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcgGodd5C2OKKcLbUhQCNkuQCgy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174512'),
  ('628473635827316477', 'Red Hot Rangers', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', 'Heck Allen', 'Tex Avery, Dick Nelson', 'NR', 'Forest rangers George and Junior try to snuff out a frisky flame with a sparky personality that threatens to set the forest alight.', 'Forest rangers George and Junior try to snuff out a frisky flame with a sparky personality that threatens to set the forest alight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikRGHxMVS9BrvbF56mTVjOsoAD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86756'),
  ('141471110898724463', 'Red Hot Riding Hood', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', 'Rich Hogan', 'Sara Berner, Daws Butler, June Foray, Frank Graham, Kent Rogers, Connie Russell', null, 'Tired of always playing the same roles, Little Red Riding Hood, her grandmother and the Wolf demand a new version of the tale. The story then plays out in a more contemporary urban environment, with Little Red Riding Hood working as a pin-up girl in a night club.', 'Tired of always playing the same roles, Little Red Riding Hood, her grandmother and the Wolf demand a new version of the tale. The story then plays out in a more contemporary urban environment, with Little Red Riding Hood working as a pin-up girl in a night club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16s0F2Ao6xLS6BSJtvRNXObVJsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44468'),
  ('399430244752358375', 'Red Ink', 2000, 'Drama, Crime', 'Francisco J. Lombardi, Teo Delgado', 'Giovanna Pollarolo', 'Gianfranco Brero, Giovanni Ciccia, Fele Martínez, Lucía Jiménez, Carlos Gassols, Yvonne Frayssinet, Gustavo Bueno, Tatiana Astengo', null, 'Peru, early 2000s. Alfonso wants to be a writer, but he decides to work first as a journalist. He is assigned to the crime section of a newspaper, a job from which he can know the nasty guts of tabloid publications.', 'Peru, early 2000s. Alfonso wants to be a writer, but he decides to work first as a journalist. He is assigned to the crime section of a newspaper, a job from which he can know the nasty guts of tabloid publications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9Rj7WFV5kfjKVc0YfqgEyv8OSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20276'),
  ('166713171285860888', 'Red Island', 2023, 'Drama', 'Robin Campillo, Jeanne Lapoirie, Emmanuel Gomes de Araujo', 'Robin Campillo, Gilles Marchand', 'Charlie Vauselle, Quim Gutiérrez, Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Sophie Guillemin, Hugues Delamarliere, David Serero, Luna Carpiaux, Mathis Piberne', null, 'Madagascar, at the turn of the 1960s and 1970s. On an air base of the French army, the soldiers live the last carefree years of colonialism. Influenced by his readings of Fantômette, Thomas, a child who is not yet 10 years old, gradually forges a look at the world around him.', 'Madagascar, at the turn of the 1960s and 1970s. On an air base of the French army, the soldiers live the last carefree years of colonialism. Influenced by his readings of Fantômette, Thomas, a child who is not yet 10 years old, gradually forges a look at the world around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4zSFyn49a1JUS4itgHjsZ75Wlo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820707'),
  ('198819314130012562', 'Red Istanbul', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gian Filippo Corticelli, Ferzan Özpetek, Can Deniz Atıcı', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Gianni Romoli, Valia Santella', 'Halit Ergenç, Tuba Büyüküstün, Nejat İşler, Mehmet Günsür, Çiğdem Selişik Onat, Zerrin Tekindor, Serra Yılmaz, Reha Özcan', null, 'Orhan who lived in London for years and did not come back to Turkey agrees to help Deniz -a famous director- edit his first book. Deniz has been living in a mansion with his family which started to lose its old brightness and power. Orhan finds himself in the middle of Deniz''s complicated relationships, mysterious friends and stange family members. This is the first movie of Ferzan Ozpetek which is shot in Turkey after a long time. It is also based on his own book which has the same name with the movie.', 'Orhan who lived in London for years and did not come back to Turkey agrees to help Deniz -a famous director- edit his first book. Deniz has been living in a mansion with his family which started to lose its old brightness and power. Orhan finds himself in the middle of Deniz''s complicated relationships, mysterious friends and stange family members. This is the first movie of Ferzan Ozpetek which is shot in Turkey after a long time. It is also based on his own book which has the same name with the movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSzgyCPVJVVKtb7LhvRoEjnyaQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443486'),
  ('649201063332830799', 'Red Joan', 2018, 'Thriller, History', 'Charlie Meakin, Polly Stevens, Trevor Nunn', 'Lindsay Shapero', 'Judi Dench, Sophie Cookson, Tom Hughes, Tereza Srbova, Stephen Campbell Moore, Ben Miles, Nina Sosanya, Laurence Spellman', null, 'London, England, May 2000. The peaceful life of elderly Joan Stanley is suddenly disrupted when she is arrested by the British Intelligence Service and accused of providing information to communist Russia during the forties.', 'London, England, May 2000. The peaceful life of elderly Joan Stanley is suddenly disrupted when she is arrested by the British Intelligence Service and accused of providing information to communist Russia during the forties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTQWDi31W4RpxviHGyiwEYHXDDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494974'),
  ('271807855661316671', 'Red Kiss', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Véra Belmont, Ramón F. Suárez', 'Guy Konopnicki, Véra Belmont, David Milhaud', 'Charlotte Valandrey, Lambert Wilson, Marthe Keller, Laurent Terzieff, Günter Lamprecht, Laurent Arnal, Elsa Lunghini, Isabelle Nanty', null, '1952, Paris. Nadia, a Red Diaper baby, has a sister, Polish parents, and at 15 is an active Communist. When cops beat her during an anti-American demonstration, she''s rescued by a "Match" photographer. As the friendship becomes a love affair and her slogans are tested by new knowledge and emotion, some of the Red youth want to expel her. When she goes with Stéphane to a seaside photo shoot, her father goes to the police. Stéphane faces charges, so leaving to cover the war in Indochina looks appealing. In a parallel story, Nadia''s mother meets again her prewar lover, released from Siberia, who challenges the French Reds with very real scars and word of Stalin''s anti-Semitism.', '1952, Paris. Nadia, a Red Diaper baby, has a sister, Polish parents, and at 15 is an active Communist. When cops beat her during an anti-American demonstration, she''s rescued by a "Match" photographer. As the friendship becomes a love affair and her slogans are tested by new knowledge and emotion, some of the Red youth want to expel her. When she goes with Stéphane to a seaside photo shoot, her father goes to the police. Stéphane faces charges, so leaving to cover the war in Indochina looks appealing. In a parallel story, Nadia''s mother meets again her prewar lover, released from Siberia, who challenges the French Reds with very real scars and word of Stalin''s anti-Semitism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brluvhOPVp66TaAbC1bJ2yMLKUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192784'),
  ('899884976098743191', 'Red Label', 2026, null, 'K.R. Vinoth, K R Vinoth', 'Pon Parthiban', 'R. V. Udayakumar, Anu Mohan, Munishkanth, Asmin Yazar, Lenin', null, 'An ex-student leader returns to campus politics to confront a bully.', 'An ex-student leader returns to campus politics to confront a bully.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMzFhZTQxN2UtNGNhNC00YTNiLTljZDQtZGFmNjYyZjlkOGIyXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:red-label'),
  ('585419776132738050', 'Red Land', 2018, 'Drama, War, History, Crime', 'Giovanni Dentici, Massimiliano Battistella, Armando De Vincentis', 'Maximiliano Hernando Bruno, Maximiliano Hernando Bruno', 'Geraldine Chaplin, Franco Nero, Antonio Scarpa, Maximiliano Hernando Bruno, Sandra Ceccarelli, Francesca Amodio, Vincenzo Bocciarelli, Andrea Pergolesi', null, 'Italy, September 1943. After the armistice and the flight of the King, the war theaters of the North-East see the advance of Tito''s partisans. At the center of the story, in this dramatic historical context, the figure of Norma Cossetto, a young Istrian student, barbarously raped, killed and thrown into a foiba by the Tito partisans.', 'Italy, September 1943. After the armistice and the flight of the King, the war theaters of the North-East see the advance of Tito''s partisans. At the center of the story, in this dramatic historical context, the figure of Norma Cossetto, a young Istrian student, barbarously raped, killed and thrown into a foiba by the Tito partisans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7khrFsc3kpdv8wwrrYxVlP9mhkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561996'),
  ('1141049683914848389', 'Red Latex', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Gerard Marcó de Mas, Cristian Bidone', 'Gerard Marcó de Mas', 'Fedra Duarte, Nestor Napolitano, Valeria Rowinski', null, 'Eric lives with his pregnant wife in his in-laws'' house because they have no money to become independent. Eric is very docile and the people around him: his wife, his father, his father-in-law, and his boss have always told him what he has to do with his life. But everything has a limit. Fed of with this situation, Eric leaves his family and escapes to the mansion of the dominatrix Mistress Gise to become his slave. Eric hopes to achieve liberation by submitting to Mistress Gise. When his family finds out, they do what they can to get him back. Meanwhile, Mistress Gise is a twisted Domina who takes Eric''s slavery beyond any expected limit.', 'Eric lives with his pregnant wife in his in-laws'' house because they have no money to become independent. Eric is very docile and the people around him: his wife, his father, his father-in-law, and his boss have always told him what he has to do with his life. But everything has a limit. Fed of with this situation, Eric leaves his family and escapes to the mansion of the dominatrix Mistress Gise to become his slave. Eric hopes to achieve liberation by submitting to Mistress Gise. When his family finds out, they do what they can to get him back. Meanwhile, Mistress Gise is a twisted Domina who takes Eric''s slavery beyond any expected limit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hP1o5waM6ohMTKr4QcOtyOP1oiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758308'),
  ('760521510040468912', 'Red Light', 1949, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Bert Glennon, Roy Del Ruth, Robert Aldrich', 'George Callahan', 'George Raft, Virginia Mayo, Gene Lockhart, Raymond Burr, Harry Morgan, Barton MacLane, Arthur Franz, Ken Murray', 'NR', 'Nick Cherney, in prison for embezzling from Torno Freight Co., sees a chance to get back at Johnny Torno through his young priest brother Jess. He pays fellow prisoner Rocky, who gets out a week before Nick, to murder Jess... who, dying, tells revenge-minded Johnny that he''d written a clue "in the Bible." Frustrated, Johnny obsessively searches for the missing Gideon Bible from Jess''s hotel room.', 'Nick Cherney, in prison for embezzling from Torno Freight Co., sees a chance to get back at Johnny Torno through his young priest brother Jess. He pays fellow prisoner Rocky, who gets out a week before Nick, to murder Jess... who, dying, tells revenge-minded Johnny that he''d written a clue "in the Bible." Frustrated, Johnny obsessively searches for the missing Gideon Bible from Jess''s hotel room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Vs4kB5HD3dIVoPuVNvi9xr9ONI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25807'),
  ('1083214865544585130', 'Red Lights', 2004, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Cédric Kahn, Patrick Blossier', 'Laurence Ferreira Barbosa, Cédric Kahn, Gilles Marchand', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Carole Bouquet, Vincent Deniard, Alain Dion, Olivier Fornara, Damien Givelet, Philippe Ivancic, Candide Joseph', null, 'A cross-country trip turns out to be a nightmare for a troubled couple.', 'A cross-country trip turns out to be a nightmare for a troubled couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68FX0iIQVqtRotg4RqxTYTEZNN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25500'),
  ('379688068858762115', 'Red Lights', 2012, 'Thriller', 'Susana García Díez, Rodrigo Cortés, Xavi Giménez', 'Rodrigo Cortés', 'Cillian Murphy, Sigourney Weaver, Robert De Niro, Elizabeth Olsen, Toby Jones, Joely Richardson, Craig Roberts, Leonardo Sbaraglia', 'R', 'Two investigators of paranormal hoaxes, the veteran Dr. Margaret Matheson and her young assistant, Tom Buckley, study the most varied metaphysical phenomena with the aim of proving their fraudulent origins. Simon Silver, a legendary blind psychic, reappears after an enigmatic absence of 30 years to become the greatest international challenge to both orthodox science and professional sceptics. Tom starts to develop an intense obsession with Silver, whose magnetism becomes stronger with each new manifestation of inexplicable events. As Tom gets closer to Silver, tension mounts, and his worldview is threatened to its core.', 'Two investigators of paranormal hoaxes, the veteran Dr. Margaret Matheson and her young assistant, Tom Buckley, study the most varied metaphysical phenomena with the aim of proving their fraudulent origins. Simon Silver, a legendary blind psychic, reappears after an enigmatic absence of 30 years to become the greatest international challenge to both orthodox science and professional sceptics. Tom starts to develop an intense obsession with Silver, whose magnetism becomes stronger with each new manifestation of inexplicable events. As Tom gets closer to Silver, tension mounts, and his worldview is threatened to its core.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sukxYMaUTNizM7bcEJ4YeH80e8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75638'),
  ('9913954979751054', 'Red Like the Sky', 2006, 'Drama', 'Cristiano Bortone', 'Monica Zapelli, Cristiano Bortone, Paolo Sassanelli', 'Luca Capriotti , Paolo Sassanelli, Francesco Campobasso, Simone Colombari, Rosanna Gentili, Norman Mozzato, Patrizia La Fonte, Clotilde De Spirito', null, 'A nearly sightless boy is sent to a school for blind children, where he secretly discovers the possibilities of the recorded sound.', 'A nearly sightless boy is sent to a school for blind children, where he secretly discovers the possibilities of the recorded sound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wE6S0WLuH35yfPA1MvKH4NI78cq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57965'),
  ('350900746272088167', 'Red Line', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Robert Kirbyson', 'Tara Stone, Robert Kirbyson', 'John Billingsley, Nicole Gale Anderson, Kevin Sizemore, Joe Williamson, Mark Saul, Keena Ferguson, Renee Sly, Kym Jackson', 'R', 'Terrified commuters are on the ride of their lives when terrorists send a subway train speeding out of control during rush hour. With the saboteur among them, a group of citizens are now trapped underground and in a race against time if they hope to see daylight again. Full of fast-paced action and suspense, Redline is a thriller that will have you holding on for safety.', 'Terrified commuters are on the ride of their lives when terrorists send a subway train speeding out of control during rush hour. With the saboteur among them, a group of citizens are now trapped underground and in a race against time if they hope to see daylight again. Full of fast-paced action and suspense, Redline is a thriller that will have you holding on for safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQ8ghqM9MWGr1ct5W6SAzR3IQc3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206419'),
  ('69121875166147021', 'Red Line 7000', 1965, 'Action, Drama', 'Howard Hawks, Milton Krasner, Bruce Kessler', 'George Kirgo', 'James Caan, Laura Devon, Gail Hire, Charlene Holt, John Robert Crawford, Marianna Hill, Skip Ward, Norman Alden', 'NR', 'The lives and passions of a stock car team are revealed against the turbulent backdrop of the professional racing world.', 'The lives and passions of a stock car team are revealed against the turbulent backdrop of the professional racing world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lw3nxKQsRfPUMd6rE6Ch4h51e0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80046'),
  ('1109672556913470224', 'Red Lion', 1969, 'Comedy, Action', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Takao Saitō', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Sakae Hirosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Shima Iwashita, Etsushi Takahashi, Minori Terada, Nobuko Otowa, Yūko Mochizuki, Jitsuko Yoshimura, Kawai Okada', null, 'Japan, February 1868. As the Tokugawa shogunate declines and the power of Emperor Meiji grows, Gonzo, a soldier of the Restoration Army, returns to Sawando, his hometown, to announce the end of tyranny.', 'Japan, February 1868. As the Tokugawa shogunate declines and the power of Emperor Meiji grows, Gonzo, a soldier of the Restoration Army, returns to Sawando, his hometown, to announce the end of tyranny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aidJasVBQYiKAnuNKO1SGv0xWyS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106908'),
  ('712163602869692563', 'Red Lips', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Rafael Lara Ruiz', 'Rafael Lara Ruiz', 'Silvia Navarro, Jorge Salinas, Diana García, Anna Ciocchetti, Paloma Arredondo, Guillermo Iván, Antonio Marlano, Luis Romano', 'R', 'In Mexico City, Ricardo is a family man, pressed by responsibilities, when he finally lands a better job as creative director for an ad agency. But that''s when his problems really begin: his boss is a martinet, and suddenly Ricardo finds himself unable to perform in bed with his luscious wife, whose red lips have driven him wild to now. She''s dismayed that he''s seemingly lost interest; she seeks advice from friends and tries to spice things up with Ricardo. Meanwhile, at the office, he faces other temptations. Can Ricardo find a way to succeed at work and succeed at home?', 'In Mexico City, Ricardo is a family man, pressed by responsibilities, when he finally lands a better job as creative director for an ad agency. But that''s when his problems really begin: his boss is a martinet, and suddenly Ricardo finds himself unable to perform in bed with his luscious wife, whose red lips have driven him wild to now. She''s dismayed that he''s seemingly lost interest; she seeks advice from friends and tries to spice things up with Ricardo. Meanwhile, at the office, he faces other temptations. Can Ricardo find a way to succeed at work and succeed at home?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaKACzLMeuHTxKC94BK2sVN0Yqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86728'),
  ('387832791161899099', 'Red Meadows', 1945, 'War, Drama', 'Bodil Ipsen, Lau Lauritzen Jr.', null, 'Poul Reichhardt, Preben Kaas, Lisbeth Movin, Per Buckhøj, Lau Lauritzen Jr., Kjeld Jacobsen, Freddy Koch, Preben Neergaard', null, 'A suspense tale revolving around the memories of a Danish saboteur as he awaits his execution in a German war-time prison.', 'A suspense tale revolving around the memories of a Danish saboteur as he awaits his execution in a German war-time prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpO08S6GWb8zD6FexLp1MIddo7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99272'),
  ('867829590426821668', 'Red Mist', 2008, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Paddy Breathnach, Ruairí O''Brien', 'Spence Wright', 'Arielle Kebbel, Sarah Carter, Stephen Dillane, Andrew-Lee Potts, Alex Wyndham, Katie McGrath, Christina Chong, Martin Compston', 'NR', 'A young doctor in a US hospital administers a powerful and untested cocktail of drugs to a coma victim. But instead of curing him, it triggers a powerful "out-of-body" experience and enables the patient - a depraved and dangerous loner - to inhabit other people''s bodies and, through them, take revenge on the bullying medical students who were accidentally responsible for his condition.', 'A young doctor in a US hospital administers a powerful and untested cocktail of drugs to a coma victim. But instead of curing him, it triggers a powerful "out-of-body" experience and enables the patient - a depraved and dangerous loner - to inhabit other people''s bodies and, through them, take revenge on the bullying medical students who were accidentally responsible for his condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkXdFchk58WcGD8eVdVhzQ3LpiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15011'),
  ('1050615715891765730', 'Red Monarch', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Jack Gold, Mike Fash, Irene Lamb', 'Charles Wood', 'Colin Blakely, David Suchet, Carroll Baker, Ian Hogg, David Kelly, Jean Heywood, David Threlfall, Lee Montague', null, 'British comedy satirising Stalin''s inner circle as an absolute monarchs court. In the face of rampant abuse of power and poisonous distrust some still manage to keep faith with the Bolshevist creed until the very end. In front of the firing squad a stalwart bolshevist of the first hour exclaims: "Even in the best democracy errors are being made!"', 'British comedy satirising Stalin''s inner circle as an absolute monarchs court. In the face of rampant abuse of power and poisonous distrust some still manage to keep faith with the Bolshevist creed until the very end. In front of the firing squad a stalwart bolshevist of the first hour exclaims: "Even in the best democracy errors are being made!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klEQx0KobVVmi55jlqgAAxKzkJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88835'),
  ('904985132258168129', 'Red Moon Tide', 2020, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Lois Patiño, Lois Patiño, Adrián Orr', 'Lois Patiño', 'Pilar Rodlos, Ana Marra, Rubio de Camelle, Carmen Martínez', null, 'Time seems to stand still in a village in the Galician coast. Everybody there is paralyzed although we can still hear their voices: they talk about ghosts, about witches, about monsters. Three women arrive in the village to find Rubio, a sailor who has recently disappeared in the sea.', 'Time seems to stand still in a village in the Galician coast. Everybody there is paralyzed although we can still hear their voices: they talk about ghosts, about witches, about monsters. Three women arrive in the village to find Rubio, a sailor who has recently disappeared in the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Y05XqJ51yqJI9gZKA9bTbTOYLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665403'),
  ('908784472389107990', 'Red Mountain', 1951, 'Western', 'William Dieterle, Charles Lang, John Farrow', 'John Meredyth Lucas', 'Alan Ladd, Lizabeth Scott, Arthur Kennedy, John Ireland, Jeff Corey, James Bell, Bert Freed, Walter Sande', 'NR', 'Towards the end of the American Civil War, a rebel captain flees to Colorado to join a band of Southern mercenaries. He drags an innocent gold prospecting couple into trouble when the husband is accused of a murder he committed.', 'Towards the end of the American Civil War, a rebel captain flees to Colorado to join a band of Southern mercenaries. He drags an innocent gold prospecting couple into trouble when the husband is accused of a murder he committed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYdEVik2vDSIp4QsnQen2yo9vVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146856'),
  ('405973760005989396', 'Red Needles', 2006, 'Drama', 'Jean-François Davy, Beatrice Mizrahi', 'Gaia Guasti, Elisabeth Lajarige Diot, Jean-François Davy', 'Jules Sitruk, Damien Jouillerot, Jonathan Demurger, Pierre Derenne, Richard Berry, Patrick Bouchitey, Bernadette Lafont, Bernard Haller', null, 'September 1960: on a purely punitive basis, eight scouts must climb the solid mass of Brévent to 2500 meters of altitude. The so beautiful and so majestic mountain which draws up face them very quickly reveals dangerous. All the techniques of orientation learned at the scouts will do nothing there. The teenagers find themselves delivered to themselves. Lost in the abrupt throats, the eight boys are confronted cold, with the hunger and the fear.', 'September 1960: on a purely punitive basis, eight scouts must climb the solid mass of Brévent to 2500 meters of altitude. The so beautiful and so majestic mountain which draws up face them very quickly reveals dangerous. All the techniques of orientation learned at the scouts will do nothing there. The teenagers find themselves delivered to themselves. Lost in the abrupt throats, the eight boys are confronted cold, with the hunger and the fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vN9lQIdG1NzbkY3RyEbTC87uOih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49729'),
  ('629490840944632222', 'Red Nights', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Laurent Courtiaud, Julien Carbon, Yiu Man-Kei', 'Laurent Courtiaud, Julien Carbon', 'Frédérique Bel, Carole Brana, Carrie Ng Ka-Lai, Kotone Amamiya, Jack Kao, Maria Chen, Chi-Kui Fong, Leon Hill', null, 'A woman acquires a box with a seal made of white jade, it is rumored that the box belonged to the first Chinese emperor. She journeys to Hong Kong in an attempt to sell the artifact.', 'A woman acquires a box with a seal made of white jade, it is rumored that the box belonged to the first Chinese emperor. She journeys to Hong Kong in an attempt to sell the artifact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0dsBbHrsM934W0UpD90IWVKAXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71359'),
  ('346227257422906977', 'Red Nose', 2003, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Érik Canuel, Bernard Couture', 'Sylvie Desrosiers, Sylvie Pilon', 'Patrick Huard, Michèle-Barbara Pelletier, Pierre Lebeau, Christian Bégin, Dany Laferrière, Jean L''Italien, Martin-Guy Bélanger, Frédérick de Grandpré', null, 'During the Christmas holiday season, Félix and Céline find themselves working as volunteers for the drive-home service Opération Nez Rouge. Right from the first, Félix falls for Céline. But Céline doesn''t feel the same way: she can''t forget the fact that Félix once wrote a scathing review of her first piece of writing, crushing her literary ambitions in the process. Worse, Félix doesn''t even remember her name. Céline decides to take her revenge. Just as things seem to be going from bad to worse for Félix, Céline realizes that he is vulnerable, tender... and madly in love with her. She is ready to surrender to love... but a chance encounter causes her to wonder whether Félix isn''t playing some twisted love game.', 'During the Christmas holiday season, Félix and Céline find themselves working as volunteers for the drive-home service Opération Nez Rouge. Right from the first, Félix falls for Céline. But Céline doesn''t feel the same way: she can''t forget the fact that Félix once wrote a scathing review of her first piece of writing, crushing her literary ambitions in the process. Worse, Félix doesn''t even remember her name. Céline decides to take her revenge. Just as things seem to be going from bad to worse for Félix, Céline realizes that he is vulnerable, tender... and madly in love with her. She is ready to surrender to love... but a chance encounter causes her to wonder whether Félix isn''t playing some twisted love game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1GJiiYM1GUH37z4FKJwHqjz5vy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50041'),
  ('303949378949344067', 'Red Nose Day Actually', 2017, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Curtis, Mat Whitecross, Andrew Dunn', 'Richard Curtis', 'Hugh Grant, Liam Neeson, Colin Firth, Laura Linney, Andrew Lincoln, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Keira Knightley, Martine McCutcheon', 'PG', 'Fourteen years after the events of the first film, a series of encounters between people in Britain reminds us that in these different times Love, actually exists.', 'Fourteen years after the events of the first film, a series of encounters between people in Britain reminds us that in these different times Love, actually exists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m7gBvNIXFwvuZKXd0CdbX9vwj5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447061'),
  ('669667506171313991', 'Red Notice', 2021, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Riley Flanagan, Rory Bruen, Rawson Marshall Thurber', 'Rawson Marshall Thurber', 'Dwayne Johnson, Ryan Reynolds, Gal Gadot, Ritu Arya, Chris Diamantopoulos, Ivan Mbakop, Vincenzo Amato, Rafael Petardi', 'PG-13', 'An Interpol-issued Red Notice is a global alert to hunt and capture the world''s most wanted. But when a daring heist brings together the FBI''s top profiler and two rival criminals, there''s no telling what will happen.', 'An Interpol-issued Red Notice is a global alert to hunt and capture the world''s most wanted. But when a daring heist brings together the FBI''s top profiler and two rival criminals, there''s no telling what will happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAXONuqg41NwUMuzMiFvicDET9Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512195'),
  ('72808748710440111', 'Red One', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Riley Flanagan, Jake Kasdan, Dan Mindel', 'Chris Morgan', 'Dwayne Johnson, Chris Evans, Lucy Liu, J.K. Simmons, Bonnie Hunt, Kristofer Hivju, Kiernan Shipka, Mary Elizabeth Ellis', 'PG-13', 'After Santa Claus (codename: Red One) is kidnapped, the North Pole''s Head of Security must team up with the world''s most infamous tracker in a globe-trotting, action-packed mission to save Christmas.', 'After Santa Claus (codename: Red One) is kidnapped, the North Pole''s Head of Security must team up with the world''s most infamous tracker in a globe-trotting, action-packed mission to save Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdqLnri3NEGcmfnqwk2TSIYtddg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845781'),
  ('1092435997821703343', 'Red Peony Gambler', 1968, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Thriller, Romance', 'Kōsaku Yamashita, Tatsuo Honda', 'Norifumi Suzuki', 'Sumiko Fuji, Ken Takakura, Tomisaburō Wakayama, Kyōsuke Machida, Isamu Dobashi, Masako Araki, Junpei Arishima, Daisuke Awaji', null, 'Ryuko was raised by her father, a gambler named Senzo Yano in Kumamoto, Kyushu, after her mother died when she was little. When she turned 18 years old, her father was attacked and killed by a stranger in alley. Ryuko then dissolves her yakuza family, and, carrying the wallet left by the killer, she sets out on a journey to avenge her father’s death. Five years later, she wanders the nation, known only as! Red Peony Oryu who has a red peony tattooed on her shoulder and has the defiance and courage of a man. She meets Katagiri - a loner gambler, Kumatora - boss of a family in Shikoku, and Otaka - female boss of the Doman Family in Osaka. With their help, she finally catches up with the man who murdered her father.', 'Ryuko was raised by her father, a gambler named Senzo Yano in Kumamoto, Kyushu, after her mother died when she was little. When she turned 18 years old, her father was attacked and killed by a stranger in alley. Ryuko then dissolves her yakuza family, and, carrying the wallet left by the killer, she sets out on a journey to avenge her father’s death. Five years later, she wanders the nation, known only as! Red Peony Oryu who has a red peony tattooed on her shoulder and has the defiance and courage of a man. She meets Katagiri - a loner gambler, Kumatora - boss of a family in Shikoku, and Otaka - female boss of the Doman Family in Osaka. With their help, she finally catches up with the man who murdered her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2mqSMBcPHZStIC7NcO0US8iZdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50089'),
  ('513991353748609154', 'Red Peony Gambler: Oryu''s Return', 1970, 'Action, Drama', 'Tai Katō, Tatsuo Honda, Shigeru Akatsuka', 'Tai Katō, Norifumi Suzuki', 'Sumiko Fuji, Tōru Abe, Kanjūrō Arashi, Bunta Sugawara, Akira Shioji, Yōko Mihara, Yōsuke Kondō, Bin Amatsu', null, 'Oryu searches for blind child she left behind and get involved in a Yakuza turf war that takes place in the Tokyo Theater.', 'Oryu searches for blind child she left behind and get involved in a Yakuza turf war that takes place in the Tokyo Theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82DDN8LrFcrAqwyuJw7QjvT9Ap3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55945'),
