  ('874644310519774707', 'Red Point', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Nicanor Loreti, Mariano Suárez', 'Nicanor Loreti', 'Demián Salomón, Mariana Anghileri, Edgardo Castro, Constanza Cardillo, Juan Palomino, Pablo Sala', null, 'In some vacant area in the Buenos Aires province, Diego is taking part in a radio contest that consists of answering a series of questions about his beloved team Racing Club. Meanwhile, in the blink of an eye, a man falls from the sky on the hood of his car, another man ends up gagged in the trunk, a secret agent shows up weapon in hand and a plane crashes just meters away.', 'In some vacant area in the Buenos Aires province, Diego is taking part in a radio contest that consists of answering a series of questions about his beloved team Racing Club. Meanwhile, in the blink of an eye, a man falls from the sky on the hood of his car, another man ends up gagged in the trunk, a secret agent shows up weapon in hand and a plane crashes just meters away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUyZczbumN7JAeEIGu26ZbECxA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895749'),
  ('325307520455857548', 'Red Post on Escher Street', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Masaya Suzuki, Sion Sono', 'Sion Sono', 'Sen Fujimaru, Riku Kurokouchi, Mala Morgan, Tatsuhiro Yamaoka, Takahiro Konishi, Yuma Ueji, Canon Nawata, Fumina Suzuki', null, 'Drafted to shoot a new film, Tadashi Kobayashi, a director with festival marketability, is strong-armed by the studio into hiring two famous actresses as leads. The cast of self-unaware weirdos that constitute the budding players become increasingly overwhelmed and emboldened until they stage their own micro-revolution.', 'Drafted to shoot a new film, Tadashi Kobayashi, a director with festival marketability, is strong-armed by the studio into hiring two famous actresses as leads. The cast of self-unaware weirdos that constitute the budding players become increasingly overwhelmed and emboldened until they stage their own micro-revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/174s54DpnseN14fWSbDlSl8atuQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676211'),
  ('683637858396386424', 'Red Psalm', 1972, 'Drama, War, Music', 'Miklós Jancsó, János Kende', 'Gyula Hernádi', 'István Bujtor, Tamás Cseh, György Cserhalmi, Andrea Drahota, Gyöngyi Bürös, Erzsi Cserhalmi, Mari Csomós, Ilona Gurnik', null, 'Set in the 1890s on the Hungarian plains, a group of farm workers go on strike in which they face harsh reprisals and the reality of revolt, oppression, morality and violence.', 'Set in the 1890s on the Hungarian plains, a group of farm workers go on strike in which they face harsh reprisals and the reality of revolt, oppression, morality and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eapZ1WPlH9iHodlUEJe7DE5nJzZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86732'),
  ('403859681881677800', 'Red Rackham''s Treasure', 1991, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie, Action, Comedy, Crime, Family, Mystery', 'Stéphane Bernasconi, Annick Paulhac, Michel Pisson', 'Alex Boon', 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Susan Roman, Michel Tureau', null, 'Tintin and Captain Haddock search for Red Rackham''s treasure with the help of an eccentric but lovable professor.', 'Tintin and Captain Haddock search for Red Rackham''s treasure with the help of an eccentric but lovable professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEzvGsy7oHfJ7ZojSSqBCRUNQEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441291'),
  ('511499330491503610', 'Red Riding', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Craig Conway, Darcy Baker, Dan Robins', 'Peter Stylianou', 'Victoria Tait, Lynsey Beauchamp, Ian Whyte, Bill Fellows, Jenny Quinn', 'Not Rated', 'After her mother''s overdose, teen Red Riding moves from London to her estranged grandmother''s Scottish estate, where dark family secrets, missing children, and a monstrous wolf blur reality, forcing her to fight for survival.', 'After her mother''s overdose, teen Red Riding moves from London to her estranged grandmother''s Scottish estate, where dark family secrets, missing children, and a monstrous wolf blur reality, forcing her to fight for survival.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwDsbatgGDW4gw9ViA9Bc654MP9s.jpg', 'plex:movie:red-riding-2026'),
  ('616543014261386383', 'Red Riding Hood', 1987, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Adam Brooks, Hilik Ne''eman, Daniel Schneor', 'Carole Lucia Satrina', 'Amelia Shankley, Isabella Rossellini, Craig T. Nelson, Rocco Sisto, Helen Glazary, Linda Kaye, Amnon Meskin, Julian Chagrin', 'NR', 'The high spirited daughter of the village lord and her mother have been living in the forest for seven years near her wise grandmother. They wait for her father to come home, meanwhile, her literally heartless uncle rules. He sells his soul for the aid of an enchanted wolf who turns himself human in order to spy. As the tyranical lord begins to see his niece as a threat, he sends the wolf to deal with her.', 'The high spirited daughter of the village lord and her mother have been living in the forest for seven years near her wise grandmother. They wait for her father to come home, meanwhile, her literally heartless uncle rules. He sells his soul for the aid of an enchanted wolf who turns himself human in order to spy. As the tyranical lord begins to see his niece as a threat, he sends the wolf to deal with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivMQlcweBqmwt43gk0vf9atDQI9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66176'),
  ('110516141506125678', 'Red Riding Hood', 2006, 'Family, Fantasy', 'David Stump, Randal Kleiser', 'Timothy Dolan', 'Lainie Kazan, Henry Cavill, Morgan Thompson, Sam Oz Stone, Daniel Roebuck, Cassandra Peterson, David Kaufman, Debi Mazar', 'PG', 'Teenage Claire would rather hang out with her friends at the mall than to stay home with her brother Matt while Grandma babysits. Who wouldn''t? Unfortunately, Grandma isn''t about to let Claire out of the house. Worse, she insists that Claire and Matt listen to her reworking of the Brothers Grimm classic tale "Little Red Riding Hood". Fortunately, Grandma has a sense of humor, and adds some modern twists. Claire imagines herself as Red, and her brother, parents and grandma as....her brother, parents and grandma.', 'Teenage Claire would rather hang out with her friends at the mall than to stay home with her brother Matt while Grandma babysits. Who wouldn''t? Unfortunately, Grandma isn''t about to let Claire out of the house. Worse, she insists that Claire and Matt listen to her reworking of the Brothers Grimm classic tale "Little Red Riding Hood". Fortunately, Grandma has a sense of humor, and adds some modern twists. Claire imagines herself as Red, and her brother, parents and grandma as....her brother, parents and grandma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67ReUHzeOMgdNNT1HTIwZLiA9Mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44507'),
  ('624464199468867856', 'Red Riding Hood', 2011, 'Thriller, Drama, Fantasy, Mystery, Horror, Romance', 'Catherine Hardwicke, Mandy Walker, Roger Vernon', 'David Leslie Johnson-McGoldrick', 'Amanda Seyfried, Gary Oldman, Billy Burke, Shiloh Fernandez, Max Irons, Julie Christie, Lukas Haas, Virginia Madsen', 'PG-13', 'Valerie is in love with a brooding outsider, Peter, but her parents have arranged for her to marry another man. Unwilling to lose each other, Valerie and Peter plan to run away together when Valerie''s older sister is killed by a werewolf that prowls the dark forest surrounding their village. Panic grips the town as Valerie discovers that she has a unique connection to the beast--one that inexorably draws them together, making her both suspect ... and bait.', 'Valerie is in love with a brooding outsider, Peter, but her parents have arranged for her to marry another man. Unwilling to lose each other, Valerie and Peter plan to run away together when Valerie''s older sister is killed by a werewolf that prowls the dark forest surrounding their village. Panic grips the town as Valerie discovers that she has a unique connection to the beast--one that inexorably draws them together, making her both suspect ... and bait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixQYkLeLlTTnAoT32dukndyObB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49730'),
  ('929711551898322640', 'Red Riding Hood', 2022, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Artyom Aksenenko, Ivan Gudkov, Vyacheslav Lisnevsky', 'Aleksandr Barshak', 'Taisya Kalinina, Aleksey Serebryakov, Ekaterina Klimova, Yuriy Chursin, Irina Rozanova, Danila Yakushev, Oleg Chugunov, Aleksey Barabash', null, 'Saving her city from the wolves, Little Red Riding Hood will have to solve the mystery of the disappearance of her father Wolfboy, face her fears in the eyes and find her destiny.', 'Saving her city from the wolves, Little Red Riding Hood will have to solve the mystery of the disappearance of her father Wolfboy, face her fears in the eyes and find her destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oezAXCgv7owNUiLHYutMPoqhe5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967561'),
  ('443502120216113995', 'Red Riding Hoodlum', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Paul J. Smith', null, 'Dal McKennon, June Foray, Grace Stafford', null, 'Knothead and Splinter, Woody Woodpecker''s nephew and niece, are reading "Little Red Riding Hood" and are asked to deliver a bag of goodies to Grandma in the forest. They meet a wolf.', 'Knothead and Splinter, Woody Woodpecker''s nephew and niece, are reading "Little Red Riding Hood" and are asked to deliver a bag of goodies to Grandma in the forest. They meet a wolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knjij4MTJZZut9bCWkMxh4w2N7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40602'),
  ('831021686134556729', 'Red Riding Hoodwinked', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Milt Franklyn', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Red Riding Hood is on her way from the city to the country, to visit Granny. She''s bringing Tweety Bird to Granny as a gift - which attracts Sylvester''s attention. Along the way she also meets the Big Bad Wolf. Sylvester wants to eat Tweety. Big Bad wants to eat Red.', 'Red Riding Hood is on her way from the city to the country, to visit Granny. She''s bringing Tweety Bird to Granny as a gift - which attracts Sylvester''s attention. Along the way she also meets the Big Bad Wolf. Sylvester wants to eat Tweety. Big Bad wants to eat Red.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hs9F64ZcUqdg5U0D03w99amNtqX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235158'),
  ('829540780227946053', 'Red Riding: The Year of Our Lord 1974', 2009, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Julian Jarrold, Rob Hardy, Julie Ann Horan', 'Tony Grisoni', 'Andrew Garfield, Warren Clarke, Sean Bean, David Morrissey, John Henshaw, Anthony Flanagan, Jennifer Hennessy, Mary Jo Randle', null, 'Yorkshire, 1974. Fear, mistrust and institutionalised police corruption are running riot. Rookie journalist Eddie Dunford is determined to search for the truth in an increasingly complex maze of lies and deceit surrounding the police investigation into a series of child abductions. When young Clare Kemplay goes missing, Eddie and his colleague, Barry, persuade their editor to let them investigate links with two similar abductions that draw them into a deadly world of secrecy, intimidation, shocking revelations and police brutality.', 'Yorkshire, 1974. Fear, mistrust and institutionalised police corruption are running riot. Rookie journalist Eddie Dunford is determined to search for the truth in an increasingly complex maze of lies and deceit surrounding the police investigation into a series of child abductions. When young Clare Kemplay goes missing, Eddie and his colleague, Barry, persuade their editor to let them investigate links with two similar abductions that draw them into a deadly world of secrecy, intimidation, shocking revelations and police brutality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MGUwUFkcAKawdsT2q88Sdo2vv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291081'),
  ('561908849206918573', 'Red Riding: The Year of Our Lord 1980', 2009, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'James Marsh, Igor Martinović', 'Tony Grisoni', 'Paddy Considine, Warren Clarke, Maxine Peake, James Fox, David Calder, Nicholas Woodeson, Tony Pitts, Jim Carter', null, 'After 6 years of brutal murders, the West Yorkshire Police fear that they may have already interviewed The Ripper and let him back into the world to continue his reign of terror upon the citizens of Yorkshire. Assistant Chief Constable of the Manchester Police, Peter Hunter, is called in to oversee the West Yorkshire Police''s Ripper investigation and see what they could have missed.', 'After 6 years of brutal murders, the West Yorkshire Police fear that they may have already interviewed The Ripper and let him back into the world to continue his reign of terror upon the citizens of Yorkshire. Assistant Chief Constable of the Manchester Police, Peter Hunter, is called in to oversee the West Yorkshire Police''s Ripper investigation and see what they could have missed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DeTSHV2gkT3HYTWb3o2Z8wKbIe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291084'),
  ('78543664132841801', 'Red Riding: The Year of Our Lord 1983', 2009, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Anand Tucker, David Higgs', 'Tony Grisoni', 'David Morrissey, Lisa Howard, Chris Walker, Shaun Dooley, Jim Carter, Warren Clarke, Sean Bean, Sean Harris', null, 'Detective Chief Superintendent Maurice Jobson is forced to remember the very similar disappearance of Clare Kemplay, who was found dead in 1974, and the subsequent imprisonment of local boy Michael Myshkin. Washed-up local solicitor John Piggott becomes convinced of Myshkin''s innocence and begins to fight on his behalf, unwittingly providing a catalyst for Jobson to start to right some wrongs.', 'Detective Chief Superintendent Maurice Jobson is forced to remember the very similar disappearance of Clare Kemplay, who was found dead in 1974, and the subsequent imprisonment of local boy Michael Myshkin. Washed-up local solicitor John Piggott becomes convinced of Myshkin''s innocence and begins to fight on his behalf, unwittingly providing a catalyst for Jobson to start to right some wrongs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyaV5xR5Ugsvf4An1JFVEmlkSB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291092'),
  ('936094231487157511', 'Red Right Hand', 2024, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Eshom Nelms, Ian Nelms, Jacques Terblanche', 'Jonathan Easley', 'Orlando Bloom, Andie MacDowell, Scott Haze, Chapel Oaks, Garret Dillahunt, Mo McRae, Brian Geraghty, Kenneth Miller', 'PG-13', 'Cash is trying to live a quiet, honest life in a small Appalachian town. When a vicious crime boss forces him back into her services, he soon learns he''s capable of anything -- even killing -- to protect his family and his home.', 'Cash is trying to live a quiet, honest life in a small Appalachian town. When a vicious crime boss forces him back into her services, he soon learns he''s capable of anything -- even killing -- to protect his family and his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfEG79SQIg3p6B8rBLVeIo2BBhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1227816'),
  ('1034159506489694045', 'Red River', 1948, 'Western', 'Howard Hawks, Russell Harlan, Arthur Rosson', 'Borden Chase, Charles Schnee', 'John Wayne, Montgomery Clift, Joanne Dru, Walter Brennan, Coleen Gray, Harry Carey, John Ireland, Noah Beery Jr.', null, 'Following the Civil War, headstrong rancher Thomas Dunson decides to lead a perilous cattle drive from Texas to Missouri. During the exhausting journey, his persistence becomes tyrannical in the eyes of Matthew Garth, his adopted son and protégé.', 'Following the Civil War, headstrong rancher Thomas Dunson decides to lead a perilous cattle drive from Texas to Missouri. During the exhausting journey, his persistence becomes tyrannical in the eyes of Matthew Garth, his adopted son and protégé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyNTsAzrIWB441OtvfbgKtx1kFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3089'),
  ('1087553134652182172', 'Red River Range', 1938, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Jack A. Marta', 'Stanley Roberts, Betty Burbridge, Luci Ward', 'John Wayne, Ray Corrigan, Max Terhune, Polly Moran, Lorna Gray, Kirby Grant, Sammy McKim, William Royle', 'NR', 'The Cattlemen''s Association has called in the Mesquiteers to find cattle rustlers. They get Tex Riley to pose as Stony so Stony can arrive posing as a wanted outlaw. This gets Stony into the gang of rustlers and he alerts Tucson and Lullaby as to the next raid. But Hartley is on hand and unknown to anyone is the rustler''s boss and he joins the posse with a plan that will do away with the Mesquiteers.', 'The Cattlemen''s Association has called in the Mesquiteers to find cattle rustlers. They get Tex Riley to pose as Stony so Stony can arrive posing as a wanted outlaw. This gets Stony into the gang of rustlers and he alerts Tucson and Lullaby as to the next raid. But Hartley is on hand and unknown to anyone is the rustler''s boss and he joins the posse with a plan that will do away with the Mesquiteers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duNfQGjVziKp9klrjb1tvTlj1d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134232'),
  ('421253242883807170', 'Red Road', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Andrea Arnold, Robbie Ryan, Ray Kenny', 'Lone Scherfig, Anders Thomas Jensen, Andrea Arnold', 'Kate Dickie, Tony Curran, Martin Compston, Natalie Press, Paul Higgins, John Comerford, Andrew Armour, Carolyn Calder', 'NR', 'Jackie is a CCTV operator. One day, a man shows his face on her monitor, a man she hoped never to see again. Now she has no choice and is compelled to confront him.', 'Jackie is a CCTV operator. One day, a man shows his face on her monitor, a man she hoped never to see again. Now she has no choice and is compelled to confront him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2SWtcm9bR7lqoCp3wsVp35fvmV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11705'),
  ('426653147218116546', 'Red Rock West', 1993, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Dahl, Marc Reshovsky, Mike Topoozian', 'John Dahl, Rick Dahl', 'Nicolas Cage, Dennis Hopper, Lara Flynn Boyle, J.T. Walsh, Timothy Carhart, Dan Shor, Dwight Yoakam, Craig Reay', 'R', 'When a promised job for Texan Michael fails to materialize in Wyoming, Mike is mistaken by Wayne to be the hitman he hired to kill his unfaithful wife, Suzanne. Mike takes full advantage of the situation, collects the money, and runs. During his getaway, things go wrong, and soon get worse when he runs into the real hitman, Lyle.', 'When a promised job for Texan Michael fails to materialize in Wyoming, Mike is mistaken by Wayne to be the hitman he hired to kill his unfaithful wife, Suzanne. Mike takes full advantage of the situation, collects the money, and runs. During his getaway, things go wrong, and soon get worse when he runs into the real hitman, Lyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewofUEqU3Gpr7WSgSz3TEVPIfBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10427'),
  ('553819662822704217', 'Red Rocket', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alex Coco, Sean Baker, Drew Daniels', 'Chris Bergoch, Sean Baker', 'Simon Rex, Suzanna Son, Bree Elrod, Ethan Darbone, Brenda Deiss, Judy Hill, Brittney Rodriguez, Marlon Lambert', 'R', 'After hitting rock bottom in Los Angeles, former porn star Mikey Saber returns to his hometown in Texas to stay with his estranged wife and mother-in-law. Just as tensions begin to ease, he becomes infatuated with a young doughnut shop worker named Strawberry.', 'After hitting rock bottom in Los Angeles, former porn star Mikey Saber returns to his hometown in Texas to stay with his estranged wife and mother-in-law. Just as tensions begin to ease, he becomes infatuated with a young doughnut shop worker named Strawberry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/345gLhiNpItU1ICx8OxJQwjgPmH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763329'),
  ('982722596258368792', 'Red Room', 1999, 'Horror', 'Daisuke Yamanouchi, Yasutaka Funayama', 'Daisuke Yamanouchi', 'Hiroshi Kitasenju, Sheena Nagamori, Mayumi Ookawa, Yuki Tsukamoto', null, 'How low would you go to win a million dollars? Just how desperate are you for the cash? Desperate enough to enter the Red Room? In this latest and most vicious game show to emerge from the Japanese underground, four contestants (a husband and wife on the edge of divorce, an office lady and a school girl) are locked in the Red Room to draw cards in the "king game." Whoever draws the king selects two others to enter a cage where one performs the most outrageous acts upon his or her unlucky victim. The game is played to the death. Survivor takes all, and the losers go home in body bags!', 'How low would you go to win a million dollars? Just how desperate are you for the cash? Desperate enough to enter the Red Room? In this latest and most vicious game show to emerge from the Japanese underground, four contestants (a husband and wife on the edge of divorce, an office lady and a school girl) are locked in the Red Room to draw cards in the "king game." Whoever draws the king selects two others to enter a cage where one performs the most outrageous acts upon his or her unlucky victim. The game is played to the death. Survivor takes all, and the losers go home in body bags!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWcmVLGRuK0cQIXU3sLebwncZRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58745'),
  ('350204431663579381', 'Red Room 2', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Daisuke Yamanouchi', null, 'Miyuki Katô, Yukio Kokago, Salmon Sakeyama, Yūken Yoshida', null, 'Another million dollars is up for grabs as four more contestants enter the RED ROOM. Locked inside, they begin to play "King", a deadly card game in which the loser must perform whatever action the winner desires. The game is played till there is a single survivor. How far will the contestants go for a little hard earned cash? How much abuse can a person handle? Can you dare watch the horror of the RED ROOM?', 'Another million dollars is up for grabs as four more contestants enter the RED ROOM. Locked inside, they begin to play "King", a deadly card game in which the loser must perform whatever action the winner desires. The game is played till there is a single survivor. How far will the contestants go for a little hard earned cash? How much abuse can a person handle? Can you dare watch the horror of the RED ROOM?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBCzeSPIN3WqrdUvDBPCsMQF4zk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113614'),
  ('433645468642788570', 'Red Rooms', 2023, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Stéphanie Gaudreau, Marie-Alexandre Kérouac, Pascal Plante', 'Pascal Plante', 'Juliette Gariépy, Laurie Babin, Élisabeth Locas, Maxwell McCabe-Lokos, Natalie Tannous, Pierre Chagnon, Guy Thauvette, Charlotte Aubin', 'NR', 'The high-profile case of serial killer Ludovic Chevalier has just gone to trial, and Kelly-Anne is obsessed. When reality blurs with her morbid fantasies, she goes down a dark path to seek the final piece of the case’s puzzle.', 'The high-profile case of serial killer Ludovic Chevalier has just gone to trial, and Kelly-Anne is obsessed. When reality blurs with her morbid fantasies, she goes down a dark path to seek the final piece of the case’s puzzle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBJvbf0g9rcsYElcwZCMYU0Vrj8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912480'),
  ('386030502292252871', 'Red Rose White Rose', 1994, 'Drama', 'Christopher Doyle, Stanley Kwan Kam-Pang, A Yi Shut Long', 'Edward Lam', 'Joan Chen, Winston Chao, Li Bingbing, Veronica Yip Yuk-Hing, Lam Yin-Yuk, Si Kwo, Shum Yuet-Wah, Chiu Cheung', null, 'Chronicles the love life of a man, Zhenbao. He has a steamy fling with the wife of a friend, the saucy and exciting Red Rose. Even though he feels happy with her, he knows he will not end up with her. To maintain his reputation, he marries an antiseptic, frigid but classy lady of a prim and proper background. Dissonance abound when he finds his bride irritating.', 'Chronicles the love life of a man, Zhenbao. He has a steamy fling with the wife of a friend, the saucy and exciting Red Rose. Even though he feels happy with her, he knows he will not end up with her. To maintain his reputation, he marries an antiseptic, frigid but classy lady of a prim and proper background. Dissonance abound when he finds his bride irritating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vm4trBmDSvXoIfP4fAwqLztDoiJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160022'),
  ('1058064470331399626', 'Red Roses of Passion', 1966, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Joseph W. Sarno, Anthony Lover', 'Joseph W. Sarno', 'Patricia McNair, Helena Clayton, Bella Donna, Laura London, Carol Holleck, Todd Moore, Jean James, Frank Spencer', null, 'A man-hungry suburban woman feels frustrated since she lives in the home of her prudish aunt and cousin, who interrupt and criticise her amorous liaisons. A co-worker brings her to a tarot-card reader, who introduces her to a club of women who meet occasionally to share an intoxicating brew, tease each other erotically with long-stemmed roses and honour the heathen god Pan. The occultist manages to corrupt the aunt and cousin, and lure the woman into full-fledged membership so she might participate in its climactic ritual.', 'A man-hungry suburban woman feels frustrated since she lives in the home of her prudish aunt and cousin, who interrupt and criticise her amorous liaisons. A co-worker brings her to a tarot-card reader, who introduces her to a club of women who meet occasionally to share an intoxicating brew, tease each other erotically with long-stemmed roses and honour the heathen god Pan. The occultist manages to corrupt the aunt and cousin, and lure the woman into full-fledged membership so she might participate in its climactic ritual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZq20LaX1WyVAuBem3zKhK9vh5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210809'),
  ('1067634465655904255', 'Red Sands', 2009, 'Action, Horror, War', 'Alex Turner, Sean O''Dea, Joel Jeffrey Nishimine', 'Simon Barrett', 'Shane West, Leonard Roberts, Aldis Hodge, Callum Blue, Brendan Miller, Theo Rossi, Noel Gugliemi, Mercedes Mason', 'R', 'A group of U.S. soldiers on a mission in the Middle East find themselves with nothing to do in their free time. Out of sheer boredom they end up destroying an old statue in the desert, only to unleash a horrific entity.', 'A group of U.S. soldiers on a mission in the Middle East find themselves with nothing to do in their free time. Out of sheer boredom they end up destroying an old statue in the desert, only to unleash a horrific entity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kt2K3lIUtGPj2n2DJvKveXWxZrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14977'),
  ('262220684246930379', 'Red Scorpion', 1988, 'Adventure, Action, War', 'João Fernandes, Joseph Zito, Louis DiGiaimo', 'Arne Olsen', 'Dolph Lundgren, M. Emmet Walsh, Al White, T. P. McKenna, Carmen Argenziano, Alex Colon, Brion James, Ruben Nthodi', 'R', 'A Soviet commando is sent to eliminate a rebel leader in Africa. Soon he finds himself doubting his mission and his loyalty.', 'A Soviet commando is sent to eliminate a rebel leader in Africa. Soon he finds himself doubting his mission and his loyalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzLQeJWGIKBQldk3HsAea5OFucI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12663'),
  ('42166075659901760', 'Red Scorpion 2', 1995, 'Action', 'Michael Kennedy, Curtis Petersen', 'Troy Bolotnick, Barry Victor, Straw Weisman', 'Matt McColm, John Savage, Jennifer Rubin, Paul Ben-Victor, Réal Andrews, Duncan Fraser, George Touliatos, Michael Ironside', 'R', 'An elite group of "soldiers" are assigned the job of infultrating a right-wing militia group. Each team member has unique skills (what''s new ?). The right wingers have a heavily guarded camp, and are about to launch a nationwide campaign of violent action.. Will our heroes thwart the neo-nazis in time....', 'An elite group of "soldiers" are assigned the job of infultrating a right-wing militia group. Each team member has unique skills (what''s new ?). The right wingers have a heavily guarded camp, and are about to launch a nationwide campaign of violent action.. Will our heroes thwart the neo-nazis in time....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vdNMYDV6KDDrDVa1R7QDzOUUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68359'),
  ('947377244623209111', 'Red Shadow', 2001, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Hiroyuki Nakano, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Hiroshi Saito, Masatoshi Kimura', 'Masanobu Ando, Jun Murakami, Kumiko Aso, Megumi Okina, Naoto Takenaka, Seizō Fukumoto, Ryoko Shinohara, Yoji Tanaka', null, 'The secret warriors of feudal Japan were the ninja. Sent on impossible missions, the ninja were trained to work in shadows, gather information and defeat the enemy to build a world of peace. Akakage, Aokage, and Asuka are rookie ninjas under the tutelage of Shirokage. Their life is a series of perilous missions that entail intrigue, deception and intimidation.', 'The secret warriors of feudal Japan were the ninja. Sent on impossible missions, the ninja were trained to work in shadows, gather information and defeat the enemy to build a world of peace. Akakage, Aokage, and Asuka are rookie ninjas under the tutelage of Shirokage. Their life is a series of perilous missions that entail intrigue, deception and intimidation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faicq6cvWWU4FaRnd9rxyPYVL4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14355'),
  ('81833474275082572', 'Red Shoe Diaries', 1992, 'Romance, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Marc Reshovsky, Zalman King', 'Zalman King, Patricia Louisianna Knop', 'David Duchovny, Brigitte Bako, Billy Wirth, Kai Wulff, Bridgit Ryan, Evie Sullivan, Brenda Vaccaro, Anna Karin', null, 'A man grieving the loss of his fiancée discovers a diary she kept that details a side of her he never knew. In an effort to understand, he reaches out in an unusual way by placing an ad asking for women’s diaries and hearing their stories.', 'A man grieving the loss of his fiancée discovers a diary she kept that details a side of her he never knew. In an effort to understand, he reaches out in an unusual way by placing an ad asking for women’s diaries and hearing their stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQPjn6wf1wxwaHeSUXQdpQZcmin.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5234'),
  ('1063743688921575705', 'Red Sky', 2014, 'Action, Thriller', 'Mario Van Peebles, Ronald Hersey', 'Adam Prince, Randy Arrington', 'Mario Van Peebles, Cam Gigandet, Rachael Leigh Cook, Bill Pullman, Brian Krause, Shane West, Jason Gray-Stanford, Kyle T. Heffner', 'PG-13', 'Disgraced Top Gun fighter pilot Butch Masters leads a rogue squad in recovery of a WMD. Masters must navigate a fractured friendship, a love triangle, and must take to the skies to reclaim his military and personal honor.', 'Disgraced Top Gun fighter pilot Butch Masters leads a rogue squad in recovery of a WMD. Masters must navigate a fractured friendship, a love triangle, and must take to the skies to reclaim his military and personal honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5wrpVvjeq8kgClO0CtX2aNOcxU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242166'),
  ('834921852027174224', 'Red Snow', 2021, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Sean Nichols Lynch, Gavin V. Murray', 'Sean Nichols Lynch', 'Dennice Cisneros, Nico Bellamy, Laura Kennon, Vernon Wells, Alan Silva, Edward Ewell', 'NR', 'A struggling vampire romance novelist must defend herself against real-life vampires during Christmas in Lake Tahoe.', 'A struggling vampire romance novelist must defend herself against real-life vampires during Christmas in Lake Tahoe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKpsfpUtleiVTBInYnVRHq669nV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774454'),
  ('636089020671283863', 'Red Soil', 2021, 'Drama', 'Farid Bentoumi, Georges Lechaptois', null, 'Zita Hanrot, Sami Bouajila, Céline Sallette, Olivier Gourmet, Henri-Noël Tabary, Alka Balbir, Thierry Rousset, Laurent Crozet', null, 'Freshly hired as a labor nurse in a chemical factory, Nour discovers that small arrangements exist between management and her father, Slimane, the staff representative, and the company''s pivot. Lies about polluting discharges, hidden illnesses of employees, hidden accidents ... Nour, little by little, no longer accepts the compromises of his father to preserve the image of the company. She decides to launch the alert.', 'Freshly hired as a labor nurse in a chemical factory, Nour discovers that small arrangements exist between management and her father, Slimane, the staff representative, and the company''s pivot. Lies about polluting discharges, hidden illnesses of employees, hidden accidents ... Nour, little by little, no longer accepts the compromises of his father to preserve the image of the company. She decides to launch the alert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myPrG0yAJo3DhZpj8BeUTl7hwa6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712120'),
  ('557009006902171911', 'Red Sonja', 1985, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Richard Fleischer, Giuseppe Rotunno, Michel Ferry', 'Clive Exton, George MacDonald Fraser', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Brigitte Nielsen, Sandahl Bergman, Paul L. Smith, Ernie Reyes Jr., Ronald Lacey, Pat Roach, Terry Richards', 'PG-13', 'The tyrant Gedren seeks the total power in a world of barbarism. She raids the city Hablac and kills the keeper of a talisman that gives her great power. Red Sonja, sister of the keeper, sets out with her magic sword to overthrow Gedren.', 'The tyrant Gedren seeks the total power in a world of barbarism. She raids the city Hablac and kills the keeper of a talisman that gives her great power. Red Sonja, sister of the keeper, sets out with her magic sword to overthrow Gedren.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83v0W5cCSFsWpI0cAj8DRlihySN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9626'),
  ('171583279578138361', 'Red Sonja', 2025, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy, Drama', 'MJ Bassett, Ivan Ranghelov, Danica Davis', 'Tasha Huo', 'Matilda Lutz, Robert Sheehan, Wallis Day, Luke Pasqualino, Michael Bisping, Martyn Ford, Eliza Matengu, Danica Davis', 'R', 'A young girl rises from the ashes of tragedy to become the most feared warrior woman of all time: the She-Devil with a Sword.', 'A young girl rises from the ashes of tragedy to become the most feared warrior woman of all time: the She-Devil with a Sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aE3yh4y0h96CZZpLo0UDFMWZAA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13494'),
  ('999498175673766669', 'Red Sorghum', 1988, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Zhang Yimou, Gu Changwei, Yang Fengliang', 'Chen Jianyu, Zhu Wei, Li Kezhi', 'Gong Li, Jiang Wen, Teng Rujun, Liu Ji, Qian Ming, Ji Chunhua, Zhai Chunhua, Jia Zhaoji', null, 'An old leper who owned a remote sorghum winery dies. Jiu''er, the wife bought by the leper, and her lover, identified only as "my Grandpa" by the narrator, take over the winery and set up an idealized quasi-matriarchal community headed by Jiu''er. When the Japanese invaders subject the area to their rule and cut down the sorghum to make way for a road, the community rises up and resists as the sorghum grows anew.', 'An old leper who owned a remote sorghum winery dies. Jiu''er, the wife bought by the leper, and her lover, identified only as "my Grandpa" by the narrator, take over the winery and set up an idealized quasi-matriarchal community headed by Jiu''er. When the Japanese invaders subject the area to their rule and cut down the sorghum to make way for a road, the community rises up and resists as the sorghum grows anew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CP2eazEBKJ3njm4HM63pMfs5tW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42006'),
  ('361955010965358866', 'Red Sparrow', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Francis Lawrence, Jo Willems, László Szirmai', 'Justin Haythe', 'Jennifer Lawrence, Joel Edgerton, Matthias Schoenaerts, Charlotte Rampling, Jeremy Irons, Ciarán Hinds, Joely Richardson, Mary-Louise Parker', 'R', 'Prima ballerina Dominika Egorova faces a bleak and uncertain future after she suffers an injury that ends her career. She soon turns to Sparrow School, a secret intelligence service that trains exceptional young people to use their minds and bodies as weapons. Dominika emerges as the most dangerous Sparrow after completing the sadistic training process. As she comes to terms with her new abilities, she meets a CIA agent who tries to convince her that he is the only person she can trust.', 'Prima ballerina Dominika Egorova faces a bleak and uncertain future after she suffers an injury that ends her career. She soon turns to Sparrow School, a secret intelligence service that trains exceptional young people to use their minds and bodies as weapons. Dominika emerges as the most dangerous Sparrow after completing the sadistic training process. As she comes to terms with her new abilities, she meets a CIA agent who tries to convince her that he is the only person she can trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdefNr6aS00IwVbSlxdFJnfmzKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401981'),
  ('998685895344741482', 'Red Spell Spells Red', 1983, 'Horror', 'Titus Ho, Wong Wing-Lung, Chen Yung Shang', 'Amy Chan Suet-Ming', 'Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Poon Lai-Yin, Lun Chia, Eling Chan, Hussein Abu Hassan, Wong Tiong Hock, Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, San Sin', null, 'An evil dwarf sorcerer is buried alive in the jungles of Borneo for practicing black magic: Many years later, a documentary film crew from Hong Kong opens the coffin, and discover that one of them is afflicted with a horrible curse that begins killing off everyone around them.', 'An evil dwarf sorcerer is buried alive in the jungles of Borneo for practicing black magic: Many years later, a documentary film crew from Hong Kong opens the coffin, and discover that one of them is afflicted with a horrible curse that begins killing off everyone around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xs64vfJLAYut0gy99224Gdlelv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104633'),
