  ('1146113649854008645', 'Red Thousand Miles Race', 2015, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Claudio Uberti, Icaro Lorenzoni, Cecilia Irene Massaggia', 'Claudio Uberti, Claudio Uberti', 'Martina Stella, Fabio Troiano, Remo Girone, Francesca Rettondini, Victoria Zinny, Rosario Petix, Barbara Petti, Paolo Mazzetti', null, 'The story is based on 2014 Mille Miglia and encompasses eighty-five years of the race, from early 1930s to the present day, mixing life, memories, mystery and excitement of its characters who are brought together by the love for cars and separated by long-time secrets. They are fascinated by the presence and the story of a fabulous OM 665 Superba - a car built in Brescia, who won the first edition in 1927 - taken to pieces and forgotten for so many years.', 'The story is based on 2014 Mille Miglia and encompasses eighty-five years of the race, from early 1930s to the present day, mixing life, memories, mystery and excitement of its characters who are brought together by the love for cars and separated by long-time secrets. They are fascinated by the presence and the story of a fabulous OM 665 Superba - a car built in Brescia, who won the first edition in 1927 - taken to pieces and forgotten for so many years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxiBDjFbEtDPttHiibTpeK6B1n4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364403'),
