  ('352013112045886584', 'Red White & Blue', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Simon Rumley, Milton Kam', 'Simon Rumley', 'Amanda Fuller, Noah Taylor, Marc Senter, Nick Ashy Holden, Jon Michael Davis, Mary Mathews, Sally Jackson, Laurie Foxx', 'NR', 'A woman attracts the attention of a psychotic former Army interrogator and an emotionally fragile young man caring for his ailing mother.', 'A woman attracts the attention of a psychotic former Army interrogator and an emotionally fragile young man caring for his ailing mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFGoaLCD089W8eT4Qmi9eSmqDim.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41827'),
  ('358647190765869819', 'Red Wine in the Dark Night', 2015, 'Romance, Thriller, Horror', 'Tanwarin Sukkhapisit, Tatchai Aekkuttiyakorn, Sittichai Ussawadilokchai', 'Tanwarin Sukkhapisit', 'Natouch Siripongthon, Steven Isarapong Fuhrer, Kisthachapon Tananara, Nontapat Intarasuan, Jinna Pichit-O-Pakun, Sakdinan Chusuwan, Phachara Kueakanchanaphon, Paradorn Vesurai', null, 'A boy who gets frustrated in love meets another boy who loses all of his memories and they find some ways to start a new life together.', 'A boy who gets frustrated in love meets another boy who loses all of his memories and they find some ways to start a new life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MyoAyyl8aPJVwPhjLGFcx6IYVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427680'),
  ('1041585601548106008', 'Red Woods', 2021, 'Horror, Adventure, Mystery', 'Dan Hertzog, Nicholas Danko', 'Nicholas Danko', 'Michael Barnett, Brian E Stead, Jacquelynn Ware, Justin Rose, Michael Cruse, Jennifer Milligan, Stephanie Swift, Adam Cooley', null, 'A group of urbex enthusiasts travel to the backwoods of Appalachia to capture footage of abandoned houses, when they unwittingly become the subjects of a much darker video - made by a different kind of "enthusiast".', 'A group of urbex enthusiasts travel to the backwoods of Appalachia to capture footage of abandoned houses, when they unwittingly become the subjects of a much darker video - made by a different kind of "enthusiast".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aF6ptlTCyTVx7rkzGr2dGh4oNYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786971'),
  ('423971835882156167', 'Red Zone', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emilio Fernández', 'José Revueltas, Emilio Fernández', 'Fanny Cano, Armando Silvestre, Víctor Junco, Venetia Vianello, Mercedes Carreño, Lina Michel, Yolanda Rigel, Emilio Fernández', null, 'In a whorehouse in Acapulco, lives Leonor, a young and beautiful woman who is awaiting to reunite with an old lover. Suddenly, the man reappears to take her away from her life of vice. But the debt owed by Leonor to the "Madame" of the house causes a series of conflicts.', 'In a whorehouse in Acapulco, lives Leonor, a young and beautiful woman who is awaiting to reunite with an old lover. Suddenly, the man reappears to take her away from her life of vice. But the debt owed by Leonor to the "Madame" of the house causes a series of conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6R48PArYng42fh7Xk3KLQVlykqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342301'),
  ('901908782076252369', 'Red Zone Cuba', 1966, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'Coleman Francis, Herb Roberts', 'Coleman Francis', 'John Carradine, Coleman Francis, Anthony Cardoza, Harold Saunders, Tom Hanson', null, 'Griffin escapes from jail and teams up with two local thugs to invade Cuba. However, they''re soon captured by a Castro look-alike and receive sub-human treatment. But Griffin hatches a plan- will it be enough to bring peace to Cuba?', 'Griffin escapes from jail and teams up with two local thugs to invade Cuba. However, they''re soon captured by a Castro look-alike and receive sub-human treatment. But Griffin hatches a plan- will it be enough to bring peace to Cuba?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqh6rEJbUZOiSd9h1SfKe1Oh6fZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31123'),
  ('1059710196134354434', 'Red Zora', 2008, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Peter Kahane, Dragan Rogulj', 'Christian Zübert, Peter Kahane, Ronald Kruschak', 'Linn Reusse, Jakob Knoblauch, David Berton, Pascal Andres, Woody Mues, Mario Adorf, Ben Becker, Dominique Horwitz', null, 'In this sun soaked adventure for the entire family, a group of five orphaned children form their own makeshift family while attempting to operate outside the rules of society. Though they must sometimes steal to survive, their loyalty to one another means that they will always have a brother or sister to count on.', 'In this sun soaked adventure for the entire family, a group of five orphaned children form their own makeshift family while attempting to operate outside the rules of society. Though they must sometimes steal to survive, their loyalty to one another means that they will always have a brother or sister to count on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osynXqoG8YpUaMybdsY2Rw5xRzV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5701'),
  ('1006650982082563209', 'Red-Headed Baby', 1931, 'Music, Animation, Comedy', 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'Rochelle Hudson, Ken Darby, Johnny Murray, The Rythmettes', null, 'The old toymaker goes to sleep, and his toys immediately come to life and sing "Red-Headed Baby." A red-haired baby doll begins the song. She''s soon joined by her sweetheart, a toy soldier named Napoleon. A spider briefly spoils the fun when he descends upon the toys and grabs the doll. It''s up to Napoleon to save her.', 'The old toymaker goes to sleep, and his toys immediately come to life and sing "Red-Headed Baby." A red-haired baby doll begins the song. She''s soon joined by her sweetheart, a toy soldier named Napoleon. A spider briefly spoils the fun when he descends upon the toys and grabs the doll. It''s up to Napoleon to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jiPUiDKOqrMDySSNkDNo6mT5x4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162706'),
  ('1101661927158868851', 'Red-Headed Woman', 1932, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Jack Conway, Douglas Shearer, Harold Rosson', 'Anita Loos', 'Jean Harlow, Chester Morris, Lewis Stone, Leila Hyams, Una Merkel, Henry Stephenson, May Robson, Charles Boyer', 'NR', 'Lil works for the Legendre Company and causes Bill to divorce Irene and marry her. She has an affair with businessman Gaerste and uses him to force society to pay attention to her.', 'Lil works for the Legendre Company and causes Bill to divorce Irene and marry her. She has an affair with businessman Gaerste and uses him to force society to pay attention to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Iv5sY7qWljRFEHQ3qsgRetIboC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77966'),
  ('685254968404304467', 'Red, White & Royal Blue', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Caterina Da Vià, Eve Martin, Nick Simmonds', 'Matthew López', 'Taylor Zakhar Perez, Nicholas Galitzine, Uma Thurman, Clifton Collins Jr., Rachel Hilson, Sarah Shahi, Ellie Bamber, Thomas Flynn', 'R', 'After an altercation between Alex, the president''s son, and Britain''s Prince Henry at a royal event becomes tabloid fodder, their long-running feud now threatens to drive a wedge in U.S./British relations. When the rivals are forced into a staged truce, their icy relationship begins to thaw and the friction between them sparks something deeper than they ever expected.', 'After an altercation between Alex, the president''s son, and Britain''s Prince Henry at a royal event becomes tabloid fodder, their long-running feud now threatens to drive a wedge in U.S./British relations. When the rivals are forced into a staged truce, their icy relationship begins to thaw and the friction between them sparks something deeper than they ever expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ta3ReqbdEcLJM3mcHMzbYFZI8v7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:930094'),
  ('335123684810866941', 'Red: Werewolf Hunter', 2010, 'Fantasy, Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Sheldon Wilson, Russ Goozee', null, 'Felicia Day, Kavan Smith, Stephen McHattie, Greg Bryk, Rosemary Dunsmore, David Reale, Victoria Robertson, Robert Nolan', 'NR', 'The modern-day descendant of Little Red Riding Hood brings her fiancé home to meet her family and reveal their occupation as werewolf hunters, but after he is bitten by a werewolf, she must protect him from her own family.', 'The modern-day descendant of Little Red Riding Hood brings her fiancé home to meet her family and reveal their occupation as werewolf hunters, but after he is bitten by a werewolf, she must protect him from her own family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldCKvSF1iNmNPRC7PurYwcX7CuG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48871'),
  ('1056259392275517534', 'Red''s Dream', 1987, 'Animation, Family', 'John Lasseter', 'John Lasseter', null, 'G', 'Life as the sole sale item in the clearance corner of Eben''s Bikes can get lonely. So Red, a unicycle, dreams up a clown owner and his own juggling act that steals the show. But all too soon, the applause turns into the sound of rainfall, as reality rushes back. Red must resign himself to sitting in the corner and await his fate.', 'Life as the sole sale item in the clearance corner of Eben''s Bikes can get lonely. So Red, a unicycle, dreams up a clown owner and his own juggling act that steals the show. But all too soon, the applause turns into the sound of rainfall, as reality rushes back. Red must resign himself to sitting in the corner and await his fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebPNnYqoEYntnrGdwtmppvBRHpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13926'),
  ('257531613391614653', 'Redacted', 2007, 'War, Drama', 'Brian De Palma, Jonathon Cliff, Francois Caillaud', 'Brian De Palma', 'Izzy Diaz, Rob Devaney, Ty Jones, Anas Wellman, Mike Figueroa, Yanal Kassay, Dhiaa Khalil, Kel O''Neill', 'R', 'A fictional documentary discusses the effects the Iraq war has had on soldiers and local people through interviews with members of an American military unit, the media, and local Iraqis.', 'A fictional documentary discusses the effects the Iraq war has had on soldiers and local people through interviews with members of an American military unit, the media, and local Iraqis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofXlW8FtBGVGSgRiaOIfnzR5koU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11600'),
  ('466619653312810022', 'Redbad', 2018, 'Adventure, History, War, Drama', 'Roel Reiné, Roel Reiné, Thomas Wiegerink', 'Alex van Galen', 'Gijs Naber, Jonathan Banks, Lisa Smit, Søren Malling, Derek de Lint, Egbert Jan Weeber, Huub Stapel, Renée Soutendijk', null, 'In the year of 754 AD, during a time of epic battles and bloodshed, the legend of the pagan warrior king, Rebad, is born, but so is a new weapon against his people: Christianity. Redbad must ultimately unite a Viking army powerful enough to defeat the seemingly invincible Franks.', 'In the year of 754 AD, during a time of epic battles and bloodshed, the legend of the pagan warrior king, Rebad, is born, but so is a new weapon against his people: Christianity. Redbad must ultimately unite a Viking army powerful enough to defeat the seemingly invincible Franks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmBXIR1nv1ueIBFBqKg60rLBzmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485296'),
  ('958663122838040459', 'Redbelt', 2008, 'Drama', 'David Mamet, Cara Giallanza, Stephen E. Hagen', 'David Mamet', 'Chiwetel Ejiofor, Tim Allen, Alice Braga, Jose Pablo Cantillo, Randy Couture, Ricky Jay, Joe Mantegna, Max Martini', 'R', 'Martial artist Mike Terry lives by a strict code of no competitions, for he feels that such contests weaken fighters. After saving a famous action star from a brutal attack, Mike takes a job in the film industry. He soon finds his personal beliefs and integrity on the line as circumstances force him to participate in a prize fight.', 'Martial artist Mike Terry lives by a strict code of no competitions, for he feels that such contests weaken fighters. After saving a famous action star from a brutal attack, Mike takes a job in the film industry. He soon finds his personal beliefs and integrity on the line as circumstances force him to participate in a prize fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjLKe0QCGgSrvEd41Z4q2QpSoJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12400'),
  ('145985249653155376', 'Redcon-1', 2018, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Chee Keong Cheung, Lorenzo Levrini, Matthew Thomas Edwards', 'Steve Horvath, Mark Strange, Chee Keong Cheung', 'Oris Erhuero, Carlos Gallardo, Mark Strange, Joshua Dickinson, Martyn Ford, Akira Koieyama, Katarina Leigh Waters, Michael Sheehan', null, 'After a zombie apocalypse spreads from a London prison, the UK is brought to its knees. The spread of the virus is temporarily contained but, without a cure, it’s only a matter of time before it breaks its boundaries and the biggest problem of all… any zombies with combat skills are now enhanced. With the South East of England quarantined from the rest of the world using fortified borders, intelligence finds that the scientist responsible for the outbreak is alive and well in London. With his recovery being the only hope of a cure, a squad of eight Special Forces soldiers is sent on a suicide mission to the city, now ruled by the undead, with a single task: get him out alive within 72 hours by any means necessary. What emerges is an unlikely pairing on a course to save humanity against ever-rising odds.', 'After a zombie apocalypse spreads from a London prison, the UK is brought to its knees. The spread of the virus is temporarily contained but, without a cure, it’s only a matter of time before it breaks its boundaries and the biggest problem of all… any zombies with combat skills are now enhanced. With the South East of England quarantined from the rest of the world using fortified borders, intelligence finds that the scientist responsible for the outbreak is alive and well in London. With his recovery being the only hope of a cure, a squad of eight Special Forces soldiers is sent on a suicide mission to the city, now ruled by the undead, with a single task: get him out alive within 72 hours by any means necessary. What emerges is an unlikely pairing on a course to save humanity against ever-rising odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6t2zRldr64GZDuMxKhPzwhVxyjX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485811'),
  ('1030335943299930070', 'Redd Inc.', 2012, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Daniel Krige, Richard Bradshaw', 'Jonathon Green, Anthony O''Connor', 'Nicholas Hope, Kelly Paterniti, Sam Reid, Alan Dukes, James Mackay, Hayley McElhinney, Tom Savini, Bridie Latona', 'R', 'Six captive office workers are literally chained to their desks by a demented, escaped serial killer; former regional manager Thomas Reddmann. He assigns his ''human resources'' the impossible task of proving his innocence or suffering gruesome consequences.', 'Six captive office workers are literally chained to their desks by a demented, escaped serial killer; former regional manager Thomas Reddmann. He assigns his ''human resources'' the impossible task of proving his innocence or suffering gruesome consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0sJHCm3vRqGioWywLsLnR6ujUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133463'),
  ('938491370449879060', 'Redeemer', 2004, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Ralph Strelow, Cláudio Torres, Tatiana de Lamare', 'Elena Soarez, Cláudio Torres, Fernanda Torres', 'Pedro Cardoso, Miguel Falabella, Fernanda Montenegro, Camila Pitanga, Fernando Torres, Stênio Garcia, Enrique Díaz, Jean Pierre Noher', null, 'Célio Rocha believes he was assigned by God Himself a difficult mission: to persuade his childhood friend Otávio Sabóia, a corrupt entrepeneur in the construction business, to give away all his possessions to the poor.', 'Célio Rocha believes he was assigned by God Himself a difficult mission: to persuade his childhood friend Otávio Sabóia, a corrupt entrepeneur in the construction business, to give away all his possessions to the poor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRAdlYMX7pItf6fRmQhaSKl0KeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70812'),
  ('435679832625834180', 'Redeemer', 2014, 'Action, Crime', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza, Nicolás Ibieta', 'Guillermo Prieto, Ernesto Díaz Espinoza, Diego Ayala', 'Marko Zaror, José Luís Mósca, Loreto Aravena, Mauricio Diocares, Noah Segan, Constanza Araya, Smirnow Boris, Otilio Castro', null, 'A former hit-man for a drug cartel becomes a vigilante to pay for his sins and find redemption.', 'A former hit-man for a drug cartel becomes a vigilante to pay for his sins and find redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXmN64q8nmBwcOpEMoHNZhjtwT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289198'),
  ('288290159113611244', 'Redemption', 2013, 'History, Documentary', 'Miguel Gomes', 'Mariana Ricardo, Miguel Gomes', 'Jaime Pereira, Donatello Brida, Jean-Pierre Rehm, Maren Ade', null, 'On January 21, 1975, in a village in the north of Portugal, a child writes to his parents who are in Angola to tell them how sad Portugal is. On July 13, 2011, in Milan, an old man remembers his first love. On May 6, 2012, in Paris, a man tells his baby daughter that he will never be a real father. During a wedding ceremony on September 3, 1977 in Leipzig, the bride battles against a Wagner opera that she can’t get out of her head. But where and when have these four poor devils begun searching for redemption?', 'On January 21, 1975, in a village in the north of Portugal, a child writes to his parents who are in Angola to tell them how sad Portugal is. On July 13, 2011, in Milan, an old man remembers his first love. On May 6, 2012, in Paris, a man tells his baby daughter that he will never be a real father. During a wedding ceremony on September 3, 1977 in Leipzig, the bride battles against a Wagner opera that she can’t get out of her head. But where and when have these four poor devils begun searching for redemption?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KiakHsdJEbaHuKmQQCvgu6XZmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218974'),
  ('141055082110884291', 'Redemption', 2019, 'Action, Drama', 'Mickey Fonseca, António Forjaz', 'Mickey Fonseca', 'Gil Alexandre, Arlete Bombe, Laquino Fonseca, Tomás Bié, Rashid Abdul, Cândido Quembo', null, 'A young ex-con seeking redemption is surprised by a bank foreclosure that forces him to plot against a ruthless crime boss.', 'A young ex-con seeking redemption is surprised by a bank foreclosure that forces him to plot against a ruthless crime boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ol8ixV9S8Dk5JQ4TdtHuXtTvv9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616819'),
  ('112647999275267550', 'Redemption Day', 2021, 'Action, Romance, War', 'Philip Lozano, Bandar Atifi, Jalil Lahlou', 'Sam Chouia, Lemore Syvan, Hicham Hajji', 'Gary Dourdan, Serinda Swan, Andy Garcia, Brice Bexter, Ernie Hudson, Martin Donovan, Robert Knepper, Samy Naceri', 'R', 'When his wife is kidnapped by terrorists for ransom, veteran war hero Brad Paxton races against the clock to rescue her in a daring and deadly operation that pits him against powerful and dark forces.', 'When his wife is kidnapped by terrorists for ransom, veteran war hero Brad Paxton races against the clock to rescue her in a daring and deadly operation that pits him against powerful and dark forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1Tk1LUwS3nRlugiXnag6Bu1ToG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767304'),
  ('592796515894003298', 'Redemption: The Stan Tookie Williams Story', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Vondie Curtis-Hall, David Greene', 'J. T. Allen', 'Jamie Foxx, Lynn Whitfield, Lee Thompson Young, Brenden Jefferson, Brenda Bazinet, Wes Williams, Greg Ellwand, CCH Pounder', null, 'Redemption tells the story of Stan "Tookie" Williams, founder of the Crips L.A. street gang. Story follows his fall into gang-banging, his prison term, and his work writing children''s novels encouraging peace and anti-violence resolutions which earned him multiple Nobel Peace Prize nominations. After exhausting all forms of appeal, Tookie was executed by lethal injection.', 'Redemption tells the story of Stan "Tookie" Williams, founder of the Crips L.A. street gang. Story follows his fall into gang-banging, his prison term, and his work writing children''s novels encouraging peace and anti-violence resolutions which earned him multiple Nobel Peace Prize nominations. After exhausting all forms of appeal, Tookie was executed by lethal injection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xpQkmUVD57nMcbKR6tm9sooPQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31781'),
  ('1127286187550384737', 'Redes', 1936, 'Drama', 'Fred Zinnemann, Paul Strand, Emilio Gómez Muriel', null, 'Silvio Hernández, Antonio Lara, Miguel Figueroa, Rafael Hinojosa, Felipe Rojas, David Valle González, Susana Ortiz Cobos', 'NR', 'A Mexican fisherman, whose son has died because he could not afford necessary medical care out of his meagre wages, becomes aware of how badly exploited he and his many fellow fisherman are by the one greedy man for whom they work and the corrupt politician who makes the laws to benefit him.', 'A Mexican fisherman, whose son has died because he could not afford necessary medical care out of his meagre wages, becomes aware of how badly exploited he and his many fellow fisherman are by the one greedy man for whom they work and the corrupt politician who makes the laws to benefit him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eFVC382rOiJ8C4Tv8myGwAnESx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195522'),
  ('452160966439083143', 'Redhat and Cousin', 1994, 'Comedy, Family, Music', 'Iraj Tahmasb', 'Iraj Tahmasb, Hamid Jebeli, Homayoun Assadian', 'Iraj Tahmasb, Fatemeh Motamed-Arya, Hamid Jebeli, Hamide Kheyrabadi, Morteza Ahmadi, Mehri Mehrinia, Farrokhlagha Houshmand, Akbar Doudkar', null, 'Kolah Ghermezi is a naughty school boy. His playfulness gets him expelled from school and he fails to find a job. He sees a program on TV which attracts his attention and he goes to Tehran. With the help of Pesarkhaleh, he goes to the TV program he had seen and finds the reporter. He likes the reporter so much that he decides to help him overcome the obstacles he faces for getting married, but instead causes troubles.', 'Kolah Ghermezi is a naughty school boy. His playfulness gets him expelled from school and he fails to find a job. He sees a program on TV which attracts his attention and he goes to Tehran. With the help of Pesarkhaleh, he goes to the TV program he had seen and finds the reporter. He likes the reporter so much that he decides to help him overcome the obstacles he faces for getting married, but instead causes troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smCzXXlOfFgihyyKwtUgtetFUrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386768'),
  ('415962946749507914', 'Redhead', 1962, 'Drama', 'Helmut Käutner', 'Helmut Käutner', 'Ruth Leuwerik, Rossano Brazzi, Harry Meyen, Richard Münch, Gert Fröbe, Giorgio Albertazzi, Gianni Solaro, Giovanni Rossi', null, 'Bored with her marriage, Franziska decides to travel to Venice.', 'Bored with her marriage, Franziska decides to travel to Venice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWbueJJIYeEyNSutj8zM5DNYLOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267417'),
  ('1081111934468069843', 'Redirected', 2014, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Feliksas Abrukauskas, Emilis Vėlyvis, Artūras Pugačiauskas', 'Jonas Banys, Emilis Vėlyvis', 'Vinnie Jones, Scot Williams, Gil Darnell, Vytautas Šapranauskas, Aurimas Meliešius, Oliver Jackson, Anthony Strachan, Andrius Žiurauskas', 'R', 'Four friends become stranded in Eastern Europe and have to become hit men, prostitutes, corrupt cops, smugglers and more to make it home.', 'Four friends become stranded in Eastern Europe and have to become hit men, prostitutes, corrupt cops, smugglers and more to make it home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kA6lnOcfyd5EnSqgv4dRwKYvvo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190469'),
  ('548583255741125614', 'Redline', 2007, 'Action, Thriller', 'Andy Cheng, Johnny Martin, Alexander H. Gayner', 'Robert Foreman', 'Nathan Phillips, Nadia Bjorlin, Eddie Griffin, Tim Matheson, Jesse Johnson, Barbara Niven, Denyce Lawton, Neill Skylar', 'PG-13', 'A gorgeous young automobile fanatic--and front to the hottest unsigned band on the West Coast--finds herself caught up in illegal drag-racing competitions organized by exotic car fanatics.', 'A gorgeous young automobile fanatic--and front to the hottest unsigned band on the West Coast--finds herself caught up in illegal drag-racing competitions organized by exotic car fanatics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lE1XfidwJml7lNGi0D4KlB8uQFY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16392'),
  ('405501258864533364', 'Redline', 2009, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Takeshi Koike, Takeshi Koike, Ryu Takizawa', 'Yoji Enokido, Taiki Sakurai, Katsuhito Ishii', 'Takuya Kimura, Yu Aoi, Tadanobu Asano, Takeshi Aono, Tatsuya Gashûin, Unsho Ishizuka, Kenta Miyake, Yoshiyuki Morishita', 'NR', 'A daredevil driver is determined to compete in Redline, the most popular race in the galaxy. The race only occurs every five years, but in order to participate he must overcome the mafia, the government and even love.', 'A daredevil driver is determined to compete in Redline, the most popular race in the galaxy. The race only occurs every five years, but in order to participate he must overcome the mafia, the government and even love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUkH0y9OsY7J08Dvfzi1P0di559.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71883'),
  ('880408761826736046', 'Redneck', 1973, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Silvio Narizzano', 'Masolino D''Amico', 'Franco Nero, Telly Savalas, Mark Lester, Ely Galleani, Duilio Del Prete, Maria Michi, Beatrice Clary, Bruno Boschetti', 'R', 'Franco Nero and Telly Savalas star in the story of a trio of jewel thieves on the lam after a heist goes very wrong. Wrecking their car they take another unaware that there is a teenager hiding in the back. As the flight becomes more frantic, the young man is discovered, upsetting the balance of the thieves.', 'Franco Nero and Telly Savalas star in the story of a trio of jewel thieves on the lam after a heist goes very wrong. Wrecking their car they take another unaware that there is a teenager hiding in the back. As the flight becomes more frantic, the young man is discovered, upsetting the balance of the thieves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4suqpmsu5gpa5Y8lZyyOKj6vhMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90009'),
  ('377504215453513784', 'Redneck Zombies', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Pericles Lewnes', 'P. Floyd Piranha, Zoofeet, Fester Smellman', 'Lisa M. DeHaven, William E. Benson, William Decker, Tyrone Taylor, James H. Housely, P. Floyd Piranha, Anthony Burlington-Smith, Boo Teasedale', 'NR', 'A barrel of radioactive waste is lost out in the woods. Some demented rednecks find it and use it as part of their still. Everybody who drinks from the liquor they produced turns into a zombie.', 'A barrel of radioactive waste is lost out in the woods. Some demented rednecks find it and use it as part of their still. Everybody who drinks from the liquor they produced turns into a zombie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8hZig6TdlMIMrIQciXgOSzgEbK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27916'),
  ('872277666788355199', 'Redouane Bougheraba : On m''appelle Marseille', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Lionel Chabert', null, 'Redouane Bougheraba', null, 'Redouane is endearing, impertinent, insolent and sunny, like his native Provence! First Marseille resident of the Jamel Comedy Club, actor featured in the latest masterpiece by Grand Corps Malade and Mehdi Idir “La Vie scolaire”, star comedian of the Paname Art Café… Redouane performs in a show where self-deprecation and improvisations mix. and legendary asides with the public. He tells his story and paints a realistic portrait of his life, with universal and current themes such as marriage, his travels, or even male-female relationships...', 'Redouane is endearing, impertinent, insolent and sunny, like his native Provence! First Marseille resident of the Jamel Comedy Club, actor featured in the latest masterpiece by Grand Corps Malade and Mehdi Idir “La Vie scolaire”, star comedian of the Paname Art Café… Redouane performs in a show where self-deprecation and improvisations mix. and legendary asides with the public. He tells his story and paints a realistic portrait of his life, with universal and current themes such as marriage, his travels, or even male-female relationships...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cStEth2n2sfLX7v9Ihq6VskCRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118853'),
  ('1087326361566579320', 'Redress', 2025, 'Drama', 'Régis Wargnier, Renaud Chassaing', 'Régis Wargnier, Manon Feuvray, Thomas Bidegain', 'Julia de Nunez, JC Lin, Julien de Saint Jean, Clovis Cornillac, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Anne Azoulay, Jay Huang, Jiajia Chang', null, 'A few hours before his third Michelin star is awarded, a renowned chef disappears with his sous chef during a hunting trip. His daughter Clara finds herself alone at the head of the restaurant, harassed by paparazzi. Two years later, she receives an invitation to a famous gastronomic congress in Taiwan.', 'A few hours before his third Michelin star is awarded, a renowned chef disappears with his sous chef during a hunting trip. His daughter Clara finds herself alone at the head of the restaurant, harassed by paparazzi. Two years later, she receives an invitation to a famous gastronomic congress in Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbY543pFXTJtgOlTm17Qhvsc6Si.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235294'),
  ('296174980874950374', 'Reds', 1981, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Warren Beatty, Vittorio Storaro, Enrique Gabriel', 'Warren Beatty, Trevor Griffiths', 'Warren Beatty, Diane Keaton, Edward Herrmann, Jerzy Kosiński, Jack Nicholson, Paul Sorvino, Maureen Stapleton, Nicolas Coster', 'PG', 'An account of the revolutionary years of the legendary American journalist John Reed, who shared his adventurous professional life with his radical commitment to the socialist revolution in Russia, his dream of spreading its principles among the members of the American working class, and his troubled romantic relationship with the writer Louise Bryant.', 'An account of the revolutionary years of the legendary American journalist John Reed, who shared his adventurous professional life with his radical commitment to the socialist revolution in Russia, his dream of spreading its principles among the members of the American working class, and his troubled romantic relationship with the writer Louise Bryant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeiKdVVM93fwfQG1m3N0cgVZgHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18254'),
  ('1100849128662238316', 'Redux Redux', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kevin McManus, Matthew McManus, Alan Gwizdowski', 'Kevin McManus, Matthew McManus', 'Michaela McManus, Stella Marcus, Jeremy Holm, Jim Cummings, Taylor Misiak, Dendrie Taylor, Derick Alexander, Raphael Chestang', 'R', 'In an attempt to avenge her daughter’s death, Irene Kelly travels through parallel universes, killing her daughter’s murderer again and again. As she becomes consumed by vengeance, her humanity begins to slip away—until the cycle is disrupted when she rescues Mia, a sharp-witted teenager already marked by the killer.', 'In an attempt to avenge her daughter’s death, Irene Kelly travels through parallel universes, killing her daughter’s murderer again and again. As she becomes consumed by vengeance, her humanity begins to slip away—until the cycle is disrupted when she rescues Mia, a sharp-witted teenager already marked by the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9u7sUTYPPTxGCXbkcw8FTq50PnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1340110'),
  ('620783539244050443', 'Redux Riding Hood', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Steve Moore, Jamie Thomason', 'Dan O''Shannon', 'Garrison Keillor, Michael Richards, Mia Farrow, Lacey Chabert, June Foray, Fabio, Don Rickles, Jim Cummings', null, 'Years after failing to catch Little Red Riding Hood, the obsessed Wolf tries again.', 'Years after failing to catch Little Red Riding Hood, the obsessed Wolf tries again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iad01q2TbSmiHc9JztYSnsdNbAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121076'),
  ('634296715964868072', 'Redwoods', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Lewis, Natalija Vekic, Joe Rivera', 'David Lewis', 'Matthew Montgomery, Caleb Dorfman, Brendan Bradley, Tad Coughenour, Simon Burzynski, Laurie Burke, Clara Brighton, Elinor Bell', 'NR', 'Both original and incredibly romantic, Redwoods tells the story of an already-partnered man whose love is tested when a mysterious drifter passes through his small Northern California town.', 'Both original and incredibly romantic, Redwoods tells the story of an already-partnered man whose love is tested when a mysterious drifter passes through his small Northern California town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VZu6hXM0DOTTnpgY0N0fhOL7RN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26731'),
  ('1072761633053382435', 'Reed: Insurgent Mexico', 1972, 'Drama, War, History', 'Paul Leduc, Alexis Grivas', 'Paul Leduc, Emilio Carballido, Juan Tovar', 'Claudio Obregón, Eduardo López Rojas, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Carlos Méndez, Max Kerlow, Juan Ángel Martínez, Carlos Castañon, Víctor Fosado', null, 'A dramatization of John Reed''s newspaper accounts of the Mexican Revolution. Considered the first real film in Mexican cinema to be made on the Mexican Revolution.', 'A dramatization of John Reed''s newspaper accounts of the Mexican Revolution. Considered the first real film in Mexican cinema to be made on the Mexican Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSHCVDiUy1NA5rDcmVicji2C1TP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119807'),
  ('81664567377847540', 'Reed''s Point', 2022, 'Horror', 'Dale Fabrigar', 'Sandy Lo, Suzanne DeLaurentiis, Tricia Aurand', 'Joe Estevez, Julia Kelly, Sasha Anne, Madison Ekstrand, Giovannie Espiritu, Evan Adams, Clint Carmichael, Catherine Healy', null, 'A vehicle crash in the Pine Barrens leads to a missing teen which raises conspiracy theories about the infamous Jersey Devil legend. On the anniversary of the crash, Sarah Franklin, convinced her cousin Kelsey is alive, goes out to the crash site with Alex, Kelsey''s boyfriend, to investigate. Things go downhill quickly as Sarah and Alex uncover what really lurks in the woods.', 'A vehicle crash in the Pine Barrens leads to a missing teen which raises conspiracy theories about the infamous Jersey Devil legend. On the anniversary of the crash, Sarah Franklin, convinced her cousin Kelsey is alive, goes out to the crash site with Alex, Kelsey''s boyfriend, to investigate. Things go downhill quickly as Sarah and Alex uncover what really lurks in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVHwUp1CRuvuvAbT93HULZv8ku9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957394'),
  ('605087932949372044', 'Reefer Madness: The Movie Musical', 2006, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Andy Fickman, Jan Kiesser', 'Dan Studney, Kevin Murphy', 'Kristen Bell, Christian Campbell, Neve Campbell, Alan Cumming, Ana Gasteyer, John Kassir, Amy Spanger, Christine Lakin', 'R', 'From an ominous Lecturer, a small 1930s middle American community learns of the Harper Affair, in which young Jimmy Harper finds his life of promise turn into a life of debauchery and murder thanks to the new drug menace marijuana. Along the way, he receives help from his girlfriend Mary and Jesus Himself, but always finds himself in the arms of the Reefer Man and the rest of the denizens of the Reefer Den.', 'From an ominous Lecturer, a small 1930s middle American community learns of the Harper Affair, in which young Jimmy Harper finds his life of promise turn into a life of debauchery and murder thanks to the new drug menace marijuana. Along the way, he receives help from his girlfriend Mary and Jesus Himself, but always finds himself in the arms of the Reefer Man and the rest of the denizens of the Reefer Den.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38xnsPZiuIYMTsOXhtTIg1dUnRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20521'),
  ('455952918132807312', 'Reeker', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Dave Payne, Mike Mickens, Brandon Rafferty', 'Dave Payne', 'Devon Gummersall, Derek Richardson, Tina Illman, Scott Whyte, Arielle Kebbel, Eric Mabius, Michael Ironside, Marcia Strassman', 'PG-13', 'Strangers trapped at an eerie travel oasis in the desert must unravel the mystery behind their visions of dying people while they are preyed upon by a decaying creature.', 'Strangers trapped at an eerie travel oasis in the desert must unravel the mystery behind their visions of dying people while they are preyed upon by a decaying creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyx8J1SFPjb7t8v0gLXnUBw3a8t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14457'),
  ('698541636751345218', 'Reflection in a Dead Diamond', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Hélène Cattet, Bruno Forzani, Madeleine Maistriaux', 'Bruno Forzani, Hélène Cattet', 'Fabio Testi, Yannick Renier, Koen De Bouw, Maria de Medeiros, Thi-Mai Nguyen, Céline Camara, Kézia Quental, Sylvia Camarda', null, 'When the mysterious woman in the room next door disappears, a debonair 70-year-old ex-spy living in a luxury hotel on the Côte d''Azur is confronted by the demons and darlings of a lurid past in which moviemaking, memories and madness collide.', 'When the mysterious woman in the room next door disappears, a debonair 70-year-old ex-spy living in a luxury hotel on the Côte d''Azur is confronted by the demons and darlings of a lurid past in which moviemaking, memories and madness collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CdRxBu7jRDHjthkAL8vE0GdKUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013446'),
  ('98792873721934722', 'Reflections', 1987, 'Drama, Horror', 'Goran Marković', 'Goran Marković', 'Mustafa Nadarević, Anica Dobra, Milorad Mandić, Bogdan Diklić, Petar Božović, Dušan Kostovski, Vladimir Jevtović, Gordana Gadžić', null, 'Mihajlo, an introvert piano teacher starts romance with a pretty careerist who teaches modeling at the university in Belgrade where they both work. His feelings are awakened after a long period, but this relationship makes him see the flashbacks, as well as yet unseen images that remind him of his troubled childhood - as if he experienced this already. When their university wins a contest to hold public TV performance, Mihailo fails to play the piano on the decisive night and she dumps him. The boiling point is about to come.', 'Mihajlo, an introvert piano teacher starts romance with a pretty careerist who teaches modeling at the university in Belgrade where they both work. His feelings are awakened after a long period, but this relationship makes him see the flashbacks, as well as yet unseen images that remind him of his troubled childhood - as if he experienced this already. When their university wins a contest to hold public TV performance, Mihailo fails to play the piano on the decisive night and she dumps him. The boiling point is about to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8k3Wf9soKQv8taEBVMexX3AnbMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264239'),
  ('912260855454001261', 'Reflections', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Bryan Goeres', 'Jay Beattie', 'Timothy Hutton, Dominik Garcia, Miguel Ángel Silvestre, Fernando Guillén Cuervo, Tània Sarrias, Ivana Miño, Brendan Price', null, 'Europol Agent Tom Brindle is called to Barcelona, Spain, to track down the notorious serial killer known as Pygmalion. A set of fingerprints lead to a young, volatile soldier, Marco Soler. Agent Brindle arrests Marco and intensely interrogates him, convinced that he has his man. Marco has an airtight alibi though and further investigation of the suspect leads Agent Brindle to a shocking discovery.', 'Europol Agent Tom Brindle is called to Barcelona, Spain, to track down the notorious serial killer known as Pygmalion. A set of fingerprints lead to a young, volatile soldier, Marco Soler. Agent Brindle arrests Marco and intensely interrogates him, convinced that he has his man. Marco has an airtight alibi though and further investigation of the suspect leads Agent Brindle to a shocking discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDUL9rcoiyqRjUWvqcmS5Fb6fOr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50714'),
  ('662761997435864657', 'Reflections in a Golden Eye', 1967, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Edward Folger, Vana Caruso, Alessandro Alberti', 'Chapman Mortimer, Gladys Hill', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Marlon Brando, Brian Keith, Julie Harris, Zorro David, Gordon Mitchell, Robert Forster, Jed Curtis', 'NR', 'Bizarre tale of sex, betrayal, and perversion at a military post.', 'Bizarre tale of sex, betrayal, and perversion at a military post.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aB2q0EqCedMUlGdsulIqE1REf4a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3547'),
  ('71503660626442460', 'Reflections in Black', 1975, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Tano Cimarosa, Marcello Masciocchi, Gianni Siragusa', 'Adriano Bolzoni, Luigi Latini de Marchi', 'John Richardson, Dagmar Lassander, Ninetto Davoli, Magda Konopka, Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Daniela Giordano, Ursula Davis, Tano Cimarosa', null, 'A woman dressed in black is murdering young women. The police question lawyer Anselmi for whom one of the girls worked as a secretary, and it turns out that all the victims were friends of lawyer''s wife Leonora.', 'A woman dressed in black is murdering young women. The police question lawyer Anselmi for whom one of the girls worked as a secretary, and it turns out that all the victims were friends of lawyer''s wife Leonora.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umX6REnYWfnAn4B8Al1jLic9vHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29354'),
  ('772448165107964953', 'Reflections of a Blender', 2010, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'André Klotzel, Uli Burtin', 'José Antônio de Souza', 'Ana Lúcia Torre, Selton Mello, Germano Haiut, Fabiula Nascimento, Aramis Trindade, Gorete Milagres, Zécarlos Machado, Marcos Cesana', null, 'After receiving a new blade, a blender suddenly gains consciousness. As it grapples with existential questions, it becomes the sole companion to the grieving wife of a missing man.', 'After receiving a new blade, a blender suddenly gains consciousness. As it grapples with existential questions, it becomes the sole companion to the grieving wife of a missing man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVIbeWPhyGJE5rGRbUWeLyNJ6JX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158921'),
  ('1027514316353890817', 'Reflections of Light', 1988, 'Drama', 'Mario Bianchi', 'Francesco Valitutti', 'Pamela Prati, Gabriele Tinti, Loredana Romito, Gabriele Gori, Laura Gemser, Jessica Moore', null, 'After a car incident, in which he lost his wife, a musician remains paralytic on a wheelchair. He retires in a lonely villa. Incidentally together with him in the villa there are also a bisexual, a lesbian and a vicious kid. The lascivious atmosphere drive all the protagonists into depraved games. But the pain for the lost couldn''t be medicated.', 'After a car incident, in which he lost his wife, a musician remains paralytic on a wheelchair. He retires in a lonely villa. Incidentally together with him in the villa there are also a bisexual, a lesbian and a vicious kid. The lascivious atmosphere drive all the protagonists into depraved games. But the pain for the lost couldn''t be medicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8Dv8Ymh3BYfpGPiFVIUtwap5yY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30495'),
  ('954879610895607275', 'Reflections on Black', 1955, 'Drama', 'Stan Brakhage', 'Stan Brakhage', 'Don Redlich, Lee Cole, Helen England, Ken Mecham, Pat Cleveland, Bob Mullen, Rita Parr', null, 'A series of terrifying dramas of male-female relationships offset against the background of a New York tenement. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2012.', 'A series of terrifying dramas of male-female relationships offset against the background of a New York tenement. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2012.', null, 'tmdb:movie:162186'),
  ('1072747423900548721', 'Reform School Girl', 1994, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Kaplan, James Chressanthis', 'Edward Bernds', 'Aimee Graham, Teresa DiSpina, Matt LeBlanc, Carolyn Seymour, Eleanor O''Brien, Samaria Graham, Marissa Ribisi, Erin Wiley Sands', null, 'After being a passenger in a hit-and-run, Donna Patterson is sent to reform school, taking the rap for the driver, bad boy Vince. Inside, she makes friends and self-discoveries while trying to save her little sister from their abusive uncle.', 'After being a passenger in a hit-and-run, Donna Patterson is sent to reform school, taking the rap for the driver, bad boy Vince. Inside, she makes friends and self-discoveries while trying to save her little sister from their abusive uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYBysmwwbTNbMwli2nBM7Z5ZLbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205827'),
  ('611565500762029008', 'Reform School Girls', 1986, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Tom DeSimone, Howard Wexler, Kristine Peterson', 'Tom DeSimone', 'Linda Carol, Wendy O. Williams, Pat Ast, Sybil Danning, Charlotte McGinnis, Sherri Stoner, Denise Gordy, Laurie Schwartz', 'R', 'Jenny is sent to a women''s reform school. It is run by evil warden Sutter and her henchwoman Edna. Jenny will stop at nothing to escape but she also has to deal with Charlie the bully.', 'Jenny is sent to a women''s reform school. It is run by evil warden Sutter and her henchwoman Edna. Jenny will stop at nothing to escape but she also has to deal with Charlie the bully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcAnrOJgGsXDCas67P4VPLVVBkA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29492'),
