  ('399374146308138322', 'Refuge', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Anton Sigurðsson, Anton Sigurdsson', 'Anton Sigurdsson', 'Christopher Dietrick, Adam Dorsey, Donald Paul, Adam Sinclair', 'R', 'Four estranged friends reunite on a fishing trip to mend their fractured bonds, only to be torn apart when one, a desperate father, accuses one of them of being connected to his daughter''s disappearance.', 'Four estranged friends reunite on a fishing trip to mend their fractured bonds, only to be torn apart when one, a desperate father, accuses one of them of being connected to his daughter''s disappearance.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkCZa7fDEqvWbaCzji0PcoD52JdU.jpg', 'plex:movie:refuge-2026'),
  ('261283504109129147', 'Refugee', 2000, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'J. P. Dutta, Basheer Ali', 'J. P. Dutta', 'Abhishek Bachchan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Jackie Shroff, Suniel Shetty, Anupam Kher, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Reena Roy, Puneet Issar', null, 'The films tells the story of an un-named Indian Muslim, who helps illegal refugees from both India and Pakistan to cross the border through the Great Rann of Kutch. The film is attributed to have been inspired by the short story "Love Across the Salt Desert" by Keki N. Daruwalla.', 'The films tells the story of an un-named Indian Muslim, who helps illegal refugees from both India and Pakistan to cross the border through the Great Rann of Kutch. The film is attributed to have been inspired by the short story "Love Across the Salt Desert" by Keki N. Daruwalla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gr8xmJPVUzNRpoIijXco6FMUjbK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166231'),
  ('896100937671813352', 'Refugiado', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Diego Lerman, Wojciech Staroń, Federico D''Auria', 'Diego Lerman, María Meira', 'Julieta Díaz, Sebastián Molinaro, Marta Lubos, Valentina García Guerrero, Silvia Baylé, Sofía Palomino, Agustín Rittano, Sandra Villani', null, '7 year old Matías returns home from a friend’s birthday party to find his mother, Laura, unconscious on the floor. When she recovers her senses they decide to leave home and rush to a shelter for abused women where they spend 48 hours before Laura decides to rebuild her life somewhere else. Through the eyes of Matías we will discover their escape in a city where everything Matías once knew feels dangerous and foreign until Laura finds a secure place to raise her son.', '7 year old Matías returns home from a friend’s birthday party to find his mother, Laura, unconscious on the floor. When she recovers her senses they decide to leave home and rush to a shelter for abused women where they spend 48 hours before Laura decides to rebuild her life somewhere else. Through the eyes of Matías we will discover their escape in a city where everything Matías once knew feels dangerous and foreign until Laura finds a secure place to raise her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YMyiI9sTJnQet9P2DiLamUJqJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270909'),
  ('1058099062717190360', 'Regarding Henry', 1991, 'Romance, Drama', 'Giuseppe Rotunno, Mike Nichols, Michael Haley', 'J.J. Abrams', 'Harrison Ford, Annette Bening, Bill Nunn, Rebecca Miller, Bruce Altman, Elizabeth Wilson, Donald Moffat, James Rebhorn', 'PG-13', 'After being shot, a lawyer loses his memory and must relearn speech and mobility, but he has a loving family to support him.', 'After being shot, a lawyer loses his memory and must relearn speech and mobility, but he has a loving family to support him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gyViKAIpy1jAcM3B17iXNbiHrh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11364'),
  ('181033297127705758', 'Regeneration', 1997, 'Drama, War', 'Gillies MacKinnon, Glen MacPherson', 'Allan Scott', 'Jonathan Pryce, James Wilby, Jonny Lee Miller, Stuart Bunce, Tanya Allen, Dougray Scott, David Hayman, John Neville', 'R', 'Wilfred Owen and Siegfried Sassoon, two of England''s most important World War I poets are sent, along with other traumatized combatants, to a rest home in order to treat their emotional troubles, caused by the psychological fatigue that suffer the soldiers fighting in the no man''s land.', 'Wilfred Owen and Siegfried Sassoon, two of England''s most important World War I poets are sent, along with other traumatized combatants, to a rest home in order to treat their emotional troubles, caused by the psychological fatigue that suffer the soldiers fighting in the no man''s land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWNif4E8ZRhqRBItr0FWVMz1ooO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49798'),
  ('89823587386417159', 'Regina', 2020, 'Drama', 'Alessandro Grande, Francesco di Pierro', 'Alessandro Grande, Mariano Di Nardo', 'Francesco Montanari, Ginevra Francesconi, Barbara Giordano, Max Mazzotta', null, 'Regina, a 15-year-old girl who lost her mother years earlier, dreams of becoming a singer. Her father, Luigi, her only family at that point, firmly believes in his daughter''s talent and supports her unceasingly. After all, Luigi had given up his own musical career to be near his daughter. Their relationship seems rock-solid, indissoluble, until one day an unexpected event changes their lives..', 'Regina, a 15-year-old girl who lost her mother years earlier, dreams of becoming a singer. Her father, Luigi, her only family at that point, firmly believes in his daughter''s talent and supports her unceasingly. After all, Luigi had given up his own musical career to be near his daughter. Their relationship seems rock-solid, indissoluble, until one day an unexpected event changes their lives..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keON5Eg2SFyGq6u2CjpMfzXmc2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787245'),
  ('508086026596280657', 'ReGOREgitated Sacrifice', 2008, 'Horror', 'Lucifer Valentine', 'Lucifer Valentine', 'Ameara Lavey, Jen Soska, Sylvia Soska, Isabelle Styles, Amy Lee, Honey, Cinderella Valentine, J.J.', null, 'Guided by identical twin demon spirits, The Black Angels of Hell, we see the diabolical depiction of the alternate-parallel dimension of the simultaneous suicide deaths of Kurt Cobain and bulimic porn star Angela Aberdeen, as seen through the mental activity of Angela''s journey toward brain death as a result of her self-inflicted death by drowning.', 'Guided by identical twin demon spirits, The Black Angels of Hell, we see the diabolical depiction of the alternate-parallel dimension of the simultaneous suicide deaths of Kurt Cobain and bulimic porn star Angela Aberdeen, as seen through the mental activity of Angela''s journey toward brain death as a result of her self-inflicted death by drowning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cADBvuMzDyAGmw4CTvshea7vu5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68610'),
  ('357239624328245952', 'Regresa', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Alejandro González Padilla', 'Alejandro González Padilla, Monica Abin', 'Jaime Camil, Blanca Soto, Javier Tolosa, Daniela Schmidt, Mariana Peñalva, Víctor Huggo Martin, Jorge Zárate, Mónica Huarte', null, 'Mary is married to Ernest, a successful businessman who devotes all his time managing the business he inherited from his family. Therefore, he spends little time with Mary, to the extent that she suspects he has a mistress. Isabel is married to Adolfo, Doctor of Philosophy and Letters, UNAM graduated, best friend of Ernesto. Patricia is passionate about esotericism; she believes in past life regressions. Isabel and Patricia are concerned about the marital status of Mary and to distract her, convince her to do a regression through hypnosis, the problem is when the hypnotist can not make her come back and they find Mary speaking a strange language, claiming to be a Basque princess of the XIV century.', 'Mary is married to Ernest, a successful businessman who devotes all his time managing the business he inherited from his family. Therefore, he spends little time with Mary, to the extent that she suspects he has a mistress. Isabel is married to Adolfo, Doctor of Philosophy and Letters, UNAM graduated, best friend of Ernesto. Patricia is passionate about esotericism; she believes in past life regressions. Isabel and Patricia are concerned about the marital status of Mary and to distract her, convince her to do a regression through hypnosis, the problem is when the hypnotist can not make her come back and they find Mary speaking a strange language, claiming to be a Basque princess of the XIV century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkJUhuFxCHyppiODOlGcp4XJAkL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270050'),
  ('111060491913454887', 'Regression', 2015, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alejandro Amenábar, Daniel Aranyó, Jennifer Morden', 'Alejandro Amenábar', 'Ethan Hawke, Emma Watson, David Thewlis, Lothaire Bluteau, Dale Dickey, David Dencik, Devon Bostick, Aaron Ashmore', 'R', 'Minnesota, 1990. Detective Bruce Kenner investigates the case of young Angela, who accuses her father, John Gray, of an unspeakable crime. When John unexpectedly and without recollection admits guilt, renowned psychologist Dr. Raines is brought in to help him relive his memories and what they discover unmasks a horrifying nationwide mystery.', 'Minnesota, 1990. Detective Bruce Kenner investigates the case of young Angela, who accuses her father, John Gray, of an unspeakable crime. When John unexpectedly and without recollection admits guilt, renowned psychologist Dr. Raines is brought in to help him relive his memories and what they discover unmasks a horrifying nationwide mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luHpMTmU1ygtEgdOTSSj0i9nd8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241257'),
  ('500371259557447314', 'Regret!', 2013, 'Drama', 'Myrna van Gilst, Dave Schram', 'Dick van den Heuvel, Maria Peters', 'Robin Boissevain, Stefan Collier, Dorus Witte, Charlotte Bakker, Nils Verkooijen, Rick van Elk, Gregory Samson, Brahim Fouradi', null, 'A David''s classmate, Jochem, is harassed by three bullies, but nobody does anything at school, not even David, who feels guilty for not pointing out the culprits.', 'A David''s classmate, Jochem, is harassed by three bullies, but nobody does anything at school, not even David, who feels guilty for not pointing out the culprits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKXorzrzu01HrKpXNVSRUnOvlxx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193418'),
