  ('1029815719190283517', 'Regretting You', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Josh Boone, Stephen W. Moore, Tim Orr', 'Susan McMartin', 'Mckenna Grace, Mason Thames, Allison Williams, Dave Franco, Sam Morelos, Scott Eastwood, Willa Fitzgerald, Clancy Brown', 'PG-13', 'Morgan Grant and her daughter Clara explore what''s left behind after a devastating accident reveals a shocking betrayal and forces them to confront family secrets, redefine love, and rediscover each other.', 'Morgan Grant and her daughter Clara explore what''s left behind after a devastating accident reveals a shocking betrayal and forces them to confront family secrets, redefine love, and rediscover each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4gVnxTaks3anTycwKjDmvQSuWt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1327862'),
  ('1064774890834652257', 'Regular Guys', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Rolf Silber, Arno Drechsel', 'Rolf Silber, Rudolf Bergmann', 'Christoph M. Ohrt, Carin C. Tietze, Tim Bergmann, Oliver Stokowski, Rudolf Kowalski, Andreas Pietschmann, Dieter Brandecker, Daniela Ziegler', null, 'Christoph, cop and self-confident macho, has trouble with his fiance. After a long night he wakes up in the arms of Edgar, a good-looking, gay auto-mechanic. His live gets more and more troublesome after his girl friend throws him out of their apartment and as last resort he moves to Edgars place. Working together with a new, good-looking, very self-confident, female collegue, but living with a good-looking gay guy makes him pretty uncertain about his sexuality and his role as a cop. Written by Konstantin Articus', 'Christoph, cop and self-confident macho, has trouble with his fiance. After a long night he wakes up in the arms of Edgar, a good-looking, gay auto-mechanic. His live gets more and more troublesome after his girl friend throws him out of their apartment and as last resort he moves to Edgars place. Working together with a new, good-looking, very self-confident, female collegue, but living with a good-looking gay guy makes him pretty uncertain about his sexuality and his role as a cop. Written by Konstantin Articus', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yh8IiyblpNt8QSK2r7FMStuI85q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9098'),
  ('403049039971726732', 'Regular Lovers', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philippe Garrel, William Lubtchansky', 'Arlette Langmann, Marc Cholodenko', 'Louis Garrel, Clotilde Hesme, Nicolas Maury, Caroline Deruas, Eric Rulliat, Julien Lucas, Maurice Garrel, Rebecca Convenant', null, '1968 and 1969 in Paris: during and after the student and trade union revolt. François is 20, a poet, dodging military service. He takes to the barricades, but won''t throw a Molotov cocktail at the police. He smokes opium and talks about revolution with his friend, Antoine, who has an inheritance and a flat where François can stay. François meets Lilie, a sculptor who works at a foundry to support herself. They fall in love. A year passes; François continues to write, talk, smoke, and be with Lilie. Opportunities come to Lilie: what will she and François do?', '1968 and 1969 in Paris: during and after the student and trade union revolt. François is 20, a poet, dodging military service. He takes to the barricades, but won''t throw a Molotov cocktail at the police. He smokes opium and talks about revolution with his friend, Antoine, who has an inheritance and a flat where François can stay. François meets Lilie, a sculptor who works at a foundry to support herself. They fall in love. A year passes; François continues to write, talk, smoke, and be with Lilie. Opportunities come to Lilie: what will she and François do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7L0bpB34LyybFmGNa4fSW3Ps5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45126'),
  ('1116340461285319257', 'Rehearsal for Murder', 1982, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'David Greene, Maggie Parker, Nick Marck', 'William Link, Richard Levinson', 'Robert Preston, Lynn Redgrave, Patrick Macnee, Lawrence Pressman, William Russ, Madolyn Smith Osborne, Jeff Goldblum, William Daniels', null, 'A year after his fiancée''s death, a playwright schedules a rehearsal for his new play, which proves to be a trap for her killer.', 'A year after his fiancée''s death, a playwright schedules a rehearsal for his new play, which proves to be a trap for her killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewd4K4HhjjCVczRvui0DGWsLwuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66108'),
