  ('313177955351622173', 'Rehnaa Hai Terre Dil Mein', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gautham Vasudev Menon, Johny Lal', 'Gautham Vasudev Menon, Vipul D. Shah', 'R. Madhavan, Dia Mirza, Saif Ali Khan, Anupam Kher, Tannaz Irani, Vrajesh Hirjee, Hemant Pandey, Smita Jaykar', null, 'Maddy impersonates Rajeev, the person his love interest, Reena, is about to marry and attempts to woo her. However, he is unprepared for the moment when the truth will be revealed.', 'Maddy impersonates Rajeev, the person his love interest, Reena, is about to marry and attempts to woo her. However, he is unprepared for the moment when the truth will be revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTKDqkD5h5ADx9ZoBh6RWNz4DcV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46418'),
  ('235167830838889721', 'Rehragout-Rendezvous', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ed Herzog, Stephan Schuh', 'Ed Herzog, Stefan Betz', 'Sebastian Bezzel, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Simon Schwarz, Eisi Gulp, Enzi Fuchs, Gerhard Wittmann, Daniel Christensen, Stephan Zinner', null, 'Bavaria''s most laid-back cop returns, juggling parenting and working at the family farm with the reopening of a grisly cold case.', 'Bavaria''s most laid-back cop returns, juggling parenting and working at the family farm with the reopening of a grisly cold case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHsILvJTYB05wSUNy3K6nQ5ZACu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024176'),
  ('1060069409364624155', 'Reich oder tot', 2017, 'Crime', 'Lars Becker, Andreas Zickgraf', 'Lars Becker', 'Nicholas Ofczarek, Fritz Karl, Jessica Schwarz, Melika Foroutan, Sahin Eryilmaz, Narges Rashidi, Martin Brambach, Anna Loos', null, 'Diller and Kessel, two hardened Hamburg investigators, learn that their "old buddy" Mohammed is planning to rob a bank with his buddies. Kessel is a customer there, of all places. Kessel is divorced because of previous drug problems, but has resolved to win Claire and the children back and has therefore been clean for months. Despite Kessel''s warning to the branch manager, the gangsters carry out their plan and take a hostage who happens to be there: Kessel''s daughter Ruby, who suffers from epilepsy.', 'Diller and Kessel, two hardened Hamburg investigators, learn that their "old buddy" Mohammed is planning to rob a bank with his buddies. Kessel is a customer there, of all places. Kessel is divorced because of previous drug problems, but has resolved to win Claire and the children back and has therefore been clean for months. Despite Kessel''s warning to the branch manager, the gangsters carry out their plan and take a hostage who happens to be there: Kessel''s daughter Ruby, who suffers from epilepsy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xibVnd2qpHeUwHo5jgAkXiRS1i6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481073'),
  ('718765462455828467', 'Reign of Assassins', 2010, 'Action, Adventure', 'Su Chaobin, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Yang Zhenyu', 'Su Chaobin', 'Michelle Yeoh, Jung Woo-sung, Wang Xueqi, Barbie Hsu, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Guo Xiaodong, Jiang Yiyan', 'R', 'Set in ancient China, Zeng Jing is a skilled assassin who finds herself in possession of a mystical Buddhist monk''s remains. She begins a quest to return the remains to its rightful resting place, and thus places herself in mortal danger because a team of assassins is in a deadly pursuit to possess the remains which holds an ancient power-wielding secret.', 'Set in ancient China, Zeng Jing is a skilled assassin who finds herself in possession of a mystical Buddhist monk''s remains. She begins a quest to return the remains to its rightful resting place, and thus places herself in mortal danger because a team of assassins is in a deadly pursuit to possess the remains which holds an ancient power-wielding secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIQAm7YlBoZqllu4gbnagRlO9NY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44092'),
  ('16289838910469629', 'Reign of Chaos', 2022, 'Action, Horror, Fantasy', 'Becca Hirani, Ben Collin', 'Tom Jolliffe', 'Rebecca Finch, Ray Whelan, Kate Milner Evans, Mark Sears, Peter Cosgrove, Carmina Cordelia, Mike Kelson, Kate Lush', null, 'When the world is gripped by a plague unleashed by the evil lord Chaos, and humans are turned into rabid creatures, mankind can only be saved by three young women, descendants of a Goddess, with the power to stop Chaos'' evil.', 'When the world is gripped by a plague unleashed by the evil lord Chaos, and humans are turned into rabid creatures, mankind can only be saved by three young women, descendants of a Goddess, with the power to stop Chaos'' evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAmTVjK8fDgFBFYIpa0GqfuIoPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:951546'),
  ('1150939068146741750', 'Reign of Fire', 2002, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Rob Bowman, Adrian Biddle, Julie Busher', 'Gregg Chabot', 'Christian Bale, Matthew McConaughey, Izabella Scorupco, Gerard Butler, Alexander Siddig, Scott Moutter, David Kennedy, Ned Dennehy', 'PG-13', 'In post-apocalyptic England, an American volunteer and a British survivor team up to fight off a brood of fire-breathing dragons seeking to return to global dominance after centuries of rest underground. The Brit -- leading a clan of survivors to hunt down the King of the Dragons -- has much at stake: His mother was killed by a dragon, but his love is still alive.', 'In post-apocalyptic England, an American volunteer and a British survivor team up to fight off a brood of fire-breathing dragons seeking to return to global dominance after centuries of rest underground. The Brit -- leading a clan of survivors to hunt down the King of the Dragons -- has much at stake: His mother was killed by a dragon, but his love is still alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZVXCj3jXzIPJUHLaQohzt2uTM3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6278'),
  ('451320490738051944', 'Reign of Terror', 1949, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'John Alton, Anthony Mann', 'Æneas MacKenzie, Philip Yordan', 'Robert Cummings, Richard Basehart, Richard Hart, Arlene Dahl, Arnold Moss, Norman Lloyd, Charles McGraw, Beulah Bondi', null, 'The French Revolution, 1794. The Marquis de Lafayette asks Charles D''Aubigny to infiltrate the Jacobin Party to overthrow Maximilian Robespierre, who, after gaining supreme power and establishing a reign of terror ruled by death, now intends to become the dictator of France.', 'The French Revolution, 1794. The Marquis de Lafayette asks Charles D''Aubigny to infiltrate the Jacobin Party to overthrow Maximilian Robespierre, who, after gaining supreme power and establishing a reign of terror ruled by death, now intends to become the dictator of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHJaF9RoTT1XU1uUj9c6nLVulQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27635'),
  ('195277471510753334', 'Reign of the Supermen', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Action, Fantasy, Drama', 'Sam Liu, Jake Castorena', 'Tim Sheridan, Jim Krieg', 'Jerry O''Connell, Rebecca Romijn, Rainn Wilson, Cress Williams, Cameron Monaghan, Charles Halford, Patrick Fabian, Rosario Dawson', 'PG-13', 'In the wake of The Death of Superman, the world is still mourning the loss of the Man of Steel following his fatal battle with the monster Doomsday. However, no sooner as his body been laid to rest than do four new bearers of the Superman shield come forward to take on the mantle. The Last Son of Krypton, Superboy, Steel, and the Cyborg Superman all attempt to fill the vacuum left by the world''s greatest champion. Meanwhile, Superman''s death has also signaled to the universe that Earth is vulnerable. Can these new Supermen and the rest of the heroes prove them wrong?', 'In the wake of The Death of Superman, the world is still mourning the loss of the Man of Steel following his fatal battle with the monster Doomsday. However, no sooner as his body been laid to rest than do four new bearers of the Superman shield come forward to take on the mantle. The Last Son of Krypton, Superboy, Steel, and the Cyborg Superman all attempt to fill the vacuum left by the world''s greatest champion. Meanwhile, Superman''s death has also signaled to the universe that Earth is vulnerable. Can these new Supermen and the rest of the heroes prove them wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9TzqscNRUaG8HqEP3K1jUvi8pC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487672'),
  ('676959361828270838', 'Reign Over Me', 2007, 'Drama', 'Russ T. Alsobrook, Mike Binder', 'Mike Binder', 'Adam Sandler, Don Cheadle, Jada Pinkett Smith, Liv Tyler, Saffron Burrows, Donald Sutherland, Robert Klein, Melinda Dillon', 'R', 'A man who lost his family in the September 11 attack on New York City runs into his old college roommate. Rekindling the friendship is the one thing that appears able to help the man recover from his grief.', 'A man who lost his family in the September 11 attack on New York City runs into his old college roommate. Rekindling the friendship is the one thing that appears able to help the man recover from his grief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5EtDvwj2gdG1qMBLijamlLfJLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2355'),
  ('124244271325390053', 'Reigo: King of the Sea Monsters', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Shinpei Hayashiya', 'Shinpei Hayashiya', 'Yukijiro Hotaru, Miyu Oriyama, Mao Urata, Isamu Ago, Mickey Curtis, Saori Hara, Susumu Kurobe, Yoji Tanaka', null, 'Set in World War II, the film depicts the story of the real-life Japanese battleship, the Yamato, which is confronted in the Pacific Ocean by giant monsters, including the most fearsome of them all, Reigo.', 'Set in World War II, the film depicts the story of the real-life Japanese battleship, the Yamato, which is confronted in the Pacific Ocean by giant monsters, including the most fearsome of them all, Reigo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huwbSFWvUaItjfa0eRtN22pNxaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165683'),
