  ('686084047201440293', 'Reine & Mimmi i fjällen!', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Pär M. Ekberg, Magnus Skogsberg', 'Hans Rosenfeldt, Peter Emanuel Falck, Christian Wikander', 'Bertram Heribertson, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Sanna Ekman, Sanna Bråding, Mi Ridell, Per Graffman, Tomas Norström, Mercédesz Dinnyés', null, 'Mimmi starts to get enough, Reine just work all the time and watching TV. At last Reine has to choose, either they go to vacation together or Mimmi goes alone and if she does she can''t promise that she will come back. Reine chooses the first alternative and books a vacation trip up to the mountains, many of their friends also booked the same vacation place.', 'Mimmi starts to get enough, Reine just work all the time and watching TV. At last Reine has to choose, either they go to vacation together or Mimmi goes alone and if she does she can''t promise that she will come back. Reine chooses the first alternative and books a vacation trip up to the mountains, many of their friends also booked the same vacation place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6qc4w0Al1oUdTYJCwu44WV98oq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245649'),
  ('887212985122566314', 'Reinvented Mom', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Bonnie Cartas, Joaquin Russek, Ya''asib Vázquez Colmenares', 'Marcos Bucay', 'Erika Buenfil, Michelle Renaud, Nicolasa Ortíz Monasterio, Hernán Mendoza, Patricio José, Luz María Jerez, Gabriela Platas, Gilda Gómez', null, 'Marina decides to take Patricia, her mother, to live with her, who believes that she should behave like the widow she is now. Living with Marina, he realizes that there are many things to do. Both find a new world to explore.', 'Marina decides to take Patricia, her mother, to live with her, who believes that she should behave like the widow she is now. Living with Marina, he realizes that there are many things to do. Both find a new world to explore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HOJUlJ0aZfLdsjgKIDjjc5FbUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1294949'),
  ('204620529065251782', 'Reinventing Marvin', 2017, 'Drama', 'Anne Fontaine, Mathieu Schiffman, Cynthia Sicco', 'Anne Fontaine, Pierre Trividic', 'Finnegan Oldfield, Jules Porier, Catherine Mouchet, Isabelle Huppert, Catherine Salée, Grégory Gadebois, Vincent Macaigne, Charles Berling', null, 'Telling the true story of Marvin Bijou, a young boy from a working-class family in a small village, who suffers constant bullying at school and home for being ‘different’ – too sensitive and too feminine. A chance encounter with a drama teacher opens the doors to a world that offers him the chance to escape his situation.', 'Telling the true story of Marvin Bijou, a young boy from a working-class family in a small village, who suffers constant bullying at school and home for being ‘different’ – too sensitive and too feminine. A chance encounter with a drama teacher opens the doors to a world that offers him the chance to escape his situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f49OJVemvwazXkCRQoeLmgHTzJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446178'),
