  ('828540825811808754', 'Rejected', 2018, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Iván Noel, Marcos Navarro, Federico Schmukler', 'Iván Noel', 'Ismael Flores, Thiago Stampone, Xuan Quiroga, Angelina Carnevale, Melina Gaitan, Facundo Rizzi Plaate, Alejandro Ibarra, Fermin Brandalessi', null, 'After the fall of civilization, man has repeated the same mistakes again and installed a new system of law based on false science and superstitious beliefs. This reaches its climax when it comes to the “Chisa” flower, because anyone who dares to touch it is banished from the village and has to live a life of loneliness and poverty. The most vulnerable to this deviation are children, as their natural curiosity makes them fall prey to temptation.', 'After the fall of civilization, man has repeated the same mistakes again and installed a new system of law based on false science and superstitious beliefs. This reaches its climax when it comes to the “Chisa” flower, because anyone who dares to touch it is banished from the village and has to live a life of loneliness and poverty. The most vulnerable to this deviation are children, as their natural curiosity makes them fall prey to temptation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvxiDpeGCO2qK9rjtzyoMaprmyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569736'),
  ('1149400982502876055', 'Rejuvenatrix', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Brian Thomas Jones', 'Brian Thomas Jones, Simon Nuchtern', 'Vivian Lanko, John MacKay, James Hogue, Katell Pleven, Jessica Dublin, John Marcus Powell, Roy MacArthur, Louis Homyak', null, 'A rich actress who has gotten too old for leading roles employs a scientist who is working on a formula for eternal youth. The formula involves withdrawing certain fluids from the human brain. She takes the serum, but its unforeseen side effects turn her into a murderous monster.', 'A rich actress who has gotten too old for leading roles employs a scientist who is working on a formula for eternal youth. The formula involves withdrawing certain fluids from the human brain. She takes the serum, but its unforeseen side effects turn her into a murderous monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wr6KRGFXVqaXuKxDloHIwbLBLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27729'),
