  ('684209073188964377', 'Relationship Status: It''s Complicated', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Manu Payet, Rodolphe Lauga, Martial Schmeltz', 'Manu Payet, Nicolas Peufaillit, Romain Lévy', 'Manu Payet, Anaïs Demoustier, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Jean-François Cayrey, Philippe Duquesne, Sophie Bacry Picciotto, Manon Kneusé, Jean-Charles Clichet', 'R', 'Thirty-year-old Ben is about to marry Juliette. His quiet, ordered life will fall to pieces when he meets up again with the person he secretly wants to see the most: Vanessa, the high school bombshell who never so much as looked in his direction. She''s back in Paris, and the only person she now knows is him…', 'Thirty-year-old Ben is about to marry Juliette. His quiet, ordered life will fall to pieces when he meets up again with the person he secretly wants to see the most: Vanessa, the high school bombshell who never so much as looked in his direction. She''s back in Paris, and the only person she now knows is him…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTtfDEWU2ps6oVgVVuWgOgho2W5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255913'),
