  ('711218324689512486', 'Relax Freddy', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Erik Balling', 'Jens K. Holm, Henning Bahs, Erik Balling', 'Morten Grunwald, Ove Sprogøe, Hanne Borchsenius, Dirch Passer, Clara Pontoppidan, Asbjørn Andersen, Erik Mørk, Kristopher Kum', null, 'A Chinese diplomat is kidnapped from a conference in Genève and the world peace is at risk. The trail leads to a hiding place in Denmark and the Danish secret service brings in their best agent, agent Smith, who has been in a psychiatric hospital since his last assignment. To accompany Smith they once again turn to novelty and party tricks salesman Frede Hansen, because they need an unrecognizable man to infiltrate the crime syndicate behind the kidnapping.', 'A Chinese diplomat is kidnapped from a conference in Genève and the world peace is at risk. The trail leads to a hiding place in Denmark and the Danish secret service brings in their best agent, agent Smith, who has been in a psychiatric hospital since his last assignment. To accompany Smith they once again turn to novelty and party tricks salesman Frede Hansen, because they need an unrecognizable man to infiltrate the crime syndicate behind the kidnapping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fMKJMPJEDZFT2ysFzkaMJ27a17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33442'),
  ('936252646011346832', 'Relax, I''m from the Future', 2023, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Luke Higginson, Russ De Jong', 'Luke Higginson', 'Rhys Darby, Gabrielle Graham, Julian Richings, Zachary Bennett, Marye Barton, Janine Theriault, Louisa Zhu, Peter Valdron', null, 'Casper is a time traveller who arrives in the 2020s in an attempt to prevent a major future catastrophe. He meets Holly, a queer black woman he befriends and draws into his plan by giving her his knowledge of the future so that she can make quick money. However, they unwittingly alter the future themselves with their actions, until Doris, another time traveller, arrives to stop them.', 'Casper is a time traveller who arrives in the 2020s in an attempt to prevent a major future catastrophe. He meets Holly, a queer black woman he befriends and draws into his plan by giving her his knowledge of the future so that she can make quick money. However, they unwittingly alter the future themselves with their actions, until Doris, another time traveller, arrives to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPrNuDIfbBdrTRxHvZiooPLxPB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:994133'),
  ('529253418121383517', 'Relax... It''s Just Sex', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'P.J. Castellaneta, Lon Magdich, Scott Robertson Price', 'P.J. Castellaneta', 'Mitchell Anderson, Terrence ''T.C.'' Carson, Seymour Cassel, Lori Petty, Serena Scott Thomas, Jennifer Tilly, Susan Tyrrell, Cynda Williams', 'R', 'A tight-knit group of thirty-somethings -- gay, lesbian and straight -- struggle to live, love and stay friends in modern-day Los Angeles as circumstances conspire to tear them apart.', 'A tight-knit group of thirty-somethings -- gay, lesbian and straight -- struggle to live, love and stay friends in modern-day Los Angeles as circumstances conspire to tear them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IfXHRstu6TRyZorQ8Xy4yWDfdV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84586'),
  ('964278445000833898', 'Relay', 2025, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'David Mackenzie, Giles Nuttgens, William Klayer', 'Justin Piasecki, David Mackenzie', 'Riz Ahmed, Lily James, Sam Worthington, Willa Fitzgerald, Eisa Davis, Matthew Maher, Victor Garber, Jared Abrahamson', 'R', 'A broker of lucrative payoffs between corrupt corporations and the individuals who threaten them breaks his own rules when a new client seeks his protection to stay alive.', 'A broker of lucrative payoffs between corrupt corporations and the individuals who threaten them breaks his own rules when a new client seeks his protection to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpwccO2L8LUVtVTJTdgUVgoQqAo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088166'),
  ('304359356692998105', 'Release the Prisoners to Spring!', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Tage Danielsson, Gösta Ekman, Lasse Björne', 'Tage Danielsson', 'Lena Nyman, Tage Danielsson, Georg Årlin, Margaretha Krook, Ernst-Hugo Järegård, Jan Malmsjö, Urban Sahlin, Gösta Ekman', null, 'Small and short Frida lives with her long, tall friend in a house in the countryside. Frida rejects the idea that people who have committed crimes should be locked up. One day their own house is burgled by Harald. He is sentenced to prison. Acting in accordance with her philosophy, Frida decides to use all means possible to make it possible for Harald to escape.', 'Small and short Frida lives with her long, tall friend in a house in the countryside. Frida rejects the idea that people who have committed crimes should be locked up. One day their own house is burgled by Harald. He is sentenced to prison. Acting in accordance with her philosophy, Frida decides to use all means possible to make it possible for Harald to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPpMA3RbUqcnDLYZlA37AfkHG3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129467'),
  ('1039986111894950589', 'Relentless', 1989, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'William Lustig, Spiro Razatos, James Lemmo', 'Phil Alden Robinson', 'Judd Nelson, Robert Loggia, Leo Rossi, Meg Foster, Patrick O''Bryan, Ken Lerner, Mindy Seeger, Angel Tompkins', 'R', 'Two Los Angeles police detectives hunt for a serial killer who randomly chooses his victims from a phone directory.', 'Two Los Angeles police detectives hunt for a serial killer who randomly chooses his victims from a phone directory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9P23snECnN4st50r9kD86DeVEHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87462'),
  ('1016123322607691131', 'Relentless', 2026, 'Action, Thriller, Suspense', 'Tom Botchii Skowronski, David Christopher Pitt', 'Tom Botchii Skowronski', 'Shuhei Kinoshita, Matt Stuertz, Jackie Kelly, Jerry L. Buxbaum, Molly Maloney', 'R', 'A homeless man targets a well-off elite in a home invasion. But it will take an unhinged level of brutality to find out his true motive.', 'A homeless man targets a well-off elite in a home invasion. But it will take an unhinged level of brutality to find out his true motive.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F9%2Fgracenote%2F931cadd2e4db2a0bf0f0287b5d1ee37e.jpg', 'plex:movie:relentless-2026'),
  ('1075180354208156752', 'Relentless 3', 1993, 'Action, Thriller, Horror', 'James Lemmo, Jacques Haitkin, Larry Litton', 'James Lemmo', 'Leo Rossi, William Forsythe, Robert Costanzo, Tom Bower, Savannah Smith Boucher, Stacy Edwards, Edward Wiley, Diane Rodriguez', null, 'Sam Dietz, the relentless police detective, returns to Los Angeles from a self-imposed exile to help the police solve another series of brutal killings committed by another crafty serial killer whom targets Dietz''s latest love interest.', 'Sam Dietz, the relentless police detective, returns to Los Angeles from a self-imposed exile to help the police solve another series of brutal killings committed by another crafty serial killer whom targets Dietz''s latest love interest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRHYYWUcVK1zr3ZNcbSmg8t5Jo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107341'),
  ('1132188509017717499', 'Relentless IV: Ashes to Ashes', 1994, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Oley Sassone, Russ Brandt, John Wildermuth', 'Mark Sevi', 'Famke Janssen, Leo Rossi, Colleen Coffey, John Scott Clough, Christopher Pettiet, Ken Lerner, Lisa Robin Kelly, Rainer Grant', null, 'Sam Dietz is back and must find and stop another serial killer before he kills again. Detective work for Dietz is tough having to juggle two gorgeous women - one his partner, and the other his shrink, who holds the key to the case.', 'Sam Dietz is back and must find and stop another serial killer before he kills again. Detective work for Dietz is tough having to juggle two gorgeous women - one his partner, and the other his shrink, who holds the key to the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6PaED2vYrdcN0uHRklJV0hcez3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107342'),
  ('743585361847963173', 'Relic', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Natalie Erika James, Charlie Sarroff, Breeze Callahan', 'Christian White, Natalie Erika James', 'Emily Mortimer, Bella Heathcote, Robyn Nevin, Chris Bunton, Steve Rodgers, Catherine Glavicic, Jeremy Stanford, Christina O''Neill', 'R', 'When elderly mother Edna inexplicably vanishes, her daughter rushes to the family''s decaying home, finding clues of her increasing dementia scattered around the house in her absence.', 'When elderly mother Edna inexplicably vanishes, her daughter rushes to the family''s decaying home, finding clues of her increasing dementia scattered around the house in her absence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wZ0gxLqsPleneFSTZILmM3BE8Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539181'),
  ('337696692634389187', 'ReLIFE', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Takeshi Furusawa, Takashi Matsuo, Yasushi Hanamura', 'Kumiko Asō', 'Taishi Nakagawa, Yuna Taira, Mahiro Takasugi, Elaiza Ikeda, Sae Okazaki, Yudai Chiba, Mikako Ichikawa, Natsuna Watanabe', null, 'Arata Kaizaki, a jobless adult, undergoes an experiment that makes him 10 years younger. He goes back to high school and falls in love with Chizuru Hishiro, who is more than she seems.', 'Arata Kaizaki, a jobless adult, undergoes an experiment that makes him 10 years younger. He goes back to high school and falls in love with Chizuru Hishiro, who is more than she seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvvylMdvnDrypXH7kYMhjH3XPTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437620'),
  ('1110053192907866361', 'Religion', 2007, 'Drama, History', 'Subbiah Nallamuthu, Bhavna Talwar, Anjali Bhushan', 'Vibha Singh', 'Pankaj Kapur, Supriya Pathak, Hrishitaa Bhatt, Pankaj Tripathi, K.K. Raina, Krish Parekh, Daya Shankar Pandey, Suruchi Aulakh', null, 'The story is based in Banaras and is about a Hindu Priest Chaturvedi who follows the scriptures to practice Hindu religion. When a child is abandon by a woman and brought in his house by his daughter - after initial hesitation but due to requests from his wife - the family adapts the child; only to know after 4 years that the child is a Muslim. The family gives away the child and Chaturvedi engulfs himself in the purification process to cleanse his body, mind and soul due to contact with a Muslim soul. By the time, Chaturvedi thinks he is fully purified – the child reappears – seeking refuge, due to Hindu- Muslim riots. This is the time Chaturvedi finally realizes that the true religion is - religion where humans help humans – humanity.', 'The story is based in Banaras and is about a Hindu Priest Chaturvedi who follows the scriptures to practice Hindu religion. When a child is abandon by a woman and brought in his house by his daughter - after initial hesitation but due to requests from his wife - the family adapts the child; only to know after 4 years that the child is a Muslim. The family gives away the child and Chaturvedi engulfs himself in the purification process to cleanse his body, mind and soul due to contact with a Muslim soul. By the time, Chaturvedi thinks he is fully purified – the child reappears – seeking refuge, due to Hindu- Muslim riots. This is the time Chaturvedi finally realizes that the true religion is - religion where humans help humans – humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgSC9owErpJ18de9yk2fJuw9Y4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39817'),
  ('561681866351184781', 'Religulous', 2008, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Larry Charles, Anthony Hardwick', null, 'Bill Maher, Jose Luis De Jesus Miranda, Andrew Newberg, Steve Burg, Tal Bachman, Jonathan Boulden, Francis Collins, George Coyne', 'R', 'Commentator-comic Bill Maher plays devil''s advocate with religion as he talks to believers about their faith. Traveling around the world, Maher examines the tenets of Christianity, Judaism and Islam and raises questions about homosexuality, proof of Christ''s existence, Jewish Sabbath laws, violent Muslim extremists.', 'Commentator-comic Bill Maher plays devil''s advocate with religion as he talks to believers about their faith. Traveling around the world, Maher examines the tenets of Christianity, Judaism and Islam and raises questions about homosexuality, proof of Christ''s existence, Jewish Sabbath laws, violent Muslim extremists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBv5LCbWxPB8iU77dwurSGMVZ3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13007'),
  ('483370545679919657', 'Remains', 2011, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Colin Theys', 'John Doolan', 'Grant Bowler, Miko Hughes, Lance Reddick, Tawny Cypress, Evalena Marie, Anthony Marks, Jessica Alexandra Green, Greg Nutcher', 'NR', 'The story centers on two lone survivors of a bizarre accident that reduced most of the world''s population to zombies. They take refuge in a vacant casino and fight a losing battle against the undead.', 'The story centers on two lone survivors of a bizarre accident that reduced most of the world''s population to zombies. They take refuge in a vacant casino and fight a losing battle against the undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IxvPu3zfPtZiGbXoQQ5NfkssJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84449'),
  ('998671998245316484', 'Remains of the Wind', 2022, 'Drama', 'Mark Bliss, Tiago Guedes', 'Tiago Guedes, Tiago Gomes Rodrigues', 'Albano Jerónimo, Nuno Lopes, Isabel Abreu, João Pedro Vaz, Gonçalo Waddington, Leonor Vasconcelos, Ivo Arroja, Edgar Morais', null, 'A pagan tradition in a village in the countryside of Portugal leaves painful traces in a group of young teenagers. 25 years later, when they meet again, the past resurfaces and tragedy sets in.', 'A pagan tradition in a village in the countryside of Portugal leaves painful traces in a group of young teenagers. 25 years later, when they meet again, the past resurfaces and tragedy sets in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mcuDh8bAF0xJSwakgc8z2ARVch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965817'),
  ('924955413175494082', 'Remarkably Bright Creatures', 2026, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Olivia Newman, Ashley Connor', 'Olivia Newman, John Whittington', 'Sally Field, Lewis Pullman, Alfred Molina, Colm Meaney, Joan Chen, Kathy Baker, Beth Grant, Sofia Black-D''Elia', null, 'A lonely elderly widow named Tova forms an unlikely friendship with a curmudgeonly cephalopod octopus named Marcellus, but unbeknownst to her, Marcellus is on a mission to solve a mystery that will heal the widow’s heart and lead her to a life-changing discovery.', 'A lonely elderly widow named Tova forms an unlikely friendship with a curmudgeonly cephalopod octopus named Marcellus, but unbeknownst to her, Marcellus is on a mission to solve a mystery that will heal the widow’s heart and lead her to a life-changing discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A475wjszW2O8ORYjylEfz9bqlMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1330021'),
  ('1004329264365251945', 'ReMastered: Devil at the Crossroads', 2019, 'Music, Documentary', 'Brian Oakes', 'Jeff Zimbalist, Michael Zimbalist', 'Keith Richards, Keb'' Mo'', Taj Mahal, Bonnie Raitt, Eric Clapton, John Hammond, Rory Block, Bruce Conforth', null, 'Robert Johnson was one of the most influential blues guitarists ever. Even before his early death, fans wondered if he''d made a pact with the Devil.', 'Robert Johnson was one of the most influential blues guitarists ever. Even before his early death, fans wondered if he''d made a pact with the Devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lOv1G6oMcz7BBrXN2POV2QbX3gV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553645'),
  ('409011516364035859', 'ReMastered: The Two Killings of Sam Cooke', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Kelly Duane de la Vega', 'Michael Zimbalist, Jeff Zimbalist', 'Sam Cooke, Jim Brown, Quincy Jones, Smokey Robinson, Dionne Warwick', null, 'This investigation examines the mysterious shooting of soul icon Sam Cooke, whose death silenced one of the most vital voices in the civil rights movement.', 'This investigation examines the mysterious shooting of soul icon Sam Cooke, whose death silenced one of the most vital voices in the civil rights movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hZd9TquyZp0TralTUh2zangZ0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553646'),
