  ('425045519249223084', 'Rembetiko', 1983, 'Drama, Music', 'Takis Zervoulakos, Costas Ferris', 'Sotiria Leonardou, Costas Ferris', 'Sotiria Leonardou, Nikos Kalogeropoulos, Michalis Maniatis, Themis Bazaka, Nikos Dimitratos, Giorgos Zorbas, Konstantinos Tzoumas, Vicky Vanita', null, 'The story of a group of Rembetes, singers and musicians of the Greek equivalent to the blues, in the early decades of the 20th century, seen through the eyes of a young female singer.', 'The story of a group of Rembetes, singers and musicians of the Greek equivalent to the blues, in the early decades of the 20th century, seen through the eyes of a young female singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bruXtZhukST9eP2ABKanlltoBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47736'),
  ('793290528089119503', 'Rembrandt', 1936, 'Drama, History', 'Alexander Korda, John Pommer, Hal Waller', 'Carl Zuckmayer, June Head, Lajos Biró', 'Charles Laughton, Gertrude Lawrence, Elsa Lanchester, Edward Chapman, Walter Hudd, Roger Livesey, John Bryning, Sam Livesey', 'NR', 'A character study depicting the life of Rembrandt Van Rijn at the height of his fame in the mid 1600s. Beginning with the death of his wife, Rembrandt''s work takes a dark turn, which offends many of his patrons.', 'A character study depicting the life of Rembrandt Van Rijn at the height of his fame in the mid 1600s. Beginning with the death of his wife, Rembrandt''s work takes a dark turn, which offends many of his patrons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGoJsDTITN1WBCEUzbSQEEUIGzj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50031'),
  ('896350978901714259', 'Rembrandt fecit 1669', 1977, 'Drama', 'Jos Stelling, Ernest Bresser', 'Wil Hildebrand, Chiem van Houweninge, Jos Stelling', 'Frans Stelling, Ton de Koff, Lucie Singeling, Aya Gil, Hanneke van der Velden, Ed Kolmeijer, Henk Douze, Lex Drijver', null, 'In the final year of his life, Rembrandt painted a series of self-portraits that show him in a dark, lonely state of mind. Stelling has painstakingly recreated the pathetic end of a genius with an authenticity that allows viewers to infer their own conclusions about the relationship between Rembrandt''s life and art.', 'In the final year of his life, Rembrandt painted a series of self-portraits that show him in a dark, lonely state of mind. Stelling has painstakingly recreated the pathetic end of a genius with an authenticity that allows viewers to infer their own conclusions about the relationship between Rembrandt''s life and art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpLJxc23ipP3jm1uYQXpFVDxYOo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57410'),
  ('676645636860316730', 'Remedial Reading Comprehension', 1970, null, 'Owen Land', null, 'Owen Land', null, 'Landow rejects the dream imagery of the historical trance film for the self-referential present, using macrobiotics, the language of advertising, and a speed-reading test on the definition of hokum. The alienated filmmaker appears, running uphill to distance himself from the lyrical cinema, but remember, "This is a film about you, not about its maker."', 'Landow rejects the dream imagery of the historical trance film for the self-referential present, using macrobiotics, the language of advertising, and a speed-reading test on the definition of hokum. The alienated filmmaker appears, running uphill to distance himself from the lyrical cinema, but remember, "This is a film about you, not about its maker."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gP0C6feaUHpV2NXXGooDu6UQnN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208640'),
  ('94536092072682051', 'Remember', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Atom Egoyan, Paul Sarossy, Karl Irvine', 'Benjamin August', 'Christopher Plummer, Bruno Ganz, Jürgen Prochnow, Heinz Lieven, Henry Czerny, Dean Norris, Martin Landau, Kim Roberts', 'R', 'With the aid of a fellow Auschwitz survivor and a hand-written letter, an elderly man with dementia goes in search of the person responsible for the death of his family.', 'With the aid of a fellow Auschwitz survivor and a hand-written letter, an elderly man with dementia goes in search of the person responsible for the death of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x496Ip0weJYfsEX23eNyzG4MjXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302528'),
  ('776233552246347789', 'Remember', 2022, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Yu Eok, Bae Il-hyuck, Lee Il-hyung', 'Lee Il-hyung, Yoon Jong-bin', 'Lee Sung-min, Nam Joo-hyuk, Park Keun-hyong, Jeong Man-sik, Yoon Je-moon, Song Young-chang, Moon Chang-gil, Choi Min-chul', null, 'Pil-ju, an Alzheimer''s patient in his 80s, who lost all his family during the Japanese colonial era, and devotes his lifelong revenge before his memories disappear, and a young man in his 20s who helps him.', 'Pil-ju, an Alzheimer''s patient in his 80s, who lost all his family during the Japanese colonial era, and devotes his lifelong revenge before his memories disappear, and a young man in his 20s who helps him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8y9mhh3PqGPXbZVhX7Mc25OJpHP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633374'),
  ('463135880592699562', 'Remember Me', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Allen Coulter, Jonathan Freeman', 'Will Fetters', 'Robert Pattinson, Emilie de Ravin, Pierce Brosnan, Lena Olin, Chris Cooper, Ruby Jerins, Gregory Jbara, Tate Ellington', 'PG-13', 'Still reeling from a heartbreaking family event and his parents'' subsequent divorce, Tyler Hawkins discovers a fresh lease on life when he meets Ally Craig, a gregarious beauty who witnessed her mother''s death. But as the couple draws closer, the fallout from their separate tragedies jeopardizes their love.', 'Still reeling from a heartbreaking family event and his parents'' subsequent divorce, Tyler Hawkins discovers a fresh lease on life when he meets Ally Craig, a gregarious beauty who witnessed her mother''s death. But as the couple draws closer, the fallout from their separate tragedies jeopardizes their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7umuMiLCHvWT7wYhFKJOTFSokF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23169'),
  ('993283127938240403', 'Remember Me, Mommy?', 2020, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Christina Ienna, Michelle Ouellet', 'Adam Rockoff, Zachary Valenti', 'Natalie Brown, Sydney Ozerov-Meyer, Amalia Williamson, Taveeta Szymanowicz, Kristopher Turner, Jenna Warren, Eman Ayaz, Vivianne Collins', null, 'Rebecca, a respected teacher at a private girls school, has her life turned upside down when a new scholarship student arrives who might be the daughter she gave up for adoption seventeen years ago.', 'Rebecca, a respected teacher at a private girls school, has her life turned upside down when a new scholarship student arrives who might be the daughter she gave up for adoption seventeen years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alG0x2eq9ntWL5NYGJs2g7IBiAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:688043'),
  ('43995145443063490', 'Remember Me, My Love', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Gabriele Muccino, Marcello Montarsi, Francesco Vedovati', 'Heidrun Schleef, Gabriele Muccino', 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Laura Morante, Monica Bellucci, Silvio Muccino, Nicoletta Romanoff, Gabriele Lavia, Enrico Silvestrin, Alberto Gimignani', 'R', 'A middle-class Italian family is tore apart when the father meets an old flame, the mother—a frustrated onetime actress—auditions for a play, their insecure son tries to make friends through drugs, and their underaged daughter—who has already figured out how to use sex to her advantage—does what she does best to appear on TV.', 'A middle-class Italian family is tore apart when the father meets an old flame, the mother—a frustrated onetime actress—auditions for a play, their insecure son tries to make friends through drugs, and their underaged daughter—who has already figured out how to use sex to her advantage—does what she does best to appear on TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GcAGqAtaSfD8V2ULGV1v6CROPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38970'),
  ('404543333643861040', 'Remember My Name', 1978, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alan Rudolph, Tommy Thompson, Peter L. Bergquist', 'Alan Rudolph', 'Geraldine Chaplin, Anthony Perkins, Moses Gunn, Berry Berenson, Jeff Goldblum, Tim Thomerson, Alfre Woodard, Marilyn Coleman', 'R', 'Just released from prison, a young woman arrives in town to "start a new life," but soon begins stalking a married construction worker for no apparent reason, turning his life inside out and eventually terrorizing him and his wife.', 'Just released from prison, a young woman arrives in town to "start a new life," but soon begins stalking a married construction worker for no apparent reason, turning his life inside out and eventually terrorizing him and his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stqQ9ImdkIKeEYlMo9OHnVhFune.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84207'),
  ('670241811784217864', 'Remember Sunday', 2013, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Michael Lohmann, Jeff Bleckner', null, 'Alexis Bledel, Zachary Levi, Merritt Wever, Barry Shabaka Henley, Valerie Azlynn, David Hoffman, Jerry Adler, Ann McKenzie', 'PG', 'A lonely, down-on-her-luck waitress meets a handsome, quirky jewelry store clerk and thinks that maybe, finally, she''s met Mr. Right. The more Molly gets to know Gus, the more she''s intrigued by him. But she''s also mystified. Gus is absent-minded, preoccupied. Is he hiding something? The short answer is: yes. He''s reluctant to share with her that since suffering a brain aneurysm, he''s totally lost his short-term memory. Every day is a brand new day, his life starts anew. Every day he sees Molly he struggles to remember who she is and what she represents. Every day, he has to fall in love with her all over again.', 'A lonely, down-on-her-luck waitress meets a handsome, quirky jewelry store clerk and thinks that maybe, finally, she''s met Mr. Right. The more Molly gets to know Gus, the more she''s intrigued by him. But she''s also mystified. Gus is absent-minded, preoccupied. Is he hiding something? The short answer is: yes. He''s reluctant to share with her that since suffering a brain aneurysm, he''s totally lost his short-term memory. Every day is a brand new day, his life starts anew. Every day he sees Molly he struggles to remember who she is and what she represents. Every day, he has to fall in love with her all over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/triS1L9nHDjVwWmYNBItgDo525P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188538'),
  ('819453764026532482', 'Remember the Daze', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jess Bond, Steve Gainer', 'Jess Bond', 'Amber Heard, Alexa PenaVega, Leighton Meester, Melonie Díaz, Lyndsy Fonseca, Christopher Rodriguez Marquette, John Robinson, Brie Larson', 'R', 'During the summer of 1999, a group of teenagers, through interconnected narratives, live through their last day of high school and prepare for the future. Holly, once the new girl in school, does whatever it takes to remain popular. Dawn, who is secretly a lesbian, battles drugs. Tori is the valedictorian of her class, but, on the eve of graduation, she decides to experiment with drugs for the first time.', 'During the summer of 1999, a group of teenagers, through interconnected narratives, live through their last day of high school and prepare for the future. Holly, once the new girl in school, does whatever it takes to remain popular. Dawn, who is secretly a lesbian, battles drugs. Tori is the valedictorian of her class, but, on the eve of graduation, she decides to experiment with drugs for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQajjglgJ6liZnVo6jeNzlkn9Na.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20224'),
  ('431043883569239711', 'Remember the Night', 1940, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Ted Tetzlaff, Mitchell Leisen, Hal Walker', 'Preston Sturges', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Fred MacMurray, Beulah Bondi, Elizabeth Patterson, Willard Robertson, Sterling Holloway, Charles Waldron, Paul Guilfoyle', 'NR', 'Unexpected love blossoms when an assistant district attorney agrees to take a recidivist shoplifter home so she doesn''t have to spend Christmas alone in jail.', 'Unexpected love blossoms when an assistant district attorney agrees to take a recidivist shoplifter home so she doesn''t have to spend Christmas alone in jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPeGe9VApDwwWgUSRiUCch7Huj7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29617'),
  ('1016151970462367140', 'Remember us', 2018, 'Drama', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Altan Erkekli, Tolga Tekin, Özge Özberk, Binnur Kaya, Sumru Yavrucuk, Su Burcu Yazgı Coşkun, Cem Kurtoğlu, Yeşim Gül Akşar', null, 'Kaan has difficulty getting a higher position in his work where he has built a good career. While he was occupied with his wife, children and his work, he has pretty much neglected his father. Until one day he is obliged to take care of him.', 'Kaan has difficulty getting a higher position in his work where he has built a good career. While he was occupied with his wife, children and his work, he has pretty much neglected his father. Until one day he is obliged to take care of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUKsySzpJ5OBc1qJK4hiiU6NcRT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540845'),
  ('416346506709982135', 'Remember You', 2016, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery', 'Lee Yoon-jeong, Lee Sung-jae, Choi Chan-min', 'Lee Yoon-jeong', 'Jung Woo-sung, Kim Ha-neul, On Ju-wan, Im Joo-eun, Jang Young-nam, Kwon Hae-hyo, Bae Sung-woo, Heo Jin', null, 'A mysterious woman enters the life of Suk-won, a lawyer who has lost his memory. As their relationship develops, secrets embedded in his memory slowly surface.', 'A mysterious woman enters the life of Suk-won, a lawyer who has lost his memory. As their relationship develops, secrets embedded in his memory slowly surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIDz8PU21oR8sLCYqXbHbwW2l3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376847'),
  ('817948893412167978', 'Remember Your Name', 1974, 'War, Drama', 'Sergey Kolosov, Bogusław Lambach, Vladimir Krachkovskiy', 'Ernest Bryll, Janusz Krasiński, Sergey Kolosov', 'Lyudmila Kasatkina, Lyudmila Ivanova, Vladimir Ivashov, Yana Poplavskaya, Ruben Simonov, Lyubov Sokolova, Valentina Telegina, Valentina Titova', null, 'Beginning of WWII. Zinaida, a Russian woman, is taken prisoner by the Germans and sent to Auschwitz concentration camp together with several other women. She is imprisoned with her baby son, Gena, who is learning to walk and takes his first steps in the snow, in the concentration camp. They spend a few years together in the camp until they are separated, first within Auschwitz itself, then, for good, when the Germans are losing the war and decide to evacuate.', 'Beginning of WWII. Zinaida, a Russian woman, is taken prisoner by the Germans and sent to Auschwitz concentration camp together with several other women. She is imprisoned with her baby son, Gena, who is learning to walk and takes his first steps in the snow, in the concentration camp. They spend a few years together in the camp until they are separated, first within Auschwitz itself, then, for good, when the Germans are losing the war and decide to evacuate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Q1AS9n2ffz5k7R28ExRXbgG2lU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294716'),
  ('1138479925276212298', 'Remembrance', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Anna Justice, Sebastian Edschmid', 'Pamela Katz', 'Alice Dwyer, Mateusz Damięcki, Dagmar Manzel, Lech Mackiewicz, Susanne Lothar, Joanna Kulig, David Rasche, Adrian Topol', null, 'Hannah, a young Jewish girl, is rescued from a concentration camp by her Polish boyfriend, and believes he died after their perilous escape. More than 30 years later, the married Hannah faces an emotional crisis when she learns he''s alive.', 'Hannah, a young Jewish girl, is rescued from a concentration camp by her Polish boyfriend, and believes he died after their perilous escape. More than 30 years later, the married Hannah faces an emotional crisis when she learns he''s alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ftq8Ah6ITaMUPuKt09X2xliOnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114189'),
  ('898651548777870938', 'Remembrance of Things to Come', 2001, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Yannick Bellon', 'Chris Marker, Yannick Bellon', 'Pierre Arditi', null, 'A personal history of France, told through photos by French photographer Denise Bellon.', 'A personal history of France, told through photos by French photographer Denise Bellon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KYP7Pz3O9NTBqc0eiakELkASJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31338'),
  ('1119418195683650161', 'Rememory', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery', 'Gregory Middleton, Mark Palansky', 'Mark Palansky, Mike Vukadinovich', 'Peter Dinklage, Julia Ormond, Martin Donovan, Anton Yelchin, Henry Ian Cusick, Evelyne Brochu, Gracyn Shinyei, Jordana Largy', 'PG-13', 'The widow of a wise professor stumbles upon one of his inventions that''s able to record and play a person''s memory.', 'The widow of a wise professor stumbles upon one of his inventions that''s able to record and play a person''s memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qz3mvkpTOQOEqzxenvaaObOMarj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395814'),
  ('124817987952922625', 'Reminders of Him', 2026, 'Romance, Drama', 'Vanessa Caswill, Tim Ives, Richard Cowan', 'Lauren Levine, Colleen Hoover', 'Maika Monroe, Tyriq Withers, Rudy Pankow, Bradley Whitford, Lauren Graham, Zoe Kosovic, Nicholas Duvernay, Jennifer Robertson', 'PG-13', 'When Diem''s custodial grandparents adamantly refuse Kenna''s attempts to see her daughter, Kenna discovers unexpected compassion, and then something truer and deeper, with former NFL player and local bar owner Ledger. As their secret romance develops, so do the dangers for both of them, leading Kenna toward heartbreak and, ultimately, the hope for a second chance.', 'When Diem''s custodial grandparents adamantly refuse Kenna''s attempts to see her daughter, Kenna discovers unexpected compassion, and then something truer and deeper, with former NFL player and local bar owner Ledger. As their secret romance develops, so do the dangers for both of them, leading Kenna toward heartbreak and, ultimately, the hope for a second chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7L6rceYgzQ0NeHD7PRDNrRoQ291.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1367642'),
  ('553781338817983386', 'Reminiscence', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Yasuo Furuhata, Toshimasa Miyamura, Daisaku Kimura', 'Takeshi Aoshima, Tomoyuki Takimoto', 'Junichi Okada, Shun Oguri, Tasuku Emoto, Masami Nagasawa, Fumino Kimura, Sakura Ando, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Kenichi Yajima', null, 'A detective in Toyama is forced to confront his painful past when he takes on a murder case involving his two estranged childhood friends.', 'A detective in Toyama is forced to confront his painful past when he takes on a murder case involving his two estranged childhood friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmzRfhh7489WGi3EWBogXxx0gEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451450'),
  ('351184046671651362', 'Reminiscence', 2021, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Scott Plauche, Brandon Lambdin, Kevin Lum', 'Lisa Joy', 'Hugh Jackman, Rebecca Ferguson, Thandiwe Newton, Cliff Curtis, Marina de Tavira, Daniel Wu, Mojean Aria, Brett Cullen', 'PG-13', 'Nicolas Bannister, a rugged and solitary veteran living in a near-future Miami flooded by rising seas, is an expert in a dangerous occupation: he offers clients the chance to relive any memory they desire. His life changes when he meets a mysterious young woman named Mae. What begins as a simple matter of lost and found becomes a passionate love affair. But when a different client''s memories implicate Mae in a series of violent crimes, Bannister must delve through the dark world of the past to uncover the truth about the woman he fell for.', 'Nicolas Bannister, a rugged and solitary veteran living in a near-future Miami flooded by rising seas, is an expert in a dangerous occupation: he offers clients the chance to relive any memory they desire. His life changes when he meets a mysterious young woman named Mae. What begins as a simple matter of lost and found becomes a passionate love affair. But when a different client''s memories implicate Mae in a series of violent crimes, Bannister must delve through the dark world of the past to uncover the truth about the woman he fell for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17siH6wJRQ2jZiqz9BWUhy1UtZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579047'),
  ('63869107663583899', 'Reminiscences of a Journey to Lithuania', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Jonas Mekas', 'Jonas Mekas', 'Pola Chapelle, Peter Kubelka, Adolfas Mekas, Jonas Mekas, Hollis Melton, Annette Michelson, Daniel Rogosin', null, 'Jonas Mekas weaves an elegiac diary film from his 1971–72 return to Lithuania, chronicling a visit to his birthplace of Semeniškiai after decades in exile. Blending personal memory with documentary observation, the film becomes both a portrait of homecoming and a meditation on displacement, family, and the passage of time.', 'Jonas Mekas weaves an elegiac diary film from his 1971–72 return to Lithuania, chronicling a visit to his birthplace of Semeniškiai after decades in exile. Blending personal memory with documentary observation, the film becomes both a portrait of homecoming and a meditation on displacement, family, and the passage of time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnnVqci7fGZFDXBLnxP9nHUCI2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148811'),
  ('360879477549244048', 'Remo Williams: The Adventure Begins', 1985, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Guy Hamilton, Andrew Laszlo, Jane Jenkins', 'Christopher Wood', 'Fred Ward, Joel Grey, Wilford Brimley, J.A. Preston, George Coe, Kate Mulgrew, Charles Cioffi, Patrick Kilpatrick', 'PG-13', 'Tough Brooklyn street cop Sam Makin is unwillingly recruited as an assassin for a secret United States organization known as CURE, who fake his death and give him a new identity: Remo Williams. With his appearance surgically altered, Williams is trained to be a human killing machine by his aged, derisive and impassive Korean martial arts master Chiun.', 'Tough Brooklyn street cop Sam Makin is unwillingly recruited as an assassin for a secret United States organization known as CURE, who fake his death and give him a new identity: Remo Williams. With his appearance surgically altered, Williams is trained to be a human killing machine by his aged, derisive and impassive Korean martial arts master Chiun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/it52uz6io8cA6WGzWxSbn9jgRlu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10553'),
  ('457849258322407496', 'Remonstrance', 1972, 'Drama, Crime', 'Erik Løchen, Knut Gløersen', 'Erik Løchen', 'Espen Skjønberg, Per Theodor Haugen, Kari Rasmussen, Knut Husebø, Anne Marie Ottersen, Ole-Jørgen Nilsen, Ragnar Baartvedt, Jahn Pedersen', null, 'A meta-film about a film and the common man in our own political reality. A reality that is just scenes of a film without any cinematic development, but which might be plain reality tomorrow.', 'A meta-film about a film and the common man in our own political reality. A reality that is just scenes of a film without any cinematic development, but which might be plain reality tomorrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hjG4uiDAvNSAzGl7bBHVzlmWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47448'),
  ('86708657410121163', 'Remote', 1993, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Ted Nicolaou, Adolfo Bartoli', 'Tommy Sledge', 'Chris Carrara, Jessica Bowman, John Diehl, Tony Longo, Stuart Fratkin, Derya Ruggles, Jordan Belfi, Kenneth A. Brown', 'PG', 'When 13-year-old Randy is forced to stash his remote control toys in a model home, he stumbles across the hideout of three prison escapees. With the use of his remote control toys, Randy manages to apprehend the three fugitives.', 'When 13-year-old Randy is forced to stash his remote control toys in a model home, he stumbles across the hideout of three prison escapees. With the use of his remote control toys, Randy manages to apprehend the three fugitives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zAnexLuuAyFnFCAk8Z94FVRbUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49345'),
  ('503376131543968764', 'Remote Control', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Jeff Lieberman, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Jeff Lieberman', 'Kevin Dillon, Deborah Goodrich, Christopher Wynne, Frank Beddor, Jennifer Tilly, Kaaren Lee, Bert Remsen, Jamie McEnnan', 'R', 'A video store clerk stumbles onto an alien plot to take over earth by brainwashing people with a bad ''50s science fiction movie. He and his friends race to stop the aliens before the tapes can be distributed world-wide.', 'A video store clerk stumbles onto an alien plot to take over earth by brainwashing people with a bad ''50s science fiction movie. He and his friends race to stop the aliens before the tapes can be distributed world-wide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jB44zLKtSrPA11LTPTEZH6mS0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60410'),
  ('187990629899426182', 'Renacidos: El Padre Pío cambió sus vidas', 2019, 'Documentary', 'José María Zavala, Vicente Gayo', 'José María Zavala', null, null, 'José María Zavala returns to directing to produce the sequel to the feature film The Mystery of Padre Pío. On this occasion he will once again address the life of Saint Pio de Pieltrecina, a priest known for his miraculous gifts, both in life and post mortem. However, this second part is more focused on testimonials and more specific cases. Zavala will delve into the experience of 24 people, who, like him, were blessed by the religious, and who, according to what they say, as a result of that moment, their lives changed completely.', 'José María Zavala returns to directing to produce the sequel to the feature film The Mystery of Padre Pío. On this occasion he will once again address the life of Saint Pio de Pieltrecina, a priest known for his miraculous gifts, both in life and post mortem. However, this second part is more focused on testimonials and more specific cases. Zavala will delve into the experience of 24 people, who, like him, were blessed by the religious, and who, according to what they say, as a result of that moment, their lives changed completely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98ni71uKXXbUfVqY2A2iihNEZbB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648324'),
  ('1028718293619011993', 'Renaissance', 1967, 'Animation', 'Walerian Borowczyk, Claude Copin, Guy Durban', 'Walerian Borowczyk', null, null, 'To the sound of trumpets, a collection of pulverised antique bric-a-brac begins to reassemble itself, revealing a stuffed owl, a cornet, a hamper, books, a doll, a plate – and a bomb...', 'To the sound of trumpets, a collection of pulverised antique bric-a-brac begins to reassemble itself, revealing a stuffed owl, a cornet, a hamper, books, a doll, a plate – and a bomb...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWry8cxDjZLcqQDRkgOXUIdoqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147994'),
  ('561326116522685396', 'Renaissance', 2006, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Christian Volckman, Pierre Avon', 'Alexandre de La Patellière, Matthieu Delaporte', 'Patrick Floersheim, Virginie Mery, Laura Blanc, Gabriel Le Doze, Marc Cassot, Bruno Choël, Jérôme Pauwels, Marc Alfos', 'R', 'To find Ilona and unlock the secrets of her disappearance, Karas must plunge deep into the parallel worlds of corporate espionage, organized crime and genetic research - where the truth imprisons whoever finds it first and miracles can be bought but at a great price.', 'To find Ilona and unlock the secrets of her disappearance, Karas must plunge deep into the parallel worlds of corporate espionage, organized crime and genetic research - where the truth imprisons whoever finds it first and miracles can be bought but at a great price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTdbmjAegzFQOCPTAckPcmTpJvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9389'),
  ('345528966346742050', 'Renaissance Man', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Penny Marshall, Adam Greenberg, K.C. Hodenfield', 'Jim Burnstein', 'Danny DeVito, Gregory Hines, James Remar, Ed Begley Jr., Lillo Brancato, Stacey Dash, Kadeem Hardison, Cliff Robertson', 'PG-13', 'An advertising man is slowly sliding downhill. When he is fired from his job in Detroit, he signs up for unemployment. One day they find him a job: teaching thinking skills to Army recruits. He arrives on base to find that there is no structure set up for the class.', 'An advertising man is slowly sliding downhill. When he is fired from his job in Detroit, he signs up for unemployment. One day they find him a job: teaching thinking skills to Army recruits. He arrives on base to find that there is no structure set up for the class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPRtaSfN8gNWFclgrcg5oD3V41i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11858'),
  ('236636142571954978', 'Renaissance: A Film by Beyoncé', 2023, 'Music, Documentary', 'Beyoncé, Beyoncé, Andrew Makadsi', 'Beyoncé', 'Beyoncé, Jay-Z, Blue Ivy Carter, Sir Carter, Rumi Carter, Kendrick Lamar, Tina Knowles, Larry Bourgeois', 'NR', 'Accentuates the journey of Renaissance World Tour, from its inception, to the opening in Stockholm, Sweden, to the finale in Kansas City, Missouri. It is about Beyoncé’s intention, hard work, involvement in every aspect of the production, her creative mind and purpose to create her legacy, and master her craft. Received with extraordinary acclaim, Beyoncé’s Renaissance World Tour created a sanctuary for freedom, and shared joy, for more than 2.7 million fans.', 'Accentuates the journey of Renaissance World Tour, from its inception, to the opening in Stockholm, Sweden, to the finale in Kansas City, Missouri. It is about Beyoncé’s intention, hard work, involvement in every aspect of the production, her creative mind and purpose to create her legacy, and master her craft. Received with extraordinary acclaim, Beyoncé’s Renaissance World Tour created a sanctuary for freedom, and shared joy, for more than 2.7 million fans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sVB5xuQq9njHK455JdwgN8Tx07.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1185743'),
  ('662193676866100976', 'Renart the Fox', 2005, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Thierry Schiel', 'Thierry Schiel, Erika Strobel', 'Lorànt Deutsch, Frédéric Diefenthal, Marc Bretonnière, Denise Metmer, Henri Poirier, Antoine Nouel, Elisabeth Fargeot, Hervé Jolly', null, 'Renart is a sly fox who can always chit-chat his way out of sticky situations. In his quest for an elusive treasure, Renart has ample opportunity to demonstrate how a quick mind can triumph over brute strength.', 'Renart is a sly fox who can always chit-chat his way out of sticky situations. In his quest for an elusive treasure, Renart has ample opportunity to demonstrate how a quick mind can triumph over brute strength.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zsgp36DvGXKNI1dmL28vfEuuRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94191'),
  ('542296611607426361', 'Rend Your Heart', 2018, 'Drama', 'Glauco Urbim, Matheus Piccoli, Bel Merel', 'Ana Luíza Azevedo, Jorge Furtado, Vicente Moreno', 'Marco Ricca, Drica Moraes, Chay Suede, George Sauma, João Pedro Zappa, Luisa Arraes, Anderson Vieira, Nelson Diniz', null, '40 years after fighting for what he thought was new and revolutionary, a former anonymous militant against the now fallen Brazilian dictatorship is accused of being conservative, antiquated and anachronistic by his own son.', '40 years after fighting for what he thought was new and revolutionary, a former anonymous militant against the now fallen Brazilian dictatorship is accused of being conservative, antiquated and anachronistic by his own son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21TGdSdl4zPtggfmhNyNgPpFzfN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555590'),
  ('166354298176673646', 'Rendel', 2017, 'Action, Fantasy, Crime', 'Tero Saikkonen, Jesse Haaja', 'Timo Puustinen, Miika J. Norvanto, Pekka Lehtosaari', 'Kris Gummerus, Rami Rusinen, Renne Korppila, Matti Onnismaa, Johnny Vivash, Bianca Bradey, Sheila Shah, Alina Tomnikov', 'NR', 'Rendel, a masked superhero, becomes blinded by his desire for revenge against a sinister criminal organization.', 'Rendel, a masked superhero, becomes blinded by his desire for revenge against a sinister criminal organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZiNrIRYblaJZE9m0M80IU1E2zP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397852'),
  ('229916692630849720', 'Rendez-vous', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'André Téchiné, Bruno Herbulot, Michel Béna', 'Olivier Assayas, André Téchiné', 'Lambert Wilson, Juliette Binoche, Wadeck Stanczak, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Dominique Lavanant, Jean-Louis Vitrac, Jacques Nolot, Anne Wiazemsky', null, 'Nina is a young, carefree actress who arrives in Paris searching for her big break. There, she finds drama both on- and offstage as she becomes involved with three men: a mild-mannered real-estate agent who offers her stability, a bad-boy actor who lives dangerously on the edge, and an intense theater director who casts her in a production of “Romeo and Juliet.” As opening night approaches, the emotional extremes of Nina’s love life fuel her art.', 'Nina is a young, carefree actress who arrives in Paris searching for her big break. There, she finds drama both on- and offstage as she becomes involved with three men: a mild-mannered real-estate agent who offers her stability, a bad-boy actor who lives dangerously on the edge, and an intense theater director who casts her in a production of “Romeo and Juliet.” As opening night approaches, the emotional extremes of Nina’s love life fuel her art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rICHxS03w4peWxcdGgT8pyb9eOp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34093'),
