  ('391659875258128796', 'Rendition', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Dion Beebe, Gavin Hood, Kevin Constant', 'Kelley Sane', 'Reese Witherspoon, Jake Gyllenhaal, Meryl Streep, Alan Arkin, Peter Sarsgaard, Omar Metwally, Igal Naor, Hadar Ratzon Rotem', 'R', 'When an Egyptian terrorism suspect "disappears" on a flight from Africa to Washington DC, his American wife and a CIA analyst find themselves caught up in a struggle to secure his release from a secret detention facility somewhere outside the US.', 'When an Egyptian terrorism suspect "disappears" on a flight from Africa to Washington DC, his American wife and a CIA analyst find themselves caught up in a struggle to secure his release from a secret detention facility somewhere outside the US.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uW8gNhIJkNabd0AIafWqFRxB8Os.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5125'),
  ('859785555938133250', 'Renegade', 1987, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Western', 'Alfio Contini, Enzo Barboni, Richard Nebeker', 'Marco Barboni', 'Terence Hill, Robert Vaughn, Ross Hill, Norman Bowler, Donald Hodson, Beatrice Palme, Lisa Ann Rubin, Luisa Maneri', 'PG', 'While on his travel across the Southwestern United States, with his Jeep CJ Renegade and his chestnut colt named Joe Brown, Luke meets Matt, son of a friend of his, Moose, who is in jail. Moose asks Luke to take care of Matt, and to help him to take possession of a piece of land. So starts their travel, full of adventures...', 'While on his travel across the Southwestern United States, with his Jeep CJ Renegade and his chestnut colt named Joe Brown, Luke meets Matt, son of a friend of his, Moose, who is in jail. Moose asks Luke to take care of Matt, and to help him to take possession of a piece of land. So starts their travel, full of adventures...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgwKoRfTaOgA3uWAEGhN3gsO7c0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11496'),
  ('547555438135684932', 'Renegade', 2004, 'Western', 'Jan Kounen, Tetsuo Nagata, Julián Valdez', 'Matthieu Le Naour, Gérard Brach, Louis Mellis', 'Vincent Cassel, Juliette Lewis, Temuera Morrison, Ernest Borgnine, Djimon Hounsou, Hugh O''Conor, Michael Madsen, Geoffrey Lewis', 'R', 'U.S Marshal Mike Donovan has dark memories of the death of his first love. He keeps peace between the Americans and the natives who had temporarily adopted and taken care of him. The evil actions of a white sorcerer lead him to confront the villain in the Sacred Mountains, and, through shamanic rituals conquer his fears and uncover a suppressed memory he would much rather deny.', 'U.S Marshal Mike Donovan has dark memories of the death of his first love. He keeps peace between the Americans and the natives who had temporarily adopted and taken care of him. The evil actions of a white sorcerer lead him to confront the villain in the Sacred Mountains, and, through shamanic rituals conquer his fears and uncover a suppressed memory he would much rather deny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDq2epiQUALGfYum0ijn51Re41o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10046'),
  ('1143351821790276940', 'Renegade Force', 1998, 'Action, Thriller', 'Martin Kunert, Adam Kane', 'Rick Bloggs, Alan Schechter', 'Michael Rooker, Robert Patrick, Louis Mandylor, Diane DiLascio, James Kisicki, Darnell Suttles, Charles Brown, Jeff Blanchard', 'R', 'An FBI Agent and a female cop join forces to stop renegade cops who are offing the bad guys. Robert Patrick is the leader of the renegades and Louis Mandylor is a reluctant young cop that is brought into the hit team.', 'An FBI Agent and a female cop join forces to stop renegade cops who are offing the bad guys. Robert Patrick is the leader of the renegades and Louis Mandylor is a reluctant young cop that is brought into the hit team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeVI6u7g00S598hnjkGHRK4VFPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62040'),
  ('99653204876515094', 'Renegade Immortal: Battle of Gods', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'TouXiong Shi, Li Zhenfeng, Wang Jianxin', 'Ma Hua, Wang Ziyue, Zheng Yinglu', 'Shi Zekun, Zhang Huilin, Liu Cong, Chen Zhangtaikang, Li Haojia, Zhuang Miao, Ling Jun, Liu Sicen', null, 'Behind the Ancient God''s Land, the Eternal Night Demon City in the Demon Cultivation Sea rises overnight. In order to expand its territory, it attacks the sects around the Sea, including the Yuntian Sect. Li Muwan is poisoned in the battle to protect the gate, leaving her life at stake. After Wang Lin learns of this, he takes her into the Sea again. Wang Lin fights the three city lords with his initial cultivation of the God of Incarnation, and becomes famous in the Sea. He returns with the antidote to save Li Muwan, but finds that the crisis unresolved, and the thousand-year conspiracy surfaces. Relying on their feelings and the first fusion with the body of the Ancient God after the God of Incarnation, Li Muwan and Wang Lin join forces to defeat the Demon Lord.', 'Behind the Ancient God''s Land, the Eternal Night Demon City in the Demon Cultivation Sea rises overnight. In order to expand its territory, it attacks the sects around the Sea, including the Yuntian Sect. Li Muwan is poisoned in the battle to protect the gate, leaving her life at stake. After Wang Lin learns of this, he takes her into the Sea again. Wang Lin fights the three city lords with his initial cultivation of the God of Incarnation, and becomes famous in the Sea. He returns with the antidote to save Li Muwan, but finds that the crisis unresolved, and the thousand-year conspiracy surfaces. Relying on their feelings and the first fusion with the body of the Ancient God after the God of Incarnation, Li Muwan and Wang Lin join forces to defeat the Demon Lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fa9cOfzN1wVCTnyPTnVTQCEOKM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1483614'),
  ('671587015728511577', 'Renegades', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jack Sholder, Phil Meheux, William Spahic', 'David Rich', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Lou Diamond Phillips, Jami Gertz, Robert Knepper, Bill Smitrovich, Peter MacNeill, Floyd ''Red Crow'' Westerman, Joseph Griffin', 'R', 'While investigating police corruption in his department, undercover cop Buster McHenry is forced to participate in a heist, leading to innocent casualties and the theft of an ancient Lakota tribal spear. After McHenry ends up severely wounded, he is taken in by Native American Hank Storm, who is out to recover the spear and avenge the death of a loved one in the heist.', 'While investigating police corruption in his department, undercover cop Buster McHenry is forced to participate in a heist, leading to innocent casualties and the theft of an ancient Lakota tribal spear. After McHenry ends up severely wounded, he is taken in by Native American Hank Storm, who is out to recover the spear and avenge the death of a loved one in the heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjO1uOtR91o0LaCKXJHaiThIao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20307'),
  ('676215356571159244', 'Renegades', 2017, 'Thriller, Action', 'Steven Quale, Adina Herbell, Cornelia Ott', 'Luc Besson, Richard Wenk', 'J.K. Simmons, Sullivan Stapleton, Charlie Bewley, Sylvia Hoeks, Joshua Henry, Diarmaid Murtagh, Dimitri Leonidas, Clemens Schick', 'PG-13', 'In the midst of the Balkan wars, a squad of Navy SEALs attempts to unravel a long-forgotten mystery after discovering an enormous treasure trove hidden at the bottom of a lake in Serbia.', 'In the midst of the Balkan wars, a squad of Navy SEALs attempts to unravel a long-forgotten mystery after discovering an enormous treasure trove hidden at the bottom of a lake in Serbia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hx4nxhesaagsvJNhRw2fTobg8o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335788'),
  ('1018469211051875357', 'Renegades', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Daniel Zirilli, Vince Knight', 'Tom Jolliffe', 'Nick Moran, Lee Majors, Ian Ogilvy, Patsy Kensit, Louis Mandylor, Michael Paré, Danny Trejo, Billy Murray', 'R', 'When a retired Green Beret soldier is murdered by an Albanian drug gang in London, four of his veteran SAS comrades set out to avenge him, dispensing their own brand of justice on the streets of London.', 'When a retired Green Beret soldier is murdered by an Albanian drug gang in London, four of his veteran SAS comrades set out to avenge him, dispensing their own brand of justice on the streets of London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QvhJsoFbcWsrY0iXGhZTKQaQAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913604'),
  ('692901928714904391', 'Renfield', 2023, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Chris McKay, Mitchell Amundsen, Jason Inman', 'Ryan Ridley', 'Nicholas Hoult, Nicolas Cage, Awkwafina, Ben Schwartz, Shohreh Aghdashloo, Brandon Scott Jones, Adrian Martinez, Camille Chen', 'R', 'Having grown sick and tired of his centuries as Dracula''s lackey, Renfield finds a new lease on life — and maybe even redemption — when he falls for feisty, perennially angry traffic cop Rebecca Quincy.', 'Having grown sick and tired of his centuries as Dracula''s lackey, Renfield finds a new lease on life — and maybe even redemption — when he falls for feisty, perennially angry traffic cop Rebecca Quincy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6yUjhvNGQpFZilKwOKbxQ1eHlo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649609'),
  ('718974405687828411', 'Renner', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robert Rippberger, Sean Emer', 'David Largman Murray, Martin Medina', 'Frankie Muniz, Violett Beane, Marcia Gay Harden, Taylor Gray, Craig Lamar Traylor, Estes Tarver', 'NR', 'A computer genius invents an A.I life coach to help him find love, but realizes too late he accidentally programmed his manipulative mother into the code.', 'A computer genius invents an A.I life coach to help him find love, but realizes too late he accidentally programmed his manipulative mother into the code.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCjaL0KXxcHYq2tMLncceE8m6S1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1125623'),
  ('591910181148237630', 'Rennie''s Landing', 2001, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Marc Fusco, Sean Whitler, Parker Swanson', 'Marc Fusco, Michael Garrity', 'Charlotte Ayanna, Ethan Embry, Peter Facinelli, Scott Foley, Jeff Anderson, Debra Christofferson, Gabriel Olds, Charles Walker', 'R', 'Life is hard. You can''t always get what you want. but Alec Nichols has a plan to change all that. It involves his three friends, a bank and five million bucks. Together they swear to risk it all. But is the payoff worth it when there''s no turning back?', 'Life is hard. You can''t always get what you want. but Alec Nichols has a plan to change all that. It involves his three friends, a bank and five million bucks. Together they swear to risk it all. But is the payoff worth it when there''s no turning back?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49OrQxTMIGgl7Rb7YLnTYD7hVoe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132422'),
  ('692120628136893327', 'Reno 911!: It''s a Wonderful Heist', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Crime, TV Movie', 'Christian Hoffman, Frank Barrera, Kevin Atkinson', 'Kerri Kenney, Thomas Lennon', 'Thomas Lennon, Kerri Kenney, Joe Lo Truglio, Ian Roberts, Cedric Yarbrough, Mary Birdsong, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Niecy Nash', null, 'It’s Holiday Season in Reno, and Lieutenant Dangle wishes he’d never been born. With the help of a roller skating “Angel,” he learns how much better the lives of the other deputies would be if he never existed. Will he decide to live on anyway? There’s still Christmas criminals to catch!', 'It’s Holiday Season in Reno, and Lieutenant Dangle wishes he’d never been born. With the help of a roller skating “Angel,” he learns how much better the lives of the other deputies would be if he never existed. Will he decide to live on anyway? There’s still Christmas criminals to catch!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vypohqPh0w20iirMwOaJg9wqLej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051909'),
  ('511827905172691633', 'Reno 911!: Miami', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Robert Ben Garant, Joe Kessler', 'Robert Ben Garant, Kerri Kenney, Thomas Lennon', 'Carlos Alazraqui, Mary Birdsong, Robert Ben Garant, Kerri Kenney, Thomas Lennon, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Niecy Nash, Cedric Yarbrough', 'R', 'A rag-tag team of Reno cops are called in to save the day after a terrorist attack disrupts a national police convention in Miami Beach during spring break. Based on the Comedy Central series.', 'A rag-tag team of Reno cops are called in to save the day after a terrorist attack disrupts a national police convention in Miami Beach during spring break. Based on the Comedy Central series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9v3nqTU4Gj2zuASGDLJX4YD8ma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10090'),
  ('789911757678879305', 'Reno 911!: The Hunt for QAnon', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Crime', 'Robert Ben Garant, David Lincoln', 'Kerri Kenney, Thomas Lennon, Robert Ben Garant', 'Kerri Kenney, Niecy Nash, Thomas Lennon, Cedric Yarbrough, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Mary Birdsong, Carlos Alazraqui, Ian Roberts', null, 'The Reno Sheriff’s Department find themselves in their stickiest situation yet, hunting down “Q," the person supposedly behind all of the conspiracy theories concocted by the QAnon movement. In their valiant efforts, the officers find themselves stuck at the QAnon convention at sea, and ultimately end up in more trouble when they escape only to discover that they’ve landed on Jeffrey Epstein’s infamous island.', 'The Reno Sheriff’s Department find themselves in their stickiest situation yet, hunting down “Q," the person supposedly behind all of the conspiracy theories concocted by the QAnon movement. In their valiant efforts, the officers find themselves stuck at the QAnon convention at sea, and ultimately end up in more trouble when they escape only to discover that they’ve landed on Jeffrey Epstein’s infamous island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8Mgy1UKexJfXjsTsglD83HkL5Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899599'),
  ('629824414563809529', 'Renoir', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gilles Bourdos, Mark Lee Ping-Bing, Christophe Marillier', 'Gilles Bourdos, Jérôme Tonnerre', 'Michel Bouquet, Christa Théret, Vincent Rottiers, Thomas Doret, Romane Bohringer, Carlo Brandt, Solène Rigot, Anne-Lise Heimburger', 'R', 'In the French Riviera in the summer of 1915, Jean Renoir, son of the Impressionist painter Pierre-Auguste, returns home to convalesce after being wounded in World War I. At his side is Andrée, a young woman who rejuvenates, enchants, and inspires both father and son.', 'In the French Riviera in the summer of 1915, Jean Renoir, son of the Impressionist painter Pierre-Auguste, returns home to convalesce after being wounded in World War I. At his side is Andrée, a young woman who rejuvenates, enchants, and inspires both father and son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rITdY5SdUMFZ0lKmLUCsNFoKmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134673'),
  ('860854030825018540', 'Renoir', 2025, 'Drama', 'Chie Hayakawa, Hideho Urata, Kotaro Sato', 'Chie Hayakawa', 'Yui Suzuki, Hikari Ishida, Lily Franky, Ayumu Nakajima, Yuumi Kawai, Ryota Bando, Charlie St. Cyr, Jeffrey Rowe', null, 'In 1987 Tokyo, a quirky and sensitive 11-year-old girl copes with a terminally ill father and stressed-out working mother while encountering various adults dealing with their own struggles.', 'In 1987 Tokyo, a quirky and sensitive 11-year-old girl copes with a terminally ill father and stressed-out working mother while encountering various adults dealing with their own struggles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VEFRIKge0iDjv8hT1BZEx2qG4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1392527'),
  ('161944408904115547', 'Rent', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chris Columbus, Stephen Goldblatt, Geoffrey Hansen', 'Stephen Chbosky', 'Anthony Rapp, Adam Pascal, Rosario Dawson, Jesse L. Martin, Wilson Jermaine Heredia, Idina Menzel, Tracie Thoms, Taye Diggs', 'PG-13', 'In New York City''s gritty East Village, a group of bohemians strive for success and acceptance while enduring the obstacles of poverty, illness and the AIDS epidemic.', 'In New York City''s gritty East Village, a group of bohemians strive for success and acceptance while enduring the obstacles of poverty, illness and the AIDS epidemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fomBrfOHWxlaVcjPk4yCQgIwAnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1833'),
  ('1140683193681441905', 'Rent', 2019, 'Music, TV Movie, Drama', 'Alex Rudzinski, Bernard Telsey, Tiffany Little Canfield', 'Jonathan Larson', 'Jordan Fisher, Brennin Hunt, Vanessa Hudgens, Kiersey Clemons, Brandon Victor Dixon, Valentina, Mario, Tinashe', null, 'The story of several friends in New York City facing financial poverty, homophobia, AIDS, and, of course, rent.', 'The story of several friends in New York City facing financial poverty, homophobia, AIDS, and, of course, rent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fxpcJ5a1MwLmdfMrIAqtVCRpud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557648'),
  ('791024526958682014', 'Rent Boys', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Rosa von Praunheim', 'Rosa von Praunheim', 'Sergiu Grimalschi, Peter Kern, Master Patrick, Claudia Thomas, Lutz Volkwein, Oliver Sechting, Rosa von Praunheim, Wolfgang Werner', null, 'Documentary about the current hustler scene in Berlin. Based on interviews with former and active prostitutes, the realities of male prostitutes in Berlin are treated. The film is objective, and records the hustler scene as a social Submilieu, which is characterized by both tragic fates, as well as everyday things and routines. Not only the direct sale of sexual services is discussed, but also other aspects associated with male prostitution: poverty, drug addiction, AIDS, crime, migration, love and partnership.', 'Documentary about the current hustler scene in Berlin. Based on interviews with former and active prostitutes, the realities of male prostitutes in Berlin are treated. The film is objective, and records the hustler scene as a social Submilieu, which is characterized by both tragic fates, as well as everyday things and routines. Not only the direct sale of sexual services is discussed, but also other aspects associated with male prostitution: poverty, drug addiction, AIDS, crime, migration, love and partnership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnFEc7cvibTL6bA01sPu4LDfRMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81375'),
  ('182466572651143703', 'Rent-a-Cat', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kazutaka Abe, Naoko Ogigami', 'Naoko Ogigami', 'Mikako Ichikawa, Reiko Kusamura, Ken Mitsuishi, Maho Yamada, Kei Tanaka, Katsuya Kobayashi', null, 'A young woman who rents out cats to lonely old folks finds her life turned upside down when a young man from her past shows back up in her life.', 'A young woman who rents out cats to lonely old folks finds her life turned upside down when a young man from her past shows back up in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9N1LLlSCze4M60a8JYvpfui62NP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116303'),
  ('292236573846957396', 'Rent-a-Cop', 1987, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Jerry London, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Dennis Shryack, Michael Blodgett', 'Burt Reynolds, Liza Minnelli, James Remar, Richard Masur, Dionne Warwick, Bernie Casey, Robby Benson, John Stanton', 'R', 'Detective Tony Church is forced to retire and become a store rent-a-cop when his drug sting operation comes to a tragic end by a masked killer. He joins forces with a prostitute, the only one able to identify the killer, to bring him to justice.', 'Detective Tony Church is forced to retire and become a store rent-a-cop when his drug sting operation comes to a tragic end by a masked killer. He joins forces with a prostitute, the only one able to identify the killer, to bring him to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7nRrivfDnCiUJru7A6ZYNXnOe0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80287'),
  ('645381644152267778', 'Rent-a-Kid', 1995, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Fred Gerber', 'Paul Bernbaum', 'Leslie Nielsen, Christopher Lloyd, Matt McCoy, Sherry Miller, Amos Crawley, Cody Jones, Tabitha Lupien, Tony Rosato', 'G', 'Harry Habert, owner of a rental company, has an original idea—to rent baby''s from a nearby orphanage to local families. He rents the Ward siblings, 2 boys and a girl, to his first customers.', 'Harry Habert, owner of a rental company, has an original idea—to rent baby''s from a nearby orphanage to local families. He rents the Ward siblings, 2 boys and a girl, to his first customers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnL5TxGumlBy68D4HovSlndEIkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36357'),
  ('648673503269632813', 'Rent-A-Pal', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jon Stevenson, Scott Park', 'Jon Stevenson', 'Brian Landis Folkins, Wil Wheaton, Kathleen Brady, Amy Rutledge, Adrian Egolf, Olivia Hendrick, Karin Carr, Sara Woodyard', null, 'Set in 1990, a lonely bachelor named David searches for an escape from the day-to-day drudgery of caring for his aging mother. While seeking a partner through a video dating service, he discovers a strange VHS tape called Rent-A-Pal. Hosted by the charming and charismatic Andy, the tape offers him much-needed company, compassion, and friendship. But Andy''s friendship comes at a cost, and David desperately struggles to afford the price of admission.', 'Set in 1990, a lonely bachelor named David searches for an escape from the day-to-day drudgery of caring for his aging mother. While seeking a partner through a video dating service, he discovers a strange VHS tape called Rent-A-Pal. Hosted by the charming and charismatic Andy, the tape offers him much-needed company, compassion, and friendship. But Andy''s friendship comes at a cost, and David desperately struggles to afford the price of admission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFaO4uc8po7uNCTSdvbqduMTyuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:707408'),
  ('854134503331730618', 'Rent: Filmed Live on Broadway', 2008, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Michael John Warren, Declan Quinn', null, 'Will Chase, Adam Kantor, Michael McElroy, Rodney Hicks, Tracie Thoms, Justin Johnston, Renée Elise Goldsberry, Eden Espinosa', null, 'Set in New York City''s gritty East Village, the revolutionary rock opera RENT tells the story of a group of bohemians struggling to live and pay their rent. "Measuring their lives in love," these starving artists strive for success and acceptance while enduring the obstacles of poverty, illness and the AIDS epidemic.', 'Set in New York City''s gritty East Village, the revolutionary rock opera RENT tells the story of a group of bohemians struggling to live and pay their rent. "Measuring their lives in love," these starving artists strive for success and acceptance while enduring the obstacles of poverty, illness and the AIDS epidemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLe09oTqdBudQO3mpEFT93FWJzd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15199'),
  ('541302548903151911', 'Rentadick', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Jim Clark, John Coquillon', 'Graham Chapman, John Cleese', 'James Booth, Richard Briers, Julie Ege, Ronald Fraser, Donald Sinden, Tsai Chin, Kenneth Cope, John Wells', null, 'Armitage runs a chemical company that is on the verge of producing a gas that causes temporary disability. Clearly the military want it but it is also sought by a group of Japanese. Both Armitage and Madam Greenfly hire different people in the same detective agency to guard the gas and steal it respectively... confusion, double crosses and hilarity ensue...', 'Armitage runs a chemical company that is on the verge of producing a gas that causes temporary disability. Clearly the military want it but it is also sought by a group of Japanese. Both Armitage and Madam Greenfly hire different people in the same detective agency to guard the gas and steal it respectively... confusion, double crosses and hilarity ensue...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKnqUYWJA6HyWuEWBC750SAHdxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171105'),
  ('244266648570734488', 'Rental Family', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hikari, Takuro Ishizaka, Raku Nagao', 'Stephen Blahut, Hikari', 'Brendan Fraser, Takehiro Hira, Mari Yamamoto, Shannon Mahina Gorman, Akira Emoto, Paolo Andrea Di Pietro, Helen Sadler, Shinji Ozeki', 'PG-13', 'An American actor in Tokyo struggles to find purpose until he lands an unusual gig: working for a Japanese ''rental family'' agency, playing stand-in roles for strangers. As he immerses himself in his clients'' worlds, he begins to form genuine bonds that blur the lines between performance and reality.', 'An American actor in Tokyo struggles to find purpose until he lands an unusual gig: working for a Japanese ''rental family'' agency, playing stand-in roles for strangers. As he immerses himself in his clients'' worlds, he begins to form genuine bonds that blur the lines between performance and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5lswNlytTUrnMWsuD0NFfhZlf3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1208348'),
  ('999494036822271124', 'Repas de famille', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Pierre-Henry Salfati', null, 'Éric Carrière, Francis Ginibre, Noëlle Perna, Lorella Cravotta, Ludivine Manca, Lamine Lezghad, Yves Pujol, Constance Pittard', null, 'Auguste Lumière directs four workers in the demolition of an old wall at the Lumière factory. One worker is pressing the wall inwards with a jackscrew, while another is pushing it with a pick. When the wall hits the ground, a cloud of white dust whirls up. Three workers continue the demolition of the wall with picks.', 'Auguste Lumière directs four workers in the demolition of an old wall at the Lumière factory. One worker is pressing the wall inwards with a jackscrew, while another is pushing it with a pick. When the wall hits the ground, a cloud of white dust whirls up. Three workers continue the demolition of the wall with picks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/265TTgFh6QRI8TnSMlvCzNgLpI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304031'),
  ('831892811555514864', 'Repast', 1951, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Masayoshi Nishikawa, Masao Tamai', 'Sumie Tanaka, Toshiro Ide', 'Ken Uehara, Setsuko Hara, Yukiko Shimazaki, Yōko Sugi, Akiko Kazami, Haruko Sugimura, Ranko Hanai, Hiroshi Nihon''yanagi', null, 'Michiyo lives in the small place Osaka and is not happy with her marriage; all she does is cook and clean for her husband.', 'Michiyo lives in the small place Osaka and is not happy with her marriage; all she does is cook and clean for her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWK2cRiF2vW67XqWnGZ6GD8eTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47184'),
