  ('163372316043027359', 'Repeat Performance', 1947, 'Drama, Fantasy, Crime', 'Alfred L. Werker, L. William O''Connell, Robert Stillman', 'Walter Bullock', 'Louis Hayward, Joan Leslie, Virginia Field, Tom Conway, Richard Basehart, Natalie Schafer, Benay Venuta, Ilka Grüning', 'NR', 'On New Year''s Eve 1946, Sheila Page kills her husband Barney. She wishes that she could relive 1946 and avoid the mistakes that she made throughout the year. Her wish comes true but cheating fate proves more difficult than she anticipated.', 'On New Year''s Eve 1946, Sheila Page kills her husband Barney. She wishes that she could relive 1946 and avoid the mistakes that she made throughout the year. Her wish comes true but cheating fate proves more difficult than she anticipated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lr337XUyoOfjvExZGiG2Ke0mTmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28914'),
  ('1045450255633834546', 'Repeated Absences', 1972, 'Drama', 'Guy Gilles, Philippe Rousselot', 'Guy Gilles', 'Patrick Penn, Nathalie Delon, Claude Génia, Patrick Jouané, Corinne Le Poulain, Yves Robert, Danièle Delorme, Thomas Andhersen', null, 'François Naulet turns his bedroom into an island of drugs, loneliness and despair.', 'François Naulet turns his bedroom into an island of drugs, loneliness and despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tyoj4hZZIrtsuRt7qqKlz30LBq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295912'),
  ('839756502351211316', 'Repeaters', 2011, 'Drama, Action, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Carl Bessai, Collin Leadlay, Carl Bessai', 'Arne Olsen', 'Dustin Milligan, Amanda Crew, Richard de Klerk, Alexia Fast, Anja Savcic, Gabrielle Rose, Hrothgar Mathews, Ben Immanuel', null, 'A gritty mind-bending thriller about three twenty-somethings who find themselves in an impossible time labyrinth, where each day they awaken to the same terrifying day as the preceding one.', 'A gritty mind-bending thriller about three twenty-somethings who find themselves in an impossible time labyrinth, where each day they awaken to the same terrifying day as the preceding one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nQuL87o5AcUayeZM3cOXw1VbIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71700'),
  ('248036081814610093', 'Repentance', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tengiz Abuladze, Mikhail Agranovich', 'Rezo Kveselava, Nana Janelidze, Tengiz Abuladze', 'Avtandil Makharadze, Iya Ninidze, Zeinab Botsvadze, Ketevan Abuladze, Edisher (Davit) Giorgobiani, Kakhi Kavsadze, Merab Ninidze, Nino Zaqariadze', null, 'The day after his funeral, the corpse of Varlam Aravidze, the mayor of a small Georgian town, turns up in his son''s garden. Although it is secretly reburied, the corpse keeps returning until the police capture the local woman who is responsible. This woman says that Varlam should never be laid to rest since his Stalin-like reign of terror led to the disappearance of her family and friends.', 'The day after his funeral, the corpse of Varlam Aravidze, the mayor of a small Georgian town, turns up in his son''s garden. Although it is secretly reburied, the corpse keeps returning until the police capture the local woman who is responsible. This woman says that Varlam should never be laid to rest since his Stalin-like reign of terror led to the disappearance of her family and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kZqQ2tlwfts6ch2s4ibKhjQgzW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96920'),
  ('1067191929618104357', 'Repentance', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Denis Maloney, Philippe Caland', 'Shintaro Shimosawa', 'Forest Whitaker, Anthony Mackie, Sanaa Lathan, Nicole Ari Parker, Mike Epps, Ariana Neal, Denise Milfont, Selma Pinkard', 'R', 'An earnest life-coach/author, Thomas Carter, is mysteriously abducted by a deranged client, Angel Sanchez, who delves into Thomas'' teachings and uses his spiritual messages of Karma - action and reaction (Vipaka), against him to terrorize him and his family for their past sins.', 'An earnest life-coach/author, Thomas Carter, is mysteriously abducted by a deranged client, Angel Sanchez, who delves into Thomas'' teachings and uses his spiritual messages of Karma - action and reaction (Vipaka), against him to terrorize him and his family for their past sins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJYR6GeUbrEbrapDWZDxqYdLseS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80920'),
  ('532723254308052609', 'Repete', 1995, 'Animation', 'Michaela Pavlátová', 'Michaela Pavlátová', null, null, 'This is one of the classic animations of the 1990s with its surreal tale of the struggle between the sexes. All the strains as well as the closeness of relationships are shown, the title referring to the repetition of the tensions throughout our lives. It also reveals the role the woman plays in a marriage and the need, though often not communicated properly, of the man for this companionship and support.', 'This is one of the classic animations of the 1990s with its surreal tale of the struggle between the sexes. All the strains as well as the closeness of relationships are shown, the title referring to the repetition of the tensions throughout our lives. It also reveals the role the woman plays in a marriage and the need, though often not communicated properly, of the man for this companionship and support.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3QKyy0hlNPqvX3ZMcvpwwMSdwG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207247'),
  ('60578866416608747', 'Replace', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Norbert Keil, Tim Kuhn', 'Norbert Keil, Richard Stanley', 'Rebecca Forsythe, Lucie Aron, Barbara Crampton, Sean Knopp, Adnan Maral, Agnes Kiyomi Decker, J. David Hinze, Teresa Gluck', null, 'Kira''s skin starts to age rapidly, dry out and crumble away. But then she discovers that she can replace her own skin with somebody else''s.', 'Kira''s skin starts to age rapidly, dry out and crumble away. But then she discovers that she can replace her own skin with somebody else''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5pYnf8a9Plaqwfny6lfk5Bpzgo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434986'),
  ('1134607409375140808', 'Replay', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Catherine Corsini, Agnès Godard', 'Pascale Breton, Pierre Erwan Guillaume, Catherine Corsini', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Pascale Bussières, Dani Levy, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Sami Bouajila, Marilú Marini, Clément Hervieu-Léger, Marc Ponette', null, 'Nathalie and Louise are friends from childhood. While studying drama at University Louise becomes hopelessly obsessed with her friend. Jealous of the male friends she has she breaks up the friendship, followed by a suicide attempt. Later, Louise marries, but finds time to see the, by now quite accomplished actress, Nathalie. They fight through the years, La Repetition following them as their friendship comes together and breaks up frequently, while never actually reaching anything that can be called a climax.', 'Nathalie and Louise are friends from childhood. While studying drama at University Louise becomes hopelessly obsessed with her friend. Jealous of the male friends she has she breaks up the friendship, followed by a suicide attempt. Later, Louise marries, but finds time to see the, by now quite accomplished actress, Nathalie. They fight through the years, La Repetition following them as their friendship comes together and breaks up frequently, while never actually reaching anything that can be called a climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlGdYZ4lsILxF5wnwvfU3XlYXq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47254'),
  ('305179021196643314', 'Repli-Kate', 2002, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Frank Longo, Alan Caso', 'Stuart Gibbs', 'James Roday Rodriguez, Desmond Askew, Ali Landry, Eugene Levy, Todd Robert Anderson, Ryan Alosio, Kurt Fuller, Aimee Interrupter', 'R', 'A scientist and his sidekick accidentally clone a journalist and decide to turn the mistake into Repli-Kate, their idea of the perfect woman, who loves, beer, football, and frat parties.', 'A scientist and his sidekick accidentally clone a journalist and decide to turn the mistake into Repli-Kate, their idea of the perfect woman, who loves, beer, football, and frat parties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4NcV5umUcFcG8bQgZSjdMaCg6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16261'),
  ('1072338335452054174', 'Replicant', 2001, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Mike Southon, Ross W. Clarkson', 'Lawrence Riggins, Les Weldon', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Michael Rooker, Catherine Dent, Ian Robison, Pam Hyatt, Marnie Alton, Brandon James Olson, Allan Gray', 'R', 'Scientists create a genetic clone of a serial killer in order to help catch the killer, teaming up with two cops.', 'Scientists create a genetic clone of a serial killer in order to help catch the killer, teaming up with two cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q41zGgRXfhvnObJnn1kGIyoAhSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10596'),
  ('508769449919148268', 'Replicas', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Colleen Comer, Polly Ann Mattson, Jeffrey Nachmanoff', 'Chad St. John', 'Keanu Reeves, Alice Eve, Thomas Middleditch, John Ortiz, Nyasha Hatendi, Aria Lyric Leabu, Emily Alyn Lind, Emjay Anthony', 'PG-13', 'A scientist becomes obsessed with returning his family to normalcy after a terrible accident.', 'A scientist becomes obsessed with returning his family to normalcy after a terrible accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhPBTAn9b4TYOxc1JYNsX4BFAlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300681'),
  ('898235958838137684', 'Repligator', 1996, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Bret McCormick, Wynn Winberg, Christine Caughey', 'Keith Kjornes', 'Gunnar Hansen, Keith Kjornes, Randy Clower, T.J. Myers, Carl Merritt, Brinke Stevens, Alan York, Rocky Patterson', null, 'Army experimentation with transporter devices accidentally turns people into alligators.', 'Army experimentation with transporter devices accidentally turns people into alligators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckQ0la2RgFphUr0oQJpwCvno56b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27536'),
  ('827251663955405775', 'Replikator', 1994, 'Crime, Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Jonathan Freeman, Philip Jackson', 'Michelle Bellerose, Tony Johnston, John Dawson', 'Michael St. Gerard, Brigitte Bako, Ned Beatty, Peter Outerbridge, Ron Lea, David Hemblen, Ilona Staller, Lisa Howard', 'R', 'In a poisoned world where sunshine kills, a hit squad from the Zyklor Corporation interrupts the testing of a matter replikator capable of duplicating living tissue for the purpose of extending human life. When the smoke clears, scientist Ludovic finds himself framed for murder and on the run from an exact duplicate... of himself. Joining forces with ex-lover Kat Moscow and cynical Detective Valiant, Ludovic follows the bloody path of destruction wrought by a monster with his face.', 'In a poisoned world where sunshine kills, a hit squad from the Zyklor Corporation interrupts the testing of a matter replikator capable of duplicating living tissue for the purpose of extending human life. When the smoke clears, scientist Ludovic finds himself framed for murder and on the run from an exact duplicate... of himself. Joining forces with ex-lover Kat Moscow and cynical Detective Valiant, Ludovic follows the bloody path of destruction wrought by a monster with his face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7RFI8dLcYQLknwGPaIT1iDRUrl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26309'),
  ('255850412907736016', 'Repo Jake', 1990, 'Action, Crime', 'Richard Pepin, Joseph Merhi, Steve Rockmael', 'Joe Hart', 'Dan Haggerty, Dana Bentley, Robert Axelrod, Steve Hansbourgh, Paul Hayes, Walter Cox, R.J. Walker, Carmen Filpi', null, 'Jake Baxter takes a job as a repoman with hopes of living the quiet life. Plans go sour when he''s whipped into supersonic action, involving a vicious crime lord, a mob of angry car owners, a sadistic porno ring and lastly a brutal, illegal and very lethal car race known throughout L.A.''s underworld as the "Slam Track."', 'Jake Baxter takes a job as a repoman with hopes of living the quiet life. Plans go sour when he''s whipped into supersonic action, involving a vicious crime lord, a mob of angry car owners, a sadistic porno ring and lastly a brutal, illegal and very lethal car race known throughout L.A.''s underworld as the "Slam Track."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lensYQ0wWizmSf1CgmUu4wKV7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55453'),
  ('481459827257776261', 'Repo Man', 1984, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Alex Cox, Robby Müller, Rip Murray', 'Alex Cox', 'Emilio Estevez, Harry Dean Stanton, Tracey Walter, Olivia Barash, Sy Richardson, Susan Barnes, Fox Harris, Tom Finnegan', 'R', 'A down and out young punk gets a job working with a seasoned repo man, but what awaits him in his new career is a series of outlandish adventures revolving around aliens, the CIA, and a most wanted ''64 Chevy.', 'A down and out young punk gets a job working with a seasoned repo man, but what awaits him in his new career is a series of outlandish adventures revolving around aliens, the CIA, and a most wanted ''64 Chevy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjuu5UceuVUNUjnOC2fBzL3hZKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13820'),
  ('253243270503472795', 'Repo Men', 2010, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Crime', 'Miguel Sapochnik, Enrique Chediak, Sorin Popescu', 'Garrett Lerner', 'Jude Law, Forest Whitaker, Alice Braga, Liev Schreiber, Carice van Houten, Chandler Canterbury, RZA, Joe Pingue', 'R', 'In the future, medical technology has advanced to the point where people can buy artificial organs to extend their lives. But if they default on payments, an organization known as the Union sends agents to repossess the organs. Remy is one of the best agents in the business, but when he becomes the recipient of an artificial heart, he finds himself in the same dire straits as his many victims.', 'In the future, medical technology has advanced to the point where people can buy artificial organs to extend their lives. But if they default on payments, an organization known as the Union sends agents to repossess the organs. Remy is one of the best agents in the business, but when he becomes the recipient of an artificial heart, he finds himself in the same dire straits as his many victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZA5kEKuA6HgbyzZXXlyU4piNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31867'),
  ('103202780103233459', 'Repo! The Genetic Opera', 2008, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Music', 'Darren Lynn Bousman, Steve Webb, Vicki Henton', 'Darren Smith, Terrance Zdunich', 'Alexa PenaVega, Paul Sorvino, Anthony Stewart Head, Sarah Brightman, Paris Hilton, Bill Moseley, Nivek Ogre, Terrance Zdunich', 'R', 'By the year 2056, an epidemic of organ failures has devastated the planet. The megacorporation GeneCo provides organ transplants on a payment plan - and those who can’t fulfill their plans have their organs repossessed. In the midst of this, a sickly teenager discovers a shocking secret about herself, her father, and their connection to GeneCo.', 'By the year 2056, an epidemic of organ failures has devastated the planet. The megacorporation GeneCo provides organ transplants on a payment plan - and those who can’t fulfill their plans have their organs repossessed. In the midst of this, a sickly teenager discovers a shocking secret about herself, her father, and their connection to GeneCo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2G5LczM1clXu3byEudWk9w0KDYD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14353'),
  ('806770043185047408', 'Report', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Bruce Conner', null, 'John F. Kennedy, Jacqueline Kennedy, John Connally, Lee Harvey Oswald, Colin Clive, Ernest Thesiger', null, 'Bruce Conner’s most celebrated film for a reason: it takes historical moments that were replayed over and over on television—chilling repetition of Kennedy assassination coverage—and repurposes them into a meditation on how the media tries to exert authority and apply a sense of order to the anarchic. And though it may sound perverse to say so, the film is also—not incidentally—a thrill to watch. -- The A.V. Club', 'Bruce Conner’s most celebrated film for a reason: it takes historical moments that were replayed over and over on television—chilling repetition of Kennedy assassination coverage—and repurposes them into a meditation on how the media tries to exert authority and apply a sense of order to the anarchic. And though it may sound perverse to say so, the film is also—not incidentally—a thrill to watch. -- The A.V. Club', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qma9BkU6i8HTSOvT5Ot7RzFax8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87981'),
  ('246725023243009670', 'Report from the Aleutians', 1943, 'Documentary, War, History', 'John Huston', 'John Huston', 'John Huston, Walter Huston, Milton Ashkin, Lyle A. Bean', null, 'A documentary propaganda film produced by the U.S. Army Signal Corps about the Aleutian Islands Campaign during World War II. The film opens with a map showing the strategic importance of the island, and the thrust of the 1942 Japanese offensive into Midway and Dutch Harbor. Nominated for the Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature.', 'A documentary propaganda film produced by the U.S. Army Signal Corps about the Aleutian Islands Campaign during World War II. The film opens with a map showing the strategic importance of the island, and the thrust of the 1942 Japanese offensive into Midway and Dutch Harbor. Nominated for the Academy Award for Best Documentary Feature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiUsJmATl5XyAaNTV2myd55HWmN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23388'),
  ('692272357943566126', 'Report to the Commissioner', 1975, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dick Moder, Paul Baxley, Charles Norton', 'Ernest Tidyman, Abby Mann', 'Michael Moriarty, Yaphet Kotto, Susan Blakely, Héctor Elizondo, Tony King, Michael McGuire, Edward Grover, Dana Elcar', 'PG', 'Police officer Patty Butler, alias "Chicklet," is the live-in girlfriend of Thomas ''Stick'' Henderson to gather evidence. Detective Bo Lockley is instructed to try to find her, not knowing she''s also a cop.', 'Police officer Patty Butler, alias "Chicklet," is the live-in girlfriend of Thomas ''Stick'' Henderson to gather evidence. Detective Bo Lockley is instructed to try to find her, not knowing she''s also a cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0G33xOTiu4TTGmsRt0basMSck7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42262'),
  ('697126865472982142', 'Reportaje', 1953, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Emilio Fernández, Alex Phillips', 'Mauricio Magdaleno', 'Arturo de Córdova, Roberto Cañedo, Miguel Ángel Ferriz Sr., Manolo Fábregas, Víctor Parra, Víctor Manuel Mendoza, Luis Aldás, Rafael Banquells', null, 'Reporters compete for cash prize awarded for biggest scoop on New Year''s Eve.', 'Reporters compete for cash prize awarded for biggest scoop on New Year''s Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLPxXLT3yxnTbJYxXpFSz01ZOHG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335021'),
  ('204126757503438947', 'Reports', 2024, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Eric Métayer', 'Eric Métayer, Catherine Ramberg, Clément Michel', 'Cécile Bois, Odile Vuillemin, Bruno Solo, Victoria Eber, Flavie Dachy, Christophe Laubion, Marc Citti, Thimothé Boncourt', null, 'Laurence finds out that her niece, Karine, is being molested by a family friend while her parents turn a blind eye, and they themselves constantly subject her to beatings and mental abuse. Despite Laurence''s numerous reports, social services are keeping the little girl in her home, against all logic, prompting her to go on a series of battles that will challenge the whole legal system', 'Laurence finds out that her niece, Karine, is being molested by a family friend while her parents turn a blind eye, and they themselves constantly subject her to beatings and mental abuse. Despite Laurence''s numerous reports, social services are keeping the little girl in her home, against all logic, prompting her to go on a series of battles that will challenge the whole legal system', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mTkRSBFcExc7NR5iiL8JmxpHn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1206091'),
  ('412860076804163352', 'Repossessed', 1990, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Bob Logan, Michael D. Margulies', 'Bob Logan', 'Linda Blair, Ned Beatty, Leslie Nielsen, Anthony Starke, Thom Sharp, Lana Schwab, Benj Thall, Dove Dellos', 'PG-13', 'It''s been some time since Father Jebedaiah Mayii exorcised the Devil from little Nancy Aglet, who is now grown up with a husband and two children of her own. But the prince of darkness wants to go a second round and has returned to repossess her! With Father Mayii unwilling to help, Father Luke Brophy tries his best to help Nancy, even when TV''s Ernest Weller plans to air the exorcism live on TV.', 'It''s been some time since Father Jebedaiah Mayii exorcised the Devil from little Nancy Aglet, who is now grown up with a husband and two children of her own. But the prince of darkness wants to go a second round and has returned to repossess her! With Father Mayii unwilling to help, Father Luke Brophy tries his best to help Nancy, even when TV''s Ernest Weller plans to air the exorcism live on TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDTP5KgWwvuKfOyJ2PJfTqVYnxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11510'),
  ('102777488976168130', 'Reprisal', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Brian A. Miller, Peter A. Holland, Jake Heineke', 'Bryce Hammons', 'Frank Grillo, Bruce Willis, Johnathon Schaech, Olivia Culpo, Natali Yura, Tyler Jon Olson, Wass Stevens, Colin Egglesfield', 'R', 'Jacob, a bank manager haunted by a violent heist that took the life of a coworker, teams up with his ex-cop neighbor, James, to bring down the assailant. While the two men work together to figure out the thief’s next move, Gabriel, the highly-trained criminal, is one step ahead. When Gabriel kidnaps Jacob’s wife and daughter, Jacob barrels down a path of bloodshed that initiates an explosive counterattack and brings all three men to the breaking point.', 'Jacob, a bank manager haunted by a violent heist that took the life of a coworker, teams up with his ex-cop neighbor, James, to bring down the assailant. While the two men work together to figure out the thief’s next move, Gabriel, the highly-trained criminal, is one step ahead. When Gabriel kidnaps Jacob’s wife and daughter, Jacob barrels down a path of bloodshed that initiates an explosive counterattack and brings all three men to the breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiRrAJn4MvZxsmaDwEo8gw4FmQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531593'),
  ('439021502385019030', 'Reprise', 2006, 'Drama', 'Joachim Trier, Jakob Ihre, TomTom Jorgensen', 'Joachim Trier, Eskil Vogt', 'Anders Danielsen Lie, Espen Klouman Høiner, Viktoria Winge, Christian Rubeck, Henrik Elvestad, Odd-Magnus Williamson, Pål Stokka, Henrik Mestad', 'R', 'Fueled by literary aspirations and youthful exuberance, two competitive friends endure the pangs of love, depression, and burgeoning careers.', 'Fueled by literary aspirations and youthful exuberance, two competitive friends endure the pangs of love, depression, and burgeoning careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GdptmzKh5Sx1KFiABJeUEt9eS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12197'),
  ('585919681834295087', 'Reptile', 2023, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Brett Robinson, Ryan Robert Howard, Mike Gioulakis', 'Benicio del Toro, Benjamin Brewer, Grant Singer', 'Benicio del Toro, Justin Timberlake, Alicia Silverstone, Michael Pitt, Ato Essandoh, Domenick Lombardozzi, Matilda Lutz, Eric Bogosian', 'R', 'Following the brutal murder of a young real estate agent, a hardened detective attempts to uncover the truth in a case where nothing is as it seems, and by doing so dismantles the illusions in his own life.', 'Following the brutal murder of a young real estate agent, a hardened detective attempts to uncover the truth in a case where nothing is as it seems, and by doing so dismantles the illusions in his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bk4WUvoXSqPQGrhOAtt3AR0sUZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866463'),
  ('1009751038098316084', 'Reptilicus', 1963, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Aage Wiltrup, Sidney W. Pink', 'Ib Melchior, Sidney W. Pink', 'Bent Mejding, Asbjørn Andersen, Ann Smyrner, Mimi Heinrich, Dirch Passer, Marlies Behrens, Carl Ottosen, Ole Wisborg', 'NR', 'A portion of the tail of a prehistoric reptile is discovered in Denmark. It regenerates into the entire reptile, which proceeds to destroy buildings and property and generally make a nuisance of itself. It can fly, swim, and walk, and has impenetrable scales, which makes it difficult to kill.', 'A portion of the tail of a prehistoric reptile is discovered in Denmark. It regenerates into the entire reptile, which proceeds to destroy buildings and property and generally make a nuisance of itself. It can fly, swim, and walk, and has impenetrable scales, which makes it difficult to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lD2P13VNAiIhoAs0gIhfnRazZRV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21266'),
  ('750638971947464461', 'Repulsion', 1965, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Roman Polanski, Gilbert Taylor, Frank Willson', 'Gérard Brach, Roman Polanski', 'Catherine Deneuve, Ian Hendry, John Fraser, Yvonne Furneaux, Patrick Wymark, Renée Houston, Valerie Taylor, James Villiers', 'NR', 'Beautiful young manicurist Carole suffers from androphobia (the pathological fear of interaction with men). When her sister and roommate, Helen, leaves their London flat to go on an Italian holiday with her married boyfriend, Carole withdraws into her apartment. She begins to experience frightful hallucinations, her fear gradually mutating into madness.', 'Beautiful young manicurist Carole suffers from androphobia (the pathological fear of interaction with men). When her sister and roommate, Helen, leaves their London flat to go on an Italian holiday with her married boyfriend, Carole withdraws into her apartment. She begins to experience frightful hallucinations, her fear gradually mutating into madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtyCKEPLqv9wxyVazL4b843vtUb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11481'),
  ('1025484162803730885', 'Requiem', 1982, 'Drama', 'Zoltán Fábri, György Illés', 'Zoltán Fábri', 'Edit Frajt, Lajos Balázsovits, László Gálffi, György Kálmán, László György, Antal Konrád', null, 'When a young boy comes in to see a doctor abourt a red mark on his face, the doctor''s wife welcomes him into the consulting room instead. As they talk, she offers him something to eat and then notes that his manner of eating is just like that of her previous husband, who died in prison many years earlier. It turns out that the young man had been his cell mate for a year, and he tells her the story of how her husband died. She then remembers (in flashbacks) how she had helped her first husband rid himself of his sexual repression, and how she had promised him she would marry her current husband if she were widowed. It seems her doctor-husband was a man who could remain untouched through any political climate, and was much admired by her first husband. Now that her memories have been awakened by the young man''s account, she ignores the repeated phone calls of her current husband and decides to rid this young man of his own sexual repressions.', 'When a young boy comes in to see a doctor abourt a red mark on his face, the doctor''s wife welcomes him into the consulting room instead. As they talk, she offers him something to eat and then notes that his manner of eating is just like that of her previous husband, who died in prison many years earlier. It turns out that the young man had been his cell mate for a year, and he tells her the story of how her husband died. She then remembers (in flashbacks) how she had helped her first husband rid himself of his sexual repression, and how she had promised him she would marry her current husband if she were widowed. It seems her doctor-husband was a man who could remain untouched through any political climate, and was much admired by her first husband. Now that her memories have been awakened by the young man''s account, she ignores the repeated phone calls of her current husband and decides to rid this young man of his own sexual repressions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QdKfSG09Q9ETIFrsnMB8gcG2W4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8777'),
  ('968630117770537209', 'Requiem', 1998, 'Drama', 'Alain Tanner', 'Alain Tanner, Bernard Comment', 'Francis Frappat, André Marcon, Márcia Breia, Zita Duarte, Canto e Castro, Lia Gama, Raul Solnado, Miguel Yeco', null, 'In Lisbon, French author Paul meets various people from his past who uncover forgotten memories.', 'In Lisbon, French author Paul meets various people from his past who uncover forgotten memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0Hhs3ho1LMNeBJxjmKn4MZS7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114157'),
  ('875692619519896911', 'Requiem', 2001, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Hervé Renoh, Gilles Arnaud, Rémi Honnoraty', 'Hervé Renoh', 'Patrick Dell''Isola, Moussa Maaskri, Julie-Anne Roth, Jo Prestia, Marc Chapiteau, Jean-Louis Loca, Simon Eine, Mathieu Busson', null, 'Four hardened crooks break out of prison. Hunted down, with nowhere to run, they seek refuge in the only place the police cannot follow, a Cistercian monastery. Cut off from the outside world, a nightmare stand off develops between the fugitives, ready to kill in defence of their dearly purchased freedom, and the monks they'' re holding hostage. But in this potentially lethal confrontation, nothing is quite as it seems. The game'' s been rigged from the start. Requiem'' s a violent and fast paced French film that really delivers.', 'Four hardened crooks break out of prison. Hunted down, with nowhere to run, they seek refuge in the only place the police cannot follow, a Cistercian monastery. Cut off from the outside world, a nightmare stand off develops between the fugitives, ready to kill in defence of their dearly purchased freedom, and the monks they'' re holding hostage. But in this potentially lethal confrontation, nothing is quite as it seems. The game'' s been rigged from the start. Requiem'' s a violent and fast paced French film that really delivers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82KGOXjqpWMiwE0MZDoXw8B7Rw9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2104'),
  ('737172395867080699', 'Requiem', 2006, 'Drama', 'Hans-Christian Schmid, Bogumił Godfrejów', 'Bernd Lange', 'Sandra Hüller, Burghart Klaußner, Imogen Kogge, Anna Blomeier, Nicholas Reinke, Walter Schmidinger, Johann Adam Oest, Eva Löbau', null, 'Michaela, an epileptic, enrolls in college to study education. She goes off her medication and soon begins hearing voices and seeing apparitions that tell her to avoid religious objects, although she is devoutly Roman Catholic. One priest scoffs at the idea that Michaela could be possessed by demons, but a younger pastor arranges an exorcism for the young woman.', 'Michaela, an epileptic, enrolls in college to study education. She goes off her medication and soon begins hearing voices and seeing apparitions that tell her to avoid religious objects, although she is devoutly Roman Catholic. One priest scoffs at the idea that Michaela could be possessed by demons, but a younger pastor arranges an exorcism for the young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m42xNNYk3Nxs3xmucuKjl4zSjMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523'),
  ('318261297539687301', 'Requiem for a Dream', 2000, 'Crime, Drama', 'Darren Aronofsky, Matthew Libatique, Timothy Bird', 'Hubert Selby Jr., Darren Aronofsky', 'Ellen Burstyn, Jared Leto, Jennifer Connelly, Marlon Wayans, Christopher McDonald, Louise Lasser, Marcia Jean Kurtz, Janet Sarno', 'NR', 'The drug-induced utopias of four Coney Island residents are shattered when their addictions run deep.', 'The drug-induced utopias of four Coney Island residents are shattered when their addictions run deep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nOd6vjEmzCT0k4VYqsA2hwyi87C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641'),
  ('492141123131482605', 'Requiem for a Gringo', 1968, 'Western', 'José Luis Merino', 'Arrigo Colombo, Martinez Román', 'Lang Jeffries, Fernando Sancho, Carlo Gaddi, Femi Benussi, Aldo Sambrell, Rubén Rojo, Marisa Paredes, Giuliana Garavaglia', null, 'Returning home, Ross Logan immediately gets into conflict with the Carranza gang, which had just crossed the Mexican border and has occupied a nearby Hacienda. After his brother is killed he plans a cold blooded revenge for which he separates the gang''s most dangerous members by using their individual weak points and the general discordance amongst them. The time for the final confrontation is set by the astronomically interested Logan amidst an eclipse.', 'Returning home, Ross Logan immediately gets into conflict with the Carranza gang, which had just crossed the Mexican border and has occupied a nearby Hacienda. After his brother is killed he plans a cold blooded revenge for which he separates the gang''s most dangerous members by using their individual weak points and the general discordance amongst them. The time for the final confrontation is set by the astronomically interested Logan amidst an eclipse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xj1Fy9O2KAenLE9U7WFFuohiZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145369'),
  ('288595715474542934', 'Requiem for a Handsome Bastard', 1992, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robert Morin, Ginette D''Amico, Pierre Plante', 'Robert Morin', 'Gildor Roy, Jean-Guy Bouchard, Brigitte Paquette, Sabrina Boudot, Kliment Denchev, Stéphan Côté, France Arbour, Louis-Georges Girard', null, 'Despite the fact that he is completely unrepentant about his crimes, when Regis Savoie''s son asks to visit him, prison authorities grant permission for the boy to come. The thief and murderer (Gildor Roy) takes advantage of the moment of his son''s arrival to steal a gun and take flight. He settles some old scores, gets together with his girlfriend, and heads for the hills, pursued by a detective who is not to be swayed in his efforts to follow and recapture him.', 'Despite the fact that he is completely unrepentant about his crimes, when Regis Savoie''s son asks to visit him, prison authorities grant permission for the boy to come. The thief and murderer (Gildor Roy) takes advantage of the moment of his son''s arrival to steal a gun and take flight. He settles some old scores, gets together with his girlfriend, and heads for the hills, pursued by a detective who is not to be swayed in his efforts to follow and recapture him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZDtmj8sIHPmc0WWd1DC3WZ3Hpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69889'),
  ('822365705155851219', 'Requiem for a Heavyweight', 1962, 'Drama', 'Ralph Nelson, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'Rod Serling', 'Anthony Quinn, Jackie Gleason, Mickey Rooney, Julie Harris, Stanley Adams, Madame Spivy, Val Avery, Herbie Faye', null, 'After suffering a brutal defeat and being told he can no longer fight, 37-year-old, scar-ridden prizefighter Louis ''Mountain'' Rivera struggles to find a new direction in life', 'After suffering a brutal defeat and being told he can no longer fight, 37-year-old, scar-ridden prizefighter Louis ''Mountain'' Rivera struggles to find a new direction in life', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUKTcUhIeFZO0ZGvjja5bx1rsMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53229'),
  ('499121832458049700', 'Requiem for a Killer', 2011, 'Thriller', 'Jérôme Le Maire, Antoine Monod', 'Jérôme Le Maire', 'Clovis Cornillac, Mélanie Laurent, Tchéky Karyo, Xavier Gallais, Christopher Stills, Corrado Invernizzi, Michel Fau, Frédérique Tirmont', 'R', 'Lucretia is a killer for hire. Specialised in poisoning and passionate about opera, she''ll have to fulfill a difficult contract in the heart of the Swiss alps. Posing as a singer, Lucretia will have to appear on the scene of the higly exclusive Festival d''Ermeux and try to kill one of her partners: British bariton Alexander Child. Having recently acquired a Scottish distillery, he remains the only obstacle to a strategic pipeline project with considerable economic stakes; having recently won a tough legal battle against British Oil, their last resort is to eliminate him. Complicating everything is Rico, sent by the French contra-espionage, who tries to infiltrate the orchestra and stop the plot against Alexander Child.', 'Lucretia is a killer for hire. Specialised in poisoning and passionate about opera, she''ll have to fulfill a difficult contract in the heart of the Swiss alps. Posing as a singer, Lucretia will have to appear on the scene of the higly exclusive Festival d''Ermeux and try to kill one of her partners: British bariton Alexander Child. Having recently acquired a Scottish distillery, he remains the only obstacle to a strategic pipeline project with considerable economic stakes; having recently won a tough legal battle against British Oil, their last resort is to eliminate him. Complicating everything is Rico, sent by the French contra-espionage, who tries to infiltrate the orchestra and stop the plot against Alexander Child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bbfLjRSLFetGwkl3NPUNFDiGBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68280'),
  ('159821131541790225', 'Requiem for a Maiden', 1992, 'Drama', 'Filip Renč, Milan Maňák, Otakar Cholasta', 'Filip Renč', 'Anna Geislerová, Barbora Hrzánová, Soňa Valentová, Eva Holubová, Jaroslava Hanušová, Jan Schmid, Filip Renč, Eduard Cupák', null, 'A fourteen-year-old girl isplaced in an institution for mentally ill instead of a foster-home due to an official mistake. Here she gets a most cruel treatment which is governed by high-handedness of the spineless and perverse nurses. The girl attempts a desperate escape.', 'A fourteen-year-old girl isplaced in an institution for mentally ill instead of a foster-home due to an official mistake. Here she gets a most cruel treatment which is governed by high-handedness of the spineless and perverse nurses. The girl attempts a desperate escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KVUMxNA7oCNNz7jvYKBzgk1k77.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81197'),
  ('709764026944414961', 'Requiem for a Vampire', 1972, 'Horror', 'Jean Rollin, Renan Pollès', 'Jean Rollin', 'Marie-Pierre Castel, Mireille Dargent, Philippe Gasté, Louise D''hour, Dominique, Paul Bisciglia, Michel Delesalle, Antoine Mosin', null, 'Two girls on the run get lost in the French countryside, and wind up in a haunted chateau occupied by an ailing vampire and his servants.', 'Two girls on the run get lost in the French countryside, and wind up in a haunted chateau occupied by an ailing vampire and his servants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzVCXhUDqWld6LxkRwzdWaBX9Hv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29111'),
  ('1116191325512206785', 'Requiem for a Village', 1975, 'Drama', 'David Gladwell', 'David Gladwell', 'Vic Smith', null, 'The idyllic, rural past of a Suffolk village comes to life through the memories of an old man who tends a country graveyard.', 'The idyllic, rural past of a Suffolk village comes to life through the memories of an old man who tends a country graveyard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guM8xoIPohgJoVmwaedAQXBtJSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85516'),
  ('216841389851760599', 'Requiem for the American Dream', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Robert Featherstone, Peter D. Hutchison, Kelly Nyks', 'Kelly Nyks, Jared P. Scott, Peter D. Hutchison', 'Noam Chomsky', null, 'Through interviews filmed over four years, Noam Chomsky unpacks the principles that have brought us to the crossroads of historically unprecedented inequality – tracing a half-century of policies designed to favor the most wealthy at the expense of the majority – while also looking back on his own life of activism and political participation. He provides penetrating insight into what may well be the lasting legacy of our time – the death of the middle class, and swan song of functioning democracy.', 'Through interviews filmed over four years, Noam Chomsky unpacks the principles that have brought us to the crossroads of historically unprecedented inequality – tracing a half-century of policies designed to favor the most wealthy at the expense of the majority – while also looking back on his own life of activism and political participation. He provides penetrating insight into what may well be the lasting legacy of our time – the death of the middle class, and swan song of functioning democracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z30fIUchddu5RPUN8JWFiDhk2yp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333377'),
  ('331673543311740248', 'Réquiem por un campesino español', 1985, 'Crime, War, Drama', 'Francesc Betriu, Raúl Artigot', 'Ramón J. Sender', 'Antonio Banderas, Terele Pávez, Francisco Algora, Simón Andreu, Mari Carmen Alvarado, Yolanda Botella, Susana Buen, Eduardo Calvo', null, 'Hypocrisy and betrayal are the two dramatic pivots in this effective, emotionally gripping tragedy about the life and death of Paco (Antonio Banderas), a Spanish peasant who had been fighting against the feudal landowning system that kept farmers impoverished. Paco''s life is told in flashbacks by a priest (Antonio Ferrandis) who is seen officiating at an anniversary mass attended by three wealthy landowners and no one else. The priest recalls Paco''s baptism, his communion, his marriage ceremony and then his work for the peasants as he advocated and led them in a land-reform movement. The rest of the story will rest heavy on the priest''s conscience, as he looks out at his empty church.', 'Hypocrisy and betrayal are the two dramatic pivots in this effective, emotionally gripping tragedy about the life and death of Paco (Antonio Banderas), a Spanish peasant who had been fighting against the feudal landowning system that kept farmers impoverished. Paco''s life is told in flashbacks by a priest (Antonio Ferrandis) who is seen officiating at an anniversary mass attended by three wealthy landowners and no one else. The priest recalls Paco''s baptism, his communion, his marriage ceremony and then his work for the peasants as he advocated and led them in a land-reform movement. The rest of the story will rest heavy on the priest''s conscience, as he looks out at his empty church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c14a5CGjIPvy3QP6bJIfebHiqVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197363'),
  ('21600328567878087', 'Requirements to Be a Normal Person', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Leticia Dolera, Marc Gómez del Moral', 'Leticia Dolera', 'Leticia Dolera, Manuel Burque, Miki Esparbé, Alexandra Jiménez, David Verdaguer, Núria Gago, Sílvia Munt, Carmen Machi', null, 'Maria is 30 years old, she is a peculiar person and has one goal: become a normal person. But first of all she must discover what is exactly this. Which kind of person is she? Is she a normal person? What does exactly means? That question goes deeper into her mind. After she lists every requirements, she proposes to reach them. In that journey she will find her brother''s help, Alex, a 25 years old boy who is mentally challenged and achieves every list requirements. She meets Borja as well, a boy obsessed with diets and lose weight. They will make a curious pact: she helps him to live an active and healthy live, and he helps her to meet her goal: become a normal person.', 'Maria is 30 years old, she is a peculiar person and has one goal: become a normal person. But first of all she must discover what is exactly this. Which kind of person is she? Is she a normal person? What does exactly means? That question goes deeper into her mind. After she lists every requirements, she proposes to reach them. In that journey she will find her brother''s help, Alex, a 25 years old boy who is mentally challenged and achieves every list requirements. She meets Borja as well, a boy obsessed with diets and lose weight. They will make a curious pact: she helps him to live an active and healthy live, and he helps her to meet her goal: become a normal person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vujRsKU37cPAyRlILCZNgOXuKxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331354'),
  ('3132218863107898', 'Rescue Dawn', 2007, 'Adventure, Drama, War', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger, Apichart Chusakul', null, 'Christian Bale, Steve Zahn, Toby Huss, François Chau, Marshall Bell, Jeremy Davies, Pat Healy, James Aaron Oliver', 'PG-13', 'A US Fighter pilot''s epic struggle of survival after being shot down on a mission over Laos during the Vietnam War.', 'A US Fighter pilot''s epic struggle of survival after being shot down on a mission over Laos during the Vietnam War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymPlV2ymUBSctfRzpehFOxFmJiS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9952'),
  ('855645153821250141', 'Rescue Dog', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'The snow covered mountains; but not to worry, rescue dog Pluto is on duty. Actually, given that he barely keeps himself safe, maybe you should worry. A playful seal keeps stealing his cask of grog.', 'The snow covered mountains; but not to worry, rescue dog Pluto is on duty. Actually, given that he barely keeps himself safe, maybe you should worry. A playful seal keeps stealing his cask of grog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fE22ToJEjeOJHAVmNuCVm1ASGga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148841'),
  ('474764303321602067', 'Rescue from Gilligan''s Island', 1978, 'Comedy, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Leslie H. Martinson, Robert Primes', 'David P. Harmon, Al Schwartz, Elroy Schwartz', 'Bob Denver, Alan Hale Jr., Jim Backus, Natalie Schafer, Judith Baldwin, Russell Johnson, Dawn Wells, Vincent Schiavelli', 'G', 'When a decaying Russian satellite crashes on the island, the Professor uses a key component for a barometer. With that device, he learns that a massive wave is going to swamp the island. In desperation, the castaways lash their huts together into one structure in order to have any chance to ride the disaster out.', 'When a decaying Russian satellite crashes on the island, the Professor uses a key component for a barometer. With that device, he learns that a massive wave is going to swamp the island. In desperation, the castaways lash their huts together into one structure in order to have any chance to ride the disaster out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOzFIycJHZYqXygsFAdfQ1Krao7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32677'),
  ('502475468951650872', 'Rescue Me', 1992, 'Action, Comedy', 'Arthur Allan Seidelman', 'Mike Snyder', 'Michael Dudikoff, Stephen Dorff, Ami Dolenz, Peter DeLuise, William Lucking, Dee Wallace, Liz Torres, Danny Nucci', null, 'Fraser''s unrequited love for the beautiful and rich Ginny gets a chance to prove itself, when she is suddenly kidnapped. He teams up with rebel Mac, who''s got a score to settle with the kidnappers. Together they cross the country, looking for Ginny and the bad guys.', 'Fraser''s unrequited love for the beautiful and rich Ginny gets a chance to prove itself, when she is suddenly kidnapped. He teams up with rebel Mac, who''s got a score to settle with the kidnappers. Together they cross the country, looking for Ginny and the bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOJibGA1OejhwSdjFd6v9EqECHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110624'),
  ('525058278652586769', 'Rescue Me!', 2013, 'Comedy, Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Keiichiro Kawaguchi', 'Keiichiro Kawaguchi', 'Ryota Osaka, Mayuka Nomura, Natsumi Takamori, Fukumi Matsumoto, Marie Miyake, Kazuyuki Okitsu', null, 'Masayuki''s parents have gone overseas, leaving him alone in the house. To his surprise, they have hired Sayaka, a fellow student from school, to work as his maid while they are gone. Masayuki wants his life to be peaceful, but alongside Sayaka''s affections he also has to fend off the attention of his kohai, his younger aunt, and his aunt''s yandere lesbian admirer.', 'Masayuki''s parents have gone overseas, leaving him alone in the house. To his surprise, they have hired Sayaka, a fellow student from school, to work as his maid while they are gone. Masayuki wants his life to be peaceful, but alongside Sayaka''s affections he also has to fend off the attention of his kohai, his younger aunt, and his aunt''s yandere lesbian admirer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bMw0Adc3nd58LC0VFvq35Jp9AL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278079'),
  ('576689471306838827', 'Rescue Squad Mater', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'John Lasseter, Rob Gibbs, Victor Navone', 'John Lasseter, Rob Gibbs, Bobby Rubio', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Keith Ferguson, Lindsey Collins, Elissa Knight, Peter Sohn, Bob Peterson, Bob Scott, Bret Parker', null, 'Lightning McQueen and Mater are driving in Radiator Springs and drive past Red, who is hosing some plants near Stanley. Mater tells Lightning that he used to be a firetruck, but Lightning doesn''t believe Mater.', 'Lightning McQueen and Mater are driving in Radiator Springs and drive past Red, who is hosing some plants near Stanley. Mater tells Lightning that he used to be a firetruck, but Lightning doesn''t believe Mater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mLBoPMSXshWjknql6dxc2DAfZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56553'),
  ('702853995773084433', 'Rescue Under Fire', 2017, 'War', 'Adolfo Martínez Pérez', 'Luis Arranz, Andrés M. Koppel', 'Ariadna Gil, Roberto Álamo, Antonio Garrido, Raúl Mérida, Mariano Hernández, Ruth Gabriel, Jesús Castro, Jacobo Dicenta', null, 'The crew of a medical helicopter suffers an accident when helping a joint force of USA and United Nations troops under Spanish command division in Afghanistan. The Spanish army has only one night to organize the rescue of the crew and injured, but what seems routine turns into hell once they receive the order to rescue the helicopter as well. Things only get worse when during the night a huge a concentration of Talibans begin surround them.', 'The crew of a medical helicopter suffers an accident when helping a joint force of USA and United Nations troops under Spanish command division in Afghanistan. The Spanish army has only one night to organize the rescue of the crew and injured, but what seems routine turns into hell once they receive the order to rescue the helicopter as well. Things only get worse when during the night a huge a concentration of Talibans begin surround them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxXIVJGmmckUzzxeAhp7t92NHmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437031'),
  ('472187222593872815', 'Rescued by Ruby', 2022, 'Family, Drama', 'Katt Shea, David Bercovici-Artieda', 'Karen Janszen', 'Grant Gustin, Scott Wolf, Kaylah Zander, Camille Sullivan, Tom McBeath, Sharon Taylor, Eileen Pedde, Jude Culham-Keays', 'G', 'Chasing his dream to join an elite K-9 unit, a state trooper partners with a fellow underdog: clever but naughty shelter pup Ruby. Based on a true story.', 'Chasing his dream to join an elite K-9 unit, a state trooper partners with a fellow underdog: clever but naughty shelter pup Ruby. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPlJEodEn0SSV4avo8KSawtlTlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921655'),
  ('421199105212468750', 'Research in the Interest of Families', 2011, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Franck Mancuso', null, 'Yvan Attal, Valentina Cervi, Carlo Brandt, Pascal Elso, Talid Ariss, Pascal Elbé, Armelle Deutsch, Jean-Charles Rousseau', null, 'A policeman takes his family on a holiday, and after almost hitting a wild hog, the car won''t start. They get hike with a guy scrutinizing his pretty wife. Shortly after, she disappears.', 'A policeman takes his family on a holiday, and after almost hitting a wild hog, the car won''t start. They get hike with a guy scrutinizing his pretty wife. Shortly after, she disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vC6Sx4gT5xSwN3TAXeaHSPf1fc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83097'),
  ('108771440066338354', 'Reservation Road', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Terry George, John Lindley, Eddie Micallef', 'Terry George, John Burnham Schwartz', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Jennifer Connelly, Elle Fanning, Sean Curley, Mark Ruffalo, Mira Sorvino, Gary Kohn, Eddie Alderson', 'R', 'Two fathers'' lives intersect when one of them is involved in a terrible and sudden hit-and-run car accident that leaves the other''s son dead. In response, the two men react in unexpected ways as a reckoning looms in the near future.', 'Two fathers'' lives intersect when one of them is involved in a terrible and sudden hit-and-run car accident that leaves the other''s son dead. In response, the two men react in unexpected ways as a reckoning looms in the near future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZaYofgshgEkeW4Huo3o6tEX89C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8954'),
  ('79433310186875580', 'Reserve Officer', 1972, 'Drama', 'Yuri Boretsky, Leonid Proskurov, Vitaliy Dyomin', 'Nikolai Gibu, Zinaida Chirkova', 'Boris Zajdenberg, Irina Akulova, Victor Soțchi-Voinicescu, Grigore Grigoriu, Svetlana Korkoshko, Vladimir Kozel, Antonina Maksimova, Victor Ciutac', null, 'About the concerns of the reserve officer, and now the secretary of the district committee Kirill Buzhor.', 'About the concerns of the reserve officer, and now the secretary of the district committee Kirill Buzhor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPjU73tfjHxqh9RJbup9quVgWQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1427828'),
  ('124599902243637532', 'Reservoir Dogs', 1991, 'Crime, Drama', 'Quentin Tarantino, Quentin Tarantino', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'David Jensen, Steve Buscemi, Quentin Tarantino', null, 'Short film made with the help of the Sundance Film Institute and serving as a proof-of-concept for the subsequent feature film.', 'Short film made with the help of the Sundance Film Institute and serving as a proof-of-concept for the subsequent feature film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oiPx0edR4IoT97KOHDJx4n1dk5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443129'),
  ('599913222509048454', 'Reservoir Dogs', 1992, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Andrzej Sekula, Jamie Beardsley, Steven K. Thomas', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Harvey Keitel, Tim Roth, Michael Madsen, Chris Penn, Steve Buscemi, Lawrence Tierney, Randy Brooks, Kirk Baltz', 'R', 'A botched robbery indicates a police informant, and the pressure mounts in the aftermath at a warehouse. Crime begets violence as the survivors -- veteran Mr. White, newcomer Mr. Orange, psychopathic parolee Mr. Blonde, bickering weasel Mr. Pink and Nice Guy Eddie -- unravel.', 'A botched robbery indicates a police informant, and the pressure mounts in the aftermath at a warehouse. Crime begets violence as the survivors -- veteran Mr. White, newcomer Mr. Orange, psychopathic parolee Mr. Blonde, bickering weasel Mr. Pink and Nice Guy Eddie -- unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi8Iu6qyTfyZVDVy60raIOYJJmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500'),
  ('870149284574590834', 'Reset', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Thierry Demaizière, Alban Teurlai, Alban Teurlai', null, 'Benjamin Millepied', null, 'In early 2013, it was announced that choreographer and dancer Benjamin Millepied, known as the man behind the ballet of Black Swan, would take over as director of the Paris Opera Ballet. Reset finds Millepied on the eve of his first gala with the Opera, designing and refining his inaugural choreography for the esteemed institution. As a film, Reset possesses of the same artistic assuredness as its subject as he blocks out the preliminary steps for his choreography. It explores various concepts of space simultaneously: the digital space, the space of the opera house (each scene opens with a declaration of which studio it’s in) and the space of the stage, the distance from stage right to stage left. It’s a portrait of a watershed moment for one of the ballet''s oldest institutions and one of its brightest new stars, both on the cusp of great transition.', 'In early 2013, it was announced that choreographer and dancer Benjamin Millepied, known as the man behind the ballet of Black Swan, would take over as director of the Paris Opera Ballet. Reset finds Millepied on the eve of his first gala with the Opera, designing and refining his inaugural choreography for the esteemed institution. As a film, Reset possesses of the same artistic assuredness as its subject as he blocks out the preliminary steps for his choreography. It explores various concepts of space simultaneously: the digital space, the space of the opera house (each scene opens with a declaration of which studio it’s in) and the space of the stage, the distance from stage right to stage left. It’s a portrait of a watershed moment for one of the ballet''s oldest institutions and one of its brightest new stars, both on the cusp of great transition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHlmnsHkVXuswm30i4ntcAzvHNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390518'),
  ('766087742705447903', 'Reset', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'You Seok-moon, Chang, Song Byeong-gi', 'Zha Muchun, Kim Jin-a', 'Yang Mi, Wallace Huo, King Shih-chieh, Liu Chang, Hummer Zhang, Wang Lidan, Kim Hie-won, Na Kwang-hoon', 'R', 'In 2025, a scientist on the verge of making a major discovery related to time travel is suddenly put in peril when a rival kidnaps her young son and demands a hefty ransom: her entire research.', 'In 2025, a scientist on the verge of making a major discovery related to time travel is suddenly put in peril when a rival kidnaps her young son and demands a hefty ransom: her entire research.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwTonDtQstoMQHYEBCz8x8RvBJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457832'),
  ('169595514512228692', 'Resident Evil', 2002, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Paul W. S. Anderson, David Johnson, Paul Goldsmith', 'Paul W. S. Anderson', 'Milla Jovovich, Michelle Rodriguez, Eric Mabius, James Purefoy, Martin Crewes, Colin Salmon, Pasquale Aleardi, Heike Makatsch', 'R', 'When a virus leaks from a top-secret facility, turning all resident researchers into ravenous zombies and their lab animals into mutated hounds from hell, the government sends in an elite military task force to contain the outbreak.', 'When a virus leaks from a top-secret facility, turning all resident researchers into ravenous zombies and their lab animals into mutated hounds from hell, the government sends in an elite military task force to contain the outbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UKNef590A0ZaMnxsscIcWuK1Em.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1576'),
  ('478989605742201591', 'Resident Evil: Afterlife', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Glen MacPherson, Paul W. S. Anderson, Vern Nobles', 'Paul W. S. Anderson', 'Milla Jovovich, Wentworth Miller, Ali Larter, Kim Coates, Kacey Barnfield, Shawn Roberts, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Boris Kodjoe', 'R', 'In a world ravaged by a virus infection, turning its victims into the Undead, Alice continues on her journey to find survivors and lead them to safety. Her deadly battle with the Umbrella Corporation reaches new heights, but Alice gets some unexpected help from an old friend. A new lead that promises a safe haven from the Undead takes them to Los Angeles, but when they arrive the city is overrun by thousands of Undead - and Alice and her comrades are about to step into a deadly trap.', 'In a world ravaged by a virus infection, turning its victims into the Undead, Alice continues on her journey to find survivors and lead them to safety. Her deadly battle with the Umbrella Corporation reaches new heights, but Alice gets some unexpected help from an old friend. A new lead that promises a safe haven from the Undead takes them to Los Angeles, but when they arrive the city is overrun by thousands of Undead - and Alice and her comrades are about to step into a deadly trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYPc4sJdCZLY7YFYUmqXXYt3luH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35791'),
  ('788831573809133310', 'Resident Evil: Apocalypse', 2004, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Alexander Witt, Derek Rogers, Christian Sebaldt', 'Paul W. S. Anderson', 'Milla Jovovich, Sienna Guillory, Oded Fehr, Thomas Kretschmann, Sophie Vavasseur, Razaaq Adoti, Jared Harris, Mike Epps', 'R', 'As the city is locked down under quarantine, Alice finds out that the people that died from the previous incident at the Umbrella Corporation have turned into zombies. She then joins a small band of elite soldiers, who are enlisted to rescue the missing daughter of the creator of the mutating T-virus. Once lack of luck and resources happen, they begin to wage an exhilarating battle to survive and escape before the Umbrella Corporation erases its experiment from the face of the earth.', 'As the city is locked down under quarantine, Alice finds out that the people that died from the previous incident at the Umbrella Corporation have turned into zombies. She then joins a small band of elite soldiers, who are enlisted to rescue the missing daughter of the creator of the mutating T-virus. Once lack of luck and resources happen, they begin to wage an exhilarating battle to survive and escape before the Umbrella Corporation erases its experiment from the face of the earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/way9dOm4dM2sm9UMcu2PEXMTX0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1577'),
  ('196652675266976377', 'Resident Evil: Damnation', 2012, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Makoto Kamiya, Hiroyuki Hamada', 'Shoutarou Suga', 'Matthew Mercer, Courtenay Taylor, Robin Sachs, Dave Wittenberg, Wendee Lee, Val Tasso, Salli Saffioti, Patrick Seitz', 'R', 'U.S. federal agent Leon S. Kennedy sneaks into the "East Slavic Republic" to verify rumors that Bio-Organic Weapons (BOWs) are being used in the country''s civil war, which the U.S. and Russia are making preparations to jointly intervene in. Right after his infiltration, the U.S. government orders him to leave immediately. Determined to uncover the truth, Leon ignores the order and enters the battlefield to end the chain of tragedies caused by the BOWs.', 'U.S. federal agent Leon S. Kennedy sneaks into the "East Slavic Republic" to verify rumors that Bio-Organic Weapons (BOWs) are being used in the country''s civil war, which the U.S. and Russia are making preparations to jointly intervene in. Right after his infiltration, the U.S. government orders him to leave immediately. Determined to uncover the truth, Leon ignores the order and enters the battlefield to end the chain of tragedies caused by the BOWs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkHSURVCrt7rpvDDgUXO75CV1v4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133121'),
  ('1080229625688583773', 'Resident Evil: Death Island', 2023, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Yuta Morokaji, Eiichiro Hasumi, Tomohiro Shimizu', 'Makoto Fukami', 'Matthew Mercer, Nicole Tompkins, Kevin Dorman, Stephanie Panisello, Erin Cahill, Salli Saffioti, Daman Mills, Lucien Dodge', 'R', 'In San Francisco, Jill Valentine is dealing with a zombie outbreak and a new T-Virus, Leon Kennedy is on the trail of a kidnapped DARPA scientist, and Claire Redfield is investigating a monstrous fish that is killing whales in the bay. Joined by Chris Redfield and Rebecca Chambers, they discover the trail of clues from their separate cases all converge on the same location, Alcatraz Island, where a new evil has taken residence and awaits their arrival.', 'In San Francisco, Jill Valentine is dealing with a zombie outbreak and a new T-Virus, Leon Kennedy is on the trail of a kidnapped DARPA scientist, and Claire Redfield is investigating a monstrous fish that is killing whales in the bay. Joined by Chris Redfield and Rebecca Chambers, they discover the trail of clues from their separate cases all converge on the same location, Alcatraz Island, where a new evil has taken residence and awaits their arrival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qayga07ICNDswm0cMJ8P3VwklFZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083862'),
  ('461531114853285875', 'Resident Evil: Degeneration', 2008, 'Animation, Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Makoto Kamiya, Kentaro Fujisawa, Gaku Nagao', 'Shoutarou Suga', 'Paul Mercier, Alyson Court, Laura Bailey, Roger Craig Smith, Crispin Freeman, Michael Sorich, Salli Saffioti, Michelle Ruff', 'R', 'Leon S. Kennedy and Claire Redfield must battle a rogue warrior seeking revenge after unleashing the deadly G-Virus, whilst a mutated monster goes on a rampage.', 'Leon S. Kennedy and Claire Redfield must battle a rogue warrior seeking revenge after unleashing the deadly G-Virus, whilst a mutated monster goes on a rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1x5OaFOo38JAwR5yXxeuvQg3VWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13648'),
  ('400248229688206092', 'Resident Evil: Extinction', 2007, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Russell Mulcahy, David Johnson, Carlos Benassini', 'Paul W. S. Anderson', 'Milla Jovovich, Oded Fehr, Ali Larter, Iain Glen, Ashanti, Christopher Egan, Spencer Locke, Matthew Marsden', 'R', 'Years after the Racoon City catastrophe, survivors travel across the Nevada desert, hoping to make it to Alaska. Alice joins the caravan and their fight against hordes of zombies and the evil Umbrella Corp.', 'Years after the Racoon City catastrophe, survivors travel across the Nevada desert, hoping to make it to Alaska. Alice joins the caravan and their fight against hordes of zombies and the evil Umbrella Corp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yaLr7Ymg5cvbtSVi5hHwBKx35I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7737'),
  ('728998212506637099', 'Resident Evil: Retribution', 2012, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Paul W. S. Anderson, Jamie Christopher, Glen MacPherson', 'Paul W. S. Anderson', 'Milla Jovovich, Sienna Guillory, Michelle Rodriguez, Aryana Engineer, Li Bingbing, Boris Kodjoe, Kevin Durand, Johann Urb', 'R', 'The Umbrella Corporation’s deadly T-virus continues to ravage the Earth, transforming the global population into legions of the flesh eating Undead. The human race’s last and only hope, Alice, awakens in the heart of Umbrella’s most clandestine operations facility and unveils more of her mysterious past as she delves further into the complex. Without a safe haven, Alice continues to hunt those responsible for the outbreak; a chase that takes her from Tokyo to New York, Washington, D.C. and Moscow, culminating in a mind-blowing revelation that will force her to rethink everything that she once thought to be true. Aided by new found allies and familiar friends, Alice must fight to survive long enough to escape a hostile world on the brink of oblivion. The countdown has begun.', 'The Umbrella Corporation’s deadly T-virus continues to ravage the Earth, transforming the global population into legions of the flesh eating Undead. The human race’s last and only hope, Alice, awakens in the heart of Umbrella’s most clandestine operations facility and unveils more of her mysterious past as she delves further into the complex. Without a safe haven, Alice continues to hunt those responsible for the outbreak; a chase that takes her from Tokyo to New York, Washington, D.C. and Moscow, culminating in a mind-blowing revelation that will force her to rethink everything that she once thought to be true. Aided by new found allies and familiar friends, Alice must fight to survive long enough to escape a hostile world on the brink of oblivion. The countdown has begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohdUDWVlcbuWphaLu6wS91xdJ73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71679'),
  ('14905604145309246', 'Resident Evil: The Final Chapter', 2016, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Paul W. S. Anderson, Glen MacPherson, Guy Potgieter', 'Paul W. S. Anderson', 'Milla Jovovich, Iain Glen, Ali Larter, Shawn Roberts, Eoin Macken, Fraser James, Ruby Rose, William Levy', 'R', 'Picking up immediately after the events in Resident Evil: Retribution, Alice is the only survivor of what was meant to be humanity''s final stand against the undead. Now, she must return to where the nightmare began - The Hive in Raccoon City, where the Umbrella Corporation is gathering its forces for a final strike against the only remaining survivors of the apocalypse.', 'Picking up immediately after the events in Resident Evil: Retribution, Alice is the only survivor of what was meant to be humanity''s final stand against the undead. Now, she must return to where the nightmare began - The Hive in Raccoon City, where the Umbrella Corporation is gathering its forces for a final strike against the only remaining survivors of the apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7glPlA0xPpxPxBu0TnY4ulQVCV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173897'),
  ('479233160602895413', 'Resident Evil: Vendetta', 2017, 'Action, Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Takanori Tsujimoto, Tsubasa Nakai', 'Makoto Fukami', 'Kevin Dorman, Matthew Mercer, Erin Cahill, John DeMita, Fred Tatasciore, Cristina Valenzuela, Arif S. Kinchen, Kari Wahlgren', 'R', 'When a fearless enemy out for revenge unleashes a brutal and deadly new virus, BSAA captain Chris Redfield enlists the help of Agent Leon S. Kennedy and Professor Rebecca Chambers to bring down the death merchant and save New York City.', 'When a fearless enemy out for revenge unleashes a brutal and deadly new virus, BSAA captain Chris Redfield enlists the help of Agent Leon S. Kennedy and Professor Rebecca Chambers to bring down the death merchant and save New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdiMtgjWXEH9QZ85hgmWaSwshjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400136'),
  ('376141909960958540', 'Resident Evil: Welcome to Raccoon City', 2021, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Maxime Alexandre, Randi Lee Butcher, Matt Irwin', 'Johannes Roberts', 'Kaya Scodelario, Hannah John-Kamen, Robbie Amell, Tom Hopper, Avan Jogia, Donal Logue, Neal McDonough, Lily Gao', 'R', 'Once the booming home of pharmaceutical giant Umbrella Corporation, Raccoon City is now a dying Midwestern town. The company’s exodus left the city a wasteland…with great evil brewing below the surface. When that evil is unleashed, the townspeople are forever…changed…and a small group of survivors must work together to uncover the truth behind Umbrella and make it through the night.', 'Once the booming home of pharmaceutical giant Umbrella Corporation, Raccoon City is now a dying Midwestern town. The company’s exodus left the city a wasteland…with great evil brewing below the surface. When that evil is unleashed, the townspeople are forever…changed…and a small group of survivors must work together to uncover the truth behind Umbrella and make it through the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bArhvjRHl535XMaSh9VjInF2mSZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460458'),
  ('863189069747663442', 'Residue', 2020, 'Drama', 'Merawi Gerima, Mark Jeevaratnam', 'Merawi Gerima', 'Obinna Nwachukwu, Dennis Lindsey, Taline Stewart, Derron "Rizo" Scott, Jacari Dye, Julian Selman, Tyree Wormley, Melody Tally', null, 'A young filmmaker returns home after many years away, to write a script about his childhood, only to find his neighborhood unrecognizable and his childhood friends scattered to the wind.', 'A young filmmaker returns home after many years away, to write a script about his childhood, only to find his neighborhood unrecognizable and his childhood friends scattered to the wind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cNcZhZl2GvJ7WLmXvrYgcpiKUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666271'),
  ('284825736295259951', 'Resistance', 2019, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Bruno Polidoro, Zeca Brito, Glauco Urbim', 'Leo Garcia, Zeca Brito', 'Cleo, Leonardo Machado, Fernando Alves Pinto, José Henrique Ligabue, Letícia Sabatella, Sapiran Brito, Paulo César Peréio, Fábio Rangel', null, 'Brazil, 1961. In the underground of the Piratini Palace, the governor of Rio Grande do Sul, Leonel Brizola, awaits a bombing by the Brazilian armed forces. The country is on the verge of a civil war, following the resignation of president Jânio Quadros and the movement to keep vice-president João Goulart from taking office. Using the radio transmitter from his improvised bunker, Brizola sets up the Legality movement, to ensure Goulart''s right to the presidential chair. Caught in the crossfire, two brothers who are in love with the same woman unite to fight alongside Brizola.', 'Brazil, 1961. In the underground of the Piratini Palace, the governor of Rio Grande do Sul, Leonel Brizola, awaits a bombing by the Brazilian armed forces. The country is on the verge of a civil war, following the resignation of president Jânio Quadros and the movement to keep vice-president João Goulart from taking office. Using the radio transmitter from his improvised bunker, Brizola sets up the Legality movement, to ensure Goulart''s right to the presidential chair. Caught in the crossfire, two brothers who are in love with the same woman unite to fight alongside Brizola.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QoBe13JkCMuVZvCXBtnMDlEYRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460424'),
  ('417754012697392625', 'Resistance', 2020, 'War, History, Drama', 'Alex Gavigan, Jonathan Jakubowicz, M.I. Littin-Menz', 'Jonathan Jakubowicz', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Clémence Poésy, Matthias Schweighöfer, Bella Ramsey, Ed Harris, Edgar Ramírez, Géza Röhrig, Félix Moati', 'R', 'The story of mime Marcel Marceau as he works with a group of Jewish boy scouts and the French Resistance to save the lives of ten thousand orphans during World War II.', 'The story of mime Marcel Marceau as he works with a group of Jewish boy scouts and the French Resistance to save the lives of ten thousand orphans during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/As22MQ8G3ILsdzsSIv1u9qEz6hE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491926'),
  ('886588882241261427', 'Resistance: Karatay', 2018, 'War, History, Action, Thriller', 'Selahattin Sancakli', 'Selman Kayabaşı, Uğur Uzunok', 'Mehmet Aslantuğ, Fikret Kuşkan, Yurdaer Okur, Alperen Duymaz, Burcu Özberk, Nik Xhelilaj, Volkan Keskin, Ece Yaşar', null, 'In the middle of the 13th century, following the death of "The Iron Sultan, Alaeddin Keykubat," Mongols attack Anatolian Seljuks to destroy the last power against "The Great Khan". Allegiance or independence turns into an issue of debate among the Seljuk statesmen. A secret resistance is possible. A new and stronger state is not a dream. Emir Celaleddin Karatay, Vizier of Seljuks is to sparkle a nationwide resistance. His way is not predictable.', 'In the middle of the 13th century, following the death of "The Iron Sultan, Alaeddin Keykubat," Mongols attack Anatolian Seljuks to destroy the last power against "The Great Khan". Allegiance or independence turns into an issue of debate among the Seljuk statesmen. A secret resistance is possible. A new and stronger state is not a dream. Emir Celaleddin Karatay, Vizier of Seljuks is to sparkle a nationwide resistance. His way is not predictable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lS6qggUjTByMRNl5hyQDQdjiuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499468'),
  ('908384903815731829', 'Resolution', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Justin Benson, Aaron Moorhead, Aaron Moorhead', 'Justin Benson', 'Peter Cilella, Vinny Curran, Zahn McClarnon, Bill Oberst Jr., Emily Montague, Kurt David Anderson, Skyler Meacham, Josh Higgins', null, 'A man imprisons his estranged junkie friend in an isolated cabin in the boonies of San Diego to force him through a week of sobriety, but the events of that week are being mysteriously manipulated.', 'A man imprisons his estranged junkie friend in an isolated cabin in the boonies of San Diego to force him through a week of sobriety, but the events of that week are being mysteriously manipulated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTZTCMmU7N0qTWJrSUOVBI70ZlA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121606'),
  ('96345908142632234', 'Resort to Love', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Greg Gardiner, Steven K. Tsuchida', 'Dana Schmalenberg, Tabi McCartney', 'Christina Milian, Jay Pharoah, Sinqua Walls, Christiani Pitts, Karen Obilom, Alexander Hodge, T.J. Power, Sylvaine Strike', null, 'Aspiring pop star Erica ends up as the entertainment at her ex-fiancé’s wedding after reluctantly taking a gig at a luxurious island resort while in the wake of a music career meltdown.', 'Aspiring pop star Erica ends up as the entertainment at her ex-fiancé’s wedding after reluctantly taking a gig at a luxurious island resort while in the wake of a music career meltdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7w4gX4zRlONqThjhmjdxw93FAXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785539'),
  ('741494144487239354', 'Respect', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Karine Gauze, Géraldine Israel, Hervé Lodé', 'Benoît Forgeard', 'Thibault Sauvaige, Anne Steffens, Elliot Chaumet, Darius', null, 'The story is simply set around a couple fighting at the breakfast table. All is well, nothing out of the ordinary. Steph announces to his life partner Flippy, the mascot bear for Flipp’s cereals, that he wishes to go to Japan to fulfill his childhood’s dream: study at a Ninja school.', 'The story is simply set around a couple fighting at the breakfast table. All is well, nothing out of the ordinary. Steph announces to his life partner Flippy, the mascot bear for Flipp’s cereals, that he wishes to go to Japan to fulfill his childhood’s dream: study at a Ninja school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTZFTALxmEw4Gw7xTg1BqqphXKy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436687'),
  ('121168626326245639', 'Respect', 2021, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Kramer Morgenthau, Mark Dillon, Liesl Tommy', 'Tracey Scott Wilson', 'Jennifer Hudson, Forest Whitaker, Marlon Wayans, Audra McDonald, Mary J. Blige, Marc Maron, Tituss Burgess, Saycon Sengbloh', 'PG-13', 'The rise of Aretha Franklin’s career from a child singing in her father’s church’s choir to her international superstardom.', 'The rise of Aretha Franklin’s career from a child singing in her father’s church’s choir to her international superstardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUtPwOBZJc8uJnDqlCXTibdgxKz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592863'),
  ('390942067459121941', 'Respiri', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Gemma Iuliano, Alessandro Stellari, Andrea Bottazzini', 'Alfredo Fiorillo, Angela Prudenzi', 'Alessio Boni, Pino Calabrese, Milena Vukotić, Eva Grimaldi, Lino Capolicchio, Lidiya Liberman, Valentina Cenni, Eleonora Trevisani', null, 'Francis, a forty year old engineer, after a mysterious disgrace he retired to live in a village on Lake Iseo. With still little daughter occupies the former family villa, a magnificent Art Nouveau building on the lake shore. In the big house there is, however, another mysterious person, of which only perceives the echo of the respirator that keeps her alive. But other presences no less disturbing, and certainly more dangerous, they move around the villa. What happened to the man and his family? What secrets hide? Marta will know, childhood friend always in love with him, awaken Francis from the torpor in which he has fallen, and free him from the pain? And most importantly, how many succeed they gravitate around the house to escape the danger that threatens their lives? Breaths tells how the pain can profoundly transform a man crushed by memories, guilt, fears. He also wants to show the extent to which an individual is able to accept the existence paths without being a victim.', 'Francis, a forty year old engineer, after a mysterious disgrace he retired to live in a village on Lake Iseo. With still little daughter occupies the former family villa, a magnificent Art Nouveau building on the lake shore. In the big house there is, however, another mysterious person, of which only perceives the echo of the respirator that keeps her alive. But other presences no less disturbing, and certainly more dangerous, they move around the villa. What happened to the man and his family? What secrets hide? Marta will know, childhood friend always in love with him, awaken Francis from the torpor in which he has fallen, and free him from the pain? And most importantly, how many succeed they gravitate around the house to escape the danger that threatens their lives? Breaths tells how the pain can profoundly transform a man crushed by memories, guilt, fears. He also wants to show the extent to which an individual is able to accept the existence paths without being a victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVuzMRQTo0SKzUxa52Uy4SGdTwz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447757'),
  ('179728106978458375', 'Respiro', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Emanuele Crialese, Fabio Zamarion', 'Emanuele Crialese', 'Valeria Golino, Vincenzo Amato, Francesco Casisa, Veronica D''Agostino, Filippo Pucillo, Muzzi Loffredo, Elio Germano, Avy Marciano', null, 'Grazia is a free-spirited mother-of-three married to shy fisherman Pietro and living on the idyllic but isolated island of Lampedusa in the Mediterranean Sea. She shows signs of manic depressive behavior — one moment she''s laughing wildly and swimming half-naked in the sea, while the next she''s curled in a ball on her bed. Out of her earshot, the adult members of her extended family vaguely discuss sending her to a facility of some sort in Northern Italy.', 'Grazia is a free-spirited mother-of-three married to shy fisherman Pietro and living on the idyllic but isolated island of Lampedusa in the Mediterranean Sea. She shows signs of manic depressive behavior — one moment she''s laughing wildly and swimming half-naked in the sea, while the next she''s curled in a ball on her bed. Out of her earshot, the adult members of her extended family vaguely discuss sending her to a facility of some sort in Northern Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DUXqmOpHZBQSQOHQcAdK6GVlKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12544'),
  ('289477092006929739', 'Ressha Sentai ToQger Returns: Super ToQ #7 of Dreams', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Fumie Arakawa', 'Sho Aikawa', 'Jun Shison, Jin Hiramaki, Riria Kojima, Ryusei Yokohama, Ai Moritaka, Shin Nagahama, Homare Mabuchi, Keishiro Nagase', null, 'The year is 2025, 10 years after the fight against Z. The ToQgers are all grown up and have now entered life. But one day, the Shadow Line reappears and the fight must resume. Right and his friends try to repel them but they can’t transform because they lack imagination. Fortunately for them, a mysterious purple warrior appears to save them. Will they be able to defeat the Evil Army Shadow Line once and for all? Will they find the ultimate imagination?', 'The year is 2025, 10 years after the fight against Z. The ToQgers are all grown up and have now entered life. But one day, the Shadow Line reappears and the fight must resume. Right and his friends try to repel them but they can’t transform because they lack imagination. Fortunately for them, a mysterious purple warrior appears to save them. Will they be able to defeat the Evil Army Shadow Line once and for all? Will they find the ultimate imagination?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XaNFy4vjSXJmIKxabZfpha0FFl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354224'),
  ('1027685498668301987', 'Ressha Sentai ToQger vs. Kamen Rider Gaim: Spring Break Combined Special', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Shojiro Nakazawa', 'Nobuhiro Mouri', 'Gaku Sano, Jun Shison, Jin Hiramaki, Riria Kojima, Ryusei Yokohama, Ai Moritaka, Mahiro Takasugi, Yutaka Kobayashi', null, 'The ToQGers stop at a station in Zawame City, where there is no Shadow Line activity. However, they come across Kamen Rider Gaim and are brought into a fight with the Underground Empire known as Badan. As the ToQGers and the Armored Riders work together to discover Badan’s true intentions, a mysterious Rider calling himself Fifteen appears…', 'The ToQGers stop at a station in Zawame City, where there is no Shadow Line activity. However, they come across Kamen Rider Gaim and are brought into a fight with the Underground Empire known as Badan. As the ToQGers and the Armored Riders work together to discover Badan’s true intentions, a mysterious Rider calling himself Fifteen appears…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqoigTBo7qS4PqU6cwWtEdYJIC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270893'),
  ('28805137264921215', 'Ressha Sentai ToQger vs. Kyoryuger: The Movie', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Katsuya Watanabe', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Jun Shison, Jin Hiramaki, Riria Kojima, Ryusei Yokohama, Ai Moritaka, Shin Nagahama, Ryo Ryusei, Syuusuke Saito', null, 'ToQger vs. Kyoryuger will see the twelve rangers from both teams join forces to fight against an evil super giant. They must also save the Galaxy Line, which is falling from space. To make matters worse, the five main ToQgers are turned into children by a Shadow Monster.', 'ToQger vs. Kyoryuger will see the twelve rangers from both teams join forces to fight against an evil super giant. They must also save the Galaxy Line, which is falling from space. To make matters worse, the five main ToQgers are turned into children by a Shadow Monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kRtkuCCjvcRLF3wK60GzA11jOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313462'),
  ('716007685922080619', 'Rest in Peace', 2024, 'Drama', 'Rolo Pulpeiro, Marcello Pozzo, Sebastián Borensztein', 'Sebastián Borensztein, Marcos Osorio Vidal', 'Joaquín Furriel, Griselda Siciliani, Gabriel Goity, Lali González, Luciano Borges, Raúl Daumas, Alicia Guerra, Macarena Suárez Dagliano', null, 'A debt-ridden father takes advantage of an unforeseen situation to disappear and live off the grid under a false identity. But a chance event occurs and the temptation to want to know his family resurfaces.', 'A debt-ridden father takes advantage of an unforeseen situation to disappear and live off the grid under a false identity. But a chance event occurs and the temptation to want to know his family resurfaces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQTpmzVlg55Fj0IXnkhzOyBP6kz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1106049'),
  ('195608620997681166', 'Rest in Pieces', 1987, 'Horror', 'José Ramón Larraz, John Tharp, Manuel Rojas', 'Santiago Moncada', 'Scott Thompson Baker, Lorin Jean Vail, Dorothy Malone, Jack Taylor, Patty Shepard, Jeffrey Segal, Fernando Bilbao, Carole James', null, 'A newlywed couple move into the mansion of the bride''s recently dead aunt. Soon strange things begin to happen when the various tenants and servants of the mansion don''t want to leave and the bride and groom are in a deadly predicament.', 'A newlywed couple move into the mansion of the bride''s recently dead aunt. Soon strange things begin to happen when the various tenants and servants of the mansion don''t want to leave and the bride and groom are in a deadly predicament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkKMAqhdB08YbEKzLgPibqvHSvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30796'),
  ('388714268466778206', 'Rest Stop', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Shiban, Mark Vargo', 'John Shiban', 'Jaimie Alexander, Joey Mendicino, Deanna Russo, Diane Salinger, Curtis Taylor, Joey Lawrence, Gary Entin, Edmund Entin', 'NR', 'In Texas, the aspirant actress Nicole Carrow runs away home to Los Angeles with her boyfriend Jess Hilts. They drive through a shortcut in an old road, and when they park in a rest stop, Jess is abducted by the sadistic driver of an old yellow truck. Along the night, Nicole is threatened by the sick maniac, while mysterious things happen to her in the place.', 'In Texas, the aspirant actress Nicole Carrow runs away home to Los Angeles with her boyfriend Jess Hilts. They drive through a shortcut in an old road, and when they park in a rest stop, Jess is abducted by the sadistic driver of an old yellow truck. Along the night, Nicole is threatened by the sick maniac, while mysterious things happen to her in the place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrmgeb2v8MTqk0sl9uBst06E3qc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9841'),
  ('961526775938007824', 'Rest Stop: Don''t Look Back', 2008, 'Horror', 'Shawn Papazian', 'John Shiban', 'Richard Tillman, Jessie Ward, Graham Norris, Joey Mendicino, Julie Mond, Brionne Davis, Diane Salinger, Michael Childers', 'NR', 'One year after running away from home, Nicole and Jesse are still missing. When Jesse''s brother, Tom, returns home from active duty, he sets out with his friends Marilyn and Jared to locate the lost couple. Their search leads them to the stretch of old highway with a mysterious Rest Stop, where they find themselves in the same predicament as Nicole and Jesse: confronting a madman.', 'One year after running away from home, Nicole and Jesse are still missing. When Jesse''s brother, Tom, returns home from active duty, he sets out with his friends Marilyn and Jared to locate the lost couple. Their search leads them to the stretch of old highway with a mysterious Rest Stop, where they find themselves in the same predicament as Nicole and Jesse: confronting a madman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXe8PPETH134KOWYW50OrwG6nPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19066'),
  ('343804429109811185', 'Restart the Earth', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Lin Zhenzhao', 'Lin Zhenzhao', 'He Shengming, Luo Mi, Michelle Ye Xuan, Yu Rongguang, Li Ning, Zhang Mingcan, Li Ruoxi, Huang Kai-Lun', null, 'When a drug to replicate plant cells creates a sentient form of flower, the planet is over taken by flora and humankind is depleted. A Chinese task force, a widowed father and his young daughter fight to survive in a mission to inject an antidote to the core of the plants to reverse their growth.', 'When a drug to replicate plant cells creates a sentient form of flower, the planet is over taken by flora and humankind is depleted. A Chinese task force, a widowed father and his young daughter fight to survive in a mission to inject an antidote to the core of the plants to reverse their growth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kl80N1g69v9QXe1wvkFza31WhD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870096'),
  ('519509226920399855', 'Resting Place', 1986, 'Drama', 'John Korty, William Wages', 'Walter Halsey Davis', 'John Lithgow, Morgan Freeman, CCH Pounder, Frances Sternhagen, Richard Brooks, Richard Bradford, G.D. Spradlin, M. Emmet Walsh', 'PG', 'A television movie set in Rockville, Georgia, in 1972. Major Kendall Laird, a Survival Assistance Officer, arrives in this sleepy little town with the body of Lieutenant Dwyte Johnson, a Vietnam war hero. It''s Laird''s job to help Johnson''s parents bury their son. But since the dead hero was black, his parents are turned away by the white racists who maintain the town''s "all-white" cemetery.', 'A television movie set in Rockville, Georgia, in 1972. Major Kendall Laird, a Survival Assistance Officer, arrives in this sleepy little town with the body of Lieutenant Dwyte Johnson, a Vietnam war hero. It''s Laird''s job to help Johnson''s parents bury their son. But since the dead hero was black, his parents are turned away by the white racists who maintain the town''s "all-white" cemetery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dv0wGog8xcdJQ8wN2ADuNOXj1he.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71741'),
  ('873760223302474370', 'Restless', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aku Louhimies, Mac Ahlberg, Ray Corbett', 'Aleksi Bardy', 'Mikko Nousiainen, Laura Malmivaara, Irina Björklund, Petteri Summanen, Matleena Kuusniemi, Valtteri Roiha, Samuli Edelmann, Vilma Melasniemi', null, 'Ari, a paramedic, is a chronic womanizer; he makes it a point of pride to never sleep with the same woman twice, and his nights are a long series of brazen one-night stands. But when Ari meets Tiina, something unexpected happens – he falls in love.', 'Ari, a paramedic, is a chronic womanizer; he makes it a point of pride to never sleep with the same woman twice, and his nights are a long series of brazen one-night stands. But when Ari meets Tiina, something unexpected happens – he falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MQyo1msG02u7MPZe3IxvmPOkgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20160'),
  ('244523422001945750', 'Restless', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Harris Savides, Gus Van Sant, Ian Calip', 'Jason Lew', 'Mia Wasikowska, Henry Hopper, Ryo Kase, Schuyler Fisk, Jane Adams, Lusia Strus, Jesse Henderson, Kyle Justin Leatherberry', 'PG-13', 'Two outsiders, both shaped by the circumstances that have brought them together, forge a deep and lasting love.', 'Two outsiders, both shaped by the circumstances that have brought them together, forge a deep and lasting love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cv0AonfuCDrt1sfR8HRopODEbul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47760'),
  ('38812322521924357', 'Restless', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Régis Blondeau', 'Julien Colombani, Régis Blondeau', 'Franck Gastambide, Simon Abkarian, Michaël Abiteboul, Tracy Gotoas, Serge Hazanavicius, Victoire Zenner, Perez Michael, Nabil Missoumi', 'R', 'After going to extremes to cover up an accident, a corrupt cop''s life spirals out of control when he starts receiving threats from a mysterious witness.', 'After going to extremes to cover up an accident, a corrupt cop''s life spirals out of control when he starts receiving threats from a mysterious witness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aw4GGsRwhQtyLsjzC7dsAahfCDY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928381'),
  ('210213330003772978', 'Restless Knights', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Charles Lamont', 'Felix Adler', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Geneva Mitchell, Walter Brennan, Al Thompson, Bobby Burns', 'NR', 'Set in Medieval times, the stooges learn they are of royal blood and vow to save the kingdom. They become the queen''s royal guards but are sentenced to die when the queen is abducted on the orders of the evil prime minister. The stooges escape, free the queen, and end up knocking each other out.', 'Set in Medieval times, the stooges learn they are of royal blood and vow to save the kingdom. They become the queen''s royal guards but are sentenced to die when the queen is abducted on the orders of the evil prime minister. The stooges escape, free the queen, and end up knocking each other out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHwzHyfJu2XKbEUf3SvMd0UzWgk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115774'),
  ('664162368448185795', 'Restless Love', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Vera Egito, Camila Cornelsen', 'Vera Egito', 'Maria Laura Nogueira, Renata Gaspar, Thiago Pethit, Ana Cañas, Lucas Brilhante, Sarah Oliveira, Thiago Pinheiro, Nara Chaib Mendes', null, 'São Paulo best friends Julia, Micaela and Diego enter their thirties entirely unprepared for the considerations of adult maturity. Julia has chosen to remain blind to the obvious signs that her current boyfriend is a two-timing cad, but her eyes are forced wide-open when she discovers that she is pregnant with his child. Diego is a party boy with daddy issues who can’t stay faithful to his sweet, dependable boyfriend. Micaela, meanwhile, is wasting her time chasing a bisexual actress who won’t even acknowledge their shared intimacy in private. As these three charismatic but troubled friends keep spinning their wheels, even their own chosen-family bonds get stress-tested to their breaking point.', 'São Paulo best friends Julia, Micaela and Diego enter their thirties entirely unprepared for the considerations of adult maturity. Julia has chosen to remain blind to the obvious signs that her current boyfriend is a two-timing cad, but her eyes are forced wide-open when she discovers that she is pregnant with his child. Diego is a party boy with daddy issues who can’t stay faithful to his sweet, dependable boyfriend. Micaela, meanwhile, is wasting her time chasing a bisexual actress who won’t even acknowledge their shared intimacy in private. As these three charismatic but troubled friends keep spinning their wheels, even their own chosen-family bonds get stress-tested to their breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vq7zjiOWFcQYmmgagUxQ042aF0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364601'),
  ('150279785393516684', 'Restless Natives', 1985, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ken Tuohy, Rupert Walters, Jim Gillespie', 'Ninian Dunnett', 'Vincent Friell, Joe Mullaney, Teri Lally, Ned Beatty, Robert Urquhart, Bernard Hill, Mel Smith, Bryan Forbes', 'PG', 'Two lads in Edinburgh embark on a non-violent spree of robberies. They dress up in clown masks and act as modern highwaymen, robbing coach loads of tourists in the highlands. In the process they become folk heroes to the locals.', 'Two lads in Edinburgh embark on a non-violent spree of robberies. They dress up in clown masks and act as modern highwaymen, robbing coach loads of tourists in the highlands. In the process they become folk heroes to the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HSgeevfF3pkh0okq3oO3A4DKw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29907'),
  ('474903286905772697', 'Restless Waters, Shivering Lights', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Ángeles Hernández', 'José Pérez Quintero, David Matamoros, Ángeles Hernández', 'Hugo Silva, Zoé Arnao, Sergio Castellanos, Irene Montalà, Maria Ribera, Carles Cuevas, Noelia Balbo, Lucas Minuzzi', null, 'Lidia and her father, Pablo, return to the family lighthouse after her mother’s death. Pablo, aware of Lidia''s fragile emotional balance, worries for a possible relapse after her suicide attempt. Lidia, annoyed by her father''s lack of trust, will discover that something’s not right at the Lighthouse, and that danger awaits for them if they do not find out the truth.', 'Lidia and her father, Pablo, return to the family lighthouse after her mother’s death. Pablo, aware of Lidia''s fragile emotional balance, worries for a possible relapse after her suicide attempt. Lidia, annoyed by her father''s lack of trust, will discover that something’s not right at the Lighthouse, and that danger awaits for them if they do not find out the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29QMWjc65fgsDj8W2Z9X0nmiF65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172604'),
  ('240379739729543475', 'Restons groupés', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Salomé, Jean-Claude Larrieu, Nicolas Guy', 'Bruno Dega, Jean-Paul Salomé', 'Emma de Caunes, Judith Henry, Hubert Koundé, Estelle Larrivaz, Samuel Le Bihan, Bernard Le Coq, Bruno Lochet, Antoinette Moya', null, 'A group of French tourists goes on an organized trip to visit the American West. A dream trip from California to Las Vegas, passing through national parks and grandiose sites immortalized by the western.', 'A group of French tourists goes on an organized trip to visit the American West. A dream trip from California to Las Vegas, passing through national parks and grandiose sites immortalized by the western.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GCaRNyNu3ubGL2swxPyeS1NMdA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81119'),
  ('675343610034349339', 'Restoration', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Hoffman, Oliver Stapleton', 'Rose Termain, Rupert Walters', 'Robert Downey Jr., Meg Ryan, Sam Neill, David Thewlis, Hugh Grant, Polly Walker, Ian McKellen, Ian McDiarmid', 'R', 'An aspiring young physician, Robert Merivel found himself in the service of King Charles II and saves the life of someone close to the King. Merivel joins the King''s court and lives the high life provided to someone of his position. Merivel is ordered to marry his King''s mistress in order to divert the queens suspicions. He is given one order by the king and that is not to fall in love. The situation worsens when Merivel finds himself in love with his new wife. Eventually, the King finds out and relieves Merivel of his position and wealth. His fall from grace leaves Merivel where he first started. And through his travels and reunions with an old friend, he rediscovers his love for true medicine and what it really means to be a physician.', 'An aspiring young physician, Robert Merivel found himself in the service of King Charles II and saves the life of someone close to the King. Merivel joins the King''s court and lives the high life provided to someone of his position. Merivel is ordered to marry his King''s mistress in order to divert the queens suspicions. He is given one order by the king and that is not to fall in love. The situation worsens when Merivel finds himself in love with his new wife. Eventually, the King finds out and relieves Merivel of his position and wealth. His fall from grace leaves Merivel where he first started. And through his travels and reunions with an old friend, he rediscovers his love for true medicine and what it really means to be a physician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1YM3WFZnF2NwHT5IRGYUcvZBSl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35196'),
  ('467015037070042696', 'Restore Point', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Hloz, Filip Marek', 'Tomislav Čečka, Robert Hloz, Zdeněk Jecelín', 'Andrea Mohylová, Matěj Hádek, Milan Ondrík, Václav Neužil, Karel Dobrý, Agáta Červinková, Katarzyna Zawadzka, Iveta Dušková', null, 'It’s 2041 and the gaps in social and economic inequality have left the world on the brink. A breakthrough in science has given humanity the ability to bring victims of a violent crime back to life by backing up their brain every 2 days. This allows an ambitious, young detective the opportunity to solve a case of a murdered couple when the restoration team is able to bring one of them back.', 'It’s 2041 and the gaps in social and economic inequality have left the world on the brink. A breakthrough in science has given humanity the ability to bring victims of a violent crime back to life by backing up their brain every 2 days. This allows an ambitious, young detective the opportunity to solve a case of a murdered couple when the restoration team is able to bring one of them back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxFqu8foXkq2AQTaFUIk7SwhCkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071815'),
