  ('645650553647021363', 'Resurrect Dead: The Mystery of the Toynbee Tiles', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Jon Foy', 'Jon Foy, Colin Smith', 'Justin Duerr, Colin Smith, Steve Weinik', null, 'An urban mystery unfurls as one man pieces together the surreal meaning of hundreds of cryptic tiled messages that have been appearing in city streets across the U.S. and South America.', 'An urban mystery unfurls as one man pieces together the surreal meaning of hundreds of cryptic tiled messages that have been appearing in city streets across the U.S. and South America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEY9BVAEDXWZHrq1C1LlfDngteS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54358'),
  ('392802033185825834', 'Resurrected', 1989, 'War, Mystery', 'Paul Greengrass, Waldo Roeg, Max Keene', 'Martin Allen', 'Tom Bell, Rita Tushingham, David Thewlis, Rudi Davies, Michael Pollitt, Christopher Fulford, Ewan Stewart, David Lonsdale', null, 'A Falklands War soldier missing, believed dead, turns up claiming amnesia.', 'A Falklands War soldier missing, believed dead, turns up claiming amnesia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnbxKwuvJPKtPlykMmPIvusekkX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77292'),
  ('333229534742951532', 'Resurrected', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Egor Baranov, Ezequiel Casares, Alan Chu', 'Joe Rechtman', 'Dave Davis, Karli Hall, Erika Chase, Kristen Ariza, Julian Moser, Brad Greenquist, Ezra Buzzington, Timothy V. Murphy', null, 'In a dystopian future, the Vatican knows how to resurrect people. A priest discovers a conspiracy behind the resurrections and their possible link to a series of murders.', 'In a dystopian future, the Vatican knows how to resurrect people. A priest discovers a conspiracy behind the resurrections and their possible link to a series of murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWw1x5CpLN25s4i5ZUIXOMhqyY6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584004'),
  ('270219545738725658', 'Resurrecting the Champ', 2007, 'Drama', 'Rod Lurie, Adam Kane', 'Michael Bortman, Allison Burnett', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Josh Hartnett, Alan Alda, Teri Hatcher, Kathryn Morris, Dakota Goyo, Rachel Nichols, Nick Sandow', 'PG-13', 'Up-and-coming sports reporter rescues a homeless man ("Champ") only to discover that he is, in fact, a boxing legend believed to have passed away. What begins as an opportunity to resurrect Champ''s story and escape the shadow of his father''s success becomes a personal journey as the ambitious reporter reexamines his own life and his relationship with his family.', 'Up-and-coming sports reporter rescues a homeless man ("Champ") only to discover that he is, in fact, a boxing legend believed to have passed away. What begins as an opportunity to resurrect Champ''s story and escape the shadow of his father''s success becomes a personal journey as the ambitious reporter reexamines his own life and his relationship with his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJKTZf2QIhUwvqsfkher1JlLCdZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13074'),
  ('636811867923441367', 'Resurrection', 1980, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Daniel Petrie, Jerram A. Swartz, Craig Huston', 'Lewis John Carlino', 'Ellen Burstyn, Sam Shepard, Richard Farnsworth, Roberts Blossom, Clifford David, Pamela Payton-Wright, Jeffrey DeMunn, Eva Le Gallienne', 'PG', 'The story of a woman who survives the car accident which kills her husband, but discovers that she has the power to heal other people. She becomes an unwitting celebrity, the hope of those in desperate need of healing, and a lightning rod for religious beliefs and skeptics.', 'The story of a woman who survives the car accident which kills her husband, but discovers that she has the power to heal other people. She becomes an unwitting celebrity, the hope of those in desperate need of healing, and a lightning rod for religious beliefs and skeptics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Oq0lF2a0Cqzp5NA8spLPola0lN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98864'),
  ('549269403607512809', 'Resurrection', 1999, 'Crime, Mystery, Horror', 'Russell Mulcahy, Jonathan Freeman', 'Christopher Lambert, Brad Mirman', 'Christopher Lambert, Leland Orser, Barbara Tyson, Jeff J.J. Authors, David Cronenberg, Jayne Eastwood, Rick Fox, Robert Joy', 'R', 'A jaded homicide detective has been put on the case of a ruthless killer in the city of Chicago, who leaves a trail of horribly mutilated and dismembered corpses along with perversely ironic biblical quotes.', 'A jaded homicide detective has been put on the case of a ruthless killer in the city of Chicago, who leaves a trail of horribly mutilated and dismembered corpses along with perversely ironic biblical quotes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2j6cMHN1Mx1u8S897VVhO7wSrce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10359'),
